INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39797, '1cd3c92f23', 'Survey: What else is there?', 'Arite, so we all know most of the fellas here eat, drink, and sleep Bits, but what else consumes your time?  What\'s your excuse for not truning out micro RCs like a sweatshop worker?\r\n\r\nFor me, hell I\'m a pimp and it\'s Got to be the crack. :cool:   Yep, I\'m addicted hardcore, going on 5 years.  Pretty much everynight.  It\'s tough to control but whatever, I do what I want!  Some people like to dumb it down and call it Evercrack or even worse EverQuest, but that aint pimp, it is what it is.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (464, 'dfbc92b554', '', '[quote:dfbc92b554="MythosGR"]Sorry but I have the same mod(as I show you before) in my Bensu clone and the traction is perfect!And I can go with tight turn and wide curves...The R-spec is slower(or less torque-er)than the Bensu motor?[/quote:dfbc92b554]\r\nWell in my experience with the Bits, it\'s either one extreme or the other... meaning either the set-ups gonna give you a \'wide\' turning radius or a \'tight\' one w/o having to compinsate drastically (being non-proportional is the culprit for this I believe). \r\nI, unfortunately haven\'t come across a setup that satisfies both needs. You must share your secrets with us!\r\nAs far as the Bensu motors go, I don\'t have one so I don\'t know it\'s capabilities. I\'ve heard though that the motors a comparable to a 2.2, which would mean it\'s not as kwik and does not posses the torque of an r-spec. Again this is only if it\'s comparable to a 2.2. *shrug');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39792, '2a55a25334', '1st of many', 'Arite, here is the almost completed RX7 Zip.  This is the RC that I poped my moddin cherry on.  Kitted, painted, and slapped some Muscle Tuners hubbies on her.  Gotta do some touchup and detail painting along w/ a clearcoat to make her shine, but I felt bad lurking in the Hood for so long w/out showing what I am up to.  Well here it is....\r\n[img:2a55a25334]http://img26.photobucket.com/albums/v77/marjoke/MazdaRX71.jpg[/img:2a55a25334]\r\n[img:2a55a25334]http://img26.photobucket.com/albums/v77/marjoke/MazdaRX72.jpg[/img:2a55a25334]\r\nHope some day to look back at this car and think how much I have improved :)');
