INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41183, 'ee6a2f9fca', '', '[quote:ee6a2f9fca="CaboWabo"]love the grace of the acceptance speech  :lol: \r\n[/quote:ee6a2f9fca]\r\nYeah, that was the sarcasm talking.... I really am disappointed that no one else entered. I was hoping to see some stories, and I know that there are a bunch of talented, creative guys here that could have easily outdid mine.\r\n\r\nSeriously, though, I\'d like to thank you guys for putting this contest on, and thanks to crazydave for putting up the Homies, and thanks Cabo for putting up the space on the homepage. I\'d also like to thank David Gonzales for making his karate homie look uncannily like President Dubya, and also thanks to sg219 for letting me use your camera.\r\n\r\nBeyond that, I\'d like to thank all of the bitPimps for making this hobby so damn fun to be into, and for getting me back into collecting Homies, I hadn\'t bought any for almost a year until I found this place.');
