INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (620, '9ac110ab46', 'Your Friday Funnies', 'Instead of making a bunch of new topics for these generally entertaining items, I\'ll post them all in one swoop! :)\r\n\r\nThe first 3 are the best  :lol: \r\n\r\n[b:9ac110ab46]Enjoy your flight[/b:9ac110ab46]\r\nTurn up your speakers and sit back to enjoy this one.\r\nhttp://64.224.14.56/EUNI/july_02/pilots_01.html\r\n\r\n[b:9ac110ab46]Terrible Mr. G.[/b:9ac110ab46]\r\nSo, the story goes that co-worker A got sick of co-worker B\'s constant profanity whilst playing Counter Strike. Co-worker A then hid a microphone next to co-worker B\'s desk, and captured this stream of rantings. Then, as co-worker A was a member of an electronic music-making concern, he endeavored to edit it all together. The end result was this: [url=http://overstated.net/media/terrible_mr_g.mp3]The Terrible Mr. G.[/url]\r\n\r\n[b:9ac110ab46]Bubb Rubb and his Lil\' Sis[/b:9ac110ab46]\r\nIf you haven\'t seen him yet, you need to, he and lil sis are going to be the next big Internet video superstars! Already has a cult following Woo Woo!\r\n[url=http://overstated.net/media/bubb-rubb.wmv]Click here to watch the news story[/url]\r\n[url=http://bubbrubb.howheels.org/]Unofficial Bubb Rubb and Lil\' Sis Info Center[/url]\r\n\r\n[b:9ac110ab46]Photoshopped video game boxes[/b:9ac110ab46]\r\nFor all you video game lovers.\r\nhttp://www.somethingawful.com/articles.php?a=1263\r\n\r\n[b:9ac110ab46]Smith &amp; Wesson goes pimp[/b:9ac110ab46]\r\nDon\'t you wanna pack some heat? How about a .50 caliber revolver?\r\nhttp://www.boston.com/dailynews/044/region/Smith_Wesson_introduces_50_cal:.shtml');
