INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (637, '2fc7579425', '', '[quote:2fc7579425="payaso"]What the hell happened there? Did you run the hell out of it or what? I\'ve run about 10 triple charges through mine so far and it just gets smoother everytime I use it. I guess I\'ll have to go outside and poor a little bur on the sidewalk for your dead r-spec...lol\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla[/quote:2fc7579425]\r\nI don\'t quite know, it was acting squirlly when i had first recieved it. It would have a hesitation or sometimes a studder on take-off, whether in forward or reverse. I thought that after breaking it in it would cease... well it did... it cease to exist. Funny coincidence though, the last time \r\nI used it was just before I tested the 2.2 before sending it out to you... hmm it may have become overwhelmed with jealousy. \r\n\r\nMy God What Have I Done! :P  :lol:');
