INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39757, 'cc071cbe2e', '', '[quote:cc071cbe2e="Son_Gokou"]I feel like shoving this up their pussys:  :ak:[/quote:cc071cbe2e]\r\n\r\n\r\nHere\'s how I delt with a similar situation that had happened when i had to ride the bus for a week or two. (I usually had a ride from a freind, or taxi)\r\n\r\nI was a smoker for middle school, and always had a lighter with me, so one day I get on the bus to go home, and while waiting for the bus to fill, I took the old skool metal lighter case off of my bic, and started to make it sound like a was playing a kazoo...\r\n\r\nAs I\'m doing this, this ckick in the grade above me starts giving me shit about it, so I told her to fuck off.   She decides to come over to me, and push the case into my mouth (with force) cutting up all my gums and bleeding like a stuck pig.\r\n\r\nI told her that I was going to check out my mouth, and if I saw blood, her ass was mine.\r\n\r\nI put my hand to my mouth, and it was covered in blood, so I snapped on her ass, and punched her so hard in the chest, that she flew off her feet, and landed on her back..... As I aproached to continue, I saw a weird look on her face that resembled a smirk..  Now I\'m really mad, so I move in for the kill, an dnotice that she can\'t breath...  I hit her hard enough to knock all of the wind out of her for a good 2 min.  She was freakin, and I was content..\r\n\r\n\r\nShe never even looked at me again... Ever\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is not advice or reccomended, but worked for me..  The 80s were different.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAnd that\'s right, I hit that bitch... I don\'t go around hitting women, but when they wanna act like a man, they\'ll get treated like one. :-) \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
