INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39754, 'f0f02d0862', '', 'Sometimes I just wish the people on my school bus would die and have their heads sliced off, chopped up, and used for fertilizer. I\'m sick of putting up with their double standards, and whatever SHIT. \r\n\r\nWow, I feel a bit (no pun intended :lol:) lighter. :smile:\r\n\r\nToday, when I got on, I heard something weird coming from the back of the bus (a mini bus, that is...I\'m stuck on one with fuckin retards) And I whirled around, lookin to see what happened....One of them just said in a bitchy voice "Mind your own business", I just tried to defend myself and told her to calm down, another girl (who is a total fuckin slutty little bitch...man, feels so good to curse) told me to shut up and "don\'t start fights like you always do, you\'ll just get written up again and again. We\'re tired of putting up with you. You don\'t wanna get nasty with me, trust me, you will end up crying." Always starting fights? I don\'t know why the fucking hell these sluts decided to talk out of their asses today. The bus driver (sub) was hearing all this, and when I tried to stand up, he said "turn around and sit down, and don\'t start. NOW!"\r\n\r\nI feel like shoving this up their pussys:  :ak:');
