INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41153, 'beb8150487', '', '[quote:beb8150487="Son_Gokou"]I myself am indian (from India, not native american) and some bitch-fuckers like to take advantage of the fact that my background is from the east, and call me osama. I was eatin a white cocunut meringue cookie one time, (meringue cookies are basically just dry and hard), and this black guy, tall and FAT, asked me for one. I gave him one, and he crushed it into a powder in his hand, and said "Whatchoo tryin to do to me boy? Is this anthrax? You trying to poison me, indian terrorist boy???" And today he brought it up, 4-5 months after that incident, and told everyone. \r\n\r\nThese guys at my school are a perfect example of LIARS....They will slander my background, say things such as "Hey A.J., how\'s uncle osama?" and a bunch of [b:beb8150487][size=24:beb8150487]SHIT!!!!!!![/size:beb8150487][/b:beb8150487] In fact, you wanna know about my race\'s accomplishments? First off, did you know about the time they....*gets slapped in the face with hogjowlz\'s trout*......never mind....gotta stay on the topic....[/quote:beb8150487]\r\n\r\ntell em to be real careful when they open their locker\r\n\r\n[quote:beb8150487]But, payaso....I don\'t get what you mean by the teachers at my school lying about how getting good grades can affect your career. I mean, for god sakes, a guy who has F\'s and D\'s in his math classes all the time can\'t exactly become an html designer or a code-hacker![/quote:beb8150487]\r\n\r\ni dropped out of school at 15 and have worked in some very priveledged positions. it\'s all down to attitude and work ethic. i get what you\'re saying, jimmy the idiot boy probably won\'t be an air traffic controller, but it\'s not a rule. einstein was told in school that he would never amount to much! the most important talent you can possess is the ability to learn, drop me in any job and i\'ll do pretty well.');
