INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39303, '106a1fef2b', '', 'Let me just clear up some confusion (if there is any) here...\r\n\r\nFor the MRCC and WGU case, at MRCC I got banned cuz I kept "complaining" about how the mods there were acting a little Nazi-ish, putting me down cuz of my age and what not...They got away with stuff I didn\'t, and well, that kind of pissed me off... And afterwards, I got the boot up my ass. It took a while to get over, but eventually I just thought that MRCC was kind of a place where you can\'t voice your 2 cents without fear of the admins there not liking it and making a whole bunch of "judgements" about you. \r\n\r\nSo, When I heard of WGU, I came there, thinking I could start over and try and contribute some things.....wrong. The guys there were no better than Nazis they were at MRCC. WTF? I thought WGU was supposed to give everyone a clean slate and be fair, somewhat like TRC. They didn\'t say "cut it out" or "stop \'trolling\'" or "this is what you are doing wrong" or any shit of the sort, they just said things like "that\'s 1" or "that\'s 2" and "if I get to three, you\'ll be famous" and I had no idea what the fuck they were talking about. So I asked questions, tried to defend myself.....BAM! I got an even bigger foot up my ass. And I was known as the "first banned member" there. I was so pissed, I could\'ve done this in Stride\'s (or Palabras\', whatever he likes to call himself) mouth:  :crap:  \r\n\r\nI had a debate with them on AIM about this, and they were still saying shit like "you\'re a kid, so you may not understand" or "why should we have tolerance?" or other shit like that. I tried to explain my side, they were so stubborn they would say stuff like "don\'t tell us this, just answer" or "that\'s not a reason, we want incentive" or whatever crap. I said to myself "fine, let them go to hell, it\'s not my karma they\'re trashing by doing this" and shrugged them off. \r\n\r\nAs for improving: When I came here first, it was cuz Namuna told everyone about how I tried to strike up a chat with him, and he scared me by joking about how he may have been gay (no offense, hulkster :-)) and when everyone said things like "poor little boy" for some reason...maybe cuz I didn\'t have an adult sense of humor, or I forgot my medication...I got pissed. So I came there, and basically a lot of shit flew out of my mouth, which I would have rather swallowed. \r\n\r\nAs I moved on, I learned to take a joke first, then to try and contribute, then to KNOW what I\'m talking about and how to behave (HirotoR34, if you\'re reading this, I\'m sorry bout acting like a bitch the other time, didn\'t know what I was doing...do I ever?) and, it comes to today. \r\n\r\nMaybe you guys are right....Maybe less people think I\'m retarded, maybe some thing I\'m even more retarded....I don\'t care, I just want to fit in and be respected, and if I do something wrong, I want to improve on that. \r\n\r\nAnyways, \r\n\r\n[quote:106a1fef2b]I\'m just sayin YES he\'s an annoying little snot, but it\'s just that, who was\'nt at that age[/quote:106a1fef2b]\r\n\r\nWell, if I read this a year ago, I\'d get mad and have PMS, but I\'ll try to remain calm:\r\n\r\nI really don\'t like it when people are put down cuz of their age. People may say stuff like "Look, you may not get it cuz you\'re young" or shit like that. Well, who can you blame for me not knowing stuff? I mean, adults know more stuff than I do, I\'ll respect that, but I\'m just as capable of knowing the stuff as any adult! It\'s just that we\'re busy learning all DIFFERENT kinds of subjects here at school, while the adults only have to focus on fewer things at work, like accounting, or electronics, or whatever. Us kids are learning all sorts of stuff: English, arts, science, history (which for me, is a pain in the ass), but if we were to spend that same amount of time learning fewer things, it would sink in faster, correct? Us "young-uns" or "whippersnappers" or "little punk shits" are like a soft clay, when we\'re soft you can mold us into any shape you want, when we harden (lol...pervs :lol:) it\'s very hard to change that, hard to learn anything new...."You can\'t teach an old dog new tricks" or whatever philosophical shit. \r\n\r\nI would continue ranting, but right now I think I\'ve said enough, and I\'d better stop before I piss people off again like in the old days.');
