INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41142, '5e6cc7e391', '', '[quote:5e6cc7e391="Bird"]I have no trust for "educated" people. Go to any college campus and you will see what is going on. Slacking, partying, and cramming for tests. I really want these people handling my affairs(right). They get by and go on to their careers, and they FRONT. They kiss ass and get into managements little clique, and get ahead of the people who are genuinely busting their asses. Very unfair indeed.[/quote:5e6cc7e391]\r\n\r\nI went to college and I partied hard and slacked off, but I also worked my ass off. I\'m not at all like the people that you describe here. I do know people like that... the girl in the office next to me fits your stereotype perfectly. I don\'t think it has anything to do with education, though. I think some people take pride in what they do and have a good work ethic, while others are just looking for the next angle to weasel their way to the top. Some of my friends went to college and some didn\'t... all are hard-working, regular folks.');
