INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (1045, 'c334ad3252', '', 'off and on for about 4-5 years now, just recently got back into it myself after a long absence. Went pretty much from 4 to MX in one hop and skipped most of 5! lol (I was out of the loop long enough for 2 releases!)\r\n\r\nYou up in dat shit too I\'m guessing?\r\nWe should collaborate!\r\n\r\n&lt;insert=boring technical geek speak&gt;\r\nAnyways, I\'ve been doing some really cool shit with it at work, simultaneously managing several systems through a single multi-channel point that effects displays, datas, apps, etc. both visually on touch screen kiosks, flat screen plasma displays, handheld devices, telephones, and normal desktops, as well as the underlying business logic and management. All of this is seemless and transparent to the end user who is identified through speech and thumb print analysis, meaning now content can be delivered specified to the user, dynamically.\r\n&lt;/insert&gt;\r\n\r\nWhat\'s even cooler about learning and doing this stuff at work... you know that mystery game we\'re talking about for our site? Well we\'re currently trying to figure out a way to use the automated speech recognition and phone systems for our game!  :lol: \r\nLets say a visitor on bitPimps site starts the game, hits a link to mail "Pimp Daddy Whatever", later that night (about 3 am) - they recieve a disturbing phone call from Pimp Daddy Whatever giving them a threatening message and a hidden clue!\r\n\r\nThis could turn out to be really frickin bad-ass and slightly ground breaking as far as normal entertainment/information/community websites go!');
