INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41134, 'dbd1158170', '', '[quote:dbd1158170="Son_Gokou"]But, payaso....I don\'t get what you mean by the teachers at my school lying about how getting good grades can affect your career. I mean, for god sakes, a guy who has F\'s and D\'s in his math classes all the time can\'t exactly become an html designer or a code-hacker! [/quote:dbd1158170]\r\n\r\n\r\nSee what i mean by them filling your impressionable mind?   you\'re already setting yourself up for a major let down....\r\n\r\n\r\nOf course a person that has bad grades can be successful... Did you know that "Bill Cosby", and many others never even finished high school?\r\n\r\n\r\nYou\'ll understand what I\'m saying in a few more years when you go in to apply for a job, and you get beat out by some guy with less education than you only because he knew the owner, and you didn\'t.\r\n\r\nIt\'s called nepitism..  \r\n\r\nYou could just as easily be on the other side though. If you were to marry some rich girl and her pop has a large company, and hires you first just cause you\'re fuckin his daughter.  Happens every day.\r\n\r\n\r\nSo not only can someone that had Ds, and Fs in math get a good job, but they can get top jobs and fire the people with degrees...\r\n\r\n\r\nIf this is not making any sense, you\'re in the group with the rest of us.\r\nTell your stupid teacher that payaso said to go back to the teachers lounge, and smoke another cigarette, and hope for a clue...\r\n\r\nDegrees = Dick   (unless you\'re in the medical, or law field.)\r\n\r\nWelcome to America :-) \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
