INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41131, 'ebd4a917ef', '', '[quote:ebd4a917ef="Son_Gokou"]...I don\'t get what you mean by the teachers at my school lying about how getting good grades can affect your career. I mean, for god sakes, a guy who has F\'s and D\'s in his math classes all the time can\'t exactly become an html designer or a code-hacker! [/quote:ebd4a917ef]\r\n\r\nI don\'t even know where to begin on this... Yes they can. I know high-school dropouts with high paying professional careers in many different fields. Some of the biggest slackers I have come across in this life have gotten further on personality than people who did everything they are supposed to and worked hard. \r\nI have no trust for "educated" people. Go to any college campus and you will see what is going on. Slacking, partying, and cramming for tests. I really want these people handling my affairs(right). They get by and go on to their careers, and they FRONT. They kiss ass and get into managements little clique, and get ahead of the people who are genuinely busting their asses. Very unfair indeed.\r\nA society that puts entertainers and athletes ahead of real people doing real shit is what we have degraded to. It sickens me.\r\n\r\nGetting ahead SHOULD be based on merit. Unfortunately, that just isn\'t the case.');
