INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41127, 'abd71cbcdf', '', 'You guys aren\'t the only ones who are sick of this war shit....\r\n\r\nI myself am indian (from India, not native american) and some bitch-fuckers like to take advantage of the fact that my background is from the east, and call me osama. I was eatin a white cocunut meringue cookie one time, (meringue cookies are basically just dry and hard), and this black guy, tall and FAT, asked me for one. I gave him one, and he crushed it into a powder in his hand, and said "Whatchoo tryin to do to me boy? Is this anthrax? You trying to poison me, indian terrorist boy???" And today he brought it up, 4-5 months after that incident, and told everyone. \r\n\r\nThese guys at my school are a perfect example of LIARS....They will slander my background, say things such as "Hey A.J., how\'s uncle osama?" and a bunch of [b:abd71cbcdf][size=24:abd71cbcdf]SHIT!!!!!!![/size:abd71cbcdf][/b:abd71cbcdf] In fact, you wanna know about my race\'s accomplishments? First off, did you know about the time they....*gets slapped in the face with hogjowlz\'s trout*......never mind....gotta stay on the topic....\r\n\r\nBut, payaso....I don\'t get what you mean by the teachers at my school lying about how getting good grades can affect your career. I mean, for god sakes, a guy who has F\'s and D\'s in his math classes all the time can\'t exactly become an html designer or a code-hacker! \r\n\r\nAnd the government....I never noticed anyone talking shit about them until George Bush became president. I know that he is one of the very few presidents who was full of shit. He made a bunch of promises that he never fulfilled, he declared war on Iraq without ANY proof that they had plans to unleash their "weapons of mass destruction", and he flirts around with society.  He basically slandered Iraq, talks shit, and loves to score easy brownie points with the people of America.\r\n\r\nWhat I mean by flirting with society and all that, consists of his following actions:\r\n\r\n-hosting a baseball game consisting of little kids as players, and having a Disney channel actor to sing the national anthem\r\n-attending a racing event, making the announcement for racers to "start your engines", and waving to the crowd, showing off his authority and getting cheers from the crowd. [size=24:abd71cbcdf]FAKE BASTARD!!!![/size:abd71cbcdf]\r\n-going to a school and reading infantile books with kids\r\n-so much more. \r\n-sending my dad (he works at the United Nations in Manhattan, he\'s an account clerk....not that much of an important role, but you guys are entitled to think I\'m full of shit, if you must) some letters asking him to join his campaign and send him 50 dollars, bribing him with a high quality picture of himself and his wife standing together.\r\n\r\nAnyone who wishes that George Bush will die, go to hell, and be raped up his ass with a blade in hell, say AYE!\r\n\r\n[b:abd71cbcdf][size=24:abd71cbcdf]AYE  AYE  AYE  AYE  AYE  AYE  AYE  AYE  AYE!!!!!!!!![/size:abd71cbcdf][/b:abd71cbcdf]');
