INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (1214, '2047ecbabf', 'The Wedding Photographer', 'The BIG day draws near (my wedding day) and today we had a guy from a Photo Shop (sheesh, so used to writing that as one word, Photoshop) came to our place to show us his deal.\r\n\r\nThe Wife (Yeah, that\'s right she\'s my Wife...Our \'religious\' ceremony is what\'s comin up) saw an ad in Bridal mag that these guys are supposed to be like $375.\r\n\r\nNow, you gotta understand a little about my background first...I had some College for Art (including a Photog Class) and I currently own some pretty hefty equip (I love Digital Photography). I\'m no \'pro\' but some monkey with a mustache, a NY accent and only half a clue about Photography ain\'t gonna pull no wool over my eyes either.\r\n\r\nThis guy shows up with 3 weddings Albums and to say the pictures looked like they came right out of a disposable would be about accurate (some of the Brides in the albums looked friggin CONSTIPATED MAN!)...Then he shows us a price list (this is all after the \'shpeel\' and BS) and the cheap \'package\' which included ONLY 18 8x10s in a wedding album was $895!!!\r\n\r\n$895? For 18 pictures? F-That my friends. I could have my grandmother take 800 shots with my digicam (I\'ve got a 1gig Microdrive in it) and I GUARANTEE at least 18 of em would be worthy of our wedding album and for only the cost of the stupid album!\r\n\r\nCan you guess that we decided to just have our friends and family take pics and we\'ll all just share?  :roll:');
