INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41076, '3794837113', '', 'crikey!! where to start!? it\'s all true, your government is really letting the american peeps down big time! and they\'ve been doing it for years. the pattern is too familliar, us gives military aid to a struggling country, leaves it to fend for it\'s self then decides they are a threat to little bobby usa and bombs the shit out of it. i\'m not convinced there is such a person as osama or that any of the crap coming outta the "official" news channels. they lie to you and do the most pathetic cover ups to create a distraction from the real evil they spread. i mean by definition the us gov, cia and military are the most real and immedeate terrorist threat facing the world today!!\r\nnow don\'t get me wrong, it\'s just as bad down here. we\'re just 10 years behind down here in most things political. our government is on shaky ground now about blindly following the us into conflict and we even screw the odd country over too (east timor). we take people who have travelled across an ocean with nothing, in a leaky pile of shit boat to flee a horriffic fate and send them away claiming we can\'t cope with too many people in our country (aus is roughly the size of the usa, with a population of 20 million!)\r\none problem you guys face is the fact that george is openly and obviously a narrow minded moron. this whole thing screws it up for the people that it\'s supposed to help. i\'m sure i\'m not alone in thinking travelling overseas is now more difficult because of the reputation that precedes us. america = conquering war state, australia = the new south afrika! now people have to watch their backs all the time, i chat to sessiz on aim now and then and i\'m sure he\'s just a regular lowlife like the rest of us, not a blind murderous muslim sheep! all of a sudden everyone\'s scared to say what they feel because we might be labelled a threat and scrutinised for the rest of our lives. ha! fuck em, i got nothin to hide. and even if you do speak out they can\'t hear you, they\'re too busy monitoring people covertly to see what\'s in front of them!\r\niraq, osama bin laden, afghanistan, saddam hussein, terrorist, s11, bali, oil. NOW we got the intended audience listening!!!\r\nguys, i know it may not help (refer to your last election result) but vote those turds out, i\'m gonna! it\'s worth a shot but most likely pointless. if you really wanna make a difference, it starts at the grass roots level. people like youi an me standing up and saying "fuck you and your blatant control methods! i\'m thinking for me from now on!!!!"\r\n\r\nphew! :shock: glad i got that one out. just remember kiddies, never believe lies  :suspect:');
