INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39297, '9cd7ed2178', '', '[quote:9cd7ed2178="sessiz"]I hope you won\'t have to eat them words bird. :-)[/quote:9cd7ed2178]\r\n\r\nme too, me too.\r\n\r\nI live in a shitty neighborhood with crackwhores right next door and crackfiends knockin\' at my door at 3, 4am lookin\' for crack(wrong house, fucker!, next one down!) and disturbing my bit obsession... \r\nAnyhow, there\'s this 15 year old kid from up the street. His moms died last summer and his crackhead dad moved in a crackwhore and her daughter  like immediately after... the kid was sleepin in the garage. Events since then(just the highlights) include this kids dad gettin\' set up by his bitch and the neighbor crackwhores to be robbed which included a brutal pistol-whipping by 20 year old wannabe gangsters...\r\nThe point of all of this is that this kid is a typical annoying 15 year old and when he shows up at my place, I let him come in and hang because I know the alternatives... I try to be some type of role model to him because I feel bad for him. I even set up his clone that he begged, borrowed, stole, whatever with one of my extra 2.6\'s and a vw body that I was\'nt using.\r\nBECAUSE HE IS BASICALLY A GOOD KID IN A FUCKED UP SITUATION.\r\n\r\nI think that this kid is pretty straightforward with me and my family, so when he needs a place to chill, he\'s welcome at my spot.\r\n\r\nSo in Goku\'s case, I hope I don\'t have to eat my words... \r\nBut in the kid up the streets case, if he ever decides to take advantage of the kindness of me and my family, I have a nephew in the same grade as him at the same school, and my nephew is very loyal to uncle Jay....');
