INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (1312, '85cc0bfb29', '', 'Dudes, check it out.\r\n\r\nI\'m getting a base together for the first major sets of puzzles. Here\'s what I was thinking it would entail, please give your thoughts on this:\r\n\r\nFirst, I want to program a very small, bare bones, static login page to what\'s supposed to be, and look like a web based email client. So the first page would be a bare-bones login page taking them into a bare-bones page the looks like a web browser based email client, that happens to list a few emails. In those, we have clues and puzzles.\r\nThose clues, puzzles, and faked correspondence would lead them into other things. One of those other things I was think we could do was this:\r\n\r\nOnce the game started and we could figure out where the majority of the players are from - and we\'ve let them see a supposedly \'privately\' email that just so happens to be a message from (INSERT NAME HERE) to DaGeneral, that basically says something like: "I really need to contact you, you are in a lot of danger, go to the pay phone at (INSERT PLACE HERE) at (INSERT TIME HERE) and we\'ll discuss it more!"\r\n\r\nWe then can use [url=http://www.payphone-project.com/]these listings[/url] to call the pay phone we think would have the most likely hood of players answering.\r\n\r\nSo whaddya think?');
