INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41058, '18d71268b9', '', '[quote:18d71268b9="CaboWabo"]\r\nhowever, I can say with confidence, that\'s absolutely no fucking excuse what-so-ever.[/quote:18d71268b9]\r\n\r\nTrust, I\'m not trying to make up excuses here man.\r\n\r\n[quote:18d71268b9]civilized countries belong to NATO.\r\nnothing would happen until there was a majority agreement by NATO. as it somewhat did, which didn\'t support US interests as much as it serves French, German, and Spanish interests.[/quote:18d71268b9]\r\n\r\nCabo, the war in iraq wasn\'t sanctioned by the UN. Baby Bush said fuck that and went in. Yeah he had some support, but not the full support of our so called "allies".\r\n\r\n[quote:18d71268b9]all over in my industry (IT) our jobs are going overseas to cheaper labor.\r\ncontracts are not being awarded to US companies, they are being awarded to other countries - mainly Eastern Indian countries.[/quote:18d71268b9]\r\n\r\nTrue, but I\'m talking about the industrial sectors. Which can be argued to be the major backbone of any country. Can you say "OIL"?\r\n\r\n[quote:18d71268b9]if I followed the Iraqi\'s lead. \r\nthat means I should go out and shoot and grenade some guys from Iraq, hang their bodies on the brooklyn bridge, drag and beat their charred remains through the streets and dance and celebrate and hold signs that say things like "this is where Iraqi\'s come to die".\r\n\r\nthat\'s just insane.[/quote:18d71268b9]\r\n\r\nSee, you don\'t have any east indian IT guys in your neighboorhood surrounded by soldiers with tanks and guns. You\'re livelyhood wasn\'t just taken from you by force. I get what you\'re saying cabo and understand your point. It aint right what they did, I agree. Call it insane becuase it is. It aint all that hard to lose your sanity when you don\'t see a future for yourself.');
