INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41039, 'f291f072ae', '', 'Not from the factory, and it didn\'t cost a 1/4 mil.  The RS 200, which is a factory car, and was designed for rallying, pulled mid 9s in the 1320, is the fastest car 0-60, at 2.1 seconds, and you can pick one up for about 120k.  The RS hhas 654 hp.  That is STOCK, FACTORY SPECS.  The 1700 hp stang I was talking about also didn\'t cost anywhere near 250k, as it was a single turbo, and a simple 331 stroker kit, I.E., it was cheap.  I also believe that the design in the computers is american, though they probably are made in china (like all other electronics).  Chrysler suffered a hostile takeover, even though it was called a merge.  I call that merge bs, as the company is almost all german now.  I also said imports, as referring to Japanense and Korean cars.  Who could not love Ferraris and Benzes.  I do not like the new Viper.  The old one was absolutely great, as i can attest to.  The Ford GT is kicking ass and taking names.  It just got uprated to 550 hp, and an independent dyno facility just got around 600 at the wheels.  That lists at 139k.  You\'re just pissed because of the unspoken 276 hp rule.\r\n\r\nAnd to add insult to injury, I can pick up a new SVT Cobra with 390 FACTORY HP!');
