INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41035, 'f92b93f039', '', 'Super nice job. It\'s so.... subtle. I mean that in the best way. As in you don\'t notice how much you changed the S2000 you started with until you start looking at every detail, and then you realize there\'s not much of the S2000 left.\r\n\r\nI read an interesting tidbit about the real Del Sol once... something to the effect of it being able to pull the most lateral G force of ANY production car ever made. So apparently that little Honda can hold its line in a hard turn without sliding better than Corvettes and Ferraris.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41036, 'e1cd25b42c', '', 'ya sure the ps2 can play old washed out games. my computer can play games from every console,arcade and computer system ever made if i want.\r\n\r\nthe xbox is superior in just about every aspect when it comes to hardware specs.\r\n\r\nalso the ps2 likes to break a lot. ive never heard of an xbox breaking but ive seen a hell of a lot of ps2s lose their laser or at least need a cleaning.\r\nmost ps2 games are weak attempts at improving the "resident evil" playing a movie concept which tends to bore me. \r\n\r\nright now the only console i own is a gamecube and for just sitting down and playing a game for a few i think it is the best. plus its half the price. but i rarly touch consoles since i have a computer which is capable of better graphics and way better sound output. plus oh ya a ps2 and xbox cant browse the web, dload files, create av stuff, write resumes, ...etc\r\n(someone please mention ps2linux hahahahahahahahahahaha)\r\n\r\n\r\nbut then again if you are sitting there having fun playing any system thats all that really counts.');
