INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41033, '0f5c56290d', '', 'did the 1700hp come from the factory? are you talking about the 1/4million dollar car? it would suck in a drag(the whole point of a muscle car).\r\n\r\nthen again you can get a 10second neon if you throw enough money at it.\r\n\r\nbut my point was: you can build a car to suit any purpose. ie.. drag racing, touring, circle track, off road, luxury, common commuting(most cars are for this but may try to act like they are for some other purpose).\r\n\r\nand any really bad ass car is far from factory specs.\r\n\r\nwhat parts of american cars are foreign? well most of any car\'s computer system was probably made in taiwan or china, lets see umm chrysler isnt even an american company anymore. japs are building cars in american plants. american companies steal foreign engineers and vice versa.\r\nunless you are talking about a small limited run car, there is no such thing as "all american" or "pure german" anymore. oh ya you forget about our stupid emissions laws which ruin any car put out on the american market anyhow.\r\n\r\nso ya remember your beloved viper(ya its a nice piece of engineering) isnt even really an american car anymore  :eek:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41032, 'c7eb782646', '', 'K then.....\r\n\r\nI\'d recommend getting a PS2, they have some nifty games that can be played, I mean they can use games from the previous PSone console. And, I hear that they have their own special battery, which can be recharged.....but of course, knowing the electronics gurus you guys are, you could just buy some li-poly batts and put together your own. :???: \r\n\r\nAlso, since you can play games from the other PS console....You could play Gran Turismo 2, which IMO is the SHIZNIT, for a racing game at least....:-)\r\n\r\nPlus, I hear they have their own portable screen coming out, just like the PSone did....if you search on www.toysnjoys.com , you may find it.....At least, they had it last time I visited....which was probably like a year ago anyways.  :-(');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (1422, '0da1841646', 'Muhahaha! Try and fight the Demon off for THIS...', '[url=http://www.archos.com/lang=en/products/prw_500375_specs.html]Archos Multimedia Jukebox[/url]\r\n\r\nWhat is it you ask? Check THESE specs man...\r\n\r\n- USB 2.0 or Firewire compatible, with a 20gig HD\r\n- It\'s an MP3 Player\r\n- It\'s a Digital Camera\r\n- It has a Color LCD screen\r\n\r\nHere\'s the BEST part...[b:0da1841646]It\'s a Digital Camcorder that encodes to Divx on the fly![/b:0da1841646]\r\n\r\nA couple of weeks ago my co-worker picked up the super bundle from buy.com ([url=http://www.buy.com/retail/product.asp?sku=10336727&amp;loc=101]Archos super bundle[/url]) for like $350...It\'s now down to $310 and free shipping!\r\n\r\nAnd you know what module they have coming soon for it? An A/V input component that\'ll let you capture from a source (like VCR or maybe even DVD) and directly encode to Divx!');
