INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (1435, 'aef15eba32', 'Tomy multi-band controller', 'Ok guys so I got this sweet little honey yesterday and here are some of my thoughts on it;\r\n\r\n[b:aef15eba32]Pros[/b:aef15eba32]\r\n\r\nTakes the place of 4 controllers (obvious, but one of the best features)\r\n\r\nBetter design than stock controller ie; more ergonomic\r\n\r\nThe buttons rock, 8 points of movement\r\n\r\nNo clicking when buttons are depressed, lack of momentary buttons (pics coming soon)\r\n\r\nSaves money on batteries lol :P\r\n\r\n[b:aef15eba32]Cons[/b:aef15eba32]\r\n\r\nOnly one, that I have so far... Range sucks!\r\nBut we already knew this, Telescopic antenna mod is a must.\r\n\r\nAs far as the mod that [b:aef15eba32]hog[/b:aef15eba32] loves so much, the [i:aef15eba32][b:aef15eba32]battery mod[/b:aef15eba32][/i:aef15eba32]... unfortunately that may prove to be a bit more difficult. Because of the cases streamline design, and 1 battery being on each side of the back of the controller (for those who aren\'t familiar with this config. pics coming shortly) it leaves little room for anything inconspicuous. Time will tell though.');
