INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41017, 'adf8486642', '', '[quote:adf8486642="hogjowlz"][quote:adf8486642="crazydave"]\r\n[quote:adf8486642]Crazydave, does the Shaker hood actually shake? I doesn\'t on mine.[/quote:adf8486642]No, it don\'t actually shake. That what they call that type of hood on real cars, because the scoop is attached to the motor, and does shake.[/quote:adf8486642]\r\n\r\n[quote:adf8486642="viperdout"]1. The shaker shakes on the real car, but it shouldn\'t on the ZZ body.  \r\n\r\n2. Why didn\'t the stang get a shaker?  If the ZZ body was real, it\'d be a Q-Code car.  I wish RS had put a shaker on the stang, b/c then I would have the R-Code model.[/quote:adf8486642]\r\n\r\n\r\n[b:adf8486642]ok dude. one moment you dont even know what the hell a shaker hood is. the next you are whining that they didnt put one on the mustang?\r\ndude you got some serious issues if you start crying about radioshack not putting something that you didnt even know what the hell it was 2 minutes before on a little piece of plastic that you have no obligation to buy. \r\n\r\n\r\nplease go whine about stupid things somewhere else in the future ok?[/b:adf8486642][/quote:adf8486642]\r\n\r\nI thought Canadian bit was talking about it on the ZZ, and it doesn\'t shake.  I don\'t know what a shaker is?  Are you kidding?!  Do you even know the car codes on stangs?  I am a car person first and foremost, and R/C car person second.  Not knowing what a shaker is?  Dude, my first word was Ford.  I am not kidding.  I am right now looking for a clean, high-mileage \'93 Cobra, like my neighbor\'s, because of the GT-40 heads and intake.  If I cannot get that, I will buy an LX, and shove either a 347 or a 418 in it.  If you know so much about Boss 302s, then which motor did the heads come off of, huh?  Do you know the bore and stroke of the motor?  \r\n\r\nI like the bodies, and have one, I just think that RS should\'ve put it on there.  Not only that, but then they show a pic of a real Boss with the Shaker!  I said I wish, but I am not about to screw up the body putting a shaker on it.  I think it would look cooler.  \r\n\r\nHog, I might be 15, but I still know a ton about cars.  And BTW, imports suck!');
