INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40993, '26dcf0c9c3', '', '[quote:26dcf0c9c3="crazydave"]\r\n[quote:26dcf0c9c3]Crazydave, does the Shaker hood actually shake? I doesn\'t on mine.[/quote:26dcf0c9c3]No, it don\'t actually shake. That what they call that type of hood on real cars, because the scoop is attached to the motor, and does shake.[/quote:26dcf0c9c3]\r\n\r\n[quote:26dcf0c9c3="viperdout"]1. The shaker shakes on the real car, but it shouldn\'t on the ZZ body.  \r\n\r\n2. Why didn\'t the stang get a shaker?  If the ZZ body was real, it\'d be a Q-Code car.  I wish RS had put a shaker on the stang, b/c then I would have the R-Code model.[/quote:26dcf0c9c3]\r\n\r\n\r\n[b:26dcf0c9c3]ok dude. one moment you dont even know what the hell a shaker hood is. the next you are whining that they didnt put one on the mustang?\r\ndude you got some serious issues if you start crying about radioshack not putting something that you didnt even know what the hell it was 2 minutes before on a little piece of plastic that you have no obligation to buy. \r\n\r\n\r\nplease go whine about stupid things somewhere else in the future ok?[/b:26dcf0c9c3]');
