INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40888, 'bfdfe7fafa', '', '[quote:bfdfe7fafa="betty.k"]not quite sure what\'s going on but i get the idea that someone ripped off one of your images and called it their own yeah? if so that\'s shit :finger:  personally i don\'t mind people using my pics just so long as credit\'s given. and if i found out someone was trying to pass off my work as their own i\'d be pretty fricken vengeful that\'s for sure! :ak:[/quote:bfdfe7fafa]For those just tuning in, and don\'t want to click the link above, here\'s what\'s up...\r\n\r\nThis is for the \'Rate-an-XMODS\' part, where users rate other users cars. Someone removed my name and logo from the image and replaced it with "frika lika", and then submitted it as ther own.\r\n\r\nNow, of all the thousands of cars out there, I\'m a little bit honored he chose me to rip off, but still irritated What is really really (really) chapping my hide is he got in the top 10 with his name on it, meanwhile my cars get dogged. That\'s the biggest kick in the ass.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCabo, I sent him a link to both images. You can see mine were obviosly submitted first by the lower number. Also mine is obviously the original, as he distorted the quality of his.\r\n\r\nAs you guys may or may not remember, I\'ve been dogged by the Xmod webmaster in the past, when he (they) rejected my pictures, and post for no apparent reasons. So that\'s why I\'m afraid I might have to call in for back up.\r\n\r\nI give him a few days, then I\'ll let you guys know what\'s up.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40889, '7595e7ad11', '', '[quote:7595e7ad11]Her mom loves me so much, that when I woke up, she cook for me, and then make the room up, and then bring me the controler for the PS2, and while I was playing, she\'s bring out the bong for me, and the herb...lol [/quote:7595e7ad11]Now that\'s \'love\' for ya. Wish someone would love me like that.  :lol: \r\n\r\nMy wife grew up around the long haired, guitar playin\', pot smokin\' typed. So it never fazed her that I got high. I got her to try weed for her first time, but I got her too high, and she laughed her self silly for almost an hour, at Jay Leno of all people, until she got sick to her tummy, and passed out. She didn\'t like that, and has refused to try it again.\r\n\r\nNow after 10 years together, she\'s been kinda acting irritated by my smoking. For some reason I think it\'s compounding with the micro RCs into one big irritation, but then I\'m really not sure what\'s up with her lately. :roll:\r\n\r\nYou better appreciate what you got there. ;)');
