INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40884, '8312676664', '', 'I hear ya man. My wifey was my tokin partner for the last 6 years, but she quit the herb 2 months ago. We\'re gonna do the baby thing so she wants to stop for a year. \r\n\r\nShe\'s all cool with me though. LOL true story.\r\n\r\nmy wife is dominican, and I met her in the Dominican Republic when I lived there. My friend rented a room in my wifes mothers house, so we\'d go there sometimes to burn and play nintendo.\r\n\r\nThat\'s how I got into the family. one day I go to my friends, and my wifes mother tells me that her daughter is down from Jersey, and I should meet her. Long story kinda short, she moved back to the DR to be with me for 3 more years. We moved to FL after 9/11. Her mom moved in cause she also moved to the US. Her mom loves me so much, that when I woke up, she cook for me, and then make the room up, and then bring me the controler for the PS2, and while I was playing, she\'s bring out the bong for me, and the herb...lol\r\n\r\nShe rocks.\r\n\r\nBefore I came along, her family was not into the weed scene, but since they love me, they could care less about it. It\'s kinda weird...\r\n\r\n\r\nI guess that wasn\'t so short..lol  And I gots 1000s of stories like that. Some with pics, and vids\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
