INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (2095, '39dbe62aae', '', 'Damn shypo a bmx all I ever got was a huffy :cry: \r\nI did steal a mongoose but I got caught :evil: \r\n\r\nAnother short war story since we\'re sharing. Again with the skate board but about a year before lincoln park and normal wheels. I was skating down the street and by a stewarts shop on my way to the college dorms to see if I couldn\'t get some that night :twisted: when I noticed a car speeding up behind me. I turned my back to the stewarts parking lot as I was trying to get away from being plastered by this @ss speeding towards me. This girl backing out of the lot backs right into me and sends me tripping over my feet and deck. My knee sorta split in two and then snapped back together and went numb for a couple of minutes. the girl was pretty so i was in awe and told her that I was allright and got up (this i will never forgive myself for) she asked me if I needed a ride and that she could take me to her place a couple of blocks over to put ice on my knee. (are you guys ready) i say naw I\'m allright, she says okay and sorry and then gets back into her car and leaves. :cry: Not 2 minutes later I\'m limping over to the dorms and it hits me I COULD HAVE PLAYED THAT INTO SOMETHING!!! I\'m kinda tired of typing so to sum it up, the next day my knee swells to like 3 times the size and I cant move for about a week and then on crutches.');
