INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (2104, 'a46130e55c', '', 'I agree with kwik. A contest to draw in new members is a great idea, but what kind of a contest, and how do we promote it?  I know that Cabo has got his $$ goin towards the site, so I can supply the prize. I can get a new MS sport for 20 bucks. Does that sound like a good prize or cheezy?\r\n\r\nAnother option is we can chip in and get one of the Mach 5 from Namuna and offer that as a prize. That should get some people in da house. I\'ll put in 20 if somebody can put in the other 15. It\'s up to you guys, but I don\'t think a free motor will cut it, unless we give one away everyday for a week...\r\n\r\n Anywho, the contest needs to be fun. Any ideas?\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla');
