INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (2110, '1a88f8dd22', '', '[quote:1a88f8dd22="payaso"]I agree with kwik. A contest to draw in new members is a great idea, but what kind of a contest, and how do we promote it?  I know that Cabo has got his $$ goin towards the site, so I can supply the prize. I can get a new MS sport for 20 bucks. Does that sound like a good prize or cheezy?\r\n\r\nAnother option is we can chip in and get one of the Mach 5 from Namuna and offer that as a prize. That should get some people in da house. I\'ll put in 20 if somebody can put in the other 15. It\'s up to you guys, but I don\'t think a free motor will cut it, unless we give one away everyday for a week...\r\n\r\n Anywho, the contest needs to be fun. Any ideas?\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla[/quote:1a88f8dd22]\r\nI agree we need something a little more tempting than a motor right now. I\'d say go with the isport, it\'s a great prize... no need to go as far as a mach me thinks.\r\npayaso if you go and pick it up I\'ll shoot a $10 USPS money order out to you to cover the other half, sound aight? \r\n\r\nRe: contest ideas-\r\nlemme mull it over for a bit...\r\n\r\nCabo- \r\nforgot to mention about the news story, I think maybe they need a little more promotion... so people know that they are there.\r\ni today just went to the home page by accident and happened to notice the new story. i\'m linked to the forum page automatically, so i don\'t always check for new stuff on the homepage. just my personal experience.\r\n\r\n 8)');
