INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (2144, '3b4d1ce79a', 'Got my Formula 34', 'Insanely Fun! This thing’s performance is outstanding, here’s what I ran it with; \r\nI tested with a tomy 50 mah battery double charged \r\n9.86:1 gear ratio\r\nBit racer soft tires in the front \r\nBit char-g stock mediums in the rear\r\n\r\nCrazy torque, blazin’ top end combine for a sick motor… I love this thing, I think more than my R-spec… nah j/k. It’s got crazy speed and stability in the corners, I love the acceleration to… I think I’m going to switch the gear ratio to 12:1 for more acceleration. Plus the friggin thing is damn fast for linoleum, taming it down won’t be that noticeable.\r\nThere’s no doubt in my mind that it’s one of my favorites now. \r\n\r\nI tried it in my Wild char-g too; it zips around pretty good for a wild now… probably comparable to a bit w/ 2.2. (again a double charge is a must). The added torque of the motor gives it that extra umf to get going.');
