INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (2167, '9279fcdd6d', '', '[quote:9279fcdd6d="kwikbb"]Ok here we go...\r\n\r\nsomething hot\r\n\r\nshattered elbow, had to be rebuilt... still got hardware in it :twisted:\r\n\r\nanother\r\n\r\nIf my head were shaved right now, i\'d take a pic of the scar I got there.\r\nIt\'s probably 6" in length (maybe a little more) in the shape of a "?". Doctors must of been in a comical mood when they did that one! :lol:[/quote:9279fcdd6d]\r\n\r\nI told you guys that I had some Dominican beauties that would make ya sober... View these at your own risk. The first is right after I got out of the ER..(notice how they stitched it up with lovely blue fishing line)\r\n[img:9279fcdd6d]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/payaso_knee2.jpg[/img:9279fcdd6d]\r\n\r\nThis is one after a day or 3 before the stitches pulled through the meat..\r\n[img:9279fcdd6d]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/payaso_knee1.jpg[/img:9279fcdd6d]\r\n\r\nThis next one is not a scab... It\'s what your meat looks like after the stitches pull out and it dies. It took three monts to remove all of it so my knee could heal..\r\n[img:9279fcdd6d]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/payaso_knee3.jpg[/img:9279fcdd6d]\r\n\r\nAnd here\'s one with the dead meat all gone... Yummy.. And I have nerve damage all the way to my foot.... :( \r\n[img:9279fcdd6d]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/payaso_knee4.jpg[/img:9279fcdd6d]\r\n\r\nHope you all enjoyed that... I have more from different crashes..\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
