INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (2281, '7c3d6548d4', '', 'Aight kids, here\'s the deal with the R-spec... this Ho\'s a power hungry biatch yall! And I also think that I gathered more evidence to support my theory that the [u:7c3d6548d4][url=http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=111]Wild Char-g can\'t go any faster than it already does...[/url][/u:7c3d6548d4]. Alrighty first things first, my continuing problem was a nasty studder coupled with the fact that i had to give it a nudge to get it going... and no matter how many times I would re-seat the motor it would constantly occur. So I\'d put it through the motions of "break\'n it in", still no better... keep in mind that i\'m double charg\'n too. It still was not enough for this Ho!\r\n\r\nSo i got to thinking about my theory on how the Wild char-g runs at full boost all the time, hence the motor being fed much more juice than a standard char-g PCB would put out. I proceeded to pop the R-spec in to my Wild and OMG this muthafunkas\' like a damn tsunami kid! I thought I was impressed when I dropped the Formula34 into this monster... well kiddies not as impressed as the R-spec. I\'m salivating right now at the thought of dual battery mod in the mud spit\'n monster. so to make along and painful science project short, if you think it\'s broken... don\'t sweat it, it\'s only showing it\'s true colors. This motor needs to be bottle fed and i don\'t mean mothers milk.\r\n\r\nMore Power is the key! Time to Play!');
