INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40792, '1043e6c8ca', 'Twister stuntcar inside Pics. Can it be mod out?', 'Last week I bought a couple of these Twister stuntcars just to see what\'s inside and I was quite impressed with the gearsystems that give these cars considerable strenght and speed.\r\nI want to use the insides for other purposes and want to know if there\'s a hidden Turbo function on the their?\r\nI can see a letter T but this can also stand for Test. Anyone knows?\r\n\r\nBy the way the transmitter runs on 3 AA batteries, range is pretty good. I Have no clue what type of rechargebale bats are in the car they run for 5 to 10 minutes depending on what moves you do.\r\n\r\n[img:1043e6c8ca]http://home.wanadoo.nl/jevries/jevries/text/stuntcar%201.jpg[/img:1043e6c8ca]\r\n[img:1043e6c8ca]http://home.wanadoo.nl/jevries/jevries/text/stuntcar%202.jpg[/img:1043e6c8ca]\r\n[img:1043e6c8ca]http://home.wanadoo.nl/jevries/jevries/text/stuntcar%204.jpg[/img:1043e6c8ca]\r\n[img:1043e6c8ca]http://home.wanadoo.nl/jevries/jevries/text/stuntcar%203.jpg[/img:1043e6c8ca]');
