INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (2688, '712a6550a8', 'IR cars', 'I have been thinking again about writing software on my iPAQ to control my bits.\r\n\r\nBut instead of the standard Bit-charg cars, I was wondering about the InfraRed Cars.   Mainly because most handhelds have an IR port embedded.  I don\'t think at this point it would take much to write and control.\r\n\r\nMy question is....what is a good IR car available ?\r\n\r\n-Nox');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (2689, '53ead05a7d', '', 'they sell niko iracers at toysrus for 20 i think. they are the same thing as digiqs. \r\n\r\nthey make ppc apps for remote controls so i cant see why you couldnt use those apps to control one. there is also a company that sells a piece of hardware(im pretty sure its just an ir l.e.d. hooked up to a headphone plug) for added range. my audiovox maestro only gets about 8foot range for my tv.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (2690, 'bad6db010c', 'Pimped out cool car contest', 'I was thinking that we could get another contest started to bring in more members.\r\nIt would be another cool car contest, which would (I hope) bring in some new members with mad modding skills. ie. NDTO, Mr. Freeze, among others..\r\n\r\nThese guys seem to have an audience watching for their next mod. or paint job...ect.\r\nWhat do you guys think we should offer as a prize? Or should we offer 1st 2nd and 3rd place prizes as well?\r\n\r\nAnd would we as members/moderators/pimps, be able to enter said contest?\r\nI\'m stoked about this, and ready to see some kick ass cars up in here besides ours.. And I also think that this place is ready for some serious BSing...\r\nWhat do you guys think about all that??? \r\n\r\nkwikbb, you\'re excused until you need to be...:)  Hope all is well in your neck of the woods...\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (2691, 'dc2cfc4519', '', 'Sounds perfect to me!\r\nI like the idea\'s, the 1st, 2nd, and 3rd place stuff too, but I\'m worried about the those places.\r\nLet\'s say first place gets a car.\r\nWhat does 2nd and 3rd get?\r\nIf it\'s too small, they\'ll think it\'s worthless and I\'m affraid they\'ll be driven away if they see someone that\'s just totally badass.\r\nOn the other hand, if we offer anything more, it\'ll start eating into our pockets pretty good.\r\nWe\'ve got some thinking to do, great ideas, we definetaly need to do something with them.\r\n\r\noh, and I think users would be thinking "conspiracy" if we entered too, what do you think?');
