INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (2742, '62b9ff4d41', '', 'no shit! :D   Tiny definately has a runnaway site on his hands.....\r\n\r\nI want to put this circuit into a pistol-grip like housing like a lot of RC controllers.  Then I\'d use a connector at the base of the grip to be able to plug into the various controllers I have.   The best mod would be to plug this into a 4-channel controller and it\'s then propo all the way.\r\n\r\nJust one question, since I\'ve never owned a pistol grip controller I\'d like to know which way is fwd/rev on the trigger?   Pressing the trigger towards you forward?  The pushing it away from you is reverse?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
