INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39699, 'a30e2726ea', 'Nothin special', 'I got this new $4.00 pullback body last week, opened up one of my $10 original MicroSizers, threw in a $1.50 mystery 3.8, lowered the tabs, teal gears from a $1.25 Hop up kit (Target sale), spring suspension, painted wheels, stock tires. Less than 2 hours and $20 and I\'ve got a great new racer.\r\n\r\nI might add a little detail and clearcoat, but this one\'s gonna be a driver. The Murcialago is one of the nicest stock body/paint I\'ve seen, gonna leave it like that. I drove it a bit last night, and I don\'t even think it needs mosfets.\r\n\r\n[img:a30e2726ea]http://www.grymttr.com/carpix/murcie1.jpg[/img:a30e2726ea]\r\n\r\n[img:a30e2726ea]http://www.grymttr.com/carpix/murcie2.jpg[/img:a30e2726ea]\r\n\r\n[img:a30e2726ea]http://www.grymttr.com/carpix/murcie3.jpg[/img:a30e2726ea]\r\n\r\n[img:a30e2726ea]http://www.grymttr.com/carpix/murcie4.jpg[/img:a30e2726ea]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (3072, '8bf26e3994', '', 'Alright all you crack babies, here\'s some pics...\r\n\r\n[url]http://tinyrc.com/gallery/MicroComparisons[/url]\r\n[url]http://tinyrc.com/gallery/puchi[/url]\r\n\r\nI don\'t know what the hell the deal is, but I\'ve had to bust apart the goddamn steering components TWICE already because the thing locked-up. \r\n\r\nWhat\'s worse is I\'ve taken that thing COMPLETELY apart and still can\'t pinpoint the problem area...I did enjoy bustin that shit apart though, gettin yur hands dirty is the ONLY way to learn baby.\r\n\r\nDid a little more running around with it, the comparison of the Puchi with a Bit that has a 2.2 motor in it is about right...It sure as hell ain\'t fast (stock anyway). Definitely nice for running on the table and small tracks though...Real nice steerin/throttle control.');
