INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (3285, 'ca80a31b5c', '', 'let\'s go with what kwik has above, we\'ll just add to it where we need to.\r\n\r\nI\'m also proposing we only offer a 1st place prize - we\'re trying to keep the expenses down.\r\n\r\nAfter talking w/ payaso, I think for this contest, for many reasons, I\'ll pitch in $10.00. If us 3 do, that\'s 30.00 (no shit sherlock right?), that\'d buy the Speed Racer car... that\'d be a good 1st place prize.\r\n\r\nso, if we went that route, we could start the contest like now (payaso\'s got the car), contest goes for 2 months, so that\'s plenty of time to come up with 10.00, and the only thing I can think of to add to kwik\'s post above, would be to announce and show a pic of what the prize is for the winner. oh, and I guess we\'llhave to give them the deadline date, and a few posting rules (i.e. 2 pics, 1 with bitpimps addy written on card in background, and 2 submission per user?)\r\n\r\nwhat do you guys think of all that?');
