INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39164, '9f8eeb9c05', '', '[quote:9f8eeb9c05="sessiz"][quote:9f8eeb9c05="payaso"]\r\nWTF is up with weebles?  \r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D[/quote:9f8eeb9c05]\r\n\r\nWTF is a weeble? :???: \r\n\r\nI remember when I was a kid my moms figured she would make me a pizza. She rolled the dough out put it in a pan, put the suace on it and the cheese, stuck it in the oven and let it sit. (she wanted for some reason to let the dough rise a bit more) She turns on the oven and cooks it. I\'m going crasy over here waiting for the damn thing to be cooked, finally it\'s ready she says. She pulls it out of the oven and lo and behold a multitude of roaches for a toping. Even though they were cooked and all my moms didn\'t let me eat it. :?[/quote:9f8eeb9c05]\r\n\r\n\r\nWeebles are a little black bug about the size of a flec of pepper.  They like to chill out in the canister of flour...  \r\n\r\nIf you wanted to only eat food that\'s 100% bug free, you\'d starve, cause they\'re in everything..\r\n\r\nThe FDA has a limit though.  Did you know that a certain amount of rat hair is OK in Peanut Butter?  they keep it pretty low, but they allow some..\r\n\r\nAnd i love Jiffy PB &amp; J   Mmmmnnn.... Rat hair. :-) \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
