INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (3730, '898c4a197c', '', 'I dunno, I\'ve been wondering that myself.\r\nI think its apparent we have to abandon the idea of payaso sending or recieving prizes, Cliff will just fuck that shit up and then we\'ll have pissed off contest winners.\r\nSo, now we need to choose someone to be the designated prize holder for this contest - my nomination goes to kwik. lol - you guys got any ideas?\r\nThen, we need to figure out what the prize is going to be. I like the Mach 5 idea because it\'s kinda rare, not as easily obtained and not so many have them. I\'d like to stick to that, kinda makes the prize more worth while... I just don\'t know what\'s where and how easy or hard it is to get for others. Like a MS Pro? or maybe we just buy a car, and put the "bitPimps Custom Modifications" touch on it and mod if it before it\'s shipped?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (3731, 'e34f9c9888', '', 'I have no room to test... it\'s beyond.\r\n\r\n[img:e34f9c9888]http://home.attbi.com/~noxorc/boosterpro.jpg[/img:e34f9c9888]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (3732, 'c90bdaeef4', '', 'I think that convinces me.\r\n2 is plenty, 3 is overkill.\r\nI\'ve been giving it alot of thought lately, especially seeing these vans around, seems like you could fit 4 batts in there no prob.\r\nAt first I thought 3 cells would be great for super torque, hill climbs and wheelies, but now I\'m thinking it would just spin the tires out of control - useless.\r\n\r\nhey hog, how\'d the stomper wheel mod go?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (3733, '21556a3dd7', '', 'you gotta find someplace and shoot video - I gotta see that thing rolling unboosted and then going plaid when it is boosted! lol\r\n\r\nstreet out front isn\'t smoove enough?');
