INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (3761, 'fd462a6d96', '', '[quote:fd462a6d96="Namuna"]What 3.8 you runnin? \r\n\r\nMine is the green endbell 3.8 (From Tiny)...What makes mine different is that it\'s pretty damned efficient! In my Motor Tests I found that the \'typical\' current drain (which means what it runs off of under normal load) for this motor was actually pretty close to the 2.6, which is to say failry low...But when you put it under load (like from a dead stop or pullin out of turns), it pulls plenty of juice.\r\n\r\nWhat am I getting at? Well that 3.8 you\'re using might need the high current at all times, so it\'s piss poor when starved on unboosted mode. The 3.8 I got runs great under normal to low current, and kicks balls when the juice flows.[/quote:fd462a6d96]\r\n\r\nI\'m runnin the green end bell from tiny as well, except I actually got mine from kyle before tiny started stocking his motors..\r\n\r\nDon\'t get me wrong, I love the 3.8 in the booster, but it\'s no match for the 2.6 in severe driving conditions..ie. carpet, hills.\r\n\r\nWhen I race in open spaces, it\'s the 3.8 all the way..  You should try the 2.6 from Kyle though... You\'ll be impressed... Trust me..\r\n\r\nI have videos to prove the torque that it puts out is INSANE... It even beats the pink clone motor hog talks about..(but not by much)\r\n\r\nI have plenty of clips for you now hog... You\'ll have to cut em up though, and show people there\'s a story of tribulation behind it...lol\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla');
