INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39694, '41c7605469', '', '[quote:41c7605469="hue35"][quote:41c7605469="sessiz"]Sessiz basically is what I am. Sessiz = turkish for silent. I\'m the quiet one. Until I get some alcohol in me. :-)[/quote:41c7605469]\r\n\r\nOH YEAH, I totally forgot, but I\'ve been meaning to ask you this for a while... I saw your screen name on some old sheet music at an antique store The lady told me the text was in Turkish... the song was \'Silent Night\'. You don\'t strike me as the silent type.[/quote:41c7605469]\r\n\r\nWas it "Sessiz geceler"?  :???: \r\nIt takes me awhile to open up to new people (issues I guess), so this makes people label me "the quiet one". This offcourse changes quickly and they start refering to me as "GOD" or " the one who is wise beyond his years" or " The mighty KROM", don\'t ask me why...I guess I\'m just cool like that. :-)');
