INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (4423, 'bfd69ef3b7', '', 'BIG UPS!\r\n\r\nI appreciate the quick inclusion ito the play list. BTW its Suntzu28@hotmail.com if ya like what ya hear.\r\n\r\nJust a lil info....an im probably puttingmore out there than i need to lol (looks through the blinds for cops)....\r\n\r\nI got tired of mangement and the boring life and that mixed wit BU-KOO stress makes a man do crazy things in So. Cali. So.....I came up on some change  :wink:  (10 +) and decided life in another location wuld be beneficial. Bought a ticket on the next thing smoking.....\r\n\r\nQ-Zero is my cuzzo and he has mad talent  and i have a background in music ( helped Toni Tony Tone write material as a teen). Rather than take the stadard contract that RAPES new artist , i put up G\'s and started a label and funded this,  the 1st of three projects. I produced , co -wrote and performed on the  radio friendly track "Ice Cold" and co -produced "Highway" a few others. This is getting long ..if ya feel it THANK YOU regardless of whether you cop it. Big Ups to Bit Pimps....I was getting tired of being nice on my home board and Tiny\'s spot.  relish the opportunity to talk about these tight ass cars (which make great eye candy sitting on a DAT or near a mic stand ) without playin\' the PC role.');
