INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39680, '6427aaef5a', 'Oh snap!.....then, fix!', 'Well, yesterday, when I tried to modify the suspension coils by stretching them to make em long and hard (perverts :lol: ) the stick on the bottom part of one of the plastic dampers broke off. I got pissed.....and that was on one of the front dampers. :x\r\n\r\nSo, I swapped the rear dampers to the front, and as for the rear suspension.... this is what I came up with. \r\n\r\n[img:6427aaef5a]http://img19.photobucket.com/albums/v57/amitojbatra/d61cb32c.jpg[/img:6427aaef5a]\r\n\r\nIt doesn\'t work too well, and when you hit a bump or something, it will go all the way in. It may be the softest system of suspension you\'ll ever have... However, once you gain some distance while driving, it evens out nicely. ;)\r\n\r\nEDIT: I just realized, with the softness in the BACK, and the hardness in the FRONT, it will cause understeer. I\'m gonna swap the systems.');
