INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (8058, '72feaebd1f', 'here it is guys....', 'can I post it now?? I hope so, cuz here it goes\r\n\r\n\r\n[b:72feaebd1f][size=24:72feaebd1f]Truck of Bit Pimps Member Found in Back Alley, Officials Say Rival Gang “Tiny R/C” to Blame[/size:72feaebd1f][/b:72feaebd1f]\r\n[i:72feaebd1f][size=18:72feaebd1f]midget_man1387--Pimp City, Pimpafornia[/size:72feaebd1f][/i:72feaebd1f]\r\n\r\nThe truck of a member of the Bit Pimps Gang was found by Pimp City Police yesterday in an alley behind the house of Tiny R/C gang member, tinyrc. Neighbors to the evil man called police after they saw a truck they’d seen in the suburbs of Pimp City shot up and trashed. Officials believe that the truck’s owner, Bit Pimps gang member payaso was busy working on a few Glorias of his and blasting country music, when the rival gang swept in and took the truck. Therefore, because of payaso’s music, he was not able to hear the gang steal his truck.\r\n\r\nOfficials say that the gang members of Tiny R/C then took the car through fire, busted out a couple of windows, shot the car with machine guns, and tore the car up. They then “left it for dead” in the alley behind tinyrc’s house. Luckily, m_m1387 news was able to get a couple of action shots of the trashing, as we see the gang driving the vehicle through fire. [img:72feaebd1f]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0VgCuBJYbr9Ym38xsxaLYcA5Svy0SCts1PopfJVeRxTSVvIJBuSS7yiG4vhm9Jo3VdtVfq46NK8p97V4OYQjQTTmQWziLFy3*NbwBhv6mjC!GX!FPmlEVPkb2f7pYccVW/hahaha.jpg?dc=4675422610519099757[/img:72feaebd1f][img:72feaebd1f]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0VwDeAsgb*Ogm38xsxaLYcFv*vl3D8O2E61C0S!0LXdYWdDZNI*xWaY7Ipj0iq4jEnd7cla2lAnktrzWUFz44W5fCCQD1rvF0UxvZD!JGDX0YyVxNu02O0ToAB0N36vk2/hahaha2.jpg?dc=4675422610532916825[/img:72feaebd1f]\r\n\r\nThe reason for the demolition is unknown, but insiders believe it has something to do with tinyrc thinking payaso was a traitor, as payaso posed as a friend to the gang. Obviously there was some turmoil between the two gangs, which seemed unaware to the public.\r\n\r\nThe truck, seen to the right following the damage, was a bB, modified by the Bit Pimps gang, and used often by the leaders of the gang, payaso, CaboWabo, and kwikbb. [img:72feaebd1f]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0VwDeAskbS!km38xsxaLYcGvQ3Ggi0BL!y1E*uAABl1xrjJzLty!3aXNT0lep6mZ7tmKVmPFChxqMoDKkmjCfWHRSBeniHWoMrU3PcL03H6b*k6IBpOkX4lJOH!EayObJ/hahaha3.jpg?dc=4675422610556905013[/img:72feaebd1f] One gang member, who claims to be DarkTari, stated, “We’re gonna get these bastards.... I don’t care what it takes, but we’ll get those bitches back for what they’ve done,” as he flexed his muscles and showed off his muscular physique. Payaso replied by saying, “They just started a war. I’m just damn glad it wasn’t one of my Glorias. They mess with the Glorias, they will go down.”\r\n\r\nAs previously stated, payaso was customizing one of his many Glorias, a car which he loves with all of his heart and does work on constantly. CaboWabo, a fellow gang leader, saw the truck driving away from payaso’s house, but thought nothing of it, he says. “I just figured he was out of Vaseline or something.”\r\n\r\nTinyrc remains in jail tonight awaiting trial, along with fellow Tiny R/C gang members xatu, Namuna, Pie, and yellowsupra. No word yet on charges or bail.');
