INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (4519, '1f4f6fff8b', '', 'aight the dual\'s playtime has dropped to 1 min. on a 5 min. charge... :x \r\nI gotta see if i accidentally toasted a cell whilest soldering or sumthin?!\r\nDamnit what the freak is going on, it\'s so frustrating... Anyone got any ideas?\r\n\r\nMeanwhile i dropped a 160 mah single into another bit at about the same time as i began the dual, and i gave it a charge on my bypassed charger for 2 min. and got a whopping  6 min. run time :shock:. \r\nIn the beggining after about 1.5 min. of running it began to studder, so i figured that at this point it was gonna die. then all of the sudden out of the blue it got a 2nd wind a ran for about another 4.5 - 5 min. studder free!\r\n\r\nsumthing else i ran into when testing the bypassed charger for the voltage it was spittin\' out, i had my multi-band handy so for comparative purposes i tested that as well and here are the results;\r\n\r\n[color=blue:1f4f6fff8b]bypassed charger: 2.83V\r\nmultiband: 2.95V[/color:1f4f6fff8b]\r\n\r\nok so this confused the hell out of me! i tested them both the same way, by  way of the charging pad... so this is bizzare because i was under the impression that the bypass opened up some kind of current block or sumthin\'?!');
