INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (8913, '84d9e151a2', 'Re: Prize Donation Request', '[quote:84d9e151a2="CaboWabo"]\r\n#1 If they\'re talking about a "bit" contest, as in to do with cars, noway - too little of a prize for what we expect from contestants entries.\r\n#2 I believe this is purely because midget man happened to enter and win. he made some posts over at tiny and here we are. that was kind of a disaster I thought, but I could be wrong.\r\n#3 That place has always left a bad taste in my mouth for many reasons.\r\n\r\nOne side of me obviously wants to turn them down, politely I guess. lol\r\nThe other side of me says to let them give a motor for another press release contest and just hey whatever its for the community.\r\n\r\nWhat do you guys think?[/quote:84d9e151a2]\r\nHmm... i think that if their talking about the pimped out ride contest, then yes there living in a delusional state.\r\nI think the PNN contest was a kinda of a fluke that no one expected to fulfill it... well that\'s how i see it anyway, and in reference to doing that type of contest again well i think maybe in few months or so. We wanna keep some element of intrest and creativity in the contests, so maybe they can donate a motor in a few months if they\'re still interested when it comes around. But if they have a change of heart and would like to offer up something a little more substantial for a future contest then by all means... not to sound greedy or anything but EM would no doubt be more forthgiving, given his past efforts. \r\nSo i guess i\'m saying i think we are all set for donations at this time and i\'d rather see EM get the publicity.\r\n\r\nYa feelin\' me :D \r\n\r\n-word');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (5087, 'a09c16d8b1', '', 'yea if you dont have those tapes lying around dont buy any.. they would probably cost more than a dollar..  find a place that has slot cars. and buy some slot car springs.  i bought 4 of them for 1.25  and you can get different heights and spring rates... and no they are not magnetic..');
