INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48877, '3abf3980fc', 'Re: l', '[quote:3abf3980fc="jmays"]man i tell u that u are trippin, the last thing i want to do is build an rc and spend like three weeks on it and post it here to have ppl tell me that it sucks ass, something that u may think is awsome might suck to another person, so if the pimps from this sight are open minded enough to consider that you may have put some real effort into an rc , why on earth would they knock u down, I know that some pple like it black and white, just tell it like it is. BUt they are few and far between.\r\n\r\nIf i put three weeks into a body and i was told that the paint sucks, shit i would just go some where else were i might find some support.\r\n\r\nlightin up some , its a hobby, there are no gold medals to be handed out, just some clean fun and colaborations between fellow enthusiast .\r\n\r\n\r\njmays[/quote:3abf3980fc]\r\n\r\nyou got a great point, but I dunno, when I posted that, it juss seemed like the peeps here at bitpimps cared a lil bit too much for me lol, and you mite not tell me my shit sucks. Most of the time, it does... but you guys find the good shit about it and say that, it seemed like the germans find the bad shit, and tell you so you can correct it. I figured that when I posted that, the germans would say, the corner lites should be different, or something like that. That way, I vould post here and have you guys enjoy EVERYTHING, not just the few things good about it. It just sucks, because honestly, I was real proud of this ride, but now I\'m not sure what to think anymore.\r\n\r\nSo basically, I hope you guys do post your thoughts, in honesty, no matter good or bad. I mean I\'m sure I\'ll have a few people against me, and a few on my side, but you know, I\'d love to stay here.\r\n\r\nyeah, thanks again.');
