INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39668, 'e168df9629', '', 'hue35 is a hodgepodge of stuff... in college, I used to sign up for things, like the record club or petitions or bottle return slips, using the name Hugh Jorgan (huge organ). Occasionally, when needed, I would rope someone in to be my brother, Lar Jorgan (large organ) for double the fun. Anyway, when SuperFly and I used to go to the nickel arcade, 10-11 years ago, my screen name was \'hue\' (techno version of "Hugh" 8-) ). My dad raced Vettes throughout my single-digit years and his number was 35... me pappy passed-on 11 years ago. From him, I learned to love racing and to "do the shit out of hobbies" (ho trains and large-scale rc planes were his deal)... so, \'hue\' represents SuperFly and I hangin\' out as full-tilt kids (we met in our early 20s), and \'35\' represents the foundation of my little-car madness.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (5329, 'ab4a39cdd9', '', '[quote:ab4a39cdd9="noxorc"]\r\nSorry fellow pimpers....been wicked busy..\r\n\r\nMy days are running into the nights  ... and nights have been late ones.\r\nMy kids b\'days coming up..so some of my spare time has been building\r\na [url=http://www.cedarworks.com/playsets/detail.php?s=JJS1]Playset[/url], wallpapering, etc.... getting ready for guests over the house.\r\nit will all end soon...and I can get back to my hobbies.\r\n[/quote:ab4a39cdd9]\r\nDamn nox how the hell ya gonna hide that from the kid! :shock: LOL\r\nit\'s all good mang.\r\n[quote:ab4a39cdd9="noxorc"]\r\nCrib (aka  kwikbb),  I went to Radioshack and bought a 2-C cell battery holder.\r\nI\'ve been chargin my dual cells this way...and it\'s working great.\r\nGives them a nice charge.  (next morning, they still have something)\r\n\r\n-Nox[/quote:ab4a39cdd9] \r\nthat\'s definetly a good piece of info mang, thing is i gotta bust into another chassis. i fried my 27mhz PCB (not much love lost there) and two cells (lotta love lost there) so i\'m back to the lab again!\r\nOn a good note I rebuilt my other 45mhz, that was gonna be donor for my ZZ chassis, out of spare parts from the 27mhz! yippy!\r\nSo it made me feel a little better to be able to create one after i had destroyed another :(   :lol:');
