INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39661, 'f10cf54b51', '', 'Arite My SN is Old ass school, as in AOL 2.0.  Basically my RL name is Jesse King.  Well a chick friend of mine in freshman year came in one day flabbergasted by a Wizard of Id comic strip where this parrot calls the King "the King is a fink, the King is a fink"  Bottom line, she thought it was wayyyy funnier than it actually was but the name stuck, morphing a bit into finks.\r\n\r\nArite so that\'s the story I tell everyone (which is true).  But now I am going to go one step further and tell all my pimps the almost diasterous evolution of Finks.  In gym class a year later we are doing hurdles.  Well I had to race against this track chick and to save a little dignity it was a very even race.  After the race tho I was talking to my friend and said, "I feel like a friggin fairy jumping those hurdles compared to her" (due to her very agressive run/jump compared to my "hop")  So on the next race I literally pranced over the hurdles and Finkles the Fairy King was born  :sob: for all of 3 days till the joke got tired.  Arite getting of the couch now.  Bring on the abuse  :grin:');
