INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43695, '4641b1c438', '', 'Thanks for the props everyone!!!  It motivates me to keep moddin\' and improving the mods, like what I\'m going to post now.\r\n\r\n[img:4641b1c438]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Xmod%20Stuff/Xmodtires_007_11.jpg[/img:4641b1c438]\r\nChassis Shot, with body grindings!!!\r\n\r\n[img:4641b1c438]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Xmod%20Stuff/Xmodtires_007_14.jpg[/img:4641b1c438]\r\nNew anttenna, with SG bent into tip!!  No matter how much I tried, I couldn\'t get the \'tenna to stop moving!!\r\n\r\n[img:4641b1c438]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Xmod%20Stuff/Xmodtires_007_16.jpg[/img:4641b1c438]\r\nTook tape spacer off, and used a toggle switch cover that was cut to fit. Huge improvment.\r\n\r\n[img:4641b1c438]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Xmod%20Stuff/Xmodtires_007_20.jpg[/img:4641b1c438]\r\nNew smaller wheel mod, next to old larger one.  Smaller one has ZZ hubcaps glued to them with the Xmod nuts glued on.\r\n\r\n[img:4641b1c438]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Xmod%20Stuff/Xmodtires_007_21.jpg[/img:4641b1c438]\r\nLarger wheels with countersunk Xmod nuts.\r\n\r\n[img:4641b1c438]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Xmod%20Stuff/Xmodtires_007_22.jpg[/img:4641b1c438]\r\nThe smaller wheels.  Yet to be tested, still drying.\r\n\r\nThe body has been totally weight reduced.  Anything that was unnessary was dremeled off!!  No mirrors, mounts for the mirrors, no tail pipe mount, no hood mounts.  Headlight covers and hood are glued on.  The only screws in the body are the front and rear bumper.  I ground the rear wells to the bottom of the window and the front to the headlight and back to door.  I\'ll have pics of this later. :smile: \r\n\r\nI also have vid that Bird helped out with and shot for me, but need to edit so you can load it and watch it in the same night!!  The vid was shot in front of Bird\'s crib on a hill with a perfect jumping curb!!! I\'m off to search out some dirt for some footage!!! Vid will be posted up on [url]http://www.sg219.com[/url], hopefully later tonight!!!!  I\'ll drop a post when its up. :cool: \r\n\r\n\r\nAnyone have a really big staple, and do they sell install kits for the staple suspension kit? :???: \r\n\r\nTO BE CONTINUED...................');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (5889, 'bbb069188a', '', 'update after a few days of running and a dual cell: steering is off the hizzie. drivetrain wasnt as good as i initially thought but i put a ms idler/pinion and now no problems. i put the motor that came in it in my bit and man let me tell you that my bit is now probably the fastest one ive had to date. even faster than the 2000gtr. i think the 2kgtr had more torque but this thing tops out like crazy. \r\n\r\nthe clone isnt brag ready yet. im gona drop in a 45mhz pcb and i gota match my batteries up better. i put my wrx cyclona body on it and it looks sweet.\r\n\r\n\r\nagain i cant emphasize how well it handles.');
