INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (5960, '97fa0675e7', '', 'Usually if someone finds out about Clarks powers, they die at the end of the episode... Now there are 4 people out there that know he\'s a bad ass...\r\n\r\nLionel, and the three morons from last night...\r\n\r\nThe episode where Lionel, and Clark are together, Lionel\'s just getting his site back. That\'s the way I understood it.. So I don\'t know how much of his powers Lionel actually saw, but the episode where Mrs. Kent, and Lionel were being held hostage, now that\'s a different story....\r\n\r\nLionel told Lex that Clark Kent was a very special boy after they were rescued...  Was it just me, or was Lionel sportin some "Soul Glow" in his hair last night?  lol\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla');
