INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48143, 'aae0002366', '', 'hello iwaver fans :-)   \r\n\r\nwhat can i say....  as a moderator at mini-zracer i have to apologize for the crap fest that continued to drag on over there.  i tried my best to stay out of the way and i never took any action that i didn\'t think was necesarry.  heck i was ll for the iwaver thread\'s as you can see in each one that has posted.  it\'s a shame really that such a wealth of information on these doesn\'t get the chance to be heard or shared.  i\'ll do my best to not comment on anyone in particular regarding the fiasco that was as it is not my place here to do so.  sufice to say i was extremely disappointed that all the iwaver threads seemed to get swamped by pointless bickering.  i wanted to see cool stuff like most of this thread shows.  \r\n\r\nas far as their availability, someone in a thread on mzr said an ebay seller has them for something like $40 which is $10 bucks cheaper than the next u.s. seller.  at that price i will be buying a few for the younger kids to run on my rcp track.  they keep aksing me to run my z\'s and i keep telling them no way in hell as i don\'t want to tape $150-300 on a car and run it into a wall :-(   i\'d rather get a few clones or whatever your favorite term fot them is and let them wreck those.  \r\n\r\ni\'d also like to use the electronics in some of the custom projects i have in mind.  you can\'t beat that price for full set of working electronics 8) \r\n\r\nnow if they would only release an iwaver overland i\'d be in heaven :eek:');
