INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40558, '2b8b7e5b15', '', '[quote:2b8b7e5b15="betty.k"]son goku, people are right to look down on you, you are a spoilt little turd that throws tantrums when you get cut off halfway through a download, or something equally as trivial! your schoolfriends are just doing the best they can to get through the day without having to listen to your piss ant little whining voice, trust me. i\'ve been to school with fuckwits like you, i feel their pain. :sob: frickin\' baby!\r\n\r\nbut i can sympathise with you on the high school adolescence thing, anyone who says "you\'ll look back on these days as the best days of your life" was obviously a total taco in high school. best days start when you leave as far as i\'m concerned. i still think you\'re a twat though.... :thebird:[/quote:2b8b7e5b15]\r\n\r\nWoah, calm down!!! I wasn\'t trying to just throw a tantrum outta nowhere, and you haven\'t even seen the people in my school. I mean, I thought this was a thread where people could just talk about the things that piss em off, maybe it\'s cuz I only read on pg 15 and on from there. And, I\'m not throwing a tantrum or anything...since other people here are talking about their probs, I thought I could do so too. Fine, maybe I can\'t. Maybe I got outta hand.....fine. Sorry....but I think you need to calm down and stop calling me a twat. What is your problem? \r\n\r\n@ Cabo: Ok, you win. Maybe I was overreacting, I was just starting to notice that kids were being looked down cuz of their age.....alright, I misunderstood. I take it back.\r\n\r\n[quote:2b8b7e5b15]Gokus rants in here always have a way of making me feel old... dammit I\'m only 29![/quote:2b8b7e5b15]\r\n\r\nAlright, I took the hint.\r\n\r\n\r\nSorry guys..... :-(');
