INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39658, 'ce4331560a', '', 'If it helps you get your head around it DT, I\'ve got ya beat. I\'m not even going to mention hue35 (known around here as "the hoarder"), who probably has me beat 2:1.\r\n\r\nOur thinking was that micro RC may very well be a fad, and this shit may be hard to come by. It already is! No more at TRU, Target, KB, or other stores that used to carry them. When you want to sit down and mod up a car in a year, you\'re gonna need some raw materials.\r\n\r\nI vowed to not have this be a collector hobby, where you keep the pristine, unopened box for 20 years. I do have an unopened Speed Racer Mach 5 and Ultraman Mat Vehicle that I may not drive, but everything else is fair game. It\'s nice to get a cool pullback body and rip a new chassis out of the box to put under it. \r\n\r\nI even drive the show cars from time to time. Put a nasty chip in the front fender of that ivory Porsche last week. :-?  \r\n\r\np.s. I\'m droolin on yer unopened Nakamichi Racers. Mmmmm, wheels!');
