INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39108, '87c481e8b3', '', 'Hey, any of you guys having a problem with NFO8oldskool?\r\n\r\nDude sent me this PM yesterday..\r\n\r\n[quote:87c481e8b3]Do You have a Xmods? I was just wondering because I am starting a page for Xmods where You can post pics and Mods and everybody can talk about X mods and stuff, it would be cool if I could get more people to join, If You would like to join i need Your Email address so that I can send You a invitation to get into the site. Need more members, and I am trying to figure out how to make the site public to the web, right now it is a private site and I need managers and other people. thanks[/quote:87c481e8b3]\r\n\r\nI was getting ready to be nice and say i don\'t play with my xmod that much, but if wants to sign me up I\'d probably drop by, but before i could finish typing that, he sends me another saying simply..."I need more members"\r\n\r\nthen I thought, ok you little spammer you\'re getting carried away, I should be shutting you down now, but I decided to think about overnight before I reacted. Then the little prick resends the first PM again. If he needs memebers so damn bad, why is invite only.  :???: \r\n\r\n\r\nIs he bugging you guys too? what you guys think, is this crossing the line? Should I tear him a new one?');
