INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40462, '254a95469a', '', '[quote:254a95469a="CaboWabo"]difference between doing it at a young age and as an adult at an older age is a black eye and a marked locker or a ditch and a stab wound. lol[/quote:254a95469a]\r\nI don\'t know, but it seems that these young guys nowadays are pretty quick to pull out guns... even over petty shit that would\'ve been handled with a fistfight in my school days. That fact combined with the fact that most of these fools on the streets don\'t know how to handle a gun and usually end up smoking innocent bystanders makes me leery of even arguing with people nowadays. I got a family to worry about and all I need is some little punk that thinks he\'s 50 Cent or Eminem or whatever to come at me and accidentally hurt or kill one of my loved ones.\r\nA few weeks ago, at the house of a cousin of a friend of my lady, these 2 guys were looking for one of the guys car keys, and the guy whos keys they were looking for went back inside and gave up. The other guy ended up finding the keys in the ignition of his "friends" car and took them in to him. When he told him where he found them, this guy starts flippin\' out about "You shouldn\'t be touching my ride!" and all that shit and somehow they all ended up outside and the guy who couldn\'t find his keys wound up pulling out a gun and "accidentally" shooting the other guys lady in the chest. She died in that driveway.\r\nMakes me miss back in the day when people handled shit like MEN, with their fists. Not like little pussies, with guns.\r\n\r\nNow I feel like the dad in "Friday"\r\n\r\nGokus rants in here always have a way of making me feel old... dammit I\'m only 29!');
