INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (6814, 'f38409385f', 'My best 1/64th scale flame job yet.', 'I emphasize 1/64th scale, because I think I\'ve still done better work in 1/10th scale, but this is getting damn close to what I can pull off in larger scale.\r\n\r\nFunny thing was this was a junk body that had I had attached a oversized wing on to be funny. I got carried away with the project, and accidently pulled off my best work yet. I was even using an Exacto with a broken tip, because I\'m out of blade.\r\n\r\nThe wing has been trimmed down for these pics, here\'s a peek of what it used to look like. (Hogjowls, you ought to love this one :wink: )\r\n[img:f38409385f]http://erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/ricerbk.jpg[/img:f38409385f]\r\n\r\n...and here\'s what it currently looks like...\r\n[img:f38409385f]http://erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/civicfl.jpg[/img:f38409385f]\r\n\r\n[img:f38409385f]http://erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/civicfl1.jpg[/img:f38409385f]');
