INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40448, 'ed7d76c353', '', 'Mmm hmm....\r\n\r\nSo today, in the hallways after 7th period, there was this fucker behind me, and he was slapping and hitting by backpack with his shorts or whatever. He thought it was funny, and I grew tired of this after the third time. I remember the discussion here about how to just hit back and not take shit, so I turned around and gave him a roundhouse kick, and it hit him. He just caught my leg and laughed his ass off like a retard, and I was gonna give him some more but the assistant principal caught me and gave me a detention. \r\n\r\nAnd then I had to go on the late bus, and there was this pretty girl there, I\'d known her for a little while. She wasn\'t HOT or a BABE or slutty hot.....just plain pretty and cute. I was kinda pissed, and in a low mood cuz she never knew I existed, or never paid attention to whatever I did. \r\n\r\nToday was a shitty day, the only thing that made it better was knowing that I fixed a hummer micro RC car for a lunch monitor\'s son. Oh well. FUCK MY HIGH SCHOOL!');
