INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (7162, '6e0cac2c9e', '', '[quote:6e0cac2c9e="crazydave"]I don\'t alllow photos of myself, so it was kinda hard to find a pic of myself, but you guys all look people I\'ve hung out with at some point in my life, so I felt like I had to put a pic up. This probably a couple years ago, because my hair is longer now, but I still wear that shirt.\r\n\r\nAnd I have to admit I feel a certain kinship toward Hogjowls knowing he used to skate, and has a kid about he same age as my kid. About a year ago I move into an apartment that is about a 1/4 mile from a skate park, so I bought a board and tried to get back into skateing. Skateing and falling go hand in hand, and at first I\'m like, "I can take it, no big deal", but I soon discovered my 32 y.o. body doesn\'t recover like it did when I was a teen. I actually sold that board to fund my first Bit Char-G\r\n\r\n[/quote:6e0cac2c9e]\r\n\r\nI agree with you...  once you look at someones picture... you feel more comfortable talking with them.  it\'s amazing how some of the homies in here have the same life styles/ life problems/ life situations as others.\r\nsometimes I feel my lost twin is in here posting my crap before I made it.\r\n\r\n-Nox');
