INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40379, '2977cb89ed', '', 'Dammit, I want that Lard, and it\'s cut off twice now at 46mb. :mad:\r\n\r\nWell, this account is costing me not-a-cent so I can\'t complain.\r\n\r\nI\'ll just have to get a down load manager, or maybe we should break the albums in half?\r\n\r\nAnyways, here\'s something I wanted you guys to check out. Some hardcore techno-industrial. I stumbled across these guys while perusing the Earache catalog. They caught me off guard, because Earache bands are usually guitar oriented Industrial Metal, but these guys are more like gabber type stuff, but I dig this, because the riffing is almost speed metal like, and I find this a lot less monotonous compare to say like the Thunderdome comps.\r\n\r\nTheir albums have a theme through out. This one has the theme of a love gone bad, and self detructive racer. I dig the hell out of the last track, "Team UVR". It\'s the big race song, right after the break up song, it\'s almost like a video game song, and the woman\'s voice at the beginning announces, "Team Ultra-Violence Racing...Hardcore...Fucking fast", then about halfway through the song proceeds into the sonic equivilent of knocking you upside the head.\r\n\r\nSo here it is: Ultra-Violence - Super Power (41mb)\r\nhttp://www.crazybydesign.net/bitpimps/tunes/uvr.zip \r\n\r\n1. Sex\r\n2. Electra\r\n3. Superpower\r\n4. Airbreak\r\n5. Speed\r\n6. Race\r\n7. The Dark Station\r\n8. Diamonds\r\n9. Seperation\r\n10. Team UVR\r\n\r\nLet me know if you guys dig this, cause I\'ve got all their stuff.\r\n\r\nI also want you guys to hear "Psycho Drama", the tale of Jessica, crack whore gone on muderous rampage. I think it\'s a better album than this, but I chose this one for the race theme.');
