INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (7348, '4c7901fa97', '', 'I have to agree with most of what\'s being said here. My MS Pro is not very impressive. Noisy gears, bad steering, and it squeaks. I\'ve had to grease all the axles to quiet it, but it is faster than my LXX Modellista. The MS Sports I\'ve had both had monster torque, and are good cars, but have noisy gears, and one has the same steering issues as my Pro.\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m guessing Hogjowls is talking about the original Microsizers, and by this point I\'m assuming they are higher quality that the Microsizers being put out now, if they\'re anything like my Bit Char-G. Which is my only car that doesn\'t have any issues. \r\n\r\nI\'m thinking I need to get a Fairlady Z.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (7349, '0e899177bc', '', 'my take on all this is my OG MS is pretty good - steers straight, blah blah.\r\nmy MS Sport really isn\'t that noisey, not as noisey as my MS Pro anyway. So far I\'ve been having some luck with the MS Sports.\r\nI like my MS Pro - who wouldn\'t like a booster, but as I said before, it\'s probably my most noisey car I have, sounds like it\'s all in the gears and how well they fit together or don\'t fit together.\r\nBut... my I like my Fairlady much better than my MS Pro :)');
