INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (7422, '57a19b9024', 'The Latest Project', 'I really wanted to test out my skills at trying to make a "new" body style from using chopped up existing bodies and epoxy resin.\r\nI have no molds so I had to free hand everything and it\'s really starting to irk me. I\'m not letting it get me down though - I\'ll call it trial and error. lol\r\n[img:57a19b9024]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/cabo_resinbody1.jpg[/img:57a19b9024]\r\n[img:57a19b9024]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/cabo_resinbody2.jpg[/img:57a19b9024]\r\n[img:57a19b9024]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/cabo_resinbody3.jpg[/img:57a19b9024]\r\n\r\nI got a feeling though this ones getting put aside for the time being.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40362, '027cf0cee8', '', '[quote:027cf0cee8="filelicker"]There isn\'t anything wrong with a little ass-beating when it is for what\'s right.I used to video tape { night vision}-{ me and the camera at night }crackheads and dealers in my hood to keep them off my street{ lots of kids and families and the cops said there was nothing they could do}. I got confronted and threatened all the time{ gonna burn your house , kill you and your kids  , etc.} , one asshole came at my wife with a shovel when I was at work , she beat him back with rake!I had many middle of the street fist fights , just to protect my hood with no one to back me up{ neighbors were too scared to get involved}. The moral of the story is fuck what the world says stand up for your people and whats right  , even if it means a little blood spilled , so be it , I didn\'t start this but I am damn sure gonna finish it!\r\nCabo - don\'t feel bad about those urges to kick some fuckers ass raw-it is only natural !\r\nokay my adrenaline is up and I am having chest pains --so I\'m done ranting now too.[/quote:027cf0cee8]\r\n\r\nyeah, what he said....\r\n90 years ago when Ghandi was alive and today is pretty damn different. Fuck that "non violence" thing, filelicker said it himself, "There ain\'t nothing wrong with a little ass-beating when it\'s used for what\'s right". If you want to get revenge on them for stealing your stuff, do it and be satisfied. They stole your stuff, it was important, you treasured it...they insulted you and your efforts by stealing what you worked on. Go after them, and don\'t let them walk off knowing that they got away with fucked up skunkshit. You\'re not a person to be messed with, Cabo.');
