INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (7456, 'c89a18c048', '', 'at this point I think it\'s too late - I\'m already pretty upset at this job so I\'m just gonna use her a stunt body. With the results we look for, vacuum molding seems to be the best approach - or at least for my skills anyway.\r\nI might try another sometime, but not until I have a perfectly clear picture in my mind. This particular one changed 3 times as the shape of the body changed. lol\r\nIt was my first dremel experience on these little babies too - and boy do I need to practice that too! I don\'t know how many times I was smoothing out the front wheel wells only to slip and take out the fender! lol\r\n\r\nah well - thanks for the words fellas ;)');
