INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (7463, 'd519247ffa', '', 'I just picked up mine last night too... it was like a sixth sense thing! I was checking out RS online and saw that they had the body set in stock, so i added to my cart then got to think (hate when that happens... except for this one occasion lol), I wanted to pick up the tuner kit at the same time. So in a last ditch effort i called the RS up the road from work and reluctantly asked if they had recieved the new goods yet, and in fact they had!\r\nI was so excited i couldn\'t wait an to go after work, which was an hour away, so i jumped in my car and headed up the road. I arrived at the destination and went to the counter where they should be, looked around and saw no sign of any of the 2f2f sets or bodies! I was like WTF, and told one of the guys there that i just called not 5 min. before asking about the stuff, and he says "oh yeah we just got the delivery like a half an hour before you called, and haven\'t had a chance to un-pack them yet".\r\nI was like whoa, that\'s wierd (insert twilight zone theme song) it was like a little bell went off in my head and told me, after waiting and stalking my local RS\'s, i could endulge in a little ZZ goodness.\r\n\r\nSo in closing this long and drawn out story, I got the sets and am totally stoked about them! They look great! And');
