INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (7628, 'a8eeff2ea3', 'Sneak Peek: Extreme Micro Products', 'Here\'s just a little sneak peek at a few products from www.extrememicros.com\r\n[img:a8eeff2ea3]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/cabo_em_prods.jpg[/img:a8eeff2ea3]\r\n\r\nI haven\'t yet had the time to extensively play and test any of the motors, though I will be this weekend.\r\nI have broken in the motors and did 1 quicky with each motor and so far I can tell you the Vanquish Rotor motors seems to be what I\'m most attracted to right now. I\'ll have more information and feedback on these puppies soon for you guys.\r\n\r\nIn the meantime - these motor tubes and the Fatty Tube are frickin awesome! I want a motor tube for each of my motors, I can\'t say enough about these motor tubes, they\'re just cool as all hell.\r\nThe wires are a must have - you can never have too much of this stuff. Perfect for dual cells, modding controllers, pcbs, etc. pretty much anything dealing with the wires on the bit.\r\n\r\n...and one more sneak peek...\r\non one of my quicky runs using the Vanquish Rotor motor, it absolutely flew across the carpet! that\'s all - more to come soon after my playing frenzy  :P');
