INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40348, 'a8c67b9334', 'Spring Cleaning..updated 4/21 .....wife is impatient', 'UPDATE 3-20     more scala rims added to list.\r\nUPDATE 3-21     marked items that have been sold\r\n\r\nUPDATE 4-20     only 1 set rims left!!!   OFFER of the day, Everything that is left for $108.00  shipping included to domestic US \r\n\r\nUPDATE 4-21 wife says $75 shipped for everything ( continental us). Heck rims are $15 and if u returned all the new stuff back to RS you prolly would have a pretty nice Credit to spend there ( at least $20).\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHey guys, i know ive been gone for a while. Hope everyone is doing fine. Wife wants alot of this stuff gone so i am listing it here for sale. Would like to get rid of it all in one big package but will consider seperates. My email and paypal addresses have changed. send all correspondance to ang_N_ern@peoplepc.com  and paypal payments to funstuff4me@zipido.com . Paypal is preferred. Heres the list.....(LONG)\r\n\r\nZZ STUFF\r\n\r\n1 ZZ case\r\nF+F1 red rx7 body  X2\r\nred porsche body\r\nblack porsche body\r\nhonda civic blue body\r\nhonda civic black body\r\nhonda civic yellow body\r\nmustang black body\r\nmustang yellow body\r\n2f2f gold supra body         SOLD\r\n2f2f pink convertible body\r\n2f2f purple convertible body\r\n2f2f red rx7 body               SOLD\r\n2f2f silver lancer body\r\n2f2f "drab" lancer body\r\n2f2f orange challenger body\r\n\r\nzz tool kit\r\nBrand new sealed x2 chrome rx8 body\r\nbrand new sealed 2f2f tuner kit ( 2 bodies,  Nos motor and more)\r\n49mhz zz controller\r\n27mhz zz controller\r\n\r\nCONTROLLERS\r\n\r\n49mhz oval clone controller\r\n35mhz round fitracer controller\r\ncustom project nakamichi controller with 3 toggles for 6 freq\r\n\r\nNKOK stuff\r\n\r\n4aa charger nkok\r\n27mhz nkok boat controller\r\n49mhz nkok boat controller\r\nred boat 49mhz\r\nyellow 27mhz boat ( is parted was to be a project to upgrade it)\r\nblack nkok escalade car ??mhz\r\nburgundy hummer car ??mhz\r\n27mhz contrtoller nkok\r\n\r\nWILD CHAR G ( these are complete used like 2 times, imports with import frequencies)\r\n\r\nOne red truck with controller   \r\nOne blue truck with controller\r\n\r\nMISC. BODIES  ( all listed "new" still packaged)\r\n\r\nnew packaged bit char red Bb\r\nred clone body ( not sure what it is)\r\nMS blue supra modellista body             SOLD\r\nMS rx7 blue body                                SOLD\r\nMS rx7 clear body                               SOLD\r\nnew s2000 bit char body orange\r\nnew s2000 bit char body yellow\r\nsilver amigo nakamichi body\r\nwhite trueno clone body X2\r\nMS clear orange s2000 body\r\nnew bit char silver celica body\r\nbit char blue wrx body \r\n\r\nCHASSIS  ( when i say clone i mean not ms, zz or bit char g, could be shens, precious, fit..... whatever)\r\n\r\n35mhz working clone car\r\nMS pro chassis never used but pcb stolen outta it     SOLD\r\nMS 49mhz chassis complete and working with cat 5 antenna\r\n49mhz clone chassis , works but plastic tab that holds heat sink down broke off\r\n45mhz clone chassis works fine\r\n57 mhz chassis works fine\r\n\r\n\r\nSCALA RIMS (u can search the site to find out what styles these are)\r\n\r\nwt4365 X2   1 set SOLD  only 1 set left!!!\r\nwt4316 X2 both sets SOLD!!\r\nwt4307   SOLD\r\nwt4323       SOLD\r\nwt4342         SOLD\r\n\r\nMISC STUFF\r\n\r\nmisc ZZ hubcaps\r\nmisc ZZ axles\r\nmisc motors\r\nmisc ZZ tires\r\ncat 5 cable\r\nfiber optic cable\r\nmisc. project bodies and pieces and parts\r\nmisc empty chassis and stuff\r\nNEW RS project box\r\nNEW RS 4aa batt holder with on/off switch X2\r\nNEW RS 3v 1000mA ac adapter \r\nNEW RS voltage regulator\r\nspools of enamelled wire ( for making steering coils)\r\nsmall hot glue gun\r\n\r\nAlso have most ZZ cards that came with bodies listed\r\n\r\nI beleive thats all. Feel free to email me offers at my new addy ang_N_ern@peoplepc.com\r\n\r\nPaypal preferred at funstuff4me@zipido.com');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (7690, '81309750c4', '', 'well i don\'t think that when they post, that they\'re conciously taking advantage of TRC. It is in most cases it\'s innocent, I think. \r\nas far as how to deal with it, we can just explain that we\'d like to nip it in the bud and....... mmmm bud [damnit getting side tracked again  :lol: ] anyway nip it in the bud and avoid any unpleasantries between the 2 site\'s. Maybe make it clear that we or CW has first hand knowledge of the costs of maintaining a site... in a nice way. :)\r\nAnd we have respect for TRC and don\'t wish disrupt it. \r\nI don\'t think anyone should be offended, but if they are then they\'ve got no concept of expenses.');
