INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (7723, '7eb558287d', '', 'I think Radio Shack hit the jackpot releasing muscle car bodies, and doing it right. (nice detailing, and not sitting so high in front)\r\n\r\nSeems like everybodies getting a piece of this action. You know I had to get in on it. Borrowed money from my wife the second I seen someone post a pic at TRC. Called her at work, and said, "Hey, I need $10 like right now. Yeah I\'ll do the dishes whatever, I just need the money NOW."\r\n\r\nI\'m just hoping that Radio Shack still has some of those new tuner sets in stock by the time my payday rolls around. I\'m hearing the 3.4 is quick, and for the price they sell those it\'s a pretty good deal for the bodies motors, and gears sets.\r\n\r\nOh well at least they always have plenty of 350Zs in stock. I hope the PCB in those is as good as everybody says. It still too bulky underneath to dual cell without having to flip the board.');
