INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48878, 'c0a4ffc6d4', '', 'as far as leaving goes...\r\nI\'ve made only 5 people leave in the history of bitPimps.\r\nyou know how far we let shit go.\r\nanyways, point being - you\'re more than welcome to stay here - you woulda seen a "banned" message if you weren\'t.\r\n\r\nand now to get in to the nitty gritty...\r\n[quote:c0a4ffc6d4="midget_man1387"]It seemed to me that whatever I posted here at bitpimps was just for a confidence boost. It seems like I get two pages of great job midget man, but nothing more than that.[/quote:c0a4ffc6d4]you\'re absolutely right. that\'s exactly what you got - that\'s exactly what a lot of us get.\r\nfor some, that\'s what is needed.\r\nfor others, that isn\'t.\r\nI think "bitPimps" the community has black and white areas, and very little grey - if you know what I mean.\r\nthat is to say, either the pimps here love you, hate you, or could care less - and really nothing in between.\r\nthe pimps that feel a bond with a fellow pimp, send off words of encouragement.\r\nthey mean good, but never the less, many times it ends up being useless drivel - the basic "yea you\'re cool, great job, whatever".\r\n\r\npersonally, I give those "posts" out to pimps who you can tell are just starting out or pimps that I know or think would be offended otherwise. I don\'t want to say "that looks like a turd baked in the oven" and discourage them from ever trying it again or even letting us see what they\'ve done. I\'ve made and still make plenty of turds. and nobody should forget - we all started off learning and making mistakes.\r\n\r\nnow that I know what you want and now that I know you\'re old enough to handle "constructive critisisms" that\'s what I\'ll give you, all to help better yourself. the good with the bad.\r\n\r\n[quote:c0a4ffc6d4="midget_man1387"]It was like a kid who wants to be JUST LIKE michael jordan getting told to fuck off... That was how I felt.[/quote:c0a4ffc6d4]that\'s understandable. we felt betrayed. I feel like I\'ve help foster some of your ability, as I\'m sure other long standing pimps here do as well. we even ran a contest that we kiddingly joked about, was "midget_man\'s" contest. for some odd reason you seem to be the "cousin" of bitPimps and we like to watch out for you and a few others. lol\r\n\r\n[quote:c0a4ffc6d4="midget_man1387"]Basically, now i get to sit, hope, wait, and pray that your guys wont see it like you\'re seeing it now. if you want me to leave because you think I\'m not in love with this site, then so be it. I can take it like a man, but I want you to know, I dont wanna leave, and I certainly dont want to be fuckin hated.[/quote:c0a4ffc6d4]you\'re not hated, at least by me lol\r\nI was dis-appointed to say the least (okay dad)\r\nbut I also understand and believe your intensions (okay dad)\r\n\r\nnow go play you little fucker lol (okay dad)\r\n\r\n[b:c0a4ffc6d4]edit:[/b:c0a4ffc6d4] and what jmays just said before me lol');
