INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48868, '57b459d5e0', '', 'lol....\r\n\r\nwell, on Sunday I (er, my dad) ordered these following parts from MZR:\r\n\r\n1 GPM alloy motor mount\r\n1 11T pinion\r\n1 Carbon Fiber Midship Conversion X plate\r\n4 SI4562DY FETs (for now, I think I\'ll try stacking FETs first before I try ph2t\'s woah nelly turbo)\r\n\r\n[img:57b459d5e0]http://img19.photobucket.com/albums/v57/amitojbatra/excitement.bmp[/img:57b459d5e0]\r\n\r\nI\'m not putting in the P.D. until I make or buy a Woah nelly from ph2t though....\r\n\r\nOh, I have a few questions, for anyone who has experience:\r\n\r\n1. Some people on R7R say that you can use a KT-2 Perfex controller with the Iwaver Z to increase proportionality and range, is this true? I\'m thinking of buying one eventually. \r\n2. Where is the best place to buy the FETs that are featured in the Woah nelly (IRF7425 and NTD110N02R)? I\'m getting them next month when I get my next allowance.');
