INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (8084, 'd8508a61ac', 'XBOX', 'Definately XBOX... its a mini pc. You can get a mod chip and you can install a larger HD say 120GB  :lol:  then u can goto blockbusters and rent any game and "back it up" ( nice way of saying steal it by saving it on your new high capacity hard drive) then yo unever got buy games anymore :) plus you can play online threw your computer for free. There is SOOOOOO many things you can do it is unreal. I woul dsuggest a used one since ur gonna void the warranty anyways when u mod it an dalso add a bigger HD. theres only a 4 GB Hd standard  and games take from 1-4 gb when u save then so u wanna upgrade to a bigger one.( that is if you wanna "backup" games. You can save music on your xbox and play it through your homestereo. burn from internet to cd then save on xbox. That simple. Many games also incorporate a custom soundtrack wher eyou can choose songs you saved toplay during the game. This is just the tip of the iceberg....... SOOOOOOOOO   much more. Definately get the xbox. best mod chip is like 40-50,and bigger HD like 50-120? and used xbox like 100-150? so for under $300 you could have the SHIZNIT. But definately spring for the S-controller. Smaller controller is wayyy better.');
