INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (8163, '540761bbab', '', 'if gta came out for the xbox id say xbox. im sorry guys the xbox is superior and they dont break like the ps2.\r\n\r\n&lt;&lt;---broken ps2 owner\r\n\r\nif you like gta then well theres your answer.\r\n\r\nor you can just beef up your computer. i like pc games better than console games for the most part. warcraft3 is the shizzle. you can play it on pc and that stupid fruit platform even!! search screenshots of doom3. tell me a console can do that.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (8164, '4f0d251447', '', 'lol\r\nPS2 has lead the revolution in console gaming for a long time - they\'re not going anywhere. The graphics are comparable - maybe donkey kong on PS2 don\'t look as good as Halo on XBox but come on.\r\nEver seen Gran Turismo 3 or 4?\r\nI\'ve never seen a console come close to matching the graphical quality, not even xbox.\r\nxbox sells games at around the same price, only theres like 1% the amount of games PS2 has out.\r\nFacts are Sony is the industry leader, they\'ve killed off Nintendo and all the other crappers - xbox will be next - the only reason why xbox is even around still is because microsoft has the cash to keep backing it. They\'re trying to force themselves in to a new market with brute money force.\r\nAll the gaming companies make games for multiple consoles, mainly geared towards Sony\'s consoles - they\'re not going to stop making games for their "bread and butter" clients. And xbox games are using a silly microsoft tactic, their attitude seems to be.... "launch a game thats only been programmed for xbox console only, everyone else screw off".\r\n\r\nXbox has been out for quite a while now and I still only know of a handful of people who have one.\r\n\r\nOh yea, did I mention the huge dooky controllers?  :grin:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (8165, 'fb0978254c', '', '[quote:fb0978254c="hogjowlz"]if gta came out for the xbox id say xbox. im sorry guys the xbox is superior and they dont break like the ps2.\r\n\r\n&lt;&lt;---broken ps2 owner\r\n\r\nif you like gta then well theres your answer.\r\n\r\nor you can just beef up your computer. i like pc games better than console games for the most part. warcraft3 is the shizzle. you can play it on pc and that stupid fruit platform even!! search screenshots of doom3. tell me a console can do that.[/quote:fb0978254c]\r\n\r\nPC has always beaten any console, but those days are numbered too.\r\nThe ease of a console, the size, portability and the fact that now they\'re become mini PC\'s themselves... I can\'t wait for the console gaming future!\r\n\r\nthe only thing I\'ve ever heard of breaking frequently on a PS2 was the DVD reader. And in 9 times out of 10 it\'s because someone wasn\'t too careful with it and dropped it or whatever. It\'s just like your CD player - they did the same thing - all that stuff is avoidable and fixable. The next release of PS3 I\'m sure will be much better.');
