INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40256, 'ed654c8253', '', '[quote:ed654c8253="SuperFly"]Here\'s what you do:\r\n\r\n\r\nDump a little salt (like 2 tablespoons) and some rubbing alcohol (probably about 1/4 to 1/3 the amount of water you would normally have in there). I\'m naturally cheap when it comes to using things up, so using a little more of each wouldn\'t hurt, alcohol and salt are cheap. Then, with all holes plugged, place the palm of your hand over the mouth hole and shake and swirl that bitch. About 2 minutes of thorough shaking and dump out the solvent and the abrasive (tha alcohol and salt) and rinse with water. Done. If that doesn\'t give you the cleanest bong with the least amount of work, I\'ll refund your money.[/quote:ed654c8253]\r\n\r\n\r\nI tried it, and all I can say is fuckin wow......   I can\'t believe I never knew about that one. Thanks for the tip on that dood.  I took a pic so I\'ll post it in a few.\r\n\r\nI wonder if raw rice would work as a abrasive with the alcohol?  I know it works good with glass cleaner, but not as fast as your method.\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
