INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40250, 'd4d989e2c5', '', 'well for the past several years, I\'ve been trying to change my stance in life - that kinda plays in to what did / didn\'t happen afterwards.\r\n\r\nskipping past the life long saga bullshit story... we\'re here and now.\r\nI try not to start shit, fly off the handle, etc. and I try to be understanding - I\'ve been at the bottom rung on the ladder before too - and it\'s always just a step away for people like myself.\r\nI just have to believe in karma for what its worth.\r\n\r\nat any rate - of course payaso and I immediately have thoughts of: "let\'s wait in the parking lot for the asshole we think stole it and confront him - preferrably in a violent situation"\r\nwe fought the urge and just stayed away.\r\n\r\nbut after calming down a tad yet still being very emotionally involved, not really as much for the 650.00 value as much as the value of the personal effects:\r\nmy fucking photos. my fucking really good photos of really fucking close friends, my fucking wife, good things - those are personal items. and to have some motherfucker able to rifle through them at their whim makes me absolutely fucking irrate.\r\nas I type this, again I have to fight the urge.\r\nI can tell you now - in the days of old, someone woulda got hurt - I don\'t care who, maybe even me, but damage woulda been done and I\'d be somewhat happy - I like to make / watch people hurt who deserve it.\r\n\r\nnow I just sit here and try to forgive and forget like what I would have called a fucking pussy in the past. whatever and whatever...\r\n\r\neventually I\'m going to forget about this, that\'s what I want and that\'s what I\'ll do - but I kinda think there\'s always gonna be this "thing" under the surface that says: "if I find that mother fucker/s who stole my shit - it\'s on like Donkey Kong - I ain\'t the biggest tree in the forrest, but I\'m pretty fucking insane with rage. :smile: "');
