INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (8500, '80c5910984', '', 'So, you guys that bought your Zip Zaps recently, how you liking them?\r\n\r\nI ask, because I love my F&amp;F RX-7 (now a Challenger). The new PCBs do indeed seem to be fixed, and the 2.2 Performance(formally called the Turbo) is very punchy, though lacking in top speed. It is maybe a tad faster than my Tomy 2.2s. Just tried it with a Perfection 3.8, and it was very quick, even drove on carpet. Tracks straight, turns on a a dime, and very silent gears. \r\n\r\nSeems like a quality product. I\'ve got nothing to gripe about. Quite an improvement over my previous 2 Zip Zaps. Much more satisfying out of the box.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (8501, '00cca489c3', '', 'Yea my RX-8 is doing pretty good.\r\nSounds similar, not great on top end with the 2.2 "Turbo" it came with, but it wasn\'t bad on torque.\r\nI was just running on carpet with it last night with no problems.\r\nIt didn\'t catch anything on fire, but it moved aight.\r\nI haven\'t dropped in a new motor in that chassis yet.');
