INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40223, '48dfcb634c', '', '[quote:48dfcb634c="SuperFly"]Wow! That is so cool. I love that the exposed part of the engine is somewhat scale, not like the cartoonish Muscle Machines (which I love in a different way). I also like the different finishes you put on it, makes it look real. Now all you need is a really small tachometer to put out there on the hood and your 1/4 mile time written with a bar of soap on the window. And a mullet.  :-)[/quote:48dfcb634c]Aww man, I missed this when I was typing my post.\r\n\r\nI glad you dig on the engine. You know how those die-cast motors tend to look like blobs of chrome, with flashing hanging off everywhere? I spent half the day detailing the motor. \r\n\r\nGood call on the the tach, and e.t. soaped up in the window. I hadn\'t considered that, that\'d be perfect. I\'ll have to pass on the mullet. :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks Sezziz. :-)');
