INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (8646, 'b9850d438d', '', 'yup, seen the German version.\r\nIt could be done better, give the car a "guide wire" to run along and it\'ll leave your sight in no time.\r\n\r\nFunny side note, the very first model rocket/plane I built was an F-18.\r\nIt launched with the wings tucked inward, instead of popping out the parachute, the final burst was to open up the wings and the plane glides back down to earth.... in theory....\r\n\r\nwhat really happened was I had just 1 of my alyrons (sp?) just a touch tweeked the wrong way. When I fired the rocket engine, the plane burst up in the air about 15 feet - went directly horizontal to the ground and came right back at us at like light speed. We hit the deck, I watch in horror as my first rocket plane was going straight for a concession stand kamakazi style. About 5 feet before the structure, it took a nose dive and burried itself in the ground about 6 inches.\r\n\r\nSince that day, my nickname was "One Shot"  :lol:');
