INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (8682, '97bb3ffef5', 'ZZ', 'ZZ\'s are what i like the best so far anyways. I like the longer wheelbase and the bodies i think look nicer(more accurate). Only negative is the lack of additional body styles. Everything else thats for a bit pretty much works the same in a zip. I got 3 working Zips, 1 ms sport, and 2 working clones ( shen, fit racer). I really loved the ms sport , until i did the pcb swap into my ZZ ( i had an original pre xmas ZZ which was very slow an dwould not run faster motors). Now not only is it a odd freq (40mhz) but if moved around very nicely and after the dualcell i just did its awesome.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39612, 'a4c0e45e55', '', 'And now there\'s somewhere to bitch about it as it happens....\r\n\r\nOn a side note, last night after 219 dropped off my bodies (Sen Fa)?, I made myself a new body painting rig, german style, only instead of a gutted pullback attached to a Pringles can, I gutted a Bensu and used the tx antenna threaded into the bottom. I can stick it into one of the screw holes on the back of the transmitter, or remove it and extend the antenna for "in hand" spraying.\r\nI knew that 2 dolla Bensu was gonna come in handy.\r\n\r\nI need to try that plasti-kote lacquer on my next body. thanks hogjowlz.');
