INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (8720, '9ce9b07882', '', 'I know very little about rockets, I built one in middle school tech class  :razz: \r\nMaybe you could give me a lil help.\r\nThis is the engine I got.\r\n\r\n[img:9ce9b07882]http://www.imagestation.com/picture/sraid63/p3b595ff37aed486872e3a9088490f848/fc187fc6.jpg[/img:9ce9b07882]\r\n\r\nI was planing to do a dual rocket 4 cell dragster. The car would be a 4 cell dragster fully operational and then it would have a seperate attachment with the rockets. The rocket "pack" would have it\'s own pcb to control the ignition, but I\'m not sure how many volts it would take to spark the engines. Fire proofing the body is also still up in the air. \r\nLike I said before this was a lil idea I had months ago and sorta lost intrest becuase we had snow up the wazoo. I have a 1/4mile  stretch of 3 laned road where I was planning to shoot it off. The other spots I thought of firing off this rocket was in the downtown area around here where they have plenty of empty wherehouses with large parking lots. Space isn\'t a problem.');
