INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40217, '6294c3794a', 'Micro RC 4x4 (Kidriffic) - Hog please take a look.....', 'I recall you doing a cel mod ( i think it was you) to one of these pimp ass tank steering trucks. How did you set up the multi cell mod? Ive done many but hte set up looks strange inside...as if instead of being dual celled ( which it is as you know) it looks as though the atts arent connected at all. I want to replace the dual with a pre made tricell pack from one of my Epochs but im not sure if i can just wire the (+) terminal to the first positive battery compartment contact and then the (-) terminal to the 2nd battery compartment terminal.\r\n\r\nCan you help a pimp out  :cool: ?\r\n\r\nAlos...have you  tested the construction vehicles fromKidriffic on the same blister pack? I only ask as someone mentioned it has 3 features (regular tank steering and an additional spinning feature *ex. cement mixer spinning*).');
