INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (9412, '9d65b34203', '', 'Sweet ass man. I got a 88KB file down to 22 KB and theres NO difference to my eye and I use a high end flat monitor at 19"\'s.\r\n\r\nIt does save alot but when you have 100\'s of images it would fo sho.\r\n\r\nI found a great way to optimize movies in XP for web as well as optimizing colour/nrightness/contrast etc \r\n\r\nYou need \r\n\r\nAdobe Premier\r\nWindows Movie Maker\r\nPhotoshop 7.0\r\n\r\nAnd about 20 mins of time depending on the speeed of your CPU and size of the movie.\r\n\r\nShould I do a small tutorial anyone?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (9413, '6ce296d160', '', 'That\'s one is cool, probably one of your better ones. You really are starting to mass produce these things, I hope your getting some oxygen between paint fumes. Wouldn\'t want to pop that last brain cell, you know.\r\n\r\nAs far as selling them, I\'ve had a couple people ask me to paint bodies for them, and I was willing to do it at cost. I figured with the cost of paints (I use laquer, it\'s a little more expensive, $5 a can, yeah I can paint dozens of cars with a can, but if they request a specific color, I have to spend my $5 to buy that color.), the body, and shipping it to them, $10-$15 is barely covering my cost, and I\'m not even including the couple hours I put into it or my skill (I\'s gots skillz), but people thought that was too much and passed. I took personal offense to that, because I\'m not going to take a loss on this. \r\n\r\nSo anyways, I\'m kinda ranting, but my point being, it\'s a hard to set a price point on custom painted bodies, where you can offer a good deal, but still get paid fairly for your time. I think it was just kids bugging me, so there might some serious customers out there, but I just thought I\'d warn you of my experience.\r\n\r\nYou could always put a couple on ebay, to get an idea of what people are willing to pay.\r\n\r\nFor me, rather than sell custom painted bodies, I\'m thinking about putting my flames on decal sheets, and selling those for $3 a piece.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (9414, '7abbaf6576', '', 'we\'re thinking right in the same line crazydave - that\'s exactly what I figured would happen to me too. probably not worth the troubles.\r\n\r\neh - whatever, if I get an offer I like, I\'ll take it, if not I won\'t.\r\nbut I don\'t think I\'m going to go out of my way and start posting or advertising that I\'ll do this. I know I\'ll run into the same shiat you did. buying 5/can colors to be used once, more than likely 3 or more cans and then time and whatever... I\'d probably only offer it to those who would really appreciate it.');
