INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39563, 'ceefc2008a', 'Hey, Gfunk was right!!!!!', 'So, a while ago on AIM, (b4 I got trillian  :rockon: ) We were talking about how to make some money, or save it. He told me "time is money" and gave me some examples. He said to "apply it in your life, it will come in handy one day" (heh....sensei  :smile: ) \r\n\r\nSo, today, after breaking boards at my Tae Kwon Do class, I realized what I could make a new racing surface with! I remembered all those broken boards from all my TKD classes, and I figured I could glue em back together, and put em together for a racing surface! I\'m gonna get some more from downstairs.....Over so much time, I broke so many boards....and now I can use them for a racing surface! \r\n\r\nGfunk was right...."Time is money".....hey G, if you\'re reading this.....thanks pimp! :smile:');
