INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (9716, '45d2f00fef', '', '[quote:45d2f00fef="DarkTari"]You sure your name is "CrazyDave" ?  That shouldn\'t bother you one bit!\r\nNot like you tripped him up while trying to go for the merchandise.  Besides they\'ll get more, you just don\'t have to wait for it!\r\n\r\nIs that the kit with the 2.8 Turbo &amp; 3.4 ExNitros motors?  How do you like them?[/quote:45d2f00fef]\r\nI don\'t consider myself crazy, it\'s everyone else that\'s that keeps calling me crazy. I say everyones crazy, I just got caught. Any rate, I just thought it had a nice ring to it, "crazydave". \r\n\r\nYes, it is that kit, and I love the motors. The 2.8 has good top speed and tons of torque. Pushed to it\'s limit using the green 9.86:1 gears, it just starts to flip. Back off in time, and you\'ll be driving on 2 wheels. It would flip, but it was difficult to get it to. \r\n\r\nThe 3.4 smokes. Easily the best motor I\'ve owned. It\'s very fast, probably true to the 3.4 rating, but still probably as fast as my pink endbell 3.8 was, and puts Perfection 3.8s to shame. Gobs and gobs of torque. It reached top speed nearly instantly. It\'s a little harder to flip a ZZ than a bit, and this thing was not only flipping, but doing barrel rolls back onto it wheels. One time I got it to roll about a foot. Flipped twice, and away we went.\r\n\r\nThe motors are worth the price of admission, and all the other goodies are just icing, but I love icing.\r\n\r\nMmmm, lime gold icing...\r\n[img:45d2f00fef]http://erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/lancer.jpg[/img:45d2f00fef]');
