INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (9738, '54a21fcfc9', '', '[quote:54a21fcfc9="hogjowlz"]also why would you wana run a single cell car? unless you havnt had time to upgrade.[/quote:54a21fcfc9]\r\n\r\nI\'ve got his crazy idea to have one car set up for every situation. I\'ve got my dual cell clone, my dual cell booster Zip Zap, my dual cell non booster Zip Zap, my new Zip Zap is staying single cell, etc. etc., but I do have to admit, the single cell cars are not as fun after playing with the dual cells. I\'ve got to set up another tri-cell. I\'m missing Franken-Zap\'s former glory.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (9739, '832f756c9e', '', '[quote:832f756c9e="hogjowlz"]hmm a 50cent clone. that would rule. im pretty good at those but i think the dome would be hard to hitch onto.[/quote:832f756c9e]\r\n\r\ni got a clone several months ago from a claw machine at my local laundry mat , all for my first .25 !!!!   it had tie-wraps around it which made the claw be able to "grab" it.( 2 wraps like a package " + " shaped) Got it on the first try.  :razz:  They got another one i just checked today but the damn claw machine is broke  :hurt:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (9741, '7c6272bd20', '', 'I\'ve had 3, and the motors vary drastically. One is probably more like a 2.4, one is like a torquey 2.6, and one is so fast I keep getting it mixed up with my Perfection 3.8s, because they look exactly the same.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (9742, 'f855ca3d25', '', 'I just wanted to let you guys know, I\'m not sitting back playing this out strategic or anything like that. Just been tight on money, and been spending what little money I have on deals I\'m finding.\r\n\r\nBut I promise I am working on something, and I\'ll will be entering something before this is over, even if it\'s not going to be as cool as I planned. Already too late to order a pull back for wheels, but hey one of the deals I scored was an Impreza, so now I\'ve got my sights aimed squarely at second place.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (9743, 'a4c773c01a', 'I like my MS Pro a lot better now.', 'My MS pro was plagued with handling problems and squeeky wheels. It had potential, but I was just so irritated with it I never really messed with it.\r\n\r\nYesterday I was noticeing that the front wheel wells on the RX-7 body are almost as big as the rear. I wondered how some fullsize rims would look, so I got the Zip Zap rims off my MS Sport, and not only does it look slick, but the Zip Zap steering knuckles solved my handling problems. I just thought it was funny that my concern over cosmetics, fixed my mechanical problem.\r\n\r\nNow I\'m digging on the Pro, it\'s probably my favorite car right now, but whatever car I just got done messing with is my favorite car.\r\n\r\n[img:a4c773c01a]http://erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/newrx7.jpg[/img:a4c773c01a]\r\n\r\nAnd since  was paying some attention to it, I freehanded in the euro taillights with a silver Sharpie.\r\n[img:a4c773c01a]http://erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/newrx7b.jpg[/img:a4c773c01a]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (9744, 'a87f6b692b', '', 'that\'s dope!\r\nso still no wheel rubbing on the front?\r\n\r\nwonder what was up with the "bad" knuckles?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (9745, 'fb48575648', '', 'good job man. looks clean.  im digging my dual cell with the teal gear on it. doesnt peel out and goes hella fast. it has less torque than stock but its no weaker than a single cell with stock gears and after a few feet its warp drive kicks in and man does it want to move. i used to think that gear ratios didnt do much but that was single cell.');
