INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (9784, 'c1109af564', '', 'I did the mosfet mod for 2 and 3 cells. All I can say is WOW!!! This mod gives so much more power to wheels. Traction can become a serious problem with this mod. I tried the pcb I modified in a 3 cell car that is basicly two rear halves glued together, 4 wheel driven, no steering. I used kit racer blue gears and zip zap red motors. This thing lights up the tires. I even broke my old speed record of 11.6 mph, I hit 13.06 mph! I am gonna drop this pcb in a 2 cell car, to try and tone it down a bit. With no suspension, any little inperfection in the painted concrete floor at work, gets this thing completely airborne! You gotta try this mod. I will be sending one to micro_Amps in austaulia for the single cell mod. I attempted the single cell mod, but it was a little more difficult. Try it, you\'ll like it!!!');
