INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (10043, 'c69c945dcc', 'Summer is Coming...my favorite Bit..its a Mazda RX-7 SPYDER', 'Hello(Good Morning?)\r\n\r\nI have done today(4th June) this Fullcustom and other Things MOD!The Summer is Coming so i make this BIT!I have enough time because i begin a technical studium in Germany(Mechanic&amp;Design/Wirtschaft[german Name]But now to the Name:\r\nI call it MAZDA RX-7 SPYDER!\r\n\r\nI have done:\r\n\r\n-Fullcustommod\r\n-remove the big Spoiler\r\n(Cut Mazdabody into a Cabrio/new Spoiler in back&amp;front addet/new Sitewings)\r\n-paint into greenbluemetallic(Spezialcolor for a german Spyder)\r\n-add silverlines\r\n-add new pcb into carbonlook\r\n-Mosfetmod\r\n-add new GERMAN Rims\r\n\r\nIts my favorite Bit...but now the pictures:\r\n\r\n[img:c69c945dcc]http://land.heim.at/toskana/211863/Spider4.jpg[/img:c69c945dcc]\r\n\r\n[img:c69c945dcc]http://land.heim.at/toskana/211863/Spider3.jpg[/img:c69c945dcc]\r\n\r\n[img:c69c945dcc]http://land.heim.at/toskana/211863/Spider2.jpg[/img:c69c945dcc]\r\n\r\n[img:c69c945dcc]http://land.heim.at/toskana/211863/Spider1.jpg[/img:c69c945dcc]\r\n\r\nhope you like it!!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39550, '277c3df680', '', 'I realize this is a rant thread and you weren\'t looking for advice (and maybe don\'t need this) but a good 1/2 of my paintjobs have gotten fucked up in some way mid-way through, and I was able to save all but 1 with 1600 grit wet sanding and patience (and ultimately about 5 layers of paint). In fact, one of my most fucked up paint jobs turned out to be one of the best, because I fussed over that bitch so much. Here\'s a picture:\r\n\r\n\r\n[img:277c3df680]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10017/skyline1.jpg[/img:277c3df680]\r\n\r\nThis thing suffered cat hair, orange peel texture, drips, a drop on concrete floor just before clearcoating, a bad first clearcoating, a thumbprint on what was to be my final clearcoat... and then it worked out.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you\'re into modelling you probably already know this, but try using Future floor polish for a clear coat. The beauty of it is if you fuck it up you can wipe it off with amonia without hurting the paint.');
