INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (10078, '5b63d64c82', '', 'the only thing I don\'t like about members getting to vote is I have to allow for poll options (all registered users can create polls) that allow for as many poll options as there are entries. That could be up to 50 or so. Some dorko kid will create a fucking huge non-sense poll with all 50 options and we\'ll be scrolling for days lol. but more importantly, each member will no doubt vote for their own entry. So the list probably wont be narrowed down much because each entry will have at least 1 vote. each is 1 less vote for another "winning" car - so we\'ll be right back at square 1 where we just pick the winners from them all.\r\n\r\nI don\'t think narrowing it down to 10 will be hard at all. top 3, maybe, but not 10. we own this shiat anyways, we should decide - we gotta keep a little bit of power around here lol *shrug too - 2*');
