INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39548, '1580680a4a', 'Dammit! The botched paint job rant thread.', 'I have been tossing around the idea of starting this thread all week, and then ph2t said something today that made me have to do it.\r\n\r\n"It\'s also good to see a serious enthusiast join our crib instead of all those dickheads out there that don\'t contribute anything...."\r\n\r\nI really took these words to heart. Well, o.k., knee jerk reaction was to take offense, but, really, I don\'t "contribute" much with my opinions and such but I AM a serious enthusiast. I got into bits a little over 2 months ago and have quite a collection to show for such a short period of time... I posted pics of my mostly stock stuff in the "user gallery" like a month ago and aside from some easy wheel conversions, there\'s not much to say about my rides... I dont have electronics skills, only ENTHUSIASM for the autos of the wee variety.\r\n\r\nThat said, I have a massive body collection, and more to come. I began masking a few a while back so I could be ready when the shitty Pittsburgh winter finally went away, and was confident that I\'d be putting out some nice work shortly. I have been lucky in the past, all my lexan jobs have been nice(I HAVE BEEN AN RC ENTHUSIAST SINCE 1983) and when my lady and I went on a model building kick a few years ago I had some very good results. So, I started on my Celica body earlier this week with visions of all the props I was sure to be recieving once I posted my first paintjob.\r\nSHITFUCKDAMMITALLTOHELLFUCKERSHITSHITSHITDAMMITDAMMITDAMMIT!!!!!\r\nAfter all of my meticulous prep, everything that can possibly go wrong has gone wrong. Bubbles, wind knocking it into the bushes right after a fresh coat, more bubbles, and everything else. I WILL FINISH THIS BODY. Even if the finished result is the shittiest bit of all time, I will post it.\r\n\r\nSo, now that I\'ve gotten all of that off of my chest, here you go, a place to bitch about your painting disasters.');
