INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39568, '918103543b', '', 'Thanks guys for your opinions...I am going to try to adjust or mod my avatar, as soon as I have the ability and/or time.  But I still think once you pick yours, it should be yours at some point in time.  \r\n\r\nI agree with TMP, after reading enough posts you can tell the difference between pimps writing style and general presention of themselves.  Sometimes I don\'t even look at the name, I just look at the avatar and realize who\'s post it is.\r\n\r\nWhen you read a ton posts and you have to refer back to the last one read, its easier to look for a pic than the name or quote.\r\n\r\nExample--If your following a thread and you know last night that TMP was the last one to post in it before you crash for the night, and you log on the next day, you can just scroll up till you find the last TMP post you read.  Instead of trying to check dates and times.  Sometimes threads build and grow quickly. \r\n\r\nIts a minor situation we have with the avatars that has come up, but it does give everyone something to discuss and develop over time, but most importantly an avatar does give you a distinct identity that you can clearly veiw as your doin\' your pimpin\' through-out the forums.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEDIT-- [quote:918103543b] TMP&gt;&gt;&gt; Man it was so confusing distinguishing the 2 of them. Seeing SG is very well literate and taco was... well... he spoke differently. I started reading and i immediatly knew something was wrong. isnt that funny how you can pick someone out by there internet style? crazy... \r\n[/quote:918103543b]  \r\n\r\nThanks for noticing Pimp, I try my best.  I write alot.');
