INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (10118, 'f1c554421e', '', 'well I cannot get the thing to die again. I got the batt drained once. Now its run for 15 mins without axle and will not die. I charged it twice in a row to see if it was a juice issue but I guess its not.\r\n\r\nI tried the batt from my dual motor works and it didn\'t help.\r\n\r\nI even used the gears from my motor works thinking it could be a ratio issue or maybe speed it up or whatever.\r\n\r\nIt s a 1.0 true charG from japan but comon. I did the bit calculator and my motor works stock goes 180+ MPH and the Char G goes 60MPH. I think i got  faulty motor or theres a connection issue with the charging unit.\r\n\r\nAny ideas will help. Heres what I\'ve done so far\r\n\r\n2 dry runs\r\n1 load run\r\ndifferent batt and gears\r\n\r\nno difference in speed.\r\n????????????????????  :mad:  :mad:  :mad:  :mad:\r\n\r\nMy biggest problem is I\'m not all stocked with bit like most of you are. I have 2 the new NSX-R and the motor works car. The motors aren\'t interchangable due to the motor works is wired.');
