INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (10210, '10beac43ef', 'Added detail: Driver and Steering wheel.', 'After some inspiration from crazydave\'s pcb cover painting, and a little of my own brainstorming I thought it would be nice to have a driver in the car. Here is the results:\r\n\r\n[img:10beac43ef]http://plaza.ufl.edu/mpbiv/rc/driver.jpg[/img:10beac43ef]\r\n[img:10beac43ef]http://plaza.ufl.edu/mpbiv/rc/driver%20rear.jpg[/img:10beac43ef]\r\n\r\nAll it took was some modeling clay, 30 mins in the oven to harden, and some paint  :-D \r\n\r\n[img:10beac43ef]http://plaza.ufl.edu/mpbiv/rc/clay.jpg[/img:10beac43ef]\r\n\r\nAnd here is what it looks like with the body on\r\n\r\n[img:10beac43ef]http://plaza.ufl.edu/mpbiv/rc/in%20the%20car.jpg[/img:10beac43ef]\r\n\r\nHere\'s a peek at some other stuff I added to the body which includes some painted graphics, a tow hook and other misc. painted stuff.....not much different from the last time I took a pic of this body.\r\n\r\n[img:10beac43ef]http://plaza.ufl.edu/mpbiv/rc/project2.jpg[/img:10beac43ef]');
