INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (10294, 'ec21a7a429', '', 'Namuna,\r\nTV - Plain ol\' TV series\r\nMovie - should be able to figure that out\r\nOVA - original video animation, refers to video that was made for home market.\r\n\r\nYou should watch Gundam SEED since you\'re interested in the GAT 105 strike. G-SEED is available in fansub format since no one here has a license to it...for now. Too bad that die cast model only busts out in Aile Strike mode, but you can get the Launcher and Strike modes on another kit but that kit comes in Phase Shift armor deactivated mode.\r\n\r\n[img:ec21a7a429]http://www.hlj.com/images/ban/ban917987.jpg[/img:ec21a7a429]\r\n1/60 plastic model Strike Gundam with all strike packs.\r\n\r\nYes, American market Gundam model kits suck. They claim it\'s all translated but the only thing translated is the precautions and the box art text etc. It\'s also expensive most of the time and the variety is somewhat limited.\r\n\r\nBTW maybe you will be interested in the Master Grade line of Gundam model kits. They feature an internal skeleton. If you want to go big, then hit the Perfect Grade kits.\r\n\r\nhogjowlz,\r\n- the $1000 R/C is the MS-06 Zaku. It doesn\'t really walk that well but the best thing about it is that it shoots bb bullets :D');
