INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (10392, '4764503046', '', '[quote:4764503046="daazndood"]is there someone i should email the pics too or something? i have no other way of entering it. pleese help me. i wanna enter my pic real bad[/quote:4764503046]\r\nAs PimpIke and Stoli mentioned, you can either send the entry to me at: cabowabo@lixlink.com\r\nor you can have Stoli host the file for you.\r\nit\'s your choice.\r\n\r\n[quote:4764503046="Impreza WR reX"]yo cabo, since I had a typed logo in the background of my entry (bottom of page 22), did you need me to take another pic with a handwritten one?[/quote:4764503046]\r\nYes Impreza WR reX, please do, thanks for the catch pimp.\r\n\r\n@PimpIke - sweet ride mang, you gots a dope sled pimp! love the color, you\'ve done a great job - the decal adds perfect accent.\r\n\r\n@DarkTari - holy shizzbam dizzle fur-hizzle nizzle. I love those greens and that gloria and the details... hell yea - not to mention under the hood. damn the rims oh mang....\r\n\r\n@All - about allowing you guys to vote for your favorite sled. We\'re currently working out ideas, there\'s a laundry list of pro\'s and con\'s to this. For now, the contest will stay as intially stated and the bitPimps will choose the winners. However, once the contest is over, we might offer the users to vote on their favorite sled just for a "test run" to see how we all like it, etc.\r\n\r\nwhew, did I miss anything? lol');
