INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (38736, '1ce2e9b23d', '', '[quote:1ce2e9b23d="hue35"][quote:1ce2e9b23d="crazydave"][quote:1ce2e9b23d="hue35"]HOCUS POCUS by FOCUS... I\'m a sucker for yodeling, and that shit\'s first rate.[/quote:1ce2e9b23d]Haha, funny you should mention that, that was my favorite song on Saturday for about 20 minutes, but I\'m over it now.[/quote:1ce2e9b23d]\r\n\r\nI have a hard time making sarcasm clear in my posts... I\'d hate to go down as the dude who LOVED Hocus Pocus by Focus. I dig that tune and all, but it cracks me up, in the context of classic rock radio... "Okay, that was Led Zeppelin with \'Bring it on Home\', coming up next, we have leprechauns and yodelers gone haywire"... my favorite part is the munchkin-scat breakdown near the end.[/quote:1ce2e9b23d]So you\'re not that guy?  :???: \r\n\r\nI heard that at work on saturday, and I thought that it was like progressive rock gone totally over the edge and insane. It\'s great because it\'s like it parodies itself in an almost Spinal Tap sorta way. It cracked me up and I thought it was great, until a I found a Santana insrumantal on the jazz station 20 minutes later.');
