INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (10551, '6a997f44ce', '', '[quote:6a997f44ce="DarkTari"]The only car wax/polish I would use is a qick wax.  I use Production ShowRoom Shine, it\'s and Anti-Static liquid polish.  Sprays on like Windex, I use this on my REAL rides after washing between waxings.  I have also used this product:\r\nhttp://groups.msn.com/DTMicro/shoebox.msnw?action=ShowPhoto&amp;PhotoID=1\r\nI originally bought this to try to get the scratches out of my son\'s Gameboy screen.  Read somewhere that this is what the Top Modelers use.[/quote:6a997f44ce]\r\n\r\nyo DT I noticed you used the link. if you wanna post the picture directly here, right click the picture and click properties see where it says Address(URL)? well, highlight that part, to right of that, this URL is 5 lines long... lol, yeah, it\'s long. for that pic, it should look like this: http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0PwDiArESZVAWuvQyDpEzbH6R1gYM*jA5Ozf3whgMToRQ*EBRSnU9KqTR1fa!lENH86!O4HspZc5Y7AlDITlv6HOMypHA5yM7/Novus.jpg?dc=4675425232897095560\r\n\r\nnow, what you do is just post that link inside [img][/img] and you should end up with this:\r\n[img:6a997f44ce]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0PwDiArESZVAWuvQyDpEzbH6R1gYM*jA5Ozf3whgMToRQ*EBRSnU9KqTR1fa!lENH86!O4HspZc5Y7AlDITlv6HOMypHA5yM7/Novus.jpg?dc=4675425232897095560[/img:6a997f44ce]\r\n\r\nnow ya get it? lol :smile:');
