INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (10568, '4d23b0562e', 'My wheelie-mobile (dual NiCd\'d 350z)', 'Well, here is the dual cell 350z booster I modded last night.  I am working on getting a vid up, but it is too dang big (file size wise).  Man though, this thing does wheelies like you wouldn\'t believe.  It will even do them just going forward boosted and not going reverse first.  On with the pics! :D \r\n\r\n[img:4d23b0562e]http://www.adams.net/~dbuss/pics/boost2cell1.jpg[/img:4d23b0562e]\r\n[img:4d23b0562e]http://www.adams.net/~dbuss/pics/boost2cell2.jpg[/img:4d23b0562e]\r\n[img:4d23b0562e]http://www.adams.net/~dbuss/pics/boost2cell3.jpg[/img:4d23b0562e]\r\n[img:4d23b0562e]http://www.adams.net/~dbuss/pics/boost2cell4.jpg[/img:4d23b0562e]\r\n[img:4d23b0562e]http://www.adams.net/~dbuss/pics/boost2cell5.jpg[/img:4d23b0562e]\r\n\r\nBTW cabowabo, I would like this to be entered into the contest, and the mods are a dual cell, custom EM motor, and a re-routed antenna.  I am probably going to pig-tail it tonight.\r\n\r\nEveryone, just feel free to tell me what you think (I know the outer battery is pretty messy, but it was a pain in da poop to rig it up because of the fat wires I used).');
