INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (10649, '179612aae6', '', 'Well, here\'s my first entry. gotta say, I\'m a little disappointed with the way it came out. Never got around to ordering a pullback to snag the rims from, and I set out with the intentions of a Candy Blue, when I got to the store I ended with a a Dark Blue that I thought looked nice, but when I got it home it was even darker than under the florescent lights, and when I painted it, it was even darker. :shock: I think it\'s too contrasting to the Silver, but I\'ve got another project going also, so  I\'ll go ahead and enter it.\r\n\r\nHere\'s the specs:\r\n- Dual Tomy cells, and booster board, in the infamous "Franken-Zap" chassis, which is about 3 or 4 different cars, whose parts have been selected for optimum performance.\r\n- Fully painted and detailed chassis, with the "Original Painted PCB Cover", and one of my patented flame jobs.\r\n- Custom painted \'69 a Camaro body, in a deep Midnight Blue. I decided to throw some stripes in with my flames.\r\n- Custom chrome exhaust w/ flanged ends, made from pen tips.\r\n\r\nThe pics:\r\n[img:179612aae6]http://erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/entry1-1.jpg[/img:179612aae6]\r\n\r\n[img:179612aae6]http://erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/entry1-2.jpg[/img:179612aae6]\r\n\r\n[img:179612aae6]http://erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/entry1-3.jpg[/img:179612aae6]\r\n\r\n[img:179612aae6]http://erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/entry1-4.jpg[/img:179612aae6]\r\n\r\nI noticed after the fact that I wrote "bitpimps.lixlinks.com" with the extra s, I saw other people do that, and swore I wouldn\'t do that, but I did it anyways. Oh well, I have one more chance.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (10650, 'e13e653024', '', 'I have make my first Dualceller(last Year...i think November)also(with the Cell outside the body)...in Germany we hate it!\r\nWe don´t do Dualcellcars...we make Mosfet and put a 200Mah Cell into the Chassi or use a Polymer Cell with 4,2V!\r\n\r\nBut the Car is nice...and a Dualcellmod is very good for Wheelis!!\r\n\r\nGreetings from Germany...Sinned');
