INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (10819, 'a1081d9bba', 'HELP ME curb my demon!!!!', 'I NEED serious help here peeps!\r\n\r\nAs many may (or not) know, I\'m a Hulk freak...Well let\'s clarify that, I\'m a freak for anything done by Dale Keown about the Hulk.\r\n\r\nA quick bit about Dale is that he basically drew the Hulk in a new and KICKASS way. He was only the penciler for \'The Incredible Hulk\' comic for a short time, but for me his rendition of the Hulk (ESPECIALLY the \'Smart\', aka \'Professor\' Hulk) is absolutely worship worhty...Imagine, The Strength of The Hulk WITH the brains of Dr. Banner!\r\n\r\nWell, the \'tards at Marvel didn\'t let that live too long and what\'s worse is there ain\'t much of SHIT as far as merchandise with the \'Smart\' Hulk, or any of his versions of the Hulk smart of not. I HATE the usual, Mongoloidal retard lookin Hulks man, Keown\'s version RULES.\r\n\r\n...All of a sudden, today I find a fucking HUGE ass statue available...And guess what? It\'s based on Dale Keown\'s Hulk! But the fucking thing is almost [b:a1081d9bba]$200!!![/b:a1081d9bba] The wife is gonna shit a DONKEY if I come home with this thing!\r\n\r\nI NEED you all to talk me OUT of getting it!');
