INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (11025, '143471ec8c', '', 'Crap, I meant to go back and see what Kwibb reply was, but I kept forgetting. :roll: \r\n\r\n[quote:143471ec8c="hogjowlz"]what kinda tunes you write dave? i figured you were only into rock n roll or something with the flame job guitar and all.[/quote:143471ec8c]\r\n\r\nI\'m a confused musical mutt. Speed Metal is what led me to play guitar, 15 years ago, and now 60s garage rock, and old school punk keeps me playing, I also experiment with Blues, Jazz, Classical, Rockabilly, Folk, Surf, Techno, Rap, etc. etc.\r\n\r\nAbout 5 years ago I started learning keyboards, and experimenting with a cheap Yamaha sequencer. Shortly after I got into the computer, and starting playing with recording software like Cakewalk, and Steinberg Cubase. I then had the power to do anything I wanted, but was at a loss. Then I got into Atari Teenage Riot, and was like, "This is it, this is the shit that\'s going to piss parents off" I started playing with sequencer software like Fruity Loops, and ReBirth, that simulate the old school stuff, and trying to mix hardcore gabber stuff, with speed metal. \r\n\r\nNow I\'m getting a little bored playing with the computer, and am trying to get a 3 piece garage band together, but my techno experiments continue, and I made this little hip hop track for a friend that had a song called "Crazy Pay" about getting that Social security for being out of your head.\r\n\r\nI\'d like to show you what I\'ve done, but they\'re lost in a stack of backup CDs, and it would be easier to record a new track, than dig out the old ones. ;)\r\n\r\n[quote:143471ec8c="kwikbb"]crazydave wrote: \r\n\r\nWay to bust the rhymes Kwikbb. If I lay some tracks, would you be able to bust the rymes for reals, and record it? If so, maybe I\'ll work something out. \r\n\r\nThanks dawg!  \r\nI was just palyin\' around, sometimes they\'re smooth, sometimes they\'re not lol. \r\nThe only time i got in front of a mic, was \'Karaoke Night\' many moons ago, sang a littte Tom Jones and i was stinking drunk too lol! [/quote:143471ec8c]\r\n\r\nWell, hey, if you don\'t want to rap it, do you care if I use it to try tp put together the Bit Pimps theme song? I can\'t rap, I\'ll probably use a pitch shifter or something on my voice. ;)');
