INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48994, '9db5a64fec', '', '[quote:9db5a64fec="Son_Gokou"]Don\'t bitch at me just because I had a bit of a hard time understanding the whole thing.[/quote:9db5a64fec]\r\nGokou, you need to settle down a few notches... ph2t is an EE, and his schematic is drawn up accordingly. \r\nIt\'s cool that he\'s sharing it for those who can understand and see what he\'s doing. You need to understand \r\nthat asking ph2t to explain it from the ground up, to someone who doesn\'t understand any of it, is way \r\nout of line... it takes a lot of time and energy to explain things that complex to a beginner... that\'s why \r\nteachers get paid and school costs money. You seem to have zero respect for any of this. He\'s already \r\nbeing pretty generous, so don\'t be so fucking disrespectful. This shit is over my head too, but I\'m not about \r\nto ask him to take me step by step through his work and teach me how to read a schematic, and ask why \r\nthis and why that... that would make me a clueless asshole with no fucking respect for someone else\'s \r\nwork, not to mention their time. If you need ph2t to explain every little thing on his schematic, then you \r\nneed to save your pennies and buy one... that\'s why he\'s selling them. \r\n\r\nYou really need to understand the concept of "knowing just enough to be dangerous"... it\'s a fucked up thing, \r\nand the best example I can give is you. You ask all these questions about things you don\'t really understand... \r\nyou pick up a little bit of jargon and mix it with an ounce of understanding. Then, you take that worthless \r\n"knowledge" and ask a lot of questions that make little sense to someone who knows the shit inside and out. \r\nWhere do you expect them to start? How much of their time do expect them to give to you? You have got to \r\nget it through your skull that this is extremely disrespectful and even more annoying.\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:9db5a64fec="Son_Gokou"]now THIS is a fucking diagram!!\r\n\r\nhttp://www.geocities.com/mastermind_sound_solutions/NFUD.html[/quote:9db5a64fec]\r\nNow you\'re just adding serious insult to injury... like you know what the fuck one diagram is from another. \r\nWhat you\'re saying here, is that the hobbyist\'s diagram you linked to is better than a clean and clear schematic \r\nfrom an actual EE. Your comment here has me so fucking irritated, I\'d like to tear you the fuck apart. I\'m \r\nbeing as nice as possible, because you\'re a kid... please try to understand your lack of fucking respect, and \r\ntry to learn from it. I know you\'ve tried real hard, but this shit proves to me that you have a long way to go... \r\nyou don\'t need to be in the center of the Rocket Science topics... in fact, stay outta the way, you have nothing \r\nto contribute. Just read the stuff and learn from it, but until you understand how to participate in a respectful \r\nmanner, shut your fuckin\' mouth.');
