INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48214, '10787ea77d', '', 'the unfinished basement is the only place large enough to house my track. :-D \r\n\r\ni\'ve been a lurker here since the early days.  sorry to have taken so long to actually take part.  as a moderator, you can understand these things (forums) can take up a good deal of your time :cool: \r\n\r\nyou should see some of the video clips i\'ve added, some are fairly funny 8) \r\n\r\n[url=http://mini-zracer.com/albums/album194/MVI_2412.avi]launching my diablo off of overland hill[/url]\r\n\r\n[url=http://mini-zracer.com/albums/album194/a_game_of_tag.wmv]game of tag team[/url]\r\n\r\n[url=http://mini-zracer.com/albums/album194/piggy_back_clips.wmv]piggy back rides[/url]\r\n\r\n[url=http://mini-zracer.com/albums/album194/trip_around_the_track_on_the_diablo.wmv]taped the camera to my diablo[/url]\r\n\r\n[url=http://mini-zracer.com/albums/album194/another_trip_around_the_track_on_the_mercedes_overland.wmv]taped the camera to the g55[/url]\r\n\r\n[url=http://mini-zracer.com/albums/album194/clip_show_of_f1_on_the_new_track.wmv]f1 on the track[/url]\r\n\r\nmy pit station\r\n[img:10787ea77d]http://mini-zracer.com/albums/album194/IMG_0958.sized.jpg[/img:10787ea77d]\r\n\r\ni am sad to report xmods do not do well on my track.  i\'ve never been able to get one up my overland hill.  they have a hard time with the simple banked turn and obstacle mounds i have placed throughout as well.  so, my rsx collects dust on pit lane');
