INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39368, 'e4fe9a4a2d', '', '[quote:e4fe9a4a2d="Bird"] and you know what they say about opinions being like assholes.... everybody has one....[/quote:e4fe9a4a2d]\r\n\r\nOMFG!  :-D I\'ll have to write that one down!\r\n\r\nAnyways, You\'re pretty much correct, Bird, maybe what I want to say comes out wrong sometimes. I have that trait, and it\'s not a good one. The thing is, nobody at those forums wanted to help me work on it, they just said "stop it" or "you are a troll" or whatever stuff. They were just too lazy to TELL ME IN MY FACE what I was doing wrong, and they never admtted their wrongs, like cheesecake at MRCC picking on peeps cuz of their age, or oldtamiyaphile making huge numbers of posts that harshly put down other people\'s ideas or harshly correcting them. What I\'m saying is that they never directly told me what I did wrong, but they would perform the wrong actions themselves...one time, one of them even purposely took one of my jokes seriously and embarassed me by saying not to make complaints about the mod staff. I found that disgusting, and when I reported it....he lied and said he was joking. Fuckin coward...\r\n\r\nAnyways, the people here are different.....They are direct, to the point, and tell me to my face, even though it may hurt....unlike the smartasses at the other boards, who will quote proverbs like in here: http://www.microrccenter.com/forum/index.php?showtopic=17942&amp;st=0&amp;#entry155617\r\n\r\n or some shit like that. That\'s why here, as sessiz says, "little goku here has come a long way...." but, "still has a long way to go." I know what he means, I still haven\'t matured that much (corny jokes, and little posts that have anything to do with RC\'s), but people are telling me what not to do, and I have improved on that. This is why I prefer to be cussed at on bitpimps than made an example of @ mrcc or wgu. \r\n\r\nThanks pimps! :-)');
