INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48184, '19b3e0274f', 'They really fucked up now', 'For those of you who still want to believe this is just a "muslim" thing (ie. us against them muslims) I present you with this...\r\n\r\nhttp://www.foxnews.com/story/0,2933,123826,00.html\r\n\r\nI\'m loving this shit. As soon as them 3 turks get beheaded it\'s pretty much on. A lil background for the uneducated in turkish history. Turkey has been fighting terrorists (kurdish terrorists which were up until recent times called freedom fighters and rebels and such here in the states and european countries) for over 30 years. Turkey hunts them wherever they may be, and actually captures them.(few years back turkey went all the way into africa after ocalan the pkk\'s head) These same kurdish terrorists used to hide in northern iraq crossing the border into southern turkey for raids on villages. Now that iraq is pretty much opened and the controlling body of iraq (aka USA) pretty much needs nato\'s help. I forsee some turkish excursions and serious actions within turkey to squash the fanatic islamists. :-) \r\n\r\nThe extremely fucked up thing is that it\'s all about the fuckin oil and "markets" and the all mighty currency that rules all. Turkey\'s government aint that different from the USA, but the general public there are way more active in government. This offcourse is counteracted by the fuckin corruption that runs rampant.  :-(');
