INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (11662, '5789949905', '', '[quote:5789949905="Stoli"]Try try again.\r\n\r\nFinally got the mirroring down I think?\r\n\r\n[img:5789949905]http://members.rogers.com/computermod/images/rc/nsx%20with%20mirror-400.JPG[/img:5789949905]\r\n\r\nFull Image\r\n[url]http://members.rogers.com/computermod/images/rc/nsx%20with%20mirror%201000.JPG[/url][/quote:5789949905]\r\n\r\nClose, real close man. I think Ima do a tut man. \r\nFor the mirror effect I did this.\r\nFirst you flip the image like ya did.\r\nThen you add some blur/motion blur (play around wit it).\r\nYou rotate the mirrored image so that the wheels touch, back and fronts.\r\nYou play around with the opacity and fill of the layer. You could even do a gradient fade over top of the mirrored image.\r\nGood job man If ya want there is mad resources out on the net, I could email ya some sites.\r\nAre ya using photoshop or another program?');
