INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12224, '2db699d1f2', '', '[quote:2db699d1f2="noxorc"]I hope CrazyDave is feel good.[/quote:2db699d1f2]\r\n\r\nYou bet, had a great weekend, stocked up on killer $5 clones, then I won, damn, couldn\'t have been better.\r\n\r\nForgot the victory dance... :-D  :D  :D  :-D \r\n\r\nWheeee, that was fun.\r\n\r\nHey, forgot to say great job to the other winners. \r\n\r\nDark Tari\'s idea of making a flipped pcb dual cell, and actually using the PCB to add to the detail, genious, pure genious.\r\n\r\nWhen I saw Yagbowls highly detailed cop car, right at the beginning of the competition, I knew that we\'d need something special to beat that out.\r\n\r\nAnd Hoboman\'s NSX, well just look at it, it\'s clean. Glad you got in on the booty too.\r\n\r\nSo yeah, anyways, I\'m feeling pretty cool right now. :cool:');
