INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40058, '7c22dcae75', '', '[quote:7c22dcae75="sg219"]\r\nPlus, some things in the works. [size=18:7c22dcae75] [color=green:7c22dcae75]I think to veiw all my albums, just go to [url]http://www.picturetrail.com[/url] and enter sg219.[/color:7c22dcae75] [/size:7c22dcae75] I\'ll edit this later if something is wrong.....\r\n\r\nHeres the link to all galleries.  [size=18:7c22dcae75][color=green:7c22dcae75]Just Enter sg219 and it should take you to where you gotta go.[/color:7c22dcae75][/size:7c22dcae75]\r\n[url]http://www.picturetrail.com/gallery/view[/url][/quote:7c22dcae75]\r\n\r\n\r\nHere you go.  Sorry for any confusion.\r\n\r\nScrew it.  I had time to move some of the pics to Photobucket so I can put them up here.  But you can still go to picturetrail and enter "sg219" and see all of them and more.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[img:7c22dcae75]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/tools.jpg[/img:7c22dcae75]\r\n\r\n[img:7c22dcae75]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/putty.jpg[/img:7c22dcae75]\r\n\r\n[img:7c22dcae75]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/under.jpg[/img:7c22dcae75]\r\n\r\n[img:7c22dcae75]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/side.jpg[/img:7c22dcae75]\r\n\r\n[img:7c22dcae75]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/b4after.jpg[/img:7c22dcae75]\r\n\r\n[img:7c22dcae75]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/b4aftergreen.jpg[/img:7c22dcae75]\r\n\r\n[img:7c22dcae75]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/topback.jpg[/img:7c22dcae75]\r\n\r\n[img:7c22dcae75]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Project%20SG/Picture_001a.jpg[/img:7c22dcae75]\r\n\r\nAll right now...I think I\'ll just do this from now on.  I like this photobucket site.\r\n\r\n\r\nI still have a long way to go.  I have to add the windsheild, wing, steering wheel and the detail paint.  Plus the clearcoat.');
