INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (38714, '5c90dbc2c3', '', '[quote:5c90dbc2c3="hue35"]HOCUS POCUS by FOCUS... I\'m a sucker for yodeling, and that shit\'s first rate.[/quote:5c90dbc2c3]Haha, funny you should mention that, that was my favorite song on Saturday for about 20 minutes, but I\'m over it now.\r\n\r\nIn the last week I went through The Dillinger Escape Plan w/ Mike Patton (Insane mathematically plotted descent into insanity), Thin White Rope (Almost like a Goth Country band, great metaphoric lyrics),  The Godless Wicked Creeps. (Some Scandinavian Rawk a Billy that borders on speed metal, if anything you gotta love the name, but I happen to love the music too).  Garage rock bands with chick singers; Bratmoblie, 5 6 7 8\'s, Detroit Cobras. Steve Albini\'s 2 bands, Big Black and Shellac. The Big Boys, thanks to Hue. (Thanks Hue, still lovin\' \'em :-) ), and all day yesterday all I listened to was techno, Atari Teenage Riot, Three Steps Ahead, Ultra-violence, One of the Thunderdome comps, and I wound it down with some Massive Attack, and Portishead. I did give the Big Boys one more listen, and my wife slipped some Blind Melon in there on me.\r\n\r\nThe bands that were the biggest influences on me in the past are, Syd Barrett era Pink Floyd, David Bowie, Iggy and the Stooges, bauhaus, Sonic Youth, Butthole Surfers, The Ramones, The Beatles...etc. etc.');
