INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (38713, '02bdb47aee', '', '[quote:02bdb47aee="Canadian Bit"]I\'m ok with a BC or CD-style bodykit but not a Crap N\' Furious bodykit on this kind of a car.[/quote:02bdb47aee]\r\n\r\nI can say the same thing, I wouldn\'t touch any of the SuperBit Body\'s cause to me they are Great in their original detail. [b:02bdb47aee]BUT[/b:02bdb47aee] the only reason I wouldn\'t is because I couldn\'t think of a thing to do to them that will enhance their appearance.  Now Miva has thought this out thoroughly, step-by-step and has come up with something that totally blows my mind.  Seeing it in stages and how much skill is being applied, you\'re not seeing the Big Picture Pimp. I think you\'ll change your tune once this starts to come to closure.  I\'ve been all over Da World (net wise) and been to many forums and seen some incredible things done with Micro\'s and I gotta tell ya, this one will be one for the history books!  And you saw it here 1st, step-by-step in Pimp City!\r\n\r\nPS. \r\n Did you see what the paint remover did to this body!  It [b:02bdb47aee]WAS[/b:02bdb47aee] Crap !\r\n Now as Silla said earlier, [i:02bdb47aee]Crap doesn\'t fit [b:02bdb47aee]into[/b:02bdb47aee] Miva\'s Mod\'s[/i:02bdb47aee], just the           beginning!');
