INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (11821, 'fc5bc08b18', '', 'The Biglots by me finally opened yesterday, so I finally got one of these Thunder Charger cars.\r\n\r\nI have got to say, these things do kick some serious butt. Tracks perfectly straight with the adjuster centered. Turns on a dime and gives 9 cents change. The pink endbell clone motor is very good. I would\'ve liked a little more top end, but accelleration is excellent. I can see why these motors would work out well for dual cells. The gears are quiet, and the tires are flat wide, and fairly sticky.\r\n\r\nMy only complaint is that I don\'t care for the cheesy bodies, and the chassis is just slightly too long for bit bodies. Cannonball clone bodies fit perfect, but I only have a couple of those that I\'m not real fond of.\r\n\r\nBut for $5 I\'m not complaining. I only got one to check \'em out, and because I don\'t get paid until monday, but on monday going back and buying as many as I can!');
