INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (11855, '08f1cc8efa', 'Slamin Deal', 'Hey guys. Got bitten by the BIT BUG again today. Went to wally world to look for more motor works cars. None to be seen :(\r\n\r\nbut I did find these. I\'m guessing there a clone of a zip-zap since there just a little bigger than a BIT Char-G. Picked up an impreza and 2 track sets for $30 Bucks. Down fall is they only come with 1.0 motor but they take standard MS/Bit motors and they come with 150mah batt already inside.\r\n\r\nHeres tha pics\r\n\r\n[img:08f1cc8efa]http://members.rogers.com/computermod/images/rc/Track%20and%20Car.JPG[/img:08f1cc8efa]\r\n\r\n[img:08f1cc8efa]http://members.rogers.com/computermod/images/rc/ZipZap%20front.JPG[/img:08f1cc8efa]\r\n\r\n\r\n[img:08f1cc8efa]http://members.rogers.com/computermod/images/rc/ZipZap%20side.JPG[/img:08f1cc8efa]\r\n\r\nWhat do you think. The track stuffs pretty awesome. Will post pics when its built. :cool:');
