INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (11888, 'd3e64e47b9', 'any suggestions on a CHEAP but decent digital camera???', 'i really need to show off all my rides. i have about 6 months worth of mods, custom stuff, and all that good stuff. im also saving for a larger 1/10 touring car, so i dont want to spend too much on a camera. it doesnt have to be the best(obviously) just good enough to take a few 640x480 or so pics at a good quality. i need it to focus in close too, but i think a trick around that is to use a magnifying glass but im not too sure how good that works. i think the most i want to spend is maybe $60. im mainly a 35mm SLR photographer but i dont really keep up with the digital stuff. any suggestions? what do you guys use to take pics of your bits?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (11889, '5721de2279', '', 'yeah well hack is right. I figured I\'d take the motor from it since its definetly not a 1.0 and put it in my bit. Of course me being the newb I am I took the gear off the axle and now I have to reglue it on because all I get it free spinning gear movement. DAMMIT :finger:\r\n\r\nOh well I\'m returning the one I bought today. The steering absolutly sux ass. I\'ll be gettin another motorworks instead.\r\n\r\nAlso like I said before the track is silly cause you cannot een drive in it since its sooooo easy to flip over the rails. \r\n\r\nI\'m just gonna buy some cardboard/plywood and tubing and go ghetto like C-Dub did. \r\n\r\nThats all for now. Awaiting 2.6 and 3.0 motors from US. Should be here tomorrow.');
