INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (11997, '8e21b4ded5', '', 'Hey, wait, hold on a minute here...you guys saying I won? :shock: \r\n\r\nI\'m dumbfounded. I really didn\'t plan to win. I just figured I like hangin\' out here, so I better make an appearance. It was funny, because I wasn\'t planning to win, but just to make it fun for myself I kept reminding myself it\'s for a contest, so it has to be perfect, and every time I would go to lay a coat, my heart would start racing, because you just don\'t know exactly what\'s going to happen when you peel that masking tape off. After I finally got it all together, it looked pretty good, and I was proud of myself. I thought maybe, just maybe I [i:8e21b4ded5]might[/i:8e21b4ded5] place in the top 3, but I sure didn\'t plan to win. There was some really nice cars. \r\n\r\nSo that goes to show you, even if you don\'t think your stuff is good enough you should go ahead and enter it, and let the judges decide if it\'s good enough. That\'s one reason to enter, another is when you go to a car show, everyone is checking out everyone rides, and appreciating their work, not just first place. It\'s not about winning, it\'s about showing what you got, and having fun with it.\r\n\r\nReally, thank you very much, I\'m truly honored, and to show my appreciation I\'m going to put the together the best damn flame job tutorial anyone\'s ever seen. :smile:');
