INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12079, '604ebb5fb6', '', 'That drill press attachment would be tits. I\'d like to get ahold of one of those snaky attachments too.\r\n\r\nSuperfly, I was reading your story fully expecting some gore, that was a close one.\r\n\r\nI had a chunk of metal stuck in my eye, by a dremel, had to have drilled out by a doctor. Not cool watching a high speed drill approach your eye. I [i:604ebb5fb6]always[/i:604ebb5fb6] wear safty glasses when I dremel now. Ironically I got another chunk of metal stuck in my when I was playing with a spring stuck in a hole. I got it out alright, and it spit a chunk of metal in my eye on it\'s way out. Now wife and everyone makes fun of me, but seriously, how the hell was I supposed to know to wear safty glasses when playing with springs? I guess I\'m just an endangerment to myself, and shouldn\'t be messing with power tools. Oh well.');
