INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (40026, 'a73dedf134', '', 'I picked-up the camera I hid at Best Buy.  The funny thing is, that they had 2 of them this time.  They found the one I hid and there was another one there also.  It was origonally $99.99(new), then when I found it about a week ago it was $89.99 (open box), thats when I hid it.  I went back Friday and found 2 of them for $84.99 (open box).  \r\n\r\n\r\nI hope this camera helps out on the clarity of the pics I can post now.  It has a ton of features.  The only thing it don\'t have is a flash.  \r\n\r\n[color=green:a73dedf134][size=18:a73dedf134]Thanks for your suggestions and input Filelicker and Finks!!  [/size:a73dedf134][/color:a73dedf134]If this camera wasn\'t there when I went back I would of turned to one of your suggestions for sure!!!');
