INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12173, '749b154a6d', '', 'I\'ve gotten a few replies about the decals.\r\nSeems some people are interested in a variaty of colors of just the "BitPimps" logo - which is great - those turned out great because they\'re vector based. Nice clean print edges and graphic with solid coloring.\r\nAnd better yet, it\'s easy as shit to do. I\'ve got the sources, so I can size em however small (to a point so they\'re still legible) or however big (to a point to where they\'ll still fit on a car).\r\nNext, I\'m going to take that silhoette (sp?) of the chick on got on the back of my truck, and I\'m gonna make a vector based graphic of here, and then we can have her in any color and size as well.\r\nNext, I\'m not sure, maybe numbers?\r\nooh! License plates!\r\nusernames?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12174, '6399a80688', 'Dual-celll Thunder Charger &amp; revived body', 'These Thunder Chargers are da bomb, but I just can\'t quite take a liking to the bodies. They\'re a tad longer than bits, so only my Cannonball clone bodies fit. That leaves me the option of my hummer, which I already have plans for, and the Celica, that was my first micro RC and has been through every experiment imaginable. \r\n\r\nI didn\'t think it was worth saving, but I gave it a go. Sanded most of the guck off. Repainted it with the original paint scheme I did 6 months ago. Gave it a new Zip Zap wing, and since I had already hacked out the back window for a dual cell, I went ahead and made it a wheelie machine\r\n\r\nWhen it came together, I think this body is actually ready for one more tour of duty.\r\n\r\n[img:6399a80688]http://www.erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/celica2.jpg[/img:6399a80688]\r\n\r\n[img:6399a80688]http://www.erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/celica3.jpg[/img:6399a80688]\r\n\r\n[img:6399a80688]http://www.erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/celica1.jpg[/img:6399a80688]\r\n\r\nI made a video clip, let me know how this works out, it\'s my first time posting a video.\r\n\r\nSorry for the Quicktime format, if anyone knows how to convert it to Windows media let me know. This ones been optimized, I have a larger higher quality one if this ones too hard to see.\r\n\r\n\r\n[url=http://www.erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/tclow2.MOV]Video Clip[/url]');
