INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39086, '37a11a271a', '', 'I don\'t want a fast motor for the steering. Cell phone vibrators are low rpm, high torque motors. They\'re designed to spin an unballanced weight block creating vibrating force. Also, cell phone vibrators are designed to handle 3.5 - 4v which is perfect for a 4v Li-ion. The dual engines in the rear will provide sufficient torque even if there is a nominal deficiancy of torque per motor and for thus I want the highest rpm motors I can get. Also, having the dual engines soaks up any over-volted stress because the stress is split between two motors.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12314, '1ba209821a', '', 'The "HULK" back in the day with Lou, and Bill Bixby was the shit.. for real.. I used to get geared up fo dat like it was "Smallville" lol\r\n\r\nI liked in the intro when he was changing the tire, and slips off the nut, and goes into a rage, and accidently kills his Nana...lol  Great stuff.\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12315, '4f4e5c289f', 'EVO is off da chain.........', 'Im really feelin\' these cars , yo. The fact that their scale is off da fu**in chain. Finally a realistic car as opposed to this "bubble dome" sh** they keep pushing our way. Same with the ZZ\'s and the rounded curves. Im not buying ANYTHING else so if anyone wants my collection (Sizers 1st wave, ZZ\'s 1st wave and a ton *8+ of varying types* of clones ..few stretched cars...ton of cells ranging from 70 mah to 210 mah - pairs only........all controllers...couple Naka boosters...lots of custom bodies) ill trade it for one or two of these new or used but not screwed lol.\r\n\r\nAnyway....the traction on  a linoleum floor isnt bad. It steers fine with no issues ( tracks fairly well...especially consideringthe tires are to scale i.e. small). The bodies ARE the sh** ESPECIALLY the green EVO. Run time is da izm ( 4 AA batt pack linked to the nitrous bottle and 2 minutes ran  and ran ...went to sleep and the next morning it STILL ran. I figure 20 minutes is about right ona 2 min charge). Turbo is as Turbo Does...smokes. I can see this being a real nice "race track" car  on flat tracks. Inclines might kill it because of the low profile and tires...ill find out later. \r\n\r\nAll in all....considering we are going to mod the hell outta these cars anyway the pan chassis and quality craftsmanship (TOP NOTCH!) are all that really matters. Besides...it smokes the Bits and ZZ\'s stock. \r\n\r\nBottom line....let the HOES get down on the FLO\' ( say it like a PIMP!)...theres a new sheriff in town. \r\n\r\nAt least untl the Muscle Machines R/C\'s hit the shelves..............');
