INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12352, 'c1bb60d0db', '', '[quote:c1bb60d0db="ph2t"]Yo crazy, what sorta results do you get with that antenna man?  I would assume the range would be curtailed a bit....... :???:[/quote:c1bb60d0db]\r\nHonestly, I can\'t comment on range, because I run in a small area, but there is a washer, dryer, fridge, and thermostat all right in that area, and I usually have problems with glitching, when everything\'s goings it\'s almost unbearable, but I haven\'t had the slightest problem with these cars. I bought one for my 3 y.o. to play with when I\'m playing with my cars, and I only pull the antenna out an inch or two, and there still isn\'t hardly any problems.');
