INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12428, '1d8ecf6d46', '', 'Well I couldn\'t figure out how to do most of the stuff Quicktime Pro advertised, because I don\'t get along well with help menus, but I did figure out how to trim the movie, and export frame sequences. So I just edited the PNF files frame by frame, and made about 30 more at the end.\r\n\r\nI have Photoshop, but my wife prefers Paint Shop Pro, so that\'s where all her cool filters are installed. I made the trail effect with something from EyeCandy 4000. Added it to 4 frames, increasing length, and opacity each time.\r\n\r\nI didn\'t have much footage to work with, I need to set up a stunt coarse and start working on something, now that I have the means, but I still need figure out how to attach music. I\'ve only played with it a few hours, I\'ll get better. ;)\r\n\r\nThanks for the compliments. Encourages me to make more. :smile:');
