INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12592, 'c99e152463', '', 'ok, makes sense with the whole bB thing. \r\n\r\nI\'m a bit concerned with the whole 9 winners thing, choosing three winners was not exactly a walk in the park! \r\ni think we may be making things more difficult for ourselves and again raising the expectation bar too high.\r\nthe way i look at it is, so far i\'ve only known of one site that gave away a full set with their first big contest... us. and not only that but we had 2nd and 3rd place aswell, again only one site i\'ve seen do this... us. now were gonna follow it up with the mother of all giveaways, a 9 prize contest... then what? We just blew our load in one fell swoop, maybe i\'m the only one seeing it this way but it would seem that we could do ourselves a favor and tame it a bit.\r\nLike just keep it to a single winner per category, some may not see this as interesting or colorful as 9 prizes but i think we\'ll love ourselves more in the morning.\r\n\r\nor maybe i need to get drunk... again');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12593, 'aa04940b0b', '', 'noway man, I\'m right there with ya.\r\nI\'m totally concerned about all that you mentioned, this contest is too big - but like I said, I just updated the post to reflect as many of everyone\'s suggestions that I could.\r\n\r\nI\'m still open to however you guys wanna do it, I just wanna get the details ironed out so we don\'t get caught with our pants down so to speak.\r\n\r\nI\'m with kwik, we need to tame this one down.\r\nsave our booty so we can keep having contests, I personally think close together is fine, but I\'m easy on that too - so however.\r\n\r\nI can say this, whatever we do for the next contest, we have to let extrememicros supply the prizes mentioned above, he\'s already got his post made on his site and blah blah blah lol\r\n\r\nwe can still run a minor trivia deal too while the major contest is going - it\'s all up to us, we just gotta discuss it so we can get it all planned.\r\n\r\n*turning off tony robbins tapes* \r\n\r\nman, that all sounded really dumb and like work, but I don\'t know how else to communicate it without being half-assed and falling off the map.\r\n\r\nC-diddy');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12594, '88fdbf0c14', '', 'I\'ve had the same problem with the uneven steering on MS\'s, but that just a recent thing, most are not like that.\r\n\r\nI\'ve isolated the problem in my cars to chassis tweak. Look at your chassis at eye level from the front, see if one steering knuckle is sticking out the top more than the other. If it is like mine, then you need to twist the chassis. The side with the least amount of steering knuckle sticking out is the high side, and when you twist your chassis, that side needs to be twisted down. Did that make any sense? I\'m going to try to make a picture later on that will better illustrate this for people. The problem is the problem keeps returning. I\'m going to experiment with heating up the chassis with a heat gun, and then holding it twisted until it cools.\r\n\r\nThe idea here is when you turn the outside front corner dives down, lifting traction from the inside rear wheel, allowing tighter turns. When the chassis is tweaked it\'s diving more on one side than the other. \r\n\r\nI\'m planning to write a tutorial about this, but first I need more research.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12595, '42979b27e9', '', '[quote:42979b27e9="sessiz"][quote:42979b27e9="crazydave"]He\'ll be back, they always come back. Modding is like cigarettes, you may think your quitting cold turkey, but you\'re going to end up getting your fix here and there, you just can\'t resist.[/quote:42979b27e9]\r\n\r\nI used to be like this guy &gt;  :cool: \r\nNow I\'m more like this guy &gt;  :sad: \r\nSometimes I\'m more like this guy &gt;  :-) \r\nBut then I think about when I was like this guy &gt;  :smoking:  \r\nThen I\'m like  :mad: \r\n\r\nAnywho, great job there sinned. I Think sinned may have meant his latest mod, it\'s kinda hard to believe that he\'s gonna stop.[/quote:42979b27e9]\r\n\r\nHey good going sezziz, more power to ya. I\'m jealous that I don\'t have the will power to overcome my addiction. \r\n\r\nAnyhow the point of my joke was that I\'m always hearing, "Hey got a cigarette, I don\'t have any because I quit."');
