INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12641, '171a6f18ca', 'Da Answer !', 'Okay guys, now that I\'ve gotten about 5 hours sleep, I\'ve come up with a tentative solution inwhich I think is fair and all 3 catagories can recieve prizes in all places.\r\n\r\n1st off the contest should run only 1 month, being announced at the end of the previous month. This way we can pull off 2 contests for the summer.\r\n\r\nThe prizes for this contest should be motors period.  Todd had made his offer, now let me tell ya the plan\r\n\r\nIf we\'re still going with the first agreed 3 catagories.....\r\n\r\n[b:171a6f18ca]Gloria:\r\n1st - Goes to the finals\r\n2nd - Perfection 3.8 (I\'ll donate)\r\n3rd -  Perfection 3.0 (I\'ll donate)\r\n\r\nSkyline\r\n1st - Goes to the finals\r\n2nd - Perfection 3.8 (I\'ll donate)\r\n3rd - Perfection 3.0 (I\'ll donate)\r\n\r\nS2K:\r\n1st - Goes to the finals\r\n2nd - Perfection 3.8 (I\'ll donate)\r\n3rd - Perfection 3.0 (I\'ll donate)\r\n\r\nFinals:\r\n1st -  1 of every EX motor\r\n2nd - 1-MIT-02\r\n3rd -  1-MIT-01[/b:171a6f18ca]\r\n\r\nCatagories can change if neccessary but the format should stay the same.\r\nThis is the easiest solution so that every catagory gets 3 place prizes.  The contest can still be BIG cause we can now handle that shit.  \r\nWe are Bit Pimps and ain\'t shit too big for the IC !!!!   :bowdown: \r\n\r\nNow I have a suggestion for a trivia question:\r\n\r\n[b:171a6f18ca]What was the release date for the MicroSizer in the US?[/b:171a6f18ca]\r\nPrize can be a set of Homies or other ????\r\n\r\nLemme know what you guys think.\r\nI went over to the Homies Hood and informed them that I may be commin at \'em with an offer but I wanted to confer with you guys first.  More on that later.');
