INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12654, 'fb96411b1f', '', 'That was cool, just a laid back cruzin\' vid. No high speed stunts here.\r\n\r\nHere\'s my official Hollywood review:\r\n\r\nI was drawn in by the clean production and hip soundtrack. At first I felt this was a flick that truly had potential, but I soon came to reallize that the actors were stiff in their roles, almost as if they were hunks of plastic. The plot had many twist, and turns, and seem to be going some where, but in the end it was all tension, and no release, and you know what happens when guy have tension without release.;)\r\n\r\nI give it a thumbs up, but my buddy Richard (you can call him Dick for short) he\'s mad, I guess he\'s feeling a bit testy. (testi?)\r\n\r\nheh heh, just joking around, good work man.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12655, '4da101f2a5', '', '[quote:4da101f2a5="crazydave"] but I soon came to reallize that the actors were stiff in their roles, almost as if they were hunks of plastic. .[/quote:4da101f2a5]\r\n\r\nA Ho walked by and give us all woodies.  (what\'s why we waz stiff).');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12656, '9a3c9e216f', '', 'Maybe I watched the Hulk for the wrong reasons, but I\'m not planning on loving the movie, because (and go ahead and call me cheezey, \'cause I\'m sure you will) my favorite aspect of the TV series was how at the end they played the sad piano song, and we felt David Banner\'s pain, being a disfunctional freak, who wasn\'t really allowed to have a life. i related to to that.\r\n\r\nOk, and who doesn\'t want to turn into a big green body builder and smash everything in sight, every time someone pisses yo off. I guess that was a big part of the hook too.\r\n\r\nSeriously when I was like 7 or something like that, the Hulk was my favorite show, and I\'m just not planning on liking the movie, because I hate all these movies nowadays, that revamp an old theme. Seems as though society has run out of creativity, to the point where all we can do is remake things now.\r\n\r\nBut that\'s just my narrow minded opinion. The movie probably will be bad ass. Just, let\'s not bring up Godzilla.');
