INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12665, '5cdd1c8c79', '', '[b:5cdd1c8c79]crazydave,[/b:5cdd1c8c79]\r\n\r\nI have a feeling you\'re going to like The Hulk dude, because throughout the \'Making of\' show they kept referring to how Ang Lee (the Director) is ALL ABOUT the humanity aspect. \r\n\r\nThere was an Ang Lee quote that sums it up; "I don\'t know how to make an action movie, but I do know how to make a Greek tragedy" after I heard that AND seeing what the graphics really look like, that\'s when i got psyched to see the flick.\r\n\r\n[b:5cdd1c8c79]hog,[/b:5cdd1c8c79]\r\nWas it the show about the apes that walked upright and one specific one called Lucy and it was narrated by Alec Baldwin?\r\n\r\nI watched that, when Lucy got killed I laughed and changed the channel.');
