INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12673, '6204b97d9d', 'Re: congrats crazyDave!', '[quote:6204b97d9d="ib311"]i\'m confused as to what the winning cars were based on. let me rephrase that. what i meant is, as great as everybody\'s cars were, i don\'t see how biohazard\'s green lowrider truck wasn\'t picked to be one of the top 4 winners.\r\nit is your game, so it\'s rules. but i kinda feel like the kid who shows up with the ball, should be someone who\'s picked to play.\r\ni knew i wouldn\'t win, but you got to admit that truck was super fly.  :cool: \r\nanyway, congrats to all who won!!![/quote:6204b97d9d]\r\n\r\nHave you never judged a contest?  Ya think it\'s easy?\r\nit\'s like a jury room.  You got your mind set, but now convince others.\r\n\r\nThere were about 50 entries and 5 judges.  it was a matrix.\r\n\r\n-nOx');
