INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12707, '1c219e8a3b', '', '[quote:1c219e8a3b="hogjowlz"]they sell niko iracers at toysrus for 20 i think. they are the same thing as digiqs. \r\n\r\nthey make ppc apps for remote controls so i cant see why you couldnt use those apps to control one. there is also a company that sells a piece of hardware(im pretty sure its just an ir l.e.d. hooked up to a headphone plug) for added range. my audiovox maestro only gets about 8foot range for my tv.[/quote:1c219e8a3b]\r\n\r\n\r\nI just bought an Nikko Iracer.  20 beans.\r\n\r\nbig remote controller. looks like a space weapon.\r\nI\'ve seen Namuna has one of these...As to why I bought it. \r\nI remember some of his write ups and it faired ok.\r\nThe car is much smaller than a bit.  and is it fast.\r\nblows away an off the shelf bit.  and would stand up well to a dual cell.');
