INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12712, 'e2a6d613eb', '', '[quote:e2a6d613eb="kwikbb"]yeah that is a great idea! Cool!!! :D \r\n\r\nYeah nox, go nox it\'s yer birfday 8-)[/quote:e2a6d613eb]\r\n\r\nit ain\'t my birfday.   end of may....back a month.\r\n\r\nYes...I wrote your login names.\r\nKwikbb\'s says Kwibkk and\r\nDt\'s says DarkTari and\r\nChair\'s says Silla Payaso\r\nHog\'s says HOG.\r\nCabo says CaboWabo.\r\n\r\nLike I said, this is a test run.  I personally don\'t like the way they came out.\r\nI was using a Font that matched a good size output.  But then cabo sent me the \'Real\' font for the bitPimps. \r\nWhich then changed the size of my printouts.  I printed them anyways.\r\n\r\nTell me what you don\'t/do like and we can print and send out round #2.\r\n\r\nI also did not put any clear coat on them...The laser printer ink seems to be waterproof.   let me know if you have any bleeding.\r\n\r\n-nox');
