INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12731, '26c1f9fb56', '', '[quote:26c1f9fb56="Namuna"]\r\n\r\nHey hog, I didn\'t know you had a Maestro...me too. Mine gets used twice a day...On the train to work and home, to play Hearts/Spades. Other than that, it don\'t do much of shit cept take up space in my bag.\r\n\r\n[/quote:26c1f9fb56]\r\n\r\nhearts and spades? are you aware of the gaming possibilities? they have a spawn game. a buncha rts games. a superb emulator for gameboy/nes/snes games. need for speed was ported. a buncha sports games. assloads of puzzle games. www.pocketgamer.org is a good place to browse.\r\n\r\ni have a special place that gets games at really good discount prices  8-) pm me and ill give ya the skinny.\r\n\r\ni use my ppc for other stuff besides games even!! its an excellent notepad for jotting down info real quick, calculator, mp3s of course, several drawring programs. heck i even make music on it. \r\n\r\nhearts and spades?');
