INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12764, '8e91418438', '', 'Well I finally found my Homie hook up. Here\'s the funny part, I was in RS buying Zip Zap, and they had a bunch of Homies hanging around that new 1/43rd scale Vette they have, and I asked them where they got them. Just thought it was funny that the guy was hooking me up with micro RCs and Homies at the same time. For a minute he was my new best friend.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I\'ve got 2 machines to hit, and they\'re both series 6, and one of the place also has the clowns. I\'ve got a few, but I ket getting chicks, so I sterted getting some clowns. I only had a few bucks, have to go back when I have more money. I want that guy pushing the ice cream cart. Those guys are a dime a dozen around here, so I just though that was funny. \r\n\r\nWhich reminds me, I\'ve been meaning to ask Payaso, did you take your user name from the ice bars those guys sell, or is that just a coincidence, that they sell Payaso brand?');
