INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12822, 'b149b1fce5', '', 'Well I guess I\'m not going to make it to that series 6 machine this weekend, because I spent my extra change tonight. \r\n\r\nWe went to this all you can eat pizza place, it\'s right down the road, we been meaning to go there for 4 years, and we just finally got around to it. They had a machine that said it had Homie bobble heads, but inside was a mixture of cheap non-homie keychains, series 4, 5, the Clowns, and Mijos. Since I\'m starting out I figured it was a good machine to get a variety from. I got a cheap keychain my first try, but I got some others that are kinda cool. I dig the skater Mijo, but not so much that I wanted 2. ;) My wife\'s has already taken the little baby from me, and I got a couple mourners, and a preacher, so I can have a bit funeral.\r\n\r\nI also got a tip fom a 8-y.o. girl  :lol: that there\'s more Homies at the skating rink. Then on the way home I saw series 4 in the door of the all you can eat Chinese food place. It\'s funny, because a month ago I thought there wasn\'t any homies around here, now I\'ve got them all scoped out.\r\n\r\nI probably get some of the series 6 ones next pay day. My wife got me couple, but she lost them somewhere.\r\n\r\nHere\'s the one\'s I got tonight:\r\n[img:b149b1fce5]http://erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/01.jpg[/img:b149b1fce5]');
