INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (12903, '5347276926', '', 'I was a bit (pun intended) bummed out by the fact that we were supposed to post two pictures of our cars. If you\'ve pimped your Bit with a lot of detail, there\'s just no way to show off all you\'ve done in two pics. This is especially true if you’ve been playing with LED mods. Pictures in the dark aren’t good for much other than proving your skills with the lights. Blowing half of your allotted pictures on a single mod is a big bummer. A two pic limit almost makes the photographer’s skill level just as important as the pimps skill with modding his ride. \r\n\r\nHog – A movie? Wouldn’t that have been against the rules? It would have also given definite advantage to the people with enough cash to afford to flick their bit. \r\n\r\nNot that I’m bitchin’. The contest rocked. I’m just tossin’ in a little input for the next contest.');
