INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13087, '66bd6045a0', '', 'hey pie, yeah the single AA isn\'t gonna cut it... you definetly need the juice of  of 2 AA batts. \r\ni don\'t know if you feel comfortable soldering but ph2t did a small tut. on swapping out the 45 sec. capacitor for a 90 sec. capacitor.\r\n\r\nhere\'s the link;\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=539&amp;highlight=90+sec+capacitor\r\n\r\nyou sportin\' a tomy or a clone? i\'m not sure if it makes a difference, but i\'m sure that ph2t can clarify it.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13088, '1accf59fdb', '', '[quote:1accf59fdb="hogjowlz"]i just painted a tjet body and put it on my zz. still gota iron out a few issues. how did you get the shell to attach to the body?[/quote:1accf59fdb]\r\n\r\nThe thing is so tight on the sides that it just stays in place. In fact, the body also holds the motor spring tab down. I had to remove both front and back tabs to get the damn thing to fit at all.\r\n\r\nHow does everything line up on the Zip?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13089, '057b3b998e', '', 'koo koo.. 2 AA\'s.. heh, 40 for 10 bucks canadian, i can spare a couple..\r\n\r\nim kinda gettin the hang of soldering... but the thing is, i dont knwo where to find that little.. timer thingy.  or... whatever, the black... thing.  yeah.  \r\ni\'ve been charging off a clone controller, but i think ima chop one of my tomy chargers for this.  \r\n\r\ni only have Bits ... no ms, no zz, no clones..  :smile:  i kinda want a zz tho.. just to see.  ohhh, and there\'s one little issue.. i found that charging with higher voltage charges faster, (makes the battery hot faster), but seems to have a shorter runtime.  is this actually true?  thanks kwibb \r\n:comfort:\r\n\r\n*whoops, just one more question.. is soldering batteries safe? like those AA batteries.. i kinda wanna solder them, cuz taping wires sux.  are they gonna blow up...?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13090, '9dcf1308b2', '', 'Thanx Payaso,\r\n\r\nAs I\'ve been spreading da word on the many other pages out there, \r\n[b:9dcf1308b2]the happnins dis summa will be in Da Hood !![/b:9dcf1308b2]  \r\nAnd It Will, I\'ll see to dat!  I am [i:9dcf1308b2]Da BitPimp Enforcer[/i:9dcf1308b2]\r\n\r\nWhen I first signed to this page there was very lil traffic, \r\nI would hit the site every once in a while.  But look at it today? \r\nMan I see so many new Pimps in Da Hood now, it\'s a playa\'s paradise. \r\nWe\'ll get a record number of pimps by the end of the summa.\r\nWord Spreads just like a fine babe in love!');
