INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13175, '8eb3a42ab1', '', 'Well I looked at it like this,  The prizes that EX is offering outweighs the 2nd &amp; 3rd place prizes for each catagory so any of the Final prizes would be worth the extra voting and no matter what place they\'re in in the finals, the prizes will be better than 2nd catagory place.  Now offering one of each of the EX prizes for 1st place in the 3 catagories will seem unfair, see what I mean?\r\n\r\n\r\nGloria: \r\n1st - Goes to the finals \r\n2nd - Perfection 3.8 (I\'ll donate) \r\n3rd - undetermined motor \r\n\r\nSkyline \r\n1st - Goes to the finals \r\n2nd - Perfection 3.8 (I\'ll donate) \r\n3rd - undetermined motor \r\n\r\nS2K: \r\n1st - Goes to the finals \r\n2nd - Perfection 3.8 (I\'ll donate) \r\n3rd - undetermined motor \r\n\r\nFinals: \r\n1st - 1 of every EX motor \r\n2nd - 1-MIT-02 \r\n3rd - 1-MIT-01 \r\n\r\nWho would get the 1 of every EX motor, who would get the MIT-02, who would get the MIT-01?  See what I mean?  And you know if you give the 1ofEm to the 1st place Gloria and not the 1st place S2K or Skyline there\'s gonna be rebuttals!  [i:8eb3a42ab1]"How did you guys decide who got what prize[/i:8eb3a42ab1]"? etc. Actually if you look at it, no one loses in the finals. The way I idealized it is the only solution to be fair about all the prizes if you want to keep all 3 of the catagories.  If your\'e gonna offer only the EX prizes then there can only be 1 open catagory.  I really like the 3 catagory contest and when suggested you hadda know it would be real difficult to format something this big! It will be the first of it\'s kind that I know of in Bit History!  And the BitPimps can pull it off cause we badd like dat!\r\nI know that there are still reservations out there but there aren\'t many ways to go about this given the situation.  Now if anyone has a better solution let\'s here it now cause if we\'re gonna announce it this week we better get the leg work done.  Times a waistin Pimps!\r\n\r\nOh, Kwik &amp; Cabo, thanx for the props on da S2K\'s. I tape \'em at work, and paint \'em at home.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13176, 'bb37640a5c', '', 'you\'re right, there\'s a flip-flop there we can\'t really avoid.\r\nI guess it really is better to let all 3 first place winners go to "another round" of voting for the EM products.\r\n\r\nthanks too DT for offering up all this booty!\r\nthe entire contest is now sponsored by EM and you! lol\r\n\r\nthanks pimp :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13177, '0643cab248', '', 'Well here\'s the scenario, if infact there were a grand prize that the 1st place winners were winning for being re-judged, where there is only one winner, then this structure would work out. Since thats not the case and the 1st palce winners of each catagory are only being recognized for a final contest,  it\'s like mixing 2 different contest but not finishing the first one. You guys see what i\'m saying? \r\n\r\nIf I were one of the 1st place winners, i\'d be like "ok i just won 1st place, sweet... but now i\'m going up against 2 others outside of my catagory to win 1st, 2nd or 3rd place and then get a prize?! WTF I barely got a chance to enjoy being in 1st place!"\r\nI\'m pretty sure that\'s how i\'d feel anyway, the current structure just doesn\'t seem to fit together unless the the 1st place winners in each catagory recieve more recognition then being placed into a final pool. Now i\'m not saying we should expand the contest even more to adapt to this structure, i just feel that we should limit it to 1st, 2nd and 3rd place winners in each a catagory. That way everything is evenly balanced and fair across the board.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and you can forward all of your comments and concerns to hogjowls@lixlink.com  ^_^');
