INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39934, '397265b217', '', 'good point cd! the short answer is suspension makes it go more gooder!  :smile:  in the process of adding suspension i lengthen the wheelbase so it\'s more like a zz length. this plus a little widening increases stability. steel springs are my choice for suspension as they are more responsive to small high frequency bumps.  damping is pretty much handled by friction. the plastic hinge allows a little twisting of the rear end resulting in independant rear suspension. hinges seem to wear out and deform in the end from the forces of acceleration with the plastic i\'m using, but they\'re easily fabricated and replaced. as a result the suspension does an admiral job considering how primitive the design is. so concrete is no challenge at all and hardpack dirt is well within it\'s abilities. even crazy terrains like the bluestone gutter on the street are soaked up efficiently. and jumping is greatly enhanced with much smoother landings.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13185, '09273c85c4', '', 'Understand your concerns Kwik, in a nut shell.....\r\n [b:09273c85c4]if infact there were a grand prize [/b:09273c85c4]\r\nThere isn\'t one unless someone\'s going to donate one.\r\n\r\n[b:09273c85c4]it\'s like mixing 2 different contest but not finishing the first one[/b:09273c85c4]\r\nI don\'t follow you?  We\'re actually mixing 3 contests and having the top in each class move on to the Finals where there are 3 prizes. Everybody wins a prize, it\'s not like they get to the finals and there\'s only one prize to win. \r\n\r\n[b:09273c85c4]I\'m pretty sure that\'s how i\'d feel anyway, the current structure just doesn\'t seem to fit together unless the the 1st place winners in each catagory recieve more recognition then being placed into a final pool.[/b:09273c85c4]\r\nI think winning prizes weighs more to the population than recognition.  Not all but most.  If we had a contest that offered bragging rights as opposed to prizes????\r\nSpeakin for myself, I\'d be proud to be the best in my class and make it to the finals! The same way as if I were an NFL player/coach, an NBA player/coach, or a NBL/ABL player/coach. Getting to the playoffs is just one step close to the Super Bowl, NBA Finals, The World Series !!!!!\r\n[i:09273c85c4]Sorry about that Pimps, lemme get off my soapbox......[/i:09273c85c4]\r\nBut you get my point.\r\n\r\n[b:09273c85c4]i just feel that we should limit it to 1st, 2nd and 3rd place winners in each a catagory. [/b:09273c85c4]\r\nIf the EX prizes will be offered, how do you determine who gets what?\r\nIf not then that would be cool, then we need to decide on a first place prize for each catagory. We could hold the EX offer for another contest or not.\r\n\r\nBottom line is Kwik, take your time and give another contest proposal and let\'s put it to a vote. I\'m not trying to be difficult by no means but let\'s just get it done Pimps!');
