INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13188, 'aa6313ea79', '', '[quote:aa6313ea79="CaboWabo"]lol - I sent my flaming comments.\r\n\r\nI see what you\'re saying kwik, I\'m not sure how to handle this.\r\nI can see both yours and DT\'s points.\r\n\r\nI see what you\'re say - the first place winners, if they happen to get 2nd or 3rd in the "final round" they might feel like 1st place was taken from them.\r\n\r\nI was hoping that would be the case as they are in a "final round" but not loosing first place, just in the running for the "Grand Prize".\r\nall 2nds and 3rds in each category just get 1 motor. Not a really big deal - but worth winning. Each 1st place winner has the opportunity to win and win big by being in the drawing for the main prizes.[/quote:aa6313ea79]\r\n\r\nMy point exactly Cabo, each Final prize is worth getting there.  And the Booty is worth a final voting. The 2nd &amp; 3rd place winners in the finals gets 3 motors, 2 batts, Cat5 antennas + tubes for storage now that beats a single motor prize any day!  And the Extreme Motors are the shit too.');
