INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13282, '09edf9837b', '', 'Yeah I had trouble as well.  The front flame job is crap, I was just trying a few methods.   At the moment I cut out the flames onto paper and then trace them onto tape.   I don\'t have a printer at home so that\'s my method.   The problem with that is with every re-trace, the error increases.  Oh well, gettin\' there.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13283, '835a7bc7c0', '', 'No Fuckin wonder I never received a response!\r\n\r\nRCMod is trying to get Rep by hanging onto our jocks and donating no doubt.  We are the baddest mutha fuckas out here and they recognize dat shit now.  I remember a few months ago reading on another webpage where they had links and descriptions. They described BitPimps as the ghetto of the Bit World.  Dem Mutha Fuckas know better now.  Shit man we gonna have all da juice up here in Pimp City no doubt.  It only takes 1 big thing to get noticed and the last contest was it!  We appeal to the majority, the red,white, blue, yellow &amp; black collar workers, the preps, possers, and geeks cause they all wanna be Pimps ! Now our next contest is gonna blow Da Lid off Da Bit world !\r\nWe\'ll rule Da World...  Muuhahahahah! [i:835a7bc7c0](thunder crashing, lightning flashing)[/i:835a7bc7c0]\r\n\r\nBut serious, let\'s put RCMod on the back burner, play \'em cause that\'s what we do!  We\'ll figure out how to use \'em.  Just leave \'em to Da Enforcer.  Now I got my sights on MRC, dem fuckas dis me everytime I spread Da Word in their page, that goddamn MysticNight kills my posts.  I\'ll recruit some of their members to Da Hood then they\'ll be jockin us too.\r\nWe already got Todd!  He\'s from MRC ????');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13285, 'bbfeeb36c0', '', 'I\'m about to sit down and try the rear axel and I got an idea for the nub. Those that got the rims\'ll understand better. What if the lil disk part of the rim (which would be the rear of the wheel) was put in backwards. :???: \r\nThe lil protrusion in the disk just might work as a nub. I\'ll explain better and put up some pics after I try it.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13286, '776ef52188', '', 'you got that right DT!\r\nI love how when we first started, no other sites would give us the time of day, now I\'m constantly getting cheese offers from the cheese sites.\r\n\r\nfuck em - they\'ve put themselves in their position.\r\nI\'m with DT, we don\'t need to do shit but our own thang, cuz that\'s what made this place and that\'s what set it off, and will continue to do so, while they do their thing, and continue to create their own demise! (insert evil laughter) lol\r\n\r\nyup, I stopped posting all together over at MRC, they killed a lot of my posts without saying shit to me. unless you suck Mystik\'s balls, you aint getting shit and you\'re getting treated like nothing.\r\n\r\nTodd (EM) is from MRC, Gfunk, Chewysk8er911, ThugMizz, and a few others are from MRC.\r\nI think the latest newbies are from RCMod.\r\n\r\n\r\nedit: now that I think about it - I don\'t really post anywhere but here anymore. Once in a while I\'ll make a post over at Tiny or Ausmicro, but even that has dropped off. Seems like the other sites are just slowly dying off, and increasing in non-sense posts.');
