INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13291, 'e26125af01', '', 'Ok here\'s my bottom line, if the rest of you feel that contest is fine as it is then thats fine with me... it seems to me that,  after what i had taken as agreement, the direction has changed to an even larger scale... let me reiterate;\r\n[quote:e26125af01="CaboWabo"]noway man, I\'m right there with ya.\r\nI\'m totally concerned about all that you mentioned, this contest is too big - but like I said, I just updated the post to reflect as many of everyone\'s suggestions that I could.\r\n\r\nI\'m still open to however you guys wanna do it, I just wanna get the details ironed out so we don\'t get caught with our pants down so to speak.\r\n\r\nI\'m with kwik, we need to tame this one down.\r\nsave our booty so we can keep having contests, I personally think close together is fine, but I\'m easy on that too - so however.\r\n\r\nI can say this, whatever we do for the next contest, we have to let extrememicros supply the prizes mentioned above, he\'s already got his post made on his site and blah blah blah lol\r\n\r\nwe can still run a minor trivia deal too while the major contest is going - it\'s all up to us, we just gotta discuss it so we can get it all planned.\r\n\r\n*turning off tony robbins tapes*\r\n\r\nman, that all sounded really dumb and like work, but I don\'t know how else to communicate it without being half-assed and falling off the map.\r\n\r\nC-diddy[/quote:e26125af01]\r\nand then following:\r\n[quote:e26125af01="DarkTari"]Yeah Man, That\'s too big even for me, and I know Big! Like Kwik said, it should be 1 winner from each class, but the delima would be the prizes ?\r\n\r\nIf we\'re to do that then the prizes should be of equal value. I like the idea but we have a lot to settle with being fair across the board. Lemme think a lil more on this one.[/quote:e26125af01]\r\n\r\nSo i\'m tired of going back and forth about this nonsense, so if this how bussiness is going to run...\r\n[quote:e26125af01="DarkTari"]Bottom line is Kwik, take your time and give another contest proposal[/quote:e26125af01]\r\nin this fashion then i\'ll leave it to you guys.');
