INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13305, '91d30e09d8', '', '[quote:91d30e09d8="CaboWabo"]alight.\r\nI\'m gonna go ahead and make an executive decision here.\r\nBefore all of this talk - we had made a deal with extrememicros.com - it\'s time to pay up on our end.\r\n\r\nSo here\'s what\'s happening for this contest:\r\n[b:91d30e09d8]Title:[/b:91d30e09d8] Twisted Plastic In Da BitPimps Hood\r\n[b:91d30e09d8]Start Date:[/b:91d30e09d8] Tuesday, June 24th 2003\r\n[b:91d30e09d8]End Date:[/b:91d30e09d8] Thursday, July 31st 2003 @ 5:00 PM (CST)\r\n[b:91d30e09d8]Cars On The Lot:[/b:91d30e09d8]\r\n- S-2000\r\n- Gloria\r\n- Skyline (all models)\r\n[b:91d30e09d8]Judging Criteria:[/b:91d30e09d8]\r\n- mod content\r\n- paint job\r\n- functionality\r\n- sex appeal\r\n- pimp-tude\r\n[b:91d30e09d8]Prizes:[/b:91d30e09d8]\r\n1st place - 1 each of every motor EM offers\r\n2nd place - 1 "Insane" mod in a tube from EM\r\n3rd place - 1 "Sane" mod in a tube from EM\r\n[b:91d30e09d8]Rules:[/b:91d30e09d8]\r\n- micro r/c\'s only (bit char-g, microsizers, zipzaps, clones)\r\n- 1 entry, per user, per category\r\n(ie you can enter 1 S2k, 1 Gloria, and 1 Skyline)\r\n- must have your username and "bitPimps" on a piece of paper in at least 1 picture of your entry\r\n- you can post as many photos of your entry as you feel necessary.\r\n- only registered users may enter.\r\nbitPimps admins and moderators not eligable\r\n\r\n\r\nnow that we have this contest going.\r\nthis should give us some breathing room and we can continue to discuss our next contest.\r\nso I\'m going to lock this thread up - it\'s done - feel free to start a new thread making suggestions for our next contest.[/quote:91d30e09d8]\r\n\r\nHey Pimps!  I\'m Down!  Now let\'s get this party started right!\r\n\r\nKwikbB, didn\'t mean any offense brotha, we were slappin ideas around to get this contest krankin.  My apologies if I offended you in any way.  I still got yo back Pimp!  Now let\'s discuss the trivia contest..........');
