INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13418, '219c32e785', 'Havok\'s Shaggin\' Wagon  A.K.A. The Decal Test', '[color=green:219c32e785][b:219c32e785]MS Sport chassis\r\nNakamichi rims\r\nPullback tires\r\nPhatties on da front\r\nLow profiles on da back :grin:\r\n1/4AAA 150mah\r\nPerfection 4.2 King\r\nCustom paint\r\nMy man CaboWabo\'s Bitpimpin Decals\r\n[/b:219c32e785][/color:219c32e785]\r\n[img:219c32e785]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2242190/28015302.jpg[/img:219c32e785]\r\n[color=green:219c32e785][b:219c32e785]The slots on front and back are hand made with a  dremel and hobby knife[/b:219c32e785][/color:219c32e785]\r\n[img:219c32e785]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2242190/28022731.jpg[/img:219c32e785]\r\n\r\n[img:219c32e785]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2242190/28015296.jpg[/img:219c32e785]\r\n[color=green:219c32e785][b:219c32e785]Wheel wells shaved..etc..[/b:219c32e785][/color:219c32e785]\r\n[img:219c32e785]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2242190/28022794.jpg[/img:219c32e785]\r\n[color=green:219c32e785][b:219c32e785]I had to modify the chica on da side...her bikini didn\'t show so I hand painted it after application but before clearcoat[/b:219c32e785][/color:219c32e785]\r\n\r\n\r\n[img:219c32e785]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2242190/28023307.jpg[/img:219c32e785]\r\n\r\n[color=green:219c32e785][b:219c32e785]Peep the controller[/b:219c32e785][/color:219c32e785]\r\n\r\n[img:219c32e785]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2242190/28038944.jpg[/img:219c32e785]\r\n\r\n[color=green:219c32e785][b:219c32e785]She likes to flip on hard turns....but she ain\'t made to be fast....I drives her slow and easy...You got dat right...\r\n\r\nMy 2 favorite things are GREEN...Cash Money and.... 8-)[/b:219c32e785][/color:219c32e785]\r\n\r\n[color=green:219c32e785][b:219c32e785]So what do you think? Do you like the GREEN?[/b:219c32e785][/color:219c32e785] :cool:');
