INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13535, 'dbe66610dc', '', 'I\'ve got an idea for the trivia contests in general, let me know what you guys think.\r\n\r\nsince they are smaller and we all have cool ideas for them.\r\nwhy don\'t we just post up our idea for the trivia in this thread, and if we all think its cool - then we\'ll have Chedder make the post.\r\nmy idea is this.\r\nif you come up with the idea and supply the prize and we all agree, then I see no reason why not to run it. as far as trivia goes that is.\r\nif you\'d prefer that Chedder didn\'t make the post and you want to, we can discuss how we can handle that, so basically its cool too.\r\n\r\nanyways, share your thoughts');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13536, '928047b8c7', '', 'Wassup pimps n biznatchez!\r\n\r\nIm new in da hood. \r\n :-) \r\nSummer is here, so i might have time to pull one ride out n floss it up. I checked out some of the galleries. Where ya\'ll get those sick ass rims from?\r\n\r\nnvm, i read and got the answers. \r\n(edit out)I gotta ? If i take one of my skylines outta da lot and put it over a fire, and it dont look like a skyline no\' mo, can i enter dis?\r\nAnd whens this gig s\'posed to be over?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13537, '3619b46a32', '', 'I threw this together just so I could get this kicked off. We haven\'t much time. ;)\r\n\r\nSo here\'s my Skyline entry. I figured with the car choices there wouldn\'y many, if any hot rods, so I went my GT-2000 body, just to be different. It was hacked so I had to go over it with super glue to fill the dremel scars.\r\n\r\nHere\'s the details\r\n- $5 Thunder Charger chassis.\r\n- Dual cell\r\n- Trimmed front body mount on chassis to move body back, and then trimmed out he front wheel well to fit the bit body on the slightly longer chassis.\r\n- Since  I didn\'t mod much, I wanted to get extreme with the flames, so I layed charcoal, and red flames over each other. My first try at this, but I\'m happy, and it\'s only going to get better.;)\r\n\r\nIt don\'t seem like much but it\'s fast. So I like it.\r\n\r\n[img:3619b46a32]http://www.erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/entry3.jpg[/img:3619b46a32]\r\n[img:3619b46a32]http://www.erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/entry1.jpg[/img:3619b46a32]\r\n[img:3619b46a32]http://www.erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/entry2.jpg[/img:3619b46a32]');
