INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13597, '0fe4e6b1e6', '', '[quote:0fe4e6b1e6="Pie"]whoa... darktari, you look like you could kick some serious ass...\r\n\r\nit\'s kinda hard to imagine you playin with bits, lookin like that.\r\n\r\nwho else wants to see a pic of him playin with bits?!  :smile:[/quote:0fe4e6b1e6]\r\n\r\n\r\nWell Pie, I\'m from the ol\' school.  Back in the day I used to run HO\'s (scale not women) up until I got my first real car.  I still have all my HO cars and track in the attic, refuse to givem up.  So when the Micro R/C\'s hit, I got my son one and saw how fun they were, I was hooked again.  Old hobbies never die, they just fester!  Most of us on this board are grown, some older than others from different backgrounds but we all got this in common.\r\n\r\nNever Judge A Book By It\'s Cover! \r\n\r\nDid you get a gander at Havoc?  Now that\'s one mean lookin mutha! \r\n\r\nBut It All Good In Da Hood\r\n\r\nPeace Out.......');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13598, 'c55c32e234', 'Tuitorial Mod Contest.......', 'Crazy Dave might go Crazy when it\'s announced, cause the body painting tuit, he did a damn good job.  So my first suggestion of topic is[b:c55c32e234] Speed[/b:c55c32e234].  Now we\'ll get a lot of dual, triple, batt mods which is pretty common these days but I\'m hoping we get a thorough Mosfet Tuit, like I said the page can use one.  We want step by step with Pics.\r\nWe\'ll work out the details later.  Who\'s in?   For this contest I have a Rotory Tool Set (Dremel) for the winner.  Let\'s put this one to bed early Pimps......');
