INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13610, '6707ae7302', '', 'I want in on this project. Nox, how can I get my hands on your \'bitspeedracer\' ?\r\n\r\nusing the mouse guts was my initial hope for making an RPM motor tester, but I never could find anything (software wise) that seemed anygood.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13611, 'bb2a6e66ff', '', 'S2000 GAV was a body I got in a parts buy. I just decided to see what I could do to it.\r\n\r\nFirst I lowered it.\r\nThen I made it a targa top.\r\nThen oh well lets get rid of more of the top, roll bar.\r\nThen side skirts.\r\nThen filled in rear bumper.\r\nThen Front spoiler.\r\nThen the wing, I little larger than I intended but I made it work.\r\nToo much sanding.\r\nThen the exhaust Pipes.\r\nMounted it on a chassis and it looked like it needed motor, but 8 pipes in the front would be too much so settled on 6.\r\nThen I tried to mount it on a chassis, OH CRUD, Doesn\'t fit.\r\nModified Chassis with spring susspension and cutting front so it would mount.\r\nThen I painted and detailed it.\r\n\r\nAnd I don\'t really like S2000\'s to begin with. But I now have this one and another I posted in RCmod\'s Gallery. [url]http://www.rcmod.com/forums/msgs.cfm?msg=5693&amp;forum=10[/url]\r\n\r\nA third that I totally chopped the top off and is waiting to be painted. It was going to be a T top but after I cut my thumb I got so angry I chopped it all off.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13612, '2b82045826', '', '[quote:2b82045826="crazydave"][quote:2b82045826="BilboBaggins"]Had to try something drastic to beat one of your cars.[/quote:2b82045826]\r\nThat\'s exactly what I\'m saying about yours. I like how you left the bar on the roof of the S2000. That\'s exactly what I planned to do to a RX-7, but it never occurred to me that I could have done it to the S2000. Now I have to come up with something else, \'cause you beat me to it, and I want to try to be clever. I would have dropped topped the Skyline I entered, but I was in a rush to be the first entry, and it\'s too late now, since I like the paint.\r\n\r\n :???: Hmmmm, now what am I going to do...(dave\'s thinking hard)[/quote:2b82045826]\r\n\r\nI know what you mean Dave. I thought of a Targa Skyline &amp; Gloria myself and after seeing yours, it was like seeing the idea come to life.  I do have a backup plan though.......');
