INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13799, '1d48369fd4', '', '[quote:1d48369fd4="cj"][quote:1d48369fd4="DarkTari"]\r\nIf you examine them closely, there are a lot of 1 piece wheels...\r\nWT33, WT34, WT25, WT41?, WT28, WT37, WT69, WM02, etc[/quote:1d48369fd4]\r\n\r\nMy WT46 and WT56 were both one piece and the insert for the WT56 was gold not silver like in their picture.\r\n[img:1d48369fd4]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2102813/28114142.jpg[/img:1d48369fd4][img:1d48369fd4]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2102813/28114403.jpg[/img:1d48369fd4][/quote:1d48369fd4]\r\n[b:1d48369fd4]Nox, I think those are 2 piece, you\'re showing a separate basket (gold).  [/b:1d48369fd4]\r\n\r\nWhen I say 1 piece, I mean [b:1d48369fd4]1 solid piece[/b:1d48369fd4]...\r\n [img:1d48369fd4]http://www.scala43.com/scala43/rad/rad-fotosk/rad-wm01.jpg[/img:1d48369fd4][img:1d48369fd4]http://www.scala43.com/scala43/rad/rad-fotosk/rad-wt33.jpg[/img:1d48369fd4][img:1d48369fd4]http://www.scala43.com/scala43/rad/rad-fotosk/rad-wt25.jpg[/img:1d48369fd4]\r\n\r\nThese are going to be tricky cause I gotta drill \'em, not like doing the plastic bit wheels, I do those by hand and it\'s easier to center. As you can see, the [b:1d48369fd4]WM01[/b:1d48369fd4] has no hole while the others do!!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13801, '335271e09f', 'Super Bit Char-G series now available!', 'That\'s right all you pimps and pimpettes, www.hlj.com has a couple sets and PB (pullbacks) available. Just hooked myself up with a couple these, BTW these are supposed to be the Super Bit Char-G sets! RE-designed controller and MAYBE something new under the hood, no freqs are givin either... i love surprises... mostly lol\r\n\r\nWill do a review when these mofos are in my possesion 8-) \r\n\r\n-word');
