INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13892, 'f493994213', '', '[quote:f493994213="CaboWabo"]nox, same here - if there\'s something I can send ya, let me know.\r\n\r\nas for midget, I haven\'t read the post yet, will do now. but yea charge whatever you want, you\'re printing them.\r\nI always thought that if I sold "bitPimps" stuff, I\'d put the cash right back in to the site via prizes, server enhancements, domain renewals, etc.\r\nbut that\'s me.[/quote:f493994213]\r\n\r\n\r\nya bastard.... just kidding..\r\n\r\nI agree, we could even have a treasurer and a check book.\r\n\r\nI would just want to recoup my cost of doing the business first.\r\n(ie... I think it was $18.99 for 20 sheets and then for S/H the bill came to ~25.)\r\nSo, a buck a sheet is what it\'s costing me for the paper.\r\nInk and time and some paper waste, haven\'t completely filled a sheet, yet i\'ve chu\'d up 4 or 5.   (no biggie, don\'t get me wrong).\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI don\'t know.  I feel like I\'m babling .....');
