INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13897, 'ae0897047c', '', 'don\'t get me wrong, I\'m not telling you where to put this particular ventures monies - believe me, I know about trying to re-coup costs. I\'m still trying to get the site to pay for itself and not out of my pocket. I know for a fact I\'ve spent way more (in the hundreds of dollars) to get everything up and running and keep it that way.\r\n(this includes hosting, domain registration, etc. - but not coding and designing that I did all myself and would normally be charging $125.00/hour for, like at my current job)\r\n\r\nI want to make a general announcement, just to make myself feel better - it\'s not directed at anyone, but a general annoucement:\r\n\r\nnobody is welcomed to use the "bitPimps" name on a product or promotion to help make themselves a profit or any other monies.\r\n\r\nso, if you guys see anyone using our name to help promote their own ventures, let me know please.\r\n\r\n[b:ae0897047c]again, nox you\'re absolutely welcomed to re-coop your expenses on this round.[/b:ae0897047c]\r\n\r\nhowever, after you re-coop your expenses or whatever, I would appreciate it if you stopped printing out "bitPimps" decals and selling them at least until we work out how $$$ and using "bitPimps" is worked out.');
