INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13901, '5f775f80bf', '', 'that\'s exactly what I\'m trying to avoid. lol\r\n\r\nwe never have sold anything for this reason and others.\r\nmy stance is this: if you don\'t want to spend the money on it, then don\'t - nobodies asking you to.\r\n\r\nI know that sounds harsh, but it\'s not meant that way, merely just another statement.\r\n\r\nthis is gonna create a huge ball of wax, we don\'t need to deal with that - so the rule is - we sell nothing for now.\r\n\r\n[i:5f775f80bf]edit:[/i:5f775f80bf] what you guys sell on the side (not using the "bitPimps" name, logo, brand, etc.) is your own business.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13902, '7f1e3e2de5', '', '[quote:7f1e3e2de5="CaboWabo"]don\'t get me wrong, I\'m not telling you where to put this particular ventures monies - believe me, I know about trying to re-coup costs. I\'m still trying to get the site to pay for itself and not out of my pocket. I know for a fact I\'ve spent way more (in the hundreds of dollars) to get everything up and running and keep it that way.\r\n(this includes hosting, domain registration, etc. - but not coding and designing that I did all myself and would normally be charging $125.00/hour for, like at my current job)\r\n\r\nI want to make a general announcement, just to make myself feel better - it\'s not directed at anyone, but a general annoucement:\r\n\r\nnobody is welcomed to use the "bitPimps" name on a product or promotion to help make themselves a profit or any other monies.\r\n\r\nso, if you guys see anyone using our name to help promote their own ventures, let me know please.\r\n\r\n[b:7f1e3e2de5]again, nox you\'re absolutely welcomed to re-coop your expenses on this round.[/b:7f1e3e2de5]\r\n\r\nhowever, after you re-coop your expenses or whatever, I would appreciate it if you stopped printing out "bitPimps" decals and selling them at least until we work out how $$$ and using "bitPimps" is worked out.[/quote:7f1e3e2de5]\r\n\r\nI understand...no problem...\r\n\r\nIn fact that give me ideas...\r\nwe can make two grades of decals for sale on the site.\r\none\'s with the bitpimps and ones without.\r\n\r\nWith will be the primium cost.  If they want to have the logo, they have to pay for it.\r\n\r\nYo, man, I understand trademarks, i\'ve battled a couple with my personal corp.  \r\nRemember Beanie Babies...well, I won\'t go into it...but TY was after me. (as with others).\r\n\r\nSo, I\'ll sign up to be an OFFICIAL printer for you.  I will only print QTY that you ORDER. If you accept my offer.\r\n\r\nIf you want me to send you stock, and as orders come in... \r\nyou mail them out and retain the cash. that way it\'s in your control.\r\n\r\n-nox\r\n\r\nps. I\'m sure you ARE the most in debt in regards to this site.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13903, '5615b419d4', '', 'aiaite. but when you have a buncha shells all painted and ready to go with bitpimps logos ill buy em off you(at a fair price) and sell the whole thang.\r\n\r\nthe first thing that has to happen is you gota agree to this. the second would be me getting the money. \r\n\r\nthe rest o you painter freaks this is to you as well. of course id like to use the bitpimps name(which would be an auto cut in cabo\'s pocket). i bet these cars would fetch some $$. then again it could lead to the demise of the bitpimps so whichever. \r\n\r\njust some idears.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (13904, 'b43eec7ef5', '', 'I really feel like an ass for having to say all that but we really just aren\'t ready to deal with money yet ya know? too many issues and blah blah blah lol\r\n\r\nI\'m so glad you guys are understanding of that.\r\n\r\nand nox, I want to make sure you know that really was not directed at you - I seriously just wanted to make a broad and general statement since the situation arose.\r\n\r\nI\'m glad it arose here and not in the public forums. It\'s always better when the ring leaders (us) are all on the same page, less confusion for us and our members.\r\n\r\nhere\'s a dumb side note kind of pertaining to hog\'s offer. (which I like, and we can try to figure out someday)\r\nI\'ve gotten 6 offers so far from 6 different users to build and paint them a truck. I\'ve turned them all down. I\'m scared to do something for them and have a kid look at a molding imperfection from the factory and try to blame me. not to mention the fact that it\'s hard to let go of a good custom painted body.\r\nmaybe one day when the "painters" have a bunch of bodies they\'re willing to hop off of, and all the "modders" have a bunch of chassis they\'re willing to hop off of, we\'ll meet in the middle and setup shop.\r\n\r\nwe just gotta take our time and make sure we do it right and everyone\'s happy, yada yada yada.\r\n\r\nman I\'m glad we have the team we do.');
