INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (14037, '13a83350b3', '', 'aiight folks.... although I said I would hold back, I\'ll enter once..... my entry fo the skyline category...\r\n\r\nnissan skyline r32\r\nwith 3 individually applied pinstripes, modded around nissan symbols and taillights\r\nre-routed antenna\r\norange undersides\r\nZZ 2F2F lancer Evolution rims\r\nZZ 100 mAh batt\r\nCustom painted PCB cover and heatsink, same as in [url=http://www.rcpics.net/media/DCP_1470.jpg]this[/url] pic and [url=http://www.rcpics.net/media/DCP_1471.jpg]this[/url] pic\r\nEM Vanquish Rotor\r\nLowered via replacing front tab with another MS front tab lower on chassis\r\nEhxaust custom fitted, dremelled chassis to fit\r\nBlackened out windows\r\n\r\nI think I hit everything.... it\'s a mouthful, but here she be\'s!\r\n\r\nwit da homies!\r\n[img:13a83350b3]http://www.rcpics.net/media/DCP_1492.jpg[/img:13a83350b3]\r\n\r\nda bootey lol wit da exhaust and pinstriping not covering up symbols or lights..\r\n[img:13a83350b3]http://www.rcpics.net/media/DCP_1499.jpg[/img:13a83350b3]\r\n\r\nfor some reason, in this pic, the pintriping in front looks like it\'s uneven...which it\'s not... hrmmm :???:  oh yeah, and it\'s got a nick in the antenna, but it still reaches just as far, it juss looks kinda bad lol\r\n[img:13a83350b3]http://www.rcpics.net/media/DCP_1502.jpg[/img:13a83350b3]\r\n\r\na terrible pic of the orange neons.... they\'re a lot brighter than this...I even had to prop the car up so they would show up on the camera... POS cam!\r\n[img:13a83350b3]http://www.rcpics.net/media/DCP_1518.jpg[/img:13a83350b3]\r\n\r\nhere is what the light setup looks like... I used double sided tape and aluminum foil to spread the light around!  :) \r\n[img:13a83350b3]http://www.rcpics.net/media/DCP_1509.jpg[/img:13a83350b3]\r\n\r\nand in case you were wondering, here is the switch... it\'s totally nifty!\r\n\r\nOFF\r\n[img:13a83350b3]http://www.rcpics.net/media/DCP_1513.jpg[/img:13a83350b3]\r\n\r\nON\r\n[img:13a83350b3]http://www.rcpics.net/media/DCP_1514.jpg[/img:13a83350b3]\r\n\r\nwell, it\'s not really the best I could do, but it is pimp enuff to attract some hoes!\r\n[img:13a83350b3]http://www.rcpics.net/media/DCP_1520.jpg[/img:13a83350b3]');
