INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (14347, '5f9fd0ea22', '', '[quote:5f9fd0ea22="DarkTari"][quote:5f9fd0ea22="midget_man1387"]oh ok.... I think I want one of these anyways.... they seem like they\'d be good for the price....[/quote:5f9fd0ea22]\r\n\r\nHell Nah Mang, not when CaveyDave said he saw them last year Xmas being cleared for $12.99 ?????  I\'ll wait it out.......[/quote:5f9fd0ea22]\r\nAt first I thought you typo\'ed my name, but then I remembered my last post in the Mug shots thread, and realized you must\'ve read that. :lol: \r\n\r\nBut yeah here\'s [url=http://tinyrc.com/forums/showthread.php?s=&amp;threadid=8871&amp;highlight=1%2F43+viper]The Thread At TRC[/url] where someone was saying the got theirs for $11.99. I found another thread when looking for this one where people where getting them for $29.99. At any rate I never pay full price for anything (except electric components and Zip Zap stuff) because their strategy has always been charge way too much, then blow it out after Christmas. I realized that one year when my Dad bought my a 100 watt tuner amp for almost $400 bucks, and then I saw it a couple weeks later being blown out for a $100.\r\n\r\nNever understood why my dad loved RS and TRS-80s so much.');
