INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (14394, 'f22e4ba743', 'Must See. new 1/64 car. fast and the furious.', 'Well i was up at walmart today, and i was walking around the toy section to see what crappy motor works they had and something cought my eye. a big NOS bottle\r\n[img:f22e4ba743]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL250/1240314/2351917/28465528.jpg[/img:f22e4ba743]\r\nand i was like cool as i got closer i realized it was a nice looking car.\r\n[img:f22e4ba743]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL250/1240314/2351917/28465841.jpg[/img:f22e4ba743]\r\ni was like this thing is awsome, real 1/64 scale car with full functions and a turbo.\r\n[img:f22e4ba743]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL250/1240314/2351917/28465784.jpg[/img:f22e4ba743]\r\non top is a microsizer pro, in the middle is the new rc car i got "a mitsubishi eclipse", and on the bottem is a diecast 1/64 scale mitsubishi eclipse.\r\n[img:f22e4ba743]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL250/1240314/2351917/28465750.jpg[/img:f22e4ba743]\r\nthe car is a little less tall than a MS, but its a bit longer than one also.\r\n[img:f22e4ba743]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL250/1240314/2351917/28465676.jpg[/img:f22e4ba743]\r\nthis is the whole package, is has a detachable controller which is small. and the charger is inside the NOS bottle.\r\n[img:f22e4ba743]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL250/1240314/2351917/28465652.jpg[/img:f22e4ba743]\r\nthe bottem has a nice little tweeking lever, and fat rear tires and skinny front tires.\r\n[img:f22e4ba743]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL250/1240314/2351917/28465596.jpg[/img:f22e4ba743]\r\nwhen i open it up by removing one screw in the back. i see it has very wierd main board with the batteries in the middle of the board.\r\n[img:f22e4ba743]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL250/1240314/2351917/28465581.jpg[/img:f22e4ba743]\r\nthe chassi fully used up by items within, not much room within. and yes i also got some beef jerky  :-D \r\n[img:f22e4ba743]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL250/1240314/2351917/28465571.jpg[/img:f22e4ba743]\r\nid you look closely it looks like it has two batteries. when i looked at the batteries it looks like they are set up in a series. not peralel, "ps i cant spell.\r\n[img:f22e4ba743]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL250/1240314/2351917/28465542.jpg[/img:f22e4ba743]\r\none thing that sucks is that it has a soldered on motor, but the motor seems pretty fast ill make a review of it later.\r\n[img:f22e4ba743]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL250/1240314/2351917/28465488.jpg[/img:f22e4ba743]\r\none last thing is that the is the most fucking small controller i have ever seen.');
