INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (14461, 'd14a66cc5d', '', 'Making progress pimps.  Making the pcb is the current hurdle.  I\'ve been experimenting with using overlays printed on transparent overhead sheets.   \r\n\r\nLike this:\r\n\r\n[img:d14a66cc5d]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/hbridge/pcb_2.jpg[/img:d14a66cc5d]\r\n\r\nThis overlay is put on top of a uncut piece of copper sheet pcb that has been treated with a resistive coat.  This is wedged between glass to ensure there is no space between the overlay and copper to ensure a sharp transfer.\r\n\r\nThis jig is then exposed under a UV lamp for about 30 minutes...\r\n\r\n[img:d14a66cc5d]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/hbridge/pcb_1.jpg[/img:d14a66cc5d]\r\n\r\nThis changes the chemical composition of the expose resist that makes all the pretty copper tracks appear during etching.\r\n\r\nGot some more pics to upload but I\'ve been having troubles getting this process right!  :x \r\n\r\nmore to come.......\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (14462, '3bbb82fe96', 'BS?', 'OK that sounds way to good to be true! What I don\'t understand is the 1/43 vipers arnt fully propo there like 8 step........ still better than not but what about price?\r\n\r\nAlso why would they stop selling the origonal Zz\'s in USA but start selling them in Canada? I am guessing more profit and as soon as sale\'s drop they will take out the 2.0s in that country, which makes me VERY angry  . I can see a Ebay market were people from USA will want old cars to collect though which isnt a bad thing for me :grin: . \r\n\r\nI dont understand how they have full suspenshion and still use the same bodies......... it just makes no sence. :???:  I smell some BS or some mouth to mouth mix up.  I belive some of it is true but not all of it .......... just doesn\'t add up. \r\n\r\nSorry if I sound like a "Prick in the ass" todd.\r\n\r\n\r\nnemaK');
