INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (14478, 'cec431da0d', '', 'Pricing on ZZ 2.0 is to be 29.99\r\n\r\nX Mods, undetermined\r\n\r\nKamen\r\n\r\nUnderstand your doubts, not a problem.  Whereas some fine details may change from now till release date, the main details are pretty much an affirmative.\r\n\r\nThey tried to keep third party parts companies from popping up.  Only thing is motors and batteries, and of coars Bit parts that were already out.  That is why they kept them in the states.  With release in other countries, they make more profit, yet the desire for 2.0 stays well alive in the states.\r\n\r\nNow, if parts are in fact compatible, that seems to go against their original theory.  Cos if 1.0 are available in say Japan, they can still mold bodies that would fit 2.0s here as an example.\r\n\r\nAt any rate, my source is pretty damn reliable.  Not your typical run of the mill RS employee.  He is the one that told me about them last early August to where I was able to post over at mysticfrights site about zzs to let everyone know that they were coming. \r\n\r\nWell pull this topic up around xmas or so when more concrete details are available....Ill put a zz 1.0 in the mail for you if were wrong... :grin:');
