INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (14622, '7b7bb7561b', '', '[quote:7b7bb7561b="CaboWabo"]:lol: no kidding - 3 cars all duel celled, someone\'s getting his speed fix\r\n\r\ngot a booster duel celled?[/quote:7b7bb7561b]\r\nMy only booster that\'s dual-celled is the Franken-Zap with the LXX PCB board in it. I know that board is stifling it, but it\'s more than fast enough to put that car on it\'s roof. I\'ve been debateing over dual celling my MS Pro, but I usually like to leave my bits single cell, and set up tight roadcoarses to navigate. I always thought external dual cells seemed way off balance, but I don\'t know if it\'s the flat tires or what, but these cars seems as stable as my dual cell Zip Zaps, and way more stable than my one internal dual cell bit. Great stunts cars like you seen in the video. \r\n\r\nI love these cars, but for $5, I [b:7b7bb7561b][i:7b7bb7561b]LOVE[/i:7b7bb7561b][/b:7b7bb7561b]these cars. :lol: \r\n\r\nNox, thanks :-) , the S2000 ones would be perfect. :)');
