INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48407, '597ff3768c', '', '[quote:597ff3768c="sg219"]I say give him a little while. Maybe a week or 2 to see if someone could get a Bit Mod out of him. I think that should be a small requirement.  Not so much of a yes or no, in or not, but just to see one from him.  I think it could only be as good as his other cars.\r\n\r\nI think he\'s cool.  :cool:  He treated my whole shit-storm with Drac at Mini-Z like a pro.\r\n\r\nHe got my vote.....after I see a sweet 1:64th Mod from him.  :shock:  :eek:[/quote:597ff3768c]\r\n :-)  sometimes you have to act a bit more mature, as hard as it is, when your a moderator :-(   \r\n\r\nthanks for the nod :smile:  i\'m glad to join such a talented group of people.  just because i dont\' post in teh bit sections anymore doesn\'t mean i don\'t lurk 8) \r\n\r\no.k. i have to dig some bit mods from my early bit days :???: \r\nhow about my first full decal jobs... \r\nqfm (remember them) sponsored racing honda\r\n[img:597ff3768c]http://mini-zracer.com/albums/album56/qfmbit.jpg[/img:597ff3768c]\r\ntransformers jazz celica\r\n[img:597ff3768c]http://mini-zracer.com/albums/album56/tfbit.sized.jpg[/img:597ff3768c]\r\n\r\nsorry for the crappy pics.  they are before i found that god damn macro button :x   you don\'t know how long i f\'ed with that damn camera to get closeups before i took out the manual\r\n\r\nhere is another mod from teh very early bit days, a hard wired antenna.  all that work to get a pidly extra foot of range :( \r\n[url=http://mini-zracer.com/gallery/album56/antenna_mod5]see this[/url]\r\n\r\nor even my first ever led set\r\n[url=http://mini-zracer.com/gallery/album56/bit_light_set02]see this[/url]\r\n\r\noh, i still buy these too 8) just got my cherished [url=http://mini-zracer.com/gallery/album56/IMG_0146]initial d set[/url]\r\n\r\nand jus tto throw a bone, i even have a high quality scan of the official tommy decal set for people to print and use for themselves, [url=http://mini-zracer.com/gallery/album56/bit_char_g_decals]here[/url]\r\n\r\ni hope this is enough :cool:');
