INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (15099, '1e202f0f2e', '', 'I just happen to be a major knife collector. Heck, I\'ve got more knives than bits!!!!\r\n\r\nMy EDC (every day carry) is a 440V steel Spyderco Military. My other great love is my custom made Bob Dozier Straight Hunter with stag handles and D2 steel. \r\n\r\n[img:1e202f0f2e]http://home.nycap.rr.com/sosak/blades/millie1.jpg[/img:1e202f0f2e]\r\n[img:1e202f0f2e]http://home.nycap.rr.com/sosak/blades/dozier5.jpg[/img:1e202f0f2e]\r\n\r\nBTW - Old Timers are probably the best value there is in the knife world; or at least right up there with Victorinox Swiss Army Knives. Tons of bang for the buck. I personally love the Old Timer Middleman. Great carbon steel, three blades, and small enough not to weigh down your pocket too badly.');
