INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39871, '6fd7843905', '4.2 king', 'hi all i have a ? about the 4.2 king motor, i dont remember what they looked like on the end, i got two from toy east in the little red boxes, this is what i have, two motors have a white cap with an e on them, and i have three red ones, and a purple one i think came from a zip zap kit, i put the white end capped with e in a clone and the thing crawled and when i put the purple motor in it it was great hella fast. i thought the 4.2 which is the white with e caps i think wre supposed to be the bomb,. actually  i put the e cap motor in a lxx char g and it was better there than the clone, both rc\'s are single speed. are we calling the 4.21 with an e cap an elvis, i read an earlier thread. motors seem to work differantly in diff cars. slower,faster and so forth, just a thought.\r\np.s. i picked up this rc from big lots today, it has a wire shaped in a square under the body for an antenna i thought this is cool. gets great range too, its called thunder charger, good little car, and i see that dark tari has modded a couple of these and they would be the blue car and the gold car of his in the gallery wow. i was suprised with this little car to say the least.\r\n\r\ni know its getting warmer out side, lets not give up the hobbie\r\n\r\nl8r\r\nj');
