INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (15141, 'f37a8e90d6', '', 'I don\'t want to have this discussion either, but please stop with the super huge text.\r\n\r\n...and Adobe Systems, an Apple Computer partner, published a document stating that PC is indeed faster.\r\n[quote:f37a8e90d6]Also, the increasing performance gap between Macs and PCs comes at a tough time for Apple, which is reportedly examining a replacement for the Power PC platform. Apple once touted the RISC-based Power PC as the future of computing, but the Pentium line, in which Intel has incorporated various RISC-like technologies, long ago surpassed the Power PC in performance, blurring the line between CISC and RISC architectures and ending the debate over which is superior. Apple\'s choices appear to come down to an IBM advance on the Power PC platform called the Power PC 970 or possibly moving to an Intel-based architecture. Whatever the company chooses, it needs to move quickly; Apple\'s market share continues to erode. The company\'s high-profile Switch campaign has proven ineffective, and changing platforms is always risky. However, the company pulled off a similar change when it moved to the Power PC platform years ago. You never know, Apple could do it again.[/quote:f37a8e90d6]\r\n\r\nyou\'re not gonna maul anything but your respect');
