INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (15572, 'b22e43aaab', '', 'Here is the car.  I just painted it glossy black.\r\n[img:b22e43aaab]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/willymod1.jpg[/img:b22e43aaab]\r\n\r\n[img:b22e43aaab]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/willymod2.jpg[/img:b22e43aaab]\r\n\r\nThen I painted the back end purple.  The rest of the pictures\r\nnever show the purple very well, so notice it now!\r\n\r\n[img:b22e43aaab]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/willymod3.jpg[/img:b22e43aaab]\r\n\r\nI did the \'Elemer\' Mod on the windows prior to painting.\r\n\r\n[img:b22e43aaab]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/willymod4.jpg[/img:b22e43aaab]\r\n\r\nThen I painted the nose yellow and accented the grill and lights.\r\nFollowed that with the background white for the flames.\r\n\r\n[img:b22e43aaab]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/willymod5.jpg[/img:b22e43aaab]\r\n\r\nThen as close to the white lines, I placed Red paint.\r\n\r\n[img:b22e43aaab]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/willymod6.jpg[/img:b22e43aaab]\r\n\r\nAll the way accross.\r\n\r\n[img:b22e43aaab]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/willymod7.jpg[/img:b22e43aaab]\r\n\r\nThen I mixed up three colors to blend together.\r\n\r\n[img:b22e43aaab]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/willymod8.jpg[/img:b22e43aaab]\r\n\r\nBlend complete.\r\n\r\n[img:b22e43aaab]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/willymod9.jpg[/img:b22e43aaab]\r\n\r\nNow, this car is far from done.\r\nBut I felt I owe you an update on my progress.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think?  \r\n\r\nfor a homie pushin decals, I\'m havin fun.\r\n\r\n-NoX');
