INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (15883, 'afa0e5b850', '', 'Well I tried it doesn’t work..... I talked to my ISP and they do not support PHP code. I hate that I pay $130 a month for 350 channel digital cable and high speed. With this I get a total or 50 MB of web space spread over 5 10MB accounts and I cannot use PHP. They do however support MySQL if that helps?\r\n\r\nThey said they were looking into it but had no idea as to when php would be implemented?\r\n\r\nSTOOPID :finger:\'s\r\n\r\nI guess there’s no work around huh? Using a small lixlink account again and just uploading to Rogers? Does that work? Can it work? Is it a big pain in my arse to do that?\r\n\r\nI\'m already working on 5 sites at once in DWMX and its becoming a little confusing. Yesterday I uploaded a bunch of stuff and couldn\'y view it on the web. I was going nutz then I realized I uploaded it to the wrong site (DUH)\r\nROFL');
