INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (15924, '75fce43835', '', '[quote:75fce43835="Stoli"]Well I tried it doesn’t work..... I talked to my ISP and they do not support PHP code. I hate that I pay $130 a month for 350 channel digital cable and high speed. With this I get a total or 50 MB of web space spread over 5 10MB accounts and I cannot use PHP. They do however support MySQL if that helps?[/quote:75fce43835]\r\nSounds like you have almost the same deal we have. I wanted to put a picture uploader thing on one of my accounts to host pictures for you guys, but my wife says you need both php and SQL support.\r\n\r\nYou probably don\'t want to spend any more money, but another option is to pay for space like my wife does. She goes through alwayswebhosting.com and gets 350 mb of space, and 10g of bandwidth for $8 a month. There is php and SQL support, and that 4images uploader thing, is a built in autoinstalling feature.\r\n\r\nBTW, I know Cabo is professional, and knows way more about this stuff than I do, I just figured if there is already a script out there that does what you want, then I would suggest it, and save Cabo the trouble. :)');
