INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (15947, '2e9ec746ed', 'A nice bling-bling find', 'I have a Notre Dame Pen I got last month and I took it apart and it has a Gold Clicker which I used for a muffler on my PT. Well I also found a little flat ring of gold the same diamiter of a ZZ Rim.  I saved it.  Now today I was workin on my lego ZZ Track (its awsome I wish I had a pic) and in my lego box I found a different pen with the same clicker and ring so I glued the clicker on for dual mufflers and then I glued the rings on my PTs rear wheels.  My theory is that it is a standard format of pens made by the same company and I thought a might pass on this message so U can lookie for some of those pens. Now I wish I had a digi camera to take a pic of it.   :-(');
