INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (15958, '2bba32d01d', 'childhood dream toy...', 'I had a lot of slot cars as a kid, and I always fantasized that I could drive off the track and keep goin\'. So, when those NOS Bottle cars came out with their HO scale intact, I had to build me up a slot car that goes off the track.\r\nT-Jets are my faves, so that\'s where I started. This was a total bitch. The body is screwed onto custom mounts behind the front wheel wells, and one screw in the back from underneath. The body is literally crammed on the chassis, and I broke the steering wires FIVE DAMN TIMES trying to get the shit to fit. It\'s not the best driving car, but it works pretty well, all things considered.  \r\n\r\n.\r\n[img:2bba32d01d]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/vette1.jpg[/img:2bba32d01d]\r\n\r\n\r\n.\r\n[img:2bba32d01d]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/vette2.jpg[/img:2bba32d01d]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhue35');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (15960, '74afcdf7c3', 'cabo-inspired work in progress', 'That chop-top Challenger of Cabo\'s is my favorite car online. So, I had to start building one of my own. I am pretty excited about the way the Camaro is shaping up. The plan for the Challenger is purple metallic with the standard black trim, and the Camaro will be light metallic green with a white/gold burst flame job. I\'ll post pix when they\'re done... probably a while from now (I\'m slow).\r\n\r\nhue35\r\n.\r\n[img:74afcdf7c3]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/workA_1.jpg[/img:74afcdf7c3]\r\n.\r\n[img:74afcdf7c3]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/workA_2.jpg[/img:74afcdf7c3]\r\n.\r\n[img:74afcdf7c3]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/workA_3.jpg[/img:74afcdf7c3]\r\n.\r\n[img:74afcdf7c3]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/workA_4.jpg[/img:74afcdf7c3]\r\n.\r\n[img:74afcdf7c3]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/workA_5.jpg[/img:74afcdf7c3]');
