INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (16356, '882b18d2e7', '', 'Thanks brothers, you\'re making me feel right like a pimp.   I can tell the banked turn is gonna be fun.    It gives you a noticeable boost coming off the corner.\r\n\r\n[quote:882b18d2e7]crazydave Posted: Where you getting that 2mm PVC? I want some.  [/quote:882b18d2e7]\r\nI got the board and the 2 mil pvc sheet from a sign shop, where my wife happens to be the manager.    You\'re gonna love this..... Their cost on the stuff was like $40, and the owner [i:882b18d2e7]gave[/i:882b18d2e7] is to me!    She says you can get that stuff at a sign-supply place.\r\n\r\n[quote:882b18d2e7]Yagbols Posted: Far out track mang! i like the loopy thing and that banking! \r\n [/quote:882b18d2e7]\r\nAnd I\'m gonna steal an idea from your track bro!    Those railing decals or prints are awesome!    Great realizm effect.\r\n\r\n[quote:882b18d2e7]payaso Posted: So far so good.. How long till she\'s finished? [/quote:882b18d2e7]\r\nMaybe another month or so I hope.     I\'m all hyped up on it with all the comps.    I just got all the 5/8" railing today to glue and screw all the way around it.    Maybe next weekend have the railing and track painted.    Look for another update next weekend.\r\n\r\n-SilentWolv');
