INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (16363, 'd2f2551450', '', 'Apparently it is 2 boats, and 2 RC die cast. here\'s the description:\r\nThis NKOK Combo set (2 boats and 2 cars) \r\nRed H2 SUT with a Yellow Wave Runner Boat \r\nBlack Cadillac Excalade with a Red Wave Runner \r\nSuper-Micro size car is "3" long! \r\nIndependent front suspension; Adjustable steering \r\nRubber tires for great grip \r\nE-Z Snap-On Quick Charger Deck allows the micro R/C vehicle to be charged in approx. 45 seconds and run up to 15 minutes! \r\nHas built-in Ni-Cad rechargeable batteries! \r\nOperating distance range up to 50 Feet! \r\nThe car comes with a box package as a package.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (38515, '789ebdea7b', '', '[quote:789ebdea7b="CaboWabo"]I\'ll never be stuck - the mcgivere (sp?) comes out in the true smoker in all adverse situations lol\r\n\r\nI still remember coke cans with holes for bowls and payaso throwin rocks at geese all before we were 14. lol[/quote:789ebdea7b]\r\n\r\n\r\nLook at how Cabo throws me a bone with the master of joints, and takes it back away by calling the goose hurter..\r\n\r\nFuck off... that was totally you that threw that rock.  It was the same night you banged michelle nevins...lol\r\n\r\nAs for the doobie rolling, I don\'t know, but it just comes to me.  they look like they came from the factory when I\'m done.  Weird thing is, I don\'t even like joints.  Only roll em when there\'s too many lungs st the session.\r\n\r\n\r\nthe trick for me is when i\'m rolling one, I put the herb in the paper, and roll it back, and forth like a piece of playdough..\r\n\r\nYou know when you got some playdough, and you making a snake between your fingers. like that.\r\n\r\nWhen I can feel it in the shape of a cigarette, I tuck the paper in, and roll it up..\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
