INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (38503, '29cc5b5613', 'So do we have an official joint roller?', 'Ok, you know how proper joint rolling is an art and a science? And some people are just natural masters at it, and others like me just never get the hang of it?\r\n\r\nSeemed like there was always one guy in the bunch that rolled the perfect joints, and always became our official joint roller. I could roll in pinch, if no one else could, but I rolled these pregnant hippo looking things.\r\n\r\nOne news years eve, I was fall over drunk and in the back of a dark cramped car, and I rolled perfect joint after perfect joint, but I never been able to do it since. Odd.\r\n\r\nI\'m bring this up, cause I just tried another one tonight, once again it was too tight to get a hit, and running all over the place, so I gave up on it. I\'ve wasted so much weed trying to roll joints over the years. I need to just give up.');
