INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (16625, 'b49975122f', '', 'let me be the first to guess at how u did it \r\n1 take one of those voice recording hallmark picture frame thingys\r\n2 rip the important shit outt it\r\n3 record the song\r\n4 put the important shit into you\'re bit (probably a tight fit)\r\n5 twist the play button wires together so it\'s allways playing\r\n6 take the power wires and hook them directly to the motor wires probably need a diode so in reverse the power won\'t be backwards to the pcb for the hallmark thinggy\r\n7 put you\'re car together\r\n8 enjoy tunes when you\'re driving.\r\n\r\nis this the way u have planned?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (16626, 'e8786ecf0c', '', 'ok here it is\r\nlist:\r\nraised car shell\r\nmini max fm tuner link: http://www.uniquestuff.com/radios.htm\r\n3" boom box (for the speakers) link: http://shop.store.yahoo.com/rainbowsymphony/minboomrad.html\r\nsolder gun if u want u dont need\r\nelectrical tape\r\ndremal tool\r\nsteps\r\n1. prepare the speakers by taking them out and then cuting the wires on the headphones so that u can do step two.\r\n2. then u take and strip enough wire to twist them to the right wire that means right-right left-left and then when twisted u can solder or tape the showing wire.\r\n3. now dremal the windows out when u do that glue the speakers on the inside in the front and back.\r\n4.your done now go and put your favorite radio station on and pick up the girls.\r\n\r\nno pics but right now i am worjing on a mp3 player for my bit and i will tell u how it goes.\r\n\r\np.s. give the playa some Credit by playa i mean me k thanks');
