INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (16814, '2fd693f677', 'It\'s Finally Finished - Project ZZT', 'Everybody tell little ol\' me what you really think.\r\n[img:2fd693f677]http://www.rcpics.net/media/ZZTP2.jpg[/img:2fd693f677]\r\n[img:2fd693f677]http://www.rcpics.net/media/ZZTP1.jpg[/img:2fd693f677]\r\n[img:2fd693f677]http://www.rcpics.net/media/ZZT-1.jpg[/img:2fd693f677]\r\n[img:2fd693f677]http://www.rcpics.net/media/ZZT-2.jpg[/img:2fd693f677]\r\n[img:2fd693f677]http://www.rcpics.net/media/ZZT-3.jpg[/img:2fd693f677]\r\n[img:2fd693f677]http://www.rcpics.net/media/ZZT-4.jpg[/img:2fd693f677]\r\n[img:2fd693f677]http://www.rcpics.net/media/ZZT-5.jpg[/img:2fd693f677]\r\n[img:2fd693f677]http://www.rcpics.net/media/ZZT-6.jpg[/img:2fd693f677]\r\n[img:2fd693f677]http://www.rcpics.net/media/ZZT-7.jpg[/img:2fd693f677]\r\n[img:2fd693f677]http://www.rcpics.net/media/ZZT-8.jpg[/img:2fd693f677]\r\n[img:2fd693f677]http://www.rcpics.net/media/ZZT-9.jpg[/img:2fd693f677]\r\n[img:2fd693f677]http://www.rcpics.net/media/ZZT-10.jpg[/img:2fd693f677]\r\n[img:2fd693f677]http://www.rcpics.net/media/ZZT-11.jpg[/img:2fd693f677]\r\n[img:2fd693f677]http://www.rcpics.net/media/ZZT-12.jpg[/img:2fd693f677]\r\n[img:2fd693f677]http://www.rcpics.net/media/ZZT-13.jpg[/img:2fd693f677]\r\n\r\nI made this for the contest at RCmod.com and entered it today. A lot of work went into it.\r\nMods.\r\nStretched bB Body to ZZ Length (two cuts)\r\nHeadlights (Green) and Taillights (Red) Black electrical tape prevents glow of lights from anywhere except where I wanted them.\r\nFront Air Dam\r\nSide Skirts\r\nTesters Dark Blue Acrylic Paint.\r\nYellow Stripes are Dry Erase from Pine Car decal set.\r\nToyota decals from 24th scale slot car set for GTP.\r\nTailpipes custom made from aluminum tubing.\r\nKrylon Clear Gloss Acrylic covers whole thing.\r\nWindow tinting by Sharpie.\r\n\r\nIt took me two weeks to get it to where I wanted it for the contest.');
