INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39448, 'd8eb34216a', '', '[quote:d8eb34216a="Son_Gokou"][quote:d8eb34216a="SuperFly"]What\'s with that steelwoolghandi dude over there? Has he got a chip on his shoulder or what?[/quote:d8eb34216a]\r\n\r\nI don\'t think you\'ve taken a thorough analysis of MRCC. Over there, STG was actually one of the EXTREMELY few mods who was fair, open minded, and kindly. He had plenty of patience, and only banned people when they really forced his hand. He explained the rules whenever someone did something wrong, and when they still persisted with their annoyance and rule-breaking, then he brought out the stick....which he left to the other mods, most of the time. I\'ve chatted with him on Yahoo and AIM, trust me...he\'s soft.  :-)[/quote:d8eb34216a]\r\n\r\nYeah, I said that based solely on his first coupla posts in the contest thread. He just seemed to get irate over simple questions, but maybe patience gets tested over there more.\r\n\r\nHehe, going over there reminded me of visiting my old high school after I had been in college a coupla years. Everyone seemed so young and dumb.');
