INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (17066, 'cf900e9d21', 'General Site FAQ\'s &amp; FGA\'s', 'Welcome to our FAQs and FGAs.\r\n\r\nWe\'ll use this thread to address all the frequently asked questions about the site and how to use it. We\'ll add to this list as necessary.\r\nHere we go...\r\n\r\nThe purpose is to limit the need of posting the same common questions over and over again, quickly inform, and allow members to share knowledge. It is an on-going thread, so check back for updates. If there\'s some other general question you have, please post it in a new thread or send one of the Administrators or Moderators an e-mail. There is another "thread" for Bit Char-G related questions found here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=52\r\n\r\n[b:cf900e9d21]General[/b:cf900e9d21]\r\n[list:cf900e9d21]\r\n[*:cf900e9d21][b:cf900e9d21]What the hell is this site about?[/b:cf900e9d21]\r\nSimple. Entertainment, education, sharing, and most of all fun.\r\n[*:cf900e9d21][b:cf900e9d21]Why do I keep seeing little figures and other whack pictures?[/b:cf900e9d21]\r\nBecause they all fall into a category of either: cool, funny, or straight pimp.\r\n[*:cf900e9d21][b:cf900e9d21]Who made this site up?[/b:cf900e9d21]\r\nPeep out our [b:cf900e9d21]Members[/b:cf900e9d21] section.\r\n[*:cf900e9d21][b:cf900e9d21]Are you on crack?[/b:cf900e9d21]\r\nLet\'s just say that rehab is for quitters.\r\n[*:cf900e9d21][b:cf900e9d21]What\'s FGA stand for?[/b:cf900e9d21]\r\nFrequently Given Answers.\r\n[/list:u:cf900e9d21]\r\n[b:cf900e9d21]Forums[/b:cf900e9d21]\r\n[list:cf900e9d21]\r\n[*:cf900e9d21][b:cf900e9d21]Do I have to register to post?[/b:cf900e9d21]\r\nYes.\r\n[*:cf900e9d21][b:cf900e9d21]Are there any rules or guidelines?[/b:cf900e9d21]\r\nYes. See below in the [b:cf900e9d21]Forum Rules[/b:cf900e9d21] section.\r\n[*:cf900e9d21][b:cf900e9d21]Once I register, can I change my user name?[/b:cf900e9d21]\r\nNo. Well, not without good reason and a request to the Administrators or Moderators.\r\n[*:cf900e9d21][b:cf900e9d21]What about changing my other information?[/b:cf900e9d21]\r\nAfter you\'ve registered, if you want to change your profile, look for the "Profile" button at the top of the page, inside are your options.\r\n[*:cf900e9d21][b:cf900e9d21]Can I edit my posts?[/b:cf900e9d21]\r\nNo. If there is good reason, send a request to the Admininistrators or Moderators, however both can and will edit posts that do not adhere to the rules without consent.\r\n[/list:u:cf900e9d21]\r\n[b:cf900e9d21]Forum Rules[/b:cf900e9d21]\r\n[list:cf900e9d21]\r\n[*:cf900e9d21][b:cf900e9d21]First off[/b:cf900e9d21], have fun. Fun does not include attacking another individual or group of individuals. If you are on the recieving end, report it immediately to Administrators or Moderators. \r\n[*:cf900e9d21][b:cf900e9d21]Secondly[/b:cf900e9d21], please do not post "huge images". By this we mean, try and keep the image dimensions (width x height) no larger than 450 x 450, this also means you should try to optimize your images, that is, keep the file size (kilobytes) low. All this will help for a more enjoyable forum and faster forum for everyone. Most all computers have at least a basic image manipulation program, find it, and use it.\r\n[*:cf900e9d21][b:cf900e9d21]Thirdy[/b:cf900e9d21], yes the site can be "R-Rated" at times, but keep it to a minimum, no pornographic words or usernames are allowed, neither are any racist remarks, words, or usernames - refer to the first rule.\r\n[*:cf900e9d21][b:cf900e9d21]And last but not least[/b:cf900e9d21], it\'s okay to stray from the topic a little here and there, but you should try to keep general conversation in the "General" forums.\r\n[/list:u:cf900e9d21]');
