INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (17156, 'e79ef9940d', 'blew out my zz....', 'erk.....my 3rd zz. tried some weird stuff and  i overcharged and killed it. see cuz i made a standalone, and i wanted to test if it would work. i dindt finish my dual cell yet, so i put my single on it, and wahddya know, 2 of the copper wires (im assuming the forward ones, since that\'s the direction i tried before it fried) are now BLACK. it\'s like marvins magic drawing board. gold to black! woppeee. now i have an excuse to get a new zz and go to RS for some supplies. oh well, at least i know my charger puts out alot. it\'s just the zz charger base directly connected to the zz AAA battery compartemnt.');
