INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (17172, 'f595054a09', '', 'BCG\'s and ZZ are far cheaper to get and modify. If I did to a real Gloria what I did (make into Pickup, see my contest entry) the cost would have been several thousand dollars. If I did that my wife would kill me. A Shen Gloria cost me about $15.00 for whole car. The Modification cost me about 2 hours and about 5 bucks in supplies.\r\n\r\nBig difference.\r\n\r\nWhen you grow up you may realise that you need other things than a flashy car to make your life worth living.  :lol:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (17173, '6df622e5de', '', 'In the late 80\'s and early 90\'s I belonged to a rap/dance group/gang called the East Side Posse....out of Lynn, MA...we put out 2 albums....heres some shit I threw down back then......copywritten and shit..............and before anyone says anything \'bout it, I ain\'t racist...the group consisted of 2 black guys, 2 white, and 2 dominican.......\r\n\r\n"Ruthless Niggas"\r\n\r\nTalkin \'bout the N to the I double G. A. S., I got the rifles and the uzis but the 9\'s the best, A 211s in progress on Timson St., sprayed bullets in his chest, nigga felt the heat, next victim was a sucka, tried to fuck wit my biddy, brought him  to the turf of da East Side City, Me and him one on one, gun to face, I blew the punk away and left without a trace, now it\'s a sorry ass shame, but he played the game, in the paper under death, another suckas name, next night on the news "Who pulled the triggas?", police shoulda known, I was a Ruthless Nigga.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nand heres one of my versus in a song called "Intro" as in introduction.......\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ll go 12 rounds with anyone, cuz violence to me is just plain old fun, and when I\'m kickin on the microphone, you can pack your bags and just go home, cuz I\'ll knock you out, without a doubt, wanna battle me boy, you\'d better just head south, and when I hunt you down, I\'ll try to kill ya, if I can\'t do it, I\'ll just plain old drill ya, and when you\'re dead and six feet under, all you can try to do is wonder, and with that thought everything will cease, and I\'m outta here so Peace!\r\n\r\nJust wanted to share a little history witcha....like it says....OlD SkOoL  :cool:');
