INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (17228, 'c5bf51c9a7', '', '[b:c5bf51c9a7]How do I post a picture so others can view them?[/b:c5bf51c9a7]\r\nUse the IMG tags when making your post.\r\nIt should look something like this:\r\n(make sure there are no spaces between the beginning and ending IMG tags)\r\n[code:1:c5bf51c9a7]&#91;img&#93;http&#58;//www.domain.com/image.jpg &#91;/img&#93;[/code:1:c5bf51c9a7]\r\n\r\n[b:c5bf51c9a7]What if I don\'t have web space to host my own images, can I still post an image?[/b:c5bf51c9a7]\r\nYes. You can one of the many free hosting sites out there or you can go to:\r\nwww.photobucket.com or www.picturetrail.com \r\nregister for free for an account so you can upload pictures. \r\n\r\nonce you upload a picture, there will be a URL to that picture. \r\n\r\nthat URL is what you want to put between the IMG tags.\r\n\r\n[b:c5bf51c9a7]How do I make a clickable link in my posts?[/b:c5bf51c9a7]\r\nYou have several options here.\r\n- You can type the full URL like this: http://bitpimps.lixlink.com\r\n- You can use the URL tags\r\n(make sure there are no spaces between the beginning and ending URL tags)\r\n[code:1:c5bf51c9a7]&#91;url&#93;http&#58;//bitpimps.lixlink.com &#91;/url&#93;[/code:1:c5bf51c9a7]\r\nor like this\r\n[code:1:c5bf51c9a7]&#91;url=http&#58;//bitpimps.lixlink.com&#93;bitPimps &#91;/url&#93;[/code:1:c5bf51c9a7]\r\n\r\n[b:c5bf51c9a7]How do I get a picture (avatar) under my screen name?[/b:c5bf51c9a7]\r\nClick the "Profile" link at the top of the forum to edit your profile.\r\nScroll to the bottom of the page and you will see the "Avatar control panel".\r\nYou can use 1 of the 4 options found there with further instructions.\r\n\r\n[b:c5bf51c9a7]Where do you get those little people (Homies) I see next to people\'s cars?[/b:c5bf51c9a7]\r\nThey\'re called "Homies" and you can get them from several places:\r\n- In this forum under [url=http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/index.php?c=4][b:c5bf51c9a7]"bitPimps Flea-Market"[/b:c5bf51c9a7][/url]. People trade, buy and sell them under these forum catagories.\r\n- Gumball machines at some stores like Toys R Us, some hobby shops and other places that have cool gumball machine items.\r\n- Online at www.homies.tv, ebay.com, and a few other online shops.');
