INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (17449, '6d1ced05b8', 'Cyberkidd007\'s MOD', 'OK watcha do is order some batteries from allelectronics.com and get the NIMH batteries Store number  NMH-11 these are the button cells (rechargeable) then you put them in the same way you do as a regular battery except this time put three leave the little green insulater around the sides. You then have to make a homeade PCB cover to fit because stock will not fit. Then you get a really fast motor and stock- performance gears. And then you put some kind of lubricant (I used the stuff you put on you hair clippers) on the gears and axel while pressing forwards. The liquid lubricant. You can find it just about anywhere. And the good thing is that it doesnt pick up hair. :???: i think that is about it then you may want to make a wheelie bar by using a paper clip and mini tech deck wheels. (since this is a speed mod i will not post instructions)[url]http://www.allelectronics.com/cgi-bin/category.cgi?category=search&amp;item=NMH-11&amp;type=store[/url] This is the batteries. [Note] charge at five min. max. If you overcharge then you will explode your batteries. if you use a red motor ZZ and stock gears you will get the same run time as your charge time. So higher motor less run time. Lower motor more runtime.');
