INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (17526, '0f8a0a10a9', '', '[quote:0f8a0a10a9="sessiz"]Are the bodies plastic or diecast?\r\nIf they\'re plastic did they keep the detail of the diecasts?[/quote:0f8a0a10a9]\r\n\r\nPlastic. Just looking, I don\'t think you could tell the difference between the RC and the diecast, except for the antenna.\r\n\r\nI got mine off eBay. Seller\'s ID: ccamarobob . Extremely fast shipping. I think it took no more than 3 days. $18 w/o shipping.\r\nI was browsing the Zip Zap page and there it was.... the only one I found. :???: \r\n\r\nSpeed\'s OK, I probably say between a 2.6 and a 3.0\r\nHard to tell with mine, it goes out of range in no time.  :sad:');
