INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (17534, '72090b4852', '', 'OK, I had to open the car up. Looking for range!!! :( \r\n\r\nWell, I couldn\'t tell if there were any crip caps but.....\r\n\r\nWhat I found:\r\n- 110mAH batt\r\n- [b:72090b4852]a second motor is used for steering! That\'s right no magnet![/b:72090b4852] It sits right down the middle of the chassis, next to the batt. It\'s hard wired. I think there\'s possiblities for proportional steering.... anyone up to it?  8) \r\n- The drive motor is under a plastic shield. I had a hard time trying to remove it. I left it alone since I didn\'t want to screw it up by breaking something (it\'s my only one!)! I\'m going to assume it\'s also hardwired.\r\n\r\nSorry I don\'t have a digital cam... Otherwise you\'d be looking at pics instead of reading about it!\r\n\r\nOpened up the controller too. Nothing special here.\r\nI found out why I didnt\' have any range.... broken antenna wire on the inside! WOO HOO! Easy fix!   :D');
