INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (17555, '1c8a13ca1a', '', '[quote:1c8a13ca1a="CaboWabo"]is that blue one a sub too?\r\n\r\nez, did you actually buy the other subs (expensive)?\r\nif you did, are they crap because of the price or just plain crap?\r\n\r\nBoats need a submarine friend[/quote:1c8a13ca1a]\r\n\r\nI never bought a sub, they were like $60. I just heard they were boring and with that price tag i wasnt gonna see for myself. And yeah that blue one i beleiv eis also a sub.... 2 colors styles and prolly for the 2 diff freq\'s.\r\n\r\nWell i bought the blue 49mhz tunnel type boat with wing. It goes pretty good. About the same as the nkok but these turn better due to the fact that the 2 props are farther apart and closer to the edge of the boat so the boats turns sharper. Looks to be even tougher to crack open than the nkok was. Dont think im gonna mess with this one. The rear sits farther down in the water but i think that might be to make sure the props stay under water for control.\r\n\r\nNot bad at all but for the same amount of money i got the nkok combo pack that also came with a truck and seperate cotroller/and charger for it.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (17556, '53da7adfd2', '', ':eek: I want that so bad. That is off the hook Cabo. :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (17557, '52431c5c3e', '', 'dont  u know  cabo always makes the best rides :-)  :-D  :smile:  nice job cabo,now its time to relax and drink a cold one//// :-D  :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (17558, '61d9f376bd', '', 'I picked one up today at walmart. $17.+ beans.\r\n\r\n[img:61d9f376bd]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/mwnasacar002.jpg[/img:61d9f376bd]\r\n\r\n[img:61d9f376bd]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/mwnasacar004.jpg[/img:61d9f376bd]\r\n\r\nNote, the steering adjustment is backwards compaired to other bits.\r\nand the 3 screws to take the body off. (swearword)\r\n\r\n[img:61d9f376bd]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/mwnasacar005.jpg[/img:61d9f376bd]\r\n\r\nIn the bottom right corner of the box is a button.\r\nWhen pushed, pops open the "slide out" charger.\r\n\r\n[img:61d9f376bd]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/mwnasacar006.jpg[/img:61d9f376bd]\r\n[img:61d9f376bd]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/mwnasacar009.jpg[/img:61d9f376bd]\r\n\r\nNote the two connector pointers on the bottom of the slide out charger.\r\nIt (the charger, containing the two AA batteries) when slide back in the box. IS the power source for the Transmitter.\r\n\r\n[img:61d9f376bd]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/mwnasacar010.jpg[/img:61d9f376bd]\r\n\r\n[img:61d9f376bd]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/mwnasacar011.jpg[/img:61d9f376bd]\r\n\r\nThe connecter to keep the car connected to the charger is cumbersome to work the car on.\r\n\r\n[img:61d9f376bd]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/mwnasacar012.jpg[/img:61d9f376bd]\r\n[img:61d9f376bd]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/mwnasacar013.jpg[/img:61d9f376bd]\r\n[img:61d9f376bd]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/mwnasacar014.jpg[/img:61d9f376bd]\r\n\r\nThe Motor is the exact same as the Radio Shacks NOS/NX Motor.\r\n(speed/performance/size)\r\n\r\n[img:61d9f376bd]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/mwnasacar019.jpg[/img:61d9f376bd]\r\n\r\n\r\n[url=http://noxorc.lixlink.com/mwnascar.wmv]MotorWorks Nascar Video[/url]\r\n\r\n\r\n-nox');
