INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (17798, 'bf2e164612', '', 'Yo\r\n\r\nI messed around with it a bit, and tried some other motors.  I can definately see the benefit of 2 speed, without a doubt, I just gotta toy around with it a bit more.\r\n\r\nI am getting more of the feel of it, but without a track, all I have is the hardwood floor at my store and we waxed it last week before we opened.... :eek:  so damn if I don\'t just slide the hell around.  My whole house is carpeted, and I\'ll just toy with it some more at the shop.\r\n\r\nSpeaking of shop, those near me, who can make it, we\'ll have our first race in a couple weeks.  We\'ll run either EM 1.0\'s or 1.6\'s(depending upon how the track is when we get it done.)  All comers will recieve a free EM motor that we use.  \r\n\r\nWill probably be on a Wednesday, round 6 PM or so.  Might be tough for some, and we may do a Sunday Noonish race sometime too.\r\n\r\nAt any rate, we\'ll keep ya all posted and man, I\'d sure like to see some of ya pimps make it by.  I am dying for some good competition!!! :-D \r\n\r\nWe are in Princeton, Indiana.  FYI, about 2.5 hours from NellyVille(IE St Louis), 1.5 hours from AliVille(IE Louisville),  about 1.25 from MellenVille(IE Seymour(Bloomington), about 2 hours from NappyVille(IE Bowling Green KY), about 2.5 hours from WhyStoreVille(IE, Indy), about 1.5 hours from ClabberGirlVille(IE, Terre Haute), about 5 hours from RKellyVille(IE ChiTown), about 1 hour from JohnnyDeppVille(IE Owensboro KY), about 9 hours from ShawnMullinsville(IE Decatur/HotLanta GA) and about 28 or so hours from FabriceMorvanVille(IE LA)\r\n\r\nEmail us if interested in coming and we\'ll get ya some directions.  And if you come from any of those cities listed above, please bring the celeb/s listed with you....or just pick up Sirena Williams :screwed:  along the way, that\'ll do just fine yo!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\nBring some spending $$$ we got ALL the hot clothes at our store, Snoop, Outkast, RocaWear, FUBU, Sean John, Johnny Blaze, and more, oh yeah, EM Motors and stuff on the cheap!!\r\n\r\nHolla\r\nDirty Sanchez');
