INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (17900, '9ded4dfa89', '', 'hmm, to tell the absolute truth, i was pretty pissed off with my auto modellista set when i fired it up.  it wasnt the lack of speed that pissed me off, but the lack of range.  fortunately, i got used to it pretty quick.\r\n\r\nthe speed is fine to me, and with a 3.2, it\'s nice and quick, but doesnt flip much w/o boost.  \r\n\r\nif you can get over the range, then it\'s good fun on a smaller track.  however, most of us just go for pure pants-shitting-wall-smashing-breaking-bodies-in-half speed... and boosters just plain arent made for that, unless you can do the anti-boost mod  :shock:');
