INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (18033, '595254c6ae', '', 'OK Cabo, I know you want to see it.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nProject Name: GT-W (Grand Touring Wagon) aka: Grocery Getter\r\nChassis: MS\r\nBody: MS Skyline\r\nRims: Nakamichi Racer\r\nAntenna: Cat 5 Tightly wound\r\n\r\n[img:595254c6ae]http://members.rogers.com/forbitpimps/images/bilbo/bilbo.jpg[/img:595254c6ae]\r\n\r\nI decided to do this as something a little different. Who else here even thought of making a wagon. :lol: \r\n\r\nUnder Construction\r\n[img:595254c6ae]http://www.rcpics.net/media/Skyline_GT-W-4.jpg[/img:595254c6ae]\r\n[img:595254c6ae]http://www.rcpics.net/media/Skyline_GT-W-2.jpg[/img:595254c6ae]\r\n[img:595254c6ae]http://www.rcpics.net/media/Skyline_GT-W-1.jpg[/img:595254c6ae]\r\nPainted Up.\r\n[img:595254c6ae]http://www.rcpics.net/media/GT-W-10.jpg[/img:595254c6ae]\r\n[img:595254c6ae]http://www.rcpics.net/media/GT-W-9.jpg[/img:595254c6ae]\r\n[img:595254c6ae]http://www.rcpics.net/media/GT-W-8.jpg[/img:595254c6ae]\r\n[img:595254c6ae]http://www.rcpics.net/media/GT-W-7.jpg[/img:595254c6ae]\r\n\r\nMain Color: Testers Metallic British Racing Green\r\nStripes: Tamiya Silver Chrome.\r\n\r\nAs Cabo previously noted the stripes are euro style off center. I liked many GT cars over the years with the off center stripes so I just had to do it.\r\n\r\nI painted the underside of the body for the headlights. Added Amber for turn signals in front. (it looks better IRL)\r\n\r\nYes I put a piece of aluminum tubing for the tailpipe and flared it at the end.\r\n\r\nI even detailed the rear view mirrors (normal for me) and taillights.\r\n\r\nThe pigtailed antenna was done by wrapping it around a thin piece of music wire (a paper clip also works in a pinch.) I used to wrap it around a jewelers screwdriver but I think the thin wire works better for me.\r\n\r\nThe only I haven\'t done (but may still do) it tint the windows. I think I have a green sharpie around here somewhere.\r\n\r\n[img:595254c6ae]http://www.rcpics.net/media/GT-W-6.jpg[/img:595254c6ae]\r\n[img:595254c6ae]http://www.rcpics.net/media/GT-W-5.jpg[/img:595254c6ae]\r\n\r\nAre you happy now Cabo, No more tease.  8-) \r\n\r\nI hope people like it.');
