INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (38397, 'd5f651bee6', '', '[quote:d5f651bee6="Son_Gokou"][quote:d5f651bee6="hogjowlz"]interesting calculations little man. only problem is you are probably losing about 15% of your energy to slop in the gears. so take your top numbers and drop 15%.[/quote:d5f651bee6]\r\n\r\nK, I\'m redoing it....Now, do this...and that....and....\r\n\r\nOk, so the top speed is 9 miles per hour, dropped by 15 percent....7.65 miles per hour, times 43....a scale 329! Still not bad.....Beats the Porsche and Skyline top speeds by a landslide (in scale mph)  :-)[/quote:d5f651bee6]\r\n\r\nOr for that matter, almost any road car.\r\n\r\nBTW, these super slicks, do they leave alot of room for modding? anyone have pics of the internals?');
