INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (18113, '4f592a79f1', '', 'I took three days to detail it to the current look. the Windows were a PITA.\r\n\r\nI have a Accord wagon I got with used BCG I bought on eBay. It doesn\'t look to me like what a wagon should look like.\r\n\r\nI was thinking of making a Gloria into a Volvo wagon. Two things stopped me. 1. I entered a Gloria in the contest at a pickup (Scamp) and I didn\'t have another Gloria body to spare. Since Skylines are easier to come by it became the wagon. I almost used the new skyline body for a wagon but I thought the older one had the lines for it.\r\n\r\nI\'m working on a Subaru WRX right now that is a little odd, but after that I\'m going to need a new project. I\'ve been thinking something about a ZZ body to a BCG and I do have a spare FORD body to use. If I had another PT Cruiser I\'d think about shortening it too.');
