INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (18276, '38f6d96819', '', '[quote:38f6d96819="ezenterprises"][quote:38f6d96819="sessiz"][quote:38f6d96819="Bit boy"]yeah theres even more stuff that points it out as fake. like the bad impression of the sun sentenial front page,and what would a Federal agency be doing with a case in panama? :???:[/quote:38f6d96819]\r\n\r\nYeah but how can you be sure it\'s fake. I mean zombies and vampires holy shit  :shock: \r\nWhat if, what if it\'s all true? What if that chick I met when I was in college that had the smelly crotch was really just a zombie. What if the dunkin donuts guy with the black hair and pale complection who looks like he wears lipstick really is a vampire?[/quote:38f6d96819]\r\n\r\nIts from a game.........  That iluminate symbol with the pyramin and eye is a tm of a game called illuminati, im sure this is just a website that deals with that game.[/quote:38f6d96819]\r\n\r\nI can\'t believe that you guys don\'t think this is for real. I suppose next you all are gonna tell me the freakin easter bunny aint real. Yeah like them eggs paint themselves, I don\'t think so.:roll:\r\n\r\nYou can believe or not but when a freakin zombie comes and chomps on your ass don\'t go shoutin "AAGhhr my ASS!!! Sessiz was freakin right!!!"\r\n\r\nMeanwhile I\'m forming a zombie/vampire hunting team. My mom says she\'ll bake some cookies and I\'m sure cabo will bring his magic the gathering cards. We will meet in my bedroom every tuesday night after smallville and practice our zombie/vampire fighting skills. I\'ll supply the knives and garlic wreaths but I\'ll ask you all to bring your own beer. I barely have enough for myself :sad: \r\nAnyway anybody interested in joining my cool vampire/zombie hunting team just post here in this thread. :-)');
