INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (18304, 'ec030d4f9b', 'Who can PIMP this much?', 'Rollin\' Down, Silver Black, Sittin\' On Chrome, Like It Bad Like Dat, Silver Black\r\nDis Pimp Ride Be Rollin\' slow, no waitin for da hoes to sho som mo, cash baby, yo want hash!\r\n\r\nHeres the low down Pimps!\r\nGloria\r\nMods Include the following...\r\n-Tab Lowered.\r\n-Two Tone flat black Hand-done paint job. (insipired by DT, Thanks mang)\r\n-Black Grill, with Lime Green Gold Accents.\r\n-Light Lime Gold Head Lights.\r\n-Japan License Plate\r\n-Dub Wheels\r\n-Custom Muffler\r\n\r\nINTERIOR\r\n-3.8 Clone Pink motor (off thunder charger, hella fast)\r\n-Flat Black heatsink cover\r\n-Flat Black Painted PCB cover\r\n-Silver painted on\r\n-X-acto knif-into the silver to create many 3-D like accents!\r\n-Pimpike, on the car to PROVE it mine!, (no room for bitPimps)\r\n-NOS nitrous bottle\r\n-Shifter\r\n-Huge Amps, Subs\r\n-Wire out back antenna, to make it look "different"\r\n-Silver accents on the steering part\r\n-White Gears (very smooth)\r\n-Center Console\r\n-Steering Wheel\r\n\r\nWow, what a list! God now my fingers hurt. Thanks for ideas from many people including, DarkTari, Sinned, Yagbols, Payaso, Midget_Man1387, CaboWabo etc. etc. If i missed you sorry man, ill edit you onto list!\r\n\r\nWell heres the gallery!\r\n\r\nhttp://www.pbase.com/pimp4eva/inobx\r\n\r\n\r\nBTW DarkTari, you were damn straight right about that post, back when you replied to Aquarius saying that "Wait till Pimpike sees that!!! Too bad I don\'t have my avatar, and i don\'t take hand outs from nice people live Havok!');
