INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (18802, '45d599e8b2', '', '@ midget_man\r\nwell we did pretty much the same judging system as with the [url=http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=324][b:45d599e8b2]Most Pimpin Ride Contest[/b:45d599e8b2][/url] - the points just added up to what they did.\r\n\r\nyou shouldn\'t take not winning to heart so much man.\r\nYou did an excellent job, personally - I liked the fact that it was what some may concider "overly detailed". You wrote it so a beginner, someone who knew nothing at all, could follow it - I liked that.\r\n\r\nI understand it\'s cool to win and it sucks to loose - but seriously, I don\'t think you lost at all. You\'re going to reap benefits like the knowledge, experience in doing as well as teaching/explaining (that\'s really hard), recognition when people use it and ask you about it, etc., etc.\r\n\r\nIt sucks that we can\'t hand out more prizes for your efforts, but we try and we\'re doing more than any other site out there... and we\'re not done by any means! :wink:\r\n\r\n@ RobotGT\r\nCongratulations on the win pimp! You had an excellent article as well (obviously, as you won)!\r\nPersonally, with your article, I liked the fact that it was a new approach to a mod that isn\'t currently posted on this site, a new resource of information to share! Your diagram was clean, clear and precise and the legend helps immensely. The re-use of a previous article was showing resourcefulness, I liked it.');
