INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (19147, 'd44a33a48f', '', '[quote:d44a33a48f="sessiz"]Speakin of buttons, The 2 freakin buttons on top, wtf do they do? I remember hearing something about steering concerning those buttons but haven\'t noticed anything. The controller is a major improvement on the old one but I hate being teased with buttons that don\'t do anything. [/quote:d44a33a48f]\r\n\r\nYeah, there\'s been some major BS floating around about these two buttons.  I\'m waiting on my 911 to arrive from toyeast.  When it does I\'m gonna attempt to reverse engineer the sucker to find out what those buttons do.   Once and for all.\r\n\r\nDT, could you please take a photo of the TX pcb from above? (ie birdseye view)  I\'d like to see what IC they are using, eg, TX2, TX6, etc.....Thanks...\r\n\r\nph2t.');
