INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (19180, '742935e3ea', '', 'this muther fucker mario is about to meet my darkside...\r\n\r\n[quote:742935e3ea]MAN GUYS WHY DON\'T YOU EVER REPLY?\r\nREPLY COME ON!\r\n \r\n           SICERELY,\r\n                        MARIO CAMPOS JR.[/quote:742935e3ea]\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:742935e3ea="CaboWabo"]Mario,\r\nI\'ve gotten 2 emails from you.\r\nThe first email, you asked for your password - you got an automated\r\nresponse email back.\r\nThe second email, you just said thanks\r\n\r\nI didn\'t reply to that email because I thought it was self explanitory,\r\nall I would of sent back was, "You\'re welcome". Which in my eyes didn\'t\r\nwarrant an email response. Sorry if it offended you - that\'s not what\r\nwe\'re trying to do. The problem is we\'re very busy running the site and\r\nsetting up contests. We\'re constantly swamped with questions (via PM or\r\nemail) from a lot of users (most of which should be posted in the forums\r\nfor a better response). It\'s hard to address each one individually so\r\nsometimes we have to be selective and reply to those that really warrant a\r\nreply.\r\nDon\'t take any offense to it - we\'re just busy running the site and\r\ndealing with the hundreds of other users who contact us on a daily basis.\r\n\r\nIf you have questions and/or comments regarding the micro R/C\'s - you\'re\r\nbetter off to just post it in the forums, we will see it for sure, and\r\nplus you\'ll get more valid responses which in turn will help you obtain\r\nthe exact answers you\'re looking for.\r\n\r\nSee ya on the boards pimp!\r\n\r\n- CaboWabo\r\n\r\n\r\nbitPimps Custom Modifications\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com[/quote:742935e3ea]\r\n\r\n[quote:742935e3ea]oh no you did not offend me, dont worry, I understand\r\nwell I didnt know mthat you cabbo wabbo where a  curator for that site!\r\ncabo! look heres what ill do.... next time,when you reply ill send you the\r\nmod for sppining rims so u can po9st it on your site. ok?\r\n\r\n        c-ya homie\r\n\r\n                        sincerely,\r\n                                   mario campos jr.[/quote:742935e3ea]\r\n\r\n[quote:742935e3ea="CaboWabo"]Hey mario,\r\nhowever you see fit is fine - you can post it or I can (giving you credit).\r\nJust let me know.\r\n- CaboWabo[/quote:742935e3ea]\r\n\r\n[quote:742935e3ea]***********************ok so when do you wANT ME TO SEND YOU THE MOD?*****************\r\nTHE LOTUS TEAM CORPORATION\r\n7248 NW 31 STREET, MIAMI, FL 33122\r\nTEL(305)718-8619 FAX(305)718-8163\r\nCELL. (786)346-3617\r\ne-mail: mariocampos@thelotusteam.com[/quote:742935e3ea]\r\n\r\n[quote:742935e3ea="CaboWabo"]How about ASAP?\r\ndidn\'t you already tell me you were going to email it to me like a few\r\ndays ago?[/quote:742935e3ea]\r\n\r\n[quote:742935e3ea]ok! calm down jezuz[/quote:742935e3ea]\r\n\r\n[quote:742935e3ea="CaboWabo"]uh, what are you talking about?\r\nyou\'ve asked me several times now about getting this mod from you - I\'m\r\njust replying.\r\nnow you\'ve gotten me "un-calm"...\r\n\r\nthe problem here is you.\r\nyou tell everyone that you are "for sure" sending off the mod, "for sure"\r\n- "emailing it to admin tonite"...\r\nI don\'t how many times I\'ve read this from you, and yet still no\r\nmodification.\r\nyou shouldn\'t tell people you are going to do something, and then never do.\r\ndon\'t claims or promises you don\'t intend to keep.\r\nI honestly don\'t think you even have a mod to share, I think you\'re making\r\nall of this up for one reason or another...\r\nif you weren\'t making this up, we would of seen the mod already a few\r\nweeks ago.\r\nyou\'ve lost all my respect.\r\nplease don\'t resond to this email as I\'m blocking you from sending me\r\nanymore emails.\r\n\r\n- CaboWabo\r\n\r\n\r\nbitPimps Custom Modifications\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com[/quote:742935e3ea]\r\n\r\nnext time I hear from him...\r\nhe\'s getting the ass chewing of a fucking life time, I\'ll make that little fucker cry himself to sleep - then he\'ll be committing suicide the next morning when he awakes, still balling');
