INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (19186, '2795945428', '', '[quote:2795945428="hogjowlz"]they come in a rally car that sorta looks like a wrx with a buncha foglights on it and an suv. neither look that great but the chassis can be modded to fit bit bodies anyhow. they have wider wheels than bits to.\r\n\r\nrally racers are pretty much total knockoffs of bits. someone said that they are actually shen qui weis repackaged. if so it seems to live up to its reputation.[/quote:2795945428]\r\n\r\n\r\nHave You hadda chance to beat on it yet?  Wanna know what you think.\r\n\r\nI bought mine from KBToys for $9.99 (when they put them on sale, $13.99 when not) and in my opinion they are best clones I\'ve ever purchased.  They\'re fast, great handling, track straight, kickin azz range. I\'ve praised these since day1 and think they\'ll out perform any Micro straight out Da Box!');
