INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (19453, '59d49153e4', '', 'I got the Porsche 911 (27Mhz, Chan B) and here\'s my observations:\r\n\r\n[b:59d49153e4].[/b:59d49153e4]  Front and back rims are equal in diameter\r\n[b:59d49153e4].[/b:59d49153e4]  Tyres are softs, not med\'s like original bcg\r\n[b:59d49153e4].[/b:59d49153e4]  Range is shithouse, like less than 3 meters (6ft)\r\n[b:59d49153e4].[/b:59d49153e4]  Last command is "remebered" when gioing out of range (as stated above)\r\n[b:59d49153e4].[/b:59d49153e4]  Car keeps it\'s charge very well.  I can pickup where I left off from hours ago and the car still runs.\r\n[b:59d49153e4].[/b:59d49153e4]  Can\'t do an internal dual cell to the chassis due to a smaller body cavity.\r\n\r\nMy overall view is that it is shit.   Save your money and just get the pullbacks for the shells. :( \r\n\r\n(deflated) ph2t.');
