INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (19474, '58454fa94c', '', 'Well, the other day I was at a big lots in Springfield and I FOUND \'EM!!!!!!!\r\n\r\nSo, I picked up 2 for me (1 truck of each freq.) and 1 blue (27) truck for a friend of mine.  Well, mine work fine, and I freaking love \'em.  I got about 30\' of range straight on my 49 Mhz one.  The only problem is, is that my friends controller doesn\'t work right.  Like, you can charge the car up on it, and when you have it on and hit a button, the LED goes on, however, no signal is sent out.  So, unless one of you guys knows what I am talking about and could help me fix the problem, or send me a spare 27 Mhz controller, (I knew I shouldda gotten that micro sizer one at the hobby shop laying there) I am going to return it for a different one.  I felt really bad for him though, it kinda blows.');
