INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (19485, '31e6f15516', 'Saving The Prototype', 'So I started building a prototype car...\r\nas I\'ve been doing lately, this one was an experimental paint job as well...\r\nnear the end - it really looked like shiat - I was furious.\r\nSo I tried to save her - did an okay job - but woulda looked hella better if I woulda just done this in the first place!\r\noh well - so goes life in the bit world.\r\nhere\'s my prototype car.\r\nit was made from an accord wagon\r\n[img:31e6f15516]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/bits/cabowabo/accord_wagon/shot1.jpg[/img:31e6f15516]\r\n[img:31e6f15516]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/bits/cabowabo/accord_wagon/shot2.jpg[/img:31e6f15516]\r\n[img:31e6f15516]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/bits/cabowabo/accord_wagon/shot3.jpg[/img:31e6f15516]\r\n[img:31e6f15516]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/bits/cabowabo/accord_wagon/shot4.jpg[/img:31e6f15516]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (19486, '4f7f1ee274', '', '[quote:4f7f1ee274="sessiz"]White owls and dutchies, choclate dutchies were the shit. I dunno about that westsider blunt, sounds more like a spliff to me. :-) \r\nMaybe payaso can edumatate us a lil bit. :???:[/quote:4f7f1ee274]\r\n\r\n\r\nWell, down here, and in STL, a BLUNT is straight herbs rolled in a tobacco leaf... (honey flavored are the best)\r\n\r\nAnything rolled in a paper with tobacco is just somebody trying to saver the stash... (wasting it)  IMO...\r\n\r\n\r\nA real blunt costs about $20 to make...\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
