INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (19500, '2f395e6d0d', '', '[quote:2f395e6d0d="payaso"][quote:2f395e6d0d="sessiz"]White owls and dutchies, choclate dutchies were the shit. I dunno about that westsider blunt, sounds more like a spliff to me. :-) \r\nMaybe payaso can edumatate us a lil bit. :???:[/quote:2f395e6d0d]\r\n\r\n\r\nWell, down here, and in STL, a BLUNT is straight herbs rolled in a tobacco leaf... (honey flavored are the best)\r\n\r\nAnything rolled in a paper with tobacco is just somebody trying to saver the stash... (wasting it)  IMO...\r\n\r\n\r\nA real blunt costs about $20 to make...\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D[/quote:2f395e6d0d]\r\n\r\nI agree about the papers. I used to hate it when kids would pull out a pack of papers and start rollin up. Allthough Big bambus were allright. still though, the burn is quick when compared to a fatty blunt.\r\n\r\n@payaso- Do yall down there break and roll the blunts or just scoop and stuff?\r\n\r\nIt\'s been years since I smoked my last. I should be at the point now were an 8th\'ll do me. I think I might pick me up a sack. :???:');
