INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (19506, 'f9d58f44ea', 'Old or Crappy MicroSizer?', 'I was in a local toy store today and I saw a MicroSizer so I one and brought it home (It was 35.99) Well it was an RX-7 and I assumed it was an MS pro. When I opened it up and saw [b:f9d58f44ea]there was no booster[/b:f9d58f44ea] I was like WTF? Then I thought well I guess its a Sport but that can\'t be right it was an RX-7 and I checked all the manuals they said nothing  about Pro, sport, or Auto Modelista. I was like WTF [b:f9d58f44ea]again[/b:f9d58f44ea]. Then I get it running with a ZZ 2.8 it sputters and doesn\'t go constantly. Again...[b:f9d58f44ea]WTF?!?[/b:f9d58f44ea] I\'m kinda pissed by such a [b:f9d58f44ea]RIP![/b:f9d58f44ea]  \r\n\r\nI ask you is this an Old MS or just a P.O.S Sport?\r\n\r\nI never suspected my favorite toy store when i was little  to [b:f9d58f44ea]RIP ME OFF LIKE THAT![/b:f9d58f44ea]\r\n\r\n :sad: - :(');
