INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (19532, 'd3ae821c68', 'Shen batt. trouble', 'I got home with my new 12 dollar shen and i carged her up and let it loose on the kichen floor or so i thouhgt i hit it and it ran for 5 feet and stoped and charged it again and same result, so i was like wtf? i have an old ms with the tabs cut off (dont ask i got a little cut happy with my swissy) so i take its batt. and put it in the shen and now it works fine. So what do you think was wrong or was it just a pos batt.?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (19533, '782209da65', '', '[quote:782209da65="Bit boy"]no offense chees but Boo-Freakin-Hoo! Didnt you check the box before you bought it?[/quote:782209da65]\r\n\r\nWell we were about to check out when I saw it and I look at the box and pretty much assumed it was an MS Pro.  Il have to watch mah self next time  :lol: .\r\n\r\n\r\nEDIT: Lol I lost the motor that came with it so I popped in a ZZ 3.5 and my it screams!  :eek: Then I popped in a 100 NiMH Battery in it and I\'ve been playing with it for atleast 15 and I never had to charge  :eek: . Oddly only some ZZ motors fit like my 3.4 didn\'t fit  :( . But now i got a huge axle slipping problem. If it crashes into a wall in my track it slips and if u touch it and apply just the tiniest presure to the rear and off it goes.  I tried the methods of anti-slip that work fine on ZZ\'s. I stuck so electrical tape by the hole and pushed it in but if i push it as far a it needs to go the axle won\'t turn.  But man this thing is pimped speed with the 2.3! I flipped and did awesome drift stops  :smile: . Anyone got help with my axle prob?\r\n\r\nI\'ll have to go get an MS Pro soon! I wanna c that turbo booster lol!');
