INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (38291, '5ebdac86c7', 'Check out what the BitPimps crew is up to (contest involved)', 'Hey guys, just want to let you know we\'ve been busy building up the BitPimp\'s crew galleries, to give you guys a chance to see some of the finest collections on the net.\r\n\r\nWe\'ve invited some of the top builders that have been long time contributers to add they\'re own galleries. So it\'s really worth your while to check out.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php?cat=1\r\n...and there\'s more to come...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nJust to make things more interesting, we want to give everyone a chance to get involved. So we put together this little contest, that should be pretty fun if you kick back and get into it.\r\n\r\n[b:5ebdac86c7]The Contest[/b:5ebdac86c7]\r\nIt\'s a picture story contest. Put together a series of pictures involving your cars, that tell a story. Top ten entries will go into the crew galleries here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php?cat=10019\r\n\r\nI\'ve already got one in there as an example.\r\n\r\n[b:5ebdac86c7]The Prizes[/b:5ebdac86c7]\r\nI said it was a little contest, so there\'s little prizes, but hopefully you\'ll think these are cool.\r\n\r\n1st - 10 Homies, + an Article on the home page describing the events in your pictures.\r\n2nd - 6 Homies + your user name mentioned in above article.\r\n3rd - 4 Homies\r\n\r\n(I\'ll try to make them unique sets, but due to the nature of the gumball machine, you may get some doubles.)\r\n\r\n\r\n[b:5ebdac86c7]The Rules[/b:5ebdac86c7]\r\nGet your cars, grab your Homies, and/or whatever props you want to use. Bring your dog, we don\'t care, and make a scene.\r\n\r\nIt must be a series pictures so at least 2 or 3 pictures. We\'ll say no more than 10.\r\n\r\nEntries will be judged by (In no particular order):\r\nCreativity\r\nHumour\r\nCool factor\r\nOverall quality and visual appeal.\r\n\r\nYou [i:5ebdac86c7]will not[/i:5ebdac86c7] be judged by the quality of your cars or the number of Homies. ;)\r\n\r\nContest will be judged by me, Cabo and any of the Bit Pimps moderators who wish to help us. Therefore contest will be open to everyone, but BitPimps moderators.\r\n\r\nIf you need help getting your images on the net, please refer to the Faq forum.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewforum.php?f=28\r\n\r\nTo enter just post the URL to your pictures in this thread.\r\n\r\n[b:5ebdac86c7]Start Date[/b:5ebdac86c7]\r\nUmmm, we\'ll say right now.\r\n\r\n[b:5ebdac86c7]End date[/b:5ebdac86c7]\r\nApril 1st  12:00 PM \r\n\r\nAny questions post \'em here.\r\n\r\nNow get to it.  :-)');
