INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (19954, '1aec4ab0ac', '', '[quote:1aec4ab0ac="CaboWabo"]LMFAO\r\n\r\nit\'s like how those people get freaked out by smiling clown dolls...\r\nexcept this one\'s way more trippy, you can probably find her at the "local watering hole" (make sure it\'s the seediest dive around) she\'s got her own stool and she\'s waiting for john and the boys to show up for darts[/quote:1aec4ab0ac]\r\n\r\nAnd her name is candy.\r\nI learned how to play darts from her. I learned how to throw underhand and what not.\r\nI was a gofor at a local neighborhood bar (Iffy\'s place) when I was 13. My first job :sad: \r\nI got cigs and sandwiches and shit for the bar flies. I got a hefty $10 a day for a couple of hours of playin darts and putting quarters into the juke for the fellas. Now that I reflect I\'m glad as all fuck I didn\'t get molested by some of those filthy bums.\r\nCandy was cool though. :-)');
