INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (39361, '62182ff7fe', '', 'First, I\'d like to point out how I began that post:   \r\n[quote:62182ff7fe="Bird"]In that kids defense[/quote:62182ff7fe]\r\nThat said, I\'d like to let you know that I was\'nt bringing into question Goku\'s knowledge or lack of or whatever. He probably knows more about all this micro stuff than a few of us adult newbies, I\'ll be the first to admit. What I was trying to illustrate was that maybe it\'s the way he PRESENTS himself that turns people off, and I did\'nt think the treatment he got at WGU was fair, regardless of past dealings or whatever. I was\'nt around for that, so I\'m by no means implying that they had no reason to do what they did, I was just saying that I thought he deserved a little more than "strike 1, 2, 3- now you\'re an example".\r\n                              That was harsh. \r\nI have no ill will towards anyone on any forum or whatever. This is the only one I post on, because I see a really tight group of laid-back guys that I can relate to. I don\'t get that feel anywhere else. Everywhere else I get an outsider feel, maybe it\'s the hood-rat in me that makes me feel like I belong here.\r\nWhatever, in the end it\'s all just a matter of opinion, and you know what they say about opinions being like assholes.... everybody has one....');
