INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (20073, 'e19c37be1a', '', 'Couple more things I wanted to bring up;\r\n\r\nI thought since the mosfets to allow more current to flow, that the battery would drain faster, but it actually runs longer. that\'s because the electrcity is not being burned off as heat build up from resistance.\r\n\r\nAlso, I don\'t notice any difference in foward speed, between the first with the partial mosfetted reverse, and the second, that I did the full foward, and reverse mosfet mod on. I\'m thinking it\'s waste of mosfets to do reverse, and it might be better to put those toward the steering. What you guys think?');
