INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (20230, 'a0214c2d87', 'Contest: Who Say\'s You Can\'t Polish A Turd?', 'Well we sure didn\'t!\r\nWe\'re goin ghetto this time pimps...\r\n\r\nHere it be - yet another contest for all you pimps to be enterin and flossin da skills that pay da bills!\r\n\r\n[b:a0214c2d87]Contest:[/b:a0214c2d87]\r\nWho Say\'s You Can\'t Polish A Turd?\r\n\r\n[b:a0214c2d87]Start Date:[/b:a0214c2d87]\r\nTuesday, August 5, 2003 @ 7:00 PM (CST)\r\n\r\n[b:a0214c2d87]End Date:[/b:a0214c2d87]\r\nFriday, August 29, 2003 @ 7:00 PM (CST)\r\n\r\n[b:a0214c2d87]Prizes:[/b:a0214c2d87]\r\n[i:a0214c2d87]1st place[/i:a0214c2d87]\r\nThe infamous "Butt Char-G"\r\n[img:a0214c2d87]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/contests/pimpin_ride/hogjowlz_2_1.jpg[/img:a0214c2d87]\r\n[img:a0214c2d87]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/contests/pimpin_ride/hogjowlz_2_2.jpg[/img:a0214c2d87]\r\n\r\n[i:a0214c2d87]2nd place[/i:a0214c2d87]\r\n4 various clone motors\r\n\r\n[i:a0214c2d87]3rd place[/i:a0214c2d87]\r\nbag of random clone parts\r\n\r\n[b:a0214c2d87]Rules:[/b:a0214c2d87]\r\n- Only clone micro r/c cars allowed, no zip zaps allowed\r\n- No Tomy or MicroSizer parts, bodies, chassis, etc. allowed\r\n- 2 entries per user (you are allowed to enter 2 cars in the contest - that is all)\r\n- Must have at least 4 images to prove it is a clone and it is yours, those images must be\r\n[color=red:a0214c2d87]1 shot of the top of the chassis\r\n1 shot of the bottom of the chassis\r\n1 shot of the underside of the shell (body)\r\nand at least 1 shot with your username and "bitPimps" on a piece in the same image as your entry[/color:a0214c2d87]\r\n([url=http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=654][b:a0214c2d87]Click here for some examples[/b:a0214c2d87][/url])\r\n- You can post as many photos of your entry as you feel necessary. \r\n- Only registered users may enter. (bitPimps admins and moderators not eligable)\r\n\r\n[b:a0214c2d87]Judging Criteria:[/b:a0214c2d87] (in no specific order)\r\n- Overall transformation from bad to good\r\n- Mod content\r\n- Paint Job\r\n- Functionality\r\n- Originality\r\n- Sexuality &amp; Pimp-tude (sleek, smoove, sexy, all of it)\r\n\r\n[b:a0214c2d87]* NOTE:[/b:a0214c2d87]\r\nWe require valid entry photo\'s to ensure that people don\'t \'snag\' a picture from another site, of a car that isn\'t theirs.\r\n\r\nAnd there you have it!\r\nHave fun and enjoy gang - dat\'s what all dis ill schizzle dat\'s off the hizzle dizzle fur rizzle is fo!\r\n\r\nThe judges still have hair left to pull out when it comes time to judge...\r\nso you pimps can bring it like you have before in previous contests! :cool:');
