INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44316, '81ba23e83a', '', 'I actually bought a couple shen clones for my nieces last Christmas. I like them so much I got one for myself. Then I came across the RS SE\'s and had to have one. They reminded me so much of the slot cars I had as a kid. Since then I\'ve been hooked.\r\n\r\nSo I got curious, did a search on Google similar to what filelicker did. Came across bitpimps. Me and my boy Mike (two grown men in their early thirties) sat their for hours checking out the pimp galleries... laughing our asses off the videos (and smart ass comments in the forums)and staring in awe at the amazing mods that can be accomplished with these tiny cars. This site is the hands-down winner for originality and pure entertainment as far as micro rc sites go.\r\n\r\nSo I was hooked. Although I am more of a bit collector than modifier at this point, not a work day goes by that I don\'t log-in and see what\'s up.');
