INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (38979, '2631a7d0a8', '', 'Well, I\'ll tell ya ph2t, this prize thing has taken on a life of it\'s own. CJ stepped up with a brand-new, bad ass, covetable ZZ SE Starsky and Hutch car. Betty.k is putting up a not-yet-annouced prize (coming this weekend), but y\'all know his specialty. Sessiz will be lending his talents to create excellent prizes. I know hue35 and I both felt like we couldn\'t pass off average or unremarkable work for the discerning participants of this contest, so I understand how ya feel. If it makes it any easier, we already will have 4 complete cars as prizes, so don\'t feel like you need to go over the top. But if you want to I won\'t stop ya. :eek: \r\n\r\nThe only thing that worries me is that we\'ll have more prizes than participants. I hope Nox and kwikbb are getting busy.  :???: \r\n\r\nAs I mentioned before, I will post complete rules, timelines, prizes and contest criteria this weekend. Rather than assign prizes to 1st, 2nd, 3rd, etc., the 1st place winner will get to choose first, second place can choose from what\'s left, etc. Can you imagine coming in 4th place and getting a custom painted, mosfetted, tricked out car? :-D');
