INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (20321, 'f2b39f0dd9', '', 'Got mine today. Took exactly a week. I love ToyEast.\r\n\r\nBoth cars look damn nice, the Jota is just a sexy bitch, and I like the FD3S a lot more than I thought I would. It\'s cool the vents are cutout on the front.\r\n\r\n[img:f2b39f0dd9]http://members.cox.net/crazylittlecars/rx7fd3s.jpg[/img:f2b39f0dd9]\r\n[img:f2b39f0dd9]http://members.cox.net/crazylittlecars/jota1.jpg[/img:f2b39f0dd9]\r\n\r\nI was really impressed with the power and handling of the cars, and the 4.2 is really fast, even though the first one I tried was squeally. I also bought a 4.2 pro I haven\'t tried yet, so we\'ll see if that is torquier as promised.\r\n\r\nI race in a small areas, so range seemed ok. It did glitch a couple times, and my car started off in crazy circles. That was pretty annoying.\r\n\r\nMy biggest bitch is that they don\'t fit my charger bases, and I don\'t like to charge off my controller to keep its batteries fresh.\r\n\r\nI guess I\'m going to have to come up with something. Maybe I\'ll just put a jack on my controllers so I can plug my power source in when I want to charge.\r\n\r\nStill, all in all, I\'d say it was money well spent. I\'m happy.');
