INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (20816, '693e54f573', '', 'Aight pimps, you asked for it you got it. Hue35 and I just ordered a shitload of parts and cars. So if you want just MOSFETS to DIY, we got that. If you want a pre-modded MS, we\'ll have those too. There will be an equal amount of 27 and 49 cars, and the available bodies will be yellow lancer, white skyline, black celica and green clovers. I mean red lancer. \r\n\r\nIt will take a week or two to get all the stuff and get the mods done, but we\'ll post when they\'re available for shipping. It will be first come, first serve, and money talks. If you want to pre-order a particualr frequency or body (they do go hand in hand, you know), let one of us know via PM or post it here and we\'ll reserve it for you. As hue mentioned they\'ll be $30-$35 bucks, we\'ll know fo sure once we get a shipping cost. This is all subject to minor change, but we\'ll keep ya posted.\r\n\r\nOh yeah, Payaso, MS does make boosters, they\'re the Pros. We\'re thinking about ordering some stuff from TE, so we could get some boost cars in alternate frequencies and mosfet mod them, but we\'d probably need to get some cash up front so we\'re not left holding. Let us know.');
