INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (20446, '56794efd1a', '', 'bro you obviously dont noe anything about BATTLES im  not tryin to make a ja rule song here im BATTLIN...how bout you show me what you got kid..before you start spitin trash..heres a song i wrote awhile ago in class....\r\n\r\nYo, it was me and GES, right. On a tuesday night\r\nHad green, brown, black, two blue shades and white\r\nBORE stayed home but IA crew stay tight\r\nStaking out the steel dragon for a true spray fight\r\nIn other words a backjump\r\nWishing that we wouldn\'t bumb into them wack chumps\r\nCause the lay-ups getting crowded after sunset\r\nWhich is cool but get in line cause it ain\'t your fucking turn yet\r\nGotta burn shit can\'t come up with no lame style piece\r\nIf you wanna tame the wild beast\r\nHad better burn murder the red worm spread germs in the system\r\nto make heads turn\r\nAnd snap necks at the central stations\r\nYoung kids making cops run like mental patients\r\nDon\'t they know that graffiti can\'t be stopped\r\nWriters unlike rappers can\'t go pop\r\nSo they stay underground till the day graff is legalized\r\nCivil eyes look upon us as evil guys\r\nThough we trod one away on third rails in front of metal giants\r\nDeath defiant to cops we keep lying\r\nIn the bushes ambushes being plotted clean trains being spotted\r\nsigned like there was dotted\r\nLines on the sides of the iron monsters\r\nRepresenting 2X mafia, call us bombsters\r\n\r\ntheres more but im tired of typing if theres a request for more just ask and ill type the rest cuz i have it in a note book lol :cool:\r\n*edit Badboy i was laughin so hard man no good rapers of the 80s? i think rap and hip hop was the BEST in the 80s now rap turned into bitchin about dead homies drugs and cars....what the fuck that isnt rap! dont forget about the legendary KRS-ONE, A TRIBE CALLED QUEST, GRAND MASTER FLASH, CURTIS BLOW, THE B-BOYS(Not beastie boys but the B-boys), MOTHA FUCKIN MC HAMMER YALL!, NWA, HASHIM, HERBIE HANCOCK and more....');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (20447, 'f4e4548bbf', '', '[quote:f4e4548bbf]wut if we b sendin u r cars and controllers so you can do it 4 us? i\'d pay for shipping+labor+parts. whats time estimation on 1 of these for a MS chassis? and how much would it cost?\r\n[/quote:f4e4548bbf]\r\n\r\nI would only need the controller. But, NB: I do not know how to do it . I\'m selling my current booster (to a local)so i cant fiddle with that. So I\'ll have to wait until I get the order from TE, THEN Figure it out.\r\n\r\nI wud gladly do it once I get confident enough (so I wunt trash other ppl\'s stuff :lol: ). \r\n\r\nSo on that note, I\'ll keep the hood posted  :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (20448, '584f1ef9c3', '', 'SilentWolv - this is looking like one hell of of mother of a track. When I checked out your initial drawing I thought - "What the fck is this ?". How wrong could a guy be ? I keep checking out the tracks forum JUST TO SEE IF YOU POST MORE PICTURES ! How sad is that ?\r\n\r\nAnyway, for what its worth my advice to anyone making their own track is - don\'t use hardboard. It  warps. It took me about 8 hours to make and about 1 week later it was warped to fck. Took me about 2 minutes to rip it apart. Whooped its hardboard bitch ass.....\r\n\r\nI\'m now taking the lazy route and waiting for the Bonzer Mat to come out. If it ever does ......\r\n\r\nSo, keep posting more pictures. I hope youv\'e got a camcorder too as an mpeg of the finished product would be coooool.');
