INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (38192, '145d5cd1fb', '', '[quote:145d5cd1fb="CaboWabo"]homework assignment for SuperFly:\r\ndo 5 chips ahoy hits in a row\r\n\r\nhomework assignment for hue35:\r\ndo 2 "st. louie" style b-hits... as close together as you can\r\n\r\n\r\nrepeat every 45 minutes\r\nnow resume normal habits lol[/quote:145d5cd1fb]\r\n\r\n\r\nWell, we did our homework Monday evening... SuperFly looked pretty frustrated with the chips ahoy method, and I almost passed out and barfed simultaneously goin\' the "st. louie" route... I have feeling we\'ll be back to our respective "normal" methods straight away. \r\n\r\nWhat I learned is, while I [i:145d5cd1fb]am[/i:145d5cd1fb] a weed pussy (sure, I can admit it), my sack lasts longer. So I got that goin\' for me... which is nice.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (38191, '83eeadb05e', '', '[quote:83eeadb05e="betty.k"]this topic is a good example of why it\'s good to show off your disasters as well as your masterpieces, gives everyone a chance to turn on the knowledge fountain. :???: \r\nson g, i think you\'re gonna have to strip that sucker back and start again :sad:  i\'ve done it with a toothbrush and turpentine and all the paint came off. BUT the clear plastic becomes cloudy making the windows a bit ugly. i just paint them black in that case, better to have a smooth job than clear windows. also, use rubber gloves when cleaning with turps or you will leave finger prints in the plastic as the plastic becomes a little softened from the turps. wash thouroughly with warm soapy water and the toothbrush and allow to stand for about a day just to be sure the turps has evaporated completely. keep us posted, we all wanna see you succeed with you\'re painting! :-)[/quote:83eeadb05e]\r\n\r\nThanks betty.....I think I\'ll just use paint thinner....will that work?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (20469, '77a26dc1e8', 'Nox\'s NSX', 'Yea know.....all of ya have had these \'pullbacks\' for awhile now.\r\nI have seen most for tire exchanges with bits.\r\n\r\nwell I got one in my last \'Far East\' order....\r\nA NSX (one of the sweetest cars on the streets today).\r\n\r\nWell, I really like this \'pullback\' series. Just as a toy by itself.\r\nI could see having races and jumps without the electronics.\r\n\r\nWell, I\'m starting to feel like C-Dave again...(wordy).\r\nI\'ll talk more as I warm up to you homies..\r\n\r\nI\'m posting this now...as I see a MOD coming with this body/tires.\r\n\r\n[img:77a26dc1e8]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/pullbacknsx.jpg[/img:77a26dc1e8]\r\n\r\n-nox');
