INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (38187, 'b9cc246ea1', '', '[quote:b9cc246ea1="crazydave"][quote:b9cc246ea1="payaso"]i do however do own a mini Z OL, and that will rock the walls of a X-Mod...lol[/quote:b9cc246ea1]Oh well I bet it will...\r\n\r\n...no wonder you never had an interest in a Xmod. :lol:[/quote:b9cc246ea1]\r\n\r\nWell, I actually test drove a x mod when they came out, and wasn\'t impressed with it, so I just canceled that thought.\r\n\r\npimpike seeing my dilema, hooked me up big time with the BMW X5 OL....\r\n\r\nLet me tell you, I\'ve had it about a week now, and this thing will whip some serious ass..\r\n\r\nI tested my 50th Ann Corvette against "Grunges" Hopped up X-Mod, and my vette was just dancing circles around it. we were both like in amazement.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
