INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (20627, 'e5e46678b2', '', 'As far as being parallel, I don\'t think they are because there is three cells in the pack and it is 3.6 volts, total MAH 360.\r\n\r\nIt is basically 4 bucks a battery, which isn\'t too bad, considering some 3rd party shops sell stock replacements for up to 5 bucks...\r\n\r\nIf you buy, you\'ll have to buy three at a time cos they are prepacked in a cell.\r\n\r\nI think it will work, so I\'ll need to get the number.  But for now, Basically, go to RS, ask them for the phone battery that is three coin cells wired flat triangle shape.\r\nThe pack is white cased, the closest thing I found on the webpage is this:\r\n\r\nhttp://www.radioshack.com/product.asp?catalog%5Fname=CTLG&amp;category%5Fname=CTLG%5F009%5F007%5F007%5F000&amp;product%5Fid=23%2D296\r\n\r\nThe pack at my local RS may be discontinued or in store only, I\'ll check today for the number.\r\n\r\nThey should be easy as pie to take apart as the case is a plastic snap case that they are in.  I believe the price is 11.99 for the pack.\r\n\r\nI came across it trying to find a way to get 4.8volt packs small enough and prewired for my Viper/truck project.  \r\n\r\nMy guy said that if you snap it apart, the three cells have pre assemebled tabs and the batts will just come apart fine.\r\n\r\nWho ever said RS didn\'t sell cool stuff????...God I love that store, and it helps when you have a kick ass cool manager....who gives you heads up like XMods, ZZ SE/2.0 and talks zips and stuff with you all the time... :-D \r\n\r\nI\'ll try to get a number today.\r\n\r\nHolla\r\n\r\nBen Folds');
