INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (20651, '4514b7c12f', '\'Super\' Microsizer', 'We\'ve all seen the new Super Bit Char-Gs, now here\'s my Super Microsizer...\r\n\r\nPorshe 911 GT2 body, mosfet mod, Perfection 4.2 Pro, and pullback rims make this puppy one bad mofo. Bring your Super Bits on. I\'m ready. :-)  8-) \r\n\r\n[img:4514b7c12f]http://erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/superms.jpg[/img:4514b7c12f]\r\n\r\nI didn\'t have the pullbacks out of the package more than 10 minutes, before I became really irritated with how high the Porshe body sat. So I got the hacking, and lowered that puppy. \r\n\r\nWhile I was mod mode, I jumped on the pullback wheel coversion. I did the less nicer looking Countach rims first, and spray painted them silver. I was disappointed I thought the Countach pullback had Countach rims. (The 5-hole type), but they look pretty nice with this body, now that they\'re painted.\r\n[img:4514b7c12f]http://erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/superms1.jpg[/img:4514b7c12f]\r\nI love the way the pullback wheels fill out the rear wheel wells on the 911.');
