INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (20720, '689668846d', '', 'I\'m talkin about an old-skool MS for $35... maybe $30. I\'m just thinkin\' out loud at this point, I guess. We\'re pretty comfortable with the regular MS PCB right now... the pros are different, and remember, we\'re sub-geniuses. Basically, I was figuring cost of car+parts+shipping+$10 - $15 or so for our time (order stuff, do mod, package \'em up, stand in line at the post office)... again, just thinkin\' out loud. If we did any, I think we\'d want to do a them all at once based on interest... that way we could keep the cost down per car quite a bit. We wouldn\'t be doing it to make money, just cover our costs with enough left over for a short sack.\r\n\r\nI still think you guys could do it... Cabo, I\'ve seen the attention you pay to detail. I\'m going to post a tutorial on a simplified version for a regular MS soon. My fuck-ups ended up leading to a version that boosts fwd only, and uses only 2 mosfets. One is a direct swap on the top side of the board and the other is glued to the bottom with 2 wires soldered to it. \r\n\r\nSorry for the rambling,\r\n\r\nhue35');
