INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (20786, 'dc6c71355c', '', '[quote:dc6c71355c="hue35"]Wow Dave, that thing looks mean spirited. It looks SO much better lowered, and the silver makes those wheel perfect for the car. Based on the pictures I\'ve seen up to now, I wasn\'t sure I liked the GT2. Now I\'m sure I need one. How does it handle?\r\n\r\nedit: I can\'t stop looking at that shot of the back end... that is [u:dc6c71355c]BAD ASS[/u:dc6c71355c]![/quote:dc6c71355c]It handle really good. It turns kinda wide because the rear end is hooking up so good, but if you tap the throttle it makes tighter turns.\r\n\r\nIt\'s difficult to flip even with the mosfets, and 4.2, which combined should flip this car easily. Definately my best handleing car, for a wheelie popping beast.\r\n\r\n...and yeah, I meant to say that the rear end looked bad ass, you took the wording out of my mouth.\r\n\r\n\r\nMy alloys showed up today. Figures, but I pretty much knew they would. It\'s too late for this body, I spent too much time lowering it, and I\'m alomost positive 10mm rims are not going to fit under it now. ;)');
