INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (38109, 'b09106fca9', '', '[quote:b09106fca9="SuperFly"]OK, here\'s the deal. The contest is definitely on, but as the moderators who\'ve run contests before know, there\'s quite a few details to iron out first. While micromatch started this thread, I\'m going to run with the concept and organize the dealio. Here\'s what I\'m thinking so far:\r\n\r\n1. ph2t, hue35 and myself are putting up prizes. If anyone else is interested in helping out here, let me know.\r\n\r\n2. There will be a 1st, 2nd and 3rd place, but rather than pre-assign prizes to places, we thought we would let the first place winner pick first and so on.\r\n\r\n3. Rather than have a poll to determine the winner, I will be assembling a small pool of judges, based on board participation. I simply feel that there are enough qualified "regular" pimps to decide whose work is the best rather than opening it up to anyone with an internet connection. \r\n\r\n4. Because I feel like we can\'t officially kick this off until we can post up the prizes, the deadline will be determined later. The prizes are handbuilt, custom items that can\'t be rushed, and the moderators deserve top-notch prizes. If you don\'t think that puts a fair amount of pressure on the creation of prizes, go ahead and volunteer a prize and send it to me. :-) \r\n\r\nI\'m estimating that the prizes will be done by the end of the month, and the deadline will be at the end of March, but I can\'t promise anything until I have all the prizes in hand.\r\n\r\nIf anyone has input or suggestions, feel free to PM me, though there\'s no guarantee I will incorporate them[/quote:b09106fca9]\r\n\r\n\r\nSuperfly, Id like to volunteer as a judge.  EH HERM.... here\'s a summary of my resume.\r\n\r\n1. Ive been with and loved Micro R/C for almost 3 and a half years.\r\n2. I visit the forums atleast 3 times a day, \r\n3. I have been following the bitpimps forum for a long while now, (far before i became a member)\r\n4. Ive seen a countless number of all of your mods and have modded my own cars with these techniques, therefore making me very familiar with them.\r\n5. I am very well literate within the standards of the english language.\r\n6. I think im a prime cantidate for a judge.\r\n\r\nWell i dont know if i\'ll even be put up for judge, but if i get to be one i will do the best job i can do. Whoa! I feel like im at a job interview  :-D .');
