INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (20951, '9135f297c3', 'ph2t i remember you talking about neutral brake custom', 'pic 1 needed* Circuit explanation The right figure is the normal circuit. At the time of neutral on the both ends of the motor becoming a state where voltage is not required, it increases.\r\n\r\nWell when the brake is used on the motor, the terminal is short-circuited. When it adds that to the circuit the right, when it becomes..., in the circuit of this "neutral non voltage" it is difficult. Being to be, first "neutral +B" or it makes the circuit "of neutral GND". This time, "neutral +B" it did.\r\n\r\nWhen "neutral +B" is, +B the circuit by way of, it is the case that it is short-circuited, but the transistor (FET? ) It flows only under from above. Being to be, it adds also the diode for reverse current.\r\n\r\n\r\npic 2 needed So, the fact that it is completed is the circuit in the right figure. Modification on the baseplate is held down to minimum. The &amp;#12414;, this is the circuit of &amp;#12458;&amp;#12461;&amp;#12510;&amp;#12522;, but....\r\n\r\nThe distribution cord on the baseplate is modified a little, the diode two has been added. As for this diode..., the &amp;#12387; &amp;#12369; which is what (laughing). You think that they are extremely normal ones with person something which with 10 is bought for about 50 Yen but it is.\r\n\r\n\r\n* Remodelling on baseplateThe &amp;#12385;&amp;#12421; &amp;#12358; or the baseplate upper limbs without remodelling, the shank.\r\n\r\n\r\npic 3 needed* Surface\r\n Chip resistor of the right figure 2 place is removed. The urethane (the black person) being piled up, being to be a &amp;#12427; case it shaves the condenser of the left side. I buy, choosing the body which the coconut is not piled up excessively but....\r\n\r\nAs for the part which you remove being to reuse, way you do not throw away.\r\n\r\n\r\npic 4 needed First it solders the chip capacitor of the left side, in the anterior terminal of the right line foremost transistor. And you attach the cord/code to one side, you connect to the land of the left side on the baseplate which is removed.\r\n\r\nThe solder it attaches the condenser of the right side sideways in the land the rear section, from before the right line solders one side already in the anterior terminal of the 2nd transistor. Just it replaces &amp;#12467;&amp;#12452;&amp;#12484; is sideways.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n* Underside\r\npic 5 needed Anode side of the diode, cathode side is connected to "+B" in the respective terminal of "F" of the motor and "R". Like photograph with suitable feeling.\r\n\r\nWith well, it is simple remodelling.\r\n\r\npic 1[img:9135f297c3]http://www.age.jp/%7Eex2/bit/09/09_1_00.gif[/img:9135f297c3]\r\n\r\npic 2[img:9135f297c3]http://www.age.jp/%7Eex2/bit/09/09_1_01.gif[/img:9135f297c3]\r\n\r\npic 3[img:9135f297c3]http://www.age.jp/%7Eex2/bit/09/09_1_02.jpg[/img:9135f297c3]\r\n\r\npic 4[img:9135f297c3]http://www.age.jp/%7Eex2/bit/09/09_1_03.jpg[/img:9135f297c3]\r\n\r\npic 5[img:9135f297c3]http://www.age.jp/%7Eex2/bit/09/09_1_04.jpg[/img:9135f297c3]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (20952, 'e9b104e193', '', 'I think it depends on the surface you are driving on. On a super-smooth surface, the stock tires have more grip because there is more of the tire\'s surface area making contact with the driving surface. The soft tires have a bit of tread and would grip better than stock tires on a rougher surface, like concrete or industrial carpet (the short, firm kind).');
