INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (21051, '8713f50c85', '2 Quick Rants', 'These are 2 things that rly bug me...\r\n\r\n1.[b:8713f50c85]A Hummer is  a shrunken civiliazed version of the military\'s Humvee availible for Civilians and a HumVee is a huge big ass vehical in Military service...THEY ARE DIFFRENT GET IT RIGHT!!! A HUMVEE IS NOT AND HUMMER AND A HUMMER IS NOT A HUMVEE!![/b:8713f50c85]\r\n\r\n2.[b:8713f50c85]NOS=Nitrous Oxide Systems® Its a friggen company not a mod for you car. Nitro=The mod for your car that injects n2o intro the conmbustion adding more oxigen to the mix and cuases your car to have an extreme boost of speed. Okay get it? NOS is a company, Nitrous is a car mod...GET IT RIGHT PEOPLE![/b:8713f50c85]\r\n\r\nI just needed to gripe about that cuz It\'s startting to get on my nerves... :?');
