INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (21158, '0194691882', '', 'well the white paint was ROCKIN. I\'m dead serious it is the best enamel i\'ve ever seen. It fricken roxorz. It\'s called Magic Spray Enamel or something. A bottle like a foot long costs 2 bucks, which beats the heck out of testors/tamiya acrylic. I was really afraid after my last spraypaint expedition, so i was more than a foot away when spraying, so my coats were going on real thin. after about 11 coats i let it dry. taht stuff shines like it has 18 clear coats on it, yet it retains all of its details. Amazing. But, i was impatient, and apparently i was daydreaming. It got too heavy in one area, and it looks like this boy is gonna get doused in pinesol/other remover soon.');
