INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (21297, 'f651b4908e', '', '[quote:f651b4908e="DarkTari"][quote:f651b4908e="TheEvo"]That\'s just.. No words.. \r\nAnyway...! WTF is styrene?[/quote:f651b4908e]\r\n\r\nStyrene is the material of opaque plastic used for the ground effects and other structual projects, usually white.  Comes in several different ticknesses. 0.20, 0.30, 0.60.  Other materials are:\r\n[b:f651b4908e]Butyrate [/b:f651b4908e]- Optically clear, easily cut, dimensionally stable. Great for model window glazing. \r\n[b:f651b4908e]Vivak[/b:f651b4908e] - Multipurpose high-strength clear plastic. Use for forming airplane canopies. \r\n[b:f651b4908e]Polycarbonate[/b:f651b4908e] - An unbreakable, high-temperature plastic. Ideal for forming engine cowls[/quote:f651b4908e]\r\n\r\nWhere can I pick up some DT?\r\n\r\nand Ahh5hit....you already know I think you\'re the shiznet...but damn son...I\'m liking that skyline ....and DT is right...its all about bein\' original.....a good example is my Shaggin\' Wagon :grin:');
