INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (21476, '7d7badbfb2', '', 'aight aight, I\'m setting the record straight...\r\nthese 2 cats are imposters, they came with my wife - they\'re not mine!\r\nSERIOUSLY damn it! :lol: \r\n\r\n[quote:7d7badbfb2]If you know more than six names of colors or four different types of dessert, you might as well be handing out free passes to your ass.[/quote:7d7badbfb2]now that\'s frickin funny! lol\r\n\r\nI\'ll go ahead and reveal another little juicey tid bit here...\r\n\r\nI know I\'m not the only one who won\'t poop at work!\r\nIt has nothing to do with the homosexual tendencies, and everything to do with the 3 gallons of piss and vomit covering the seat lid. Not to mention - get this - our urinal is straight up like billy madison small, no joke. and our shitter is like a frickin high chair for adults.\r\nmy god damned feet swing off the thing like I was 4!\r\nso I don\'t shit at work no mo.\r\n\r\nand here\'s the best I\'ve ever heard....\r\nthis dude I worked with figured out he made 30K in 1 year - sitting on the toilet...\r\nhow you ask?\r\neveryday he would go into the shitter, for about 3 hours and fall asleep.\r\nafter awhile, co-workers, bosses, etc. started getting suspicious so they asked him what was up...\r\nhe told them he\'s had some medical problems lately and can\'t seem to get rid of them. now that he know\'s people are on the look-out - he takes it another step further...\r\nnow he goes in to the shitter, closes the door, pulls down his pants to the floor, sits on the toilet and rests his elbows on his lap and his head in his hands - and falls asleep.\r\nhe got away with this for just about 1 year.\r\n\r\nthat kind of shit takes dedication - you gotta appreciate that! lol');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37981, '4ce222d4f4', '', 'yet to be proven man...gotta get the font wheels properly setup yet...\r\n\r\nHere\'s the battery layout...\r\n\r\n[img:4ce222d4f4]http://users.tpg.com.au/ph2t//bit_g/monster/tricell_layout.JPG[/img:4ce222d4f4]\r\n\r\nI use an old motor terminal contact.  just pull it out of the rear motor assembly and it\'s shaped well to sit over the top of the original terminal.   As noted on the diagram use electrical tape or similar to insulate the original -VE terminal from the  new contact.  It\'s all spaced out on the diagram but it fits, trust me..\r\n\r\nph2t.');
