INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37972, '683536dccd', '', 'u can try to make the chassis as low as possible. but then u only can use it on floor. suspension is really important, u need very soft if u don\'t want flipping. Or use 1/4 AAA batteries instead of 1/3 to reduce weight. Lower the body by use slot or tab lowering methods helps too.\r\nI use the side flap method. but now i use  transparent and thin strip of plastic so it\'s not that visible. and it work well.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37973, '242fe4ab0c', '', 'Thanks man.  :-) \r\n\r\nI didn\'t start out with the intention of the semi story, but you know that just sorta happens when the Homies get involved. :lol: \r\n\r\nI think it would be a good idea to use some in a news story. I was actually kinda thinking with some talk in General Bit Discussion about the members putting together some new stories, I was kinda hoping one of them would see the series and get the hint.\r\n\r\nOh and I forgot the funeral scene. I could still put that together.\r\n\r\nAnyways, glad you liked it, I thought it came out kinda cool.\r\n\r\n\r\n***Edit: A picture story gallery might be cool too. You know Midget Man would be down for that.  :lol:');
