INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41213, '1b85bdaacc', '', '[quote:1b85bdaacc="noxorc"][quote:1b85bdaacc="Bird"]Ever play Atari? [/quote:1b85bdaacc]\r\n\r\nthe better question is...do you still play with that 2600.?\r\n\r\nTank![/quote:1b85bdaacc]\r\n\r\nWe used to bust it out every so often, but it\'s been a good while, maybe like a year ago or so. It\'s still in good shape, though. I had a Turbo GrafX 16 from the late 80\'s that I sold to my older brother, and he still plays with that all the time, even though his kids have Playstation 2. I guess it\'s a nostalgia thing.');
