INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (21673, 'b26aa2291e', '', 'Hey guys, that was cool, and all, and the Traxxas T-Maxx is a killer car, but I was waiting for the huge airs, That was nothing...\r\n\r\nI had a Traxxas Stampede, that I used to run a 13-turn modified, and 7-cell pack, 17-tooth pinion, with a 78-tooth spur, and a Novak speed control, and I used go back and forth over this dirt hill, pulling 6+ ft. air. all day long. So that\'s just the norm for me.\r\n\r\nBack in \'98 there was an article in RC Car Action. They had a Traxxas Stampede, with a second battery pack (12 cells :eek:  ), that they were jumping it on a BMX track, and pulling 40+ ft. of air.  :eek: No shitting man, you could see a baseball back stop in the background, and it looked like the Stampede was clearing it.\r\n\r\nNow that\'s what I call a HUGE air.!');
