INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (21924, '29a45d3652', '', 'Well, for those interested, I did some fiddling and here is the end result.\r\n\r\nI had to high expectations for this car unfortunately. :-) \r\n\r\nI modded the motor down to an EM 1.0, which was 10 times better on the steering issue, but, was too slow for my tastes....so I did a EM 1.6, perfect speed, but it phucked the steering all up again....and since I have no motor in between, I think I am done with this one.... :-? With the 1.6 it wasn\'t as bad steering as stock, but still, not getting around my track any time soon...\r\n\r\nSo, that said, next time, I\'ll not have such high hopes for a car.  Wal Mart will get this kat back this weekend....\r\n\r\nHolla\r\n\r\nBam Bam Bigelow');
