INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (22010, '9aa667393a', '', 'I\'ve been getting the mosfets from [url=http://www.digikey.com/scripts/us/dksus.dll?Criteria?Ref=58611&amp;Cat=30933887]Digi-Key.com[/url]. If you want more than $25.00 worth, get them there. If you just want enough for a couple cars, PM me and I\'ll break you off some of ours.\r\n\r\nThanks for the shout, btw, but I\'ve got to give credit to pht2, Crazy Dave and left toe (as well as MicroAmps and various german dudes) for sharing the info as well. And to hue35 for helping me stumble through it. I\'m mostly coming at it from the angle that if I can do it, you can too!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37841, 'efbd92163c', '', 'I had a plant growing my window, but my mom made me get rid of it. She was cool, she didn\'t make me kill it, she just didn\'t want it in her house, so I gave it to my buddy and he killed it a week later.\r\n\r\nMy wife won\'t even let me keep a plant. :-( \r\n\r\nI did pull a Johnny Potseed manuever in my old apartment complex. The lawn service people were leaving a row of them under some Oleanders, where not too many people would see them, but they had to be seeing them when they trimmed the bush every week. There must have been anywhere between 50 to 100 of them. Some were getting about a foot high, before they finally hacked them down. But it would have been nasty stem-y weed anyways, since they weren\'t being pruned so they\'d bush out, but it was still a cool scene. Wish a had a camera at the time.\r\n\r\nI never had no big time hook up, I was always the quiet guy in the corner, with no money, but somehow I was always in the middle of everything, and drugs always just came to me.');
