INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37831, '3b24395e34', '', '[quote:3b24395e34="CaboWabo"]\r\n\r\nya feelin me?\r\n\r\nAmen![/quote:3b24395e34]\r\n\r\nYeah, I\'m feelin ya. I say \'back in the day\' far too often. I had a couple growing projects with friends that had some really nice yields. The law got pretty close to 2 of the projects, which made for some of the more serious drama in my life, can\'t say I miss that. I still have one metal halide light, a timer and some trays that I need to get rid of, but can\'t bring myself to throw them away.\r\n\r\nIt\'s funny, because I too have no photographic evidence of it. We knew a dude that got busted by a tip from the photo lab, so we never took any pictures. I fondly remember the tropical atmosphere, 80?, fans blowing, getting a tan, lol. :cool:');
