INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (22125, 'd4924a6711', '', '[quote:d4924a6711="CaboWabo"]yea dude, those came out great!\r\nthat just masking or a combo of hand touch-ups?[/quote:d4924a6711]My usual masking/spraypaint technique. I did touch up the headlights, because I masked a little too much of them and left a red line around them. The red in the hood line doesn\'t usually show, that\'s just the flash hitting it. I took these pics in  hurry before work. I\'m going to try to take some better ones.\r\n\r\nFor some reason I always do my best work on my hacker bodies. I\'m going to try to redo this on one of my good bodies. the Zip Zap S2000 maybe?\r\n\r\nWell thanks for the compliments, I appreciate them. :grin:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (22126, '3224adfa56', '', '[quote:3224adfa56="cj"]Found this.\r\n\r\n[quote:3224adfa56]\r\n[b:3224adfa56]RadioShack Launches ZipZaps SE as Next Generation of Popular Micro RC Cars; Headlights, Taillights and Six-Person Racing Takes Micro RCs to the Next Level[/b:3224adfa56]\r\nJuly 09, 2003 08:02:00 AM ET\r\n\r\nFORT WORTH, Texas, July 9 /PRNewswire-FirstCall/ -- Beginning this fall, RadioShack Corporation RSH will unveil ZipZaps SE (Special Edition), the next generation of micro RCs featuring the latest innovations in ZipZaps technology including six-person racing, headlights and taillights for nighttime racing and digital-proportional steering for precision maneuverability.\r\n \r\nIn addition to the ZipZaps SE line, RadioShack has licensed several new models as part of the original ZipZaps series. A green and yellow-gold Jeep Wrangler Starter Kit highlights the new line-up, while ZipZaps fans who love muscle cars will be thrilled to get their hands on the white and navy blue 2002 Chevrolet Camaro SS Starter Kit and the silver and black 2002 Pontiac Firebird Starter Kit. [b:3224adfa56]Paying tribute to the 35th anniversary of the Chevrolet Camaro SS, a Past and Present Body Kit including a 2002 Camaro SS and a black 1967 Camaro SS is also being offered[/b:3224adfa56]. \r\n\r\n[/quote:3224adfa56][/quote:3224adfa56]\r\n\r\nNot in store yet but comming real soon [b:3224adfa56]60-7534 PAST AND PRESENT KIT  $4.99[/b:3224adfa56]');
