INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (22160, 'bd6a1f3158', '', 'My internet was out all afternoon, I was going to post these sooner, but here\'s a couple shots I like better.\r\n\r\n[img:bd6a1f3158]http://members.cox.net/crazylittlecars/scallop4.jpg[/img:bd6a1f3158]\r\n\r\n[img:bd6a1f3158]http://members.cox.net/crazylittlecars/scallop3.jpg[/img:bd6a1f3158]\r\n\r\nThe red is still showing in the hood line line, that\'s really weird because it\'s not there in real life, must be because the paint is thin there. :???: \r\n\r\n@Superfly, flames and scallops are a different hard. Flames are more of a creative hard, because there\'s so many styles to emulate, and they need to flow with the body lines to look good, but scallops were harder to lay out, because everything had to be measured out. It\'s just more time consuming, but it\'s not like I had to think and plan as much, you know?');
