INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47260, 'f792a7d69e', 'bitPIMP MY RIDE !', 'I\'ve been toyin with this idea for a while, ever since I 1st started looking at Pimp My Ride.  Since we\'re gonna run the Contest all Summer, Let\'s do our own version, [b:f792a7d69e]bitPimp My Ride [/b:f792a7d69e].\r\n\r\nWanted to do 1 per month.  But I have a delima, when to announce it?\r\n\r\nNow I originally wanted to do it during the summer, but since we started the Auction, I don\'t want the 2 to bump heads.  You know, "[i:f792a7d69e]Why bid on a car when there\'s a possibility I can get one done for Free "[/i:f792a7d69e] So I wanted to start this after the last car is bought off Da Block!\r\nWhom ever wants to participate can.  I\'m not asking for any contributions, your choice.  We\'ll post, ask the Pimps to submitt their rides, we\'ll judge to find the one that is worthy and decide what to do from there.\r\nOn the show, (as you all may know) They pick a car from the letters &amp; pics people send in. They do extreme work, we don\'t have to go too far unless we vote to.  They paint, sometimes body kit, interior, wheels &amp; tyres, stereo, etc.  Very rarely do they touch the motor except to dress it up unless it ain\'t runnin, then they rebuild or replace!\r\n\r\nSo think about it, we\'ll work out the details later.....\r\n :cool:');
