INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37779, '2cb90a6753', '', 'Hehe, stashing is an art in itself. I sometimes go through a rather bizarre ritual when I get a fat sack. My connections these days are spotty enough that there may actually be a few days between running out and getting something new (the horror!). \r\n\r\nAnyway, when I\'m flush with green, I will fill my trusty film cans and hide them from myself. Then when I run out, it\'s like an easter egg hunt. Favorite hiding places are inside coat pockets of coats I don\'t wear often, bottom of ski boot, mountain bike toolkit under the seat, bit garage, office desk drawer, guitar case. It\'s pretty easy to forget where I hide them, or if I\'ve already found all of them. Plus, they\'re all places where you just might accidentally leave it anyway.\r\n\r\nThe other method is making a deposit in the "weed bank". When I have a bunch, I just give a nice bud to my friends who partake, and then when I\'m out I just ask to borrow some back.');
