INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37753, '2292d65b2b', 'The Salad Bowl', 'Back when I was in college, I started running low on cash my 3rd year (who doesn\'t). Anyway, I had been turning OZs and QPs since high school, mainly for friends. I knew some people that grew large quantities, and I climbed up the food chain for a couple years. \r\n\r\nWhenever I would get a new batch, I would dig through it and pull out the nicest, fattest bud that would fit in a film cannister, put a date on the side and stash it in this subdivided wooden box I had, must have been an antique fishing tackle box. After doing this for a while, I must have had around 40 different kinds; indoor, outdoor, sativas, indicas, hawaiian, jamaican, you name it.\r\n\r\nAnyway, whenever there was a special occasion to get [i:2292d65b2b]really[/i:2292d65b2b] baked, I would pull that out and we would have "salad bowls." Basically, you would load a fat bowl with 3-4 varieties, and smoke them together. You know how some kinds give you the sleepy lay-on-the-couch-and-watch-TV buzz, some give you the clear-headed-go-for-a-bike-ride high, etc. The salad bowl thing seemed to somehow compile all the qualities on top of eachother and really get ya blazin.\r\n\r\nYou guys ever try that?');
