INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37732, '83c99ff3f2', '', '[quote:83c99ff3f2="betty.k"][quote:83c99ff3f2="DarkTari"][quote:83c99ff3f2]then last september i picked up a shen for $15 aud at an annual urban country fair and was totally blown away! it was slow, wobbled all over the place and kept flipping over[/quote:83c99ff3f2]\r\n\r\nFunny  :???:   I\'ve always found the Shen Qi Wei to be one of the best clones out there!  I have quite a few of them after buying the Panthers, Prescious, Lxx, etc. and found them to perform better speed &amp; agility wise.\r\nYou probably got a bad one cause I have several and not one issue with any of them.  Whatever get\'s you hooked Pimp !   :cool:[/quote:83c99ff3f2]\r\n\r\nwhen i first got it home i put it on the concrete, hence all the bouncing around.i still have it, only has a few mods but still runs true! i\'m on top of the concrete prob though![/quote:83c99ff3f2]\r\n\r\nWell I guess that explains all the bouncing around  :greenblob:');
