INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37714, 'b89f911d9d', 'Re: Xmods FAQ (Updated January 6th)', '[quote:b89f911d9d="midget_man1387"][quote:b89f911d9d="cj"][b:b89f911d9d]CJ\'s Xmods FAQ[/b:b89f911d9d] .\r\n\r\n12414314 - JOINT CUP CENTER SHAFT $2.49   \r\n12414322 - JOINT CUP CENTER LEFT $2.49   \r\n\r\nFor RSU you must also add shipping.  Under $9.99 add $2.50.\r\nYou can order parts by visiting the store or calling the Shack at 1-800-THE-SHACk.\r\n[/quote:b89f911d9d]\r\n\r\n\r\njust an FYI to all of you guys: The "Joint Cup Center Left, item #12414322, is the one that makes up most of the rear axel... the one with the thicker metal piece. I ordered one thinking it was the smaller of the two, but it wasn\'t... also, when I got it(today), it came broken! I\'m not sure what exactly I should do.... could you help me CJ?? Here are the pics ([b:b89f911d9d]*note: I never have even taken this piece out!*[/b:b89f911d9d]):\r\n\r\nand another FYI: my order came to like $19.92 total(I got other stuff... new frequency crystals for my skyline, and a new supra body. the supra body won\'t be here for a few more weeks, the guy said), and that includes shipping, which was $3.50[/quote:b89f911d9d]\r\n\r\nHow are those new parts working out for you?  I found something that may help with your problem and everyone elses if RS can\'t get those parts.\r\n\r\nemail wjhecox@yahoo.com and ask him for more info on his Aluminum Drive Axles \r\n[img:b89f911d9d]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2412489/45680406.jpg[/img:b89f911d9d]\r\n[url]http://www.geocities.com/wjhecox/photopage.html[/url]');
