INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (23452, '998017255c', 'Race time....', 'Well, it looks like we\'re going to have some sponsored races..\r\n\r\n"Hobby Town USA" is hosting some races sponsored by "Hobbico"\r\n\r\nFor those of you that live in central FL, "Hobby Town" in Lakeland FL will be one of the shops to set it up. Hobbico will send them a track, and all the rules in the next couple of weeks..\r\n\r\nThe bad part is that it\'s only open to Microsizers cars, and parts.. (no motor, or batt mods allowed)  That sucks, but what can ya do?\r\n\r\nThey will run 2 cars at a time in a 10 lap race, and you will be awarded points. At the end of the season, they add up the points for the grand prize, which should be a mini Z..\r\n\r\n\r\nIt sucks that it\'s only a 2 car race, but I guess it\'s a start... \r\n\r\nI\'ll be there...  Hope to see some of you other punks there too.\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
