INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (23481, '41b648f0a6', 'Toy East: Group Buy...', 'Toyeast now has pre-order on their "Mini-Heart" Coopers. Here\'s the link to start at:\r\nhttp://www.toyeast.com/subcatlist2.asp?catid=1084\r\n\r\nHere\'s the breakdown:\r\n- Dual Speed (Turbo button, or always on turbo)\r\n- Stock with a 3.5 Motor\r\n- Stock with a 200mAH battery\r\n- Front light LED\r\n- Interchangable roofs\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you\'ve ever ordered from ToyEast, you KNOW how insane their shipping is...Hence the Group Buy idea. I\'m shooting for at least an order of 20 cars. Once they ship to me, I\'d send them out to you via US Priority Mail (the wife doesn\'t start her new job until Sept 8th, so she\'s been helping me with sending out packages).\r\n\r\nHere\'s the coop in red:\r\n\r\n[img:41b648f0a6]http://www.toyeast.com/productimage/AMINIH02a.jpg[/img:41b648f0a6]\r\n\r\n[b:41b648f0a6]Update[/b:41b648f0a6]: This is now the ToyEast Group Buy thread. You don\'t have to get in on this group buy with just Mini-Coop. Anything you will buy from ToyEast, post here.\r\n- [b:41b648f0a6]This Group Buy ENDS on Monday, Sept 1st @ 6pm EST[/b:41b648f0a6]\r\nWhen I get home on that day I will tally the orders and email ToyEast with what we want to order and ask for better shipping costs. We, as a group, decide whether to go ahead with the order when we hear back from them.');
