INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (23611, '664383e6f0', '', '[quote:664383e6f0="VooDooMafia"]OK this is my first entry to a contest on the site and my second mod/custom job hope you like. Also this was a clone so I am not sure what the body type is so I gonna call this car Capcom(if you know what the body style is please let me know).\r\n\r\n\r\nCustom CellShading Graphix\r\n3.0 motor\r\n80Mah cell\r\nRed Spocket with Orange Axle Gear\r\nSoft Tires\r\nremoved spoiler\r\nadded new rear window\r\nlowered ever so slightly\r\n&amp;\r\nThe best mod out there Interchangable HOES for the front passanger side so the diver can get his freak on with a new hoe every day/hour or whatever he feels is needed to keep the PIMP style runnnin\r\n\r\nSO there it is its not much but I would like to say she\'s fast handles well and all but the red ZZ sprocket she is all clone.[/quote:664383e6f0]\r\n\r\nNice Job VDM.\r\n\r\nhave you tried "Clear Coat" ?   youd put a sweet shine on that badboy.\r\n\r\nGreat Entry... Keep em coming...\r\n\r\n-nox');
