INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (23780, 'ca219a6f21', '', '[quote:ca219a6f21="crazydave"]I sure could use an airbrush, but I\'m afraid my smear super glue all over it, and then sand it off technique probably wont win me any prizes.\r\n\r\nWe need to get DT to write a body mod tut, now that\'s he\'s kickin\' some butt with them German techniques.[/quote:ca219a6f21]\r\n\r\n\r\nI tell ya Cavey, Sinned\'s technique is Da Shit. I just don\'t feel right unless I\'m modding something.  I keep lookin in my BodyBag just to mod. My son liked "Crystal Blu Persuasion"  so much, he asked me to paint one of his cars and I jumped at the chance. It came out great.  I\'ll be postin it this weekend after the clearcoat dries.  It\'s gonna be slamin Pimp!  Look for it!  Got a couple more in Da Body Shop too.  I\'m gettin REAL good at it as you will see........');
