INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (23785, '76056b087c', '', '[quote:76056b087c="bdebde"]Wow, what a flashback. I learned basic back before there was dos (\'78-\'79). I used to get the game magazines, and type in the lines of code for different games. Did the 1200 baud bbs\'s. Wow, I must be old![/quote:76056b087c]Yeah who needs DOS, when your loading your programs from a cassette tape. :lol: \r\n\r\n...and I forgot all about those games in the magazines. Usually like 10 pages of typeing, me and my dad would take turns, and then the it wouldn\'t work due to typos, take my dad a couple day to debug my mistakes, and then the game would usually suck anyways.\r\n\r\nAnyone remember having to put a AM radio next to your computer to get sound effects?\r\n\r\nWhen I got my computer  in \'97, I downloaded the TRS-80 ROM, and 40 games, and fit them all on 1 floppy disk. A Super Nintendo game fills a floppy disk.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n...and Nox, it\'s looking like you got a us beat for the oldest flashback.');
