INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (23858, '562dfc1dd2', '', 'I think the some of the games that were made back in the day didn\'t have endings. \r\n\r\n  Take the COLECO \r\n\r\n They make a game like "The Smurfs".  Its a very basic platform game that went upto level 100.  all teh boards are almost the same they just add a new log to jump over here and there things like that.\r\n\r\n  Then you reach Level 80 were they put 2 seets of double logs one after the other.  Now you finally make it over those sets of logs with a series of perfect(and I mean perfect) jumps.\r\n\r\n  Then they hit you with it.  Level 99 only one more to go.    You got this shit now.  All those hours of playing till your eyes watered are about to pay off.  You are half way through with 3 lives left you can do this.\r\n\r\n   SHIT WHATS THIS?????  a series of 3 double logs........  SHIT you need to make this perfect but ........FUCK.......you died.\r\n\r\n Thats ok you have 2 lives left here we go back at the start level 99.  you make it to the logs again and BINGO you made it.  The rest of the board is a breeze.\r\n\r\n  This is it COLECO fans you are about to meet the CHAMP king smurf commin your way baby this is level 100 and HAHAHA you have 2 lives left you da man.\r\n\r\n  You more then half way through when......WTF........3 logs in a row......whats this bull shit?  You could JUST(and I mean a smurf hair just) make 2 logs.  OK you breath deep and try it.\r\n\r\nHAHAHAHAHAHA  not even close....ok   ok  ok  you have one life left.  You try again and..........................oh oh oh oh.... you DIE\r\n\r\nFUCK what happens now?  Well if you are like me you usay FUCK over and over as you toss the controller at the wall....rip the COLECO out of the cabnet and smash it to bits.\r\n\r\n  Now you might be thinking WOW that made me feel better. Well it did untill my parents found out when they got home and chased me around with a belt.\r\n\r\n  Now this is the case for many games back in the day.  the companies found it easier to make them unbeatable then to finish the game.  And it worked out better for them in the long run cause after you destroied that game youthough you were all over it UNTILL you walked by it in the store and could hear that lkittle basterd just laffing at you like this "HAHAHA you can\'t beat me NA NA NA NAAA NAAA NA" so you buy it again and repeat the proccess all over again.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOH the memories\r\n\r\n\r\nBTW check this out [url=http://www.bordergatewayprotocol.net/~jon/humor/web_animations/strife_smurfs.swf]The Smurfs[/url]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (23859, '554f302618', '', '[quote:554f302618="Maxximum Attack"]Crazydave,\r\n\r\nI think i did it wrong. I\'ll post a pic later. But my batteries are heating up VERY fast, and no lights are comming on. I used a 10k resistor, 0.5 watts.\r\n\r\nhelp :sad:[/quote:554f302618]If the batteries are getting hot, then you\'ve got a dead short, and you\'ve definately wired it wrong.\r\n\r\nMake sure the copper strip you cut is cut all the way through, and not just the green coating. I actually sawed about halfway into my PCB just to make sure I had broken contact, because the metal kinda stretches before it breaks..\r\n\r\nIf that\'s not it, look at this picture from the original tutorial on BitMod, his picture is a lot clearer that mine, maybe you can see how you\'ve wired it wrong.\r\n\r\n[img:554f302618]http://www.universalhost.de/html_bit/antiboost/DSCN0804.jpg[/img:554f302618]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (23860, 'e4e3fc2178', '', '[quote:e4e3fc2178]Make sure the copper strip you cut is cut all the way through, and not just the green coating. I actually sawed about halfway into my PCB just to make sure I had broken contact, because the metal kinda stretches before it breaks.. \r\n\r\n[/quote:e4e3fc2178]\r\n\r\nI wired it correctly but i did not know that you had to acctually had to cut the PCB. Can you make it clearer where to cut it?');
