INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (23923, '520b050d3e', 'Re: the Cop\'ers Lights', '[quote:520b050d3e="noxorc"]There has been talk about a "Cop" car with lights and all.\r\n\r\nHere\'s a starting point.\r\n\r\n[url]http://noxorc.lixlink.com/coplites.wmv[/url]\r\n\r\n-nox[/quote:520b050d3e]\r\n\r\nDunno how I missed this thread.....  Nice starting work there nugget.   \r\n\r\nThe sequence looks a bit hectic though, you might wanna bring the osc freq down a notch.  What circuit are you using?\r\n\r\nI dunno how yankie cop cars work but the aussie bacon has a definate sequence.   Each light alternates it\'s ON time.  During that ON time the light flashes like really quick.   I hope to start building this circuit in the next few weeks and I\'ll take some video then to help explain what I mean.  I\'m pretty sure Barto would know what I\'m talking about since he runs from the cops all the time, lol....\r\n\r\nOnce you got that circuit down pat fella you\'re gonna have to make it into a SMD design....\r\n\r\nAgain, great work!\r\n\r\nph2t.');
