INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24123, '6ff523b670', 'Good quality still pics needed for RS video', '(car pics that is :lol: ).\r\n\r\nOK heres the deal. \r\n1.Ratshack UK are running a trade show. \r\n2.Team bonzer will be there racing the ZZ on the mat. \r\n3.They like my vids :eek: . and want to show them on a big screen\r\n4.I suggested creating a couple of new vids featuring ZZ series 1 (they can only launch series 1 at the moment) they said yes.\r\n\r\nNow it gets interesting. The VP of ratshack USA will be at the show as well as a couple of country MD\'s (Greece, Turkey etc). So i thought it would be really cool to do these guys heads in  :D by slipping in some stills of the ass kickin modded ZipZaps you guys have got.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for visual effect, so custom paint jobs, body mods, lowering etc would all look great, I might also be tempted to slip in a couple of technical mods (dual battery) but unless the pics are well thought out it might not be clear what we have done to them.\r\n\r\nI need high quality pics to splice into the vid so send them to my email at teambonzer@bonzergear.com rather than clogging the board.\r\n\r\nI will credit all pics shown (dont forget to include the name you want to appear - but keep it reasonably clean (or at least obtuse))\r\nAnd I will also stick the finished vid on my website (which you can download)\r\n\r\nPS Hog, if you want I will also credit bitpimps site with logo.\r\n\r\nKeep the faith - Bonzer is gonna happen :smile: \r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nTeamBonzer');
