INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24209, '6022fae9ab', '', 'I have Shen\'s LXX and dome clones as well as BCG and the best overall car is Shen.\r\n\r\nAs for LXX range/pcb problems. I have none. Its my second best car. I think the rage issue with all BCG/MS/LXX is because of the floppy antenna. I think if you do Dagenerals antenna mod to any of these controllers it would greatly improve the range');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24210, '0072c9d770', '', 'Yea Stoli I have though that 2 maybe next timne I am at Radio Shack I will see if they carry the telescoping antenas and try that.\r\n\r\n  Did you mod yours?  cause all my LXX get about 6 feet of good reception then its a gamble from there LOL');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24211, '998a9c543b', '', 'yeah its hard to find MS/BCG but shens are plenty full and $20.00 is good price since most US suppliers are in the 8-11$ range. After shipping and exchange there cheaper.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24212, 'ff64669e7f', '', 'I haven;t done one yet on LXX or BCG stlye controller.\r\n\r\nMine gets about 10ft and thats all the space I have/need so I don;t really care right now.\r\n\r\nI find it works better if you extend the antenna all the way the use your finger to hold the antenna stright up. \r\n\r\nI think its because the antenna isn;t soldered to anything. Just thos 2 metal brackets making contact with them. If you sodlered your antenna directly to the board or at least to those bracket things it would proll be much better. Hog and Ph2t are the electrical experts?\r\n\r\nWhacha gotta say boys?');
