INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24370, 'dd009c0f36', 'It\'s not a Countach...', 'I thought I already posted this, but I guess I just hit preview or something, oh well, anyways...\r\n\r\nRight after I get the FETs in, my Countach body disappears, can\'t find it anywhere. I blame the kitten my wife brought home.\r\n\r\nThis car is kickin\' butt so I need a bad ass body for it. I run down to Target to see what I can find. It came down between the Supra, or 350Z, I decided the the Supra looked just a little more \'bad ass\', but the Orange paint job had to go. So I went to work on the clear body, and here\'s what i came up with;\r\n\r\nMedium charcoal flames faded in over Charcoal, for a stealthy effect.\r\n\r\n[img:dd009c0f36]http://members.cox.net/crazylittlecars/frankg1.jpg[/img:dd009c0f36]\r\n[img:dd009c0f36]http://members.cox.net/crazylittlecars/frankg2.jpg[/img:dd009c0f36]\r\n[img:dd009c0f36]http://members.cox.net/crazylittlecars/frankg3.jpg[/img:dd009c0f36]\r\n[img:dd009c0f36]http://members.cox.net/crazylittlecars/frankg4.jpg[/img:dd009c0f36]\r\n\r\nIt reminds me of the one I called \'Franken-Zap\', \r\n[img:dd009c0f36]http://members.cox.net/crazylittlecars/franko.jpg[/img:dd009c0f36]\r\n\r\nSo I named it \'Lil Frankie G.\r\n\r\nIronically I realized after the fact that the PCB that I burned out the steering in the original Franken-Zap, ended being revived for this car. So I guess I subconsciuosly brought Frank back from the dead.\r\n\r\nI digging it, but it aint no Countach. I want my Countach back. :-(');
