INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24409, '24ac4831f6', '', '[img:24ac4831f6]http://hogjowlz.lixlink.com/group2.jpg[/img:24ac4831f6]\r\n[img:24ac4831f6]http://hogjowlz.lixlink.com/group1.jpg[/img:24ac4831f6]\r\n[img:24ac4831f6]http://hogjowlz.lixlink.com/bug2.jpg[/img:24ac4831f6]\r\n[img:24ac4831f6]http://hogjowlz.lixlink.com/bug1.jpg[/img:24ac4831f6]\r\n[img:24ac4831f6]http://hogjowlz.lixlink.com/cuda1.jpg[/img:24ac4831f6]\r\n[img:24ac4831f6]http://hogjowlz.lixlink.com/cuda2.jpg[/img:24ac4831f6]\r\n\r\nand finally what color is it you ask??? even under good light its hard to say. sometimes pink sometimes gold sometimes purple sometimes silver.\r\n\r\n[img:24ac4831f6]http://hogjowlz.lixlink.com/z1.jpg[/img:24ac4831f6]\r\n[img:24ac4831f6]http://hogjowlz.lixlink.com/z2.jpg[/img:24ac4831f6]\r\n[img:24ac4831f6]http://hogjowlz.lixlink.com/z3.jpg[/img:24ac4831f6]\r\n\r\nthe bug actually looks a lot cleaner in person. i havnt cleaned up the headlights yet but the camera shows imperfections that the eye doesnt seem to puck up. oh well painting these things is fun once you pick up a technique. mine happens to be stolen from cabo payaso and crazydave mainly with  my own failures from the past pushing me to get better.\r\n\r\nhope ya enjoy. if ya dont ill come to your house and slap your sister around.\r\n\r\noh ya whats with everyone not liking the muscle machines? that chassis is the bombest thing around. i cant wait to start funkin it up.');
