INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24425, '6b2eda102f', '', '[quote:6b2eda102f="sessiz"][quote:6b2eda102f="hogjowlz"]hard to do cuz thats the bedspread from the hotel your mom was working at last night. she moves from different parts of town every few days to let the locals catch up on their antibiotic doses so it may be a while.[/quote:6b2eda102f]\r\n\r\nThat\'s cool man, I totally understand. I had the same problem when I was putting your daddy out. He kept biting peoples, so I had to move him around.\r\n[img:6b2eda102f]http://picserver.student.utwente.nl/getpicture.php?id=303172[/img:6b2eda102f]\r\n\r\nSo whenever you can man. :-)[/quote:6b2eda102f]\r\n\r\n  Fuck man you way to funny\r\n\r\n  But I asked you to keep that pic onthe low down.  Man hes my main ho and I only use her/him for the High rollers.\r\n\r\n  Man now I need ta get a new ho he just called saying he is being chased down by a car full of peeps wanting to do nasty shit with him/her.\r\n\r\n  Fuck sessiz youknow hes/shes not into the group thing now shes/hes all freaked out.\r\n\r\n  You know what if he/she comes a knockin at my Door I am sending him/her yer way.\r\n\r\n Shit I will be right back the door bell is ringing..................');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37503, 'c88e5559cc', '', 'Some of the cars in my garage:\r\n[img:c88e5559cc]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/jay_spics002.jpg[/img:c88e5559cc]\r\nThats a line up of my bits and clones. Oh, and a ZipZap SE.\r\n[img:c88e5559cc]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/jay_spics006.jpg[/img:c88e5559cc]\r\nThis is the motorworks "hotrod". I took out the LED and\r\nslapped on some rims from a Bensu. Other than that it\'s stock.\r\n[img:c88e5559cc]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/jay_spics005.jpg[/img:c88e5559cc]\r\nThis be tha SuperSlick. I got the hop-up stuff and some\r\nSkylines and Fairladies for it. I\'m seriously considering\r\npainting one of these bodies and have some rim ideas that\r\nI want to try on this.\r\n[img:c88e5559cc]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/jay_spics009.jpg[/img:c88e5559cc]\r\nThis is my favorite. Shen Qui Wi with the black rims from the\r\n Tomy Skyline history set, blue MS gears, 4.2 Pro, and MS\r\n Fairlady, even though I usually run the blue and silver Gloria\r\n body that it came with. I plan on getting this car fetted when\r\n I gets my tax return. On that note, I\'m also sending the ZZSE,\r\n and maybe this:\r\n[img:c88e5559cc]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/jay_spics010.jpg[/img:c88e5559cc]\r\nThis is the ride in my avatar. My "pet project". It\'s a \r\nmotorworks with ZZ rims, and a MS Celica body, the \r\nrest is stock. I have serious, serious plans for this one. \r\nI would like to get a fetted Shen PCB put into it and get \r\none of them BitCharMotors 3.8\'s soldered in. And heavier \r\nwiring. I have a body prepped and ready to shoot, but \r\nthe weather here isn\'t cooperating. I may have to go to \r\nmy Dad\'s house on saturday and hole up in his basement \r\nall day to paint it. I\'m also color-matching the tx at the \r\nsame time. (I\'ll just run it with the SuperSlick tx til it\'s done).\r\nthanks for lookin.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24428, 'd3677449b5', '', '[quote:d3677449b5="Bigdog206"]today i went into radioshack to get an update on the SEs    they had a little sign about them with the white and yellow cars. i asked the assistant manager to look up the prod. #s in her computer nothin yet , but she told me they are called x pods is this true or did they get them mixed up with the x mods[/quote:d3677449b5]\r\n\r\ni was there today, I saw a little sign by the normal zips saying zipzaps SE (special edition) coming soon..and then something about 6 times the fun which I\'m thinking is the 6 frequencies. The picture had takumi\'s 86 and the yellow FD...classic initial D shot...i\'m excited.');
