INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24595, '911b24997e', 'KB Toys.......', 'For those that are interrested, KB Toys (store) has the KITT car on sale 2/$5.00.\r\n\r\nFor you newbies they have a 2.2 or 2.6 motors that in my opinion are the best I\'ve driven (no matter what Hog says), heat sink, Tomy battery, wheels &amp; tires that are 1/64 RC compatable.  The chassis/charger is good for breakin-in new motors.  KB also have the Ralley Racers (Shen Qi Wei) for $9.99.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24596, '17e5d29a4e', '', 'Damn Sess, I always seem to step on dem toes don\'t I ???\r\n\r\nI\'ll kill your post... LOL');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24597, 'ccffa4fefa', '', 'ok first night i: took the damn supercharger apart and glued just the blower to the hood and i took it apart and put springs in it. man are these front ends tricky to put back together. there is less verticle travel so the springs are really stiff. after getting rid of the front weight and making the suspension l/r independant it drove straighter than any car ive ever driven. just by doing that i guarantee it would beat any bit on a technical track.\r\n\r\nlast night: i cut out the rear window and installed my handy dandy second cell. and let me tell you this is the most power output ive ever seen on anything this scale. it would actually skwawk the tires in fwd!!! it even drove straight. having a physical steering system is so much more reliable than an electromagnet.\r\n\r\nand again this is the only micro rc where adjusting the trim actually makes a difference.\r\n\r\n\r\nthen after about 15mins of glory the thing stopped responding for no reason. i think i blew out a battery. luckily it was from the "test " pile. ill probably bust out some zipzap batteries for this bizitch.\r\n\r\n\r\nbut for those of you who like zipzaps cuza the wheelbase this is the car for you. they sit lower and are more rigid');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24598, '72d5e7ba79', '', '[quote:72d5e7ba79="noxorc"]I\'ve nevered \'ordered\' from Ratshack...  always a walk-in customer.\r\nDo I have to pay in full?[/quote:72d5e7ba79]\r\n\r\nYea but usualy you don\'t have to pay the shipping.\r\n\r\n[quote:72d5e7ba79="hogjowlz"]is there a definate relaease date for zipzaps stupid edition? i work within a 5 block walk from 3 different radiosnacks.[/quote:72d5e7ba79]\r\n\r\nIt is still some time after the 14th.  They got to get them in the wearhouse unpack them devide them up and ship them to 7000+ RadioShack\'s.');
