INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24787, '1a211e24d3', '', 'my first car was a shen than i drove it off the table one to many times and wires started comming out and i dont have a soldering iron so i bought another car and i still like it better than my ms\r\n\r\noh the reason i bought one in the first place was i like cars and these little things were cheap and i wanted a rc car but didnt want to give up 200 bucks for a crap one so i got one of these');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24788, '23db00d8ba', '', 'I think the body is terrible but i disagree, i like the contoller. Its nicer than the original i think. A sleek mini pistol grip. Im curious about the pcb part. It looks like its all sealed up and you cant get to anything. I think imma wait till the othger body is available as this ones leaves alot to be desired ( at least by me).');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24789, 'cfd169ec63', '', 'My first one was a zipzap. I never heard of or saw anything on mini rc(1/64) then my wife says she saw a commercial for these "zipzap" things from radio shack and thought i would like them. So i finally tracked them down and bought one. This was when they first came out b4 xmas . it was ok but i was kinda dissapointed in its speed. then i got online and found a whole new world of goodness.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24790, '79c7acfa0c', '', 'thats tight but when i got my bit char-a i was defiantly not dissapointed...it hade this red motor in iti thats about as fast as 2.0 i was like woo hoo! but it had all tires on it as hard as the bit hard tires but with no ribs so i spun out fast but after that my freind who looks up to me bought a zip zap and i fust put all seasons on the back');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24791, '89fa4c83d2', '', '[quote:89fa4c83d2="oxhadokenxo"]Thanks for the info..Does Ahh5hit have anything to add to that?[/quote:89fa4c83d2]\r\n\r\nI did a little test..A regular Zip and a SE, both with blue gears and red motor that comes stock. The regular Zip had more tourqe off the line but both seemed to have the same actual speed. May have something to do with the propo throttle. The SE battery is longer than the regular.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24792, 'cff0caf7af', '', 'Have you tried anything like a 3.0 or 3.8..maybe even a 4.2 in it?  Or how the 2.8 motor you have comapres in speed when in your other cars as to when it\'s in the SE?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24793, '9df6297b6c', '', 'My cousin got a Zip Zap last fall because it was the "toy to have" and I loved it so much the first day he got his I went looking for them and of course couldn\'t find them..then I went to KBtoys and found the Shen Qi Weis (Rally Racers) for $15..$5 less than his and beat the pants off his Zip Zap..then he went and bought 2 of them and hasn\'t used his Zip Zap 3 zip zap bodies 3 zip zaps engine since....');
