INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24809, '3a363ba457', '', 'I kinda did this last minute. Tried an experiment with the paint job. I guess it came out ok, but I\'ll let you guys be the judge.\r\n\r\nSpecs:\r\n-Microsizer Pro\r\n-Anti-boost mod\r\n-FETs\r\n-Perfection 3.8\r\n-150mah cell\r\n-8.3mm alloy rims w/ pen grip front tires\r\n-Targa top RX-7 body\r\n-a little body kitting\r\n-shaved front liscense plate holder thingy\r\n-Painted PCB cover and glued some seat backs on it.\r\n-Painted Med. Red Pearl, w/ med Charcoal &amp; Gold scallops.\r\n\r\n[img:3a363ba457]http://members.cox.net/crazylittlecars/contest4_1.jpg[/img:3a363ba457]\r\n[img:3a363ba457]http://members.cox.net/crazylittlecars/contest4_3.jpg[/img:3a363ba457]\r\n[img:3a363ba457]http://members.cox.net/crazylittlecars/contest4_2.jpg[/img:3a363ba457]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24810, '420b6f3de7', '', '350z Familie!\r\n\r\n\r\nwell here is the story, i had a unpainted Z in the process with another r34, done up just like cabos, except with more body work, and iit had the shaved grill, everything and all, but it just didn\'t have enuf time for paint. because when i go to school tomorrow, i will be back at 3 PST, and that is already 5 CST, which means im not gonna enter that. but o\'well i hope this "last minute" entry gets good honors, im not really scoring to win, this is just for fun, ya know?\r\n\r\n-Super BCG chassis, with tab lowering, custom alloy/plastic wheels, pen grip tyres, disc brakes behind the wheels (if u can even see the damn things) orange gears, 7t pinion, 4.2 motor, perfection gold heat sink\r\n-interior consists of single seat, nissan logo on 3 spoke steering wheel, black carpet, shifter, fire extiguisher\r\n-exterior, sunroof, blacked out rear lights and front lights, touring wing, baby blue paint (does no justice), front lip spoiler, twin exhaust tips, and canisters\r\n\r\nheres the pics for the shizzle \r\n\r\nhttp://www.pbase.com/pimpike/inbox\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nbtw this is a kid herre at 13..\r\n\r\nEDIT::: Seat belt harness was added....');
