INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24960, '710ac474cb', 'Gettin\' there fellas, gettin there........', '[b:710ac474cb]Nissan Gloria[/b:710ac474cb]\r\n\r\nThis is sorta a "mod in progress".  The chassis is stock with a l.0.   It\'s a crusin\' car so I quite like the speed being slow enough to be able to actually look at the car!.   The shell has had 2 coats of "Holden Gunmetal" auto touch-up paint, followed by several coats of clear.   All the lights/windows were masked, I\'m gonna put some electrics in it soon so I wanted them clear.   The grill is nice so I though hey!  Might as well leave it in there.\r\n\r\nThis is what I\'d consider my first proper paint &amp; mask job...\r\n\r\n[img:710ac474cb]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/showroom/gloria_1.jpg[/img:710ac474cb]\r\n[img:710ac474cb]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/showroom/gloria_2.jpg[/img:710ac474cb]\r\n[img:710ac474cb]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/showroom/gloria_3.jpg[/img:710ac474cb]\r\n\r\n[b:710ac474cb]Pugeot 305(?)[/b:710ac474cb]\r\n\r\nI *think* that\'s the name of the shell.  It\'s from a Bensu clone.   The widows were black to start with, so I continued that.   The masking on the headlights, rearlights and other places wasn\'t the best, sorta learning with this car :fool:.   The chassis is TOMY, the wheels are pullbacks and the antenna is internal.....\r\n\r\n[img:710ac474cb]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/showroom/pugeot_1.jpg[/img:710ac474cb]\r\n[img:710ac474cb]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/showroom/pugeot_2.jpg[/img:710ac474cb]\r\n[img:710ac474cb]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/showroom/pugeot_3.jpg[/img:710ac474cb]\r\n\r\nThese are some pics for the ausmicro.com comp, I thought you pimps wouldn\'t mind a squizz.\r\n\r\n[i:710ac474cb]ph2t.[/i:710ac474cb]');
