INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24979, '34da086139', '', 'When I correspond with the people, I usually remind them a couple of times to leave me feedback, and I\'ll do the same for them..\r\n\r\n\r\nPeople do forget though..  What\'s your feedback now?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24980, '974578564b', 'Re: For all you Ebayers...Q about Feedback', '[quote:974578564b="Namuna"]\r\nBut what\'s the proper etiquette? I\'d imagine it would be right after the person paid...But I\'m reluctant to do that cause then I got no ammunition to fight back if the buyer decides to be a DICK.\r\n\r\nThoughts?[/quote:974578564b]\r\n\r\n\r\nIf the people pay that fast, they are usually (educated ebay users) and will have read your conditions in your auction. As long as you meet those requirements, you should be golden...\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24981, '6652109157', '', 'Yes people do forget butI would say most just dont care they got there item and they leave it at that.\r\n\r\n  I also put a little thanks you slip in the package with a reminder for leaving feedback.\r\n\r\n  Alsodont worry about negative feedback over time you are bound to get some LOL you can\'t please everyone even when you try your hardest :(');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24982, '528a95465c', '', 'I\'d hate to be the judge of this contest. Lately I\'ve been forgetting to post props for all the nice rides, so consider this a blanket shout out to all the entries, especially DriveWRX, Yagbols, Crazy Dave, Bilbo, too many others. \r\n\r\nYou guys are making it too hard for me to enter any of my rides. Or I should say y\'all make me feel like I need to keep working on them, hence they\'re never finished.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24983, 'c849cf78e1', 'Re: Gettin\' there fellas, gettin there........', '[quote:c849cf78e1="ph2t"][b:c849cf78e1]Nissan Gloria[/b:c849cf78e1]\r\n\r\nThis is what I\'d consider my first proper paint &amp; mask job...\r\n\r\n[i:c849cf78e1]ph2t.[/i:c849cf78e1][/quote:c849cf78e1]\r\n\r\n\r\nIndeed..  Super job. Looks factory done. Your headlights are gonna be ph2t\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24984, 'fde2d052c9', '', 'My friend TheFanMan saw a bit for cheap on HLJ when he was searching for gundam and bought it. This is when they were ONLY selling the blue and white skyline. the fastest upgrade motor was a bit racer 2.2..the 2.6 and 3.0 were being advertised.. No clones out yet, just tomy. I drove his for a little while, the first thing i asked is if you can make the front and back wheels the same size. We forgot about it for awhile and then about 6 months later I got my own car, a white subaru impreza for $45 :-( and after bringing it back to the shop 2 times to get parts replaced before it even drove, I drove that one car for almost 6 months every day. by then the axle fell out when you picked it up. around then I was using martiniracing forums, but then i found tinyrc. i got a loctite zexel and used that to death too, then i went and bought a bunch of the new microsizers. I just recently bought a couple of zipzaps but they are not quite the same. I\'m getting one of those SEs soon...');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24985, '9c4d58c4d5', 'Weekly update', 'Got good news and bad news for you.  \r\n\r\nGood news I know know what the new ZZ and Xmods look like.  Got the new toy plan guide at rs and they list a new ZZ that I didn\'t mention.\r\n #60-7035 and 60-7036 The Cat in the Hat\r\n  Pick one of three characters to ride in The Cat in the Hat Vehicle -\r\n  The Goldfish, The Cat, or Thing 2 8-) \r\n\r\nXmods chassis looks like a miniZ  :???: \r\n\r\n\r\nNow for the bad news.  According to the toy guide the Xmods are to arrive in stores late October.  :( :sad:  :sad:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24986, '02490cca2f', '', 'yea I primer all my bodies.\r\nand it depends on the paint job as to what primer I use.\r\nobviously the lighter color of primer you use, the brighter the paint on top of it will be.\r\ntypically I use white, grey, deep maroon, or black.\r\nand the brands I use are Tamiya and Painter\'s Touch by Rust-oleum');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (24987, '5d0163c663', 'Girls of Xmods', '[url]http://www.bigapplehead.com/viewpost.aspx?postnum=7622[/url]\r\n\r\nGet your girl friend a job.\r\n\r\n[quote:5d0163c663]Company:\r\nGC Marketing Group, Inc., \r\nCompany Description:\r\na NYC based promotional staffing agency is looking to staff the following promotion: (Please read the entire posting and follow the application instructions)\r\n  \r\nJob Description:\r\nGC Marketing Group, a NYC based event marketing and promotional staffing agency has a few more NYC jobs.\r\nPlease read all posts, you must follow the exact directions in each post in order to apply.\r\n\r\n\r\n1. Girls of XMODS promo- NYC\r\n \r\nWe are looking to hire “Girls of XMODS” to represent RadioShack’s new line of radio controlled cars (soon to be in market) at media and promotional events. \r\nDates: \r\nThursday 9/25\r\nand \r\nFriday 9/26\r\nTimes to be determined \r\nLocation:\r\nManhattan Area (Waiting on specifics)\r\n\r\nResponsibilities: Distribute catalogs with product information. Talking points will be provided to models.\r\n\r\nXMODS girls must be:\r\nGirls must be vibrant, energetic, personable, attractive \r\nGirls must interact with event participants and generate excitement surrounding the product and the event \r\nGirls must be prepared to travel to assigned events \r\nGirls must provide a resume and head shot \r\nInterest in the Import Racing Scene is encouraged but not required\r\nThis promotions will run for a few weeks and we will be sending out the girls to different car shows etc..\r\n[b:5d0163c663]Attire: Client will be providing baby tees and ask that you wear shorts. [/b:5d0163c663]\r\n \r\nOur client is looking for a select few only to represent them and be a girl of XMODS. Once picked we would be sending the girls we hire product overview material as well as talking points to prepare them for events. Additionally, we would work with the girls to schedule training via phone one week prior to events on a 1 hour paid conference call. \r\nPay: $20/hr\r\n \r\nIf you are interested in this promotion please email us at xmodes@gcmginc.com\r\n \r\nSubject line: XMODS girl NYC\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\nJob Qualifications:\r\nPlease include: 1. full name 2. contact numbers 3. list prior promo experience 4. are you available to work 9/25 &amp; 9/26? 5. why should our client pick you to be an XMODS model? 6. resume 7. one outstanding picture (not larger than 100k)\r\n \r\nContact Information:\r\n  Name: Gilad Carni\r\n  Phone: 000000000000\r\nAddress:\r\n  210 West 70th St. Suite 311\r\n  New York NY, 10023 \r\nSalary: \r\n  $20/hour\r\nHours:\r\n  To Be Determined \r\n \r\n[/quote:5d0163c663]');
