INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (25036, '85cb365cf1', 'Xmods FAQ (Updated June 30th)', '[b:85cb365cf1]CJ\'s Xmods FAQ[/b:85cb365cf1].\r\n\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]#1  They are 1:28 th scale and about 6" long.[/b:85cb365cf1]\r\n\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]#2  Known RS part numbers and prices.[/b:85cb365cf1]\r\n\r\nCat #     Description                                              Price\r\n60-8001 Nissan Skyline Starter Kit  $49.99\r\n60-8002 Acura RSX Starter Kit  $49.99\r\n60-8003 Black Honda Civic Starter kit  $49.99\r\n60-8004 Blue Honda Civic Starter Kit  $49.99\r\n60-8005 White Toyota Supra Starter Kit  $49.99 Retired\r\n60-8006 Red Toyota Supra Starter Kit $49.99\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]60-8007 (Gold or Orange) Nissan 350z Starter Kit $49.99[/b:85cb365cf1]\r\n60-8008 Black 1999 Nissan Skyline Starter Kit  $49.99\r\n60-8501 Stage 1 Motor Upgrade kit 26,000 RPM  $12.99 Retired\r\n60-8502 Stage 2 Motor Upgrade kit 30,000 RPM  $15.99\r\n60-8503 Foam Tire and Wheel Upgrade $7.99\r\n60-8504 Tire Upgrade $7.99\r\n60-8505 Suspension &amp; Steering Upgrade $7.99\r\n60-8506 All Wheel Drive Upgrade $14.99\r\n60-8507 Racing Crystal Set $19.99\r\n60-8508 Wheel Upgrade $9.99\r\n60-8509 Lighting Kit  $5.99\r\n60-8511 Graphics and Decal Set  $5.99 \r\n60-8512 Metal Ball Bearing Upgrade  $19.99\r\n60-8513 Black Honda Civic Body kit   $12.99\r\n60-8514 Blue Honda Civic Body Kit   $12.99\r\n60-8515 Acura Body Kit  $12.99\r\n60-8516 Nissan Skyline Body Kit  $12.99\r\n60-8517 White Toyota Supra Body Kit  $12.99 Retired\r\n60-8518 Red Toyota Supra Body Kit   $12.99\r\n60-8519 Tool Kit $12.99\r\n60-8520 Carrying Bag $29.99\r\n60-8522 Medium Xmods T-Shirt $14.99 \r\n60-8523 Nissan 350Z Body Kit $12.99 \r\n60-8524 XL Xmods T-Shirt $14.99 \r\n60-8527 Large Xmods T-Shirt $14.99 \r\n60-8541 XXL Xmods T-Shirt $14.99 \r\n60-8542 Xmods Hat $9.99 \r\n60-8543 Xmods Keychain $4.99\r\n23-350  Xmods Battery Charger  $24.99\r\n990-0458 18-Piece Narrow Oval Racing Track Set $129.99\r\nIncludes 18 bottom tiles, 18 side rails and a complete set of pins.\r\nCompleted track is an oval approximately 10 feet long and 5 feet wide.\r\nFeatures two surface textures–low grip and high grip.\r\n990-0459 28-Piece Wide Oval Racing Track Set $159.99\r\nIncludes 28 bottom tiles, 28 side rails and a complete set of pins.\r\nCompleted track is an oval approximately 11 feet long and 6 feet wide.\r\n990-0460 40-Piece Wide "L" Turn Racing Track Set $199.99\r\nIncludes 40 bottom tiles, 40 side rails and a complete set of pins.\r\nCompleted track is an “L” shape approximately 13 feet long and 10 feet wide.\r\nModular design allows you to combine multiple starter track sets together to create larger and more spectacular layouts \r\n\r\nSome special order parts my even be a lap counter and transponders.\r\n\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]#3  Xmods Bearings: [/b:85cb365cf1]\r\nXmod Bearings are unflanged and unsealed. Measurements are .235" Outside Diameter x .115" Inside Diameter x .079 Thick.  In mm it is 3mm ID x 6mm OD x 2mm Thick.  Have been told some Mini-Z bearings will fit.  Note 3mm x 6mm x 2.5mm will fit in most places and reduce play and improve performance.\r\n\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]#4  Axles/Drive Shaft:[/b:85cb365cf1]\r\nAxles are also .115" in diameter or 3mm.  \r\nLong Drive shaft  2.97 X 81L\r\nMedium Drive Shaft  2.97 X 77L \r\nShort (if there is one) 2.97 X 73L\r\n\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]#5 Remote: [/b:85cb365cf1] \r\nThe Xmods remotes that come with the cars are the ONE AND ONLY remotes that will ever work with the cars unless you replace the electronics inside (Receiver/Speed Control/Servo/Controller).  Xmods Controllers with the same crystal WILL control other Xmods with the same Crystals.\r\n\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]#6 Manuals:[/b:85cb365cf1]\r\n[url=http://support.radioshack.com/support_games/doc72/72058.pdf]XMODS 1999 Nissan Skyline GT-R VSpec Starter Kit[/url]\r\n[url=http://support.radioshack.com/support_games/doc72/72060.pdf]XMODS 2003 Acura RSX Starter Kit[/url]\r\n[url=http://support.radioshack.com/support_games/doc72/72062.pdf]XMODS 2000 Honda Civic Coupe (Black) Starter Kit[/url]\r\n[url=http://support.radioshack.com/support_games/doc72/72064.pdf]XMODS 2000 Honda Civic Coupe (Blue) Starter Kit[/url]\r\n[url=http://support.radioshack.com/support_games/doc72/72066.pdf]XMODS 1997 Toyota Supra (White) Starter Kit[/url]\r\n[url=http://support.radioshack.com/support_games/doc72/72068.pdf]XMODS 1997 Toyota Supra (Red) Starter Kit[/url]\r\n[url=http://support.radioshack.com/support_games/doc72/72044.pdf]XMODS Custom RC Stage 1 Motor Upgrade Kit[/url]\r\n[url=http://support.radioshack.com/support_games/doc72/72046.pdf]XMODS Custom RC Rubber Tire Upgrade Kit[/url]\r\n[url=http://support.radioshack.com/support_games/doc72/72048.pdf]XMODS Custom RC Steering and Suspension Upgrade Kit[/url]\r\n[url=http://support.radioshack.com/support_games/doc72/72050.pdf]XMODS Custom RC All Wheel Drive Kit[/url]\r\n[url=http://support.radioshack.com/support_games/doc72/72052.pdf]XMODS Custom RC Racing Crystals Set[/url]\r\n[url=http://support.radioshack.com/support_games/doc72/72054.pdf]XMODS Custom RC Wheel Upgrade Kit[/url]\r\n[url=http://support.radioshack.com/support_games/doc72/72056.pdf]XMODS Custom RC Command Logic Lights Kit[/url]\r\n[url=http://support.radioshack.com/support_games/doc72/72042.pdf]XMODS Custom RC Metal Bearing Upgrade Kit[/url]\r\n\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]#7 Wheel Nuts:[/b:85cb365cf1]\r\nWheel nuts are 2mm.  Stock nuts are plastic. Most 2mm Lock Nuts should work.  2mm Lock nuts are used on the Mini-Z and the RS4.\r\n\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]#8 Mini-Z parts:[/b:85cb365cf1]\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]Bodies:[/b:85cb365cf1]  Will NOT fit with out modification to the body mounts.  Not all Mini-z bodies wheel basses are the same.  So you may need to stretch or shorten the chassis on a Xmod. Changing the chassis length will also require changing of the drive shaft.\r\n\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]Battery Clips:[/b:85cb365cf1] On the Original Mini-z the clips can fit with minor sanding or fileing.  The MR-02 is a new design and not at all compatible.\r\n\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]Motors:[/b:85cb365cf1] Mini-z motors will physically fit in the Xmod but the stock electronics may not be able to handle the faster more powerful motors.  Also you will need to invest in a Pinion puller from a hobby shop that sells the 1:24 scale slot cars to remove the brass pinion on the Xmods motor.  Don\'t forget your soldering iron as well.\r\n\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]Tires:[/b:85cb365cf1] The rubber tires on the Mini-Z can fit but since the Xmods have a raised part in the center of the wheel they will have a raised center when installed.\r\n\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]#9 RadioShack Parts:[/b:85cb365cf1]\r\n		Common\r\nRSU#	Description			Sug. Retail\r\n12414272 - ANTENNA RX $2.49 \r\n12414413 - ANTENNA TX $4.69 \r\n12414280 - COVER BATTERY RX $2.49  \r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/42766565.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1]\r\n12414298 - LEFT BATTERY CASE ASSY RX $2.49 \r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/42766546.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1]\r\n12414306 - RIGHT BATTERY CASE ASSY RX $2.49 \r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/42766533.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1]\r\n12414470 - BEARING $2.49\r\n12414199 - HARDWARE KIT 64 PCS $2.69 \r\n-SCREW TAPPING 2.0 X 3.3 CB  8 PCS\r\n-SCREW TAPPING 2.0 X 8 CB 5 PCS\r\n-SCREW TAPPING 2.0 X 9 PCM 8PCS\r\n-SCREW TAPPING 2.0 X 5 PB 7 PCS\r\n-SCREW TAPPING 2.0 X 10 KB 2 PCS\r\n-SCREW TAPPING 2.0 X 6 KB 11 PCS\r\n-SCREW TAPPING 2.0 X 10 KB 4 PCS\r\n-SCREW TAPPING 2.0 X 5 KB 6 PCS\r\n-SCREW TAPPING 2.0 X 8 KB 2 PCS\r\n-SCREW TAPPING 2.0 X 6 PWB 1 PCS\r\n-SCREW TAPPING 2.0 X 12 PB 2 PCS\r\n-LUG NUT 8 PCS\r\n12414215 - SERVO ASSY $8.69   \r\n12414421 - MANUAL USERS 60-8001 $2.49   \r\n12414231 - HOLDER CENTER SHAFT (FRONT) $2.49   \r\n12414249 - HOLDER CENTER SHAFT (REAR) $2.49   \r\n12414314 - JOINT CUP CENTER SHAFT $2.49 \r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/42766523.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1]  \r\n12414322 - JOINT CUP CENTER LEFT $2.49   \r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/42766509.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1]\r\n12414348 - DIFFERENTIAL SHAFT 1.0 X 11 $2.49   \r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/42766492.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1]\r\n12414355 - DIFFERENTIAL GEAR SET $2.49 \r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/42088445.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1]  \r\n[b:85cb365cf1]12420089 - KNOB BODY LOCK $2.49 [/b:85cb365cf1]\r\n12414363 - ARM LEFT REAR $2.49 \r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/42088434.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1]  \r\n12414371 - ARM RIGHT REAR $2.49 \r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/42088431.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1]\r\n12414181 - AXEL SHAFT REAR (1) $2.49  \r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/40146812.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1]\r\n12414389 - KNUCKLE FRONT LEFT $2.49 \r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/42088423.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1]   \r\n12414397 - KNUCKLE FRONT RIGHT $2.49   \r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/42088415.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1]\r\n12414405 - AXEL SHAFT FRONT (1) $2.49  \r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/40424724.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1] \r\n12414462 - GEAR DRIVE 2A $2.49 \r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/42088405.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1]  \r\n12414207 - PCB ASSY RECEIVER $9.49   \r\n12414223 - CHASSIS $2.49   \r\n12414256 - DECK UPPER FRONT $2.49   \r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/42766581.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1]\r\n12414264 - DECK UPPER REAR $2.49   \r\n12414488 - DAMPER ASSY (4)	$2.49 \r\n[i:85cb365cf1]NOTE: RS may have this listed as a DUMPER ASSY or a BUMPER ASSY[/i:85cb365cf1]\r\n[img:85cb365cf1]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/42088398.jpg[/img:85cb365cf1]  \r\n\r\n:60-8001 XMODS NISSAN \r\n12414454 - CRYSTAL BAND 1 (26.540MHZ) RX $2.49\r\n12414512 - CRYSTAL BAND 1 (26.995MHZ) TX $2.49\r\n12414447 - SHAFT CENTER 2.97 X 81L $2.49\r\n12414496 - CAR BODY ASSY $7.69\r\n12415691 - MIRROR SET NISSAN SKYLINE YEL  $2.49\r\n12414504 - TRANSMITTER KIT $14.89\r\n\r\n:60-8002 XMODS ACURA SILVER \r\n12414520 - CRYSTAL BAND 2 (26.590MHZ) RX $2.49\r\n12414553 - CRYSTAL BAND 2 (27.045MHZ) TX $2.49\r\n12414439 - SHAFT CENTER 2.97 X77L $2.49\r\n12414538 - CAR BODY ASSY W/ACURA SILVER $7.69\r\n12415683 - MIRROR SET ACURA RSX SILVER $2.49\r\n12414546 - TRANSMITTER KIT $7.69\r\n\r\n:60-8003 XMODS HONDA CIVIC BLACK \r\n12414561 - CRYSTAL BAND 3 (26.640MHZ) RX $2.49\r\n12414595 - CRYSTAL BAND 3 (27.095MHZ) TX $2.49\r\n12414447 - SHAFT CENTER 2.97 X 81L $2.49\r\n12414579 - CAR BODY ASSY $7.69\r\n12415709 - MIRROR SET CIVIC BLACK  $2.49\r\n12414587 - TRANSMITTER KIT $7.69\r\n\r\n:60-8004 XMODS HONDA CIVIC BLUE\r\n12414603 - CRYSTAL BAND 4 (26.690MHZ) RX $2.49\r\n12414637 - CRYSTAL BAND 4 (27.145MHZ) TX $2.49\r\n12414447 - SHAFT CENTER 2.97 X 81L $2.49\r\n12414611 - CAR BODY ASSY $7.69\r\n12415816 - MIRROR SET CIVIC BLUE $2.49\r\n12414629 - TRANSMITTER KIT $7.69\r\n\r\n:60-8005 XMODS WHITE TOYOTA SUPRA \r\n12414645 - CRYSTAL BAND 5 (26.740MHZ) RX $2.49\r\n12414678 - CRYSTAL BAND 5 (27.195MHZ) TX $2.49\r\n12414447 - SHAFT CENTER 2.97 X 81L $2.49\r\n12414652 - CAR BODY ASSY $7.69\r\n12415824 - MIRROR SET SUPRA WHITE $2.49\r\n12416723 - FRNT ATTACHMENT TOYOTA SUPRA  $2.49 \r\n12414660 - TRANSMITTER KIT $7.69\r\n\r\n:60-8006 XMODS RED TOYOTA SUPRA \r\n12414686 - CRYSTAL BAND 6 (26.800MHZ) RX $2.49\r\n12414710 - CRYSTAL BAND 6 (27.255MHZ) TX $2.49\r\n12414447 - SHAFT CENTER 2.97 X 81L $2.49\r\n12414694 - CAR BODY ASSY $7.69\r\n12415832 - MIRROR SET SUPRA RED $2.49\r\n12414702 - TRANSMITTER KIT $7.69   \r\n\r\n:60-8007 XMODS NISSAN 350Z (GOLD)\r\n12414645 - CRYSTAL BAND 5 (26.740MHZ) RX $2.49\r\n12414678 - CRYSTAL BAND 5 (27.195MHZ) TX $2.49\r\n12414447 - SHAFT CENTER 2.97 X 81L $2.49\r\n???????? - CAR BODY ASSY ?\r\n???????? - MIRROR SET NISSAN 350Z ?\r\n12417275 - TIRE ASSY SET NISSAN SKYLINE $11.69\r\n???????? - TRANSMITTER KIT ?\r\n\r\n:60-8008 XMODS NISSAN SKYLINE BLACK\r\n12414454 - CRYSTAL BAND 1 (26.540MHZ) RX $2.49\r\n12414512 - CRYSTAL BAND 1 (26.995MHZ) TX $2.49\r\n12414447 - SHAFT CENTER 2.97 X 81L $2.49\r\n???????? - CAR BODY ASSY ?\r\n???????? - MIRROR SET NISSAN SKYLINE BLACK\r\n12417275 - TIRE ASSY SET NISSAN SKYLINE $11.69\r\n???????? - TRANSMITTER KIT ?\r\n\r\nTo use a replacement body that is not original to your chassis you MUST also replace the front mount which so far has not yet become available.\r\nFor RSU you must also add shipping.  Under $9.99 add $2.50.\r\nYou can order parts by visiting the store or calling the Shack at 1-800-THE-SHACk.\r\n\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]#10 Motors:[/b:85cb365cf1] (thanks to neurokinetik at [url=http://www.tinyrc.com/forums/showthread.php?s=&amp;threadid=15428]tinyrc.com[/url])\r\n     Stage 1: 85 turns, wire thickness is less than 30 gauge. Probably 32 or 34.\r\n     Stage 2: 49 turns, 30 gauge.  \r\n     X Speed: 49 turns, 30 gauge.   \r\n     Crest Spin Brush:  70 turn of ~ 32 gauge\r\n\r\n[b:85cb365cf1]#11 After Market Parts:[/b:85cb365cf1] Not made by RadioShack \r\n[i:85cb365cf1]My not be legal for use in the RadioShack Tournaments!\r\nUse of these parts could void your warranty![/i:85cb365cf1]\r\n\r\nEmail Address &amp; URL  Description  Cost\r\n \r\nwjhecox@yahoo.com Aluminum Drive Axles and Wheels\r\nleft front Axle $10.00\r\nright front Axle $8.00\r\nleft rear Axle $8.00\r\nright rear Axle $10.00\r\nWheels Ask\r\n \r\nslugbugg@ameritech.net  Carbon Fiber Drive Shafts $10 a Set\r\n \r\nIf you make any aftermarket parts that are not listed or want to update apart that is listed email cj@cjshobbies.net\r\nAftermarket parts listed must [b:85cb365cf1]not[/b:85cb365cf1] be exclusive to Ebay.  \r\n\r\n[URL=http://www.cjshobbies.net/XmodFAQ.html]CJ\'s Xmods FAQ with Photos of parts[/URL]\r\n[i:85cb365cf1]Note: pictures are from my picturetrail account.[/i:85cb365cf1]');
