INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (25231, '99bb6d6bd5', '', '[quote:99bb6d6bd5="hogjowlz"]well the first zipzaps totally blew nuts and that didnt stop them now did it?[/quote:99bb6d6bd5]\r\n\r\nDamn hog,\r\n\r\n You sure dis on da Zip Zaps alot! I don\'t wan\'t to start a "which is better" thread, so I will half (or maybe 1/3) agree with ya. The only thing I didn\'t like about the first run was the slow pcb\'s and motors. The handling was much better than bits, and they look more to scale (less cartoonish) than bits. Although I will admit that some bit bodies look better than the same car in a Zip Zap body. Oh, and my Zip Zap will kick your bits (clones) ass. Just kidding, lol. I like Zip Zaps better, but I don\'t dis on da bits or clones. They\'re all good, just a matter of preference. So don\'t be disin\' on da Zaps so much. Thank you.');
