INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (25311, '740b682974', '', 'Not cool with me Bro!\r\n\r\nJust how are we judging this???\r\n\r\nThe way it was agreed upon when we first started this contest was to have 3 catagories:\r\n\r\n[b:740b682974]Post .........Reality.............Prize[/b:740b682974]\r\nGood..........Worst...........(2nd place)\r\nBetter.........Middle..........(1st place)\r\nBest............Best............(3rd place)\r\n\r\nI think there\'s confusion when we say Good, Better, Best.  I only put it that way cause that\'s the way we want to explain it to the contestants.  Don\'t want to Dis or Insult anyone.  Look at it this way to make it easier:\r\n\r\n26 entries =- 9 worst----8 middle----9 best or 8-10-8 however you want to look at it\r\n\r\nOne end of the scale to the oposite end, then the middle.\r\n\r\nNow #20 Barto has definately improved his skilz but it is definately not the worst one outta the bunch (don\'t like to put it that way but this is between the IC), look again!  I vote #2 Brendan123 (my opinion)\r\n\r\n#5 BdeBde is a good choice, his Camaro or DriveWRX\'s Celica, it could go either way!\r\n\r\nNow the middle was a hard one. #22 DriveWRX is not in the middle, as I mentioned before, it\'s definately Top Notch.  #20 Barto might be in this catagory along with #13 Maxximum Attack &amp; ZipRC. \r\n\r\nYou guys still wanna stick to your votes?  Let\'s give the not so skild a chance like we intended in the first place !!!!');
