INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (25393, '81bfc453de', 'Re: Contest: Pimps Middle of Da Road', 'Da contest came, da contest went\r\nda judges have been choosin, and now they\'re spent!\r\nIt was mentioned at the start of the contest:\r\n[quote:81bfc453de="ChedderSpreader"]We gonna put a major twist on dis contest in da end.\r\nYou pimps will just have to wait to see the twist.[/quote:81bfc453de]\r\nand now the twist can be revealed...\r\n\r\n[b:81bfc453de]The Twist:[/b:81bfc453de]\r\nThe bitPimps decided to come up with a scheme that allows all users, no matter the pimps skill level or experience, to compete with each other and have a legitimate chance to win.\r\nThe scheme would also allow that same range of pimps a chance to possibley win the top place prize.\r\n\r\nTo do that, the bitPimps came up with following prize categories:\r\n- Good (3rd)\r\n- Better (2nd)\r\n- Best (1st)\r\n\r\nThis marks the first [i:81bfc453de]twist[/i:81bfc453de] the bitPimps came up with:\r\n- The Good category represents entries that were "good", show potential, budding skills, and deserve some props.\r\n- The Better category represents entries that were "better", show a lot of potential, seasoned skills, and deserve props.\r\n- The Best category represents entries that were "best", show tremendous potential, fine-tuning of the skills, and deserve props.\r\n\r\nThe next and last [i:81bfc453de]twist[/i:81bfc453de] the bitPimps added was to shuffle the orders of the places as compared to the prizes:\r\n- Good, or 3rd place, moves up 1 position to 2nd place.\r\n- Better, or 2nd place, moves up 1 position to 1st place.\r\n- Best, or 1st place, gets bumped to 3rd place.\r\n\r\nand now we\'ll announce the winners\r\n\r\n[size=18:81bfc453de]Prize Winners:[/size:81bfc453de]\r\n[b:81bfc453de]Good category winner:[/b:81bfc453de] Brendan123\r\nYou will recieve the 2nd place prize.\r\n\r\n[b:81bfc453de]Better category winner:[/b:81bfc453de] MaximumAttack\r\nYou will recieve the 1st place prize.\r\n\r\n[b:81bfc453de]Best category winner:[/b:81bfc453de] bdebde\r\nYou will recieve the 3rd place prize.\r\n\r\n[b:81bfc453de]Congratulations to da winners![/b:81bfc453de]\r\nTo collect your prizes, send a private message (PM) to DarkTari with your shipping information.');
