INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (25492, '680fe9b2c5', '', 'Yeah DT, that\'s actually closer to the color I wanted, but mine\'s close enough. It\'s a Chevy color, Bahama Blue, GM color T401. \'T\' means it\'s a truck color. That car is closer to GM color 2728, Lake Placid Blue, my favorite Fender guitar color. Plasti-Cote makes GM color 2708, that is practically the same color.\r\n\r\nI wish I could take a clearer pic so you guys could see the detail in the Porshe hood emblem. I painted it gold, with a dab of black and red, and from a slight distance looks as good as the one painted over.\r\n\r\nThanks VDM. :grin:');
