INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (25554, 'e0614bc6d9', '', 'dave, we think a lot alike when it comes to posting up the pics of our work...\r\nI worry about the same, seems after the drop top challenger, I never quite hit the peak like I did there.\r\n\r\nbut, I\'m not letting it sway me, and you shouldn\'t either.\r\nmatter of fact, the only reason in the world I ever posted this:\r\n[img:e0614bc6d9]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/bits/cabowabo/s-2000/pearl_blue/shot1.jpg[/img:e0614bc6d9]\r\nwas to show everyone that it\'s okay to screw up.\r\nsure I hate it, sure I don\'t like it, sure it\'s nowhere near my quality of work, but sure... it happens, sometimes you screw up.\r\nbut you know, it wouldn\'t happen if you didn\'t try something new.\r\nnew is what keeps it hot and fresh.\r\nif you stuck to just flames, eventually people would get bored with those too - no matter how kick ass they look.\r\n\r\nI love the ride you put up man, looks great!\r\nI also think it\'s more a credit to your skills when you try something you normally never would and pull it off.\r\n\r\nanyways, all I\'m sayin is don\'t sell yourself short - that goes for all of you pimps!');
