INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (25678, '6a083114c3', '', 'It will be tab lowered. I already removed the existing ones to see how low I could go. Right now, it\'s just sitting on the chassis. The skirts I made kinda hold it on the chassis by squeezing it. It\'s a nice tight fit. Adding the tabs should be no problem. The only mechanical mod I\'m looking at right now is a 4x Laymans Cell. Not sure if the juice will be too much for the PCB. If it smokes, at least it might burn some of that damn crap covering the PCB. ;)\r\n\r\nEDIT: It could be lowered maybe another 1/16" if I either remove or move the LED PCB mounted under the body to the rear and rewire it.');
