INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (38930, '166312658a', 'preeeview', 'Fuck it... if everyone else is showin\', then here\'s a sneak peek at the work in progress of the prize I\'m puttin\' up.\r\n\r\nSo far...\r\n- Aluminum-tubing stretched Thunder Charger chassis\r\n- tab-lowered\r\n- shaved TC rear tires, so they tuck up into the rear fenders\r\n- shaved inside of body to make room for rear tires and steering\r\n\r\nTo come...\r\n- custom paint (somethin\' authentic)\r\n- mosfets\r\n- custom pcb cover\r\n- custom painted controller (TC controller... they\'re ugly, but they have killer range. I\'ll make it look better)\r\n- kick-ass mystery 3.8 (SuperFly and I got a sack of these 3.8s that kick ass with mosfets and stock gears... great combo)\r\n\r\nSo far, it drives great... straight, even steering, good handling. I\'m lovin\' these stretched TCs...  less bulky than a ZZ, so it doesn\'t have to sit like an AMC Eagle.\r\n[img:166312658a]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/prvw1.jpg[/img:166312658a]\r\n\r\n[img:166312658a]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/prvw2.jpg[/img:166312658a]\r\n\r\n[img:166312658a]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/prvw3.jpg[/img:166312658a]\r\n\r\n[img:166312658a]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/prvw4.jpg[/img:166312658a]\r\n\r\n[img:166312658a]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/prvw5.jpg[/img:166312658a]');
