INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (26405, '725780ad30', '', 'What bastards!   Looks like these things are gonna be hell to reverse engineer.....\r\n\r\nAs for the whole LED power .vs motor thingy I guess that it wouldn\'t be possible to add the power from the leds to the motor.   The power to the leds would be current limited with a resistor to keep the leds driving current in check with the manuf\'s specs. \r\n\r\nThe motor (I assume it\'s proprtional speed controlled yeah?) prolly goes though an ESC of some sort to achieve the speed control and that the power side of the ESC is tapped straight into the main Vcc line from the batteries (2.4V yeah?) whilst the control side of the ESC circuitry comes off the same VSource as the RX chip.  \r\n\r\nFrom what I can see in the picture there is a big black cansister thingy that seems to me to be an electrolytic cap (possibly 100uF?) which is used to filter the output of the DCDC convertor on the board that boosts the 2.4V from the batteries to possibly 3 - 3.3V for the RX chip to run off.   \r\n\r\nHuge assumptions here and possibly wrong given that the car is propo the RX/TX chipsets are probably fundamentally different from the chips made popular in Bitchar-g\'s/first gen ZZ\'s.\r\n\r\nSo just to ask the question/s and sound like a complete noob:\r\n\r\n1) Steering is propo?\r\n2) Motor speed is propo fwd &amp; bwd?\r\n3) Lights are what?  headlights? brakelights? indicators?\r\n4) Functionality of lights?\r\n\r\nThis stuff will help in any futher ANALysis until the black market provides me with one.\r\n\r\nph2t.');
