INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37321, '1ced8c413c', '', '[quote:1ced8c413c="mekinhux"]Which would be the best buy? An LXX Mini Z clone or an Xmod? Of course I would prefer the real thing (Kyosho Mini Z), but they\'re way too expensive and the parts are also not cheap... If someone has some knowledge about this I would appreciate if a little bit of it could be shared.\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nmekinhux[/quote:1ced8c413c]\r\n\r\nXmods cant really be compared with a clone car, and they arent even close to a clone of mini Z, in my oppinion the chassis is far more sophisticated, within the lines of suspension and other small things. I think including price as a variable, along with quality, Xmod is a way better deal.');
