INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (26562, 'd0dea28ea5', '', '[quote:d0dea28ea5="dabomb_04"]greatest TV show is Saved by the Bell  \r\ngreatest candy is Candy Corn\r\nyou ask i\'ll tell[/quote:d0dea28ea5]That\'s funny, we have exact opposite opinions.\r\n\r\nCome on Eileen tormented me on the radio and eMpTyV.\r\n\r\nWatching Saved by the Bell when there was nothing on, on a Saturday afternoon, was excruciating, until Kelly blossomed.\r\n\r\n...and Candy Corn reminds me of Halloween at my Grandmas house, and she always had these stail candy corns left over from last year. \r\n\r\nAnyways, I love diveristy, and think it\'s great that 2 people can have such different opinions, but I think it would be more appropriate to say Come on Eileen is your favorite song, and not the greatest, because we all know the Beatles wrote all the greatest songs. ;)  :lol: \r\n\r\nJust messin with ya.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n****Edit: [b:d0dea28ea5]SLAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAYYYYEEEERRRR[/b:d0dea28ea5]\r\n\r\nEvery Slayer show I ever been to was officially declared a riot scene by the City of Phoenix.\r\n\r\n...and the only \'reported\' casualties was the security.\r\n\r\n\'Nuf said.\r\n\r\nI tell too many stories sometimes, but I got to tell this one;\r\n\r\nNo venue in Phoenix would take them, so they got stuck at a disco club. The regulars, and security was lookin at us funny. When one of the security decided he didn\'t like Slayer, their music, or our kind. So he jumped up on stage and punched Araya in the face. Araya was unfazed, just looked at us, and said, "You saw that...", everyone screams "yeah", the Araya said, "you know what to do...", and 3000 people beat the shit out of a 350 pound body builder, then being all wound up, and not content putting one guy in the hospital, the crowd proceeded to beat down every security in the place, and Slayer played on...');
