INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (26693, 'efbc081235', '', '[quote:efbc081235]My chassis (without body) weighs 19.9 grams. The front wheels support 7.6g, and the back wheels support 11.8g.. \r\n\r\nI know there are a few tenths missing if you add the weight, but it\'s the best I can do at 2:00 in the morning \r\n\r\nI guess the rear supports about around 65%-70% of the weight.. \r\n\r\n\r\nIs that what you were asking? \r\n[/quote:efbc081235]\r\n\r\nThank you very much, I always thought it was the other way round. Well when i\'m adding weight, I\'ll have to \'wing it\' and get back to yall.\r\n\r\n[quote:efbc081235]I am a drift king! \r\nI drift all the time with my 4.2 and hard tyres. \r\n Now tell me that ain\'t a drift!!! [/quote:efbc081235]\r\n\r\nCan you contribute to the \'i have a drifting bit\' topic in the general forum?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (26694, '17262134a3', 'modelling clay?', 'Is modelling putty the same as modelling clay?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (26695, '3998628fc9', '', 'probably not.\r\nI\'m guessing the clay would be more dense of a compound, probably heavier, but easier to shape.\r\nputty would be lighter, better for "filling" and "smoothing"\r\nclay would be better for "shaping"');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (26696, '8e633afc85', '', '[quote:8e633afc85="sessiz"]Thanks for the pic man :-) \r\n\r\nKing diamond might have been cheesy but one of the things that attracted me to his music was the supernatural/horror type lyrics he sang. ANd that freakin voice  :shock: \r\nHe also told a story within his songs. All the songs on an album were like chapters. For instance, I really don\'t know much about the merciful fate albums, mellisa was kings sister who was possesed by his insane grandmothers ghost, or the spirits that controlled their family\'s house. I don\'t really remember to clearly.\r\nI thought it was different from the other shit out there and at that time I liked it.[/quote:8e633afc85]Yeah, I might have come off wrong calling him cheesey. I did dig the music, and I did think he had really cool lyrics, and the the first time you hear that voice it\'s like OMG, WTF :eek: \r\n\r\nIt would probably be more appropriate for me to say that his voice started to seem more of a novelty to me after repeated listening.\r\n\r\n...and Cabo, I don\'t know what\'s up with this Menudo and N\'Sync thing, but I could go for some of that CCR.');
