INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (26780, 'eba32896eb', '', 'Well my RS had the Efni and the Savanah but no bodies i picked up both cars but damn I really wanted that damn AE86.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (26781, '120ef3a59c', '', 'yup, I hear ya on all that.\r\nit\'s really cool to see how this place has grown in to its own in a rather short time.\r\nI\'m glad we got our meat hooks in you guys early too, that seemed predestined.\r\neach of you bring something different to the table that helps to set us apart - all are excellent additions to the team.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (26782, 'c3f8cf173e', '', '[quote:c3f8cf173e="SuperFly"]To be honest, I\'m not sure if I\'m getting one of these or not. Hue35 and I have been debating the subject, cuz we\'ve gotten to the point with original one-speed Microsizers with the mosfet mod, fast motor, teal or KIT racer gears, LXX tires on the rear, hard KIT racer tires on the front where the driving is so fast and so precise, that it\'s hard to imagine it being any better. And who needs another controller to haul around. I dunno. I might spend my money on an xmod when they come out.[/quote:c3f8cf173e]I was sitting in the same boat, still kind of am - but I haven\'t had it long enough to make a good judgement on it.\r\nI know I\'ll still love my bits more, so much more you can do to them and they just generally look nicer IMO.\r\nthe sole reason I got one of these things was for the propo - which is awesome for such a small car, but I\'ll have to say - mine needs tweeking. Out of the box, it was propo to the right, but not to the left and made the odd servo studdering noise.\r\nadjusting it is proving to be somewhat frustrating as you have 2 trims, 1 on the controller and 1 on the chassis. the one on the chassis seems to be the one causing issues because it spins so damn much.\r\nI also dig the idea of changing the freqs. on the Tx, would like to see if that really works (how much interfirence)\r\n\r\nlove the new sig dude lol');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (26783, 'ff5140bcdf', 'peugot 206', 'hey every one...i just bought a peugot 206 from my big5 and brought it home and did  a tri laymans cell batt all in side the chassis and i put in a zz purple motor and icharge it for  5 min.s on my 4 cell charger and this sthing rock`s! its fast...it drifts...it handles good with spring suspension and earthmagnets...this car rocks!\r\n\r\nPICs comin soon');
