INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27075, 'f8a5324602', 'New DUB City Rims', 'I just wanted you all to know... I went to TRU today and found new DUB City diecasts with new rims.  :-D \r\n\r\n[b:f8a5324602]CTS[/b:f8a5324602]: ($2.99)\r\nThese nice 5-spoke rims are slightly smaller than Bit fronts. I\'ve seen the same style rims on trucks. Those truck rims are more the size of Bit rears.\r\n\r\n[img:f8a5324602]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UwDSAmkYuu!HSmoJxQ!d4ouIrj9ZqA48*MjPkgITw4rUQb6q9kl2VxwB2zjXHdFLL2Ix!ux7JIA*IahMnMjKMws6jhWsXEKjZWdL5przsWpcY7jnm0oz1l53m80Qu3UD/DUB%20City%20CTS.jpg?dc=4675439913576917515[/img:f8a5324602]\r\n\r\n\r\n[b:f8a5324602]MR2 kit[/b:f8a5324602]: ($4.99)\r\nThis kit comes with 2 sets of rims, 5-spoke w/disc brakes and 7-spoke w/disc brakes. They\'re about the size of Bit rears.\r\n\r\n[img:f8a5324602]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0WADaArAZvGCHSmoJxQ!d4uOUGwtbnstqbUodi6zAR8bcaiQ8dXhvWZKB*sf1M6uCljJD34a9YdrRGnBnnKQU0C01jgNiJ9d50OanTlipEdm2*WFbMNSmX*g9aY6xCQzNLgAAAP****8/DUB%20City%20kit%2002.jpg?dc=4675439913614824578[/img:f8a5324602]\r\n\r\n\r\nI think the wheels are labled [u:f8a5324602]wrong[/u:f8a5324602]! Check it out. The Formula-7\'s are the 5-spoke. Makes more sense that the 7-spokes should be called "Formula-7".  :???: \r\n\r\n[img:f8a5324602]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0WQDSAhEa9X!HSmoJxQ!d4uOUGwtbnstqZE7EfMqLytNrtMjiIRyVKM*C4EiQyXURhv8ko6yYcvlei*ACVPSLjvM4h7lRikbJL01jpjpH8D2e32qr0ErcpLzYxpfnErneMp18n9Ros*A/DUB%20City%20kit%2002a.jpg?dc=4675439913704848684[/img:f8a5324602]');
