INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27121, '9db20baa69', 'Make a foam rubber grip for your SE controller', 'My SE controller cramps my hand up, and I wanted a longer handle. So here\'s what I did, I picked up some of this Crayola Model Magic stuff from the grocery store. It\'s a modeling compound that dries into foam rubber.\r\n\r\n[img:9db20baa69]http://members.cox.net/strollerpusher/mmagic.jpg[/img:9db20baa69]\r\n\r\nI used two of the individual packs that come inside. I smashed and formed it around the base of the controller, and then formed the handle part. After I had it the way I wanted, I took an exacto knife and trimmed the edge to clear the important stuff, also to give it a nice straight edge.\r\n\r\nThis is the finished product.\r\n[img:9db20baa69]http://members.cox.net/strollerpusher/segrip.jpg[/img:9db20baa69]\r\n\r\nI wanted to use black, but that only came in the deluxe set, for 10 bucks. The set I got was mismarked for a buck, so I settled for white. I might try to color it later.');
