INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27183, 'b99bbcc4aa', '', '[quote:b99bbcc4aa="DarkTari"]Good News Pimps, Lil Matrix tied for 2nd place so they\'re gonna double up on the second prize.  I still stick to my earlier statements. He\'ll be thrilled when he wakes in the morning.....\r\n\r\nJust checked the winners,  did you guys see that shit!  3rd place to GeckoBoy ????  His shit wasn\'t mentioned in any of the picks, I don\'t think that he even got 1 vote !!!!!  See what I mean !!!![/quote:b99bbcc4aa]\r\n\r\n\r\nCongrats to your son dood.. At least one of of our own was recognized..\r\n\r\nThey booted my car out for not complying with their rules.. (rules are rules) but they let "Geiko nuts" stay in, and not only that, but he won shit too...\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m not pissed cuz I didn\'t win any of their shit.. I\'m grown, and will buy/build anything better than the stuff in a contest. Especially RC Mod contest..\r\n\r\nI just think they could have made it less obvious that they really don\'t care for "our kind" over there..  And the feeling is mutual..\r\n\r\n\r\nOh well.. se la vi. fark em in the booty\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
