INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27194, '46edf9afd1', 'Charge times......', 'I was just wondering what is a good charge time for a 200mAh cell? I would hate to over charge and mess up the cell.\r\n\r\n  Maybe someone with knowledge in this area can post "best charge times" for the different cells out there.\r\n\r\n  Thanks in advance');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27195, '1743930017', 'Re: pearl essent and paint cracking question', '[quote:1743930017="micromatch"]i was diggin through sum stuff when out of no where i see a lil pink glass bottle..then i open up the top to find nouthing but...pearl essent! i was like yes! i almost wanted to cry it was so beutiful but right now im paintint a skyline this green color but the paint keeps cracking how odo  i fix that? and also..will the pearl essent work on bit bodys?..its just so beutiful[/quote:1743930017]The paint keeps cracking because the paint below has dried too long, and you\'re laying the paint on top too thick. I\'ve had that problem when painting guitars, and doing 16+ coats. So you may be laying all your coats too thick.\r\n\r\nIs that Pearl stuff powder? If so then you\'d just mix it with your paint, preferably the clear top coat, and apply with an airbrush.\r\n\r\nIf it\'s liquid it may interact with your paint, find out if it\'s laquer, enamel, or other base.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27196, 'eb8daecde1', '', '[quote:eb8daecde1="brendan123"]I thought i voted 4 ur car bilbo but i must of got it wrong. like bilbo said 30% comes from us and the rest the judges, but they pull 2nd an 3rd out of a hat so anyone can win.[/quote:eb8daecde1]\r\n\r\nI guess that went for 3rd &amp; 4th.  Didn\'t see them in any of the picks!\r\n\r\nYea, LilMatrix got 2nd in his first contest.  He found out this morning and hit Da Roof, very excited indeed!  I congratulate all the winners &amp; participants from Da Hood that competed !  LilMatrix will definately hit the contest circuit representing Da Hood.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27197, '6eb9b1a6ff', '', '[quote:6eb9b1a6ff="DriveWRX"]Did you have to glue it onto the controller?\r\nHow\'s it holding up so far?[/quote:6eb9b1a6ff]No I didn\'t have to glue it (yet). I squished about 3/4 of an inch around the bottom to hold it. Then I had to cut it away on the front and where the trigger is, and I think there is about 1/4 of an inch left in those areas.\r\n\r\nIt\'s plenty durable for regular use, but I\'m afraid one good smack will knock it off. We\'ll see. \r\n\r\nI colored it with a marker, and it looks good, and isn\'t coming off on my hand at all.\r\n\r\n[img:6eb9b1a6ff]http://s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/segripbk.jpg[/img:6eb9b1a6ff]');
