INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27437, '5b4826f2e5', '', 'Glad you got the fets and got them working. I cracked a smile when I read your install notes, as that\'s pretty much the story on more than one that I\'ve done. Get all the transistors removed and most of the fets attached in 20 minutes, and then spend an hour or two trying to get the wires attached and all the troubleshooting done. It\'s nice when it works, eh?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27438, '5d43934cdd', 'Eat\'n crow for bein impatient!', 'For anyone that knows me, they know that I\'m an absolute ANIMAL about hunting the net for the BEST price possible before buying something I want...Rebates, coupons, pricematches, whatever it takes. I loathe the thought of paying more for anything that I absolutely have to.\r\n\r\nAnd so the latest item I wanted is the LowePro \'Trim Trekker\' camera bag. The lowest price from a reputable camera shop is $110 (+ tax or ship, from B&amp;H Photo)\r\n\r\nI\'m on the hunt! After much digging I find out a joint called Henrys puts these bags on egay for $85 (+$10 ship. when they have them, which they don\'t). I emailed them about when they\'d get more and was told it\'s a crap shoot and they never know...I got that email from them yesterday.\r\n\r\nThere was also another shop on egay selling it for $89.99...But $20 ship!!! They\'re based in Canada is supposedly why. Even so, it comes out cheaper than the $110 at B&amp;H.\r\n\r\nSo late last night I pulled the trigger and bought from the Canuck store. This morning I check on egay again...Those FUCKERS at Henrys put up the Bag!!!\r\n\r\nHad I waited only a few more hours till mornin I\'d have gotten it from Henry\'s for less...So I\'m eatin crow, but not too much crow cause those FUCKERS would have my money if they\'d have bothered to pull their heads out of their asses and let me know they had the bag (no way they didn\'t know they had the thing between last night and this morning)');
