INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27514, 'c6e612e0af', '', 'damn DT, another stylish job.  Great colour, great body work, the scoop looks good, nice coloured wheels.  Great work.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27515, 'c740417b4e', '', '[quote:c740417b4e="crazydave"]That is nice. It\'s got kinda of a cross between a hot rod, and a lowrider influence. Like a mix between performance and class.\r\n\r\n[/quote:c740417b4e]\r\n\r\nThanx Pimps!\r\nDave, that\'s exactly the look I was going for!\r\nAs I said earlier, this thing went thru so many changes while modding.  I decided to chop the top to make it different from other bB mods so I took it a step further and extended the roofline to form a visor, one piece! Then I decided to put an L88 style hood scoop to massage in more muscle. The rear wing went through a lot.  I didn\'t want to use one from another bit so I made it, formed it, changed it until I got the look I wanted.  It turned out great.\r\n\r\n[quote:c740417b4e]How did you pull off the visor?[/quote:c740417b4e] \r\n\r\nWhen I cut the back and removed, I cut the top off, chopped down the windshield &amp; side windows. Then shorten\'d the the side windows to extend the bed, slid the roof forward, fitted, shaped, glued, &amp; puddy\'d. That was one of the things that took so long. I had never worked with puddy before so it sat for a while til I got more experience modding. I\'ll post some indoor pics to show more of the detail, the sun kinda took away some with that color.  Did the same thing with [b:c740417b4e]Deep Purple[/b:c740417b4e].  Something about those Violet family colors ????');
