INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27745, '33f8e50dcf', '', '[quote:33f8e50dcf="BilboBaggins"]To keep it secret.\r\nTo keep others from getting clones on the market first.\r\nStill trying to get all the legal issues (licenses) settled.\r\n\r\nThose are the top three answers to "Why would you need permission from RS to show pics?"[/quote:33f8e50dcf]\r\n\r\n1. What secret are they they trying to keep? these cars will be officially released soon. Even the RS fliers have lil teasers on them.\r\n\r\n2. How are keeping pictures of the xmods car off of BP going to stop other companies from producing clones of it? It would be highly unlikely that some other company would release a clone of the xmods car before rs would be able to release their car. I kinda have the feeling that the xmods is a clone in the first place.\r\n\r\n3. Legal issues are always a concern but all of them should have been settled before production even started.\r\n\r\nI really don\'t see any reason to keep pics off of this forum.');
