INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27793, 'b08a6c7596', 'Great site!!!', 'I first stumbled across mini-rc\'s a little over a year ago when I picked up a Sen Fa Bit Char G at a hobby store.  I was bored at work the other day and I happend to do a search for mini-rc\'s and I found this forum.  I\'m impressed with all the work and knowledge that everyone has put into this site.  So impressed, I went out to RS yesterday and picked up a ZipZap SE.  After a few rave reviews on here, I had to try it for myself.  It literally runs circles arond my other mini-rc.  The new steering apparatus makes manuevering it very easy.  I think I\'m hooked because today I picked up some Porsche 911 bodies, a street tuner upgrade kit along with performance booster and tire and hubcap kit.  The one thing I noticed is that the Char G has two different sized wheels, a smaller size up front and a bigger size for the rear.  The ZipZaps just have one size tire for all four wheels.  Does anyone know if most other imports go with 2 different sizes of tires on their cars?  I was hoping to stick with brands that are interchangeable so I can share parts.  Can anyone list a few brands that should have parts that fit each other.  Thanks and I look forward to hanging out around here.   After reading some of the electrical modifications done to the cars, I remembered one of my friends is an electrical engineer, so I\'m going to talk to him and see if he can think of any other ideas to enhance these cars.');
