INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27807, '7acad144d4', 'Get off your face for free', 'OK so that was was my version of spam :-)   \r\n\r\nSeriously though  :???:  , Bonzer is going into production - lets hope it turns out like the vids  \r\n\r\nSo this is the first announcement of the imminent end of the Bonzer competition  :sad:  . \r\n\r\nYour last chance to win the buzz machine that no one knows about yet. \r\n\r\nIt don\'t cost owt to enter, just the will   :D \r\n\r\nFor those of you that have been watching (and give a toss) it is happenig as you read - the wheels are in motion, no stopping it now, first shipment to hit uk for Xmas (just). Radio Shack Uk selling it - the rest (retailers) are ready to be educated - bonzer style   :rockon:  :smoking:  :screwed:  :ak: \r\n\r\nSo what, you may ask, well, as soon as the first batch of 2,000 are produced, the competition closes. You have no chance of wininnnning a bonzer mat. Not just any BonzerMat, but one that is unique + you get a couple of cars thrown in. (plus 10 mats to be given away, and I\'ll pay the postage!)\r\n\r\nGo to www.bonzergear.com, do it now, it makes some sense  \r\n\r\nIt would be really cool if some pimps won a few mats (less than 50 entries so far - odds of 5:1 are pretty good :eek: )\r\n\r\nCheers \r\n\r\nTeam Bonzer \r\n\r\nAlso some new pictures on the site showing the new style red barrier. Also track design changed slightly - bonzer gone yellow and proud');
