INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27964, 'b856b456e3', '', 'ya know DT, I agree, there\'s a rush of interests in the SE\'s, but after having mine now for about 2 weeks.\r\nI can honestly say it will never replace my bits (just as I said in the beginning). The SE\'s are cool, but only to a degree - bits still stomp them in just about every aspect that concerns me.\r\n\r\nI think this "fad" will fade out, SE\'s need another version before they can even begin to contend with bits.\r\n\r\nnow my next gripe...\r\nsince the SE\'s - I haven\'t heard shiat about Super Bits, wots the dealio? lol');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37271, 'e60f6cc7da', '', ':shock: ..... i just cant keep up with your work darktari, its like you have this little machine. You throw a bunch of chassis parts, a body, some paint, and this amazing ride pops out. then you post these works of art nearly twice a week! incredible job. but dont keep us in suspense... what is up with that rear end man  :)  i can put my finger on it.. its definatly not the lancer.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27966, '05c49e9ced', '', 'alright folks, I know some of you\'ve seen this one before but, yes, she\'s been changed.... once again...well, here she is, hopefully worhty of your praise!\r\n\r\npretty much completely custom mitsu eclipse ZZ\r\nbody kit-made from gameboy cases\r\npaint-silver fade to green\r\nrims-dub city\r\ninternal dual cell\r\ndifferent interior than normal ZZ, includes single seat, NOS bottle, steering wheel and extra piece for convy roof\r\n"cabo tailights"\r\npentip exhaust that goes into the body\r\n"PIMPN IT" liscense plate\r\n\r\nand I think that about covers it.... so, here are the links\r\n[img:05c49e9ced]http://www.rcpics.net/media/bp_eclipse_1.jpg[/img:05c49e9ced]\r\n[img:05c49e9ced]http://www.rcpics.net/media/bp_eclipse_2.jpg[/img:05c49e9ced]\r\n[img:05c49e9ced]http://www.rcpics.net/media/bp_eclipse_3.jpg[/img:05c49e9ced]\r\n[img:05c49e9ced]http://www.rcpics.net/media/bp_eclipse_4.jpg[/img:05c49e9ced]\r\n\r\ndefinitely better with the dubs!\r\n\r\noh yeah, and I can\'t forget that we have payaso, DarkTari, Yagbols, PimpIke, and SilentWolv checkin it out!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27967, 'ecda591f55', '', 'I keep meaning to get a super bit but people keep telling me to stay away for now.\r\n\r\n  I hear they have buttons on top they have no use (as of yet)???');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27968, 'd8964fde1d', '', 'yea, right now I don\'t think the buttons are used at all.\r\ndon\'t get me wrong, super bits and bits in general could use some improvements as well, but overall - as it stands now, I like my bits better than my zipzaps.\r\n\r\nI gotta get me a super bit still too');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (27969, 'f6d6546dd3', '', '[quote:f6d6546dd3="CaboWabo"]ya know DT, I agree, there\'s a rush of interests in the SE\'s, but after having mine now for about 2 weeks.\r\nI can honestly say it will never replace my bits (just as I said in the beginning). The SE\'s are cool, but only to a degree - bits still stomp them in just about every aspect that concerns me.\r\n\r\nI think this "fad" will fade out, SE\'s need another version before they can even begin to contend with bits.\r\n\r\nnow my next gripe...\r\nsince the SE\'s - I haven\'t heard shiat about Super Bits, wots the dealio? lol[/quote:f6d6546dd3]\r\n\r\nDamn bit lovers. :x \r\nI\'m happy with the se, I can\'t say the same about my super bit char-g. :-) \r\nWanna give us those aspects that concern you bro?\r\nAll you gotta do is show some love to yer se just like them lil bits get. The only problem I got with the ses is the damn runtimes. :x');
