INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37270, '29f47d785a', '', '[quote:29f47d785a="Finks"]TMP, not to be rude, but was there a point to your post.  I have yet to see you post a personal mod you have done and yet I have seen SGs work.  Just seemed your response was a bit condecending even tho I doubt you intended to do that.  If you are going to post "answers" to a Pimps question, then friggin post an answer, not "phhht it\'s soooo easy figure it out yourself and stop wasting my time".  Again I know this wasn\'t your intention, but at leaste to me that\'s how it came accross.   :-?[/quote:29f47d785a]\r\n\r\n\r\nReally sorry it came across that way.. i really didnt mean it to sound angry or superior. just wanted to give him the go to be as creative as you can with these things... because half the stuff is easier and better to make yourself, just trying to inspire a bit. If i came across wrongly im truely sorry, did not intend it in that manner what so ever. None of that post was intended to be arrogant or stuck up sounding, in fact i really admire new commers to the hobby and im willing to patiently help anyone on a problem they might have, i am no way a guru or know it all to micro RC, nor am i trying to be, but i would post something like "phhht it\'s sooo easy, figure it out yourself and stop wasting my time." and i would not like to be thought of that way at all pimps. As for my Mods, ive got quite a few interesting things on the back burners that i have yet to unleash...');
