INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28414, '58da035628', 'Micro Speed body sets', 'By now you\'ve probably heard Big Lots has replaced the Thunder Chargers with the Micro Speed cars. I\'ve been waiting for mine to get them in, and I finally got a hold of one last night. They have different, slightly improved bodies now. Instead of the fake Imprezza, we now have a faux Mercedes, an artificial Skyline, and an imitation Lancer.\r\n\r\nHere\'s the Mercedes, and skyline wannabes.\r\n[img:58da035628]http://s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/mspeed1.jpg[/img:58da035628]\r\n\r\nThey have body sets for 1.99. One included the Skyline, and Lancer wannabes, I had no interest in those, even for a 1.99, but the Hummer, and pickup set is kinda cool.\r\n\r\n[img:58da035628]http://s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/mspeed2.jpg[/img:58da035628]\r\n\r\nI can not wait to slap some paint on these, but I always have a problem with paint sticking to cheap clone bodies, and I don\'t have any cash for primer right this second, since I blew my extra cash on the cars.\r\n\r\nI think I\'m just gonna give them a good sanding, and go for it. If I blow it, oh well, I can blow another 2 bucks when I get some primer.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28415, 'a447f5c321', '', 'excellent dave, can\'t wait to see them with some of your style on them.');
