INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28418, '8e66ef05a0', '', '[quote:8e66ef05a0="crazydave"]That looks clean. Nice transistion into a Mercedes. What that start out as? The Porshe Boxter?[/quote:8e66ef05a0]\r\n\r\nI think it started out as a Merc, not 100% sure.  Sinned has done a similar thing, so it looks like they come as a Merc: [url]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=2222[/url]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28419, 'f0900c259a', '', 'Its not just video game people that are like that.  I get people like that all the time.\r\n\r\nQ:  " I noticed you are in Canada, will this game play on my system? I am in the US"\r\n\r\nA:  "YES but you have to put your system on its side and suspend it from fishing line over a fire"\r\n\r\nQ:  "I don\'t see an option for buy it now on your auction, is there one?"\r\n\r\nA:  "If you dont see it then that would be NO"\r\n\r\nQ:  "I see this item is at $50.00 already, would you stop the auction and sell it to me for $70"\r\n\r\nA:  "auction ends in 1 day I would suggest placing your MAX bid at $70 if thats what you are willing to spend"\r\n\r\nReply:  " OK thanks but when I just did that is said I have been outbid and the item is now at $120 as it looks like there are 3 other people fighting for this.   Would you consider just ending the auction now and I would give you $100?  I would really like to get this item for $100(shipping included) but I keep getting outbid"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  So yea gets the idea and I am sure Namuna and many others have delt with these morons hehe');
