INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28432, '7acdee8106', '', '[quote:7acdee8106="crazydave"]That looks clean. Nice transistion into a Mercedes. What that start out as? The Porshe Boxter?\r\n\r\nI came with in inches of ordering an Atomic Z car as my first car, but messed up and got the Cannonball. I wish I got the Z car, because for one thing the CB was a POS, but also because, aren\'t those smaller like a Digi-Q? Be kinda cool to have a smaller car.[/quote:7acdee8106]\r\n\r\nNah Cavey, I wouldn\'t have changed a Boxter into a C class, maybe an "S",  but not a "C".  It started life as a Benz: The Z-Car offered 2 models, Mercedes &amp; Celica in the folowing colors....\r\n\r\n http://www.microracers.com/Merchant2/merchant.mv?Screen=CTGY&amp;Store_Code=micro&amp;Category_Code=ZCAR\r\n\r\nThe cool thing is that it has it\'s own case/cntrl/chrgr/disco!  So I stick it in the bubble and pop it in the desk drawer.  The Z-Car is the American release of the Japanese........Can\'t remember off the top of my head right now.\r\nI\'ve seen many Micro RC contests and have yet to see a Z-Car entered so let me be the 1st, and beat Sinned to Da Punch this time.......');
