INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28465, 'dac8c0e25e', 'Bits or Biatches', 'If your wife or girlriend told you to give these up or she was leaving what would you choose?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28466, '8ee4118ddd', '', 'I can\'t vote yet, I\'m still trying to figure this out...\r\n\r\nOk, now if it was to the point where she was going to leave me, then maybe I should take a step back and take a break, but am I just gonna stop buying, and still be able to play with the ones I have? because if she won\'t even let me play with what I got then maybe she is being irrational, and I should let her go?\r\n\r\n\r\nDammit this is a hard question.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28467, '90b95dbcaf', '', 'The answer to that is simple.\r\n\r\n  I tell my bitach what to do so that would never happen in my house :-x \r\n\r\n\r\n  If you need to have your biatch trained then send her this way but I can\'t be responsible if she only listens to me after the training is over  :-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28468, 'db23782527', 'Red X Racing Membership Open', 'Me and a few local friends are starting a race team known as "Red X Racing". It so far is nothing but a few local friends but we are wanting to expand it and get it big as possible. We are looking for normal bits to exclusive bits. We encourage you to send pics and specs of your cars to ImOnFireGetHelp@aol.com. We are involved in Drag,Course &amp; Track, Street(We meet in smooth parking lots sometimes and race), and also Rally. We are almost done with our drag course(working lights and staging tree), our round track is still in the process and the rally course idea is still being shaped. If you are interested and need more information, please email me.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28469, '2ee745982a', '', '[quote:2ee745982a="TheSavior*Insider"]if anyone wants product numbers for anything xmods just post what item u want the number for. i have all of them so dont be shy.[/quote:2ee745982a]\r\n\r\nGraphics and Decal Set --\r\nPaint Set --\r\nTurbo Packs --\r\nSpeed Checker --\r\nRear Wheel Kit --\r\nServo Gears --\r\nDisplay Box --\r\nTracking Race Chip --');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28470, '8108d3b341', '', 'A tough question no doubt. :???: \r\nIf she\'ld actually leave me over a few toys I\'ld give her a nice sweet kiss on the cheek. Then I\'ld go and bang The first ten chicks I found and tape it. With this done I\'ld sit her down and put on some al green, pop in the vid and whisper in her ear   " Now you gots a good reason to leave."\r\nThe funny thing is that my wife knowing me as well as she does still nags me whenever I buy a new car/toy. :-?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28471, 'bf7ecd4f72', '', 'yup, I can see the rational...\r\nif she\'s gonna leave me over a toy that is one of the few releases and escapes I have, then I might have to let her go bye-bye.\r\nnow if we\'re talking I haven\'t showered or slept in 48 hours and we can\'t eat because I gotta have a new bit, then yea - I\'d still let her leave LOL j/k');
