INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28473, 'a1cc3c33a7', 'eBay crap: Damaged item...Need advise!', 'I sold and sent off a camera and just received an email from the buyer that it\'s defective. I know I sent off a properly working camera, but the guy gave pretty detailed info about what was wrong and his attempts at calling for support...And being told it would cost $95 to get it fixed (they bought the camera itself for $83).\r\n\r\nSo, this means UPS screwed it up. The Buyer wants a refund, but what the hell do I want with a screwed up camera? Especially if it was working before I sent it!\r\n\r\nHow does this all work as far as putting in a claim with UPS? Do I have to take the thing back and refund the guy\'s money and then call UPS and put in a claim (that would SUCK).\r\n\r\nHelp me out anyone that\'s familiar!\r\n\r\nThanks.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28474, 'd6255a2310', '', 'If the choice was one or the other I\'ld definatly pick biatches.\r\nI\'m too freakin horny and bits are too small and not as soft. :-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28475, 'ed0c458271', '', 'Tracking Race Chip? OMG! That\'s off da hizzle fo shizzle. Multi-lap racing without needing to count with an impaired mind. I\'m all over that and the lap counter, if that\'s what Tracking Race Chip means.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28476, '6328b53090', '', 'that\'s why UPS offers insurance for the packages (for extra money of course).\r\nunless you had the package insured, I think you\'re going to have to eat this one. but better a learning experience on this than something bigger and more precious.\r\nthat\'s why when I ship I go overboard and put something like a bit in a box the size of a frickin tv. so when they place soccer with it in the warehouse, the shit on the inside is fine after they crush in the sides of the box wwf style.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28477, '13bd5c710c', '', 'Another thing I do is with anything I try and write down serial #\'s or anything else to help tell it was the one I sent.  \r\n\r\n  I have found and had it happen were someone will buy a product and then say it was broken.  When I ask them to ship it back(as I will not refund anything if I dont have the item back) the serial #\'s didn\'t match.\r\n\r\n  some people want everything for nothing.  Man if you wanna screw someone go screw a multi-mil company like walmart or something leave the little guy alone :)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28478, '8aa52360a9', '', 'Actually C-dub, ALL packages sent via UPS are automatically insured by them for a value up to $100...It\'s when an item cost more than that they you\'d have to get extra insurance.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28479, '440f2e88db', '', 'I want to do a lil critique if I may.\r\n\r\n[img:440f2e88db]http://picserver.student.utwente.nl/getpicture.php?id=390426&amp;size=384[/img:440f2e88db]\r\n\r\nBiggie size...http://picserver.student.utwente.nl/getpicture.php?id=390426\r\n\r\nFirst off the wallpaper looks way too cluttered. When ya add desktop icons, or a dock, the icons can get lost or at the very least become hard to see.\r\nWhat I would do is to either make the background (everything but the car, model and text) monotone or black and white. You should also blur it a lil.\r\n\r\nSecond thing is that the bitpimps text is somewhat hidden. It\'s size is small and the color and style makes it blend into the background, not in a good way. :) Seeing as this wallpaper is supposed to be a BP site wallpaper I\'m thinking the address should be somewhat dominant.\r\n\r\nYou\'ve done a great job and please don\'t take this criticism the wrong way. I\'ld love to see more wallpapers from you.  :-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28480, '7be48cea80', '', 'If I may add, (now this might just be my eyes) but the bit pimps address looks wrong.\r\n\r\n  Again I only say this cause its hard to see and (after a few cold ones) it looks incorect from my eyes');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28481, 'da1ff0f107', '', ':???: Yup, bitpimps.com brings up a 404. \r\nThe correct address is\r\nBitpimps.lixlink.com');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28482, 'cd7a2a902e', '', '[quote:cd7a2a902e="Namuna"]Actually C-dub, ALL packages sent via UPS are automatically insured by them for a value up to $100...It\'s when an item cost more than that they you\'d have to get extra insurance.[/quote:cd7a2a902e]\r\n\r\n I think they need to put a claim in with UPS.\r\n\r\n  As they are the ones that know its broken and whats broken on it.\r\n\r\n  He should ahve info with his packing slip.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28483, '5d718fc5aa', '', 'I guess the thing here is...Do I take the thing back (assuming they\'re honest people and send back the proper item) and EAT the money? Or do I tell the guy to put the claim in with UPS and I\'m willing to help with filling in claims.\r\n\r\nThis sucks.');
