INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28512, '4c549468c1', '', '[quote:4c549468c1="Quest MX5"]Like I Said before people like what they like and I\'m not here to tell people what to do, I\'m just expressing my views of good and bad. I forgot to add something. I wanted people to stop putting the "ghetto" rims on the cars like RX-7s,Skylines(old school dont count), and other RACE cars. Put them on some low riders or something. Understand what I\'m saying[/quote:4c549468c1]First you say you\'re not here to tell people what to do, then you say: \'I wanted people to stop putting the "ghetto" rims on the cars like RX-7s,Skylines(old school dont count), and other RACE cars. Put them on some low riders or something. \'\r\n\r\nYou just told me what to do, phuc you.\r\n\r\n...and another thing, the rims on my cars are BBS race rims, the same rims found on GT cars, like the Porshe and Viper, and and have very little in common with a lowrider.\r\n\r\nYou\'re entitled to you\'re opinion, just don\'t ever tell me what to do. :finger:\r\n\r\n**Edit:just because I refuse to be told what to do:\r\n[img:4c549468c1]http://www.s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/alloyz.jpg[/img:4c549468c1]');
