INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28515, '6baffd8e13', '', 'Fly!\r\n\r\nI\'ve always loved that color on the older Porsche\'s (1974-1977), especially with the Rust or Peanutbutter color interiors. I see you left the wing off the rear to give it that nice early Porsche look.  Your RX7 from a front view looks just like a Porsche 944 Turbo! Real nice kit you\'ve got there. Helluva good job Pimp! That paint on the Skyline alone with the Nach Wheels are awsome Pimp!  Can\'t wait to see Da rest !!!!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28516, '09efe133fa', '', 'Before I answer, I wanna know has this ultimatum been given to you?\r\n\r\nCircumstances is the key, I\'ve been married a long time, I just started with Bits going on 11 months now.  I\'ve had my passions in the past My Capri, My Bimmer Alpina, Body Building, and for the past few year my Rover.  Now she\'s been there all this time and all the past passions involved a lot of out of the house activities. Rallys, Summit Point Racing, Winery Tours, Out of town Competitions, etc.  She\'s complained some but nothing extreme. She been to a lot of events that involved spouses so she knew how much this stuff meant to me.  Now if she threatened to leave because of these lil things, there are deeper issues! This may be the catalyst, but not hardly worth leaving someone over.  Need to find out what the [b:09efe133fa]REAL[/b:09efe133fa] issue is! Unless you\'re totally neglecting her which bought this on in the first place, then she has a case.  It\'s petty as shit and if I were you.........\r\nSee Ya !\r\n\r\nBut don\'t let us influence any decision [b:09efe133fa]YOU [/b:09efe133fa]need to make!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28517, 'd01b174c21', '', 'Dave Is absolutely right!\r\n\r\nI want you to define [b:d01b174c21]Ghetto[/b:d01b174c21] ?\r\n\r\nThe wheels you are reffering to are "Alloys", BBS, ATS, Audi, Alpina, etc. are all European wheels designed for European Cars and beyond.  These are made in Germany where there are no Cadis &amp; lowriders of such.  \r\n\r\nYour opinion is your opinion, you like what you like, But that don\'t mean shit around here!  This is not a residential forum, You in Da Hood now, where anything goes that we allow. And if you can\'t get with that then I suggest you make your residence in one of the other [b:d01b174c21]Residential Forums[/b:d01b174c21] .  We can take constructive critisism, but we don\'t tolerate fuckin insults as you will find out!   :screwed:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28518, 'c7ea5220fb', '', 'Bling-o-licious mang :eek:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28519, 'f9d9ddefc3', '', 'I just also wanted to add, these rims are wide because they are race rims. The real race cars that would use these rims have widened panels to accomodate the wider wheels. A RX-7 is not a race car, unless you make it one.\r\n\r\nJust to show you that these rims actually fill out the wheel wells in some more race inspired cars:\r\n[img:f9d9ddefc3]http://www.s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/alloyz2.jpg[/img:f9d9ddefc3]');
