INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28522, 'fe931cc04a', '', '[quote:fe931cc04a="VooDooMafia"]I understand what you are saying but I think the rims depend on the paint job as well as the car.[/quote:fe931cc04a] Thats totally true. If they was to come out with cadilac I\'d throw the most ghetto deep dish rims on it(besides one black spare on the front right), lower it, give it scratches in paint, feel it full of small speakers and then across the front windshield a banner syaing "Dont Hate". I got this idea from a guy in my neighbor acuatlly driving such a car. I found it amussing.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28523, '2bee927487', '', 'dave stop tryin to twist my words up and start so much shit. You do have your own views of what you think looks good and what looks bad, and I\'m not here to say "Take those off your skyline now!" When I say "I just wanted people to not put em on the race cars" that was a view as in "i would like that" or "it would be nice". Believe me i know what BBS is and I just had to replace them on my MX5 due to me shifting into second with to much throttle on a corner that required third with small throttle. Dave those rims you have own your car arent what I\'m talking about. I\'m talking about rims that bow out like deep dish wheels. I\'m planning on getting some of those BBS anyway. While I\'m on the subject I\'ve got to give props for CaboWabo for his Dual Cell RX7 with the white wheels, and the Green R34 with the chrome and broze rims. If anyone can me where I can order those I\'d be most grateful');
