INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28558, 'c75571312a', '', '[quote:c75571312a="hue35"]I\'ve said it before, y\'all are lucky the biatch is in place BEFORE the little cars. This shit is chick repellant. "so what\'s all this stuff?"... "oh that\'s my dozens of little cars, and drawers full of parts... for days at a time the living room rug is rolled up to make room for the track. Yeah, the dishes ARE stacked up pretty high, but check out this new chassis... it\'s mosfetted."\r\n\r\nI\'m screwed..er, not.[/quote:c75571312a]\r\n\r\nHue,\r\n\r\nU got it bad Pimp!  I mean I like these cars more than anything.  I never visit the Rover webpages anymore, haven\'t ordered anything for it from the UK in more than a year (since Bits) but when it comes to keeping everything else up, work, running LilMatrix to Karate, Soccer, B-Ball practices and games, yard work, in the house upkeep, that can\'t suffer!\r\nI do loose gym time but not because of the Bits, this is a hobby, not an obsession.  Gotta take care of home 1st.  \r\nI share my interest with friends, male &amp; female and they think it\'s pretty cool.  Especially when they see what I can do to these lil buggers.  A good female friend likes BettyBoop and asked me to make her a Red Convertable to go with her collection.  She has collectables so she understands my hobby.  And what female wouldn\'t understand your hobby especially when you share it with your kid !!!!   I\'ll floss it when I\'m done.........');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28559, '2863314215', '', 'This reminds me of a joke (please forgive my veering from the topic for the moment).\r\n\r\nThere\'s this guy who\'s been seeing 4 women for some time and finally decides he wants to settle down with 1.\r\n\r\nHe\'s unsure which to choose, so he decides to put them to the test.\r\n\r\nHe gives $1,000 to each gal and tells them it\'s a \'gift\' to do with what they want. A couple of weeks later he asks each of them what they did with the money...\r\n\r\nGal #1: "I went out and bought make-up, clothes, shoes and such...I want to make myself look my very best for you!"\r\nGal #2: "I put the money in a savings account, for a rainy day in case anything ever happens."\r\nGal #3: "I invested the money in stocks, bonds and mutual funds...I want us to be well off in our future!"\r\nGal #4: "I love you so much, that I bought you a Mini-Z Overland, MiniX, and all this other stuff!"\r\n\r\nThe guy had a real hard time trying to decide which girl to go with. After a lot of thought and consideration he decided to go with the girl with the biggest tits.');
