INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28586, '2235b75c05', '', 'good work chiga, improvement from the first wallpaper I saw.\r\n\r\nthey\'re all really nice, some better than others.\r\n\r\nhttp://chiko003.tripod.com/mine/000504_2.jpg\r\nthis ones a cool shot, but the background might be too busy (at least for my tastes), maybe darken the background so you can just see hints of the road, cars, buildings, etc.\r\nlove the angle of the shot and the bit seems to fit good on the road.\r\n\r\nhttp://chiko003.tripod.com/mine/cof-copy.jpg\r\nI like this one alot. the sepia and blur give it a not so "in your face" tone.\r\nwould probably make a nice wallpaper.\r\n\r\nhttp://chiko003.tripod.com/mine/DCP02692-copy_web.jpg\r\nthis one\'s pretty damn cool too, the only gripe I\'d have is I think you should shrink the car up so it doesn\'t look so distorted and pixelated.\r\nother than that, this ones great. (specially boobies!)\r\n\r\nhttp://chiko003.tripod.com/mine/gripevo2.jpg\r\nI like the background you chose, but again I think the top part of the background should be dulled out more so it doesn\'t compete for attention with the icons on your desktop. I could live without the lens flares too...\r\nand there\'s a small typo in the URL.\r\nother than, this ones pretty nice too.\r\n\r\nkeep crankin chiga!\r\n\r\n(by the way, those were all constructive criticisms as well since you seem to be looking for them, I aint knockin your shiat.)');
