INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28697, 'eb3697f2ce', '', 'Yeah the flames came out well enough, it was just a poorly planned concept from the beginning. It\'s too contrasting. I like how the red and charcoal blended to give it a glowing effect, but blue and white flames were just the wrong colors to go with it, and for the front end of this body too.\r\n\r\nOh well you never know until you try.\r\n\r\nIt is a sorta odd Hummer. I can see your Jeep comparison, Superfly, because I thought something about it looked just a bit sportier, than a typical Hummer. Maybe because it\'s smaller and \'cuter\'. Maybe I just made the front bumper too low. :???:');
