INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37263, 'bab38a3eae', 'Ya, Whats up with that?', 'Thanks, Finks....but I guess I\'ll figure it out on my own since its soooooooooo easy....because the almighty himself TMP said so...\r\n\r\nWhats up with that?  I\'m still new to most of this stuff, but I do throw up some useful or at the very least interesting posts.  \r\n\r\nI usually dont reply to replies that are of no help, but I\'ll make an exception in this case.\r\n\r\nI try to only reply if I can acually give good help or advice on where to get what your looking for. My post count is low, and proably will stay that way until I learn more and get down and dirty with some of the mods I see in this forum.  I would like to inovate something, but that just happens, you can\'t just invent.  Its about creativity (and being h**h while you do it) and trial and error.  I\'ve had plenty of errrroors!!  \r\n\r\nSome of the things I see and read about these Pimps is absolutly insane.  I have to lean back in the computer chair and say, "What the hell?  Did I read that right? No, someone just didn\'t use powdered milk and beer as putty filler!!!"  Its stuff like that and the full explination of how they did it and why, that makes this place (BitPimp.com) as great as it is.......\r\n\r\nI have 2 cars in the shop right now, I was on vacation, but I go back to work Monday.  So theres no telling when I\'m going to get done now.  \r\n\r\nPlus, I work in a restuarant, so that just increases the time its going to take.');
