INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28726, '16cccba996', '', '[quote:16cccba996="BilboBaggins"]If you are going to make a sleeper car (a car that looks slow but blows the doors off other cars) why not use something that nobody else would think of using. Maybe a AMC Pacer or a Dodge Aspen.[/quote:16cccba996] Well you want a sleep but yet you want smething with a motor worth working on. You dont see to much performance parts for those cars, lol. Suprising as it may seem you can find alot of parts for miata, turbo,superchargers,nitrous everything, fly wheels to leight weight drive shafts,etc and the suspension list is longer. You gotta parts to make it go fast instead of the body, lol. There was a Dodge Shadow at our track, it was fucking turbo and was damn quick, it was a sleeper form hell and it was primer, hahaha');
