INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28782, 'cfaa558f7d', '', 'She\'s been a while I know.   But I did say I would be adding lights to the Gloria.  I haven\'t actually glued them in yet, but here\'s a preview:\r\n\r\n[img:cfaa558f7d]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/gloria_lights1.jpg[/img:cfaa558f7d]\r\n\r\nI know the image is crap, I currently don\'t have a digicam.   It will have white headlights, blue foglights and red tailights.\r\n\r\nOf course I use my custom DCDC convertor light PCB which allows me to run all these lights off the car\'s own battery.   I also did a current measurement and found it to be only draining 30mA!  Not too shabby.\r\n\r\n[img:cfaa558f7d]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/gloria_lights2.jpg[/img:cfaa558f7d]\r\n\r\nI\'ll try and get my bro\'s cam before the weekend is out and get some better pics.   Damn she\'s gonna be a slamin\' ride once it\'s finished!\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28784, '316f2396b6', '', '[quote:316f2396b6="ph2t"]Prey tell how you got over the ZZ SE\'s high steering mounts?\r\nph2t.[/quote:316f2396b6]\r\n\r\nThe biggest obstacle was the front of the pcb hold down, I had to trim it back a bit. As for the steering mount, I trimmed a very small amount off the front of the center (highest point) where the screw goes in.\r\n\r\nBrendan123,\r\n I entered this in the Ausmicro contest, check it out there.');
