INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28800, '00e2ccf75d', '', '[quote:00e2ccf75d="sessiz"][quote:00e2ccf75d="VooDooMafia"]\r\n  I think its time to invest in a new dremil though :)[/quote:00e2ccf75d]\r\n\r\nBe very careful with that dremel bro. If ya can muster up the patients use paper and blades for body work. \r\nNice job by the way :-)[/quote:00e2ccf75d]\r\n\r\nI use a dremel to get most of the crap off (depending on what I\'m doing).   But I always file/sand/cut with a blade when I get close to the edge of what I\'m doing, the dremel is just too muach of a beast to get any closer, woah nelly!   Also don\'t use the grinding heads, use a cutting head, they\'re better for plastic, the grinding heads just make the plastic melt.\r\n\r\nph2t.');
