INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28813, '077e5c8781', '', '[quote:077e5c8781="BilboBaggins"][quote:077e5c8781="Quest MX5"]Well you want a sleep but yet you want smething with a motor worth working on. You dont see to much performance parts for those cars, lol. Suprising as it may seem you can find alot of parts for miata, turbo,superchargers,nitrous everything, fly wheels to leight weight drive shafts,etc and the suspension list is longer. You gotta parts to make it go fast instead of the body, lol. There was a Dodge Shadow at our track, it was fucking turbo and was damn quick, it was a sleeper form hell and it was primer, hahaha[/quote:077e5c8781]\r\n\r\nThe Aspen came with an optional MOPAR 318ci V8. I think the 360 would also fit.\r\nThe Pacer I would stuff a V8 under the hood (or a turbo 6) and customize some lightweight parts (hood, seats, etc).[/quote:077e5c8781] I like old cars but not to familar witht he engines, lol. Just the ones I like and I\'m still pretty sketchy on those. lol I like v-8s but something about the 4 banger rice burners just draws me closer');
