INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28840, '02169ef6e9', '', '[quote:02169ef6e9="ph2t"]DT, I found that the R-34 pullback wing looks really nice on this shell.  AS shown below:\r\n\r\n[img:02169ef6e9]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/showroom/pugeot_1.jpg[/img:02169ef6e9]\r\n\r\n[img:02169ef6e9]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/showroom/pugeot_2.jpg[/img:02169ef6e9]\r\n\r\nI find the R-34 wing fits the width of the shell nicely.  As to the original wing that came with it, I think it\'s shit.   What you did with yours makes it look a lot nicer. :smile: When you see the wing in real life you can tell that Bensu didn\'t give a shit in getting that part right.\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:02169ef6e9]\r\n\r\nthis car you made is really wha inspired me to a peugot body but i have also found that on my xbox game rallisport that i have the peugot has kind of like a double wing and is yellow  with som weired as peougot body kit but it dont look to bad i might try to imitate it soon');
