INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (28972, '2079495eb0', '', '[quote:2079495eb0="ph2t"][quote:2079495eb0="Son_Gokou"]I LEFT TinyRC Because I wasn\'t helping out in anyway. All I was doing was causing shit on the boards, so I thought they\'d be better off without me. \r\n\r\nAnd I\'m ABOUT to be kicked off of this board for OBVIOUS reasons.  :cool:[/quote:2079495eb0]\r\n\r\nCharlie, I\'m sure if you make a positive commitment and put some time into your thoughts and suggestions you will find this forum quite an agreeable place to be.  Sure they are a lot of kids on these boards and not just adults but you will find that some of the most influential members are still growin\' hairs below the belt.....\r\n\r\nWith all that said I think your 2:1 ratio mod was an interesting one and I beleive that you probably have the capacity to come up with more interesting ideas and mods.  You obviously spend a fair amount of time on these forums and that\'s cool, I\'m not knocking you there but if you chill out a bit more I\'m sure a lot of pimps will be happy to converse with you.   \r\n\r\nMaturity isn\'t a function of age, just inversely proportional to pure dickheadness......\r\n\r\n :-) \r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:2079495eb0]\r\n\r\nThanks pimp!\r\n\r\nSpeaking of mods, I swapped my antenna on my ZZ Se with a green Cat5, giving it over 30 feet of range. I also found a way to drift better (but I\'m sure half of the members on this board thought of it already  :-) )\r\n\r\nAlso, I knew a member on the GameFaqs board who had a special quote: "Maturity has more to do with the experiences you\'ve had and what lessons you\'ve learned than the number of birthdays you\'ve celebrated."\r\n\r\nNow back to the topic of this thread(have to stay da topic, or it\'ll get locked down like these threads: http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=1946 &amp; http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=1950  ): I knew a member who "got his punk ass" booted off THREE forums, including MRCC, TRC, and this one. If none of you pimps mind me asking, why the hell was he kicked off here? His S.N. was SkyLiNEz 4-eva! or somethin\' like that.....  :???:');
