INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29014, '84c5f8b928', '', 'it is 4 AAA\'s in the car and a 9 volt in the controller, i just picked up the acura rsx, rsx body kit, awd kit, stage 2 motor kit, and suspension kit tonight. havent really had a chance to do too much with it. Tried it for about 5 mins in the kitchen.... what a mistake. This thing is a fricken bullet straight outta da box.Can take a licken too... my 3 y.o.  wanted to play wit daddys new zipzap so i let him... All he knows to do is pull the trigger  :eek:  made a bullet into the fridge , bounced off and slammed into the cabinet, bounced again and went straight for the dishwasher and stopped there  :shock:   Not even a scratch on it  :-)  Not too sure about dialing stuff in yet but i would like to get a tigher turn radius if possible ( only semi complaint i had). Definately gotta use this outside in a nice open area to see what she really can do. Can wait to experiment with all the other stuff. Definately recmmend one.');
