INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29222, 'd1a0a92365', '', '[quote:d1a0a92365="PimpIke"]Alright, im just plain out PISSED! The Savior* Inside has been mouthing off on how SHITTY the quality is on the MINI-Z, and I have to TOTALLY disagree. If there quality is shit, then why dosen\'t the whole world buy x-mods instead of those "shit" quality mini-z\'s? DID you notice that Tiny had a and still does have a WHOLE SITE just for the light of mini-z\'s? Are you kidding me that these are shit quality? Man you must be paied by RS to mouth off like that. Geesh, im out. and PEACE... \r\n\r\n\r\nMood:PISSED OFF                      Pimpike, fellow member of\r\n                                                        www.mini-zracer.com[/quote:d1a0a92365]\r\n\r\n\r\n  Well for the price I think the quality can be batter for sure.  They are nice cars but can get very pricey very fast.\r\n\r\n  As for everyone buying up a XMOD well wait till they are fully availible in all the shacks with all there hop ups :)  I think the faactor here is gonna be price.  Hell just look at the motor set you get 3 motors with gear for like 13 bucks.\r\n\r\n  For what I have seen and heard about these so far they are gonna be hot thats for sure :)');
