INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29228, 'cd1f0badd0', '', 'Update:\r\n\r\nNew products on the market for this christmas, not quite as fascinating as the ropelight, but here it is:\r\n\r\nChristmas lights made of LEDs , it uses 3mm led lights, theres 50 on a string, multi-coloured red,green, blue and yellow, it will go for about 7 bucks canadian when released, (sittin in our stores basement for now), and they light up using the regular 120 volt socket, but can be taken out of the string and used as single led lights for mods or anything, This method would be a lot cheaper than the ropelight, not as good effect, but can be made clean looking, and can also be inserted into tubing used for the rails and pointed straight on the track rather than all around. Theres also a 5mm size in this with 30 on the string for the same price.\r\n\r\nRice lights: incandescant version of the led, it is verrrry small, i was surprised that they werent leds, they look about 2mm and will go for under $3 cdn, 50 on a string, once again they can be removed, although they are not as bright as the led, they spread the light a bit better.\r\n\r\nRopelights: price has gone really cheap on pre-cut sizes, about $10 cdn for a 12 foot section of: Green light with green casing, and red light with red casing.\r\n\r\nThats everything for now!');
