INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29382, '8ac6454fac', '', 'Welp, I couldn\'t wait any longer for reviews once I knew a RadioShack across town had \'em in stock. Picked up a red Supra and a white Supra for SuperFly and myself last night. Right outta the box, I\'m shocked at what you get for $50. The thing drives great and it\'s pretty damn fast stock... probably about like a dual-celled bit. \r\n\r\nThere are some things I hadn\'t read about (I\'m sure they\'ve been said already), like you can adjust the battery boxes fwd and bkwd to adjust the weight distribution. Also, there are tie rods to adjust toe-in and toe-out, and a million other cool features.\r\n\r\nThe controller does seem a bit a little bit wussy, but I love the way feels... I instantly felt comfortable driving the car. I\'ll just be careful not to drop it cuz I don\'t think it will handle that too many times.\r\n\r\nAnyway, most of this has already been said, so I\'ll stop rehashing... the main thing for me is that this car could have been $100 and I would have felt like I got a badass car for the money. Tonight, we\'ll race in a half-empty 50x100 ft. room with a smooth painted floor and I can\'t fuckin\' wait!  :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29383, 'e4afae36f2', '', '[quote:e4afae36f2="hue35"]Tonight, we\'ll race in a half-empty 50x100 ft. room with a smooth painted floor and I can\'t fuckin\' wait!  :D[/quote:e4afae36f2]\r\n\r\n\r\nwhere the hell is this??? you lucky man!!! lol.... I think once i get one I\'ll have to rip it up in my church gym!!! baller!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29384, '0848dd82b0', '', 'I screwed something up, not sure what though. My car now only gets about 10ft at best worth of range. Could a bent car anttena have that much of an effect on the range? :???: \r\nIt got a lil twisted after a tumble off of mycar seat on the way to the track. I tried straightening it out but meh.\r\nI got spanked at the track by a kid that looks like he\'s homeschooled and don\'t get out to much.\r\nHe said that the miniz he had was bone stock, and it took the xmod pretty easy. I\'m not totaly sure that I got spanked that easy though, becuase of the range problem I\'m having the car would start to stutter half way down the track. \r\nThe owner of the place was being a lil assy I thought. I also saw him coming back to the track with a big RS bag. I wonder what he had up in there. :???:  :lol: \r\n\r\nAnywho, here\'s some pics. :-) \r\n\r\n[img:0848dd82b0]http://picserver.student.utwente.nl/getpicture.php?id=414444[/img:0848dd82b0]\r\n\r\n[img:0848dd82b0]http://picserver.student.utwente.nl/getpicture.php?id=414446[/img:0848dd82b0]\r\n\r\n[img:0848dd82b0]http://picserver.student.utwente.nl/getpicture.php?id=414447[/img:0848dd82b0]');
