INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29413, '4774b55abf', '', 'I don\'t understand your findings. The Perfection 4.2 Pro is advertised to have more torque than the Perfection 4.2. the reason it is reccomended for booster cars. In my experience the one 4.2 Pro I have has great torque, and probably more torque than the other  4.2s I have combined. \r\n\r\nHow did you come up with the findings?\r\n\r\nMy method of testing is unscientific, but the way I judge power is in my fet\'d cars. I only half FET reverse, so I don\'t have as much of a problem with the front wheels being in the air when slamming from reverse to forwards, trying to back out of tight situations, hard to steer with your front wheels in the air. Anyways, (stay focused dave, stay on track, k sorry, I\'m better now) with motors that have more torque, I can hardly tell the difference between forward and reverse, but with weaker motors, the difference is very noticable, and that is the case with the 4.2, where-as the pro is one of the ones that there is very little difference.');
