INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29458, 'da157ae8b8', '', '[quote:da157ae8b8="crazydave"]I would say this is why I refuse to ship through UPS, but it sounds almost like the customer is either trying to pull a fast one, or not too bright.\r\n\r\nThat\'s why I\'ve stopped using ebay completely in the last few months, been too many ignorant people, buyers and sellers, hanging about that place lately.[/quote:da157ae8b8]\r\n\r\n  Yep I would agree but I mostly get good people buying my shit.  What I really used to bother me is I would sell something for 2 bucks and people would complain about something really stupid like "The item was dusty when I got it, you didn\'t mention the dust on it in the add".   Well you are right I didn\'t what I said in the add was this toy is coming right from a shelf in my personal collection into the shipping box.\r\n\r\n\r\nFu&lt;kin people :)');
