INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29465, 'cd2b401bae', '', '[quote:cd2b401bae="sessiz"]I get annoyed by almost everyone under 16yrs old pretty damn quickly.[/quote:cd2b401bae]Ditto that 10x.\r\n\r\nI wont pick on one person I\'ll just rant on the stupid stuff kids do...\r\n\r\n1. They PM you asking you to do a mod, and offer to pay. When you try to be nice, and do it for a price that is more than fair, and I may even be losing a couple bucks on, thy come back with: I\'m just a kid I don\'t have that kind of money. Then what the fuck are you PMing me asking for shit for. I\'m broke dick mofo, I really really can\'t afford to buy toys for all they worlds poor children who only have 5 bits.\r\n\r\n2. They read 2 words of a post, think they get it, and then go spouting off misinformation all around the internet.\r\n\r\n3. This relates directly back to 2. They got this thing in their head, that just removing parts from the car at random will somehow make it faster. I think this somehow related to the crip cap mod, and on the first generation ZZs where removing a couple resistors helped out.\r\n\r\nI\'m sure I could go off all day, but that\'ll do for now.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHey Cabo, thanks for the place where we\'re free to speak our minds, I think alot of us needed this.  :-)');
