INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29617, '9cae1bc94f', '', 'A couple notes:\r\n\r\n1. All that white stuff is hue35\'s white Supra. His has even more red on it.\r\n\r\n2. These things are tough as hell. Full speed head on into a steel pipe, no damage. Full speed rear end crash into hue35\'s parked Supra causing it to flip end over end, a little paint exchange.\r\n\r\n3. Buy lots of rechargeable batteries. 4 sets will do, as the charging time is 2 hours, and the rechargeable batteries will give 30 minutes of runtime. This is assuming you can charge more than one set at a time.\r\n\r\n4. Do your mods gently, the screws and lugnuts will strip easily.\r\n\r\n\r\nAnd I never would have put myself in the Supra-liker category, as pretty much everything else I really like is German, Italian or 60s and 70s American. But I do like the Supra. Check this out[url]http://www.drunkstunts.com/videos/suprasliding_300.wmv[/url]');
