INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29729, 'fb1b336946', '', '[quote:fb1b336946="DarkTari"]Nice Ride CJ,  maybe a clear coat would prevent racing rubs ????\r\n\r\n[quote:fb1b336946]Nice job there cj. I\'m digging the euros but I dunno about that grill. Paint might have been better[/quote:fb1b336946]\r\nSezz,\r\nI think he was going for the [i:fb1b336946]Intercooler[/i:fb1b336946] look ?[/quote:fb1b336946]\r\n\r\nWhen you rub against concrete I don\'t think any amount of clear coat will help.\r\n\r\nThe Intercooler needs more work.  Nices thing about using that Foil to do that if I don\'t like it I can just peal it off and try again. \r\n\r\n[quote:fb1b336946="CaboWabo"]I see you and sessiz already have some racing rubs on the bodies. \r\nhow are those bodies anyhow? they seem like they might get destroyed easily? [/quote:fb1b336946]\r\n\r\nOnce the body is snaped on the chassis it feels like a brick.  The sides of my body just touches the batteries and the major gap between the body and chassis it the rear end.  They are definatly not model car plastic.');
