INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29732, '0976fc7eb5', 'Issue w/ microAmps?', 'I was just made aware of an issue with microAmps that I wanted to let you guys know about.\r\nI\'m not sure if there needs to be action taken or not, we can figure that out as we discuss it.\r\nHere\'s the gist.\r\n\r\n[quote:0976fc7eb5="crazydave"]You know I\'m not really a complainer, but there is bit of an issue going on behind the scenes. I hope I\'m not out of line bringing this up.\r\n\r\nSee Micro_amps has cracked the issue with SE, but is refusing to share his info. That is to be expected, he\'s a business man, like I\'ve been telling everyone, and people are starting to see it.\r\n\r\nSo anyways, yesterday me, ph2t, and VDM had been PMing each other about it. ph2t sent me copy of the email where micro_amps declared that he intended to get something out of this, because he put a few hours into it. \r\n\r\nMe and ph2t are working together to come up with our own solution. We want our info to be made public, ph2t because of creative development. Me because I think it\'s ridiculous to send your car to the other side of the world, end up paying 50 bucks just to have 2 dollars worth of mosfets installed in your car. It takes me about 20-30 minutes nowadays. I feel micro_amps is ripping people off, and I don\'t dig on that.\r\n\r\nAnyways, here\'s where you come in. I not sure if you would consider this spamming, but micro_amps just posted this thread annoucing he\'s open for business on the SE mods. I personally felt this was crass self promotion, but it\'s your site your call, i just wanted to bring to your attention what went down yesterday.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=2317\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:0976fc7eb5]\r\nI\'ll go ahead and admit, this is the exact reason why I have never dealt with microAmps. He\'s a salesman. I know the dude knows his shit for sure when it comes to electronics, but whatever - so do other people, here, in the US.\r\nSo while I am curious to have him do some work for me, I doubt I ever will just because of "that feeling" I get.\r\n\r\nnow I\'ve never really looked at microAmps quite the way crazydave has described, though taking just a few seconds to look from that perspective, I can see where crazydave, ph2t, and VDM come up with their assumptions.\r\n\r\nreally, what irks me about this situation is microAmps greed.\r\nhe never really contributes a whole lot, but if/when he does, there\'s a few nuggets there. I hate the fact that he is un-willing to even give hints as to his situation, then being as bold to tell ph2t he\'s planning on getting something out of this. to me, this shows that even someone who had a pretty strong bond with microAmps (ph2t), is even backing up and taking a moment to think about his fellow aussie mate and what he\'s doing.\r\n\r\nagain, I\'m not sure if action even needs to be taken here, but it for sure puts microAmps in a much dimmer light for me than he already was.\r\n\r\nthoughts?');
