INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29806, '28f3db5789', '', '[quote:28f3db5789="cj"][quote:28f3db5789="TheSavior*Insider"]if anyone wants product numbers for anything xmods just post what item u want the number for. i have all of them so dont be shy.[/quote:28f3db5789]\r\n\r\nGraphics and Decal Set --\r\nPaint Set --\r\nTurbo Packs --\r\nSpeed Checker --\r\nRear Wheel Kit --\r\nServo Gears --\r\nDisplay Box --\r\nTracking Race Chip --[/quote:28f3db5789]\r\n\r\nGraphics and Decal Set -- 600-8511\r\nPaint Set -- RS not selling them, gotta go to a hobby store\r\nTurbo Packs -- u mean motors? 600-8501 and 600-8502\r\nSpeed Checker -- none right now\r\nRear Wheel Kit -- u mean AWD? 600-8506\r\nServo Gears -- ???\r\nDisplay Box -- make your own lol. there is a messenger style bag made specificly to carry your xmods and xmods gear tho. it is 600-8520\r\nTracking Race Chip -- on drawing board, trying to get the same technology that is used in nascar.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29807, 'c20655c8db', '', '[quote:c20655c8db="VooDooMafia"][quote:c20655c8db="PimpIke"]Alright, im just plain out PISSED! The Savior* Inside has been mouthing off on how SHITTY the quality is on the MINI-Z, and I have to TOTALLY disagree. If there quality is shit, then why dosen\'t the whole world buy x-mods instead of those "shit" quality mini-z\'s? DID you notice that Tiny had a and still does have a WHOLE SITE just for the light of mini-z\'s? Are you kidding me that these are shit quality? Man you must be paied by RS to mouth off like that. Geesh, im out. and PEACE... \r\n\r\n\r\nMood:PISSED OFF                      Pimpike, fellow member of\r\n                                                        www.mini-zracer.com[/quote:c20655c8db]\r\n\r\n\r\n  Well for the price I think the quality can be batter for sure.  They are nice cars but can get very pricey very fast.\r\n\r\n  As for everyone buying up a XMOD well wait till they are fully availible in all the shacks with all there hop ups :)  I think the faactor here is gonna be price.  Hell just look at the motor set you get 3 motors with gear for like 13 bucks.\r\n\r\n  For what I have seen and heard about these so far they are gonna be hot thats for sure :)[/quote:c20655c8db]\r\n\r\nhehe thats 4 motors.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37218, 'd3a6e88d6a', '', 'Dude, that\'s cool. What a sweet way to control lights or other implements. Could you make a dual-celled car, and use it to switch from single cell to both cells? That would leave a boost car in the dust. Lots of possibilities.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37219, 'c822cea5f8', '', 'Thanks man, yes you could use it to do that sort of thing.  That\'s my point.   This mod is more of a platform to do other mods on.  By itself it\'s just an academic exercise but when it\'s used for something else, then hey, it\'s the real thing.  \r\n\r\nSome ideas for this mod could be:\r\n\r\nturn on/off headlights, rearlights, etc....\r\nswitch between single and daul cells\r\nturbo addon to add an extra cell ontop of a normal dual/single\r\n\r\nI\'ve got an idea for an insane turbo mod that will kick in an extra 3V (from a lithium batt) into an already daul celled booster just using this mod and a mosfet or two......coming soon.....\r\n\r\nph2t.');
