INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29885, 'd23a72e834', '', '[quote:d23a72e834="payaso"][quote:d23a72e834="crazydave"]That\'s odd now micromatch and Payayso have said they prefer the 4.2 to the pro. My Pro is noticebly more powerful in FETed, and non-FETed cars both. I \'m guessing there is some inconsistancies. \r\n\r\nThese motor all seem to get better the more you run them, but I don\'t know if that makes a difference.[/quote:d23a72e834]\r\n\r\n\r\nThe blue ZZ looking motor is the PRO?\r\n\r\nIf so I prefer the 4.2 king.. [b:d23a72e834]The blue one does seem to have more torque though.[/b:d23a72e834]\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla[/quote:d23a72e834]Oh well see that\'s starting to make more sense. I\'m all about torque.\r\n\r\nI think one of my 4.2 Kings is a dud, and the other 2 are in my Super-Bits, which seem to put out more power. I\'ll have to try one from Super-Bits to see if I like that any better.');
