INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29966, 'aa22b42462', '', 'Ahhh, the memories. This reminds of about a year ago when zips first came out and everyone with a bit char was eager to put them down. they are slow and don\'t look right. Somethings change some don\'t. I will be happy if the miniz community does or doesn\'t accept my car (xmod). I plan on having fun with it regardless.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29967, '0db0fc16b0', '', '[quote:0db0fc16b0="hue35"]OR... crazydave could ship his cars to me, okay, then I\'ll photograph them for crazydave, ya see... and... uh maybeI\'llhavetokeep\'em. Cool, thanks dave, I\'ll PM ya with my address.  :)[/quote:0db0fc16b0]Hey cool, thanks bro, nice to know someone got your back....Hey wait a minute!  :eek: \r\n\r\nI like Superfly\'s idea better. I\'ll take something with SLR, thank you.  :-) \r\n\r\nSeriously I think I just need a flood light, and to know WTH I\'m doing. I\'ve always sucked at pictures, never understood why.\r\n\r\nHey Sezziz, you really want one? PM me I\'m sure I could hook you up.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (38637, 'db5e21abe5', '', 'oh man! sorry about that, didnt look right under my nose. But anyway, i tried this on two of my bit controllers, and the red light stops normally and doesnt put any more char-g into the car than normal, my car runs normaly, with the dual cell... so that means the car must be ok right? hmm.... :???:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29969, '02caa06713', '', 'I\'m with you sessiz. I\'ve never owned a mini-z, so I don\'t know what I\'m missing out on. I\'m having a blast with my xmod anyway. If you put 2 stock Microsizers next to a stock xmod and realize that each cost roughly the same, you see what a good deal it is for what you get.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29970, '93dd38592b', '', 'the ms i bought my brother for his birthday was 40 bucks, when i put those 2 next to eachother roughly the same price you really realize what a deal it is');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29971, 'c05ab3f97e', '', 'i ust use regular duracell alklalines');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29972, '66aebbdc48', '', 'what differences do you see from the radio shack rechargable nimh?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29973, '2fcf8fb2eb', '', '[quote:2fcf8fb2eb="hue35"]I don\'t experience that with mine, nox. It does take a bit of getting used to... the first time you hit the rev position it\'s the brake. Then you have to hit it again for rev to kick in. I\'m just starting to get used to the "double pump" action for rev. Not sure if that was what you were experiencing, but it did seem kinda broken until I figured it out.[/quote:2fcf8fb2eb]\r\n\r\nu got the rsx? mine does that also');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29974, '4333ae9499', '', 'i vote no more double friggin post');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29976, '533e9db0dc', '', ':lol: heeeaay boo');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29977, '8e355b0fe3', '', 'I just want to say thanks! It is a real honor considering the quality of the rides around here.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29978, 'bb619b8b4c', '', 'Keep us posted for sure on these lights dude :)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29979, 'cd2b6e22db', '', 'found some pics of the event. im in one of em. [url]http://www.urbanracer.com/gallery/gallery.asp?action=browse&amp;categoryid=459&amp;whichpage=1[/url]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29980, 'c7e8cb4578', '', '[quote:c7e8cb4578="SuperFly"]I\'m with you sessiz. I\'ve never owned a mini-z, so I don\'t know what I\'m missing out on. I\'m having a blast with my xmod anyway. If you put 2 stock Microsizers next to a stock xmod and realize that each cost roughly the same, you see what a good deal it is for what you get.[/quote:c7e8cb4578]\r\n\r\nWell from what I\'ve been told the mini z has a better steering servo (I\'m okay with the xmods 16steps) and faster motors. The mini z\'s have also been out for what like 2-3 years now (not sure of that). They better be up to speed by now and especially for what they ask as a base price. I really wasn\'t expecting as much as I got from the xmod so I\'m friggen happy with it. I know that if I had gotten a mini z and that mutha wasn\'t fast as all hell and handled like buttah I would be pissed. With the xmod I can be more forgiving and I also have the added bonus of getting it to to the point where it can contend with mini z cars. :lol: \r\nIn the end, just like with bits and zips, it\'s alot better for both groups to cooperate than to be negative and clannish. I truely and honestly would hate if all the people that got xmods for christmas or whatever were put down or told they got an inferior product. Wtf does that serve.\r\nI\'m in it for fun, if I wanted to compete I\'ld play some football. :-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29981, '443e19e14f', '', '[quote:443e19e14f="TheSavior*Insider"]found some pics of the event. im in one of em. [url]http://www.urbanracer.com/gallery/gallery.asp?action=browse&amp;categoryid=459&amp;whichpage=1[/url][/quote:443e19e14f]\r\n\r\n  I didn\'t see you in any of those pics  :???:   I did see me and one of my homies though  :eek:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29982, '4d60c23388', '', 'Will do man.   I will finalise the circuit shortly and then minaturise it!   I gotta post the schematic for nox.   Hey nox, you can use the 555 timer I sent you last time as part of this circuit.\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (29983, 'd8825d07f2', '', 'Out of all them pics (thanks by the way, pics are always great) the only thing that really caught my eye (besides vivica fox ofcourse) was that the designer\'s car (striped white red and black acura) has some nice rims, and the ant is coming out the front. :???: \r\nMy mind is spinning with ideas. :lol:');
