INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30028, '9cf74a25ae', '', 'yup, I say you finish them all as well.\r\n\r\none thing though...\r\nI love how you\'re trying to go for these squished tops, looks hot.\r\nbut ya gotta find a way to perfect it even more.\r\nI see you\'ve gotten better at it, but there\'s this weird lip around the windows that seems like it needs to be sanded down and smoothed out on some of your squished tops.\r\nnot knocking them, just offering up an opinion and some constructive criticism on what I\'d like to see from you  :lol: \r\n\r\nmaybe a cannonball clone?\r\nI think I\'m the only fool left with 2. lol');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30029, 'feb2b408e6', '', '[quote:feb2b408e6="VooDooMafia"]nice stuff there, IMO you should finish them all :)\r\n\r\nAs for that clone what does the controller look like? and yes teh 4.2 pro has a blue endbell.[/quote:feb2b408e6]\r\n\r\nThe controller is Oval (black with silver face) and has a belt clip on the battery door. It\'s less than 3 inches high, about 3.75 inches wide and about an inch and a quarter deep. Uses 2 AA batteries and the mount on the car doesn\'t fit a standard BCG charger base without modification to one of the holes in the bottom.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30030, '76afa24cc3', '', '[quote:76afa24cc3="hue35"]That\'s a sucker bet... how about, which one plays the part of \'I\'m gonna hafta stick this tube down your throat\'?[/quote:76afa24cc3]\r\n\r\nWell now thats a hard one.  I bet they would both fall for teh old "Hey lets flip a coin, heads I win Tails you loose" trick.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30031, '25e6d9e63e', '', '[quote:25e6d9e63e="CaboWabo"]yup, I say you finish them all as well.\r\n\r\none thing though...\r\nI love how you\'re trying to go for these squished tops, looks hot.\r\nbut ya gotta find a way to perfect it even more.\r\nI see you\'ve gotten better at it, but there\'s this weird lip around the windows that seems like it needs to be sanded down and smoothed out on some of your squished tops.\r\nnot knocking them, just offering up an opinion and some constructive criticism on what I\'d like to see from you  :lol: \r\n\r\nmaybe a cannonball clone?\r\nI think I\'m the only fool left with 2. lol[/quote:25e6d9e63e]\r\n\r\nI was getting fed up with it on Monday Night when I was working on it. I was trying for clear windows but the glue I was using had other ideas. It i will be sanded some more before it hits the paint shop.\r\n\r\nOn the Mits It was the 56 mhz that was throwing me for a loop. It\'s not the normal 57 on Tomy and LXX.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30032, '6ffc4bdc0e', '', '[quote:6ffc4bdc0e="VooDooMafia"]I bet they would both fall for teh old "Hey lets flip a coin, heads I win Tails you loose" trick.[/quote:6ffc4bdc0e]\r\n\r\nheads in tails... they both win.  8-)');
