INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30129, 'e579fb990a', '', 'I\'m with Nox,\r\n\r\nI\'ve been talking to Cavey &amp; pht2 about micro_amps, I\'ve even talked to him about sharing some info since he seems to be the Guru of FETs and got nowhere with him.  He used to have modding info on his page a while back but then started charging for his services and the info went away.  He\'s got his side business and I\'m not hating on that,  FET mods are not a trade secret but he\'s now in it for the money instead of for the sport as he once was.  With that being said, ask if he will volunteer to write a short FET tuit for us, if he refuses, kill his advertisments and any future related post.  We\'ll probably get bad mouthed for it but who gives a fuck!  I\'ll reply to his azz, where\'s the post?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30130, '4eecf9b890', '', 'Kill the Celica project, some cars are just not meant to be wagons and the Celica is one of them.  I felt the same way about the Celica when I first saw them, didn\'t like \'em too much.  I decal\'d up one and gave it to my Nephew, then it started to grow on me. Do you rmember DriveWRX\'s Celica ??  But if you insist on finishing it, you gotta [i:4eecf9b890]kill that square back [/i:4eecf9b890]and round it off, every other line on it is rounded so you have to make the mod blend with the rest of the cars lines.  \r\n[img:4eecf9b890]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0QgCz*xUS5DJuQErINalA2R51qDUJw!sKekQI*!!WPWkXMiWYbNc!TgQQzuouxp3QEvQWrId7lZqr!7wFpE2phRlCLqnr2QMfF2etJmRF3nQ/DSC00853.JPG?dc=4675444196271751693[/img:4eecf9b890]\r\nThe Nakamichi truck is the SHIT man!  I like the hell outta what you\'ve done to it. It looks like it was meant to be a pick-em-up. When I first got mine I thought about it, never got around to it with all the other projects in Da BodyShop, I think you just inspired me to go ahead with it now.  This is one you\'ve gotta finish.  There are a lot of colors out there.  Check out your local automotive parts shop for color ideas.  They have many, many more colors than any hobby shop would ever have. Candy apple has been done a lot, not saying it wouldn\'t look good but just weigh your options.....\r\n\r\nMy Mitsubishi Montero I picked up at the mall a while ago is just as you\r\ndescribed it down to the controller except I got the Red one.  Never found\r\nout who made it though and wasn\'t too interrested in finding out but I\'m willing to bet it was between Cannon or Bensu even though Cannons have a separate charger and Bensu\'s usually have round controllers but produce more of a variety of bodies.\r\n\r\nOtay!  those are my thoughts, keep up da good work Pimp!');
