INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30134, '1bca74c750', '', 'i just picked up one of the clones last night at biglots, havent had a chance to run it yet since the controller takes AAA batteries, not AA. i like the wider tires that it comes with, i put them on my bit looks alot nicer if youre still running the stock wheels. if youre not buying the clone to race its still worth the $7 for the parts. i need to go back and see if i can find those track sets, didnt see them last night.\r\nhow fast of a motor do you guys think is included with the clone? like i said i havent run it yet, or swapped it into my bit (was soldering a new antenna on the bit last night)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30135, '6879d73ed3', 'Controller: CB Antenna Mod', 'I was going through cleaning up some old emails and I ran across something a user submitted to me.\r\nI\'m wondering, has anyone tried out a similar approach?\r\nIf so, what were the results?\r\nWill a magnet based antenna increase range regardless?\r\n[quote:6879d73ed3]27 meg  has a inherent distance problem. Take a magnet base cb antenna; and attach a piece of wire from the cb antenna to the controller antenna. The results are amazeing. My distance with a zz went from about 5ft to around 20ft indoors.[/quote:6879d73ed3]');
