INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30159, '108309a18c', '', '[quote:108309a18c="hogjowlz"]in that case i vote for stalker[/quote:108309a18c] :screwed:  :-D Thanx 4 tha vote');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30160, '7acc462823', '', '[quote:7acc462823="hogjowlz"]but then again he did take his skills(assumable he paid a lot to goto school to learn them) and his time and resources to do this so you cant totally bag him for it.[/quote:7acc462823]\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m going out on a limb with this one. I agree with the statement from hog.\r\n\r\nI can totally understand that MA wants to make his money back, and this is why.\r\n\r\nMA has been around the boards for a while, and he\'s usually helping with a tutorial or some techy BS that I don\'t understand, and now he\'s sees his chance to be on the "cutting edge" so to speak of the micro electronics gig, and once again the people wanna know the story behind it..\r\n\r\n\r\nWe all know that he\'s a salesman of sorts. (not the best) but never the less, he wants to sell his stuff, and recoop some of his investment.\r\n\r\nThe way I see it is he basically has 2 options here, and those would be either give away his findings to the people in a tuit. (people are happy, but he loses money for his business)\r\n\r\nOr try to charge for his findings to generate a little profit on his previous investment. (school, assuming he went)  This will make a buck or 2, but now he has people mad at him.  He\'s in a little jam here..\r\n\r\nOut of those 2 choices, he loses either way, and that sucks for him..  While he\'s not the most contributing member here, he\'s far from being an asshole.  I\'m guessing that he feels that he\'s done enough for free, and now wants to be compensated for his trouble, and we all know that free shit is cool, but  getting it from him means he\'s screwing himself out of profit for the sake of "Favors" and we all know that favors don\'t pay the bills. Cash does. \r\n\r\nI\'m not choosing sides here guys, rather than just giving the "point of view" from a another salesman. I totally see both sides here.\r\n\r\n\r\nHis days are numbered till another one of our local techys figures this shit out, then it will be back to the norm. "I hope"\r\n\r\n\r\nHope I didn\'t step on any toes up in hur, and if I did, just tell me to fuck off, and we\'ll be all good again...lol \r\nMy dad does it all the time.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
