INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30393, 'b14cff8738', 'Yet Another Pimpin Azz Ride From The DarkTari Collection....', 'This is it Pimps, I\'ve been holdin on to this one for the longest time.  \r\nI think it\'s my personal best, the detailing is On!  I\'ve been hintin\r\naround about this one for a long time, well Pimps, here it is.  My \r\nPersonal favorite, in [b:b14cff8738]Mint Green[/b:b14cff8738], [i:b14cff8738]BlingBling[/i:b14cff8738]!  here is....................(drumroll)\r\n\r\n[img:b14cff8738]http://darktari.lixlink.com/MintCond1.jpg[/img:b14cff8738]\r\n[img:b14cff8738]http://darktari.lixlink.com/MintCond2.jpg[/img:b14cff8738]\r\n[img:b14cff8738]http://darktari.lixlink.com/MintCond4.jpg[/img:b14cff8738]\r\n[img:b14cff8738]http://darktari.lixlink.com/MintCond5.jpg[/img:b14cff8738]\r\n\r\n[b:b14cff8738]Here Ya go Cavey ![/b:b14cff8738]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30394, '9d81d7b31e', '', '[quote:9d81d7b31e="SuperFly"]DT! I\'ve missed your last two rides cuz I was only looking in "flossin..." That is beautiful! Your cars often look like those really cool drawings of concept cars before they even build a prototype. I love the interior. Nice work dawg.[/quote:9d81d7b31e]\r\n\r\nI used to do the same thing SF until I looked in Customs and this is home for now.  I post all my latest mods right here so you better come back PIMP !!!!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30397, '76920697ab', 'Mustang SE greatly improved', 'I just played with My mustang SE for the first time. I am impressed. It handled great, and had about as much torque as my FET\'ed SE that still needs the bugs worked out.\r\n\r\nWhat really got me was that I got a 10 minute run from a single charge, and that was almost non stop running with the headlights.\r\n\r\nI didn\'t mind the jitter in the steering when it handled good. This is much better than the RX-7 I bought.\r\n\r\nI was in shock so I had to run a stock Zip Zap 350Z to compare, and it did have better off the line punch, but they were much more closely matched. I then tried my FETed SE and it was about the same as the Mustang, but it only ran about 3-4 minutes on a single charge.\r\n\r\nI\'m going to go stick some FETs in this right now, to see how it responds. I\'m also gonna go over the PCB to see if I can\'t spot the change from the first one');
