INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30582, 'f038e64538', '', '[quote:f038e64538="payaso"]It sucks picking up my limo in that part of town cause they always beg the shit out a people, and I just can\'t  deal with people that don\'t even like themselves.  They try to talk to about how their teeth fall out in their sleep,and shit like that.... \r\n\r\nI\'m thinking, yeah right, you probably smoked em..  Big time negative energy over there.\r\n\r\nI turn into a ghost in that neck of the woods.\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D[/quote:f038e64538]Yeah I know what you mean. I seem to attract people like that. What pisses me off is when they get an attitude. Like when you\'re coming out of the store, you tell \'em you gots no money, and they\'re like oh yeah how\'d you get the groceries, and you\'re like, one, it  aint none of your damn business if I really have money or not, and two, I paid with a debit card,  I really don\'t have a cent on me, so fuck you.\r\n\r\nThere\'s a lot of people out there that make me feel uncomfortable. A guy in a 3-piece suit makes me feel just as awkward as a drunk bum. I just avoid them.\r\n\r\nI don\'t know what I was saying last night, I was just drunk, but I will say I try not to judge people, it\'s not my place.');
