INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30591, '4e0dbc052e', '', '[quote:4e0dbc052e="Namuna"]The Combat Digi-Q Tank shells are made by Dragon Models...The people that make KICK-ASS military models. I have a bit of a hard time believing the clones come anywhere close in detail, scale and craftmenship. But I\'ve never bothered buying a tank clone so I can\'t say for sure.\r\n\r\nTiny is still waiting on Konami to ship the turret controllable tanks, it\'s been awhile I\'ll have to bother him to get an update.[/quote:4e0dbc052e]\r\n\r\n  Take my word for it dude they are NO EVEN CLOSE :)\r\n\r\n  and yes dragon and bbi make nice figures :)\r\n\r\nAs for the rotating turets mine should be in this week can\'t wait');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30593, 'e3225d0725', '', '[quote:e3225d0725="crazydave"][quote:e3225d0725="payaso"]It sucks picking up my limo in that part of town cause they always beg the shit out a people, and I just can\'t  deal with people that don\'t even like themselves.  They try to talk to about how their teeth fall out in their sleep,and shit like that.... \r\n\r\nI\'m thinking, yeah right, you probably smoked em..  Big time negative energy over there.\r\n\r\nI turn into a ghost in that neck of the woods.\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D[/quote:e3225d0725]Yeah I know what you mean. I seem to attract people like that. What pisses me off is when they get an attitude. Like when you\'re coming out of the store, you tell \'em you gots no money, and they\'re like oh yeah how\'d you get the groceries, and you\'re like, one, it  aint none of your damn business if I really have money or not, and two, I paid with a debit card,  I really don\'t have a cent on me, so fuck you.\r\n\r\nThere\'s a lot of people out there that make me feel uncomfortable. A guy in a 3-piece suit makes me feel just as awkward as a drunk bum. I just avoid them.\r\n\r\nI don\'t know what I was saying last night, I was just drunk, but I will say I try not to judge people, it\'s not my place.[/quote:e3225d0725]\r\n\r\n  We get the people asking for change at the coffee drive through\'s, thats why I keep a bunch of different job applications in the car.  They ask for cash they get an ap simple.\r\n\r\n  I am with you dave on the people in a suit.  I avoid them at all costs they are either Stuck up and think they own the world or they are detective looking for my ass so either way I say the fuck away  :shock:');
