INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30630, 'bcbeba3f89', 'Re: How would someone fade?', '[quote:bcbeba3f89="Doggie Stylz Garage"]I saw some of the fades you guys do and i was wondering how u do it?[/quote:bcbeba3f89]\r\n\r\nwell I just started with one color and painted the front(or back) of the car and worked my way to about 2/3 of the way back(or front).  Then took the next color and started from teh oposite side from teh first color.\r\n\r\n  Continued with the second color till it looked right.  On my fade job I also used a piece of paper so that the fade line was even but thats only cause it was my first one and I am sure it will take sometime to get that down pat like CW, CrazyDave and all the other FREAK Sprayers out there :)\r\n\r\n  Take a look through the custom jobs and flossin section to get some ideas.  You give some of them guys an ugly bitch and a spray can you they will have you horny for her in no time  :cool:');
