INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30709, '5296f48724', '', 'Nice job dave :) damn I can\'t believe you got around to painting your before I had the chance to do mine.  Didn\'t I just get a PM saying you got it in ok  :???:   You are like me you get something in and start thinking right away.  Only differance is you paint it and I stop 80% of the time at thinking and get another beer  :sad:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30710, 'e9496c697d', '', '[quote:e9496c697d="DarkTari"][quote:e9496c697d="CaboWabo"]good choice on this weeks ride of the week\r\nI was just admiring that baby again earlier today\r\n\r\ngreat work there DT[/quote:e9496c697d]\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp!  Geisem\'s bug inspired that 100%.  Picked up 2 RX7 &amp; 2 VW bodies yesterday.  Remember that comment I made about Mint Condition being my last one for a while ?.........Well..........Um.............??[/quote:e9496c697d]\r\n\r\n  Well I can see why you dont have a track yet hehe\r\n\r\n Do you mod in your sleep? Fall asleep with a shell in your hand then wake up with a new creation?  theres gotta be some trick as you are pumpin them out like a wild man  :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30711, '2d8e294cef', '', 'That came out nice. It\'s funny, the Nakamchi body looked vaquely, but not quite likr a Skyline, now it looks like a pickup, and doesn\'t look anything like a Skyline. It\'s even got a tailgate, nice touch.\r\n\r\nCareful using that Krylon over the Duplicolor. I believe the Krylon is enamel, and I know Duplicolor is laquer. Krylon laquers are usually branded Duplicolor. Check the can.\r\n\r\nThat\'s not to say it can\'t be done, obviously, you did it, I\'m just saying be careful, that\'s risky stuff mixing types of paint. I\'d hate to see you mess up a project at the last step.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30712, '7abee656f1', '', '[quote:7abee656f1="VooDooMafia"]Nice job dave :) damn I can\'t believe you got around to painting your before I had the chance to do mine.  Didn\'t I just get a PM saying you got it in ok  :???:   You are like me you get something in and start thinking right away.  Only differance is you paint it and I stop 80% of the time at thinking and get another beer  :sad:[/quote:7abee656f1]Yeah, I jumped on it right away. When I got a picture in my head, I have to act.\r\n\r\nBesides, I\'ve been trying to work out the SE issue all week, and been dreaming mosfets. I had to do something non-techy for the afternoon to clear my head.  :lol:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30713, '69b10cc863', '', 'Well its nice so good job.  IMO some of the hero bodies are nice to work with cause they are different and not seen as often.  Plus they have some great lines in them');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30714, '20919fead6', '', 'My Krylon is Acrylic not enamel. It works on everything I\'ve tried, not a probelm yet. Now Rust-o-leum that is trouble with their clear, it eats the top coat of paint.');
