INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (30965, 'fa084cefc4', 'Xmod Supra body kit', 'Here it is. I like it just ok. For $13, I don\'t think it\'s one of the better values in xmod upgrades (unlike the light set, which is surprisingly sweet for $6). What you see here is the "wild" front and rear, with the "mild" side skirts and the stock spoiler. RS cheaped out on the second spoiler, as it is just one of the spoilers from another body, and I would have to drill holes to mount it, and then I would be left with 2 empty sockets. The hood is cooler than I thought, as the black inserts have a kind of carbon fiber-y texture. Both front bumper/spoilers are cool, and I had a hard time deciding which to use. All the body kit parts seem less tough than the stock stuff, and I imagine I will break these in no time at all if past damage incurred is any indication.\r\n\r\n[img:fa084cefc4]http://www.grymttr.com/carpix/xsupra7.jpg[/img:fa084cefc4]\r\n\r\n[img:fa084cefc4]http://www.grymttr.com/carpix/xsupra6.jpg[/img:fa084cefc4]');
