INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31119, '1dcf790aa2', 'Keep your Xmods Batteries Cooler', 'over on mini-zracer they have battery clip heat sinks.  [url]http://mini-zracer.com/shop/product.php?pid=18[/url] They will fit an Xmod with minor modifactions.    \r\n\r\n[img:1dcf790aa2]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2864565/36931373.jpg[/img:1dcf790aa2] \r\n\r\nThey don\'t have purple you see here.  The ones on mine are made by Megatech.  Found them at a LHS on clearance DEAL.  :lol: \r\n\r\nTo make them fit you will have to file the lower clip of the heatsink.  \r\nOn the battery holders in the car you will also need to remove the center dividers.  \r\n\r\n[url=http://www.megatech.com/product_detail_hop_ups.php?ID=22623][img:1dcf790aa2]http://www.megatech.com/images_5.0/products/miniz/22623.jpg[/img:1dcf790aa2][/url]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31120, 'e7e264ec3b', '', '"he is my new friend and I will call him George...."\r\n\r\n\r\nSeriously the only good thing abot sbcg\'s is the pullbacks, the shells are sweet.  I\'m not a fan of the 27mhz variety, they suffer all sorts of issues.    The 40mhz might be ok though.\r\n\r\nAs to zzse\'s I think you should buy one just so I can say "look, there goes another bloody yank with his xmods and se\'s, why I\'d like to......."\r\n\r\n\r\noh well......\r\n\r\n\r\nph2t.');
