INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31126, '420d952de1', '', 'aiight, here\'s an update fo ya\'s... I got rid of the decals on the quarterpanels because i thought they looked ugly lol.... I added a license plate(even tho it don\'t look that great...).... added the address on the wing, and put one of the bitpimps.lixlink.com\'s on my chassis :grin: ....I also got calvin pissin on both ford AND chevy!\r\n\r\n[img:420d952de1]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0VAAAAMIacZggboCR2IvT013y86d!zLSPPneKSUeN4YRfRhCrmJCffB4jJXNwn4EYkyyuhnWaIQ77HXw7CXtbR3bYcNvZj3CVC1!ReWQpQ7dlc*yaX47Jxy5qZGFZHlpG/bitpimps1.jpg?dc=4675445136117165332[/img:420d952de1]\r\n[img:420d952de1]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0VADUAsMau5ggboCR2IvT01v5gaWTDXhLBPh9Nrgxjy3azjqCWcKTAsTwN2WFN2L*3Zw!njUGhUU1bq18CdMH5RWiotRFIEI9PUDC7zNYKu7mukIM1FIm863YHTRKm!*O/bitpimps2.jpg?dc=4675445136203885494[/img:420d952de1]\r\n[img:420d952de1]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UgDYAjkZzxw4n6XCwkDPNqRuu95EgEk4KokIZ8QCSXzAfT6vr1HPpesJdUSi0CtJZG4p8sgmr9Q1pEFmYH8PXz70E0rTR!GKSAhV6V!wuk6S02V3UGKzrqSpR2mdkfz1/MIDGTMN.jpg?dc=4675445136489278117[/img:420d952de1]\r\n[img:420d952de1]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0VgAUA7Abq!XpQZ4PokSCf25uxgSPgMwhJUtdfZlhv29SKYV5UOQD0dkqaCP92r9kpAE5WCk6r3*2BVhBuDIUp690vbnehEUmiuBYGPw0rG8RvdBaXQBK1Xrnu1lyVDt1/calvin_ford.jpg?dc=4675445136403008131[/img:420d952de1]\r\n[img:420d952de1]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0VgAAAKsbFeTpQZ4PokSCf6jcfdHU6OUzuO1xVTDQJ57m8R715!BGkVi*OrLsvnFsB5!SbDcXy81UwZow4AlL7vnaAaQ9iL61HrlNTfVW9eRb5P3h4rTdR!CEO0Elewwa/calvin_chev.jpg?dc=4675445136330454999[/img:420d952de1]\r\n\r\n\r\ni may have to change the license plate though.... it\'s kinda messy lol');
