INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31184, '94026f01da', '', '[quote:94026f01da="noxorc"]sad to say...Ph2t is getting a White RX-7, so I hope he\'s not dissapointed.\r\n(I know Santa, that\'s how I know what Ph2t is getting)\r\n\r\n-nox[/quote:94026f01da]Oh I\'m sure he\'ll be fine once he figures out how to get it kicking butt.\r\n\r\n[quote:94026f01da="ph2t"]Dave, how TF did you remove the black shit coating the pcb? I know hog will answer shortly by saying "search google for epoxy remover you shithead" but I wanted to ask anyways...... \r\n[/quote:94026f01da]I have an obsessive compulsive disorder about picking at paint. If I see paint that\'s starting to chip, I pick at it.  :lol: \r\n\r\nWith in 5 minutes of opening the package I had already started removing the paint from the PCB.\r\n\r\nI just use my thumbnail to scratch it away.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31185, '3b20e53cea', '', '[quote:3b20e53cea="DarkTari"]My only beef!\r\nI got this one prick, joez2872. Every damn time I post a Custom job, this azzhole pm\'s me for a trade of some shit he doesn\'t want anymore! Being da cool dude that I am, I actually replied to him and offered to do a body for him for free if he sent me one. Then before I hit the send button, I woke the fuck up and said FUCK NO! I must be outta my fuckin mind, deleted dat shit and told him No Thanx! \r\nIf I wanted to trade it, fuck, I\'d advertise it! I tried to be polite every time but I\'m like a loaded 44mag right now, one more offer and I\'ll hafta blow his azz away! Dirty Harry style ![/quote:3b20e53cea]\r\n\r\nthat\'s a real bugger man, I get pm\'s at times about fet mods, leds and other crap and if it\'s from some pimp on the board then it\'s cool and I\'ll help.  Hey even if it\'s someone I don\'t know I\'ll try and help BUT my tolerance levels are at an all time low with these idiots..\r\n\r\n[b:3b20e53cea]example[/b:3b20e53cea]\r\n\r\nHere is your typical idiot thread:\r\n\r\nhttp://www.microrccenter.com/forum/index.php?showtopic=16582\r\n\r\nGuy thinks he has searched everywhere for the mosfet mod which he clearly hasn\'t so he posts this meaningless titbit.\r\n\r\nMadScott, being a resourcefull and subtle moderator shows the idiot that the search does work and here\'s the results....\r\n\r\nI being the smartarse, foul mouthed aussie from downunder tells said idiot that he\'s his namesake and points him to the german site for the mosfet tutorial.\r\n\r\nIdiot says he looked at that and it was only in german.   I give a link back to the idiot saying that it\'s also in english....\r\n\r\nNow I\'m waiting on the idiots response that I\'m sure will be just as englightening as the previous ones.\r\n\r\nReasons like this make me wonder why I bother sometimes.....\r\n\r\nph2t.');
