INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31337, 'f041928e2a', '', ':mad: I hate Sprint PCS.....they re-signed me to another year\'s contract without my consent. I told them 3 weeks before my contract ended that I intended on going to another company. They told me there was only one way out of the bogus contract and that was to pay their $175.00 cancellation fee.....shit thats about 6 months of service....so I said  :finger: .  My current bogus contract is due to end December 18th. I called them on October 1st and November 1st to remind them that I [b:f041928e2a]Will[/b:f041928e2a] be cancelling my service. They are a shady company.  :twisted: \r\nMy wife had Verizon and they screwed her....they told her that her plan would cost $35.00 a month and that included taxes, etc.....her bill for 6 months in a row were $85.00....she never used her phone....I was working nights and she only called me after midnight, during her supposed "free minutes" time.....\r\n\r\nSprint PCS knew they wronged me.....so they "let me" trade in my $50.00 Kyocera 2255 phone for my $150.00 Sanyo 4900 phone(at least this one has a color screen)....my wife just gave up and cancelled her service......\r\n\r\nI am currently looking for a good plan with shared minutes or free minutes between 2 phones....I have a phone and will need to buy one for my wife.........if anyone has any suggestions....they would be much appreciated  8-) \r\n\r\nthanks for letting me vent   :grin:');
