INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31374, 'bcf36b3578', '', 'namuna: i got a 610 and its the best phone ive ever had. the screen is huge and clear. the camera is decent for a cameraphone and wap works great. u can get skins and any midi works for a ringtone. i highly suggest getting one for the price. oh ya battery life is 3days or so.\r\n\r\nheres a pic i took with it\r\n[img:bcf36b3578]http://mywebpages.comcast.net/myaaiko/rld.jpg[/img:bcf36b3578]\r\n\r\nhavok: tmobile is definatly the best in my area. i pay 70 a month for two lines. free roaming and long distance. 800 weekday minutes free weekends and calls to other tmobile phones dont count on the 800mins. wap is like 3bucks a month per phone. ive been with them for 3 years or so and havnt had any major beef.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31375, '2eb895df25', 'SpeedSlicks', 'Jus saw a commercial fo\' these things called speed slicks (i think that\'s what they\'re called :???: ) they\'re at Toys R Us, dunno, the motor/gearings look like a bit clone, but the bodys are cool 8-) . Dunno see if i can see another commercial :???:  :???:  :???: .');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31376, '2de366520a', '', 'well, after several months of driving just about every combo of micro r/c. (1:64)\r\nI\'ll have to say my fastest car by far is the dual cell 150.\r\nit smokes mosfet pro\'s, mosfet stocks, stocks, etc.\r\n\r\nnow if I could get that same speed in my se (which I\'m not super fond of in the first place), I think I\'d have a much higher opinion of the se\'s.\r\n\r\nI haven\'t gotten into the xmods for the same reason why I never got into mini-z, scale.\r\n\r\nthe price is a total bonus (1:64), but probably not my main feature.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31377, '79da28b2bc', '', 'yup, hate my yard, it\'s more like just a "buffer zone"\r\nthe pool\'s cool, but when you can look into your neighbors kitchen while floating, it\'s kinda weird.\r\nahh well, an investment, I don\'t plan on being here too terribley long.\r\nbut I do blend into the average joe schmoe world well now lol');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31378, 'ead28f2540', '', 'Yep I agree with the whole scale thing, if you have the room to race/play with the larger scales then great but if you dont its kinda hard to drop any amount of cash on them knowing its just gonna sit on the shelf.\r\n\r\n  Right now I would have to say my fav car to play with is my digi Q R, it is fast handles great and super small.  The SE\'s (although I like them) have crap run times, atleast the one I just got does.  I can charge it 3 or 3 times and still only get a few minutes of runtime and thats a big factor for me as I dont want to spend more time charging then playing.');
