INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31401, '72ff196c15', '', 'Well I\'ve had my SE for about 2 days now and I fucken love the thing ;-) , it has so much potential to have mods done to it, be they performance or aesthetically orientated..  I\'ve still got mine stock and I\'ve just put my EM38 motor in it and enjoying to change in drive style.\r\n\r\nI so enjoy running it around that I\'ve spent bugger all time in actually pulling the thing apart.   I mean I have done that already (of course I have, what you kiddin me?, lol) and gotten a quick look at it but really I am still just enjoying at the moment....\r\n\r\nI was never really into larger RC, mainly because of the cost associated with 1/10 stuff n shit.   For $50 - $60 though, you can\'t go wrong!   Yeah! :lol: \r\n\r\nThe thing that sux the most is the charging of the SE, the first few times I got great runtimes of 4 fresh AAA\'s, but now I avg 3 minutes of runtime, arghhhh!  So a charger is the first thing you should do I reakon!  Bdebde, your charger looks cool man, nice fix! :smile: \r\n\r\nAnyways, back to picking that black shit off the PCB.......\r\n\r\nph2t.');
