INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31572, '260398e157', '', 'I am ordered one Monaco style i am waiting the arrival ;)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31573, 'e725c29df3', '', '[quote:e725c29df3="brendan123"]nice work there looks great,and the fade really give it that extra touch.how do u make graphics like that?[/quote:e725c29df3]Same basic technique as I use to do my flames. Just follow this tutorial: [url=http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/articles/article_postings.php?id=21&amp;catId=6]Painting Flames and Graphics 101[/url], and when you get to the part where you print the flame to the tape, just print your graphic instead.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:e725c29df3="Ahh5hit"]What would look cool is to have it run to the front of the car and over the hood, almost as if it had run thru the fence and took it with the car. Just another few hours of masking right? [/quote:e725c29df3]That\'s kinda what was supposed to happen. I\'m debating, stick with the barbed wire theme across the hood, or go with a tattoo theme, and put a skull, and Inca design on the hood. Something different that ties into the same feel, you know?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks for the the comps cabo, and everyone. It [i:e725c29df3]is[/i:e725c29df3] worth the effort when others dig on my work.  :-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31574, '457836b044', '', 'ya ive had this thing for about 2 weeks now and i have umm 80bucks into it?  \r\n\r\ncar = well duh\r\nbatteries = may as well buy em when you get the car cuz you will go back the next day if not.\r\nlights = all i could afford last week and im even poorer this week so i guess ill get the motors next week.\r\n\r\nbut really for 75bucks you have an easily rechargeable car that drives like it should.  and like dave said. its like actually repairing something instead of filling in cracks with epoxy to fix major flaws or whatever. i see myself one of these days adding more voltage but not for a little bit cuz i havnt totally got bored with this thing stock yet.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31575, 'fb93810483', '', 'But the other LXX cars are amazing 4,2 Pro motor is blaster.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31576, 'ae407082c1', '', '[quote:ae407082c1="oxhadokenxo"]But with Toy East the actual car is only $6 but the shipping will be another $6+ unless you\'re ordering something else....But the engrish on the packages and manuals are worth it..\r\nHeres some from the  LXX Auto Modellista ones.."Do not to swim to play in the street."  What does it mean? Who knows...but it was hilarious. The whole instruction manual and box is like that.[/quote:ae407082c1]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nwww.engrish.com');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31577, 'b92b9078c8', '', 'Well Darktari, it wasn\'t easy, I mean I started the build knowing the end result but when the clear dried it was really hard to go any further, but I have other shiney cars but I don\'t have any with mud, and I kept think how yenko is now one of my favorites.\r\n\r\nI posted some pics before the mudding, so check em out it was a beautiful subaru, now it\'s got character.\r\n\r\nThanks again everyone.\r\n\r\nAlready planning another one to add to Ripper\'s Reality Collection.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41224, '6437cb9d16', '', 'dude that episode was hilarious!\r\nI watched that a few weeks ago on TV.\r\nyou\'re right, that shit\'s already getting huge, there\'s t-shirts everywhere, our IT guy made his work email sig "I\'m Rick James Biatch!".\r\n\r\nchappell didn\'t used to crack me up so much, but now days - he\'s got me rollin.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37186, 'a9db545963', '', 'as for molds, just make your own... trust me its not too difficult. And as for the softness or hardness of the tires, that depends on what type of stuff you use.... and yes the treads...make em yourself! get thinking and dont be afraid to make alot of stuff yourself, its a good learning experience.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37187, '157f17faee', '', 'well understand his ZZ is Mosfet modded... its gonna be way torquier and faster than most ZZs. for good measure, its metal oxide semiconductor field effects transistor. just so if you didnt know, Micro_amps does mosfet mods or commonly Fet mods for people... it does make a considerable difference in the cars power.\r\n\r\nIf you know all this.. sorry if im treating you like you dont know... he didnt really mention in detail why his car was so fast.');
