INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31655, '15b19e997c', '', '[quote:15b19e997c="ezenterprises"][quote:15b19e997c="sessiz"]The mini z bearings come 7 to a pack, only 3 of them can be used on an xmod. Dinball has a set of 10 for $10 that\'ll work.\r\nhttp://www.rcmart.com/catalog/product_info.php?cPath=421_108_109&amp;products_id=1889\r\nTiny is also releasing some sets of xmods bearings.\r\nI still don\'t have any bearings in my car, still waiting to see what Tiny comes out with. Unfortunatly I\'m getting kinda antsy over here and will probably end up buying a couple sets of them dinball bearings.[/quote:15b19e997c]\r\n\r\nHEy sessiz, i was gonna get the same from dinball (2 packs of 10). Really only need like 14, you wanna go halves on 3 sets?? 15 each is enuff and im sure they would be cheap to ship to one another. Would save a little coin that way. i was also thinkin of pickin up some "screw sets" from the mini-z and hopin they would replace the xmod screws for a custom color look.You think they would fit?[/quote:15b19e997c]\r\n\r\nI\'m down with that. :-) \r\nAlls I want are the bearings but I\'m not 100% on the measurements. I also have no clue on the screws, sorry.');
