INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (31815, '59eef3339f', '', '[quote:59eef3339f="hogjowlz"]well dave all you need to do now is get a model airplaine and put the wing over the trunk and you will have the fastest xmod known to man  :-D \r\n\r\nthat is nice tho[/quote:59eef3339f]Hey you know what? If you\'re saying it looks too much like one of them street tuner types, then that\'s perfect, \'cause that\'s what I was going for. I saw that Street Tuner magazine is having a monthly graphic contest. So I wanted to do something that would appeal to them, and suit my taste also. I\'ve made some beer money drawing plates for tattoo artist when I was younger, so I dig the theme, even though I don\'t have a tattoo on my body.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks for the comps guys. That was definately the most intricate masking I\'ve done yet. I was hoping people would appreciate the time I put into it.');
