INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (32003, 'a908d903b5', '', 'Oh boy, there\'s a bit of a story here...\r\n\r\nMy first micro wasn\'t even the Bits, it was the Takara Digi-Q...This is back when these things first came out, months before MicroSizers or ZipZaps came out.\r\n\r\nIt was quite by accident. When I was a kid I used to LOVE Penny Racers and one day (I guess around May or June of \'02) I decided to see if I could find some info on the Net about any current events with them...I chanced on a small video of the Digi-Q in action and the idea of a Penny Racer that was remote controllable BLEW MY MIND! I was hooked.\r\n\r\nBeing the maniac that I am, I was adding to my collection like a madman and soon started documenting everything on my website...I soon found a Forum to hangout at to get and share info (Nope, not TinyRC folks, it was MicroRCcenter). \r\n\r\nAnd so that\'s how it started for me.');
