INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (32101, '4dfe4f9af8', '', 'The way I did it was to use the entire wheel and just replace the stock. I also had to cut a spacer out of a stock wheel to keep the rim from touching the chassis on the non gear side. As for tires, I had to shave the inside of the stock ones till they were flat and then superglue them onto the Dubs.\r\nI still like your way better. Wish I had thought of it.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (32103, 'a8908a3956', '', 'Cool beans! \r\n\r\nNot only did ya find that cool Outkast song, but you got some Pixies up there too. Good news for Dave. :-D \r\n\r\nOddly that Outkast song suddenly reminds me of some Frank Black stuff. You do that to me on purpose, Cabo? (tie that Outcast song in with the Pixies, that is)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (32104, 'd88eca6b38', '', 'am i the only one who can\'t stand the video for that outkast song... songs not bad but when you hear it with the video it seems pretty pretty fucking gay');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (32105, 'e1bb79f872', '', '[quote:e1bb79f872="dabigpig"]am i the only one who can\'t stand the video for that outkast song... songs not bad but when you hear it with the video it seems pretty pretty fucking gay[/quote:e1bb79f872]Them early 60s music show were pretty fuckin\' cheesy. I think he did a great job poking fun at them. From the happy go lucky rythm guitarist strumming away in a Lennon-esque manner so common of many Beatle wannabes of the time, to the drummer that hams it up everytime the camera hits him. Don\'t ask me what\'s up with them jocky suits but, I think he did a good job of capturing the cheesyness of an era, and with a slight social impact, that I could have never pulled off if I tried to make the same video, \'cause I\'m a white boy.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (32106, 'e5437ea38e', '', 'I like all the ones about the indicators of speed, and it aint how you stand by your car, its how big the wing is.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (32107, 'a44b1be733', '', '[quote:a44b1be733="crazydave"]Cool beans! \r\n\r\nNot only did ya find that cool Outkast song, but you got some Pixies up there too. Good news for Dave. :-D \r\n\r\nOddly that Outkast song suddenly reminds me of some Frank Black stuff. You do that to me on purpose, Cabo? (tie that Outcast song in with the Pixies, that is)[/quote:a44b1be733]we\'re freaks lol\r\nI was killing 2 birds with 1 stone there, MBLP asked for the Pixies, I happened to have it and haven\'t heard them in awhile...\r\nI totally dig the outkast song and so that was going in no matter what.\r\nbut then I put the list together and gave it an overview, and I did feel there was sumfin up with the playlist but couldn\'t put a finger on it.\r\nI wouldn\'t of come up with frank black but it does fit somehow.\r\nI just chalked it up to an eclectic playlist lol');
