INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48541, '0753f7ad55', '', 'The game will start at 19.45 GMT. The time difference is 5 or 6 hours depending on your location at US (not 100% sure). About watching it on tv, I don\'t know if the portuguese tv will broadcast the game in their international channel RTPi, but you might be able to see it in some other sat channels.\r\n\r\nAnd we already have a final opponent: Greece  :-) Now let\'s see if we can have our revenge from the first game.\r\n\r\nPortugal has been completely caught by the EuroMania. I\'m not a big soccer fan. I just see a few games, but I think everyone watches the Euro2004 games.\r\nWhen there\'s a game going on, is really hard to find any traffic in the streets.  :???:');
