INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (32335, 'ae20ebad65', 'free ringtones and crap', 'well thinking about namuna\'s post about getting a t610 im sure at least one person will benefit from this thread.\r\n\r\nany midi(polyphonic) ringtone enabled phone should work the same for this. or any phone that displays pictures(this varies a little more). also any phone that plays java games(that varies as well). also ive only done this over tmobile via gprs but you should be able to use bluetooth or an ir port if your phone has it.\r\n\r\nok we will use ringtones as an example since its more universal. goto google. search for a song you want and midi and sift through the bs until you find a link to the midi file you want. example: http://hogjowlz.lixlink.com/jeopardy.mid  you can now either dload the file to your hard drive and beam it to the phone via ir or bluetooth or you can goto your wap browser on the phone and enter the link directly to the midi file and it should download and tell/ask you to save it in the ringtones on the phone. \r\n\r\ngames that work on the t610 are java based .jar or .jad files. i found a zip file on imesh with about a hundred or so and theres some on the web for free or shareware. most nokia games work fine with the 610 and vice versa.\r\n\r\npictures vary a little by what kind of files your phone will display and screen resolution. most phones use .gif or .jpg. the t610 will use an animated .gif as the screensaver.\r\n\r\nalso beaming via ir works the same for games and pics. umm ya can you tell im bored?');
