INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (32363, '6cebd01826', '', 'https://sourceforge.net/projects/fma/\r\n\r\nBesides giving you direct access (through Bluetooth) to the components in the phone (like phone book, and SMS features)...The thing gives you the ability to control your PC!...Things like volume, media player and Winamp control.\r\n\r\nThe thing has a proximity sensor too, it knows when you go in or out of range and has options (mute/unmute, screensaver, lock/unlock PC) when it detects.\r\n\r\nThe program is able to work with VBScripts and I\'m in the midsts of teaching myself VBScript (I want to make a script that hooks into the proximity sensor and set your IMs to away/back).');
