INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (32407, '634382bd0d', '', 'Guys, use your common sense. If he showed us how he did it, then people would do it themselves without him gettin the dough. I even emailed him and asked him for a tutorial and he said something like, "I don\'t have a tutorial on how it\'s done, but if you pay me 20 dollars and send the car, I\'ll do it for you." THINK about what you guys are asking. He\'s like the owner of a cookie factory, if everyone knows the secret recipe then they\'ll make it themselves and he\'ll go outta business. Chances are very slim he\'ll put up a tutorial.  :-)');
