INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (32596, '6069dffb63', '', 'You Pimps crack me up!\r\n\r\nI\'ve always been good at figuring out shit, assembling shit, creating stuff. As a kid when I got a toy, I\'d tear it down to see what makes it tick, then put that shit back together.  Racing H.O.\'s back in da day, I\'d come up with shit to make things faster, whether it was tightening the brush springs or mixing sewing machine oil with the HO jell, It was always something.\r\n\r\nI got the skilz and the tools to get into the electronics but can\'t seem to get my head outta da body modding book!  Fly is sending me some more FET\'s and I know if I got questions I can always count on you Pimps for answers, just gotta find da time and pull away from Da Body Shop a lil.\r\n\r\nAs for Da Hemp, I cut back tremendously to once a year, the week between Xmas &amp; New Years and wouldn\'t touch it till next Xmas so whatever was left over, would be some mean shit the following year.\r\nBut for that week, I\'d start at about noon and be fuck\'d up all day.\r\nThat was years ago (5-6), hadda cut that due to job contract switching, drug tests, etc.  Gotta have a job to support the family &amp; habits!  Now I make some slammin ass NOG w/OGD 100 proof for the week of Xmas.  I still get buzzed but it\'s legal now.');
