INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (32756, '35aca20b0f', 'insane modding?', 'hey guys.. im new here but not new to micro R/C and bit char-g. ive been readin the forums for the past 2 weeks and looks like a cool place, so i finally brought myself to sign up. i also owned the long retired bitchar-g site 2 years ago (wow its been that long!) Bit galaxy. (find it on google)\r\n\r\nwell.. i was lookin at all the mod options, the mosfets, multi cellings. has anyone really tried doing a mosfet, then quad cell it? or dual motors aswell. what kind of power curve would this produce? i cant even imagine. or if it would be possible to run at a certain level, (like instant flips when tapping the gas), boy prop controls would be a must then. but anyway..has anyone ever tried...and/or plan to do this kind of thing?  :???:');
