INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33060, '74da0a5002', '', '[quote:74da0a5002="CaboWabo"]\r\ndon\'t hide stuff from her, let her get to know the real you, if she\'s still diggin - that\'s gonna the bomb for both of you - there\'s no foundation for things like dis-trust, dis-honesty, etc. there.\r\n\r\nor you could just feed her drinks and dong for desert[/quote:74da0a5002]Dude I know exactly what you\'re saying. Now I gotta tell a story... :roll:\r\n\r\nBack when I was like 20, I had this buddy, we used go out and get in trouble together, and his girfriend would hang out with mine getting her worked up. We\'d fight every freakin\' weekend. It got to the point where I had to hide everything, to avoid getting trouble. Same shit with my parents when I was a teenager. I got sick of all that, and when I met my wife I was straight up with her from the beginning. It\'s like, this is who I am, either deal with it, or I guess I\'m not who you want me to be.\r\n\r\n...but bits that\'s another story. He\'s got her hooked, don\'t want to kill her interest. The be plenty of time to kick her ass later, but you have to let her think she has a chance at least.');
