INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33062, '6598184e27', '350z - W.I.P', 'Here\'s my 350z, she\'s still a work in progress but I thought what the hell, why not share it with the pimps.\r\n\r\nI pretty much have to play the waiting game for a least 24 hours to allow the coats of clear finish to dry and harden.  Then I\'ll be cool to continue on.\r\n\r\nI removed the tape.  btw, I didn\'t need to score the tape edges with a knife.  The paint [b:6598184e27]didn\'t[/b:6598184e27] chip as it has done before.   It might have to do with the fact that I know more about what I\'m doing now than before, oh wel......\r\n\r\nSo here\'s the shell pretty much done (drying on a pullback chassis)save a few finer details.\r\n\r\n[img:6598184e27]http://www.users.bigpond.com/matt.marcos/bit_g/350z/shell_1.jpg[/img:6598184e27]\r\n[img:6598184e27]http://www.users.bigpond.com/matt.marcos/bit_g/350z/shell_2.jpg[/img:6598184e27]\r\n[img:6598184e27]http://www.users.bigpond.com/matt.marcos/bit_g/350z/shell_3.jpg[/img:6598184e27]\r\n[img:6598184e27]http://www.users.bigpond.com/matt.marcos/bit_g/350z/shell_4.jpg[/img:6598184e27]\r\n\r\nI\'m keeping the light fittings clear (like on my gloria) so I may install some headlights/rearlights.\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33063, 'df598033da', '', 'Hog I tell ya, all the advice is good!  This is my realm of expertise!\r\n\r\nWhen you find a woman that is interrested in Micro\'s, which you luv, bottom line, you\'re in........... period!  So you ain\'t gotta worry about what you should let her do, be yo self Pimp!  She already likes you so why fake anything?  You Da Man, but you don\'t hafta act it, she already knows, all you have to do is reinforce it!  But if you want to do the Pimp thing, make her her very own Micro!  I did, lemme tell ya.....\r\n\r\nI have a good friend I\'ve been knowin for about 15 or so years, we worked together way back when, thea couplet years ago I came back to the job.  Anyways I showed her my hobby, just the Pics, and she thought they were so cute! (whatever it takes), and was amazed at how I detailed such small cars.  She understands my obsession cause she is an avid collector of Betty Boop memorabellia (think that\'s spelled right) so she has all kinda shit.  She luvs Red Convertables so I decided to make her a Micro with Betty Boop colors and decals.  Car &amp; Controller is done, just gotta get the decals just right.  Of course I\'ll floss it here first.  Talkin bout scorin browny points!\r\n\r\nSo Bro, 1st find out what kinda car she digs and make her one!  If you need, I voluteer to do a body for you Pimp............Need I say more?');
