INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33233, '59b3a24c91', '', 'I\'ve never found a better battery than the 150\'s.\r\nall the batts I\'ve tried that are over, just increase run time, but not juice.\r\n\r\nthe stock batts aren\'t enough, the 160\'s I tried are no where near putting out what the 150\'s do, they put out less, just for a longer period of time.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33234, 'db58989a3e', 'You are not going to believe this: 2.0!!!', 'well, I just stopped by my local Bud\'s H.O. hobby shop today, and struck up a convo with the clerk. He told me he was importing some motors for the MicroSizers from Japan. He told me that in a week, maybe a month, they will have  the 3.8,  the 4.2, and the unsuspectable 4.8 motors! WOO HOO! This is off da hook! I plan to save up a lot of money and get them 4.8\'s! And when I throw in the Layman\'s tricell, YEEEEEE!!! But I don\'t wanna overwork the motors and use the KIT gears with them, knowing the torque and endurance they lack. \r\n\r\nSee ya\'ll later, -Son Gokou');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33235, 'f4075e2f66', '', 'son your posts aren\'t  much better.\r\nI\'ve always stayed on the sidelines as much as I could but you seem to be provoking a response from the higher ups.\r\nI\'m not sure if it\'s because you crave the attention or if you\'re seriously just whacked out.\r\neither way, I\'m trying my hardest to not come down on you, but with comments like that last one you made, I have to step in.\r\n\r\nI don\'t mind seeing people stick up for themselves, matter of fact I respect it.\r\nbut you seem to not be interested in that, you just like stirring the pot, causing shit, making a scene around yourself.\r\n\r\nJust cool down dudeman, that\'s all I\'m sayin - or I\'ll be forced to bend you over my knee.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33236, 'bc79590afa', '', '[quote:bc79590afa="CaboWabo"]son your posts aren\'t  much better.\r\nI\'ve always stayed on the sidelines as much as I could but you seem to be provoking a response from the higher ups.\r\nI\'m not sure if it\'s because you crave the attention or if you\'re seriously just whacked out.\r\neither way, I\'m trying my hardest to not come down on you, but with comments like that last one you made, I have to step in.\r\n\r\nI don\'t mind seeing people stick up for themselves, matter of fact I respect it.\r\nbut you seem to not be interested in that, you just like stirring the pot, causing shit, making a scene around yourself.\r\n\r\nJust cool down dudeman, that\'s all I\'m sayin - or I\'ll be forced to bend you over my knee.[/quote:bc79590afa]\r\n\r\nAllright, Allright, have it your way. Just thought that hue35 and Hiroto were being a little rude, I guess I\'m on the same level. Send me a private message and tell me what I need to improve on, I never had any intentions of "stirring the pot" or whatever..... Oh well, you learn something I guess.\r\n\r\nSorry if I was being an asshole.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33237, '30d4e9f5c7', '', 'Hmmm.... a 42000 motor is 42000, but a dual celled 22000 is 44000....so I\'d say dual cell the 2.2. You may want to operate an internal dual cell with the 2.2 or 4.2, but I\'d suggest the Layman\'s dual cell mod, and peak charge it. It won\'t have much torque, so use the 9.86:1 gearing and the 2.2 motor to make up for it. Good luck! BTW, there are 4.8 motors coming to the stores soon, check this: http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=2714');
