INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33260, '9ae597ab6e', '', 'Seriously, Son_Gokou, you are exibiting signs of a disturbed little mind, and while Sezziz hasn\'t helped that, the point being, this is a bit related forum, and very few of your post seem to have anything to do with bits. I bring this up, because of your attack on Hiroto, with that comment about him pushing his post count. For one thing, only silly kids worry about their post count, for another Hiroto has made quite a few post showing his fly ass rides, and discussing his technique, the way BitPimps was meant to be used. I\'ve yet to see any of your rides. Your attack on Hiroto was both unnecessary, uncalled for, and his opinion is valued.\r\n\r\nThen you want Cabo to PM you, and tell you how to act. I\'m sorry guy, but you\'re a big boy now, you should know how to conduct yourself. I hope I\'m not out place speaking for Cabo, but I think I can honestly say, he has no desire to act as your parent.\r\n\r\n...and Hiroto, no inside joke, it\'s right out in the open, he just likes to make a fool of himself, repeatedly.');
