INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33481, '1e38d8fb91', '', '[quote:1e38d8fb91="crazydave"]Well HobbyEtc. just lost me as customer. Too bad too I was planning to buy a bunch of Mini- Z stuff there. They never sent a confirmation email. I emailed them asking for a confirmation email. I instead got one from UPS. I figured, oh well at least it\'s on the way.\r\n\r\nIt shows up today, and no Wild Char-G. Oh yeah sure they credited me back, but it would have been really nice if they could have contacted me, so I wouldn\'t be sittin\' here thinkin\' I\'m getting a Wild Char-G. \r\n\r\nIt\'s funny because I should be happy that I\'ve got  new bits to play with, but so what? I have bits, I was expecting a new toy, so I don\'t even care about the other cars. They\'ll probably just sit in the boxes for a while now.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSo you hear that HobbyEtc.?  You don\'t take a minute of your time to treat your customers right, and you lose our money, dig?[/quote:1e38d8fb91]\r\n\r\n\r\na couple of months after christmas, you\'ll pull out those unopened boxes and smile.\r\n\r\nor when you screwed up a chassis, you\'ll be looking for a good replacement.\r\n\r\n :???:');
