INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33712, '3f4b796c05', 'Windows', 'Hi\r\n\r\nAs i wrote few posts before i\'m working on my first car :)\r\nI\'m trying some technics on my test opendeck body.\r\n\r\nAnd this is one of the results: simple (i think :) ) way to do black windows.\r\n\r\nYou need:\r\n\r\n- car body :)\r\n- sheet of black (or other) self adhesive foil\r\n- newspaper\r\n- soft pencil\r\n- double sided sticking tape\r\n- scisors\r\n\r\n1.  [img:3f4b796c05]http://www.gdynia.mm.pl/~miva/mrc/1.jpg[/img:3f4b796c05] 2. [img:3f4b796c05]http://www.gdynia.mm.pl/~miva/mrc/2.jpg[/img:3f4b796c05]\r\n3. [img:3f4b796c05]http://www.gdynia.mm.pl/~miva/mrc/3.jpg[/img:3f4b796c05] 4. [img:3f4b796c05]http://www.gdynia.mm.pl/~miva/mrc/4.jpg[/img:3f4b796c05]\r\n5. [img:3f4b796c05]http://www.gdynia.mm.pl/~miva/mrc/5.jpg[/img:3f4b796c05] 6. [img:3f4b796c05]http://www.gdynia.mm.pl/~miva/mrc/6.jpg[/img:3f4b796c05]\r\n7. [img:3f4b796c05]http://www.gdynia.mm.pl/~miva/mrc/7.jpg[/img:3f4b796c05] 8. [img:3f4b796c05]http://www.gdynia.mm.pl/~miva/mrc/8.jpg[/img:3f4b796c05]\r\n9. [img:3f4b796c05]http://www.gdynia.mm.pl/~miva/mrc/9.jpg[/img:3f4b796c05] 10. [img:3f4b796c05]http://www.gdynia.mm.pl/~miva/mrc/10.jpg[/img:3f4b796c05]\r\n11. [img:3f4b796c05]http://www.gdynia.mm.pl/~miva/mrc/11.jpg[/img:3f4b796c05] 12. [img:3f4b796c05]http://www.gdynia.mm.pl/~miva/mrc/12.jpg[/img:3f4b796c05]\r\n\r\nFirst try wasnt perfect, but second should be :)\r\n\r\nIn the same way you can make masks for airbrushing.\r\n\r\nMiva');
