INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33926, '209c013ca6', '', 'Thanx Pimps!\r\nI started this to look slightly different, then I went surfing and found a \r\nfew pics of a real 360 Spyder so I had to change the mod a lil.  \r\nThis is what I was going for:\r\n[img:209c013ca6]http://images.cardomain.com/member_images/8/web/356000-356999/356792_1.jpg[/img:209c013ca6]\r\n[img:209c013ca6]http://images.cardomain.com/member_images/8/web/356000-356999/356792_2.jpg[/img:209c013ca6]\r\nThen I saw the roll bars and said fuck it, I ain\'t moddin this mug no mo!\r\nI tried to make it as authentic as possible while adding a touch from\r\nTeam DarkTari (body kit).  I did get the exhaust &amp; wheel caps right!\r\nI also altered the body kit to look more conformed, molded in so to speak.\r\nThere is a tuner called HaMann that does Ferrari after market tuning \r\nso there are body kits for these things!\r\nOh and I like blood red interiors with silver.\r\nGlad you Pimps like!  Appreciate the Cudos!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33927, '822b909688', '', 'Thanks guys. \r\n\r\nSo you want me to spill how I come with \'em?\r\n\r\nNot much to spill. I was trying to do some extreme flame kinda thing, but it just wasn\'t flowin\' today, and not much room to work with on the bit body, I do that kind of stuff better on Zip Zaps, so I just did my basic flames. I added the racing stripe to fill space since I couldn\'t figure out how to make the flames work with the vents on the hood. I picked the colors, with the intention of keeping it cheap by using my scruggin\'s. The red came on the body. The white is actually primer, I was surprised how well my fade came out, because that stuff doesn\'t lay nearly as smooth as laquer. Then I sputtered out my last drops of charcoal, to barely eeek out 2 coats. \r\n\r\nI got really nervous it wouldn\'t come out, but when I peeled all that masking tape off, well, you\'ve seen...');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33928, '540e305875', '', 'Ours has come &amp; gone !');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33929, 'c69474550e', '', '[quote:c69474550e="crazydave"]I wanted one of them bodies, I wasn\'t kidding when I was saying I was aiming for second place in that contest.\r\n\r\nThat sucks to hear they weren\'t that nice, but I love what you\'ve done to yours. That looks great!\r\n\r\nSo do those bodies fit the Thunder Charger chassis, or are those just TC rims? Like the touch with the yellow dots on the rims.[/quote:c69474550e]\r\n\r\nThanx Cavey,\r\nI just used the wheels off an old TC. They are the closest thing I have right\r\nnow to the original Ferrari wheels.  Chassis is MicroSizer w/4.2 King.');
