INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33934, '4cfaa24b19', 'I need some extra eyes', 'I finally got off my ass and got to work on my skyline body. Long story short (I\'ll elaborate when the body is done) [b:4cfaa24b19]DO NOT DRINK AND STRIP![/b:4cfaa24b19]\r\nStriped her, puttied the gashes and melted parts (explained in the elaboration) sanded her, primed her and the now the question....\r\nWhich decal should I go with?\r\n\r\nA.\r\n[img:4cfaa24b19]http://picserver.student.utwente.nl/getpicture.php?id=567000[/img:4cfaa24b19]\r\n\r\nor\r\n\r\nB.\r\n[img:4cfaa24b19]http://picserver.student.utwente.nl/getpicture.php?id=567001[/img:4cfaa24b19]\r\n\r\nI plan to keep this body as my track car and I plan to sticker her up pretty good. Maybe I should have done this as a poll question  :???:');
