INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33970, '79e44002ff', 'Re: I know you\'re tired of those steering wires....', '[quote:79e44002ff="Son_Gokou"]Look, all of you are tired of breaking a wire from the pcb to the steering coil, right? Well, I was doin\' some searchin\' and I found this little tutie on how to make your own, so you don\'t have to buy a new bit. \r\n\r\nhttp://www.geocities.com/pfabersac/coil.html\r\n\r\nThis is not MY mod, I\'m just linking to one that I found.[/quote:79e44002ff]\r\nThat is just how to make them...if you want a custom mod I did, take some electric tape. Individually wrap each steering wire, now wrap all four together. Tow, they won\'t break unless you REALLY pull! I did that to all of my wires in my one cars PCB and there is ALOT of extra space! :???:  :eek:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (33971, '6a5e1be95b', '', 'I haven\'t played with all the new toys in 8.0 (aka CS) yet...But I CAN tell you that the Shadows/Highlights adjustments is COMPLETELY BADASS!!!\r\n\r\nYeah sure, if you\'re any kind of \'decent\' Photoshoper you should be able to get shit done with Levels &amp; Curves...But who the hell has all damned day to futz?! I\'ve got archived pics that are either blown out or WAYYYY underexposed that I can actually USE now because of this tool!\r\n\r\nI\'m playing around with the color match now, this is gonna be a HUGE help in keeping consistant pictures (for when I do the object movies and shit).\r\n\r\nLast, but certainly NOT least in my book for COOL SHIT about CS is the ability to open RAW files. Though I exclusively use the \'fine detail\' JPEG compression option with my Digicam, at some point I might want to try RAW and do MY OWN adjustments.\r\n\r\nBelieve me amigos, this is a SIGNIFICANTLY lovely new version!');
