INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34013, '85becb02e9', '11 tooth xmod pinion already off FREE', 'i was clearng out all my stuff when i came across an xmod 11 tooth pinion already off the motor and in perfect    condition with all the teeth in perfect alighnment..considering i didnt have any xmods i figuredhey maybe some one on here will want it to put in a different motor like mini-z motor or tamiya mini-4X4 motor, so i thought  id put it here since its free and all  just if sumone wants it tell me and ill ship it to them free of charge\r\n\r\nMicro');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34014, 'ce960492bb', '', 'the ramones &amp; the new york dolls turned it upside down, the pistols were a malcolm mclaren invention. generation x were better too.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34015, 'c67461c9d7', '', '[quote:c67461c9d7="CaboWabo"]that kicks ass!\r\nbout time we got that fucker, should have got him when bushes daddy tried.\r\nglad one of our original goals came to be\r\nnow where\'s osama? (funny how we never hear about that anymore)[/quote:c67461c9d7]\r\n\r\nBush was smart about the whole Osama thing. After he realised, that it would almost be impossible to catch Osama in those mountens. He hurried up and started a new thing: "Saddam". Then people would forget Osama for a while. Plus Bush wanted to free the people of Irak, sorry did I say people. I ment Oil\r\nDawn you americans don`t hear the whole story all the time. When the Desert Storm war was going on, you was`nt even informed the your forces used bullets with uranium until after the war was over!!!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34016, 'eb21cfff54', '', 'Im waiting to see what we try him for. I mean we attacked him first so he had the right to defend his country. And we still have not found any "weapons of mass destruction" so what do we try him for? BTW you guys should read this entire website it will give you a different outlook http://www.cbc.ca/fifth/conspiracytheories/index.html .');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34017, 'ff6d4858bf', '', '[quote:ff6d4858bf="gearboy"]the ramones &amp; the new york dolls turned it upside down, the pistols were a malcolm mclaren invention. generation x were better too.[/quote:ff6d4858bf]Damn dude, I like your style. I agree, I think people give way too much credit to the Sex Pistols, but I still have some respect for the Pistols. They pissed a lot of people off.\r\n\r\nI don\'t know how many times I got in the "first punk band" debate, and so many people think it was the Pistols, but I always tell them The Ramones are the band that the phrase, \'punk rock\' was coined for, and before the Ramones the term did not exist. So that clearly makes them the first punk band. Even Johnny Rotton has said they got the inspiration to start the Sex Pistols after seeing the Ramones for the first time in \'76.\r\n\r\n\r\n...but now we\'re way off the subject of bits...');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34018, 'b698a6ce59', '', 'Oh there it is, I can see it now.\r\n\r\nLooks good to me.\r\n\r\nWhich color are you fading in?\r\n\r\nYou know what I start to do if I\'m not happy with the fade, is fade the base color back the other way.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34019, '453648f304', '', 'You\'re right Cabo. I have another Evo shell, and am going to try it again. I wanted the fade to end at the fender, but I sprayed too far.\r\n\r\nDave, I was trying to fade the red into the white. I layed down a basecoat of white on the entire car and then added the red.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34020, '87dac7a665', '', 'Hehe, I love being a goddamned SUPER sleuth with finding shit on the net.\r\n\r\nThere\'s a patch that fixes the keyboard shortcut problem.\r\n\r\nIf anyone else is having the same problem, PM me and I\'ll send you the link for the patch.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34021, 'f4f14c3862', '', 'I would like an Altoids BJ.\r\n\r\nThat would get the holiday spirits started.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34022, '459556ac39', '', 'I know we\'re off topic, but...\r\n\r\n[quote:459556ac39="gearboy"]the ramones &amp; the new york dolls turned it upside down[/quote:459556ac39]\r\n\r\nAnd MC5 and The Stooges turned it upside down before them... and you could play that game forever, all the way back to Louis Jordan in the early 40\'s and Robert Johnson before him. Point is, it\'s all connected and it all has roots, and that\'s one of the things that makes having a record collection cool... \r\n\r\n[quote:459556ac39="gearboy"]the pistols were a malcolm mclaren invention. generation x were better too.[/quote:459556ac39]\r\n\r\nTrue as that may be, I\'m just sayin\' the Sex Pistols probably don\'t deserve the "lame" category. And, as far as bands being "better" than other bands... opinions are cool, but ultimately it\'s all personal. I like Sham 69 and the Deadboys better than I like the Damned, but that doesn\'t make them better bands. Anyway, it takes a whole world to make a whole world, and by design that gives us all a lot of record-buying options... which is better than celery.');
