INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34168, '46a715a5c5', '', 'Sorry double post, i know....\r\nheh i figured i would get more feedback on this thread than I did... but meh...\r\n\r\nI have grown very proud of the job I have done to this Skyline... Everytime I see it, it manages to look better and better....\r\n\r\nThe rims are my main pet peve right now, but I went a step further on the underbody to make it fit and hold really good, like it was made like this :p\r\n\r\nIf you want a Full Size pic, go to: [url]http://members.shaw.ca/blinnstudios/SkylineR34.jpg[/url]\r\n[img:46a715a5c5]http://members.shaw.ca/blinnstudios/SkylineR34_small.jpg[/img:46a715a5c5]\r\n\r\nI was thinkin of entering it into the Christmas Contest... but wasnt sure if I would even stand a chance.... You guys think if I got it some new rims I would stand a decent chance?\r\n\r\n :D Swavey  :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34169, '73126260db', '', 'Just turned 30 this year, so I guess I\'m in the middle somewhere. As far as us older guys playin with little cars, I would think that most of us have real cars and spend plenty of time and money upgrading them. \r\nAs for myself, I\'m more into motorcycles now than cars. I spent way too much money on my real cars over the years, and never got any of it back in the end. \r\nI could have used all that money to take my family on vacation, or bought a boat.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34170, '0c331a7620', '', 'Osama is a tougher nut to crack!  He\'s not the Lavish lifestyle dictator that Sadaam was, he\'s a rebel, he knows how to live off the land unlike Sadaam.  And once he was able to get into those mountains, the US knew he would be impossible to dispose of.\r\n\r\n[quote:0c331a7620]Im waiting to see what we try him for. I mean we attacked him first so he had the right to defend his country. And we still have not found any "weapons of mass destruction" so what do we try him for? [/quote:0c331a7620]\r\n\r\nHe\'ll be tried for the many atrocities against his countrymen.  The US won\'t be able to prove otherwise without factual evidence, and we ain\'t got none!  That\'s why Bush is so willing to have him tried &amp; judged by his own countymen or atl east give them a great say-so.\r\n\r\nAnd what Bush has been able to do with this situation is NOT gonna buy his ass back in office I guarantee that!  Let\'s not forget since he\'s been in office, He\'s created a deficit that took Bill 8 years to wipe out,  the economy is down, in turn forcing businesses to make large employee cuts and putting many companies out of business, which skyrocketed unemployment!  That increased voilent crimes, raised the price of healthcare &amp; life insurance.  And let\'s not forget all the soldiers that have died for thier country under Bush\'s term.  And guess what, all these issues directly/indirectly affected Mr &amp; Mrs. voter ! \r\n\r\nPeace Out (as I step off my soapbox)\r\n\r\nI vote to Make Bill Clinton an official BitPimp !!!\r\nAfter all, if the US presidency wasn\'t limited to 2 terms, Bill would be King!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34171, '177ab43d6d', '', '[quote:177ab43d6d="Miva"]Thx :) This is my first airbrush job.\r\n\r\nI think that another good way to do dark lines is using Citadel ink close to body colour.\r\n\r\nYou can buy them here:\r\n[url]http://uk.games-workshop.com/storefront/store.uk?do=List_Models&amp;code=300952&amp;orignav=300810[/url]\r\n\r\nMiva[/quote:177ab43d6d]\r\n\r\nNow I like that idea, I\'ve never been too particular about outlining every crevis in black.  I don\'t mind, and have done it where a real car may have rubber, around the lights, windows, sunroof, and blacken out vents but not the doors, hood, trunk, etc.  Personal Preference!');
