INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34200, '16b939ed6d', '', 'I used the little cars to help my little girl crawl, then she goto the point that no matter the car or motor she could get them.  So fets came into play lol.\r\n\r\n  My boys love there cars but they cont seem to grasp the concept of a race to then it who can do the most damage.  The wife doesn\'t mind them but she licks the epochs more (I can see why) but she does have a bit at work for when shes not firing people.\r\n\r\n  See I think my family will really get into it soon  :???:  This is why I think this.\r\n\r\n  Xmas dinner for one side of my family is this Sat at my house.  SO there will be about 20 people here or so.  I am just to damn lazy to take the track down(on the dinning room table at the moment) so they will have to eat off of it.  Its not much work moving it just have to move all the styrofoam walls and cliffs and move teh 2 pieces of 4\'X4\' but again this it to much work for me.\r\n\r\n  So we will see how that goes or if the wife puts up a fit about it lol.');
