INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34591, 'ca9c15c41c', '', 'Well, I tried.  No way I\'m gonna be making a hydro Bit, at least for this contest.   :sad:   The motor\'s twice the size of a bit.  On the plus side, anyone in White Plains, NY, should check out Bruckner Hobbies on Central Ave.  I went in, and they had microsizers for $9.99.  They are first gens, so they don\'t have boosters.  The funny thing was, Precious clones were right next to them for the same price!!!!!  Well, at least I have a daily driver until my ZZ comes back from Micro Amps.  Anyway, I think that this yellow xB needs some modding bodywise, as you can see straight through the wheelwells!!!  Anyway, I guess it\'s time to fix up "Spongebob," (since it\'s yellow and all, get it???  Get it!!! Oh well....)');
