INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48521, '9f91336f3f', '', 'I drive an 94 Explorer all i gotta say is Steel bumpers are the shit.  I was driving in Manhattan and some asshole in an old civic cut in front of me and caught the side of my front bumper and ripped the shit out of his drivers door all the way back to the gas tank. He took off like a shot not stopping for shit (most like stolen car or no insurance) I got out rubbed the paint off the bumper and went on my way.\r\n\r\nI love my tank');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34750, 'd4c3ca094c', 'Evo\'s new RX7', 'So here it is.. The newest..\r\n\r\nThis is my FIRST spray painting job, and i will remember the fucks on this one, and make my slamming S2000 even prettier.\r\n\r\n[img:d4c3ca094c]http://frip.dk/theevo/RX1.jpg[/img:d4c3ca094c]\r\n[img:d4c3ca094c]http://frip.dk/theevo/RX3.jpg[/img:d4c3ca094c]\r\n[img:d4c3ca094c]http://frip.dk/theevo/RX4.jpg[/img:d4c3ca094c]\r\n\r\nThe pen in the pictures was a test. I painted the hood, headlights, taillights and the gas cap (???). Im not doing that again. The paint didnt cover as well as it could, and the exhaust pipes, didnt fit well.\r\n\r\nWell.. all fucks.. And something i will try to avoid with my S2000.\r\n\r\n/Evo');
