INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34831, '79c1948ee3', '', 'That\'s a good point about the clearcoat fixing up transparent plastic after it\'s been "worked" with thinners and whatnot. I\'ve used wooden toothpicks with the tips soaked in thinner. The wood is sturdy, but won\'t scratch the plastic. Future floor polish works great as a clearcoat to restore clarity in clear plastic.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34824, '52e48e8fa5', '', 'usually you\'ll find me the most agreeable bloke but I gotta say one thing.  \r\n\r\nNothing is more fucked up in America than your gun control policy, or shear lack of them.  you will all eventually kill yourselves....\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34821, '6dda3b97d1', '', 'I\'ve beeen having a really bad habit of forgetting to mask the insides of my windows lately. What I do is sand it off with some fine grit sand paper, and then lay a heavy clear coat on it, which will make it transparent again.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34822, '121c7ba029', 'How many fully automatic weapons are in your neighborhood?', 'When I was a kid, everyone banged on pot and pans at New Years. Occasionally you\'d hear some firecrackers, and bottle rockets go off, but as the years went on you started hearing more and more gunshots. \r\n\r\nNowdays all you hear is gunshots,  nothing new, but what\'s bothering me is the number of fully automatic weapons I heard firing off rounds last night. It literally sounded like a war zone out there. \r\n\r\nI know a lot of people like their guns, but I\'m sorry, I just don\'t see the need for a fully automatic weapon to protect your home, and considering fully automatic weapons are illegal, you know the people that own them are not the most law abiding citizens. \r\n\r\nFor me New Years has become a grim reminder of how dangerous my hood can be.\r\n\r\nAlso, I think it\'s silly, because what goes up, [i:121c7ba029]will[/i:121c7ba029] come down, and last year 4 people were injured by stray bullets on New Years. This year the bullet rain went on for almost a half an hour straight. I\'m really curious to watch the news tonight and see how many people got hit this year.');
