INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34867, '615c855a51', '', '[quote:615c855a51="payaso"]\r\nWelcome again Dave.  You\'re amongst "friends" in here.  We can smell our own, and knew you\'d fit in..[/quote:615c855a51]After 5 years of roaming the internet, and trying to fit in somewhere. I finally found a place where I don\'t have [i:615c855a51]try[/i:615c855a51] to fit in.  It\'s freakin\' great.\r\n\r\n[quote:615c855a51]What\'s the temp like in AZ? Is it cold?[/quote:615c855a51] Well it had been in the 70s, but this last week we had a cold front move in, and it\'s been in the lower 60s, as low as the 40\'s at night. For a desert rat like me, that\'s cold. \r\n\r\n[quote:615c855a51]I didn\'t do much on the 31st. Just chilled, and kept off the streets.  I put on a good buzz with some "bubble gum" I had saved just for the 31st, and stared at my cars, and raced a bit too.lol[/quote:615c855a51]I\'ve had a miserable holiday, but this weekend, me and the wife have the weekend off together, my moms taking the kid for a trip overnight, and I just restocked, so this weekend will be our time to celebrate.\r\n\r\n[quote:615c855a51]Are you a bong man Dave?[/quote:615c855a51]Well I keep a 12" glass one around, that I ice up whenever I have company, but for the most part I prefer my super modified bored out pipe that I\'ve had for almost 15 years now.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34868, '3954b409c9', '', 'That is not my first paint job, but my first spray paint job.\r\n\r\nI have not done any major changes on the chassis except the exhaust pipes , where i had to cut Some huge holes in the chassis.\r\n\r\nThe so called front lip is a standard front, i just cutted all the small details away so that it looks like a big air intake.\r\n\r\nThen i lowered it, and putted the rims from the speed-set on it.\r\n\r\nDave--&gt;It calms me down that even you makes mistakes with your paint. phew..\r\n\r\n/Evo');
