INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34882, '6ed9736a02', '', '[quote:6ed9736a02="hue35"]That strider_mt2k dude bugged the shit outta me right off da bat...[/quote:6ed9736a02]You too?\r\n\r\nI got so sick of his heatsink rants. If you clip an alligator clip to a pcb while soldering it is reffered to as a heat sink, so why can\'t we call the motor clip a heat sink? Any piece of metal that draws heat from another is a \'heatsink\', no matter how inefficient. He keeps going on about it\'s not a heat sink, because the motor produces no heat, then why the hell did I melt an endbell when I ran my motor an hour straight? Don\'t tell me metal rubbing on metal with no lube at 30,000 RPMs doesn\'t produce heat. Maybe the motor doesn\'t get hot because it has a \'heatsink\' on it. You think? Naw couldn\'t be that simple. Damn, talking about an anal know it all punk. Ranting about something silly like a heatsink, you would never see me making a silly long winded post about calling the motor clip a heat sink. No sir, not me. I really don\'t care what you call it.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34883, 'f56c3f56b5', 'Re: Photo-Editing-Phind....', '[quote:f56c3f56b5="ChopShop"]Auight pimps, I was lookingthrogh the latest versions of PC maazine and came across a program for easy video editing (I read the topic about it the other day since I had been "gone" for a while.) The program is called muvee autoProducer. It\'s 40 bux to buy or free if you can crack the program  8-) \r\n\r\nSo far I only have the demo but it\'s pretty kick ass and better then spending a $h!tload of money for sumthin you aint even goin to use.[/quote:f56c3f56b5]\r\n\r\n\r\npost a ptr...and is it for windozs only?');
