INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34896, '4584fd22a6', '', '[quote:4584fd22a6="noxorc"]I don\'t know how much you homes really smoke.\r\n\r\nme, personally, I smoke 1oz a week.  Just me and my two bongs.\r\nOnce and a while, I smoke a pipe in the car (mainly cause I dont have a travel B).\r\n\r\nWell, my college room-mate Chuck from NJ is coming up to my farm house (and his wife) for this weekend.\r\n\r\nMost likely, we will each smoke our Oz in two days (sat,sun).\r\n\r\nI\'m feelin nervious waitin for him to show up....\r\nI keep going in the garage for another B hit.\r\nI hope I got enough to last the two days..\r\nI\'m on vacation for the next 10 days up here.[/quote:4584fd22a6]\r\n\r\nJEEE-ZUS! I consider myself a fairly regular, if not "heavy" smoker of the leaf. Like, daily. 2-3 b-hits a day. Sometimes all day on the weekend. But criminey, an Oz. will last me almost 2 months! They go for around $350 for B+ — A- quality around here, but price is never the problem. The older I get, the less access I have to quality dope in decent quantity. The indoor stuff is tasty and stinky, but high-quality outdoor can\'t be beat. There\'s just no replacement for the sun. I used to do 1/4  and half pounds during college (I miss the $2k pimp roll in my pocket). Wow, nox. I\'m impressed.');
