INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48546, '5a1ec6ecf1', '', 'Shit, now it\'s my turn to get PMs from Gokou. Hope the little bitch don\'t latch on to me.\r\n\r\nI replied in my usual politly rude manner un which I treat him, but if don\'t get a clue, I gonna have to fuck with him. :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:5a1ec6ecf1][quote:5a1ec6ecf1="Son_Gokou"]#1: What kind of shipping method would you recommend? I think I\'ll give ordering parts from Digikey a second chance....I don\'t think I\'ll try UPS ground...:roll:\r\n\r\n#2: Do you know if a RadioShack 1:43 Corvette can be FET modded?\r\n\r\n#3: Still thinking of a question...lol  :-)[/quote:5a1ec6ecf1]#1 Even if you ordered UPS, you should have got your package. If you paid for something and did not get it it, you need to follow up on it.\r\n\r\nI do not like UPS for small items, it cost too much for thesame service, that\'s why I always go for the cheapest shipping.\r\n\r\n#2 FET. Short for MOSFET. Field Emitting Transistor. If has transistors in it, there more than likely are better, more expensive ones out there. As to what type of transistors are in the Vette, I have no idea, I play with bits.\r\n\r\n#3 Don\'t sit there wracking your brain trying to think of silly questions to ask. It\'s annoying. \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:5a1ec6ecf1]');
