INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (34990, 'd987ce3104', '', 'No man, they are from a real cars something.. err..\r\n\r\nWhen a cylinder creates pressure in a real car engine, then it is those which shoots the pressure away.. damn.. \r\n\r\nIn denmark its called "tændrør", and the exhausts is the top of those. They are about 5mm wide.\r\n\r\nBTW.. i dont have that body.. After i repainted it, it fell on the grass, i repainted it again - and guess what? It did it -fell on the grass.\r\n\r\nI got this though. It was ment to be fired away at nye, but i forgot. Its has a major fuck on the left rear whell well where i cut to deep. So the wheel well is not round anymore. now its like an angle.\r\n\r\n[img:d987ce3104]http://frip.dk/theevo/sup1.jpg[/img:d987ce3104]\r\n\r\nAnd now i dont have anymore bodies to mod - 2 bad. \r\n\r\n/Evo');
