INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35048, 'f297e3ad37', 'I get it... the &quot;B&quot; is for Bad infuence...', 'It\'s funny... I\'ve been talking about cutting my weed consumption down to "occasionally, and no more hoonin\' on \'school\' nights" for quite a while now. SuperFly is really the only one who hears my "yeah, I\'m really gonna cut down after the new year" speeches, and he\'s heard plenty of them in the past 2 or 3 months.\r\n\r\nThen, I get invited into this here back room, and my smokin\' is through the fuckin\' roof. I felt myself trying to smoke as much as possible this weekend in an attempt to keep up with my Bit homies, and get conditioned for some mid-day tokin\' during the work week. I realized, very quickly, that I\'m not built for that much smokin\'... which is fine. The good news is that I realized I don\'t really smoke [i:f297e3ad37]that[/i:f297e3ad37] much after all, and instead of quittin\' the hoon, I\'ll just quit worrying about how much I smoke... cuz it ain\'t never gonna be an oz. a week. SuperFly has told me as much since I first brought it up, but I just figured he was trying to pressure me into dancin\' with the devil... now I know he spoke da troof (I love you, man... I won\'t be doubtin\' again).\r\n\r\nThanks for straightening me out, homies... when I get home, I\'m gonna have me a big, fat fuckin\' rip cuz I deserve it.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35049, '06af34cada', '', 'Reminds me of what ol\' Bennie Franklin said, "All good things come in moderation". I think he said that as an excuse to drink and smoke, but it works for me.  :lol:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35050, 'f98a056e09', '', '[quote:f98a056e09="Maxximum Attack"]dave,\r\nwhat is that square "ring"? is that some sort antenna?\r\nIf so what are the benifits if having it and how do i make it?[/quote:f98a056e09]That\'s the antenna that comes on Thunder Chargers. It\'s beneficial in terms of looks only, \'cause it stays inside the body, but I don\'t think reception as good with it. Thunder Chargers get their range from the controller.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35051, '055903b929', '', 'Like I always say, "Smoke it if ya got it," and "It\'s always better to have weed and no money, than money and no weed."\r\n\r\nWhile I\'m at it, here\'s some other pearls of wisdom I use to guide my life:\r\n\r\ncoffee + bonghit = hippie speedball\r\n\r\nsaturday morning wake \'n bake\r\n\r\nduring the summer, a popsicle and a vitamin is a meal!\r\n\r\nIf you\'re too baked, have a snack (thanks for the sesame candy treats the other night, hue.) \r\n\r\nBTW, the only time(s) in the last 10 years I\'ve been "too high" was from this weed hue\'s sister gave him, known as "polio weed" for it\'s debilitating effects. The kind where you have to say, "I just need to sit down for a minute and stare at my shoes." Imagine taking one of those hits that was probably just a little too much weed in the bowl, but you give your best effort, and then finish it when you\'re done coughing. All the while thinking you\'re going to be doing a mosfet mod afterwards. We\'re smarter now. Get all the soldering done before smoking.\r\n\r\nOh, and this tip (from Rasheed Wallace, no less) to smoke undetected: get one of those plastic grocery bags and poke a few holes in it. Throw a fabric softener sheet inside, and exhale into the bag. Get high and reek like...fresh laundry!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35052, '95267ce571', '', '[quote:95267ce571="SuperFly"]coffee + bonghit = hippie speedball[/quote:95267ce571] :lol: For some reason that one cracked me up.\r\n\r\nHow about, A friend with weed is a friend indeed\r\n\r\nor here\'s a verse from a song by the Toys, that Sublime covered, \r\nsmoke 2 joints in the morning, smoke 2 joints at night, \r\nsmoke 2 in the afternoon, make everything all right. \r\nSmoke 2 in time of peace, and 2 in time of war. \r\nI smoke 2 joints before I smoke 2 joints, then I smoke 2 more.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35053, 'b32d8a3fa1', '', 'coffee &amp; weed has been my favorite combination since I started smokin\'... the first time I heard SuperFly refer to it as the "hippie speedball", I liked it even better. Yeah dave, a friend with weed IS a friend indeed. We have this "weed account" system that works pretty well... if you got a fat sack, put some in the other guy\'s short sack. It usually comes back around when you need it most.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35054, '4c5e93ddba', '', 'My pop\'s big into burnin shit like that. I\'ll see what he says.\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35056, '2aef84071f', '', 'LMAO... You guys are a crack up.. Cabo, and myself talk daily on the phone, and have since I bolted out of that shit town, and we can\'t hang out like you guys do.\r\n\r\nWhen I lived in the Dominican Republic, he would call me, and we\'d shoot the shit and do the "International Bs"  Well, it all escladed from there. We\'ve been doing the same shit ever since. (unless he\'s here)\r\n\r\nBut no doubt about it, when we\'re on the phone, we smoke more than usual....lol  We joke about it, but when we\'re running low, we can\'t do em on the phone.lol I\'ll have to do one quietly. The first part can be muffeld, but the coughin is a dead give away.\r\n\r\nJust like right now. I\'m down to just a few hits until my home boy gets in gear, so if I call CW, I\'ll be all bummed when I hear him barfin in the sink after a phat St. Louie style hit\r\n\r\n\r\nWe should all plan a trip to Jamaica, and meet up , and chill.  Even if it took 2 years of planning, I\'d be down to hang with you guys.  "No Problem mon"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48489, '7ab483447b', '', 'sorry to confuse, i meant that that perticular tank just drives around. some of them have infra red "cannons" in them enabling 2 or more to have a shoot em up contest, like the digi q. they will fire by flashing an ir led and an ir sensor on top registers a "hit" by stopping for 10 seconds or spinning around. the digi q\'s will even recoil when the cannon is fired and simulate damage. some are completely ir controlled, some are radio controlled with ir cannons, and some are just rc tanks with no battle game capability.\r\n\r\nso if you just want a little tank to drive around then the one i posted above is for you. but if you want ir battle games with 2 or more people you\'ll have to buy a digi q (expensive) or another sort (cheaper).');
