INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35062, '7a3e55be1f', '', '[quote:7a3e55be1f="SuperFly"]I\'m there, dood. I\'ve always wanted to go to Jamaica. I\'m forgetting it at the moment, but what\'s the name of the big, annual Reggae fest? Do they still have it? When I was in HS I was waay into Peter Tosh, Sly and Robbie, Bob Marley, etc., and almost made the trip then. Ahh, it just came to me: Sunsplash. That\'s it, isn\'t it?[/quote:7a3e55be1f]\r\n\r\nYup, that\'s it man. I had a boss in the DR that was raised in Jamaica (from Dayton Ohio) weird I know, but he has some good conects.\r\n\r\nHe\'s got some cool stories, but the one that sticks out the most is the fact that when his son was born, Maxi Priest asked to be the God father.\r\n\r\n\r\nLets get this shit goin. The sooner we start, the sooner we\'re sittin on the beach higher than birds pussy sayin, "Can you believe we all met on a micro r/c site?"\r\n\r\nIs this achievable? Only time will tell.\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
