INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35217, '28a66deaf2', '', '1st off...\r\nI wanna congratulate all the BitPimps that entered thier Pimpin Azz sleds in our competition.  \r\nYou all did a fine job of representin Da Hood !   :cowboy: \r\n\r\nNow to the winners:\r\n\r\n[b:28a66deaf2]Miva[/b:28a66deaf2] - Pimp you came outta nowhere to claim 1st place.  I thought I \r\n          had seen just about all that could be done to a Skyline but you\r\n          changed that assumption.  Your work is thorough, clean &amp; smuth!\r\n          Congratulations!   :bowdown: \r\n\r\n[b:28a66deaf2]Hiroto[/b:28a66deaf2] -  In the past I\'ve seen your work and I\'ve seen the improvement\r\n             and technique in your mods lately.  You\'ve done some fine rides\r\n             lately but that RX7 just blew my eyes out Pimp.  The detail and\r\n             innovation was a winner from the beggining!  Very, Very Nice!\r\n             Congratulations!  :rockon: \r\n\r\n[b:28a66deaf2]SuperFly[/b:28a66deaf2] - Your entry in this competion is by far a Classic.  The color you\r\n                chose is one of my favorite Porsche colors ever (1976).  Your                 attention \r\nto detail and skilz just improves with every mod you                 create!\r\n                Congratulations!  ;-) \r\n\r\nNow in the spirit of the competion, the 1st &amp; 2nd place prizes were upgraded\r\n so it\'s only fair that the 3rd place prize be upgraded also.\r\n3rd place will also include a [b:28a66deaf2]Perfection 3.0 Motor &amp; Light Kit[/b:28a66deaf2].   8-) \r\n\r\nAgain thanx to all that entered.  You guys are what competion is all about, seeing \r\nthe improvements in your entries makes hangin\' out in PimpCity worth the risk  :blazin:');
