INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35342, 'd0c90737e8', '', '[quote:d0c90737e8="hue35"][quote:d0c90737e8="TheEvo"]2:What is that camera? That issome great pics.. Well.. I gotta get some that camera too..[/quote:d0c90737e8]\r\n\r\nIt\'s not about the camera as much as it\'s about the guy behind it. Miva definitely knows how to use a camera. I\'m sure he\'s using a nice camera, but his pics look great because he knows how to set up a shot.[/quote:d0c90737e8]True dat.\r\n\r\nIf you ask me, it\'s all about the lighting. Digital cameras are really sensitive to lighting...and I\'m afraid that\'s why I can\'t take good pics. :? \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYou guys mentioned dthe material of the chassis, I notice that too, and wondered if it is a composite. I doubt there\'s metal in there. Most hobby level RCs use fiberglass or similar fiberous material, to reinforce the plastic. The expensive ones use graphite. Considering the price of a bit, I doubt it\'s graphite...I\'m still wondering if it is even a composite.\r\n\r\nGreat review BTW, miva.');
