INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35350, '454ec44593', '', 'Hi!\r\n\r\n@DarkTari - How could you resist not to open?!  :shock: \r\n\r\n@Hue35 - I work in Sales and studied Economy and Marketing. I\'m just using pictures to make up for black holes in my english  :) \r\n\r\n@TheEvo - Camera is Olympus 5050Z\r\n\r\nTaking good pictures is difficult in our mini hobby. Closeups, difficult light conditions makes cars on photos worse than in reality. \r\n\r\nAs crazydave said: "it\'s all about the lighting", so first advice; use one type of light (same or close temperature). I took Ferrari pictures wit 3 types of lihgt and couldn\'t set white balance properly. This picture was taken using Logitech Quick Cam and table lamp - colors are more natural.\r\n\r\n[img:454ec44593]http://www.gdynia.mm.pl/~miva//mrc/Ferrari/Logitech.jpg[/img:454ec44593]\r\n\r\nAfter taking a photo you can improve it on the computer. For example clean up the noise :)\r\n\r\nAs as example i used Hiroto34 image, i hope it wont be angry at me :)\r\n\r\nBefore\r\n[img:454ec44593]http://www.gdynia.mm.pl/~miva//mrc/Ferrari/Noise1.jpg[/img:454ec44593]\r\n\r\nAfter\r\n[img:454ec44593]http://www.gdynia.mm.pl/~miva//mrc/Ferrari/Noise2.jpg[/img:454ec44593]\r\n\r\nFor cleaning pictures i use NeatImage, free version which you can download here: [url]http://www.neatimage.com/download.html[/url]\r\nResult above isn\'t perfect because you have to set up software with your camera.\r\n\r\nI wish all of us only good pictures :)\r\nMiva');
