INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35397, 'c703e9108e', '', 'Not sure why I haven\'t seen this thread yet. Nice track! I would completely stop worrying about losing the more complex layout if your goal truly was function over form. Honestly, some of the best racing you can have with bits is on an open oval. The more simple the track layout, the more the racing is about finding the best line, and making the other guy crash. \r\n\r\nWe\'ve tried more complex layouts, but you end up not spending very much time racing side-by-side, but a lot of time getting yourself out of crashes and just trying to get around the track. That can be fun for time trials to see who can do the fastest lap, but the real fun is neck-and-neck, NASCAR style rubbing.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35398, '51090394a8', '', 'OK ummmmm WOW!  That is one impressive review, start to finish.  I doubt you would find a more comlete review on that set from a marketing meeting. :bowdown: \r\n\r\nNow the only problem is you have set the bar very very high.  First w/ your bad ass mod and now this review.  If I could be so bold to ask, would it be possible for you to make a guide to the process of one of your next mods?  Cabo, you gotta get this boy Hustlin\' for the Pimps how to page mang.');
