INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35400, '87d79e973d', '', '[quote:87d79e973d="ph2t"]I also ordered the R-Spec II Motor , anyone have any comments on this motor?[/quote:87d79e973d]\r\n\r\nI haven\'t been too impressed with the R-Spec II. My first motor was a dud but tiny replaced it right away. The second motor seemed to work as it should... I agree with crazydave\'s review. The one thing that keeps it out of my cars is that it doesn\'t coast. When you let off the accelerator, it brakes hard and usually spins out. I like a motor that will coast... tiny\'s Formula 34 motor is, by far, the best coaster I have. The Perfection motors are also decent coasters.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35401, '0053dbb5aa', 'Re: Xmods FAQ (Updated January 6th)', '[quote:0053dbb5aa="cj"][b:0053dbb5aa]CJ\'s Xmods FAQ[/b:0053dbb5aa] .\r\n\r\n12414314 - JOINT CUP CENTER SHAFT $2.49   \r\n12414322 - JOINT CUP CENTER LEFT $2.49   \r\n\r\nFor RSU you must also add shipping.  Under $9.99 add $2.50.\r\nYou can order parts by visiting the store or calling the Shack at 1-800-THE-SHACk.\r\n[/quote:0053dbb5aa]\r\n\r\n\r\njust an FYI to all of you guys: The "Joint Cup Center Left, item #12414322, is the one that makes up most of the rear axel... the one with the thicker metal piece. I ordered one thinking it was the smaller of the two, but it wasn\'t... also, when I got it(today), it came broken! I\'m not sure what exactly I should do.... could you help me CJ?? Here are the pics ([b:0053dbb5aa]*note: I never have even taken this piece out!*[/b:0053dbb5aa]):\r\n\r\n[img:0053dbb5aa]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0ZwDqAnoiemVGTpiXKOU*CW8qEIVRQZpXpyREQdU0Am25afA0na5caZFhi2v89U0JqvkXgiA1NFVeOOfS6bcAsOF!rguQLPzyktMBCvpPWbv1APckAqZJUYDCNB5usw5f1K3bIcNm9GvUkSBIhEGSgw/broken_ordered_joint_cup_1.jpg?dc=4675455016645180482[/img:0053dbb5aa]\r\n[img:0053dbb5aa]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0ZwDcAnsixmVGTpiXKOU*CW8qEIVRQZpXpyREQdU0Am1E*TvRPjhpAlf2rqDZDe7JTI29N2!7kOg14GgrMEmSaG5V16WfWxjbEvJyL!hzyEkX1FPldFshlD6QfaI5VUmpHRe*lNpAJi4Rye5EMONzOQ/broken_ordered_joint_cup_2.jpg?dc=4675455016714397857[/img:0053dbb5aa]\r\n[img:0053dbb5aa]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0ZwDYAnwiEmZGTpiXKOU*CW8qEIVRQZpXpyREQdU0Am1weGpNGuoUKlp5y81HxbwLdrnbgTzxsT8qxbxRi6K3xoFUG9HWu*ATCSR1dSUxcXhF0EGc6a*oPuFgsBHVnocQXMPYpE!QyA9CV0OW48hClA/broken_ordered_joint_cup_3.jpg?dc=4675455016785212323[/img:0053dbb5aa]\r\n\r\nand another FYI: my order came to like $19.92 total(I got other stuff... new frequency crystals for my skyline, and a new supra body. the supra body won\'t be here for a few more weeks, the guy said), and that includes shipping, which was $3.50\r\n\r\n\r\n**EDIT**  If it makes any difference, here\'s a scan of my receipt(with obviously blocked out address)\r\n\r\n[img:0053dbb5aa]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0WAADA0AcUBIBJzvl1XLkGKqqKg1atVJOT76dMgSDhu5kmXsQQ2iRroG!SxoWKhcCMpCVnRLhxbzzud5dkNt3zhR6f6syEINOjCVsAjrlasuBpj0ugO3Iz!R5T*RfYseXMgAAAP****8/RSU_receipt.jpg?dc=4675455018544282990[/img:0053dbb5aa]');
