INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35432, '0ede77b31a', 'FET kit!', 'Check this out!  http://www.micro-rc.ch/catalog/catalog/product_info.php/products_id/244?osCsid=783efe874d35bd224ca2a7182c2764fc  It\'s a do-it-yourself FET kit!\r\n\r\nThis is what the site says: MOSFET Self change kit (engine + steering element) CHF8.90 If you click on the picture for a larger illustration who the change to rather accomplish would like, the necessary material can order here. SMD Loeterfahrung, as well as a SMD suited soldering iron absolutely necessarily! For Tomy (Bitchar g) and LXX. Other models on request! The set contains: - 4 MOSFETs for the engine change - 2 MOSFETs for the steering element change - 10cm wire (there is necessarily two bridges) - fitting instruction detailed Of course the MOSFETs is supplied not openly, but in a ESD Schutzverpackung. Dispatch info. During a single order (no other articles) the set is dispatched in A-post office a Couvert. The dispatch and packing costs amount to in this case together only 1 Franconia. Unfortunately that cannot be realized shoptechnisch, therefore you the full dispatch and packing costs are computed. Please they take the surplus amount off from the transfer. During a cash on delivery order the amount is corrected by us. For 1 Franconia surcharge can as option still another additional MOSFET (when replacement, if during soldering somewhat should go wrong) are to it-ordered.  That\'s what babelfish says.   :cool:');
