INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35540, 'dd7c99c5f9', '', 'Here\'s what I got...\r\n\r\n[img:dd7c99c5f9]http://picserver.student.utwente.nl/view_image.php/UY271AZVA4[/img:dd7c99c5f9]\r\n[img:dd7c99c5f9]http://picserver.student.utwente.nl/view_image.php/CG885J7R2S[/img:dd7c99c5f9]\r\n[img:dd7c99c5f9]http://picserver.student.utwente.nl/view_image.php/0XI84HJ41D[/img:dd7c99c5f9]\r\n[img:dd7c99c5f9]http://picserver.student.utwente.nl/view_image.php/LG6EDEW659[/img:dd7c99c5f9]\r\n\r\nI forgot to take a pic of the extra body they threw in, it\'s a white legacy body, like the blue one in the pic only white. :lol: \r\nThe reason for all the freebies was, ready for this, they didn\'t have the car I wanted. I wanted a white levin and they only had silver. SO they add all this shit to "make it up" to me. LOL\r\nThe performance of these cars is amazing. It handles super smooth and the speed is fast. The thing thats got me hooked on this car though is the size. It\'s perfect. I really can\'t play with my xmods as much as I want at home but with this I can. I\'ld recomend you spend your money on one of these instead of an xmod or mini z. If you want to go hit the tennis courts then fine get an xmods or mini z. :-)');
