INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35593, '6d6360108a', 'It\'s amazing what people will throw away', 'I\'ve got this buddy, he was doing alright as a cable guy, good pay, worked in the nice part of town, installed cable for some famous people, employee of the month, you know, not too bad, pretty decent gig.\r\n\r\nThen one day he decides he tired of taking orders, and he\'s going into business for himself, so he quits his job. His new business? Dumpster diving. Yep that\'s right, he\'s hanging with the homeless in the bottom of a dumpster. \r\n\r\nHe mostly hangs out in industrial areas, and pick out scrap metal. Clears about about 500 a week from that, sometimes more when he finds something fixable, one week he made 2 grand off some solar panels.\r\n\r\nHow does this relate to the "B" Crew? Well that\'s where this get\'s interesting. Recently he got tipped off to the ultimate dumpster score...\r\n\r\nSee there are thousands and thousands of pounds coming over the border every week. We don\'t see alot of that, cause we\'re cheap skates here, and a lot of it goes to other parts of the country that are willing to pay. So when they bring it over the border, they quickly separate it and dump off the wrapping in a dumpster somewhere. My buddy got tipped off to this, and actually made the score last week. \r\n\r\nThere was a half pound of primo bud that he picked out of the wrappings.\r\n\r\nHe\'s already on a mission for his next score.\r\n\r\nWell it just cracks me up that my tweaker friend has made a profitable business out of dumpster diving, but I thought it was even funnier he\'s finding bud in them dumpsters too, so I thought I\'d share.');
