INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35666, '482726cd22', 'Contest: moderators contest!', '&lt;Don Pardo voice&gt; CaboWabo, come on down! Dark Tari Come on down! Payaso, Crazy Dave, Hogjowlz, Noxorc and Kwikbb come on down! It\'s your turn to play.....\r\n\r\n[b:482726cd22]bitPimps Moderator\'s Throw Down[/b:482726cd22] \r\n\r\n[b:482726cd22]Entry Deadline:[/b:482726cd22]\r\nMay 1, 2004 @ 12:01 AM (PST) \r\n\r\n[b:482726cd22]Prizes:[/b:482726cd22] \r\nFor this contest, rather than pre-assign prizes to places, we will have the first place winner choose their prize first, 2nd place chooses 2nd, 3rd place chooses 3rd, etc. The winners will get to choose from:\r\n\r\n[img:482726cd22]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2102813/46074169.jpg[/img:482726cd22]\r\n\r\n[img:482726cd22]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2102813/46074141.jpg[/img:482726cd22]\r\n\r\nNew still sealed ZipZaps® SE Micro RC Starter Kit–Starsky &amp; Hutch ™ 1976 Ford® Gran Torino (batteries not included)\r\n[i:482726cd22]Donated by CJ tha Shack ZipPimp[/i:482726cd22]\r\n\r\n\r\n[img:482726cd22]http://www.grymttr.com/carpix/pimpsprize1.jpg[/img:482726cd22]\r\n\r\n[img:482726cd22]http://www.grymttr.com/carpix/pimpsprize2.jpg[/img:482726cd22]\r\n\r\nlxx chassis with full suspension conversion, \r\ncustom offroad lego wheelset with 12:1 gears, \r\nmodded red hummer shell with stikfas decals \r\nstock lxx single speed 27mhz tx/rx, \r\ndual 150 mah nicad, \r\nreinforced heatsink clip, \r\nperfection heatsink with shock mount, \r\nperfection 2.2. \r\n[i:482726cd22]Donated by betty.k[/i:482726cd22]\r\n\r\n\r\n[img:482726cd22]http://www.grymttr.com/carpix/prize2.jpg[/img:482726cd22]\r\n\r\n[img:482726cd22]http://www.grymttr.com/carpix/prize1.jpg[/img:482726cd22]\r\n\r\nTab-lowered Shen chassis \r\nQFM spring suspension \r\nLXX black wheels \r\nmosfetted Thunder Charger PCB \r\nMystery white endcap 3.8 motor \r\ncustom painted and decaled Microsizer Supra body with precision-ground rear wheel wells \r\ncustom painted Microsizer TX (49mhz) with complimentary orange LXX buttons and charging pad cover \r\n[i:482726cd22]Donated by SuperFly[/i:482726cd22]\r\n\r\n\r\n[img:482726cd22]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/prvw1.jpg[/img:482726cd22]\r\n\r\n[img:482726cd22]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/prvw4.jpg[/img:482726cd22]\r\n\r\nSo far... \r\n- Aluminum-tubing stretched Thunder Charger chassis \r\n- tab-lowered \r\n- shaved TC rear tires, so they tuck up into the rear fenders \r\n- shaved inside of body to make room for rear tires and steering \r\n\r\nTo come... \r\n- custom paint (somethin\' authentic) \r\n- mosfets \r\n- custom pcb cover \r\n- custom painted controller (TC controller... they\'re ugly, but they have killer range. I\'ll make it look better) \r\n- kick-ass mystery 3.8 (SuperFly and I got a sack of these 3.8s that kick ass with mosfets and stock gears... great combo)\r\n[i:482726cd22]Donated by hue35[/i:482726cd22]\r\n\r\n\r\n[img:482726cd22]http://picserv.beyond-reality.nl/img.php/9ICDW92416/U1F1U263U24/JPEG/1078257047//5trf[/img:482726cd22]\r\n\r\nCustom commemorative wallpaper / poster \r\n[i:482726cd22]Donated by Sessiz[/i:482726cd22]\r\n\r\n\r\nph2t also has something up his sleeve, so watch this space for further additions and updates.\r\n\r\n[b:482726cd22]Rules:[/b:482726cd22]\r\n- Micro R/C\'s only (bit char-g, microsizers, zipzaps/se\'s, clones) \r\n- No previous bitPimp contest winning car can enter \r\n- 3 entries allowed per user. \r\n- Must have your username and "bitPimps" on a piece of paper on 1 picture of your entry.\r\n- You can post as many photos of your entry as you feel necessary. \r\n- Only bitPimps moderators may enter\r\n\r\n[b:482726cd22]Judging Criteria:[/b:482726cd22] (in no specific order) \r\n- Originality - Show us something we haven\'t seen before (in a general sense, doesn\'t mean a car you did 2 months ago isn\'t a good entry).\r\n- Paint job \r\n- Presentation - You don\'t need to go buy a new camera, but make it look as good as possible.\r\n- Functionality - It\'s gotta be able to drive and turn\r\n- As always, Pimp-tude\r\n\r\n\r\nhere\'s the link to vote!\r\nhttp://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=2238');
