INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35858, '63a4878efa', '', '[quote:63a4878efa="Finks"]ROFL.... oh golly gee, this will be fun...... :fool:[/quote:63a4878efa]LMAO...Yeah, seems kinda silly just to try to jack up the numbers like that.\r\n\r\n...but I do think it would be kind of cool if there was a time when we could all get together at the same time...kind of a BitPimps party so to speak.\r\n\r\nAt my wife\'s forum they do crop circles, where they all work on their projects to gether, and show off what they\'re doing as they work. Maybe we could have a little mod party like that. You know, set aside a project, and we can post and mod, and mod and post...then again they are all women over at my wife\'s forum...maybe this is kinda gay. :???:  :lol:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35860, 'ea5b19eb73', '', 'What\'s the supercharger do in an electric car? Cool the motor?\r\nActuator steering is often more powerful and/or reliable than their motorized (servo-based) cousins. With a proportional actuator driver, you can get far better performance for your money.\r\nAlternately-get a Micro Joule flight pack (made by cirrus), it comes with a 2.1 gram servo, a 3 gram reciver, and a 1.5 gram ESC. That\'ll give you proportional controls, ad it\'ll run happily with 4 cells.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48941, '2a088508a5', '', 'Dude have you seen the previews for i Robot?  That thing is gonna kill you in your sleep and then Will Smith will have to fight em all.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35861, '5aebb3db7c', '', 'Are the iracers any good? We mac nuts are attracted to anything "i". \r\nPropo steering is neat, but IR is notoriously glitchy and finnecky.\r\nAs a side note....does anyone have the 90$ necessary for a good micro FM rx with proportional actuator driving? Get one of those with a Hitec Flash 4 SX, and you\'ll have quite the ride. Best of all, the ESC in a RFFS-100 can handle up to an amp@4.8 volts, so you could have a helluva bitcharger.\r\nI want to get a small chassis and biuld one of these with my GWS gear...showing all those Z-racers shnooks who only get premade stuff and would\'nt solder an FET for their lives what real elbow grease can do would be a hoot. What would be even greater than that? Simple-a 4-cell FET\'ed ZZSE with a 4.0 motor and corrected steering. C\'mon, you have to admit that being able to beat a car 4x as big would be gobs of fun.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35862, 'eacdd3b4b2', '', 'Give me one of them things an I\'ll write up a review! \r\nI can\'t afford too much though. Then again....putting one of the diff\'s on a Fetted ZZSE with a Li-Ion cell would be great. I have to admit that having a 2.5" long car that  can out-run and out-turn a car four times the size would be GREAT.');
