INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35899, 'a73cbf0287', '', 'Seems like those Serpent 710\'s are about the best kit.   Too damn expensive over here, with no support for parts.  A dude out there crashed his TC3, and broke the rear shock tower.   Walked inside to the HS, bought a new one, installed it and caught his next heat.   That pretty much sold me on parts availability.  \r\n\r\nSeems like most guys are running the Associated TC3\'s here.   Replacement AND Performance parts are on the shelves.    If your gonna race competitively with a group though, then your talking aluminum, titanium, graphite, and other top end stuff.    Associated makes a RTR TC3, but I don\'t think it would hold a candle to the action I saw out there Sunday.   (the pull-starts add weight and higher CoG).\r\n\r\nI used to run electric on-road oval, and got pretty good at it.    I had the car so light, I had to add lead to the chassis to make the required weight-in.    I don\'t think these guys out here are weighing \'em.     8-) \r\n\r\n Let me know which kit you\'re considering.');
