INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35938, 'adad157a41', '', 'As soon as I can remember where I put the stupid thing, I intend top Lithiumize my ZZSE. The Li-Ion I would like to use is a shade heavy, though, so if someone knew of where I can get VERY small cylindrical Li-Ion batteries, that would be great. Of course,  a set of 2 210 mah E-tecs in paralell (each provides 3.7 volts) would work even better, but chances are we will be unable to afford the darn things.\r\n    I also have half a mind to get the MicroAmps mod and see what he did to my ZipZap. That way, we can all imitate it, and save lots of money on the shipping to austrailia. Yes, it\'s a dirty trick, but I can\'t afford 20.00 per car! :-?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (35939, 'b08298c8ee', '', '[quote:b08298c8ee="HirotoR34"]But then there\'s my daughter to consider.\r\n[/quote:b08298c8ee]\r\n:shock:\r\n&lt;coughPylegemy&lt;cough&gt; \r\nI\'m no Pimp, I\'m an honest-to-the-noexistent-being nerd. I start studying my testis off a WEEK before my tests, I work really hard, and I can weasel my way into a teachers electronic gradebook if I really had to.\r\nThat aside....Bits 150%. Unless I want to miss college (and maybe grad school) due to having to maintain a family, I still have at least 5-6 years \'till I get married (or, at this rate, get a date). Besides-the trick is to find a gal that has a good personality over smashing looks. What I mean by this is that she is: \r\nA.funny\r\nB.interesting to talk with\r\nC.Loves R/C cars/boats/planes.');
