INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36023, '41e9f4f51a', '', '[quote:41e9f4f51a="G Racerz"]@Betty.K    What do you mean buy poorly assembled and a little tinkering? :???:[/quote:41e9f4f51a]\r\n\r\nThings I had to do to my convertable beetle: \r\nreset the steering magnet\r\nthe rag top needed to be trimmed so it wouldn\'t mash down on the gears\r\na rear tire was put on the rim crooked, and now it is stretched out and doesn\'t sit properly\r\nwhen the controller was put together, one of the turbo button\'s wires got pinched between the controller halves and was stripped down to the metal.\r\nthe paint on one of the bodies is chipping off, and I haven\'t even put it on a chassis yet!\r\n\r\nAll stuff that can be repaired. The quality of the piece is enough that I can overlook the assembly problems. But, after working with perfection and motorworks for a few weeks, I was amazed when I got the MSs out again and noticed how good the Tomy cars really are.');
