INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36044, '65f756713a', '', 'knew this was happening with ph2t\'s first post about a "ausmicro vs bitpimps" contest post.\r\n\r\nI know exactly what this stems from.\r\nHe\'s upset about my post asking what the fuck these aussies think they\'re doing charging kids 65.00 for a modification and not sharing information.\r\nhe took offense to it - I explained it wasn\'t meant for him specifically, but 2 other people specifically instead - and he\'s still upset - so fuck him.\r\n\r\nhere\'s what I see.\r\nph2t\'s mad.\r\nhe\'s told betty and probably microSlut too.\r\nthey came up with an idea to just go ahead and see who\'s who.\r\nwell I can tell you this.\r\ndon\'t kid yourselves, that\'s all this about...\r\nhow do I know?\r\n\r\nsimple, because what has been proposed in a contest just like always, the only difference is it is now a "team of 3" contest.\r\nso 3 people can work on the same car.\r\nnovel idea, but not that novel - afterall, we\'ve discussed this almost 6 months ago and actually somewhat did it with the contest prizes this time around.\r\n\r\nSo for him to position it as an "ausmicro vs bitpimps" thing - it shows without a doubt, he has some issue inside to prove to himself.\r\neven the moderators at ausmicro (which ph2t is not one of) kind of shot his idea out of the water explaining that they don\'t want any friction between the 2 sites (smart move for both sites).\r\n\r\non one hand, I just wanna blow this thing off and let him be pissed until he lets it blow over.\r\n\r\non the other hand - I\'m completely sick of this type shit and I\'d like to go ahead and show the rest of the world that we rule shit - period - they don\'t and we do.\r\n\r\nI don\'t give 2 fucks if he\'s done a mosfet mod because every single body/painting mod I\'ve seen come from australia looks like it was done by a fucking retarded aboriginal nutbar with mud and a stick as their only modding tools. putty mods from them look like sculpted turds. paint looks like fucking dry erase markers....\r\nI could go on forever.\r\n\r\nI\'m about ready to just hammer in the last nail on the coffin and let them know just exactly where they do stand in the micro r/c world... the very bottom.\r\n\r\nand to suggest to host the contest there?\r\nfine - as long as they are the ones running the contest.\r\nbut even at that, their site is up for like 2 out of 24 hours.\r\neverytime I go there it\'s slower than old people driving and gives me a nice huge fucking banner ad image that doesn\'t even show up... so to see the first thing on the page - you gotta scroll for a 1/2 mile.\r\n\r\nget your fucking shit together and maybe one day we\'ll talk....\r\n\r\n*end pissy (I\'m raggin) rant*');
