INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36096, 'd71a5474d6', '', 'Well, my car is toast....for now, anyway. It will probbably go into something someday. The Rx is fine, but it fell apart. It was\'nt their fault...I tripped and melted through everything. \r\nI got a second ZZSE, and performed the steering mod. It works great, has better battery life after the mod, and I love it to death. I think I will get a FETmod soon, though. It\'s a little slow.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36097, '3c7ce9ab25', '', '[quote:3c7ce9ab25="ph2t"]Here\'s hoping that they went to appreciative owners..[/quote:3c7ce9ab25]It saddens me to say they didn\'t. \r\n\r\nSold the Stampede to a teemager at work. He complained to me about the durabilty, because it didn\'t survive a header with a Tonka truck. (One of the big steel ones)\r\n\r\nSold the Camaro as a rolling chassis w/ motor on ebay, the buyer emailed me after he paid, asking what he bought. He didn\'t even realize he just paid over 100 bucks for an RC car. I don\'t know what was up with that, but he left me no feedback.\r\n\r\nThe Losi i also sold on ebay, with all my batteries radios, charger, etc. etc. The guy complained becaue one of the cheapy 10 dollar sport batteries didn\'t work. I told him, Sorry, but sometimes that happens when the batteries sit, I\'ll refund you 5 dollars,because that\'s about what\'s worth. He gave me hell in return, so I told him, look you got almost a 1000 dollars worth of stuff for 350. You got 5 other batteries that ranged from 60-90 bucks a piece, whay are you giving me grief over a 10 dolla battery. I got no reply after that, and no feedback either. I really thought I was gonna get negative feedback, after I he just got a freakin\' deal and a half.\r\n\r\nSo no one appreciated them at all, those bastards. :mad:');
