INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36103, '9438352add', '', 'You know, I couldn\'t agree with you more.\r\n\r\nThat\'s exactly the impression I got from the contest idea, as you probably guessed from my post\r\n\r\nYou know you mention their paintjobs looking retarded, well that\'s exactly why I don\'t post there anymore. Those mother fuckers pissed me off, when that old blowhard oldtamiyaphile tried to insinuate I was using inferior paint, the when one of the mods Panda something took his side, and tried to further make me look bad, that when i got completely and totally fed up with them.\r\n\r\nEverywhere else my painting advice is appreciated, then at the place where their car look like a pile of shit, they want to debate with me. Ok whatever. :roll:\r\n\r\nI\'m really extra pissed about he whole micro_amps/SE issue, because he figured that out in less than 48 hours after he got the car, I really think some info I gave him helped give him a head start, no he won\'t share his info in return... Well fuck him that piece of shit.\r\n\r\nYou know what really really, really pisses me off, people are refering to him as the inventer of the FET mod, because he\'s made himself famous for it, but he stold it from the Germans. He\'s profiting off someone elses ideas. He probably doesn\'t have an original bone in his body.\r\n\r\nAlso when I started talking about FETs on TRC, I felt like he was trying to call me out, and make me look the fool. Then I fould out from ph2t that he wanted to post a FET tutorial, but micro_amps asked him not to. Then on top of it, ph2t sent me a copy of an email that micro_amps, sent him, and at the end, he was talking shit about me, and how I\'m too stupid to figure out the SE mod. Well fuck you micro_amps, I\'m not fucking stupid, I just don\'t happen to have the education you do, and what i do know I figured out all by myself.\r\n\r\nSee apparently micro_amps was coming after me for putting out his "secret" info. Well fuck you micro-amps, fuck you, fuck you, fuck you.\r\n\r\nDamn that felt good.\r\n\r\nYou want to rant about Ausmicro, come one let\'s go, I\'m just getting started.\r\n\r\nBTW, I\'m still cool with ph2t, cause he is the pimp that turned me on to what people are saying about me. I definately appreciate that.');
