INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36106, '7124082982', '', 'I have half a mind to create a BitCharger and ZZ racing club at my school. I\'m actually creating the specs for the cars as we speak:\r\nSizes accepted:\r\nLength:\r\n3"\r\nWidth (max) \r\n1.5"\r\nHeight(max) \r\n.75"\r\nWeight(max)\r\n45 grams\r\nStock:\r\nStandard EVERYTHING.\r\nNo motors above 2.2\r\nAvailable mods:\r\nZZSE steering fix\r\nReplacement motor (if over 2.2)\r\nNew tires \r\nThis is the category for someone who bought a car, and wants to drive it. \r\n\r\nSure, the Superfections will have a bit of and advantage, but they\'re all good.\r\n\r\nmodded:\r\nAvailable modss:\r\nMotor upgrades\r\nGearing upgrades \r\nTire upgrades\r\nBattery upgrades-but no voltage increases!\r\n\r\nThis is the category for people who like racing, but are not up to messing with their car\'s innards. \r\n\r\nFreestyle:\r\nANYTHING GOES!\r\n\r\nSo long as it meets the requirements, you can drive it. This is the category for people with lithiums jucing their motors and MOSFET\'s up the wazoo! Go wild! Go nuts! Burn rubber! \r\nOf course ,this is the most expensive category, but we nerds pick up enough dough fixing the pimps\' dell boxes to pay for \'em. Pimps....they have sources. \r\n[/code]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36113, 'c325692102', '', 'it looks like a new chassis design, sounds expensive though. Not only is it hotwheels, which are ussualy a pricey name brand item. it takes a stone age 9V and 4 AAs, you might pay more for the batteries  :?  looks like everybodys hoppin on the micro r/c bandwagon. Kinda makes you miss the old days when there was BitChar-G, and no one new about em except the little underground cult. man what was that 4 or 5 years ago? the good old days  :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36114, '7b49b89453', '', 'looks like sumthin i wouldnt be afraid to jump off things with. like when i used to beat the piss out of my tyco R/Cs lol. i think ill get a 1/10 offroader before i pick that up. for offroad you really want somethin thats gonna move.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36115, '91fc1eb8f6', '', 'when i went to buy my Xmod i saw the ZZ and ZZSE`s, my little cuzin owns alot of bits and he saw the SE`s and he liked the bodies, he asked me to buy him one, but then i went 2 stores over and got him a 5 dollar precious clone lol. are they really worth that much? i havent paid that since my first few real JDM bits.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36116, '6480512b26', '2 bucks for Underglow neons on your Xmod. (sorta)', 'this is really funny, but it works non the less.\r\n\r\ni went to the local mini grocery store we have in town for somthing i cant remember, but i went to the quater machines and they had little 2.5" thin glow sticks. i bought 4 of them for 25 cents each and removable adhesive stripped them to the body, they fit great and look awesome. they last about 2 days after you crack em. its a cheap way to get the look... like if your just going to a race or showing off your car  :cool: . what do you think?');
