INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36167, 'e9e990c126', '', '[quote:e9e990c126="TMP"]hmm.... how many ticks does the propo steering have? is it like 7? you know like really left, some left, little left then center. or is it really wide? or is that not even how proportional works  :? .   :-?  so confused, maybe ill pick one up. i looove the bodies  :grin:[/quote:e9e990c126]\r\n\r\n\r\nMy SE has 4 steps in left/right, and 4 or 5 steps in forward/reverse...  \r\n\r\nPick some up... \r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36168, '870a0d9d5e', '', 'last time i was in msisouri (scott city and cape giradeau) about 2hrs away from the STL for the 4th to visit relatives\r\n\r\nwe went to boomtown and got like $150 worth of fire works and we went to ma grandmas and my bros roman canlde back fired on him and i shot my cuz in the @$$ wit my roman candle then we blew up the cardboard chicken and tanks we got well my aunt wants to be a funny @$$ and starts firein romancanles at us amout 35ft away so im runin and she \r\nfirein the thing right be hind my feet so my cousin takes a bottle rocket holds the end and fires the thing at my grandma my ma and his ma and it scares the sh!T out of there drunk @$$e$ cuz the d@mn thing lands near the rest ofall of the $150 worth of fire works we had(right in front of them) and my bros were like oh no but  my cuz and me are all like OH SH!T but nothin happened dat would have been some funny sh!t  my grandma my ma and my aunt scared as sh!t surronded in half of $150 dollars worth of fire works screamin there fucin heads off');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36169, 'f81efa5b77', '', 'That\'s what I figured, for the body.  DSs have an Acura kind of fog like set up as well, and will need to bubble up the S2000 front end but that aint no thang.  Oh and as for\r\n[quote:f81efa5b77]That was my thought also. It has the long nose and the stubby rear. Then paint it that ugly Del Sol green color and you will be set.[/quote:f81efa5b77]\r\nYeah well never really liked that green (mine was Red) but you gotta admit, it\'s an origional friggin car color and was a bold move by Honda. :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36170, '5a2942a3fe', '', 'The controller does look identical To the Micro Speed cars from BigLots, but the chassis is different.\r\n\r\nI honestly don\'t remember what was different about the chassis, but I was just looking at those last week at Walmart, and I rememer that looking through the package I saw something different. I think it was a hard wired motor or something like that.\r\n\r\nThe first few Hot Wheels micro RCs I saw didn\'t impress me. One was this futuristic, space looking thing, and the other was this space age looking surfer pickup, that my kid has the die cast of, and I just didn\'t like it because they had to deform it so bad to get it to fit over a RC chassis, but then last week when I was at Walmart, they had some cool looking jacked up, off road looking pickups. I wish I grabbed one of those instead of the Motorworks I ended up with. I think I\'m going back for one, they were only 15 bucks.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36171, '9eb8731696', '', 'Actually, if you do the steering fix, and take the front end apart, and count the steps straight off the steering\'s motor, there are 7 steps, in either direction. It seems you are losing a couple steps from that steering jitter.\r\n\r\nThat may not be totally relevant, but I think it\'s interesting.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36172, 'c890046171', '', 'Well... if we are gonna bump OLD ASS threads may as well contribute w/ some date related story.  \r\n\r\nIn Holland the big Firework day is New Years.  Let me tell you, all you could ever want is legal in Holland, including fireworks.  New Years eve consisted of my wife and I being woken up by our neighbors firing around 50 some odd bottle rockets at our front window.  Then they proceeded to throw anything that poped/exploded over our fence untill I was man enough to come over through this barage to get some breakfast beer.  After that, Yaada Yaada Yaada we drink all day till 6am New Years morning roaming the neighborhood firing bottle rockets out of our hands at cars/bikes/otherpeople/houses you know, the regular stuff.  Now you may think that\'s retarded, but we were not the only ones doing this by a long shot, 10 year old kids on up to grandmas celebrate New Years just the same.  (well the 10 year old are not drinking, but the 16 year olds do...) \r\n\r\nOnly other place I have seen more beserk than this was in Tiawan for Chinese New Year, but that\'s another story all together.  Little hint tho, wear flame retardent clothing. 8-)');
