INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36222, '3328c0d8a1', 'Big Lots shizzle', 'Not sure if this is old news, but was at Big Lots last night and like posted before, they were out of thier Micro Speed mini RCs.  Not sure what this means, cuz God only knows how that store stays open it is so disorganized.  \r\n\r\nAny how, as for "the hook up".  I did find Micro Speed bodies in 2 packs for only $1.99.  One pack was a red WRX, and a white Mitsu Evo.  The other was what I thought was bad ass, a Blue pickup and a Green Jeep cherokee/H2 body who can really tell. :lol: \r\n\r\nThey also had track rails for $2.99 not sure about these, may swing by and get a couple of these to try em out.\r\n\r\nIf anyone can hook me up w/ hosting pics, I would love to post pics if anyone cares.\r\n\r\n:EDIT:  Bah found the other thread on this, ahh well..... hehe');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36223, '8659fb8eef', '', 'Dave, that sucks about getting a hosed system...Unfortunately in order to REALLY be able to fight back against the BASTARDS that put out spyware, you\'ve got to be at least somewhat proficient with dealing with system files and the registry.\r\n\r\nAs far as preventing your system from getting hit with the shit? Well unfortunately that\'s a catch-22. If you want it so that your system doesn\'t get hit with spyware, you\'d have to turn off ALL KINDS OF browser options (like active-x, cookies, ramp the security settings to super high) and in turn you\'re running a crippled browser because of it.\r\n\r\nI myself ain\'t dealing with running a crippled browser, so I use all the tools at my disposal to fight back.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36224, '34415ad2c4', '', 'alright...\r\nI\'m really starting to get pissed at these fucking dingos from down under:\r\n[quote:34415ad2c4="betty.k"][quote:34415ad2c4]Thought as Admin of ausmicro.com I\'d better get myself over to da hood and check out what\'s being said here about this idea of betty.k\'s.[/quote:34415ad2c4]\r\n\r\njust to clarify, superfly had the idea of a 3 way mod comp, then brendan brought it to my attention and then everyone\'s had a go at it! talk about the butterfly effect! (or should that be the superfly effect!! :-D )[/quote:34415ad2c4] :???: \r\na bitPimp came up with the contest and we\'re supposed to turn it over to a site that\'s damn near death to run so they can boost their forum popularity?\r\nI know what they\'re thinking. MRCC just fizzled, members are all over, some here - some there...\r\nthey\'re trying a little ploy to make it seem like they\'re stronger than they really are - making it seem like their forum is a hot spot.\r\n\r\nwell now that I know a bitPimp came up with the contest idea - I\'m not so willing to just hand it over to ausmicro.\r\n\r\n[b:34415ad2c4]edit:[/b:34415ad2c4]\r\noh yea, now I know for sure not to trust ph2t.\r\nhe\'s spewed what was in "Gangsta Trick Click" to betty.\r\nmysteriously betty has now posted some pics and tutorial on the exact item I called him out on - his offroad 65.00 suspension shit.\r\n\r\nI\'m very dis-appointed in ph2t - he has no loyality except to himself.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36229, '133453c7ca', '', '[quote:133453c7ca="betty.k"][quote:133453c7ca]Thought as Admin of ausmicro.com I\'d better get myself over to da hood and check out what\'s being said here about this idea of betty.k\'s.[/quote:133453c7ca]\r\n\r\njust to clarify, superfly had the idea of a 3 way mod comp, then brendan brought it to my attention and then everyone\'s had a go at it! talk about the butterfly effect! (or should that be the superfly effect!! :-D )[/quote:133453c7ca] :???: this might change where we need to run the contest\r\n\r\nI had no idea a bitPimp came up with contest...');
