INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36233, 'ca44804e22', '', 'March and Nov. are the cheepest times to go to Holland.  Dude, no joke, $150 ROUND TRIP.  Hence why me and my girl were married in March, was cheep to fly over my friends and family.  Check out Iceland Air if flying from East coast.\r\n\r\nOh and as for having fun, yeah Dave Atell would represent it well.   IF you can\'t have an amazing time there, then you sure as hell aint no Pimp. :cool:   Although Holland is like New York State.  All of Holland isn\'t as nuts as Amsterdamn same and NY state to NY City.  But that\'s so you can have debauchery (sp?) and great culture.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36234, '35a51cfbfb', '', 'Those are some sweet cars dood.... I don\'t think I could give up my 1/10 cars/trucks (most of them were gifts)\r\n\r\n\r\nI actually went to the local track last night to get my race on, but missed registration by 5 min.... (story of my life)\r\n\r\nSo I sat, and watched everybody else race.. :( \r\n\r\nNext time I\'ll be early so I can get my shit together fast.   Speaking of 50+ mph on an electric, click the link, and have a look at the 1/24 scale car that does 56.... Insane.\r\n\r\nhttp://yourmicro.com/micro_movies.html\r\n\r\n\r\nThe second link is the track up the street from my house...  (offroad)\r\n\r\nhttp://minnregrcc.com/track%20info.htm\r\n\r\n\r\nDave, you could be getting some serious cash on ebay for some custom painted 1/10 bodies..\r\n\r\nDo a search for custom T-Maxx bodies.. Some are going for more than a hundred...  You can paint as good as  them if not better.. IMO.\r\n\r\nI could sure use one.....lol\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
