INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36241, '950aae55be', 'No more MS at Target? Future of MS?', 'A couple of threads have mentioned MS getting the boot from Target, and I wanted to voice a couple of more thoughts. \r\n\r\nI have been watching this site for months and months...\r\n\r\n[url]http://tabletopracers.com/microsizers-pro-series.html[/url]\r\n\r\nThey had release dates for the new line of MS Pros for a few months. Changed it twice now(original release of Nov I think...). Every time I email them, they are a bit aloof of what is going on and I don\'t have enough guts to push for a straight answer. \r\n\r\nNow Target is not stocking MS anymore. Last time I checked Toys R Us, they had one row of MS on a shelf, and many many clones strewn throughout different displays in the store. \r\n\r\nAnother thing that concerns me is that Tomy isn\'t putting the turbo buttons to use on their newer controllers. It seems that there is questionable judgement there also, or there is something going on business-wise that we don\'t know about.\r\n\r\nI\'m worried about the future of Tomy/MS... I just got into this hobby a few months ago, and I don\'t want to see the best stuff already out of production.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36242, 'a4447e42bd', '', 'The only thing good with palm runners is the bodies. Those can be used for the mini zs. Other than that the palm runners suck. If youre looking at toyeast check out the Lxx Mini z and Id get one of these instead of the palm runners.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36243, '90167fe523', '', 'these started out as a christmas gift.... for my 4 year old daughter... "something to play with with daddy"  well daddy really didnt want to play barbies etc... got her 2 ms pro... those set all this off for me. its now almost a month later and on top of "her" cars i got the tomy skyline set, a zipzap se, and about 6 clones and she barely touches any of them... now onto wifey... she understands that i need something male oriented in the sea of estrogen which is our home (its me, her, our 4 year old and 19 month old girls) so daddy needs man stuff around here... she gets annoyed when theres too many race nights and she seemed peeved when i showed up after work the other night with the superslick... but shes cool, we talk alot, and support each others obsessive compulsive tendencies, and she knows that this is all in fun, and her and the girls come first. if you have a strong relationship, all the other stuff just seems to take care of itself.');
