INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36273, 'c454d440b2', '', '[quote:c454d440b2="DarkTari"]Just gotta be careful what\'s said!  He did show Cavey what micro_amps said about him, works both ways  :???:[/quote:c454d440b2]That is a good point. ph2t is a cool guy, and if things are being said about his friends he feel obligated to tell them, apparently. I can understand that, but I also understand that sometimes people don\'t always get along, and sometimes people need to vent, just to get it off their chest, but they don\'t intend to create any further friction. \r\n\r\nSo this actually create an intersting moral dilema. Is ph2t someone you can trust, or is he an instigator? I personally believe that while his actions may instigate certain events, it is not intentional on his behalf. Also we don\'t know what exactly he told betty.k, for all we know he just said, "hey betty, people want a tutorial on your mod", and betty said, "Really I can\'t believe thay actaully like me." To which ph2t might have replied, "they don\'t, they just want a tut, dumbass"\r\n\r\nSee, I\'m just confusing myself, and I\'m not sure what going on here anymore. \r\n\r\nI do think the Aussies probably had the best intention with their idea of a comp between the Bitpimps and them. The idea came from brenden123. he hang out here quite a bit too, so he probably had goos intentions.\r\n\r\nThis is my bottom line of what I think is going on. I think when they judged the Ausmicro competition, they put a little too much weight behind techy stuff, like interior lights, than with looks, and they time and skill it takes to get those looks. Because none of them do anything as nice as what Dark Tari does, I don\'t think they apprecite the time and skill that goes into something like that. It seem to me that if DT had just said, "it has FETs, and a Perfection 4.2" his car would have beat mine. Stck a light in it, and you\'ve taken out ph2t, chain all his car together, and...well nevermind I\'m rambling, but here\'s the real bottom line.\r\n\r\nI talked to more than one pimp behind the scenes that were appalled by the judging. A couple people even PMed me about it. So when that suggestion about the contest came up, I instantaneously realized that this may cause some animosity amongst the pimps.\r\n\r\nI don\'t think that is their intention, I think they all are really trying to bring us together, with out realizing the animosity they\'re causing, cause up until this point we\'ve been pimps, and haven\'t said anything.\r\n\r\nI think we should continue being pimps, and stay cool about it. Just go about our plans to do some joint efforts, and play along with their plans, but only agreeing anything to anything if we can find a neutral third party judge that we both can agree on. Which will probably never happen, so thing will probably fizzle and pass anyways.\r\n\r\nThen again, those guys did just all meet up and talk in person. maybe they are talking some smak about us, may be we do need to step up and slap them around.\r\n\r\nI don\'t know, the whole thing confuses me, so I choose not to get involved, other that maybe doing some mods on a car, if I\'m asked.');
