INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36331, '5d060b3f67', '', '[quote:5d060b3f67]our hobby is falling apart we have to stop it we cant let micro rc become another passing fad we have to get big companies like target selling microsizers and other popular brands of micro rcs again we have to fight and keep the hobby alive even if its just a small network of enthusiast we have to stop people from gettin out of micros just because there bored and keep the stuff coming in every day after day mont after month and year after year \r\n\r\n\r\npeace \r\nand keep the hobby alive \r\n\r\n\r\nI think it\'s even more important to learn how to use a freakin period. [/quote:5d060b3f67]\r\n\r\nno shit.  Any how it is to be suspected that after the initial buzz of a new hobby that it will fade at leaste a bit.  As for Target stopping thier Bit inventory, I went to my target today and they had tons, (yet $15 for a sport... but they had em) Also, Toys r\' us still has a huge surplus and hell, they even made thier own.   Honestly I think you are over reacting, but it is true, the micro RC racers are fading out of the spotlight.  Then again, can anyone remember when regualr models were advertised on TV?  Yet you still see them at every hobby shop.  Main suggestion is CHILLLLLL there holms.');
