INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36361, '44a3a4c67b', 'we be toys superslicks.. a pimp\'s review', '[img:44a3a4c67b]http://hogjowlz.lixlink.com/ss.jpg[/img:44a3a4c67b]\r\n[img:44a3a4c67b]http://hogjowlz.lixlink.com/ss2.jpg[/img:44a3a4c67b]\r\n\r\n\r\nfirst of all they call them superslicks but they come with treaded tires?\r\n\r\nnot too much info out there on them. well after taking a little break from rc stuff i broke down and got one of these.\r\n\r\nlooks = well its a little bigger and a lot better detail on the body. it is more to scale than bits or zipzaps and sits pretty low already. paint is nice stock(good sprakly metallic). \r\n\r\nelectronics = dual cell + room for another 2 or 3 cells easily. non propo but the steering is motorized rack and pinion and it works very well. runtime is very very very good.\r\n\r\nmotor = torque/ stock the speed is ok. torque is way beyond any bit motor.\r\n\r\nmechanics = must be made by same manufacturer as zipzaps. very similar quality\r\n\r\ncontroller = kinda strange but it works. separate charger(3aaa) plugs into the bottom of the controller(runs on 9v). range is better than any microsizer.\r\n\r\n\r\noverall = im happy with it. plenty of room for electronic tinkering and mechanically its sound but should be easy to improve. driving is fun out of the box with plenty of power.');
