INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36367, '5386f49eb7', '', 'Sounds cool, I may pick one up. When you say "dual cell, room for another 2 or 3 cells easily" Then you\'re actually saying we can cram THREE more batts in there? Are they the same batts as the ZipZaps? And, how fast do they go out fo the box, in mph, and with the upgrades? Can you do any drifting with these things? How fast are they compared to an Epoch? \r\n\r\nSorry for all the questions, this is really good stuff!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36368, 'c38e28ca13', '', 'ya it has a pack 2.4 120mah. which means two 60mah cells. im sure with a little surgery you could easily have a quad cell. no clue on the hopups but stock it doesnt have a great top end but it has a lot of torque. it runs on carpet that a zipzap wouldnt even move on.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36369, '3e40bead16', '', 'i picked up one of these last thursday (the same pimped orange wrx as hog) and the hop up kit at the same time... the stock stuff was kinda quick, but the hop up stuff screams! im currently running the orange (19,000 rpm) motor with the green (6.28:1) gears and it peels out and accelerates to the point of making me want a bigger kitchen! the hop ups also come with 2 more sets of tires (treads and slicks) and a neat little pinion remover thingy. as far as i can tell the only thing this ride needs to be the for real sheeit is some sort of suspension cuz it is kinda bouncy when cornering. as for the tx, i love it! ive been using it to drive my other 49mhz cars (at least my motorworks "project celica") oh, by the way,hog, is that 4th "headless" screw on the board cover some type of pivot or something? i havent gotten around to messing with it yet (hands full with bits and clones) and does anyone know if micro amps is gonna be able to do anything with these?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36370, 'b4e51c8951', 'Need Your Help', 'I\'m trying to implement a new Gallery section to our site.\r\nI\'m not finished yet, but it\'s getting close.\r\nI\'d like you guys to go there and register.\r\nAfter you do, I\'ll approve and put you into a group "bitPimps".\r\nAfter that, you should get some special priviliages  :) \r\n\r\nJust to let you know, if we do choose to use this - there\'s a lot of work waiting ahead of us.\r\nSpecifically, we\'ll need to go through the forums and change image links. They\'re through-out the forums (which is what makes it hard) but there are a few areas that they are clumped in as well (such as the contest galleries).\r\nJust to give you a heads up.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you run into any problems or whatever.\r\n\r\nHere\'s the link to the gallery, please do not let anyone know about it yet.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php');
