INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36378, '81456deb6d', '', 'Ok here\'s what I got to offer:\r\n\r\nGuitar: I can mic my amp with a cheap mic, but I\'ll probably use a RP100 as a preamp. I play mostly rythym, but I can play a tiny bit of lead, mostly minor pentatonics, and modal stuff.\r\n\r\nComputer based sequencers: I\'m pretty decent at making drum and bass loops in Fruity Loops. I\'ve got thousand and thousands of samples of instruments, so I can do quite a bit with that. I also have ReBirth, but I get kinda lost when I play with that.\r\n\r\nKeyboard, complete w/ Casiotone: Yep I got\'s me a Casio. Got it because it has general midi, and it was on clearance for 99 bucks, but some of the instruments, definately have that \'casiotone\' sound about them. My keyboard playing is even more limited than my guitar playing, but you never know, it might come in handy.\r\n\r\nI still have to install and figure out that ProTools Free too. Hopefully it\'s not too hard to figure out. :lol:');
