INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36488, '2f3c5b259a', '', '[quote:2f3c5b259a="crazydave"]I uploaded a few pictures so you could check it out. I noticed after I uploaded it that it said maximum file size is around 1000k. Mine are all in the 15-20,000k range. Is that large? I thought I was making the files size pretty small for a photo.[/quote:2f3c5b259a]yea max file size per image is 1000 KB, that\'s 1MB - that\'s pretty huge for a picture.\r\n\r\nor are you talking just bytes?\r\n\r\nraw images from my digital camera at 2048 x 1536 are typically in the 1,100 - 1,500 kb range.\r\n\r\nto give you an idea, take the picture of the RC10 I put up.\r\nthe raw image is 1,177 KB (1.14 MB) @ 2048 x 1536\r\nthe optimized image is 48 KB @ 500 x 440\r\n\r\nbut I see so far you\'re only using 56 KB total from all 3 images you uploaded, so I\'d say they\'re optimized correctly.\r\n\r\n\r\nby the way, I fixed the gallery now to where your uploaded images don\'t require "admin approval", they\'ll just show up as soon as you post them.\r\n\r\nonce I can get the server cleaned up a bit more, I can give each of us more space for our images.');
