INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36508, '62397847cb', '', '[quote:62397847cb="payaso"]Both the car and truck are fandidlytastic...  you should try a shot at a beater/hooptie style..\r\n\r\nYou\'ve mastered this end of the spectrum, but I don\'t think I\'ve seen you do the classic junker.\r\n\r\nJust an opinion...  Either way, your cars turn out great.\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D[/quote:62397847cb]You know, your right I haven\'t done a beater, and that\'s really odd, because I dig beaters in real life. I\'ve got a thing for beat up rusted hunks, that will smoke ya in the quarter mile.\r\n\r\nI guess I\'m just trying to be original, and you and ripper 777 covered the beater ground pretty good. Oh yeah, and can\'t forget Hue\'s black primered masterpiece of badass-ness.\r\n\r\nBut maybe I\'ll keep that in mind now.\r\n\r\n[quote:62397847cb="TMP"]but fill us in on this movie your workin on[/quote:62397847cb]Basically I\'m going to just try to improve on the formula of the last one. Make a smoother dirt track, and hopefully I can get a buddy to help me out, so I can get some side by side racing action of the truck, and Beetle together');
