INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36522, 'c08cfa75bd', 'Muscle Tuners Wheels', 'Just came back from Wally World and picked up two Muscle Tuners, one for my son, and one for me to hack to bits.  They have some great minor details that I am gonna rip off (muffler, interior, and air foil to say the leaste)  What I was really wanting tho, was the wheels.  Has anyone sucessfully put Muscle Tuners weels onto a bit?  I am gonna try either way in a few days, first need to wait for my son to forget about em cuz at the moment he likes daddies car as well. :?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36523, '5f53df5a8a', '', '[quote:5f53df5a8a="payaso"][quote:5f53df5a8a="sessiz"][quote:5f53df5a8a="payaso"]\r\nI got one of the 1/43 Corvettes from RS for christmas, and it rocks the fuckin house.\r\n\r\nPropo steering, and throttle, and fast like a mofo.. It\'s the first car I feel like I don\'t have to mod...\r\n\r\nRS has em for $35 now... They were $50 before the holidays.\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D[/quote:5f53df5a8a]\r\n\r\nIf you like the corvette payaso you gotta look into an epoch. Basically the same thing, but with better electronics.[/quote:5f53df5a8a]\r\n\r\n\r\nYeah, I\'ve been wanting a epoch for a while now, but damn they\'re some pricey little things..\r\n\r\nI only hear great things about them.\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D[/quote:5f53df5a8a]\r\n\r\nYeah I hear ya man. The only reason I bought my epochs was the fact I got a good deal on them. Now I\'m freakin hooked, they are awesome. :-) \r\n\r\n@DT- I really can\'t make a fair comparison. I don\'t own a rs corvette or viper but I\'ve heard nothing but bad things about them. The epoch is full propo (steering and throttle), fast stock and built rugged. Hopups are slim but potential is there.');
