INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36649, '0ddbb3deaf', '', 'Yeah, but how it happened in the Movie isn\'t 100% on par with how things happen in the comic book, and Smallville don\'t take it\'s queue from either.\r\n\r\nI"m sure the writers have to keep to withink a certain guideline, but they\'re also taking some liberties too (and that\'s only right to do). \r\n\r\nWho\'d have thought Luke Duke would\'ve made such a good Pa Kent? I really don\'t see them killing him off anytime soon (I\'m sure a BIG part of the girly fanbase would be in an uproar). Then again, a part of the Sup\'s character foundation is based off of losing Pa Kent in his High School years so that\'s important too. It\'ll be interesting to see where they go with it.\r\n\r\nI kind of dig the idea that Chloe is Lois Lane, even though Lana is about 10x hotter, she\'s getting on my nerves lately and Chloe has grown on me.');
