INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36691, '175b3c2d04', '', 'previously, I set up FTP accounts for you moderators (i.e. http://cabowabo.lixlink.com, http://noxorc.lixlink.com, http://hogjowlz.lixlink.com, etc.)\r\n\r\nplease stop using this space.\r\n\r\nI would like you to start using the space provided in the "Galleries" section.\r\nYou have 5MB of space as of right now to upload images into whatever albums you create. The space will increase as I get to clean up the server - hence this post.\r\n\r\nI want to get rid of duplicate images, etc. and get rid of our "micro sites" (http://cabowabo.lixlink.com)\r\nNow with the new gallery, we have the same thing, just much more easily managable.\r\n\r\nSo, please start transferring your images.\r\n\r\nPlease also note that the new "galleries" does not allow for uploading of movie files. Only image files.\r\n\r\nSo, like in nox\'s case, if you have movies uploaded as well, let me know before you delete/replace them from your space.\r\n\r\nI will keep movies you have posted, but I just need to figure out if I need to keep your microsite directory or move your movie files into the same directory my movie files live in.\r\n\r\nhopefully that makes, sense, I know I\'m not the best at explinations.\r\nIf you have any questions or concerns, please don\'t hesistate to pipe up and ask.');
