INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41217, 'eab66bdc43', '', 'I went upto the 10th grade (still hold the record for skip days), becuase I missed so many days and blew off the finals they failed me (the bastards) so when faced with a second round of 10th grade I said fuck it and dropped out. I went to vermont to take my ged test a few months later (NY made ya wait a year where as vermont didn\'t) passed it with flying colors and finished 2 hrs ahead of the alloted time. I started college a couple of years later, quit that shit too. After seeing how many people were vying for the few jobs a fine arts degree could snag, I gave up and concentrated on a "real" job. (ie. anything that paid me) I\'ve owned my own bussiness and it ran well for a lil over 3yrs (a deli in one of the malls here) and am doing okay now as a butcher. I\'ve owned 3 homes here and still own a 3 floor home in turkey which has marble floors and stairways. (yeah bitches I said white marble) I think I\'m doing fine with out a degree and I know I can survive just about anything. :-)');
