INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36876, '9d798d229d', '', '[quote:9d798d229d="betty.k"]despite the messiness i think it looks ok. nice shine :-)[/quote:9d798d229d]\r\n\r\nThanks for the compliments betty.k. It\'s my first time, and just today I was rushing a paintjob (orange to blue fade) on a porsche for a ZipZap....it didn\'t turn out good. That\'s what happens when you try to do it all in less than 20 minutes. :-) Take this as a lesson: DO NOT RUSH A PAINT JOB!\r\n\r\nI guess, from those 2 experiences, I\'m no longer a painting virgin.  :-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (37132, 'f553c9c883', '', '[quote:f553c9c883="hogjowlz"]hmm pgh is all scenic tho. at least from my building.\r\n\r\n[img:f553c9c883]http://hogjowlz.lixlink.com/norsideonfire.jpg[/img:f553c9c883]\r\n\r\nwhere else can you get fries on any kind of sandwich/salad you order??\r\nthis city is neat to look at yet very depressing haha. plenty of neat forests tho and good bike riding.[/quote:f553c9c883]You hit the depressing part right on the head lol. And I am by no means putting down the \'burgh, I am 100% yinzer, born and raised (never been away from pgh for longer than 3 wks.), alls im saying is that arch is freakin spectacular. As for the fries and slaw on sandwiches, I\'ve never been drunk enough to find that appealing, although I highly recommend O fries... for patching potholes! By the way, is that the vista from your office or your apartment? A young professional who has\'nt left yet? You\'re some kind of anomaly(sp?) and I\'m gonna have to have the Post Gazette do a series on you if that\'s the case lol.');
