INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (36885, '47e4822f1e', '', 'ok, I think there\'s some confusion on using the new Galleries section of the site so I\'m going to try and explain here.\r\nwhat I\'d like you pimps who have a "http://username.lixlink.com" address, is to stop uploading your images to that and start uploading them to the Galleries section. Including the images you already have up there as they will be deleted once you put them in the new galleries.\r\nI\'ll try to explain below what you need to do:\r\n(PM\'s aren\'t going through to you DT for some reason)\r\n\r\n[b:47e4822f1e]Step 1[/b:47e4822f1e]\r\ngo here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php\r\n\r\nlogin with your username and password, once you do - you will see a new set of buttons just below this top set of links - the buttons are:\r\n"Create / order my albums"\r\n"Modify my albums"\r\n"My profile"\r\n\r\nSelect "Create / order my albums".\r\n\r\n[b:47e4822f1e]Step 2[/b:47e4822f1e]\r\nyou will be presented with a screen to create a new album.\r\nSelect new, once created, highlight it - rename it by typing in the textfield below.\r\nclick "Apply modifications" and then "continue".\r\n\r\n[b:47e4822f1e]Step 3[/b:47e4822f1e]\r\nonce you\'ve finished that and are back on the main gallery page - click "Upload".\r\n\r\nyou will be presented with an upload screen to upload your image into your own Album (browse your hard drive for your image). \r\nOnce you upload your image - it will be in the "bitPimps Crew Galleries" as crazydave\'s and mine are.\r\n\r\n[b:47e4822f1e]Step 4[/b:47e4822f1e]\r\nnow that the new image you just uploaded is in your gallery, right click it and choose "Properties" - this will give you the URL to the new image you just uploaded.\r\n\r\nUse that URL in place of your old image URLs.\r\nEdit your old posts in the forum and replace the old URL with the new URL.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\ndoes that make sense?');
