INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41267, '046820dd1f', '', '[quote:046820dd1f="noxorc"][quote:046820dd1f="hogjowlz"]emulators holmes. emulators[/quote:046820dd1f]\r\n\r\n\r\nI hear yea....and I should have thought about it that way..\r\n\r\nbut I was thinking about the actual hardware...the shape.. the size..\r\nthe bad raster graphics... the joystick....  The paddles....\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ve seen at walmart a hand-held joystick which contains the old set of games..\r\nit\'s like $20. ......nothing...\r\n\r\n\r\nglad and sad to hear all of you still have and play the original.\r\n\r\n-nox[/quote:046820dd1f]I saw those joysticks at Walmart, I want one.\r\n\r\nA few years ago my wife had brought the Atari 5200 over from her mom\'s house. It was cool because it played 2600 and 5200 games. I started stopping by the Salvation Army once a week, picking up games for 50 cents a piece. I had built up a collection of almost a 100 games. We had to throw that away when we moved, because it had become infested with roaches.\r\n\r\nI\'ve played the emulators, but\'s just not quite the same, you gotta have that old school joystick in order for it to seem right.');
