INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41438, '3ec592840e', '', '[quote:3ec592840e="crazydave"][quote:3ec592840e="SuperFly"]That thing lives up to it\'s creator\'s name: crazy. What gears are you running? A blue KIT racer gear might be the ticket for more top and speed and a slight reduction in torque.[/quote:3ec592840e]I\'m running the stock Thunder Charger gears, which is a 9.86:1 with a 7-tooth pinion. I haven\'t calculated the exact ratio with the 7-tooth pinion, but I was thinking maybe running a red Zip Zap gear with the 7-tooth pinion, but I am using the stock Thunder Charger motor, so I was going to experiment with motors before I go rebuilding my rear axle.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYou know guys, when I was putting the vid together, I thought, "They\'re gonna crap their pants when they see this.", but now that I\'m actually getting your reactions, it\'s cooler than I thought it would be, thanks.[/quote:3ec592840e]\r\n\r\nDo you have any KIT racer gears? If you don\'t, PM me, I\'ll mail you some. I\'d love to see what they do with that much power. The KIT racer gears are in the 4.XX:1 - 3.XX:1 range. I\'ve been running them with mosfetted cars and they\'re great.');
