INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41504, '84af60fda4', 'I LOVE smoking weed!', 'Plain and simple, just had to say it. Every morning when I leave for work, I have to resist the temptation to take a few more steps down to my basement for a little wake \'n bake; and when I get home at the end of the day, I walk straight in the back door to my bong hit station, take care of business, and THEN come in the house and say "hi" to the family. I do keep an emergency stash at my office for those days when I can\'t wait the extra 15 minutes to get home. \r\n\r\nWhen money is tight, not buying weed is NEVER an option. I\'ll disconnect the phone before that happens.\r\n\r\nI\'d have to admit, I used to carry around some guilt about the amount I smoke, as it\'s more than anyone else I know anymore. But fortunately, after becoming a member of the "B" Crew and reading about nox putting down an ounce in a week and the rest of y\'all not far behind, I feel like I ought to smoke [i:84af60fda4]more[/i:84af60fda4].\r\n\r\n :cool:');
