INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41509, '947ef30d3e', '', 'Thanx Pimps!\r\n\r\nThis started out as a gift. 1st I got a Camaro Z28 (new style) and the Euro Kit, got it home,\r\n test drove it, it sucked.  After stopping, wouldn\'t start (lemon).  So I took it back and got one of these.......\r\n[img:947ef30d3e]http://darktari.lixlink.com/Jeep.jpg[/img:947ef30d3e]\r\n\r\nThis one ran GREAT, I mean really good!\r\nThen I started to go to work on it on &amp; off the weekend.  I finished it Sunday night. I was gonna \r\ndo it in Black (he has a black SL, different year), but a lot of detail would\'ve been lost so I went on the hunt for a\r\npicture of an AMG SL55.........\r\n[img:947ef30d3e]http://darktari.lixlink.com/merc_sl_161.jpg[/img:947ef30d3e]\r\n\r\nThis is the look I was goin for........\r\n\r\nDave, the body is a ZipZap hardtop SL from the Euro Collection, but I coun\'t let it stay that way  :cool:\r\n\r\nNow...What to do with that Jeep Body  :???:');
