INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41547, 'f89efa423d', '', 'You know, I was just thinking about cutting out mornings, and maybe I\'ve been smoking too much, and all that.\r\n\r\n...but then I got a fat sack of fluffy popcorn buds. It\'s just so easy to break up like this, how can I resist. :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\nReally though, it\'s my theory that you only get one good high a day, then after that you just turn into a burn out. So it\'s kinda cool to go without in the morning when you\'re heading off to work and you\'re not enjoying yourself anyways, then it seems so much better when you finally get to it.\r\n\r\n...but then again, wake and bakes are probably one of the best highs.\r\n\r\nI don\'t, I love getting high, but I think it\'s good to have sober times to appreciate what being high feels like. I just stress to easy, and I kinda need a couple hits in the morning to take the edge off life.');
