INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41550, '37d5242e18', 'Re: decals', '[quote:37d5242e18="jmays"]hi dave were did you get the decals, i went to slot32    http://www.slot32.de/   they dont have any ho but i did find 1/43 and u could use the smaller ones on the sheet... i love your muscle car it the shit for real, were did you land the rear wheel?\r\n\r\nreally sweet car crazydave[/quote:37d5242e18]I got mine off a ebay store called Radical Decals. The ones I got are 1/64th, they also had T-Jet decals which are a slightly smaller scale.\r\n\r\nThe rear wheels are some german alloys, missing the laser etched pieces. A fellow pimp Havok hooked me up with these when he asked me to mount his other alloys. Thanks Havok. :-)');
