INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41554, 'b9ed0ede6f', '', '[quote:b9ed0ede6f="crazydave"]I love getting high, but I think it\'s good to have sober times to appreciate what being high feels like.[/quote:b9ed0ede6f]\r\n\r\nI hear ya, man... I\'ve been sober a lot lately. I\'ve had this bronchitis shit hittin\' me hard when I\'m smoking daily. And, being the puss I am, it scares me. So I decided to cut back to once a week, or every couple of weeks, until that shit goes away. The high is better after going without all week, but it\'s hard as hell to resist smoking for so many days in a row.\r\n\r\n[quote:b9ed0ede6f="SuperFly"]But fortunately, after becoming a member of the "B" Crew and reading about nox putting down an ounce in a week and the rest of y\'all not far behind, I feel like I ought to smoke more.[/quote:b9ed0ede6f]\r\n\r\nAnd that\'s exactly what got me into trouble in the first place. My weed consumption went up a bit after the invite to the "B" Crew\'s back room. I\'m hoping the better weather and major cutback will help get me back on track, because I have to agree with my homie... I love smoking weed.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41555, '437ba21f98', 'Project: &quot;The Bird Effect&quot;', 'I\'ve been working on this on and off for a while now, and lately I\'ve been a little busy with other things, so I haven\'t really had time to mess with it. I have to finish the ground effects, and figure out how I\'m doing the front end, and then it should be ready for paint. It started out as a Mitsubishi(obviously), and so far it has been convertiblized, wing holes filled, hood ducts filled, hood and trunk shaved, door handles shaved,exhaust eliminated so I can do some tubing, and the grill and foglights filled so I can do an intercooler and different fogs. I have almost fit the convertible boot from a die-cast MR2, but that still needs a little tweaking for clearance. Anyway....\r\n\r\n[img:437ba21f98]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/chopside2.jpg[/img:437ba21f98]\r\n[img:437ba21f98]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/chopside1.jpg[/img:437ba21f98]\r\n[img:437ba21f98]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/chopfront1.jpg[/img:437ba21f98]\r\n[img:437ba21f98]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/chopback1.jpg[/img:437ba21f98]\r\n[img:437ba21f98]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/choptop1.jpg[/img:437ba21f98]\r\n\r\nI don\'t know what kind of wheels it will be rollin\' on yet, but it\'s either gonna be pullback or alloy. As for paint, it\'s gonna be a simple one color affair, because I really don\'t want to mess up. I will decide on a color when it\'s ready for a color.');
