INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41681, 'cd48e621c4', 'iWaver mini-z video(updated)', 'O.K., So I\'m a bit of a insomniac, what of it?\r\n\r\n219 said there would be video, so I had to attempt to learn to edit....\r\n\r\nAnd when I was happy with what I had done(EDIT: found 17 seconds I didn\'t realize I had, took out stills  at end), I had to figure out how to put it up for pimps to see....\r\n\r\nEnded up staying up all night, and learning a lot in the process...\r\n\r\nJust a little clip, like almost a minute or somethin\' (20kb) .... 219 lost track of the car for a few seconds, and I couldn\'t figure out how to edit in some shit-talkin\' subtitles over that, but anyways...EDIT: figured it out! \r\n\r\nTotally stock iWaver, like 5 minutes before one of the crappy wheel nuts came off and had me looking for small rear end components. This will need addressed, The wheel nuts blow.(I found everything, though!) \r\n\r\nEDIT: I HAVE REMOVED THIS LINK UNTIL I FIGURE OUT HOW TO MAKE IT WORK RIGHT.\r\n\r\nI think I\'m gonna have fun learning this video stuff.....EDIT: a lot of fun.\r\nyo, 219, want me to do one of those xmod clips of yours that I have?(never mind, I\'ll be doing it for the hell of it.)');
