INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41795, '8ebf100eb2', 'Naughty skyline', 'hey fellas, I havnt modded in a while, but im waiting on 3 more cars from toyeast! This is the body that the paint went wrong on, it went all bumpy on one side. \r\n\r\n[img:8ebf100eb2]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10021/skyline%20002.jpg[/img:8ebf100eb2]\r\nAfter i got the bumps of i tried a putty job, but that didnt turn out properly so i ripped it off and there was still putty left on there.\r\n\r\n\r\n[img:8ebf100eb2]http://img5.imageshack.us/img5/4292/drift001.jpg[/img:8ebf100eb2]\r\ni got most of the putty off but still had more to go\r\n\r\n\r\n[img:8ebf100eb2]http://img2.imageshack.us/img2/7982/drift002.jpg[/img:8ebf100eb2]\r\ngot some more off, taped her up and put a wing on her\r\n\r\n\r\nHere is the finished product only one thing went wrong! the tape was to sticky and only half of it came off a thin layer is over the wind screen and windows! anyone know how i can get it off, kinda like a drift car, stock wheels on the rear mags on the front, black bonnet,huge wing,intercooler and exhaust on a angle. enjoi!\r\n\r\n\r\n[img:8ebf100eb2]http://img2.imageshack.us/img2/7284/drift003.jpg[/img:8ebf100eb2]\r\n\r\n[img:8ebf100eb2]http://img2.imageshack.us/img2/2063/drift004.jpg[/img:8ebf100eb2]\r\n\r\n[img:8ebf100eb2]http://img2.imageshack.us/img2/4028/drift005.jpg[/img:8ebf100eb2]');
