INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41877, '22fb933c1a', 'The project micro RCs distracted me from', 'So, before I came across micro RCs I was getting into guitar building. \r\n\r\nThis was my second project. A cheapie kit I bought for 80 bucks. What I did was cut the headstock in the Fender Tele shape, redid the electronics, dressed and polished the frets. cut a new nut, and drilled the headstock for the Gotoh tuners. I also ditched the tacky white pickguard for a black matte one. After assembling and setting it up, to assure it played good, I took it apart to finish it. \r\n\r\nI wanted a Rockabily/hot rod tie in, so I decided to go leopard skin. I did that by covering it with leopard printed foil wrapping paper. I clear coated the headstock before the body to test compatibility with the paper. I had to lay very light coats at first. Since the paper is textured, I had to lay 20 coats, level sanding every 4 coats, to get it level. I gave the headstock a month to dry before I started on the body, to make sure bubbles didn\'t develop under the paper.\r\n\r\nMy experiment was a success, but in the meantime I caught the micro RC bug, and I keep using my clear coat on my cars.\r\n\r\nIt\'s been over a year now since I left it. It\'s so close to being finished, I was just thinking I really need to get back on it.\r\n\r\n[img:22fb933c1a]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/gueetar.jpg[/img:22fb933c1a]');
