INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41888, '318aeeeb01', '', 'Thanks Bird, I knew there is a few gueetar pickers around here, so I was hoping someone might appreciate it.\r\n\r\n[quote:318aeeeb01]Did you know that the guitar Jimi Hendrix burned up in that famous footage was later bought by Frank Zappa, who sent it to Fender where it was totally refit, and clearcoated right over the fire damage, and then was given as a gift to his son, Dweezil(who I believe still has it, not sure)? I saw pics of it once, and it stands today as one of the most beautiful guitars I have ever seen[/quote:318aeeeb01]You\'re not talking about the Monteray Pop Festival, are you? The one with the legendary debate between Pete Townsend, and Hendrix, over who was gonna follow who, and Hendix said, ok if I follow you, I\'m gonna pull out all the stops, and he did.\r\n\r\nIf that is the footage you\'re talking about. That guitar couldn\'t possibly have been refurbished, \'cause during that same footage you see Hendrix smash that guitar into pieces. I\'ve seen pictures of the fragments in Guitar World, about a year and a half ago, as they sit in the Rock \'n\' Roll Hall of Fame.\r\n\r\nYou know where you read that at? I\'d like to find out more...');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41889, '8faa9e8eed', '', 'So you\'ve determined, what I\'ve been coming around to slowly realize. FETs give you enough power to pull you\'re fastest gear ratio. \r\n\r\nI like running higher gear ratios now, because it actually helps keep the front wheels on the ground, but I don\'t have anything as high as the bit-racer gears yet.\r\n\r\n\r\nAre you really seeing much improvement with the triple stacked FETs? I was comparing stacked FETs, by stacking the forward FETs, and leaving the reverse. Double stacking seems like a slight improvement, but nothing like just putting FETs in there to begin with. Triple stacking seems to make the motor whine louder off the ground like there was more speed, but I didn\'t see any improvement on the ground.\r\n\r\n...but honestly, every time I run low on FETs, I steal the FETs off the cars that have stacked FET, so I haven\'t played with stacked FETs that much, that\'s why I\'m asking about your experience with them.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41890, '39450b36b9', '', 'I must be mistaken on which guitar, and where Jimi burned it up. I just know that I read a magazine article about Frank Zappa waaaay back probably before he died, and in that article, it had the story about a guitar Jimi had burned up ending up being redone and given to Dweezil. I gotta call my brother to see if he still has that magazine.... he\'s a pack rat, so he probably still does. I just tried to get him on the phone, and got his voice mail. I\'m on a mission to find this out today... before it\'s time to go to the in-laws...\r\n\r\nEDIT: OK, got it.... and all without even talking to my bro.... Miami Pop Festival, \'68. Check this out, I found a pic and everything...\r\n\r\nhttp://www.petersen.org/default.cfm?DocID=502&amp;ArticleID=12\r\n\r\nStill one of the prettiest guitars I\'ve ever seen....');
