INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41909, '46d8d1c9d6', '', '[quote:46d8d1c9d6="Bird"]It\'s funny, I know what you guys look like from the mug shots, but I still have this image of crazydave in my head when I read his posts... I picture this tattooed up Mike Ness Social Distortion type guy, who drives a shaved up black suede primered ride with red steelies and baby moon hubcaps.... and the tele fits right in with that image... Filelicker, I just picture every cool biker guy I\'ve ever known when I read your stuff...[/quote:46d8d1c9d6] :lol: Oh crap, that\'s just too funny, because in my head that\'s exactly how I picture myself, even though that\'s not really me at all.\r\n\r\n[quote:46d8d1c9d6]Anyhow, did you check out the info on that Hendrix/Zappa guitar?\r\n\r\n[quote:46d8d1c9d6="Bird"]OK, got it.... and all without even talking to my bro.... Miami Pop Festival, \'68. Check this out, I found a pic and everything...\r\n\r\nhttp://www.petersen.org/default.cfm?DocID=502&amp;ArticleID=12[/quote:46d8d1c9d6][/quote:46d8d1c9d6]Just checked that out. Thanks for researching that. I didn\'t know about that guitar. \r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:46d8d1c9d6="ph2t"]Sorry fellas, I love the telecaster with big fat 12\'s on it. \r\n\r\nBut God came to this earth in the form of a sunburst \'75 Gibson SG and has never left since...... [/quote:46d8d1c9d6]Ack, a Gibson man. :sad: \r\n\r\nA mid-70s Gibson at that.  :shock: \r\n\r\n\r\nThat\'s cool man, really I\'ve played some SGs that I really liked, much more comfortable than a LP. \r\n\r\nMy buddy has a mint condition \'63 SG, that he bought at a garage sale for 125 bucks. One of those amazing deals you always hear about, but I never find.');
