INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41917, 'fe1336a0c4', '', 'I play bass, guitar and piano.   My main instrument is the piano, did classical as I was growing up (my old man has a piano shop) and I got into blues and jazz \'cause I like the freeform it provided.   The blues/jazz also helped in the chick dept, lol.   That\'s what I love, the ugliest motherfucker wouldn\'t be given the time of day by regular hotties.   BUT, chuck him up on a stage with a mic and guitar THEN the chicks would be all over him..... Man, gotta love music!\r\n\r\nFor each instrument i like to play different stuff.  On the guitar I like to play hedrix sounding stuff, also some old albert king (old blues player).   I also like late 60\'s funk.  This is where I like that shit when I play the bass.    The stuff those dudes could do WITH THEIR FUCKING FINGERS PEOPLE!  ( sorry, sorta anti-pick when it comes to bass) is amazing.  The crispiest basslines that went all over the place but were sharp as and defined beat like nothing else...On the pianos I like to play blues mostly and also some jazz, more melodic sorta shiat, not the corn popping happy stuff, more like Thelonious Monk if any of you pimps know him.....\r\n\r\nMy old man use to have all these really cool Fender posters from days of old.   The best one had this saying that is really poetic and totally true...\r\n\r\n[i:fe1336a0c4]"After silence, that which comes closest to expressing the inexpressibe is music......"[/i:fe1336a0c4]\r\n\r\n :cool:');
