INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41923, '5b6b8376aa', '', '[quote:5b6b8376aa="ph2t"]That\'s what I love, the ugliest motherfucker wouldn\'t be given the time of day by regular hotties. BUT, chuck him up on a stage with a mic and guitar THEN the chicks would be all over him..... Man, gotta love music! [/quote:5b6b8376aa]Yeah, but then when they get you home they\'re like, "Put that thing down, pay attention to me."  :lol: \r\n\r\nI\'ve been trying to learn soem keyboards, and I play a little bass, you do play totally different on different instruments. Nothing like switching instruments to snap you out of a rut.\r\n\r\nThat\'s cool we\'re into so much of the same stuff, but we\'re different because you always have so much more technical knowledge, I\'m the free spirit.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n@Hog, I want to to put something up for you guys, but I lost my mic, and can\'t figure out a good way to record my guitar, besides, I\'ve been playing with computer based sequencers mostly lately, so if I posted what I\'ve been working on, it would just be some crazy ass synthetic shit too.\r\n\r\nI\'m extremely shy about my playing, but I\'ll try to post something real soon.\r\n\r\nI want to hear you run your turntable through a wah wah pedal, that\'d be sick.\r\n\r\nHey wait, Superfly\'s got a turntable, and wah... :???:');
