INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41925, '4b98a7c659', '', 'for a few months i was running a turntbable through a mu-tron. then i had to give it back to the dude.\r\n\r\nwhat sequencers you got dave? ive used most of em and find fruityloops to be the best for what i do. software synths are great but my korg polysix sounds 100billion times better. i have to get a midi retro kit for it i guess. lately ive been more into the percussion end of things tho just making funk patterns and shit.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41926, 'e4edc7c466', '', 'Beautiful Tele, crazydave. That thing will be sweet when you get it done. You are the most resourceful dude... that foil looks like a million bucks.\r\n\r\nMan, I can\'t believe all you Tele haters/Gibson lovers. If there\'s one thing I\'ve learned from SuperFly (there are tons of things, but this one is extra important), it\'s that Telecasters kick ass. I have two electric guitars; a \'73 Telecaster and a \'99 Toronado (Fender\'s twin humbucker guitar... an SG with a Fender feel).');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (41927, 'b48693b92e', '', '[quote:b48693b92e="hue35"]Beautiful Tele, crazydave. That thing will be sweet when you get it done. You are the most resourceful dude... that foil looks like a million bucks.\r\n\r\nMan, I can\'t believe all you Tele haters/Gibson lovers. If there\'s one thing I\'ve learned from SuperFly (there are tons of things, but this one is extra important), it\'s that Telecasters kick ass. I have two electric guitars; a \'73 Telecaster and a \'99 Toronado (Fender\'s twin humbucker guitar... an SG with a Fender feel).[/quote:b48693b92e]\r\n\r\nI don\'t hate any guitar , I would own them all  , I just am a les paul / strat guy { not gibson----- EPIPHONE ONLY}  .My daughter has a tele , it just seems like it\'s too small and light for me { I\'m  BIG mutha} , so I really have no want to get one for me. All great rock music has been made on basically 4 different guitars , les paul , sg , tele and strat.There are a few exceptions though { ted nugent , brian may, etc.}.To me its not about the manufacturer or price its about the sound and feel.{ besides that I \'m a real cheap bastard}');
