INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42041, '3735378c9c', 'Wide Load--Caution!!', 'I went out and picked up the new wheels with the extenders for the ZZ\'s.  They are sweet!!  They come with 3 sets of hub caps and 6 fatty tires (2 of each tire), 6 extenders, and 1 of each set of regular ZZ tires.\r\n\r\nThe only major affect they have is that the steering is much wider, but still pretty good!! \r\n\r\nWell anyway I all ready had a Shen that I did with ZZ wheels, so, I of course, had to put the fatties all the way around!!!\r\n\r\n[img:3735378c9c]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Misc%20Cars/shenwide_4.jpg[/img:3735378c9c]\r\n\r\n[img:3735378c9c]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Misc%20Cars/shenwide_3.jpg[/img:3735378c9c]\r\n\r\n[img:3735378c9c]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Misc%20Cars/shenwide_2.jpg[/img:3735378c9c]\r\n\r\n[img:3735378c9c]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Misc%20Cars/shenwide_1.jpg[/img:3735378c9c]\r\nShen chassis\r\nGreen electrical tape holding board cover on. :lol: \r\nZZ wheels, extenders, tires, and hub caps\r\nBlack Kit Racer heat sink\r\nBlue ZZ gears\r\nPerfection 4.2\r\nZZ 100mah battery\r\nSerious weight reduction to chassis with a dremel...shaved/rounded edges, thinned out as much as possible.  Lost a couple of grams...');
