INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42069, '288b1ed73f', '', 'Try here.....it\'ll cost ya, but they\'ll write it.\r\n\r\n[url]http://www.pocket-poet.com/BestManToastSpeech/[/url]\r\n\r\nLarger View  Best Man\'s Toast\r\nBeing selected as a Best Man is an honor. Standing next to your best friend or brother as he pledges his life to his bride is the responsibility of the Best Man and is a moment to be cherished. When the Best Man stands and delivers his Best Man\'s toast or speech, it should be the memory of a lifetime. The right tone for a Best Man\'s speech is often difficult to capture. Choosing the right words, length and tone is critical. The writers of Pocket-Poet can create the perfect Best Man\'s toast which will create the memory of a lifetime. Our Best Man\'s speeches and toasts are written especially for you, from the first word to the last. We take the information you provide in a special questionnaire and create a memory to be cherished by all. When the spotlight turns to you, it is your time to shine. Pocket-Poet\'s custom Best Man toasts and speeches will help you put the BEST in Best Man!  \r\n\r\n Occasion\r\n Wedding   \r\n$ 70.00  In stock\r\n  \r\n  [img:288b1ed73f]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Stuff/burnttoast.bmp[/img:288b1ed73f]\r\n\r\n[img:288b1ed73f]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Stuff/frenchtoast.bmp[/img:288b1ed73f]\r\n\r\nCheckout the last name......\r\n\r\n[url]http://www.thedickmans.net/judith.htm[/url]   :eek:  :grin: \r\n\r\nI\'m a pretty good writer, but by friday, never.......sorry pimp!!!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42070, '88f9030971', '', 'This is the deal... my 9mm only holds 16 rounds, so if I say one of those, I might not have enough lead to get ma ass out the door. \r\n\r\n(80 people attending, and he just got out of prison)  lol\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAnything else??? \r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m fuckin clueless on where to start this shit...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42071, '7b5cb2352a', '', '[quote:7b5cb2352a="sg219"]I\'m a pretty good writer, but by friday, never.......sorry pimp!!![/quote:7b5cb2352a]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIt wouldn\'t have to be all "Ben Stein" like or nothin... Just a sentence or 2 would be cool.  He just got out of prison, so I\'m sure he ain\'t depending on some heart warming speech....lol\r\n\r\n\r\nI was thinking about just saying how lucky he is to not be looking behind him during the meal for a dood with a shank.... :???: \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42072, '83a369473a', '', 'I\'ll tell you what I told pimp master douche(remember him?) when his dad made him best man.\r\n\r\nBasically, just do like a set of "talking points" notes to fall back on. Go up there and just freestyle... talk about the good times you had with dude, crack wise a few times, tell his lady she\'s gettin\' a good guy, she should be good to him etc... make a toast to eternal love or something like that, I don\'t think people expect it to be all epic.... \r\n\r\npimp master douche didn\'t even throw down for a batchelor party... I couldn\'t believe it... I\'d have at least taken my dad out for a lapdance....');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42073, '6fd7fa39c7', 'challenger bit', 'Heres my new challenger bit inspired by CaboWabo. i took it from a zz and chopped it to fit a bit. The color is metal flake blue (its hard to see in the pictures). I also ihave a mosfet in it, done by micro_amps. hope you like it.......\r\n\r\n\r\n[img:6fd7fa39c7]http://img25.photobucket.com/albums/v74/chickin0000000000/chalenger.jpg[/img:6fd7fa39c7]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nlose/chickin');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42074, '55f007dd87', '', 'I would like to make a toast to Bill my best friend and someone I\'ve known for a long time. I\'ve had some great times with Bill and today is one of the best he\'ll ever have.  Today he is forever joined with his bride Suzy that he met @_______ and they fell in love and never looked back.  I wish them the best and brightest future and to live in happieness the rest of there days together.  May all their dreams come true and their childrens dreams too.  Heres to you Bill and Suzy!!!!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHows this for you?  Please change Bill and Suzy to the actual names of the bride and groom for actual use!!!  Throw in a couple of cool stories about wild sex and drug parties and you\'ll be fine!!!\r\n\r\n\r\nEdit&gt;&gt;I was typing this while Bird posted........Hes right, you can write down some points of intrest and use them as a guide also.');
