INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42099, '5680ecff7c', '', 'Man, I was Best Man for a good bud of mine. Had NO clue what to say and pretty much screwed it up royally.\r\n\r\nIf I had it to do over again, I\'d do it like this...\r\n\r\n- Pick out the cool memories between us, especially the stupid shit that seemed serious then, but make us laugh now. Make a list.\r\n- Pick out anything positive I personally noticed between him and the woman he\'s about to give up his soul to. Make list.\r\n- Pick out anything positive I personally noticed about the soul devouring demon (aka any woman) and how that\'s gonna be especially good for him. Make list\r\n\r\nTake the lists and pull out the especially good stuff, hose the rest. Now add the obligatory congrats and well wishes.\r\n\r\nBest Man Toast complete.\r\n\r\nObviously only knowin a guy for 2 years (3/4 of it being in sing-sing) is going to make for some short ass lists, but considering the guy asked ya to be his BM and that you actually accepted means there\'s GOTTA be somethin there right?...If not, play up the congrats and well wishes.\r\n\r\nGood luck man, and try not to think of ALL THOSE PEOPLE there...WATCHING YOU! WANTING you to FAIL! Hoping you\'ll CHOKE up there and make an ASS out of yourself!  :shock:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42100, '08e12694ce', '', ':-D classic bit o\' comedy! i\'ve been to meetings like that at university! :drinkin:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42101, '8eaf37d225', '', 'For the while. I think SBCG doesn\'t need FET. What it needs is DUal cell which cannot be done either.\r\nIf a SBCG and a BCG FET drag together with same specs on a smooth surface. THey will be same because a SBCG does deliever more current to the motor than a BCG. THe torque difference between a SBCG and a BCG FET only shown on a rough surface and a incline.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42102, '2fa1d45b7b', '', 'Latest little iWaver tweak: I realized that I had 2 extra bearings in my box of xmod stuff(been runnin\' 2wd), so I dropped them in the carriers on the motor pod to smooth up the axle a bit until I get around to buying a full set. I think they\'re slightly narrow, but I have a bunch of spacers and teflon washers in my big box of old traxxas stuff(can\'t seem to locate my diff grease, though :sad: ), I\'ll just dig somethin\' out of there to eliminate the slight side to side play.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42103, '1ca496e040', '', '[quote:1ca496e040="Namuna"]Good luck man, and try not to think of ALL THOSE PEOPLE there...WATCHING YOU! WANTING you to FAIL! Hoping you\'ll CHOKE up there and make an ASS out of yourself!  :shock:[/quote:1ca496e040]\r\n\r\n\r\nlol... You fucker.  Now I\'m freakin out over this.  I tend to make jokes when nervous, so it might just turn out to open mic night at the reception for me.\r\n\r\nI\'ve compiled a bit of all of your statements, and have a lil somfin goin.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n----- I\'d like to make a toast to the 2 luckiest people in this room, and then I\'ll say a few things about the bride, and groom. *insert laugh*\r\n\r\nIt\'s an honor to be chosen to participate in such a special day. I\'d like to thank the bride and groom for thinking about me on a day that\'s clearly theirs....\r\n\r\n\r\nBride, and groom were the first people I met when I moved to this country, and have accepted me as one of the family, and I\'m grateful for that.\r\n\r\nWe\'ve had some really cool times together, but it\'s not even a drop in the bucket compared to the life he\'s starting today.\r\n\r\nI wish nothing but the best for Bride, and groom, and hope all their dreams come true.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCheers you sons a bitches....lol\r\n\r\n\r\nThat\'s as good as it will probably get on such short notice..lol Thanks for the input fellas.\r\n\r\nI\'m off to the rehersal dinner.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42104, 'a080d080c7', '', 'Perfect. Good luck and have fun.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42105, '1a7e22faa8', 'VW Microbus Bit....', 'Found these on Toyeast yesterday. Check it out:\r\n\r\nhttp://www.toyeast.com/v2/prodlist.asp?catid=1158\r\n\r\nGots to get me one! Look closely at the wheels. They look damn similar to the wheels that come with the SuperBit High Speed set....nicey nice! And is it me, or do some of those buses already looked slammed to the ground?\r\n\r\nI\'m new to the forum but have been lurking around here since the end of last December. It has been informative and entertaining to say the least. There are some very talented pimps around here as far as bit customization is concerned.\r\n\r\nI know there was some discussion about VW Microbuses a little while back and I was surprised that noone had found these and starting talking about them yet. So, I felt it was my Bitpimping duty to do so.\r\n\r\nMaybe Jmays could get a hold of one of the Blue ones, cut out some more windows and make a mini replica of his VW.');
