INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42149, '580f86a6a4', '', 'I didn\'t see this post before. That was pretty cool Betty. It took a bit to get going, but then it got really noisy, I dig noise. :grin: \r\n\r\nWhat did you use to put that together?\r\n\r\nHere\'s something I did with Fruity Loops 3. I used some synth plug ins, Beep Map, Juno, Pluck\'d, TS404, and just played with layers of slight variations on a Gm scale. \r\n\r\nI\'m afraid it\'s too monotonous for the avarage listener, but I think it\'s cool the way it layers together.\r\nhttp://crazybydesign.net/crazytunes/almosttrancelike.mp3\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ve got a bunch of riffs I\'ve done in Fruity Loops, but haven\'t figured out how to build from. If anyone wants to try to build off of them, let me know, and I\'ll zip up the.flp file with the samples, for you to download. (Hog, I know you said you play with Fruity loops)\r\n\r\nI\'m gonna try to give you guys a sample of my guitar playing tonight.');
