INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42269, '16d1339b48', 'More Requested Pics.....', 'Just read comments from RODW and got this......\r\n\r\n[i:16d1339b48]HEy guys i have a request. I would like to host the ride of the week on my new website that lacks virtually any content. I have like 65 hits in two weeks. Any way i would really like to make my homepage toight. If you care about this please just tell me not to. of course i won\'t do anything until i hear from you guys to see what you think. Check out my site and you will see that I am not going to make a profit off of your work. I will credit each "artist" I also have a bitpimps link on my site and would be happy to link to any of your sites. www.cswens.rchomepage.com \r\nthanks \r\nFrom the owner of the most pimp xmod i\'ve ever seen (check my gallery)\r\n_________________\r\nholla back \r\ncdub[/i:16d1339b48]\r\n\r\nI sent him the following PM......\r\n\r\n[b:16d1339b48]Sorry Da Bomb,\r\n\r\nWe\'d have to decline on your offer to host any "Ride O Da Week" pic from this forum.  These pics are for the express enjoyment of the Pimps that cruise thru Da Hood, so please do not used pics posted here.\r\n\r\nWhat would be a good idea is to post here and on various other forums for pic of rides to be hosted on your site.  There would be dozens of replies, who wouldn\'t want their ride hosted on a website  :???: You\'ll have more than you\'ll need.\r\n\r\nThanx For Asking 1st  :cool: [/b:16d1339b48]\r\n\r\nWhy does everyone wanna cop our style  :???: \r\n\r\n[b:16d1339b48]Cause We Da Coolest Mutha Fuckas on Da Planet,  Dats Why  [/b:16d1339b48]');
