INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42298, '27766c06e3', '', 'Well, here\'s the story on that car. In 1990, I had an \'83 VW Scirocco. Someone ran into it, and it was considered totalled. The insurance company gave me $3,300 for it. I took that and $2,500 and bought an \'87 VW 16v Scirocco with a Neuspeed suspension in it. I drove that car for 10 great years, and took the equavlent of a car payment and put it in the stock market. In 2000, my wife and I were expecting a child, and my Scirocco was small (couldn\'t fit a carseat in the back) and had 135,000 miles on it. Sold the stock and paid cash. Literally, cash. The dealer gave me the sideways "are-you-a-drug-dealer?" look, hehe. First time I\'ve ever owned a new car. Can\'t say I\'d ever buy a brand-new car again, but it is cool to have a car that is extremely safe, comfortable, fast and has mad handling.');
