INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42338, 'd5911dc882', '', '[quote:d5911dc882="CaboWabo"]man, crazydave\'s playin - that\'s the kind of playin I always wished I could do.\r\nI have no musical talent in the least besides knowing what sounds good to me.\r\n\r\ncrazydave makes it sound fun[/quote:d5911dc882]That\'s interesting that you say I make it sound fun, because that\'s one thing that has prevented me from progressing... I only play what\'s fun to me, and I never force myself to play, if it don\'t feel right, I put it down.\r\n\r\nSo I guess that comes through in my playing?  Hmmm :???: \r\n\r\n\r\n...and Payaso, I always figured if I can\'t be the greatest player I could at least have style, so for you to say I have great style, that means I\'ve at least accomplished that goal, and that means something to me.\r\n\r\n\r\nIt\'s cool, whether it be little rc cars, or guitars, all of you guys come through with the perfect compliments that make me realize you guys get what I\'m trying to do. Which is really cool, I don\'t feel like too many people get me.');
