INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42517, 'c759e119d6', '', 'told you biatches I\'d make one!! I been trying to put this up, but I\'ve had a CRAPLOAD of homework to do!! But, here it is:\r\n\r\n\r\n[b:c759e119d6]The latest string of the bitPimps fighting gets caught on camera[/b:c759e119d6]\r\nFrom: undercoverBrother\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau\r\n\r\n[b:c759e119d6]PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)\r\nA fight, caught on camera, at a local dance club shows us a chilling view into to minds of the bitPimps. The fight has left a few people holding their breath, wondering what is next.[/b:c759e119d6]\r\n\r\n\r\nIt was a dark night at Grand Theft Auto, a club outside of Pimp City, as I decided to take my camera with me to my usual friday spot.\r\n\r\nThe first few pics just show the scene, as I was photographing my surroundings.\r\n[img:c759e119d6]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UwDhAt8Y5gThsZuEvfVKZXF2oWUp0c4MjOvztuuv!LayuWRbP7Z5JDAlqTxegq5Z!CjQStjpv91Pu3l2q58neMYIR7bu3kotpXfQD4DmdavArCzylASWKpOZFqAa6jRO/DCP_3795.JPG?dc=4675468630651008434[/img:c759e119d6]\r\n\r\nyou can see the club owners chillin in their usual lounge!\r\n[img:c759e119d6]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UwDhAuIYxAXhsZuEvfVKZaq2GdbCNB4xR61*7pe83kTG5AoZqdHurd8Hlu!bL5MhwbqrQd4Gw9LD5C11Oy*h6AyDsTMF2O6jdwk*o60Vxsh!pnebR*zIypiGCUKCoN0M/DCP_3798.JPG?dc=4675468630761961756[/img:c759e119d6]\r\n\r\ncheckin to make sure nobody acts a fool!\r\n[img:c759e119d6]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UwDVAuMYDgbhsZuEvfVKZSSOiXZGvNgoQ2LZgQHMDYc6aMh51idMSSv4IWTGV03108!1KaVduX92BRXM7YECsSQXqVXmEoMo8xrMKL3Jxe!*erPzEchS5kBO!ez*feVe/DCP_3799.JPG?dc=4675468630851561136[/img:c759e119d6]\r\n\r\nI turned my camera on just in time to see a member of the bitPimps get knocked down.\r\n[img:c759e119d6]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UwAAANQYsQGrUDjd9GInmMjwrlbPX2ISozs8A6bKGVDtANGcHHndt0monOGHsbV5tjwbMqa8QeAYKqLqCqq0HzWlFnuL8jnzmPQkRkwj4yXJ2QlLbDIYFAMSMvDfmxlq/DCP_3802.JPG?dc=4675468630999128259[/img:c759e119d6]\r\n\r\nbefore I knew it, midget_man(short one) and his accomplice, DarkTari had gotten upset. A crowd formed a circle around them.\r\n[img:c759e119d6]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UwDhAtUY!wGrUDjd9GInmMxnmUvMZmIK*xIgGaGV*0cMgqlNQ8I2Y!b5L9UppRMVt!M6LlVNXTMM!FnnNHgqwQOgQygd5CIqFc7Rik6L0Fb0ZxqHC!Z4j80X*dGmxQHN/DCP_3803.JPG?dc=4675468631131608911[/img:c759e119d6]\r\n\r\nI heard the little one, midget_man saying, "What, you want some of this shit, biatch!!?? I\'ll work you, dogg!!"\r\n[img:c759e119d6]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UwAJA9YYRQKrUDjd9GInmH27IdnYkn5yP4x2WMcOrLvm8OspQj!DIKZGNwGJOWKtMpPKrGXPFvsz4X5QSZMiuiLQO*sIfc0OfQ3vwTTQDuoFqjmazmQsULXWMzM1SZHM/DCP_3804.JPG?dc=4675468631252404071[/img:c759e119d6]\r\n\r\nI kept snapping photos, as midget_man bumrushed the man, tackling him to the ground.\r\n[img:c759e119d6]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UwDVAtcYjwKrUDjd9GInmH4QhAnVBCT!ubj1NrlbyQSNtyrTKAFRrboksT0oYImBNhLO3!IytGHF1YaYBCNMvfK73w*5rGXIfRhm0lzFsEEBG4msSC7XKqqSDnKoBwFf/DCP_3805.JPG?dc=4675469182132024785[/img:c759e119d6]\r\n\r\nas he was on the ground, the pair of gangsters continued "whooping ass", as the bitPimps call it. The kicked and punched him as he lay helplessly on the ground. They even let their dog get in on the action.\r\n[img:c759e119d6]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UwAAANgY2QKrUDjd9GInmKnvHXZeG1Az71n6gqBcHKI0ahMHd!bz3euATe62RRJFpoWuXoiS856cspqGeBhapxeNKdQIkAJEn1hSRvLovqHM5WNbLg080ODNm4!9wzVO/DCP_3806.JPG?dc=4675469182235671891[/img:c759e119d6]\r\n\r\nall of the sudden, the club owners came out of nowhere and knocked me to the ground, knocking the lens off my camera. They kicked the two men and their dog out, telling them never to come back. I fixed my camera in time to see them getting told never to return. \r\n[img:c759e119d6]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UwAJA9kYIwOrUDjd9GInmOcQbolYJYxngiUK7bJkjjFWH3JUehnFKqkf!6*cu3xqnmCahx30SLd!x*j64YfvKwFPgOoyo8zBBTnALdlngbOR01vCb1Jk6QQnZ009ftio/DCP_3807.JPG?dc=4675469182326045956[/img:c759e119d6]\r\n\r\nI was able to get one more picture, as the pimps got in their lowrider and screamed off. I was told later by the club owner that the man survived the attack, but had many cuts and bruises.\r\n[img:c759e119d6]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0VAAWA2wZEy*hsZuEvfVKZZP*guFGecf9yI81VJfAcrYzOEYjTnfubdT1KvY1MMcT9u*2u97Kz2N1YJHMcYAmPY0cNctXegP5fxkz1YT92H1EUw4*f3x*NTWw*SzLQPZZ/DCP_37560.jpg?dc=4675469184322003158[/img:c759e119d6]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhope you guys liked it!!!');
