INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42651, '7258706b8b', '', 'Yeah, gotta agree with hue here. Our cars drive near perfectly on the floor with stock wheels. Best tires are LXX tires in the rear, with Bit Char-A tires a close second. Up front, the best thing going is KIT racer black tires (from the slalom flavor), with bit/MS hard, grey ribbed and stock mediums in second, depending on the car. As long as the car is tracking straight and turns the same radius in either direction, it can\'t be improved upon. If it turned any sharper it would just flip. The pullbacks on the rear aren\'t bad, but they\'re just too fat up front. As I\'ve said before, y\'all are lucky you don\'t live too close or I\'d own all your cars.');
