INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42764, '190b5b2e8d', '', '[quote:190b5b2e8d="CaboWabo"]\r\nexactly my sentiments dude\'s got balls as big as church bells and the sense of a rock. I commend him for taking shit from just about everyone and still sticking to it.\r\n[/quote:190b5b2e8d]\r\n\r\nWhen you\'re a HARDCORE MASOCHIST, then it just looks like you\'ve got balls. Once upon a time I actually wasted time out of my life and tried talking to that kid and explaining about how things are and gave him some advice as to how to get back into people\'s good graces.\r\n\r\nTard boy basically IGNORED everything I told him, then later gives me the breakdown of what he did wrong...In other words, he KNEW he was being a PUTZ and kept doing it. \r\n\r\nThe only explanation for behaviour like that (IMO) is that the kid is seriously FIENDING for attention, and the negative variety is the fastest way to get it.\r\n\r\nNow, if he\'d just come out of the goddamned closet and live his life, he can put all this behind him.');
