INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42820, 'cac9430a17', '', 'Does anyone know RedRSX on MZR or TRC? Here\'s another one of his fucking blabs, straight out of his ass:\r\n\r\n[quote:cac9430a17="RedRSX"]Ok, thats fine that you wanna waste your money on something that is about as good as an xmod.  Thats absolutley fantastic for you!  3x the price?!?!  Where the hell are looking for mini-zs?  Check ebay or r c mart and you will find brand new MR-01s for somewhere around $70-$85...maybe even cheaper.  As for the real mini-zs only being "25% better quality" thats is a load of crap...LOLOLOLOLOLOL!!!  I cant even believe you would say something like that?  Its your radical opinions and your rude remarks that make you hated on the RC forums!  Mclaren F1 T3 is right man!  You need to listen to him...LOL...hes 2 years younger than you and yet sounds about 2 years older than you.  Just get a real mini-z!  Quit bashing on the real thing!  $55 a month!!!  Man, I only get $40 a month and i have to do a helluva lot mor ethan you.  My god...you of all people saying you dont have the money...LOL!  BTW...quit bashing on Drac!!  He is one of the best resources on this forum...you need to figure out who you are talking to before you start bashing on people!  No wonder I hated your @$$ on TRC!  I try and tell you that mini-zs were better than xmods and you wouldnt have it...and look at you now...you think some POS clone is awesome?!?!  You will be in awe if you ever swallow your pride and buy a real mini-z!  30-40 steps of steering and you think thats good...lol the mini-z are like over 150 steps...what you bought is a slightly better xmod...thats it...an xmod with a viper body...good job!  ;)   Maybe if you approached people with a nicer tone...youd get nicer remarks...ever think of that????  Lets all give Charlie Brown a big High Five for buying an xmod witha  viper body!!   :D[/quote:cac9430a17]\r\n\r\nAnd you guys call ME a twat....C\'mon, look at this asshole. He hasn\'t even owned an Iwaver mini-z, and yet he talks shit about it. What a fucking Douche.....\r\n\r\nAnd  he\'s telling ME to use nicer remarks? Like I said, this guy\'s talking out of his ass. Right now I\'d like to choke him by his neck, rip off his head and shove it up his father\'s twat.... :finger:\r\n\r\n[quote:cac9430a17="TMP"]btw, i love this thread![/quote:cac9430a17]\r\n\r\nWelcome to the club.');
