INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42835, 'c5690edc4a', '', 'Fuck those guys, Goku. They dont wanna hear it, so why waste your time? The fact that they call a clone of their beloved Kyosho "an x-mod with a viper body" just shows their ignorance. I\'m going to come right out and say it... I BELIEVE that the Kyosho mini-z is overpriced, overrated, and frankly, outdated. The fact that I got a "cheap" clone that is more likely 75% quality of the "amazing" real mini-z puts me waaaaay ahead, in my OPINION.\r\n\r\nI also FEEL that if the x-mod aftermarket(which is still in its infancy) ever grows to it\'s full potential, these mini-z purists who so loooove their gay purple alloy everything and pan-car technology will be speechless, as they will no longer be able to talk out of their asses about their overpriced "hobby class" cars. Ingenuity will always overtake uninformed shit talking.\r\n\r\nThe OPINIONS I am spewing in this here rant in no way affect the way I feel about any of the cars I own... I love them all, and I am in this for the fun, not brand loyalty. I enjoy the challenge of trying to come up with my own performance and appearance enhancements, not sinking my money into the same shit that everybody else can go to the lhs or shaq and bolt on.In the end that\'s what this hobby is all about for me, not a price tag, but the pleasure of working on, improving, and driving the living shit out of each and every car I have CHOSEN to buy.\r\n\r\nEDIT @219, 3 mofo\'s posted while I wrote that!');
