INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42839, 'edfb3e9ce2', '', '[quote:edfb3e9ce2="Son_Gokou"]I wonder what those DOBs would say if they saw these posts....[/quote:edfb3e9ce2]\r\n\r\nIf I gave a fuck, I\'d wonder, too. I almost edited in a whole \'nother rant aimed at the "true propo" obsessed people I come across in my readings, but, as I\'ve told you before, I don\'t like wasting my time. In my opinion, and as my good friend 219 so eloquently stated(and as I have told you before, as well), the only people worth talking to are right here, in the hood. I value the educated, informed, quick witted, and yes, sometimes harsh opinions that I get from innovative people who are respected all over the world..... I\'m not saying that all other forums are a waste of time, but I really don\'t need to go there because their most respected members are also some of the most respected members here... and for good reason, bitPimps is THE cutting edge of the micro rc world because of the atmosphere it provides these innovators with to keep pushing the limits of the hobby without all of the whining and bickering and narrow-mindedness that is so rampant in certain circles....');
