INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42912, '4ed5108615', '', '[quote:4ed5108615="DarkTari"]You are a Pioneer in this hobby Cavey!  You seem to do what others have not and damn good.  This is another triumph to your skilz Pimp!  Not only looks but the muscle to back it up!  Great Job Pimp  :cool:[/quote:4ed5108615]Damn, DT, thanks, that\'s a hell of a compliment, but I don\'t know if I\'m a pioneer. I look for something that no ones done, and try to fill that niche, but the influence and ideas come from all you guys. You\'ve been a huge influence on me, with all your body modding, and nice details. Hue and Superfly encourage me to keep it clean looking, and details also. The alloys originally come from Payaso, he also sets a standard for detailing. I\'ve seen one of his bodies up close, very crisp details. Cabo inspired me to start chopping stuff up. Hogjowls, he\'s a bigger influence that you guys might realize, he encourages me to keep things fast and have plenty of attitude. You can see a bit of hog in the scrawled Rat logo. ph2t made me want to do a 4.8v car. Ripper7777777 was a huge influence with his drag cars. Everyone that put this contest together influenced me to push myself one step farther.\r\n\r\nJeez, that\'s quite a list, but I could still go on and on, so thank you guys, for encouraging me to do more. Heck, in the beginning I would have been happy just sticking in a 2.6, and painting some stripes on my car, until I saw what other people were doing.  :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:4ed5108615="cabowabo"]everything about that car just says "screw off, I\'ll eat you alive"[/quote:4ed5108615]That\'s perfect. Most of us have seen what it like moving, I wanted it to say F you standing still. I think I pulled it off, huh?');
