INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42922, '2bcdb8c5f3', '', 'Hey, I was thinking of the wrong part!!!  Sorry.....  I was thinking of these things, not the knuckles, which you broke.  Brain Fart!!!\r\n\r\n[img:2bcdb8c5f3]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Stuff/trc-xmodaxlecups-240x180.gif[/img:2bcdb8c5f3]\r\n\r\nI will look for them too. I havn\'t broken any yet, but if everyone is breaking the same part, I better get some too, its inevitable.  Why isn\'t anyone making them yet? And if they are made where the hell are they?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (42923, '760e5a41ec', 'NewComer...', 'Did you Pimps read the comment from jmays in the RODW comment post?\r\n\r\n\r\nI have some questions about the ride of the week.\r\n\r\n1st who picks the rides?\r\n2nd wouldn\'t a ride be more qualified if it was made from scratch rather than being bought?\r\n3rd how should a person feel abought not having his made from scratch ride picked over a bought one?\r\n\r\nthanks\r\njmays\r\n\r\nHog gave him a subdued answer  :???: .  I wrote him the following PM....\r\n\r\nPimp,\r\n\r\nIs there an issue with the RODW choices?\r\n\r\n* I pick &amp; post the RODW pics. \r\n* They are chosen on eye appeal, whether it\'s a store bought Bit with a nice paint  job, custom wheels, made from scratch, chopped body, whatever!  As long as the end result is unique and done right!\r\n*  Why would you ask how you should feel?  How do you feel? This is a title that\'s not given to any Micro!  I hand (pic) pick these Micro\'s from all over Da World  and they are very deservant of this title..  \r\n\r\nIt seems that you feel you have a Micro that should be judged or you have one that you feel is better than one or some of the chosen ones.  I am only responsible for the Micro\'s I picked and no others.  So if you feel you have one/some that needs to be considered, pop me a pm and include the pics.\r\n\r\nIf you send me anything, make damn sure you come correct !  No photo visible paint/body mistakes.  The RODW Micros are as close to professional as it gets. There are modders like Crazy Dave, Cabo, Sinned, Geisem, Hue, SuperFly and myself just to name a few that deserve to have every one of their Micro\'s titled RODW.  So as I said before, if you come, come correct Pimp ![/b]');
