INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43028, 'ce7f9e52a4', '', '[quote:ce7f9e52a4="betty.k"]and anyone who paints flames on a shell is already half way there in my book! :-)[/quote:ce7f9e52a4]\r\n\r\nall the way now betty!\r\n\r\ncheerz all for the invite.its real good to be a part of this here shit.\r\n  \r\n love the funnies... \r\n     hey hog, not all aussies are related to convicts. some of us are related to nazis you know. \r\n\r\n and if any pimps ever make it over to oz, make sure to stop by my place.  nimbin is just up the road a bit,  and man you cant last 5 minutes in that place before someones tryin to sell you some funky green shit.\r\n    i had a bucket a month back for old times sake with a mate. nocked me on my arse it did.        just remember..... the ping pong ball!   float it inside the bottle so that the water dont get in your mouth.... :cool: \r\n\r\n    and over here a gravity B is when you hang upside down by the legs and get a mate to fire it up for you.    head rush in-extremis. just like your first time!\r\n\r\n  and who is this charlie person i been seeing and hearing about?  shit he is uuuuugly.');
