INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43030, '1d8b51dbcd', '', '[img:1d8b51dbcd]http://thumb8.webshots.com/s/thumb3/3/82/78/119038278FYkllA_th.jpg[/img:1d8b51dbcd]\r\n\r\n[img:1d8b51dbcd]http://thumb9.webshots.com/s/thumb3/3/79/49/119037949yTgoht_th.jpg[/img:1d8b51dbcd]\r\n\r\n   the track is mdf, which i paint with acrylic black with a big brush. and then give it a coat of matt varnish.  ever speckled spray before? like holding down the button half way, thats how to use varnish without turning it into a slipppery nightmare. also seals it real good.\r\n    and sealing is good so that you can strategicly place synth oil  and spread it out nice for a little drift.  it does sink in eventually and leaves nice wheel marks around the place.\r\n\r\n   as for driving, i only use my three supers these days. they have great steering and power output and are real easy to strip down and service after each time my racin buddies have a go.  \r\n\r\n     there are tricky spots that require a bit of planing (the left side of the second thumb) i.e. going wide. but overall a great track for testing out motor,gear and tyre set ups.\r\n\r\nthis should be in my sig: access to all my pics...\r\nhttp://community.webshots.com/album/116292953dEXcgc/2');
