INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43050, 'e04467619e', 'The no B.S. &quot;watch out betty!&quot; thread', 'aight guys... I, unlike other people, have a legit post here. Betty, don\'t even watch out, because don\'t worry, NOBODY could take your throne as the offroad bit king lol... anyway, here\'s my offroad bit, version 2.\r\n\r\n[img:e04467619e]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UwAOA80YP*6dQwmWD!oqYuEbZ9gpF!dBtzEf*GUWmf5Cdh9slt7GcfGOyk4*ed9BSNiB4Oh1gG59YLcDkDHSvrTs3YZJ1lQoSenhziEpc7*vu42vmks4ow3zeJR5ldl1/DCP_0001.JPG?dc=4675469867479999158[/img:e04467619e]\r\n[img:e04467619e]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UwCFAs8Y0*6dQwmWD!oqYsjUCxEpAt32KEoZxaFLrVjH0EFjEOIr0eSGPjG24saebuVA2LIsWefibvFbr5fkfoB4TfAm2a3wQnIcOQj3MoSuz4sBK9AIPLQI8TsZJC4b/DCP_0003.JPG?dc=4675469865942750826[/img:e04467619e]\r\n[img:e04467619e]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UwAOA9AYHf!dQwmWD!oqYss6iYzB6FyTPTsLlsON9yz!cNVLfUr7KwP2A8caIUC9*1U*AtOXgDiE1yHLyqmmW2Qh2jFpDAXtgpUwXAC1sLb2JH0ktKugXWNRoGwUjrE*/DCP_0004.JPG?dc=4675469866022537002[/img:e04467619e]\r\n[img:e04467619e]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0VwDtAqoZzGSdQwmWD!oqYjuua194sPYOoEhl7Kv57wZ6bDwKYlbpzUduW5dHQvcLLIXLc17V9em7EDyTvDwxdKoYLHe22zWJw2uKpRJa1F5w*6GTbWh7tTSOtnjCdt43/DCP_0005.JPG?dc=4675469866354129157[/img:e04467619e]\r\n\r\nI do have a few problems that I\'d like to kno answers to though. \r\n#1: This thing will not go straight, nor has any dual cell car I\'ve had. Is there any way to fix this?\r\n#2: When it is on the charger, the thing will rev higher than I\'ve ever heard a motor rev. The problem is that when I take it off of the charger, it revs only about half as high as it does when it\'s on the charger. Does this mean I need new cells?\r\n\r\nthanks in advance, yo!');
