INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43205, '1250cd584d', '', 'Man, this thread is takin\' me back to my corduroy days, right here. I used to have like 8 or 9 stompers, and 4 or 5 rough riders waaaaaay back in the day.  I have to go diggin\' in my dads attic, because I\'m sure that I still have some of the track set that I had(and hopefully a chassis or body or some parts or SOMETHING... my brothers have scavenged a lot of the old stuff up there). I used to spend hours in my backyard setting up different hillclimbs and stuff with this dude Jelani that lived down the block... good times for sure. Anyway, I did a little search, and came across this guy who has a hella big collection of stompers and clones and he\'s even into bits and stuff(there\'s even a dead link to QFM on his site), but looking at the pics of his collection really brought back a lot of great memories of my childhood... so, here ya go:\r\n\r\nhttp://www.stomper4x4.com/\r\n\r\nEDIT... damn, I gotta quit taking so long writing my posts,  payaso posted the same dude while I was writing my epic lol...');
