INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43304, 'a21e48630e', '', 'Heres my vouch list:\r\n\r\nEzenterprises\r\n**Irvineman \r\nSoundcomm02\r\nGreatdeals00\r\nPugsmith_20004foe\r\n**Allislandhobbys\r\n\r\nAll the above gave great service and responed to any questions asked promptly!!!  Most on Ebay.\r\n\r\n**--Multiple purchases made and damn quick shipping. \r\n\r\nThe people that need to be thrown under the bus a few times and backed up over, since I\'m going to put them down, I\'ll give reasons.\r\n\r\nThesavewave--The auction said 8 styles and I got 4.  I asked why, he said it was a closeout deal.  I responed by stating, that nowhere in the auction, does it state the word closeout.  He wouldn\'t even consider that he was blatently lying.\r\n\r\nWherebsara--Won 3 auctions (CF parts) of theirs in 3 or 4 days and did not combine shipping.  It took 3 days shy of a month to get the items.  When contacted they gave me the BS story that they were overwhelmed with orders.  I replied that they shouldn\'t auction items that are not ready for shipping. They replyed, We don\'t care what you think, we got yo cash and you\'ll just have to wait for yo 5hit!!....sort of like that....\r\n\r\nUsed_Tech_Guy--Send money, never got item.  Send email, never got reply.  Called and left message, never got return call.  Contacted PayPal, got my cash back in 3 days!!!\r\n\r\n\r\nThats my list so far.  If you feel the need or just bored, you can head over to ebay and check out these morons feedback!!  I just think that if your goin\' to put someone down, a little justification helps to keep them down!!');
