INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43286, '5db38264a4', '', '[quote:5db38264a4]So right now I just buy shitloads of mini r/c stuff off of ebay.I just got 2 ms lancer speedsets , ms rx7 , ms celica, clone semi ,bit gloria,bit 3 body skyline set, clone police car, 10 more hummers and 4 different tanks..It makes up for it , that I can\'t pass up a great deal ! but I am running out of places to hid most this shiat from my wife , if she knew I was getting this much stuff in she\'d flip.[/quote:5db38264a4]\r\n\r\nDamn dude....thats a lot of shiat! I don\'t have a wife to deal with, so I don\'t have that problem. Then again...I\'m a 33 year old single man that collects and plays with little cars...maybe that is a problem :???: \r\n\r\nI actually just started using ebay myself. You come across a lot of stuff on there you might not see otherwise. Right now I\'m diggin\' all those employee giveaway and promotional bits that pop up on ebay once in a while. I figure those will be fairly rare, so I keep those puppies new in the package.\r\n\r\nThere is a fair amount of zip zap stuff on ebay, including the new cuda/mustang kits....but no wheel mod kits or the new kit I just mentioned. the problem with the new zip zap stuff on ebay is that the sellers sell them close to or at the price they cost in at the Shak...so you might as well order them from the shak website. \r\n\r\nWhere ya movin\' to?');
