INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43365, 'e61da76f74', '', 'Well you\'re making me feel bad, I didn\'t come out to show anybody up. I just saw those prizes, and thought I had to put together something special.\r\n\r\nI know you and cabo are bumming on the money situation, I\'ll tell ya though, not to make light of your situations, but I\'m always bumming on the money situation, and trying to figure how to compete with the other guys. Why do you think my favorite mediums are Thunder Chargers, plastic packaging, superglue, and Hot Wheels cars? \r\n\r\nYou just gotta be creative. Look around you and say, What can I do with this, and how can I make it work? I was thinking of making a sand rail out of paper clips. Ya know what I mean?\r\n\r\nAny rate I didn\'t mean to put the pressure on you guys, I was just trying to make it fun. I hate to see you bummed. I rather figure a way to work this out. Maybe we can hit them up for an extension, DT said he was probably gonna be too busy to finish his project too, and you guys really need to be focused on finding work. This is really bad timing, that suck. :(');
