INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43420, '717d12b932', '', 'ok i had to get this kit. why did those tit-turds have to come out with another classic?\r\n\r\nunlike the se bodies they are all one piece. well the 02 has a separate piece for the spoiler but the grills and such are all part of the body. other than that its very nice.\r\n\r\n[img:717d12b932]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10003/ta1.jpg[/img:717d12b932]\r\n\r\n\r\n[img:717d12b932]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10003/ta2.jpg[/img:717d12b932]\r\n\r\n[img:717d12b932]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10003/ta3.jpg[/img:717d12b932]\r\n\r\n[img:717d12b932]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10003/ta4.jpg[/img:717d12b932]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43421, '47e07adb4f', '', 'That Bandit TA is flat out kick ass...  The shitty part is that it\'s too cool to paint.\r\n\r\nI got some scala honeycomb alloys that are gonna be so sweet on that when I get the loot.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43422, '19875b3c6e', '', 'I am glad I\'m not a moderator , this shiat is getting crazy tough.Anyone who thinks pimps don\'t have skills should see the entrys for this contest ,these cars will be what all others in future will be judged by , the level of detail , mods , creativity , and subjects are beyond comprehension , I once again am in total awe!My wife saw the pics of the entrys and she said was " HOLY SHIT , THESE GUYS ARE NUTZ!".');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43423, 'fa4acdef18', '', '[quote:fa4acdef18="Bird"]First of all, Goku.... thanks for posting the pics of the electronics... I don\'t have my own cam, and 219 doesn\'t always bring his when he comes up my crib... maybe this will help ph2t figure out if the Nelly will be usable by us iWaver owners.... \r\n\r\nSecond... and please don\'t take offense to this... but, don\'t your parents get pissed that you spend all of your dough on cars only to get them and like 4 days later mess up the motors experimenting with re-winding them and stuff? Just curious...[/quote:fa4acdef18]\r\n\r\n#1: You\'re welcome Bird, I owed you one. :-)\r\n#2: Offensive? NAH....And yes they get pissed....I need a job!  :x \r\n\r\n            So today, I was desperate for a good 130 motor. My 2 motors (stock Iwaver Miniz and Escalation for the Iwaver) had bent/cracked armature poles, and I\'d gotten a spinbrush toothbrush for the motor....$8.50 down the drain, the armature leg was too short for the pinion to reach the differential gear. So, I got desperate and busted open my mini fan (there goes a souvineir from my vacation to Florida!  :( ) and wound that motor down from 95 turns to 45. I saw some white plastic flaps, on the bottom and top of each pole on the armature. I ripped em off, not realizing what a mistake that would be. I threw the motor in my mini-Z....within seconds, the board smoked. The FETs were ok....And I looked in my Spinbrush armature, and that motor had the plastic flaps.\r\n\r\nMy guess is that removing those flaps must have caused some kind of short in the motor....I guess the wire isn\'t enameled. Oh well, I think I\'m gonna buy this little jewel right here...\r\n\r\nhttp://www.radioshack.com/product.asp?catalog%5Fname=CTLG&amp;category%5Fname=CTLG%5F011%5F002%5F007%5F003&amp;product%5Fid=273%2D258');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43424, 'c66c206b64', '', '"one of the ones where the board cover and motor clip are one big goofy piece"\r\n Thats the one , I am just going to try the best I can to fix the up for her .\r\nThanks for the help guys!');
