INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43453, '4a5ac51f9e', '', '[quote:4a5ac51f9e="crazydave"][quote:4a5ac51f9e="sessiz"][quote:4a5ac51f9e="crazydave"][quote:4a5ac51f9e="sessiz"]Yes, she\'s very nice, but I could draw something a thousand times better. (coyly alluding to the amount of airbrushing playboy uses) :-)[/quote:4a5ac51f9e]Oh come on, you can\'t tell me you actually wanted to see that big hairy mole hangin\' off her thigh?  :lol:[/quote:4a5ac51f9e]\r\n\r\nThink about what yer askin dave. :-)[/quote:4a5ac51f9e] :???: I thought and thought, and I\'m confused. I\'m saying if there\'s a big giant nasty looking thing hanging off her leg, then is it so bad that Playboy fixed it? I mean we\'re just looking at the picture, not dating the woman. Now if a Playboy was a catalog, and I was paying good money for my mail order bride, I\'d scream false advertising.\r\n\r\n\r\nLol @ Nox, dats some good airbrushin\', huh?[/quote:4a5ac51f9e]\r\n\r\nThere\'s touching up a photo and then there\'s painting a picture. Playboy falls into the painting a picture category in my opinion. Yeah I don\'t wanna be seeing pimpled asses or stretch marks in a nudie pic but when it gets as fake as playboy pics I may as well be looking at hentai. Know what I\'m saying? :-)');
