INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43460, 'aac7771f8e', '', 'That\'s crazy Cabo. The rear end throws you off, then the bright colors do look like something out of a comic book. It\'s almost surreal. :shock: \r\n\r\n...and that\'s funny seeing me hanging out with you. :lol: \r\n\r\nYeah that chassis, should be an ass kicker, I just gave it a test run, and left it to Cabo to dial in, but what you got there is a FET modded Thunder Charger, with dual cells crammed under dat dare flipped PCB. Had to widen the rear end to clear the cells. You don\'t have to do the math to figure that\'s fast. I think I stuck a ZZ 2.2 in there, I told him to try another motor, he\'ll have to let you know how it runs.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43461, 'f1286f3502', '', 'thanks DT :-) \r\n\r\nyou\'re smoking in every scene yet I seem to go through more packs of smokes crazydave lol\r\n\r\nand yea, I threw in a 2.6 I got from bitchar-gmotors a long time ago - that thing just instantly whined and cried, it musta been painful so I took it right back out lol (always had a few of them happen like that from bcgmotors though)\r\n\r\nso I stuck a big block from EM in there and it\'s stupid fast lol\r\nit\'s awesome though because I can throw that thing into so many whacked out positions that are just straight up unsafe, it\'s great.\r\nI\'ll try and get some video some time soon.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43462, '1a24458cb8', '', '[b:1a24458cb8]If You Don\'t Like The Effect, Don\'t Produce The Cause[/b:1a24458cb8]\r\n\r\n[b:1a24458cb8]It was cool, but can you imagine Dooby\'n yo Funk ! WEFUNK We Funk ![/b:1a24458cb8]\r\n\r\n[b:1a24458cb8]Sir Nose D\'void-A-Funk[/b:1a24458cb8]\r\n\r\n[b:1a24458cb8]They say the bigger the headache, the bigger the pill[/b:1a24458cb8]\r\n\r\nI hear ya Dog !  Those were da times !  That was our in da basement, smoke a joint, turn on da black light groove right there.  But you can\'t leave out Bootsy\'s Rubber Band, Cameo &amp; da BarKays!  A different kinda Funk, but funk none da less!\r\n\r\nMy All time travelin high music was Steely Dan....\r\n[b:1a24458cb8]Black Cow, FM (no static at all), Do It Again, Deacon Blues,The Fez, Josie[/b:1a24458cb8], Da List goes on...........');
