INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43500, '448dc50f87', '', 'payaso.. we gotta get our Porsches drivin\' as a team, kickin\' ass all over the track! That looks great.. it\'s so clean. I really dig the silver and black combo.\r\n\r\nhog, that\'s my favorite car of yours... that chassis is a beast and paintjob is perfect for that Trans Am body. A friend of my dad\'s had a T/A back in the day (\'78 or \'79) with a custom painjob that was sick... deep candy purple, like, 30 coats of lacquer. Yours reminds me of that one.\r\n\r\nAll you mods kicked ass... this was the most exciting finish line for a bitPimps contest I\'ve seen. Lots of surprises and beautiful work... y\'all tore it up! I feel sorry for the judges, I wouldn\'t wanna be in their shoes... d\'oh!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43501, '5b77a37399', '', 'dave: i wouldnt have been able to do this if hadnt seen each and every monster that you have put out over the past few years. ive impressed myself. it looks like it came from the store(-1 dink on the drivers side window). what it can it do? ah it wont jump off the ground, but itl smoke any old lady that would happen to be driving along my floor.\r\n\r\nbruce: payaso started that a few days ago and im sure he will finish up today uh or something.\r\n\r\n\r\nmicromatch, cj,betty,hue,superfly,ph2t : you guys kick ass. thanks for makin me sweat bullets.');
