INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43504, 'dda2c4a4b4', '', '[quote:dda2c4a4b4="ph2t"]Cabo, could you please put a gallery together for all the entries like you have done with the other comps to make it easier to review the cars?\r\n\r\nthanks dood!\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:dda2c4a4b4]payaso\'s got us covered homey\r\n\r\nhere\'s the forum gallery.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3683\r\n\r\n\r\nslick entries boys - they all look fantastic and tough at the same time.\r\ngood luck fellas.\r\n\r\nthanks to the judges and pimps who set up the contest, provide the absolutely insane prizes and make us have fun.\r\n\r\nthanks to the rest of you pimps for giving us a community un-matched by any other and giving us the inspiration to do keep modding.\r\n\r\n :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43505, '655bbfef3c', '', 'I am so glad Hog used that new Trans Am, and he painted it to!  Greeat job man, tha looks like a mullet fan club choice #1!  Mean and full of trailer glam.  To answer CD \r\n[url]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3665[/url]\r\nShe just came onto the market.\r\n\r\nPayaso, Holy hell what a nice Porsche.  Great to see a twin for hue\'s blazin baby.  It\'s good to see th Hue isn\'t an untouchable God in his skillz. :eek: \r\n\r\nOh and the Co-Op from CW&amp;CD  That car put a smile to my face.  What an awsome ride and to be done like tha made it so cool.  I have always heard about people wanting to do tha, but never actually seen a finished result.  /salute guys.\r\n\r\nAs for the judges....... GL this is by far the best competition this web site (and dare I say this hobby) has ever seen.  The total package, amazing prizes, revolutionary entries.  Thankfully there are a pant load of prizes so evern 4th&amp;5th place gets somthing totally kick ass.  Great job all, inspireing from beggining to end.\r\n\r\n:EDIT: Although I do wish Nox would have posted some new ride, or even that Old Willies he has, that thing looked so mean.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43506, 'bab7cb222d', '', 'I like the dude on the right... thinkin\' he\'s all badass with his Cadillac grille and wire wheels,  totally rubberneckin\'... \r\n\r\n "I thought [i:bab7cb222d]I[/i:bab7cb222d] was the shiznit :sad: "');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43507, '2e885d0410', '', 'i grew up right next to the willys/overland plant. its pretty much closed down now since chrysler built a new plant a few miles away a few years back.  \r\n\r\nI used to play at Willys park every day. i come from the land where jeeps are built haha. im gona have to get to work on one o those pretty soon.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43508, 'f250839251', '', 'Now that the contest is over, and the judging has started, I\'d just like to say thanks to all..\r\n\r\nThanks to all the members that make this site #1. Without you guys, it\'s just me, and Cabo BSing like day 1\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks to all the sponsors that held this contest for us. It\'s a real treat for us to be able to compete on our own stomping ground..\r\n\r\nI can\'t wait to see how the judges handle this one.  It was great fun building em that\'s for sure...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks again guys... :-) \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43509, 'f0a38f950c', '', 'lol im lovin that thing \r\nall that needs is a little nitruos bottle under the seats and you\'ll be the first to get to the green...lol :lol:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43510, '7be4af7ef6', '', 'here we go again\r\nyou have until the end of May to get your votes in.\r\n\r\nHere\'s your choices:\r\n[img:7be4af7ef6]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/thumb_28_miva_1.jpg[/img:7be4af7ef6]\r\nMiva (04-Apr-04)\r\n\r\n[img:7be4af7ef6]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/thumb_29_geisem_1.jpg[/img:7be4af7ef6]\r\nGeisem (11-Apr-04)\r\n\r\n[img:7be4af7ef6]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/thumb_30_sinned_1.jpg[/img:7be4af7ef6]\r\nSinned (18-Apr-04)\r\n\r\n[img:7be4af7ef6]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/thumb_31_hirotor34_1.jpg[/img:7be4af7ef6]\r\nHirotoR34 (25-Apr-04)\r\n\r\n\r\n[b:7be4af7ef6]edit:[/b:7be4af7ef6]\r\nSinned wins\r\n\r\n\r\nyou can always check out past months winners here:\r\n[url=http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/thumbnails.php?album=27][b:7be4af7ef6][u:7be4af7ef6]bitPimps Ride of the Month Winners[/u:7be4af7ef6][/b:7be4af7ef6][/url]');
