INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43513, 'af1e86150a', '', 'Good eye bird....lol  That just happens to be my new Bandit..\r\n\r\nLong story short. I got the Traxxas Bandit brand new RTR off this dude on ebay for $25 shipped.. That\'s right, same price as a ZZ SE.\r\n\r\nIt\'s really a cool buggy, and once I get some hop ups, it\'ll run with the big dogs.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43514, 'b24d65ddb9', '', 'lol You\'ll love the Bandit. I\'ve had a Rustler for years, same exact design, just a truck. Tons of fun. I put some Pro-Line speed hawg street tires on it and whipped it all over the place before I fried everything.\r\n\r\nI need to score some new electronics for mine to bring it back... maybe sometime this year lol.\r\n\r\nNext time 219 comes up with his cam I\'ll snap a few pics of it for ya.\r\n\r\n$25? Great score, for sure.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43515, '4c52a05c31', '', 'Nice ride Payaso!!  I\'m assuming the Jeep is electric?  Not very knowlegable on anything bigger than an Xmod. :-(   Never really had the chance to get into RC\'s when I was younger, so I\'m making up for it.  \r\nBIT BY BIT  &lt;&lt;&lt;:smile: \r\n\r\n$25, thats awsome!!!  I love EBAY!!! :grin: \r\n\r\nI bought about $200 worth of Xmod stuff off of Ebay last month and saved over $75++!!!  All new stuff, not used!!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:4c52a05c31="Bird"]Next time 219 comes up with his cam I\'ll snap a few pics of it for ya.[/quote:4c52a05c31]\r\n\r\nWhat if I change my name to sg219 1/2, do I still have to bring the camera?  I won\'t be 219 anymore....\r\n\r\nOr maybe I don\'t wanna bring the camera, maybe I wanna bring a 40oz. :smile:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43516, 'c9710df34e', '', 'aaaight 219 1/2 + a 40oz.... whatever. You saw payasos vid... that jeep is fire breathin nitro, fool!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43517, '9893076a38', '', 'Yeah, definately, thanks for putting up this contest. I thought I had retired from contest when I became a mod, so it was great to get into the spirit of competition one more time. Also thanks to all the members that post here, and make bitPimps the great place it is.\r\n\r\n\r\nPayaso, 25 bucks?! :eek: \r\nI\'d call that a deal. I also forgot to say how nice your Porshe looked. Very clean looking, but I feel funny now, cause I think I\'m the only one that left my wing on.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43518, '70bdf7dcc0', '', '[quote:70bdf7dcc0="hogjowlz"]ok i had to get this kit. why did those tit-turds have to come out with another classic?[/quote:70bdf7dcc0]That\'s what I\'m saying...\r\n\r\nSo what is the catolog number, hog?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43519, 'b073e29409', '', '600-7537 is on the upc (60-7537 should be the cat #)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43520, 'e2c14a0ecc', '', '[quote:e2c14a0ecc="Sdog"]If I\'m looking at the right number on the package its...Part # 600-7537[/quote:e2c14a0ecc]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43521, 'c83f5941cf', '', 'Now if everone has seen Hogs new classic Trans Am in the moderators contest you know that RS has a new body set out.\r\n\r\n60-7537 Pontiac Trans Past &amp; Present for $4.99\r\n\r\nSome stores have these and the site doesn\'t have pictures or links yet. I\'ll keep watching it though.\r\n\r\nIf you are a truck fan and Ford at that keep an eye out for .\r\n\r\n60-7042 Red Ford F-150  $19.99 and\r\n60-7043 Silver Ford F-150 $19.99\r\n\r\nBased on prices these are NOT se\'s.  Same as the body kit no pics yet but will as I find them or someone beats me to it.\r\n :-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43522, '0eb762813d', 'Help: making a monster', 'uhmm will i mounted big wheels on my se and its so0o slow.. i have the fastest zipzap moter in there.. do you guys no of ne mods that will make it have more tork (or go faster)? besides mosfet?\r\nthanks\r\n\r\nSky');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43523, '83fcd8c37c', '', 'Well guys what can I say?   The work shown here is just absolutely amazing!   I can\'t get over the fact that detail put into these rides is even possible at times...  Each ride has a sense of uniqueness that makes each car a collectors item fo\' sure!\r\n\r\nI think one of the main things that comes of contests like this is that people become empowered to want to achieve what you guys have.   This brings more people into the scene and makes us challange what we already know to bring on new and better things....\r\n\r\nI was going to offer up a prize as well.  I was going to be a custom peak charger for bits, with selectable charging currents and battery settings (single, daul, etc...).  Unfortunately development of this charger didn\'t meet with the timeline of this comp. (EG: I bought a madforce and now I\'m just slack...).  I will finish the beast, soon!\r\n\r\nSo instead I\'m gonna offer up a biff turbo kit as my prize.  I know it\'s not much, but hey, it\'s something, lol....\r\n\r\n[img:83fcd8c37c]http://users.tpg.com.au/ph2t/fet/fet_pcb_installed.JPG[/img:83fcd8c37c]\r\n\r\nWell done once again pimps.. :-) \r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43524, '067177aec9', '', 'RS is making me so mad. :mad:\r\n\r\nI\'m already having problems with the idea of coughing up 20 just to get a Jeep body, don\'t need the chassis, then they pull this with the F-150. Now I either have to decide, or buy both.  :sad: \r\n\r\nThank god the TA is just a body set.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43525, '3b01544354', '', 'i\'ve been keeping a low profile here so i didn\'t have to type "that\'s the best bit i seen!!" every time! :smile:  now it\'s all done i wanna say, you bastards!! here\'s me thinking "yeah sure, judging a mod comp will be fun" but now i realise i gotta tough job ahead!\r\ncongrats are already in order for all involved, i\'m sure news of this comp is around the globe securing this site\'s position as the most dopin\' rc site on da ball!! :cool: \r\nok now don\'t bother me, i gotta get bizzi :search:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43526, '9e766efc5e', '', 'um, the downhill mod.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43527, 'f5d97b2425', '', '[quote:f5d97b2425="betty.k"]um, the downhill mod.[/quote:f5d97b2425]\r\n\r\nYes, I\'ll have to agree with betty.  The downhill mod.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43528, '088264c23b', '', 'and that would be?\r\n\r\nsky');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43529, 'c40dae6444', '', 'hell the best prize was getting us all off our duffs and forcing us to step up the plate extra hard. i know we all got plenty o bs going on in our real lives so knowing i can count on my homeys on here is pretty releiving.  since last night ive come up with 3 new projects that i must get done!! you assholes making me come out of retirment was a mistake cuz now im gona keep pumpin shit out thats gona make you cry. \r\n\r\nbit props to cabo wabo in the first place, if it werent for him there wouldnt be none of this.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43530, '4b9599526d', '', '[quote:4b9599526d="Skyline_GTR_34"]and that would be?\r\n\r\nsky[/quote:4b9599526d]\r\n\r\nThat would be where you create a nice steep slope and then push the SE monster down it. :-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43531, 'f87de01c22', 'whos eyin what?', 'all that shit is dope but im sure we each got our heart set on different shit. what you guys droolin over?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43532, '010691420d', '', 'the radiosnack i goto is fairly busy being in the middle of a business district. they only got one ta set. im lucky to have grabbed it, actually if i wasnt thinking with my dick i wouldnt have goten it yesterday. i ran the ta outside today in the sunlight and oh my god is the color so fucking cool. \r\n\r\nit just screams "buttrock"');
