INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43580, '63f0582354', '', '[quote:63f0582354="sg219"]\r\nPosted: Thu Feb 19, 2004 12:30 am    Post subject:     \r\n\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n \r\nMaybe the prize for the Moderater contest could be a months supply of Assorted Ramen Noodles? \r\n\r\nHow about a BitPimp World Day of Ramen Noodles Celebration? \r\n\r\nMaybe a Centralized Continental Ramen-Pimp of the Year Convention? \r\n\r\nFind the central point for all the pimps in the US and Canada. (somewhere like Jaimaca or some other Tropical Island!!) Proably somewhere in northcentral US. \r\n\r\nThen do the same for the European pimps, (Paris, Bit love is in the air!!!) \r\n\r\nThe Austrailian pimps, (the Bridge behind the big band shell thing you always see when they talk about Aust. on T.V., like the olimpyics. You could drive cars off the bridge to music and Fireworks!!!)and so on. \r\n\r\nEvents as follows; \r\n\r\n1--Bit races all weekend. \r\n\r\n2--Have a Bit girl of the year contest. (Judgeship is elected by "The pimp of the month Forum." 12 judges....Local Girls from newspaper add or enter your own, but it would be nice to have a fresh bunch you\'ll never see after that weekend!!! \r\n\r\n3--Mod demonstrations and how-to-cook Ramen Noodle seminars. \r\n\r\n4--Beer Drinking!!!!  \r\n\r\n5--The Swap Meet \r\n\r\n6--Ramen Noodle Contest--Best Recipe--Uniqueness of Recipe \r\n\r\n7--Beer Drinkin\', and other activities that involve things on many different levels!!! \r\n\r\n\r\nBut, you get the idea.........P-A-R-T-Y!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! \r\n\r\n\r\nIf anyone would be serious in actually havin\' a big Pimp-n-Hoes party somewhere, let\'s make it happen. [/quote:63f0582354]\r\n\r\n\r\nI threw this up awhile ago...........heres the thread....\r\n\r\n[url]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3121&amp;start=15[/url]');
