INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43821, '30a6ec4403', 'single cab', 'thanks for the correction on the body style! I did get the te bus in the other day, and even thought about cutting up one of the sheels to do a quick single cab from it but decided against it, i cant give up on this project i already started! ic-dub i will have enought resin to cast hella vw single cabs so i can make a crunchy,or a street racer, or even a lowrider pimpin style with the three wheel. its all good! I am running into a little problem here though, i cant decide if the single cab should have the inside of the bed higher than it is now, the thing is that i am unable to use the pcb cover at this time, i could raise the bed liner flush with the top of the bed and utilize the pcb cover but it may look funky or odd, i am think more along the lines of excepting that it will not have a cover on the pcb, but if anyone wants to get a clo9ne of this bus what would they like for it?\r\n\r\nthanks for the ideas which is what keeps me inspired with the lenghtly project. i am sure that the rewards will be worth it...\r\n\r\n\r\njmays');
