INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43879, '20a6a8d78c', '', 'Yeah....this gots to be one of the best hook up finds ever Finks. \r\n\r\nI hit three Shaq\'s on the way home from work. I\'m really into the zips, so I already had a lot of the stuff other pimps mentioned. I picked up another Fat tire set, a black and red Porsche set (Don\'t care for this set too much. The cars are pretty ugly and sit up sooo high on the chasis).....then I went in to a Shaq I never been in before and came across a bunch of retired stuff. This Shaq must not sell a lot of zips because I found a Blue RX-8 Xmen kit (Retired last December), a silver 350Z kit (Retired last Feb I think), and 4 or 5 body sets with the yellow stang cobra and purple PT cruiser(retired like last June if I remember correctly). They also have a wheel and tire set I haven\'t seen in a while. I snatched up the RX-8 because I\'ve been eyeing them up on Ebay anyway...  That silver 350Z is looking sweet too.\r\n\r\nI\'ll be back at it again tomorrow to get another fat tire set, the stang and pt cruiser body set, and Mercedes/Audi SE body set.');
