INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43952, '842cb401bd', '', 'Ok, here is todays laundry list!!!  Thanks Radio Shack!! :lol: \r\n\r\n1--Camaro Past &amp; Present\r\n1--5pc soldering kit\r\n1--Porsche body set\r\n1--Can of Dust Off\r\n2--Trans Am Past &amp; Present\r\n1--Euro Body set..Merc and Audi\r\n1--Spool of solder braid\r\n3--Dual "AAA" holders\r\n1--Ford F 150\r\n____________________________\r\n\r\nCash spent....$19.42 total!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\nStill got tomarrow!!!!!!!!!!!!! :lol:  :lol:\r\n\r\n\r\nSo far my total is aprox. $110.00 retail and I spent aprox. $23 with coupons!!!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43953, 'a9173678ce', 'Pinion Puller', 'Just picked up a Pinion puller for the Xmod motors and other motors of course!!!!!  Got it today, 3 days shipping from Fredrickburg, VA.\r\n\r\nI tried it out, it works great, I picked it up off of Ebay for $14 and change. \r\n\r\n\r\n[img:a9173678ce]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Stuff/pinionpuller.jpg[/img:a9173678ce]\r\n\r\nIt comes with 3 different size pinion pusher things, a plastic case with spongey foam in it, and directions in Japanese and the ever popular Broken English format. \r\n\r\nI would recommend grabbin\' one if you like to mess with motors, because I can\'t figure out any other way to get a pinion off an Xmod motor!!!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43954, 'f826b99c7f', '', 'i wont spoil it for you, look around the site for youself... :?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43955, '0b8b803fd7', '', 'Aight pimps, we gots da weiners!\r\n\r\nFirst, let me say that all y\'all mods didn\'t let us down! Nice work all, there wasn\'t a lame entry in the bunch. Judging was difficult, but I think the results speak for themselves.\r\n\r\nOf course, the tough part is to come - choosing the prizes!\r\n\r\n[b:0b8b803fd7]First place and first choice belongs to the noob mod Crazy Dave, with his winning Camaro Pro-Stocker. What a beast![/b:0b8b803fd7] \r\n\r\n[img:0b8b803fd7]http://www.grymttr.com/carpix/Contest/contest1.jpg[/img:0b8b803fd7]\r\n\r\n\r\n[b:0b8b803fd7]Second place belongs to O.G. Pimp Payaso, with the Death Cuda. Now go wash your hands after pulling that out of your ass![/b:0b8b803fd7] \r\n\r\n[img:0b8b803fd7]http://www.grymttr.com/carpix/Contest/contest2.jpg[/img:0b8b803fd7]\r\n\r\n\r\n[b:0b8b803fd7]Third place goes to our own Pimp Enforcer, Dark Tari, with his silver AMG. Hammer time, indeed!!![/b:0b8b803fd7] \r\n\r\n[img:0b8b803fd7]http://www.grymttr.com/carpix/Contest/contest3.jpg[/img:0b8b803fd7]\r\n\r\n\r\n[b:0b8b803fd7]Fourth place goes to Hogjowlz, for his headbangin, butt-rockin, Trans-Am.[/b:0b8b803fd7] \r\n\r\n[img:0b8b803fd7]http://www.grymttr.com/carpix/Contest/contest4.jpg[/img:0b8b803fd7]\r\n\r\n\r\n[b:0b8b803fd7]Fifth place goes to our daddy, CaboWabo, for the unique and beautifully executed Road Hog.[/b:0b8b803fd7] \r\n\r\n[img:0b8b803fd7]http://www.grymttr.com/carpix/Contest/contest5.jpg[/img:0b8b803fd7]\r\n\r\n\r\nWell done mods! Rather than having PM\'s flying all over the place, how about if y\'all just post which prize you want. As soon as CD puts up his choice, Payaso puts up his, etc. Then the prize winner and prize provider can hook up and exchange info.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43956, 'bc73f54155', '', 'Yeah... it seems like these cars were well recieved everywhere but there... oh well, their loss. Anyway, it\'s been over a month for mine, and it is just fine, and I drive the living shit out of it lol...\r\n\r\nOh, yeah.. the iWaver site is up finally, too. Not fully done, but it\'s there.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.iwaver.com/');
