INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43971, '19040ac641', '', 'I raise my forty to you guys.Excellant effort and  for raising the bar for the rest of us.Your artistic and engineering marvels will motivate us for months , if not years to come.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43972, 'f5bf48fb7d', '', 'first off congrats dave. every contest ive judged, 1st place was never the hard part.\r\n\r\npayso i liked your other car better. ive had the pleasure of driving that chassis and i know its probably the best single cell racer out there. this dude\'s wheel jobs are rock solid.\r\n\r\ndt your geometry on that thing was striking. pimpin hard dt style. golden rod is a masterpiece as well. and as always, pimpin hard.\r\n\r\nfuck first of all you da man for getting us away from the sea of little kids in the first place. then developing this shit to what it is fookin kicks ass.\r\nwhy the hell didnt you enter this thing?\r\n[img:f5bf48fb7d]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10008/challenger_10.jpg[/img:f5bf48fb7d]\r\nthat car rocked the bit world hard.\r\n\r\n[quote:f5bf48fb7d="hogjowlz"]im sort of in "bit retirment" at the moment. i guess ill have to come out of it and whoop everyone\'s ass.\r\n[/quote:f5bf48fb7d]\r\nwell i made a bad ass car out of it so thank all of you fuckers.\r\n\r\ndudes runnin this contest. you kick ass. we didnt ask for this shit nor expect it.\r\n\r\ni gota say this has been the most fun contest yet.\r\n\r\nword to ya muthas');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43973, '07edd0aef2', '', '[quote:07edd0aef2="hogjowlz"]dude all you had to do was ask and windows could have been on your ftp site.[/quote:07edd0aef2]Oh well, too late now. :lol: \r\n\r\nReally I was against the XP thing, I thought the ether net card would have solved it, but that\'s what happens when you send the wife to Staples with the MOL :lol: \r\n\r\nI did get a deal on a sound card. Found a SB 16 PCI for $17 on the clearance table. At least something went right.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43974, '3685c158c2', '', '[quote:3685c158c2="payaso"]Where you at Dave?[/quote:3685c158c2]Over here man. :-) \r\n\r\nWow, I can\'t believe I pulled it off.  :-D \r\n\r\nWell I\'m just honored as hell to have won, but the real prize was pushing myself farther, and seeing what I can do, now with that out of the way, I can imagine other things, and see other possiblities. So thanks to everyone, for helping me see the possibilities.\r\n\r\nNow you bastards have left me with a chore, your prizes are just so damn kick ass, that not only did I have to push myself harder just to top the prizes, but now I have to choose, this sucks.  \r\n\r\nI\'ll have a an answer by morning...I think. :?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43975, '620382e459', '', 'Ok guys, last chance to call dibs. \r\n\r\nI\'m really open, they\'re all cool prizes, so if there\'s something you really want let me know now. \r\n\r\nI feel awkward. I like to try to win, but I\'m really not used to actually winning stuff. So I don\'t know what to say, but congrats guys, you made a great showing, and Cabo, you\'re right, it must have been rigged...alright who paid off who?');
