INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43992, 'd988f247c0', '', 'Auight Pimp\'s!\r\n\r\nPut this one in Da Books!  Congrats to al the winners (were there any loosers???)\r\n[b:d988f247c0]Dave[/b:d988f247c0]- Dat Bit is Da Shit, when you posted the finished product I knew it was 1st place without a doubt.\r\n[b:d988f247c0]Silla[/b:d988f247c0]- Great unique job!  Muscle mania rules!\r\n[b:d988f247c0]DarkTari[/b:d988f247c0] - Oh that\'s me! yadayadayada...\r\n[b:d988f247c0]Hog[/b:d988f247c0] - I was really hopin to see Bert Reynolds posin by dat bad ass Bit. "Boy U In A Heap-O-Trouble"  Great job !\r\n[b:d988f247c0]C-Dub[/b:d988f247c0] - As always, the craftsmanship on this was awsome. U were the 1st, as most always along with Cavey to do something unique with body modding.\r\n\r\nNow to all involved in throwin dis contest, we really appreciate da time, effort &amp; especially da PRIZES U Pimps offered.  We have to have the best bunch of Pimps of all the Bit sites out there.  It shows that you really appreciate what we do here. \r\n\r\nNow for my choice: I had my eye on Hue\'s donation as soon as I saw it.  That Bit turned out Kick-Ass !  Also BK\'s rockin azz Hummer was next on my list, I guess Silla helped me make up my mind but then pht2 offered a prize that I\'m getting more info on (full chassis or circuit board) . I should know by COB today!  Sorry for da delay Pimp\'s. Don\'t talk about me too bad, like I care :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44074, '129026edd6', '', 'Damn LT ! where U been pimp?\r\n\r\nI remember you getting some of his old alloy\'s or was it you? I contacted him and tried but he was all out.  They sell like hotcakes over on the German site! Anyways he told me that he would be coming out with some new one\'s so I guess they\'re finally here!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43994, '1350f62b16', '', 'Damn that game is hard. When I first started  playing I was like wtf do they want me to do. I quit and went to a walkthrough. To beat it without the walkthrough I think would be impossible. The last thing you have to do is put some stuff on the shelf. It is like a frame and a candle and a beer. It has to be perfect and if the beer isn\'t cold enough you don\'t beat the game. You have to make the beer colder by putting it in the fridge.\r\n\r\nPayaso, have you beat it?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (43995, '737fa17a1a', 're:', 'Nice looking cast.\r\n\r\nIf you haven\'t ordered it already I\'d advise not picking up any clear resin unless you are using a pressure pot. If you\'re not you\'ll end up with a bunch of bubbles in the cast.\r\n\r\nIf the desire is to have clear windows I would suggest modifying one of the copies by removing the windows then repouring either the male or female portion of the mold.  You\'ll have a windowless body and it should be easy to make up some wndows out of clear plastic sheet stock.  \r\n\r\n...and then there\'s making up a mold to use for vacu-forming complete windshields....but we\'ll hold off on that for now  :)');
