INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44032, '02354cc85a', '', 'Damn Hue! Thats ....wait, let me add it...1,2,3,4....that\'s like $105 beans worth of coupons...nice job.\r\n\r\nI just hit three shaqs on the way home from work the past three days. Here is my booty count:\r\n\r\n- 1 SE European Sports Body Kit (had to thrown in 2 bones for that)\r\n- 1 SE Muscle Car Power Upgrade Kit (Already had one, but what the hell, cost me 8 bones)\r\n- 1 Mazda Rx-8 Kit (retired) (Cost me 15 bones)\r\n- 1 Purple PT Cruiser and Yellow Stang Body Kit (retired)\r\n- 1 German Imports Body Kit\r\n- 1 Camaro Past and Present Body Kit\r\n- 1 Custom Tire and Hubcap Kit\r\n- 2 Fatty Custom Tire and Wheel Kits\r\n\r\nTotal savings = 45 bones....thanks Finks\r\n\r\nI actually had a guy at one of the Radio Shacks recognize me today. He said, **insert geeky voice here** "I just want to point out that these coupons are one per customer and you were here yesterday...so I\'ll have to take your name." I said, "Whatever". Then he rings up the sale, gives me the free shit and doesn\'t bother to take down my name. What the hell was that all about?!?! Silly, silly puss...did he think I would just say nevermind and walk away?');
