INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44038, '54b15137c9', '', 'I forgot to mention (I eluded but didn\'t elaborate)...\r\n\r\ndon\'t let this post scare ya.\r\nand please - as a moderator - do not let this information out.\r\ndon\'t scare our members away until it\'s time.\r\n\r\nmy post above is meant as "insider information".\r\nit\'s a real issue we\'re facing.\r\nbut it\'s not impending. it doesn\'t have to happen.\r\nthe only reason why I posted that was because of 2 things:\r\n1.) I need help with ideas, I\'m out of them and I don\'t have a lot of energy right now to focus towards this due to other life shit.\r\n2.) I feel as moderators, you need to know where we stand. Communication is the key in any relationship whether it be with your woman or with your homies. And doing with text on a screen makes it a 1000 times harder. So I just want you guys to know what I do - that\'s it.\r\n\r\nremember.\r\nkeep your mouth shut for now.\r\nlet\'s discuss our possibilities / options between us for now.\r\nif the need arises, we\'ll make it public, but for now - there is no need.\r\nI know a lot of you dudes got pals that aren\'t moderators, but they\'re good pals, I\'m still asking you to please keep this hush-hush for now.\r\n\r\nthanks pimps');
