INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44041, 'd9914c62ed', 'I\'m gonna try something...', 'Tomorrow, I might (my dad told me to use the word MIGHT...well not really, but what the hell) be going to RadioShack to get some magnet wire, as shown in this link:\r\n\r\nhttp://www.radioshack.com/product.asp?catalog%5Fname=CTLG&amp;category%5Fname=CTLG%5F011%5F010%5F004%5F000&amp;product%5Fid=278%2D1345\r\n\r\nSo, I\'m a little itchy to wind a low turn, but as everyone knows, low turns pull more current, and that could fry the FETs....But I\'m too fucking lazy to get FETs from online. \r\n\r\nSo, I was thinking of winding double or triple turns...Any advice? Any sciency explanations on how it works...(ph2t? cyborgzero? crazydave? I could use some advice here...)\r\n\r\nOk, I\'m done ranting. :lol:');
