INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44088, '416e32e0e8', '', '[quote:416e32e0e8="Bird"]I would once again like to thank Finks for letting us all know about this, and a big thanks goes out to my ace, sg219, for printing up all the coupons and mapping and driving on the trips... that was too funny when you were handing out the coupons in the stores, man.. classic.[/quote:416e32e0e8]\r\n\r\nNo problem Bird!!!  \r\n\r\nBird knows the story....but I thought I\'d tell it.......\r\n\r\nI don\'t mind drivin\' as long as I don\'t get flats, like on yesterdays Shack Trip!!!  I had a tire blow out on me and didn\'t have my floor jack with me, because I\'ve been helping sooooo many people move in the past few weeks, and the only way to jack my van up is with a floor jack because of the running boards!!!  Had to call up a buddy and he came out with a jack that didn\'t fit under the van unless I lifted it up a few inches, (yes, i have super human beer muscles!!) then trying to crank the 5hitty jack was a whole different story!! :-(   Got it changed and back on the road with a donut tire and then went to.....two Shacks, McD\'s, Gas station, Iced tea station, Beer station, and finally home!!!  The whole trip was out away from home too....I was on the distant Shack Run when this happened!!!\r\n\r\n\r\nIf it wasn\'t for a couple of situations I would of used about 10 or more coupons in the last 3 days but.....\r\n\r\nDay 1---3 were closed when I got there, city type stores, close @ 6pm\r\nDay 2--Tire problem, cash problem\r\nDay 3--Bird had to be in when the street lights came on!!!! :???:  :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\nHit almost every different Shack in the Greater Pittsburgh Area!!!!  8-)');
