INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44186, '61ae73989c', 'q', 'i hear ya like everyone will vote for there own cars right, even if they did what would be the one vote made by myself for my car, ect ect with 600 pimps, he with the most votes win. there has to be a way, i am sure that i am not the only one here that would have liked to join in on that contest, but its like at my job they managers park in a covered area and the indians have to park in the sun, I f you make the rules were u cant vote for your own car, i am sure that there are a lot of honest ppl out here that would follow the rules, if not, well we cant do anything about that person who voted for his own. idunno but its still feels like i am not part of this great sight. sorry if i am protrudeing and i know that i am a new person here, just say the word and i will go! its all good and i am sure that i have not made many freinds here will post like this, u moderatores are the top dogs here, u have already won. i am a manager at my job and do park in the covered area but for a while there last summer i stayed in the sun with the others, the only reason why i started parking in the manager area was that my car or bus is 36 years old and had 13 leaky windows, so i started to try and take care of that car, this does not mean that i feel to good to park with the others.\r\n\r\nagain u guys are great and i love your skills, dont get the wrong idea please, about my point of view which is all its supposed to be, imo\r\n\r\nI love this sight u guys rock , lets play together...lol\r\n\r\n\r\njmays');
