INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44190, 'ab0d9f2641', 'Re: contest', '[quote:ab0d9f2641="jmays"]you moderators have some nice cars there! Great work, what else would have been expected from the moderators though, the last i checked there were 608 pimps registered here, i dont know how many actually perticipate but thats alot of ppl to say oh this contest is just for the creatores and maitainers of the sight, so the 600 pipms are excluded, i know that there are contest for use but why should there be seperate contest, just one contest as a whole would be great were we all with moderators can enter as a group, I THINK THAT WE ALL SHOULD BE A GROUP AND NOT SEPERATED! I know that we 600 pimps are cool so why cant we play with the big boys, whats up!\r\n\r\njmays[/quote:ab0d9f2641] \r\n\r\nI think I get what you\'re saying...maybe you haven\'t been here long enough get why the mod contest was a cool thing (I noticed you joined just before the mod contest got started). Let me try to explain...\r\n\r\nLast year, Cabo &amp; the mods put together five contests for ALL us pimps. They spent a lot of time putting the contests together, building custom prizes or payin\' for prizes outta their pocket. And the killer was, since they were hosting the contests, they couldn\'t enter them. So, a handful of us decided to run with an idea micromatch had, and give a little somethin\' back. We thought it was time for the guys who give, give some more and keep on givin\', to do some takin\' for a change... so they got their own contest. \r\n\r\nThe regular contests will resume, and you should enter the shit outta those contests... I think if you\'d have joined a year earlier, you\'d agree that it was time for the mods to have their turn. \r\n\r\nAll that said, if you really wanna stand by your ideals, you should start your own site... bitHippies. I bet it would be a really nice place.');
