INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44198, '4cbf48efaf', '', '[quote:4cbf48efaf]jmays wrote: \r\nyou moderators have some nice cars there! Great work, what else would have been expected from the moderators though, the last i checked there were 608 pimps registered here, i dont know how many actually perticipate but thats alot of ppl to say oh this contest is just for the creatores and maitainers of the sight, so the 600 pipms are excluded, i know that there are contest for use but why should there be seperate contest, just one contest as a whole would be great were we all with moderators can enter as a group, I THINK THAT WE ALL SHOULD BE A GROUP AND NOT SEPERATED! I know that we 600 pimps are cool so why cant we play with the big boys, whats up! \r\n\r\njmays [/quote:4cbf48efaf]\r\n\r\n[quote:4cbf48efaf]thats alot of ppl to say oh this contest is just for the creatores and maitainers of the sight, so the 600 pipms are excluded [/quote:4cbf48efaf]\r\n\r\nThis particular contest was given BY THE PIMPs for the moderators period! In appreciation for all WE as moderators do. No one else was to participate, those were Da Rules! \r\n\r\n \r\n[quote:4cbf48efaf]i know that there are contest for use but why should there be seperate contest, [/quote:4cbf48efaf]\r\nGoddamn man, what is the big deal ? It was a [b:4cbf48efaf]MODERATORS CONTEST! [/b:4cbf48efaf](are you a moderator?) 1st fuckin time ever, take it for what it\'s worth! \r\n\r\n[quote:4cbf48efaf] I THINK THAT WE ALL SHOULD BE A GROUP AND NOT SEPERATED! I know that we 600 pimps are cool so why cant we play with the big boys, whats up[/quote:4cbf48efaf]! \r\nYou\'ll know when you\'re in a contest with [b:4cbf48efaf]The Big Boys![/b:4cbf48efaf] Every contest we give are participated by [b:4cbf48efaf]Da Big Boys[/b:4cbf48efaf]! in Da Hood . \r\n\r\nWhat is it with this Glory Trip you\'re on? U joined less than 3 months ago, and already you\'ve bitch\'d about the Ride-O-Da Week, now it\'s the Moderators Contest ! [b:4cbf48efaf]You need 2 Fuckin Chill [/b:4cbf48efaf]! \r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php?cat=4\r\n_________________\r\nDarkTari \r\nBitPimp Enforcer \r\nYou Ain\'t Pimpin without the Babes!!! \r\n \r\nBack to top');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44194, '4f023ccb29', 'Re: q', '[quote:4f023ccb29="jmays"]i hear ya like everyone will vote for there own cars right, even if they did what would be the one vote made by myself for my car, ect ect with 600 pimps, he with the most votes win. there has to be a way, i am sure that i am not the only one here that would have liked to join in on that contest, but its like at my job they managers park in a covered area and the indians have to park in the sun, I f you make the rules were u cant vote for your own car, i am sure that there are a lot of honest ppl out here that would follow the rules, if not, well we cant do anything about that person who voted for his own. idunno but its still feels like i am not part of this great sight. sorry if i am protrudeing and i know that i am a new person here, just say the word and i will go! its all good and i am sure that i have not made many freinds here will post like this, u moderatores are the top dogs here, u have already won. i am a manager at my job and do park in the covered area but for a while there last summer i stayed in the sun with the others, the only reason why i started parking in the manager area was that my car or bus is 36 years old and had 13 leaky windows, so i started to try and take care of that car, this does not mean that i feel to good to park with the others.\r\n\r\nagain u guys are great and i love your skills, dont get the wrong idea please, about my point of view which is all its supposed to be, imo\r\n\r\nI love this sight u guys rock , lets play together...lol\r\n\r\n\r\njmays[/quote:4f023ccb29]\r\n\r\nSorry to pick on you dude, but Jesus Christ... are you kidding with this parking lot shit? Believe me, you\'re overthinkin\' that shit.. way overthinkin\' it. Just park your fuckin\' car and go to work... god damn.\r\n\r\nDude, this isn\'t a hippie commune love fest. That shit just ain\'t gonna work here... this place is too diverse, and don\'t forget the PIMP theme. I think the way it\'s been here is the way it will always be... you get the respect you earn, and if you act like a pud, yer gonna get a pounding. There will be many contests for you to enter, so get over it... THERE HAS ONLY BEEN ONE CONTEST YOU COULDN\'T ENTER, AND THAT CONTEST IS OVER.');
