INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44256, 'a80a4058db', '', 'i\'d personally go over all the cars before selling them. i know of 2 local pimps with them. one guy says there\'s no problem with his but brendan 123 has a dud which he\'s sending to me for repairs. i\'ll tell you what i find out. as mentioned the soldering is sloppy, my vw bus had headlights rather messily added. i\'ve had all the problems you mentioned in the past buying lxx cars, the rear wheels are rarely straight and i\'ve even had half moulded pinions, the list goes on. but after a good going over they run fine. i just worry about kids who buy them expecting them to be perfect and this might be their only bit. it\'s ok for pimps like us with tons of spares and the smarts to fix them but if a kid is buying just one then i\'d steer them towards a tomy or at least go over the whole car and tx before handing it over.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44261, '6bb6855d9b', '', 'i did a search for "little tiny remote controlled cars" and came across ausmicro. this was my introduction to not only the hobby, but the net, forums and homepages. bitpimps was in the links section so i checked it out for a while and after ph2t urged me to join i did.');
