INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44269, '48dfcb634c', '', 'The problem I have with that suggestion is shipping.  Everytime that Micro is shipped to a different \r\nPimp for whatever, it costs $4.00-$7.00, that plus the price of the Micro itself will add up!  \r\nWe don\'t want to put too much ($$$ &amp; Time) into these or we won\'t get the return on our investment. \r\nI like the FET, maybe dual cell idea for a couple of special Micro\'s to see what they will fetch on Da Block. \r\nBut the main thing is to not put too much into these.  Now we gotta make every one of them look Pimp, \r\nlike Da Shit everyone wants and will bid to get!\r\n\r\nKeep stormin Hog  8) \r\n\r\n[b:48dfcb634c]UPDATE:[/b:48dfcb634c]\r\n\r\nTook LilMatrix to see Van Helsing today, Good Movie!  Anyways we went walking in da mall when I ran\r\n across a [b:48dfcb634c]5below[/b:48dfcb634c] store.  I remember a Pimp mentioning this a while back, well I got one within driving \r\ndistance now, all kindza great shit in there including these I picked up for $5.00ea......\r\n[img:48dfcb634c]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10005/normal_DSC01794.JPG[/img:48dfcb634c]\r\nThese are some of the best Clones out there (I like Shens the best) so they\'ll be a great start.  \r\nWhadaya Think?\r\n\r\nI\'ll get to workin on these and will update.....\r\nAlso picked up a Homie Poster for $5.00 which shows all the series...');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44270, '1518563bd8', '', 'damn dude nice score. i dont think shipping will kill if we do lots of 5 or so instead of shipping each car. \r\n whichever. if we just wana come up with a few a piece that should suffice.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44271, '91594191fc', 'motor', 'there are four kit racers and they do have the 3.0 motor in one set it will be labled on the back of the box as m-3, these kits also offer like 5 differant heat sinks and they are aluminum, blue coated, basic, brown coated, and curved. so thats it good for parts.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44272, '287bb79451', '', '[quote:287bb79451]if we just wana come up with a few a piece that should suffice.[/quote:287bb79451]\r\n\r\nIf you\'re suggesting that each one of us do their own thing (whatever that may be) to a few (2-3) Micro\'s and put\'em on Da Block, I\'m [b:287bb79451]totally[/b:287bb79451] for that idea. That way we\'ll have at least 1 per week in the coming months to auction on Da Block!\r\n\r\nGreat Stormin Hog  8-) \r\n\r\nCan everyone get a hold of some cheap (price) Micros ??');
