INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44278, '6f6bc37b5d', 'Week #20 2004', 'Now for this weeks RODW.  This is a very Special Micro. Scratch built and went as 2nd Place Prize \r\nin the [b:6f6bc37b5d]BitPimp Moderators Contest[/b:6f6bc37b5d].....\r\n\r\nBuilder: [b:6f6bc37b5d]Hue35[/b:6f6bc37b5d]\r\nNew Owner: [b:6f6bc37b5d]Silla (Payaso)[/b:6f6bc37b5d]\r\n[b:6f6bc37b5d]09-May-04[/b:6f6bc37b5d]\r\n\r\n[img:6f6bc37b5d]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10010/15.jpg[/img:6f6bc37b5d]\r\n[img:6f6bc37b5d]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10010/16.jpg[/img:6f6bc37b5d]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44279, '5497236764', '', 'I need to stop being lazy when I check my email... I usually just go through msn messenger because it\'s quicker than going through the msn site... anyway, last night, I was checking my mail, and before the program it runs through was loaded, there he was... Sup, bird?.... Awwwwww, FUCK!!!... So here I am shootin\' the breeze with Goku, and he\'s all "What does betty.k have against me?" And I\'m just like, dude, don\'t take shit so seriously... he\'s probly just havin\' a little fun is all... and then RIGHT at that moment, cubby edits his post in that thread.... and Goku is trippin! "hogjowlz fucking hates me!!! Why does he always do this to me?!!!".... I\'m like Goku, dude.... you really need to lighten up... that is some funny shit, and you know it... you need to learn to recognize the difference between serious hatin\' and people cutting up... So I change the subject, and start asking if he robbed any Shaqs coupon style, and point out to him that he missed out, but there is a new coupon on the zz site, so he disappears for a bit, and me, not being one to leave someone hangin\', even him, I stick around to see what\'s up...\r\n\r\nGoku is a ballsy ass little fucker... He was in the other room arguing with his pops about needin\' some money for the new zz deal... and his dad goes into this big speech about how he needs to learn the value of money, and quit wasting his money on micros and shit... Goku was not havin\' it.. I give the kid credit for standing up to all of the bullshit that is thrown at him, from us, from people on all of the other forums, and from his parents....\r\n\r\nI seriously think that all of this will eventually make him a better person for having gone through it... But I won\'t hold my breath, because as we all know, he is as thickheaded as he is ballsy.\r\n\r\nOh, yeah, and the little s.o.b. sent me an e-birthday card... Damn, I gotta quit takin\' the lazy route to check my email...');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44280, '5a3935b360', '', 'Cheap micros scarce around here. I grabbed a Charg n Go at Walgreens for six bucks, but the quality was spotty and they only had a couple left. I wish I could come a across a deal like that on some Precious, but I never even see those around. \r\n\r\nIf you guys can score the cars, I\'ll put the money into the FETs.\r\n\r\nMaybe we could split painting duties, there\'s more than one good painter around here, or if you want me to paint them all that\'s cool, but I thought it would be cooler if each car had it\'s own flavor that reflected each of us.\r\n\r\nWe could do a stretched chassis dual cell to fit a Zip Zap muscle car body. A DT styled car with some Euro flavor.  Maybe some will have custom rims some wont, but they\'ll all be one off originals. Ya know what I\'m saying?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44281, '42b783bf1b', '', '[b:42b783bf1b]B.I.N.G.O.![/b:42b783bf1b]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44282, '5262fb6c6c', '', 'Well, the Challenger that hue has probly already shipped off to payaso is the Ride of this Week... deservedly so... I will be heading down to Florida to intercept it at sillas doorstep lol. \r\n\r\nSeriously, though, this bit will probly be one of my favorites for some time to come... onr of the cleanest, best executed jobs I have ever seen. Huge props to hue for building such a beauty, and huge playa hatin\' on payaso for owning it lol.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44283, 'f4159cea28', '', 'Nope... none of the KIT Racers come with a 3.0. I have several of each flavor, the motors are either yellow (2.2) or orange (2.6). Unless it came out in the last few weeks, it doesn\'t exist.');
