INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44288, 'e4f5a0a846', '', 'just to put a note in...\r\nI only want us behind this scheme - no other pimps.\r\nthat means no ph2t stuff, nobody other than us - we got the skills right here within our own group - so lets take advantage of those.\r\n\r\nI think we can do whatever we want. just depends on how we plan it.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44289, 'b68b49df7d', '', '[quote:b68b49df7d="payaso"][quote:b68b49df7d="hue35"]it doesn\'t exist.[/quote:b68b49df7d]\r\n\r\nThey were suppose to though.   I guess they just got out as fast as they got in.\r\n\r\nThere is a product # for em, but they are similar to bigfoot, just alot of rumors, and no real evidence....lol\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D[/quote:b68b49df7d]\r\n\r\nTrue, there are parts listed that never materialized. I was just making the point that you can\'t go to KB and pick up a KIT racer with a 3.0.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44290, '7635c2b2b0', '', 'LOL you fuckers.....\r\n\r\nAny how as for the J thing... heres a classic case of a 35 year old still acting like a freshman in high school offering to carry the jocks books.  Not saying I\'m a Jock in the Hood or anything, but he sent me that Pepboys Civic HB free and he just offered Hog a free cast as well.  Don\'t get me wrong, a very very kind gesture, but shit like this mod contest complaint and bitching about ride of the week after being registered for like what... 1.5 months?!?!  Just hits me wrong.  Now as for his work... it\'s sick!  But his attitude is just not PIMP if you catch my drift.  Bit Hippies was right on the nose Hugh.  I\'ll still get excited when he posts a new project, but as for this club... no vote in from me, not just yet.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44291, 'd39f875131', '', 'Hehe, when I first joined Bit Pimps I always saw Gokou getting cut down and never relaized why, but after about a month I realized what a thick headed little boy he was and ever since then, my tolerance went from high to nonexistant.  You need to block his ass on the MSN Bird, that\'ll fix it.');
