INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44294, '498bc78084', 'kit', 'you are right hue i did some reading on the instruction sheet that came with the kit racer i got and it says that there is a 3.0 only available in an accessory pack sold seperately, so if the local kb has these packs maybe u will get lucky, i think that they are just trying to move this stuff after sitting in the store .either way i picted up a few for parts.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44295, 'e61903d709', '', 'Me, I saw a link at TinyRC about a website called BitPimps that was having a contest. I dropped in and looked around. After a few days I too the time to sign up.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44296, '01a4a056c5', '', 'Of course you know everything good in life is either Illegal, Immoral, Causes Cancer or Fatting.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44297, '7d670a965c', '', 'Yeah I blame Tiny RC.  1st started browsing the web with tiny, but got very aggitated by the same questions being asked by the same 12 year old time and time again.  How many "tricked out" X-mods can you see in one day that\'s only mod is an electrical tape raceing stripe?  Found the BitPimps thread and boom, fell in love.  Now truth be told, I was very intimidated at first due to my Micro RC noobness, but you bitches made me feel right at home.  This site has the most talented and mature micro modders I have seen.  Now I hit Tiny weekly but the hood I hit up multiple times a day. Bottom line, if you are a laidback inventive person that can hang, this is the site for you.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44298, 'f90017e0a4', '', 'it\'s lucky for the mods that this ride wasn\'t an entry! nuff said');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44299, '50d0af5945', '', '[quote:50d0af5945="betty.k"]it\'s lucky for the mods that this ride wasn\'t an entry! nuff said[/quote:50d0af5945]Oh yeah?!?\r\n\r\nI\'m not scared, bring that ol\' Dodge on, I\'ll crush it with my Chevy :cool: \r\n\r\nSeriously though, Hue\'s work is so clean, this car was a huge temptation, as was Betty.K\'s offroader. \r\n\r\nActually in retrospect, maybe it wasn\'t so cool winning this contest, because I had the hardest descision to make.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44300, '63ae6a1486', '', 'Me? Oh I was just hitting this crack whore up for a rock, when her pimp beat the crap out of me, and sold me into prostitution. Now I work for bitPimps.\r\n\r\nSeriuosly though, I originally came from TRC. I felt a general lack of appreciation there, so I came where I could be appreciated, and they must have appreciated me here, cause they made me a mod! :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44301, '1605cdb0ae', '', 'no dave we dont appreciate you. we keep ya around like jabba the hut did with that one little creature that bit 3po\'s eyes out.\r\n\r\nhaha whats sad is most of us came here to get away from little kid schmucks who have no clue. and now they think that they can hang here. we know the difference  :eek:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44302, 'fb821319b2', '2+ days now!!', 'i aint had no goddam nicotine in over 2 days and well lets say im like one of those little bomb dudes on mario brothers.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44303, '14921bcfb6', '', 'The choice was well deserved. Congrats Hue.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44304, 'c3823da63f', '', '[quote:c3823da63f]Seriously though, Hue\'s work is so clean, this car was a huge temptation, as was Betty.K\'s offroader. \r\n[/quote:c3823da63f]\r\n\r\nCouldn\'t agree more. All of the mods and regulars here do amazing stuff to these little cars, but there is something I really like about how clean and detailed Hue\'s cars look. It\'s like he doesn\'t change the look of the car completely, just makes it better. I have to admit that I am partial to the stock muscle car look. I still go back and check out that challenger pic every once in a while and drool. I also really like that Porsche race car that Hue did a little while back. Again, very clean with great details. Hue, you also do a really nice job with your photography. Hell, you could open up your own little bit photography studio.\r\n\r\nI can also really appreciate the originality of Betty.K\'s offroad bits. Some really cool engineering goes in to the chasis and suspension. In fact, I just was showing a younger cousin his offroad bits yesterday on the web, and the kid went nuts and wanted to know how to get one.\r\n\r\nI\'d just like to send out some congrats once again to all of you guys and thanks for breaking up the monotony of my work day with some great stuff.  :-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44305, '08c4d29061', '', '[quote:08c4d29061="crazydave"]I\'m not scared, bring that ol\' Dodge on, I\'ll crush it with my Chevy :cool:[/quote:08c4d29061]\r\n\r\nHell yeah you would... for the record, when it comes to performance, I\'m a Chevy guy all the way.  Anyway, you made the right choice in SuperFly\'s ride.. first off, it\'s beautiful. But, that thing drives tighter that any Bit I\'ve driven. I got to put a few laps on it, and let\'s just say I had a hard time not stealing that chassis... or did I :suspect: \r\n\r\nThanks for all the huge props Betty, bilbo and Sdog... reading all that was a great way to start a Monday morning. :grin:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44306, '0e2268ee34', '', 'Way to go, dude. Seriously, if your urges get to be too much, let\'s talk. I quit cold turkey after 10 years of smokin\' a pack a day, and it was a success. Not a single cigarette since the day I quit. It was all about mindset... I had it licked from every angle. [size=9:0e2268ee34](that\'s what she said)[/size:0e2268ee34]');
