INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46815, '854bd70d40', '', '[quote:854bd70d40="ph2t"]the thing that shits me about charlie is that he takes 2nd hand info and adopts it as gospel.  then on top of that, will argue vehemently against statements that contradict this BS info he\'s been given.   The dude obviously has some clues but is just too lazy to figure it out for himslef OR try something at home to then prove the "yay" or "ney" of a given statement......\r\n\r\nAnd the little bastard pontificates on his little soapbox at tinyRC, that\'s where I got my first whiff of hiss charlieness......\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:854bd70d40]\r\n\r\n#1: The reason that I can\'t test it out for myself is that I don\'t have the tools or money to do it. So this is why I take info and use it. I don\'t get $300 a month to spend on these things, so I can\'t buy the tools immediatley. And there\'s something called "learning". I don\'t know how to record a video on the current camera my parents let me use, but I\'ll get a better camera one day and I\'ll LEARN. \r\n\r\n#2: Can you find any examples of these "pontifications" that aren\'t a month old? I\'m LEARNING ph2t, I know what my past mistakes were and I\'m currently trying to correct them. As hogjowlz said, I\'m TRYING HARD to fit in. And the FETs I ordered from digikey haven\'t even come in yet, and my dad ordered them for me 2 Sundays ago! I promise you as soon as they come in, and when I have time, I WILL MOD THE FUCKING CAR and post up pics...and videos, when I get a better camera.\r\n\r\nAnd remember one thing: Good/Great things deserve a wait.');
