INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44381, '8353e06fd8', '', 'haha bkast cracks me up\r\n\r\nsteering	 	\r\nWell I posted the question in 4 different forums due to the reason not many people look at the X mod category and still know quite a bit about steering servos and soldering and wiring. Excuse me you cocksuckers for wanting to get a fairly immediate response from the RC community. You two should go blow each other as you do in every other forum, and if after the other one gives you a nice clean facial, answer my question if you have any useful information or if you are just gonna post whore with dumb spam remarks. Keep in mind I have a 12 year old brother looking for some help here dick wads.\r\n\r\n[quote:8353e06fd8="payaso"]\r\nKeep it up, and you\'ll be posting at microrccenter.\r\n\r\nsilla :D[/quote:8353e06fd8]\r\ndude thats halarious');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45314, '203130b56d', 'And this is why BP is still the board to be at', 'A lil background.\r\nHog went and posted at ripper7x7\'s site. He did a noble thing and posted up a good piece of info for all them cats over there. One of ripper\'s "asst, admins" or "global moderators" decides that the use of friggun isn\'t acceptable. He then goes and edits it and gives our lil hog a warning. Hog being the smart ass that we all love replys with a "disney-fied" repost of the original. Ripper is cool and I\'m sorry that his judgement allows for lil kids like this to try and sound smart and wise on his site. LOng story short here\'s a lil transcript of the pm\'s that were sent back and forth between me and monouk. (the asst.admin/whatever in question) (it\'s pasted backwards so start at the bottom of this post.) :lol: \r\n\r\nIt\'s all about tact man, damn I feel like I\'m beating a dead horse here. I\'m not saying you should be afraid to warn or not warn, with out first consulting ripper, just do it with a lil more prudence. I could have gone and re-edited your flowers in that thread but I didn\'t, instead I came to you "privately". Damn, forget it, I\'m done with this flowers right now.\r\n\r\n\r\nQUOTE  \r\nIm not attacking.  I do also understand that this is rippers site.  However, if I see something wrong I will do somthing about it.  I will admit that posting that in public probably wasnt the best idea.  However, I also feel that no one should be afraid to warn people.  A warning level isnt instant condemnation.  I would say that if the person continues to be a problem even after being warned, it would be appropriate to alert Ripper.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQUOTE  \r\nI don\'t insult, I just state things the way I see them. Maybe I\'m wrong but last I knew this was ripper\'s site and you were the maitenance man. If you\'re insulted by that my apologies.\r\nI still don\'t think you\'re grasping what I\'m trying to tell you. It isn\'t what jowlz deserved or didn\'t deserve, it\'s the way you handled it. Edit that flowers, send the offender a pm or email, and be done with it. If it were to continue then you go get ripper and ask him how he\'ld like it handled further. Ultimatly you are here to help ripper with his site.\r\nThis is starting to really annoy me, so I suggest we both drop this. I got nothing against you personally, never did, so take what I\'ve written to you as some advice or an attack, it\'s up to you.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQUOTE  \r\nIts fine, infact good that you ask questions.  However, I dont appriciate things like\r\n\r\nQUOTE  \r\nI thought it was your "job"... \r\n\r\n\r\nIf you didnt mean it as an insult, it sounded like it. Maybe this whole thing is one giant misunderstanding...but jowlz definately deserved what he got...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQUOTE  \r\nI\'m sorry, but could you clarify that a bit? From the way I\'m reading it, sounds to me like an ultimatum. If in fact that\'s what this is, you need to go check yourself. I was only trying to help you, believe that. \r\n\r\n\r\nQUOTE  \r\nQuestioning and voicing your opinion is a goof thing.  Once it starts t turn sour, its gone too far.  Please, stop yourself before it gets to that point from now on.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQUOTE  \r\nI guess you just don\'t get it monouk. I\'ve allready spent too much time and energy on you. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQUOTE  \r\nMy job title is to keep the site up technically, yes.  However if I notice a blatent disregard for the rules I will step in.  He messed up, I dealt with it.  Now please, a mods job is to enforce the rules, not feel sorry for people that break them and get in trouble.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQUOTE  \r\nSo then he said a$$ in the third post or was it fuk? The whole question is the "how" to keep this place in order monouk. I thought it was your "job\' to keep this site running "technically". Could you also explain how jowlz was degrading anyone\'s experience? Also no one is asking for the rules to be bent, just enforced with a little less zeal.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQUOTE  \r\nPower trips?  Definately not.  Im trying to keep this place clean and in order.  Im not going to let people say "fuk" and "a$$" in public forum, and then post the same picture twice followed by a stupid comment.  Its not my job to let people have fun by degrading other peoples experiance.  He chose to break the rules.  Im not going to bend the rules for someone.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQUOTE  \r\nWHat exactly did he say in his third post? WHat was the "bad" word that you felt didn\'t belong? "technically" it was only one offence and that was the first one dealing with the unappropriate language. The all mighty "third" post was in response to my edit of his second post. The second post was in fun and had no "cussing". This site should be about having fun and learning monouk, not power trips.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQUOTE  \r\nI appriciate you voicing your concern, but I think I was perfectly justified.  A person who disobeys is still disobeying the rules, no matter that.  If he has been a long time member he should know better.  I removed the langauge and asked him not to the first time, so he posts again...you should have stopped two identical posts...then he posts a THIRD time, using bad langauge again!  He disobeyed by cussing, then disobeyed when I asked him not to, and on top of the posted three times in a row and your telling me that I was too harsh?  I think I was perfectly justified.  Im giving him 3 strikes.  I could have warned him for doing it once.  He technically did 3 offences, but Im giving him the 3 strike rule with only 2 strikes...if I have to edit another one of his posts, hes getting a warning, and I urge you to do the same.\r\n    -Mono\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQUOTE  \r\nRefrence this thread: http://ripper7racing.com/forums/index.php?showtopic=418\r\n\r\nThere are a few things I\'ld like to bring to your attention. 1. Hogjowlz aka jowlz has been part of the online micro rc community for well over a year and nearing his second. I think he would be a valuable addition to this forum. 2. The warnings you supplied him with are pointless. The first warning should have just been a correction on the language used at these boards. The second warning has no bassis. Basically what you\'re doing is driving people away by being too "harsh". I\'ll admit sometimes being harsh is needed though   this wasn\'t one of them.');
