INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44387, '2bc74d3ac7', '', 'Bunch of PUSSIES!!!!!! \r\n\r\nHere is my hard points...\r\n\r\nwork in restaurant(high stress)--everyone smokes \r\nbroke--every broke person smokes\r\ndrinker--all heavy drinkers smoke\r\ngets cheap smokes--no need to buy pricey smokes, allready saving $$$ \r\n\r\nIt\'s been almost 3 months for me!!! No cigerettes!!!  No cigars!!!  I miss cigars even more than cigerettes.  I smoked about a pack a day unless I drink, then its about 2 1/2 packs!!  It is still tough to drink since I quit to this day, but I just drink less and get \'mokey more!!! :cool:  \r\n\r\nCold Turkey!!!!  Do what you gotta do!! :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44388, '958faf4c04', '', 'oo, dems old rides!! the celica ute is the first bit i got, a clone . i thought it would be easy to chop and went for it! first attempt at painting little things since i was about 12! i gave it the full size wheel treatment after i got my second bit. i still got her, a little wobbly around the axle and a little less paint on the air scoop but still going strong!\r\nas for the wrx, that\'s my first really good suspension mod i did and sold (to merc bruce). it was a clone tomy style chassis and had an alloy hinge plate, fs wheels and an enertec shell which had the perfectly distanced wheel wells for the stretched wheelbase. i did a little shell modding to fit the moving rear end and cut out the air scoop, coupla decals and a clear coat. a few led\'s and i think i managed to pull off the 1:64 mini z mod! the threads are on ausmicro which has gone down like a $2 ho at the mo. so i\'ll stick some links up when i can. both of these rides were done before i joined up here so don\'t bother lookin\'!\r\n\r\nand thanks for noticing! :-)\r\n\r\n[size=18:958faf4c04]EDIT[/size:958faf4c04]\r\n\r\njust for you, here\'s more pics of the wrx\r\nhttp://community.webshots.com/photo/104137037/108536559aAmikp\r\nhttp://community.webshots.com/photo/104137037/109433885zlDVSU\r\nhttp://community.webshots.com/photo/104137037/109434128KKlOyR\r\nhttp://community.webshots.com/photo/104137037/109434841BCsscX\r\n\r\nhere\'s the thread about the ute, the pics don\'t work any more http://www.ausmicro.com/topic.asp?TOPIC_ID=1581&amp;FORUM_ID=9&amp;CAT_ID=2&amp;Topic_Title=me+grouse+aussie+ute%21&amp;Forum_Title=Bit+CharG+and+Micro+Radio+Controlled+%2D+Technical');
