INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44474, '25a80c4ae6', '', '[quote:25a80c4ae6="Bird"]They were sold out. They must have just put them back up today, because they are there now...\r\n\r\nhttp://www.toyeast.com/v2/prodlist.asp?catid=1193\r\n[/quote:25a80c4ae6]Damn, and I just gave in and placed an order at Toyeast last week, I was gonna get one if they were in stock.\r\n\r\nThat\'s ok though, it would just be something else I\'d have to put money into. I still need to get bearings for my Xmod, that I just played with for the first time in almost 3 months.\r\n\r\nI\'m figuring with a FET upgrade, and a decent motor the Xmod will be more than fun enough on it\'s own. The question is, will the car hold together.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44475, 'efe763905b', '', '[quote:efe763905b="cj"][quote:efe763905b="hogjowlz"]any word on any new product cj?[/quote:efe763905b]\r\n\r\nNope not yet but a rumor I heard was the white supra was soon to be disco\'d.  Mabe our other shackie can [b:efe763905b]check on the supra[/b:efe763905b] before I am working again.[/quote:efe763905b]\r\n\r\nHow do ya mean CJ?  I don\'t understand why they would disco just the white supra.  Either way, I havn\'t seen one in my store for over a month, so maybe there is some truth in this.  Honestly tho that doesn\'t bother me, but damn what does is WHEN THE HELL ARE WE GONNA GET NEW X-MOD SHIAT!?!?!  I\'t nuts, every day I get people in the store and they are like, "yup have that, have that, have 3 of those, is there anything new?"  We get new Zip stuff it seems at leaste every 2 weeks if not every week.... I dunno.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44476, 'd2be294c56', '', 'Ph2t Noooooo don\'t use sarcasim with people that don\'t speak english as thier primary language, especially if they are forign.\r\n\r\n@Sinned - I can speak for Ph2t he LIKED your work.  Was just being Sarcastic.\r\n\r\nGreat ride by the way, Lowered SEs only look right that way.\r\n\r\n@ Ph2t phew you almost scared of one of our best modders  :lol: \r\n\r\nThe first year of our marriage I used to get so much shit on being sarcastic, cuz even tho she spoke perfect english, they don\'t teach sarcasim in school.  If you live in the states and speak english as a second language it\'s a different deal.  Keep up the great work Sinned!!!!!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44478, '5a6640cc21', '', 'I agree. I have yet to buy an X-mod, mainly because I do not like the current offering of body styles. I have been waiting to see what new styles will be offered and have been surprised that nothing new has come out since their introduction. Now the iwaiver is looking pretty tempting.\r\n\r\nI personally would like to see some exotic sports car bodies offered.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44479, 'd144ef09c3', '', 'to hell with what bodies are offered. iwaver electronics are superior. i think the xmod chassis may be a better design, but at 25bucks, you cant beat the iwaver.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44480, '2f46234e5f', '', 'i think the xmod\'s complexity is it\'s downfall. i know they are capable of a hell of a lot of power. but i keep breaking dumb parts like knuckles and what not. the iwavers have a much simpler design and less things to break.\r\n\r\nand if i havnt mentioned before. iwavers without bearings coast way way better than xmods with bearings.');
