INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44489, '787f839d3f', '', 'Grr you bitches got me to check out the i-waver finally...  What a cool car for the bucks, and hell I get my x-mods for almost free.  This is now on my shopping list along with some bodies.  It\'s safe to assume that with the "Velcor mod" these bodies will also fit on a X-mod?  Don\'t answer that, I know the answer.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44490, 'cb7518530b', '', 'Finks...you are right, those have been out for quite some time now. I bought three from toyeast. Quality control seems to be pretty good with them, the detailing is nice, light up headlights, and exchangeable roofs. \r\n\r\nThe controllers can be set to full speed or two speed (with use of a booster button). They are also set up to run slower when turning. I assume this is to provide control during cornering. You may or may not like that.\r\n\r\nThey seem to work well, although one of mine didn\'t seem to want to run straight. I pulled the body off and it ran straight without the body. The bodies are hard as hell to get off and I cracked the shell near the bumber trying to get it off.\r\n\r\nThe packaging is pretty nice too, if you are in to collecting like me. They are supposedly limited edition and I know Toyeast is already out of a lot of them, so if you want one, you may want to get it soon. They are cool enough to get one or two.. something different. I\'m considering modding oput the one I cracked.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44491, 'd597097ec5', '', 'True dat....25 bones is a steal...can\'t really go wrong. Hell, a zip zap SE costs that much.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44492, '709684568c', '', 'don\'t forget the shipping, though... it\'s gonna cost $45 to get it to your door, which is still cheaper than an xmod.');
