INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44496, '8eee7e1584', 'Reveiw of the Mini-z Madforce', 'Reveiw of the mini-z madforce:\r\nI got my madforce 2 weeks ago and have been using it almost everyday.\r\nI cant tell you how much fun this thing is. Anyone who has one will agree with me . :grin: I do have some cons about it though :sad: \r\n\r\nSome of the parts break very easily.I curently cant drive my car because i have broken the front damper mount, the suspension bar,and a steering servo box screw mount.I havbe it all on order and should be in tomorrow :grin: I also ordered the x-speed motor so i hope it does.\r\n\r\nThe car is fun to drive inside but even better outside.The turing is very tight so you can make nice turns and the radius is adjustable. The car is fun out of the box ,but a little too slow for my liking. This thing can kick any Xmod\'s ass. It can completly ramp off or flip an Xmod if it crashes into the back tire.\r\n\r\nAll in all the Mini-z Madforce is definitly a good buy for your money you will have tons of fun with it.\r\n\r\nPros:Good turning\r\nFun out of the box\r\nGood traction\r\nCan take a beating\r\n\r\n\r\nCons:Certain parts break easily\r\nSpeed\r\n\r\nPics:\r\n[img:8eee7e1584]http://img29.photobucket.com/albums/v87/crusty/76d13d60.jpg[/img:8eee7e1584]\r\n[img:8eee7e1584]http://img29.photobucket.com/albums/v87/crusty/DCP_0858.jpg[/img:8eee7e1584]look at that suspension :eek: \r\nP.S. Are these pics to big??');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44497, '511b8cebb5', '', '[quote:511b8cebb5="DarkTari"][quote:511b8cebb5="crazydave"][quote:511b8cebb5="DarkTari"]I\'d like some of dem decals to use on the Auction cars to put our signature.[/quote:511b8cebb5]Dats what I\'m saying, make it official.\r\n\r\nHey I just thought, the auction cars should be numbered and signed inside the body. Bam, we just hit the collectable angle.[/quote:511b8cebb5]\r\n\r\nMy Thoughts Exactly !  Collectables Baby !   :cool: \r\n\r\nNox,  Can you make this a decal?   :cool:[/quote:511b8cebb5]\r\n\r\nWhat decal?  Sorry DT, I didn\'t see one included.\r\nBut sure, I can make/print any thing in a decal.\r\nDidn\'t you ever get my thrash of decal mailings last year?\r\n\r\n-nox');
