INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44503, 'd0a8648ba1', '', 'I understand where ph2t comes from - a lot of us felt that awhile back.\r\na lot of us get that now on our own work.\r\n\r\nbottom line - yea Sinned is a spammer for his work.\r\nwhatever - so are a lot of pimps.\r\n\r\nph2t does great shit, but just like me and everyone else, he hates it when the thunder gets stolen from him and put on to someone else - whether it was deserved or not.\r\n\r\n\r\nthe reason I know this is because I feel like a lot of my body painting and mods get over looked. I take some of the clearest pictures - and I think I might be the only one that gets so damn close up on the bit that you can almost see paint molecules.\r\nI do this to prove that I\'ve pimped out the body and to show how clean it really is.\r\nbut I get the pity "great job" comment.\r\nand then some schmuck comes along and posts up a fuzzy ass picture from 3 miles away of their bit and because you can\'t tell shit from the blurred out  image - users just suck their dicks as if they were mod kings.\r\n\r\nwhatever. mod kings find a way to prove it through pictures or by sending their stuff in person to someone else to vouch for.\r\n\r\n\r\nI used to get really upset at being overlooked so much - but now days - I could give 2 shits. if the morons don\'t recognize that\'s their own downfall - let them go buy some more over priced crap and suck eachothers dicks until their purple. then when their done - they\'ll come on back, as they have so far.');
