INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44549, '6d883fca57', '', 'Thanks for the hook up. :-) \r\n\r\nThat\'s actaully kind of a nice die cast, I\'d hate to kill that just for the wheels, but I\'d do it.  :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nJust got done running my bus again. Damn this is fun, I should have got two. I stuck a 4.2 in it, and it gets a little tippy with the xtra weight of the body, but I was only able to flip it once. \r\n\r\nThe bumpers are held on by little pins, and they slip right off. You might want to take them off when you run. It only took me a couple laps with the 4.2 to rip them right off. I glued them back on, but it looks kinda cool with the bumpers stripped.');
