INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48554, 'f251588372', '', 'That Van Hagar show just came thru Pittsburgh last week.  They were practiclly giving away tickets to see them.  $25 for lawn seats and it included a $10 food voucher!!!  All that to get people to see a washed up has been band.  I like Van Halen, not Van Hagar.  Plus, its a little past their hayday.  \r\n\r\nI didn\'t go to this show, but I know plenty of Old Heads that did and have seen them when they were popular and rockin\'.  When they came thru last year with David Lee Roth opening for them, it was a sad site to see an old man tryin\' to do leg kicks and act like he was back in the 80\'s.  (Thats a general quote from the Old Head Brigade, not personal expeariance.  However I do feel the same way.)\r\n\r\nThey need to just sit down and do an Unplugged for "VH-I\'m old and still tryin\' to hang in there" channel.  It could open up so many doors for more washed up acts to take the stage.\r\n\r\nThats my thoughts and I\'m stickin\' to them.\r\n\r\n\r\nP.S....... I have 2 tickets for the Oldies group KISS if anyone wants them.  $20 or a case of Rolling Rock!!  Pittsburgh show of course. July 4th.  Someone dumped them on me because I can usually get rid of tickets, but these are giving me a hard time!!!');
