INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44655, '16d6c6d1dc', '', 'The man likes to watch his hockey.....\r\n\r\nNice breakdown CW. \r\n\r\nObviously, I am all about the Flyers. They DO kick ass and take names and I am enjoying every minute of it. This is the first time in years I feel like they have a legit chance of taking the cup.\r\n\r\nOn the other side..\r\n\r\nYou know I have a Sega Genesis with EA Sports Hockey from the late 80\'s/early 90\'s. Calgary kicks ass on that game and I think that is the last time they kicked any ass. I don\'t think anyone expected them to be where they are...they are kind of the underdog....so I would like to see them take the series against SJ...How is that for shitty logic.\r\n\r\nI have to admit though....I don\'t follow hockey all season....just too many games. I am more aof a football fan. But, the playoffs have been real entertaining this year.');
