INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44707, '30d65e8335', '', '[quote:30d65e8335="CaboWabo"]damn, built like a brute - excellent review crazydave.\r\nany chance any of those parts (fat magnet) can fit into the bits?[/quote:30d65e8335]Not without some big time surgery.  :lol: \r\n\r\nI\'m thinking the big ol\' fat magnet might be good in my drag car, because it would limit the steering to the point where it would barely move. That can be handy when trying to stay in a straight line\r\n\r\nAs far as the big motor, coil, and spring goes, they are way too big, I\'m thinking I might have to build a custom chassis utilizing the front and back ends.\r\n\r\n[quote:30d65e8335="Sdog"] Are those tires rubber or plastic?[/quote:30d65e8335]The tires are soft rubber, and grip fairly good on all surfaces. The rubber is thin, and the wheel is mostly plastic. I like \'em.\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:30d65e8335="hogjowlz"]do they have a skyline one?[/quote:30d65e8335]Ummm, no, but the bodies are the same scale as Zip Zap, so you could make it one...if that\'s what you really wanted. ;) \r\n :lol:\r\n\r\n*Here ya go hog, just for you. 2fast 2Furious even.\r\n[img:30d65e8335]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/cd_skyline.jpg[/img:30d65e8335]');
