INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44729, '007b0070d6', '', 'From what I understand, the modification was involved plugging in a 9 volt battery,and also sticking in a thingie to reduce the power through the logic circuit down to 5 volts.  That way, most of the equipment was at 9 volts, most importantly the broadcasting part itself.   Thus, I suspect that while the logic circuits ( the black thingies with a lot of pins sticking out) fry at over 5 volts, everything else works just fine at 9 volts.  I\'m gonna try several things, but first I gotta get some battery packs and do a few other mods, not to mention begin building the hull it\'s gonna go into.  Keep experimenting!');
