INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44847, 'b6a4cf6861', '', '[quote:b6a4cf6861="hue35"][quote:b6a4cf6861="crazydave"]Now if DT wants to criticize Sinned for not doing enough, that\'s his point of view, and he has the car to back up his point of view, so we really can\'t condemn him for his point of view, and making it known.[/quote:b6a4cf6861]\r\nAbsolutely... I think I did a bad job in my post, trying to get my point across. I wasn\'t trying to condemn anyone. What I probably should have written was... that dodgeracerpud dude is a prick, and I totally disagree with where he was coming from in his post... so reading, "he\'s right" bugged me a little. \r\n\r\nAnyway, didn\'t mean to start any shit.[/quote:b6a4cf6861]Yeah, and you know, condemn was kinda of a harsh word from me, I know that\'s not what you were trying to do. Words are tricky little boogers.\r\n\r\nAll I was saying is taste is subjective, and there\'s no right or wrong. There\'s just opinions, and opinions are like assholes, everybodies got one.');
