INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44874, 'db045da83a', '', '[quote:db045da83a="DarkTari"][quote:db045da83a]It\'s all a matter of taste, but i don\'t think a car needs to have a full body kit, a wing, two-tone paint and a full blown interior to be cool, nor do I think any of those things make a car "better." [/quote:db045da83a]\r\n\r\n[b:db045da83a]Hue:[/b:db045da83a] Remember 1 thing, Your donated prize was my first choice, even before it was finished. (damn dat Silla).[/quote:db045da83a]\r\n\r\nWell, thanks man.. but I really wasn\'t talkin\' about my stuff at all. After reading that quote again, it does sound like I\'m talkin\' shit about one style over another... which wasn\'t where I was comin\' from at all. I was just defending Sinned\'s clean and simple car. But, in defending his clean and simple style, I made it sound like I don\'t dig stuff that\'s over the top and fully decked-out, and that\'s not right... I dig the shit outta that shit...\r\n\r\nSome days I shouldn\'t even try to write my thoughts down.. that whole thing just came out wrong :lol: Ah well, I think the peace is restored, and the dead horse is beaten into fuckin\' oblivion.');
