INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44917, '0f964a1819', '', 'I just have to convey my personal fealings about this particular thread (users able to vote for "Ride of the Month"...\r\n\r\nI\'m more than disappointed with the participation.\r\never since day 1, we\'ve had users asking "how come we (the users) can\'t vote for who wins in contests?"\r\n\r\nwell now here\'s you\'re chance and we have a pathetic 19 votes as of today for this months "Ride of the Week".\r\n\r\nI\'m so disappointed that I couldn\'t bother with making the post if you users aren\'t going to participate as you eluded to in so many of your posts.\r\n\r\nI guess what I\'m say is....\r\n\r\nif you users don\'t participate in this simplest of tasks - I can no longer see the need to offer users that option and us (the moderators) will decide who deserves the spot for "Ride of the Month".\r\n\r\n- one seriously let down pimp');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44918, '60903f406b', '', 'part of the "inpending or not" restructure....\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?p=44917#44917\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m laying down the gauntlet here - they either respond or they miss their chance.\r\nthis a perfect way to find out who\'s who and what\'s what.\r\nlittle things like this will help us gauge if we\'re wasting our time on certain things or not.\r\n\r\njust wanted to point it out because it could be a rather "precious" changing of the guard. (e.g. we take back more ownership of what goes on here)\r\n\r\nI don\'t think it\'s out of line - but I do appreciate any thoughts on the matter.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44919, '13cc0dfb18', 'Canned Heat VW+bird=SILLY', 'So I\'ve had these two Tyco Canned Heat hoopties layin\' around for a few years... I had a gift certificate a few years back and Kaufmans didn\'t have any Pumas or OG Adidas or anything else I really wanted so I grabbed these cars... Got a red S2000 and a green Veedub. I started thinking about messing around with them a few months ago, but never did anything.. \r\n\r\nAbout a month ago I was on a late night munchie run to my local convenience store and I saw these little goofy monster truck pullbacks... I grabbed one and was going to grab another on my next visit, but they were all gone by then. My kids made the one I had disappear for a few weeks, and I came across it in their toybox last week.\r\n\r\nAnyway, one night a few days ago I was looking at the little truck thinking about what I could pilfer from it for other stuff... and the VW popped into my head. I got busy on it and an hour later I had swapped the wheels from the pullback onto it and lowered it a bit... Here is the silliness that resulted:\r\n\r\n[img:13cc0dfb18]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/greenbugside.jpg[/img:13cc0dfb18]\r\n\r\n[img:13cc0dfb18]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/greenbugfront.jpg[/img:13cc0dfb18]\r\n\r\n[img:13cc0dfb18]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/greenbug.jpg[/img:13cc0dfb18]\r\n\r\nI like the green, so I won\'t ruin it trying to play picasso lol...\r\n\r\nNow I want to body-drop the S2K lol.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44920, '86fece7998', '', 'I have comments about it all, but before my dumb ass forgets...\r\nI just wanna mention that your topic title is what lured me here, specifically the "Canned Heat" part.\r\nwhether by your design or not - it got me.\r\n\r\nwith that - the lower job looks awesome.\r\nbut the wheels (up front) are just too small, makes it look out of place (referring back to the critisism thread)\r\nother than that - I have no qaulms about this one - sometimes a solid color is what it deserves and speaks volumes.\r\n\r\nI\'m glad you kept the VW symbol and I\'m more glad you called it a Veedub (aka VDub) whether you know how it got started or not :wink: \r\n\r\nnice smooth work. masking out the logo can be a biatch I know.\r\nyou coulda masked out the trim between the back and front windows if you were feeling particularly "zoned and pimpish" but even though you didn\'t - it doesn\'t look horribly bad at all - flows right along.\r\n\r\nI also think you have more in you than just solid red or silver for the front or back, but I understand your hesitance.\r\nbut put all that together and for you - you don\'t have a finished car.\r\nyou copped out.\r\n\r\nI know you\'re better - I can see it right here in this job.\r\nyou have the skills, I\'m just guessing you didn\'t put enough faith in yourself.\r\nsure - you might have screwed it up, but then again - better chance says that you wouldn\'t have.\r\n\r\nnext time go for it dude, don\'t play it safe.\r\n\r\nand remember, I\'m only being critical because of the recent thread about it. I\'ve made plenty of my own mistakes/learning experiences.\r\nso I\'m not railing on you as much as offering up some constructive critisisms/advice and support.\r\n\r\nword to bigbird.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44921, '7d3cb47d68', 'son of a bitch', 'my wife goes to the mall, and while there, she was nice, and picked up the ZZ past and present TA set...\r\n\r\nTotally kick fuckin ass.  The old skool TA is hands down, the nicest stock paint I\'ve seen.  I\'m loving it.\r\n\r\nSit down to start a chassis for it, and thats when it happened.  I still don\'t even know how it happened..    I reached across the table to grab the body to test it on an existing chassis, and when I picked it up, it had a wet spot on it.(go ahead hog) I thought it was water, but nope...  It had to be the most evil arch enemy of paint ever... Yup, paint thinner.. One ruined TA.\r\n\r\nIt lasted about a whole 45 fuckin minutes, and yeah, I\'m mad as fuck....\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44922, 'aaf87fefcc', '', 'fuck that shit.\r\nthat\'s an opportunity.\r\nyou wouldn\'t have touched that body before.\r\nwell guess what - now I know you will - it\'s already been tainted and I know you can make it back in to something presitine.\r\nso update us when you\'re ready because I know it\'s coming.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44923, '3581540b34', '', 'I\'m all for the criticism, but you\'re criticizing the wrong fella lol... That is the stock green that it came from Tyco sportin\', and their taillight decals and whatever that is they\'re tryin\' to pass for headlights lol. I just hit it with some wax before I put it back together lol. Damn... now ya got me wantin\' to paint it.\r\n\r\nThe "Canned Heat" thing is what it says on the tube it comes in, so I just always called it that... I\'m pretty sure it\'s like 1/32 scale, or something like that. It is like a big ass bit, magnet steering and shit, and has a controller like a Shen or any other bubble clone, so it drives like a bit. 219 and myself shot some vid of my S2K and the Tyco SSR he just got, and it should be up soon... I\'m pretty sure it\'s gonna be called "Big Ass Bits".\r\n\r\nYou have no idea how bad I want to come across another one of those little monster truck pullbacks to put proper wheels on the front... that\'s why I called it silly, those tiny wheels are straight up silly... If and when I find another one, I\'m grabbin\' it to finish this right.');
