INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (44976, '07ff8b7ae0', '', 'Ph2t, those comments were more Bitch than Pimp IMO.  Sinned has been here for ever, and personally I feel he deserves more respect than that.  Now true, I do agree that it would be great to see him contribute more than just his Dope rides, but look at it this way.  Sinned speaks English, sure, but I have a feeling that it\'s to th level of my sisters in law.  They don\'t use it on a regular basis, so it\'s a royal PitA to "Brows" forums, and then post your thoughts concisly with out repeating what others have already said before.  Basically, do you speak a second language, and more so, do you research and read stuff in that language?  If not, I would suggest you back off then.  Good to see tho that it\'s not just us Americans tha feel everyone in th world should speak English, them Aussies do too :grin: \r\n\r\nIn closing, I have Jack shit against you Ph2t.  As a matter of fact, you lay down some sick shit and me being involved with this sight far less than you may not give me the right, but I\'m taking it, just for a sec.  I don\'t want this site to loose you, or Sinned, you both kick some bit ass in your own way.');
