INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45005, '7e21a06e6b', '', 'this short man is walking down the street enjoying his day, when he passes a bar with a "Piano Player Wanted" sign in the window.  He quickly snatched the sign down, and walked inside.\r\n\r\nThe man marches up to the owner, and says I\'m your new pianist. The bar owner has a surprised look on his face, and says you\'re awful sure of yourself, and I haven\'t heard you play yet.\r\n\r\n  The man sits down, and plays a song. The bar owner says that it\'s the most beautiful song he\'s ever heard, and asks what the name of the song is. The man says I wrote that song, and it\'s called "you mother fuckin bitch".\r\n\r\nThe bar owner is stunned by this, and asks if the man knows any others. the man sits back down, and plays another song. The bar owner says that it\'s even more beautiful than the first one, an dthen asks the name of that song.  The man replies I also wrote that one, and it\'s called "I shut my dick in the trunk".\r\n\r\nThe bar owner says your music is absolutley the best I\'ve heard, and you got the job on one condition. The man asks what it is, and the bar owner replies that he can\'t tell any of the patrons the names of his songs. \r\n\r\nIt\'s opening night, and it\'s a full house, and a line out the door to hear this guy play.  He sits at the piano playing, and notices a hot blonde at the table in front of his piano.  Thinking that he\'s never gonna have a chance with her, he gets up during the intermission, and goes to the bathroom to whack off to this hot blonde.\r\n\r\nHe finishes, and returns to his bench to find the same blonde sitting there waiting to talk to him. He can\'t believe it, and approaches her. She takes one look at him, and says do you know your dick\'s hanging out, and you got cum on your shoes? The man replies, do I know it? I fuckin wrote it.....\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45006, 'a981cd96a8', '', '[quote:a981cd96a8="Son_Gokou"]Oh, BTW crazydave....have you tried adding an extra cell to the SE after the FET mod, and do you know exactly how many MPH that thing can go? I hear RCmart.com has a Tamiya 4WD speed checker if you look around in the Mini-Z section...here\'s a few links:[/quote:a981cd96a8]Nah, you know, I\'m not worried about stuff like exact MPH, I just wanna see my car go, and if it looks like it\'s going faster, then that\'s all I ever wanted.\r\n\r\nI\'m not worried about adding extra cells to the SE, because for technical driving on my track, it\'s already getting too fast for good control. It\'s already throwing it\'s weight around in the corners pretty good. Any more defeats the purpose of the SE to me. If you just want top speed with no handling you might as well stick with Bits.');
