INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45067, '9f7ccfc79f', 'Touch up', 'I thought I\'d give the Hemi a little touch up, so I pulled the hubs out, and stripped em back to bare metal. i still wasn\'t happy with em, so I took a jewelers cloth, and hand polished em to a mirror finish. (still haven\'t figured out how to capture the bling on film).\r\n\r\ni put some lights on it, and dropped it as low as it can go. It still needs a clear coat, but this it it after the slight alteration.\r\n\r\n[img:9f7ccfc79f]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10004/normal_DSC02982.JPG[/img:9f7ccfc79f]\r\n[img:9f7ccfc79f]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10004/normal_DSC02983.JPG[/img:9f7ccfc79f]\r\n[img:9f7ccfc79f]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10004/normal_DSC02984.JPG[/img:9f7ccfc79f]\r\n[img:9f7ccfc79f]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10004/normal_DSC02985.JPG[/img:9f7ccfc79f]\r\n\r\nIt\'s about 98% where I want it. Should be complete in a week.\r\n\r\nI also couldn\'t resist doing a side by side shot of the car that I won with the Cuda.\r\n\r\nAs good as the pics are that hue35 takes of his cars, they don\'t do them justice. His work is as clean as it gets.  He was interested in my thoughts on it since we all talk shit, and it\'s hard to judge performance by vids. Let alone different driving preferences..\r\n\r\nI have to say that it\'s my fastest driving/handling bit. This thing flies, and is meant to handle it. I\'m not saying my cars don\'t handle well, but I set mine up for more technical tracks, while this one is balls out. I have never set one up like it, so it\'s a awesome addition to my collection, and I now have a car for every track you punks may challenge me on.\r\n\r\nThanks again for the car hue, but it might just be the one that smacks your ass if I ever come up there...lol\r\n\r\n[img:9f7ccfc79f]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10004/normal_DSC02987.JPG[/img:9f7ccfc79f]\r\n[img:9f7ccfc79f]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10004/normal_DSC02988.JPG[/img:9f7ccfc79f]\r\n\r\n\r\nThese are my 2 favorite cars hands down.....\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
