INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45085, 'd4be6e3b51', '', 'You gets an Amen to that.\r\n\r\n...but here\'s what I don\'t understand...\r\n\r\nOk you see this nasty dark brown crap and you don\'t expect much anyways, but how come once in great while I\'ll come across stuff where all the elements are in place, lime green, good smell, crystals on the leaves, but then when you go to smoke it it does nothing. You\'re sitting there, "I think I\'m high, but I really can\'t tell, so I know I\'m not as high as I should be."\r\n\r\n\r\nI almost went without yesterday, I f\'in washed my check like a dumb ass, and I waited until I got down to scruggin\'s like a dumbass. Usually my friend disappears when I ask for fronts, so I thought I was screwed, but my buddy came through for me, luckily. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI kinda hate to hear you and Cabo bummin\', cause it reminds me how far away you guys are, you know if I lived around the corner, I\'d bake you out, and send you home with a bud.\r\n\r\n..and it\'s ironic/odd I\'m not the first bitching about it drying up, because it usually happens to me about this time of year, but I\'ve had amazing luck with the quality and availability this last year. Exppect to hear some bitching this summer though.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45086, '0e34e8e3d7', '', '[quote:0e34e8e3d7="hogjowlz"]wow dave you should sell it for 400bucks and spam all the boards with it![/quote:0e34e8e3d7]Hmmm, alrighty then, I\'ll do it, and since you gave me the idea I\'ll let you have one for half price, $200. :lol: \r\n\r\nLess than $30 invested BTW, keep that in mind before you drop big dough a on a prefab track.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45087, 'a435229bd4', '', '[quote:a435229bd4="Sdog"]Hue\'s work is damn clean, but I have to say that your work on that cuda looks really clean too.[/quote:a435229bd4]I\'ve seen Payaso\'s work up close, and I will testify, it is the cleanest I\'ve seen. Very crisp precise masking, and the details are painted very crisp and cleanly. Makes my stuff look kinda sloppy.\r\n\r\nI had to step up to testify, because pictures never truly capture than kind of stuff.\r\n\r\nThat car\'s looking good, Payaso. I really liked the black rims with it, but you did a great job cleaning them up, and it\'s cool to see the details in the wheel popping out again.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n...and, damn, hue\'s car is low. I didn\'t realize how low it was.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45088, 'ab367e0a53', '', 'AMEN.\r\n\r\nI\'ve gotten to a point where I like quality weed so much better that when I\'m out, I try to just tough it out till I replenish. I too have a bag of mexi-brown in "reserve", but the last many times I\'ve been out I\'ve avoided it. I just can\'t bring myself to throw it away.\r\n\r\nI\'ve got my own little "weed bank" as we call it. Whenever I get a good amount, I make my deposits. I\'ve got 2 or 3 friends that I\'ll give a good golf-ball size bud to, and then when I\'m out they\'re more than happy to return the favor.');
