INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45114, 'd0a440eaea', 'back in pimpcity', 'Holy shit it\'s been a while...... I had taken a little vacation from my bits to compete in autocross and road racing events. I\'m doing pretty well considering it\'s been ten years away from competition. \r\nI did manage to build a custom body for my X mod. I haven\'t got the pics yet, but i\'ll get them soon. \r\nIt\'s good to see all the familiar pimps still representi\'n as well as some new blood. Great job on the moderators contest. Cabo, Dave, DT, and payaso really got some great entries. I hope to see an Xmod contest, even though they aren\'t bits it would still be cool.\r\nI also have some bit projects that need finishing, but I\'m still doin it.\r\n\r\n\r\nLater :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45115, '25d08edc90', '', '[quote:25d08edc90]Sdog... thank you. I needed a good laugh. That was awesome. I\'m really really really really surprised that he didn\'t fall or knock himself out lol. I also wouldn\'t be surprised to hear that he offed himself after all of the remixes started coming out. \r\n[/quote:25d08edc90]\r\n\r\nActually, I read that eventually his parents had a lawsuit out. I guess the kid was pretty embarrassed by it. If you look around, you can actually find the story behind it. There were quite a few websites with tons of remixes...way more than what is on the screamingpickle website, but after the lawsuit, thay started dropping off.\r\n\r\nBTW....I hope you had the sound up when you watched it....his sound effects are awesome.');
