INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45208, '4b96c14f79', '', '[quote:4b96c14f79="MadSamoan"]Growing up as a kid there was a 905 liquor store on every corner, a couple of returned soda bottles and you had enough to get some beer. It sucked ass in the worst way but it was a cheap drunk.[/quote:4b96c14f79]\r\n\r\nFor us it was Genesee Cream Ale...it was the most beer us little punks could get for the money.\r\n\r\n[quote:4b96c14f79="MadSamoan"]I hate most AB products, I let Amberbock slide, it\'s decent and easy to find. I  drink guinness and bully porter, I really like the brooklyn brewery\'s Chocolate Stout (I think they make that beer, only had it a few times) but we don\'t get that around here.[/quote:4b96c14f79]\r\n\r\nThese days I like good microbrews. I\'m lucky enough to have a distributor across the street and I try to get something different every time I go in.\r\n\r\nBTW...Sushi kicks ass....like little power packed energy bites. But what I really like about it is the wasabi and pickled ginger....bonsai muthfocker!');
