INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45273, 'f33738e916', 'you just can\'t trust micromatch....', 'dunno if you pimps have been watchin the arse-end of this thread:\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=1183&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;start=90\r\n\r\nseem\'s micro has been spinnin a bit of BS to pimpike.  Now I usually don\'t get involved with kiddie crap but both kids are throwing my name around like there\'s no tomorrow....\r\n\r\nages ago (around last xmas), I had a deal going on fet mods, some of you pimps might remember, $10 for the mod, free shipping, what can i say, I had the xmas spirit at the time, lol...  anyways...  micromatch took me up on the deal and (suprisingly) paid quite prompty using mummy\'s paysluts account.  I though that\'s cool, he\'s locked in.  Now to wait for his chassis....the chassis rocked up 4 weeks later, I modded it and sent it home..\r\n\r\nduring this time, pimpike PM\'ed me about getting one done for him.  micro was gonna pay for it (pimpike didn\'t have paypal) and I was to get a chassis from micro.  on top of all this pimpike wanted me to ship it to a different address.  I declined the offer \'cause it had disadter written all over it.  I don\'t ship to any address other than the one in the paypal transaction,  unless the pimp is cat, lol....I get no protection if I don\'t ship to the paypal listed address.\r\n\r\nso that\'s it, done and done.......\r\n\r\n*fast fwd*\r\n\r\nnow just recently micromatch bought a biff turbo off me (again, via mummy\'s paysluts), cool, no sweats.  built the biff and shipped that fucker off....  two weeks later I get an email from micro\'s mother asking (politely too) what\'s the status of the order, when was it shipped etc, etc...\r\nI advised her on this and I got a reply.  All is cool, time to play the international shipping waiting game.  another week goes past and no confirmation..?  I shoot micro\'s mum an email querying the status, she reply\'s, no go....   I enquire to Aussie Post and they basically tell me to fuck off cause I didn\'t pay for registered post.  Bugger, I hate this....\r\n\r\nSo far, no pkg has arrived.  Unless micro is hiding it from his parents, that I don\'t know.... I offer them the oprion to build and ship another biff or refund their money ( that 30 days refund option in paypal).  They are happy with this response but are also willing to wait a few more days to see if the pkg will come.  His parent\'s seem quite nice, patient, people.  Your average dream customer, trust me, I\'ve had worse.....\r\n\r\nThis is where it gets interesting....\r\n\r\npimpike now posts in the thread above with a bad slag against micromatch....I turns out that the chassis I fet modded way back when was pimpike\'s and it looks like micro just went and kept it for himeslef the little shit... (it was a 49mhz chassis I modded) \r\n\r\nSo it\'s funny how my shipping issue with the biff turbo have landed micro\'s arse in hot water with pimpike.....\r\n\r\nAnd the shit that micro\'s posting about sending 3 chassis to me is crap.  I only ever recieved one.\r\n\r\nyou live and learn........\r\n\r\nph2t.');
