INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45438, 'df0f1f5428', 'Nakamichi car carrier and car', 'I have to say I love this cheap little thing! I just got it in the mail and to say the least I am very impressed !\r\n\r\nIt is a bit sized car carrier with motorized loading ramp and it comes with a bit type car.One remote covers both {has a switch -either car 49mhz or truck 27 mhz} and has a telescopic tube antennae, They have good speed and steering and finish is good too.The only bitches I have are :\r\n1. rear axle on car is not removeable\r\n2. upper level on the trailer has to be moved by hand\r\n3. the car body is held on with a screw at the front\r\n4. the truck takes seperate batteries\r\n\r\nThe car is not good for modding due to a large pcb board , I couldn\'t get any of my  other bodys to fit it , even though it has front and rear tabs in addition to the screw.Power is transferred to the trailer via contacts on the trucks 5 th wheel area.The steering on the truck is positve and very strong , I tried some real 18 wheeler steering manuvers with this and it worked flawlessly.Only the rear most set of wheels drive and has very aggressive tires . The truck ran very well on living room carpet.\r\n\r\nSorry for being long winded , I couldn\'t believe this thing , I was expecting a piece of crap and instead I got a excellant addition to my bit collection.\r\nI have no pics but I do have a link for an auction of another one that has pics.\r\nhttp://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;category=44025&amp;item=5900286985&amp;rd=1');
