INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45678, '7c6be784c4', 'Re: 20$ dremels', '[quote:7c6be784c4="synj"]in case any of you guys havent been to wally world lately...\r\nthey got 20$ cordless dremels \r\ni dont know if anyone has posted about this yet, \r\nbut just in case, i did[/quote:7c6be784c4]\r\n\r\nI\'ve had one for awhile now.  I love it!!!  It\'s what I used to grind the hell out of my Off Road Xmod...The blue thing the car is on.  I picked it up at Wal-Mart for just under $20 a few months ago.   \r\n\r\nHIGHLY Recommend one!!!!  Rechargable, lightweight, easy to use, 2 speed..5k/10k.\r\n\r\n[img:7c6be784c4]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/Xmod%20Stuff/Xmodtires_005.jpg[/img:7c6be784c4]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45679, '6c98639293', '', 'I think it would slow you down, unless the 2nd motor ran [color=green:6c98639293]exactly[/color:6c98639293] the same RPM\'s.  If it didn\'t, one motor would be restricting the other.  Plus, the power loss, single cell--two motors? Dual cell--two motors, maybe.\r\n\r\nTrial and error.......then sucess! :-D \r\n\r\nI\'m doing that now with some stuff, but its more on the error side right now. :-(     Trial and error that is, not the dual motor thing....');
