INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45858, '5b2cc7f717', 'the flying banana!', 'just got my i waver porsche body done. after losing the mirrors in about 1 minute i decided to go without them and the spoiler. this got me onto the idea of going for a minimalist look, just keeping the basic shape with minimal detail. i really could have done more sanding and undercoating but i got sick of waiting! you can see the odd part where some of the original details show through and some halfarsed sanding, but it\'s gonna get the shit scratched out of it anyway so no one will care!\r\n\r\n[img:5b2cc7f717]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10012/normal_porschefront.JPG[/img:5b2cc7f717]\r\n[img:5b2cc7f717]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10012/normal_porscheside.JPG[/img:5b2cc7f717]\r\n\r\nand as i explained, the scratches come quickly! this is after about 30 - 40 mins of backyard running!\r\n\r\n[img:5b2cc7f717]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10012/normal_porschescratchfront.JPG[/img:5b2cc7f717]\r\n[img:5b2cc7f717]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10012/normal_porschescratchrear.JPG[/img:5b2cc7f717]\r\n\r\nnext step is a buncha led\'s and underglow crap for added night time fun. then i\'ll slowly sand it back on the road! :cool:');
