INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45855, '8e9251e498', '', '[quote:8e9251e498="DarkTari"]Need Yo Inputs...\r\n\r\nThis is what I\'ve come up with for Auction Rules...\r\n\r\n[b:8e9251e498]Auction Rules:\r\n\r\n1).  Bidding starts when Da Ride hits Da Block (Sunday) and will continue  \r\n       for 1 week (Saturday midnight Est) The highest Bid at that time wins\r\n      Da Ride.\r\n2).  All Bids must be in $3.00 minimums after starting bid.\r\n3).  Payments will be made by Money Order or Cash.\r\n4).  Rides will be shipped when payment is finalized.\r\n5).  If there are any unresolvable issues with the winning bid, the next \r\n       highest bid wins.\r\n6).  Any Micro’s Auctioned on Da Block cannot participate in any current or \r\n       future BitPimp Contests.[/b:8e9251e498]\r\n\r\n Rule #3, C-Dub, do you have PayPal ?\r\n\r\nI\'m announce\'n Da Auction Tonight..... in Breakin News....[/quote:8e9251e498]\r\n1.) sounds cool to me\r\n2.) I say the reserved amount should be determined at the end (by posting time). I couldn\'t imagine how pissed I\'d be if our members tried to use some pimp tactics and set a low bid to win, and then all the sudden our members are "helping each other" out more than sticking to what we want to happen.\r\njust a thought. I\'m sure you all can go from there and see the ball of twine being wound, so to speak. we want to help everyone out without coming off needy, shadey, or anything near that.\r\nour laborous hours in the past confirms this, we\'ve worked to pull off the reputation we have and we need to keep it and not tarnish it - I don\'t want anything that someone might even construe (sp?) as shadey.\r\n3.) I like M.O. or cash, I don\'t care where it goes, as long as whatever contribution is deemed necessary (TBD), finds it way to help pay for this site.\r\n4.) perfect\r\n5.) not exactly sure what all this covers but in most cases, I agree.\r\n6.) exactly, good thinkin ahead bro.\r\n\r\n\r\nand no I don\'t have paypal.\r\nI\'m completely willing and trust-worthy to have you pimps take your cash, and send whatever you feel necessary to contribute to the fund.\r\nI want to make it damn clear that this is a joint effort and I don\'t / won\'t rule things with an iron fist until it gets to infringing on my or others\'s rights and contributions.');
