INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45861, 'a1c8c7bc16', '', '[quote:a1c8c7bc16]I couldn\'t imagine how pissed I\'d be if our members tried to use some pimp tactics and set a low bid to win, and then all the sudden our members are "helping each other" out more than sticking to what we want to happen. [/quote:a1c8c7bc16]\r\n#2 - Oh that won\'t happen !\r\nThere will be a reserve on ALL auction cars of at least $15.00 (whadaya think?) Every bid after that will be at a minimum of least $3.00.  I can\'t see\r\n.50 here, $1.25 there, can\'t see that at all.  $2.00 is cool also, whadaya think?\r\n\r\n[quote:a1c8c7bc16]I like M.O. or cash, I don\'t care where it goes, as long as whatever contribution is deemed necessary (TBD), finds it way to help pay for this site[/quote:a1c8c7bc16]#3 - Money should go directly to you, period !\r\n\r\n[quote:a1c8c7bc16]not exactly sure what all this covers but in most cases, I agree[/quote:a1c8c7bc16]#5 - Just incase someone wins the bid, then decides or isn\'t able to come up with the money, then it goes to the next highest bidder. We need to give a limit of 1 week for payment also.');
