INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (45972, '6f4f38bc77', 'You can\'t keep a Pimp down', 'All right, before I start, yes I know this was immature, but fuck you, we all play with little toy cars :-) \r\n\r\nSo anyhow, This Sunday I was workin at the Shack.  It was a nice ol\' day and pretty lighthearted considering it was just me and two 18 year old guys.  We were sellin like mad but still had some quality chill time.  Any how we had to throw some new digs up and tag it and what do ya know, this little thang sprung outta the bubble wrap.  \r\n[img:6f4f38bc77]http://www.radioshack.com/images/ProductCatalog/ProductImage/43/43-3578.jpg[/img:6f4f38bc77]\r\nNow it\'s really hard to see in this pic, but this is a Brushed Metal phone called the Urban Accents cordless phone.  One thing that struck me other than it\'s repulsive look was that it had a friggin screw in it to secure the battery cover.  Now this may seem not so odd to you guys, but I have never seen this before on a corless phone in the 6 years I have been dealing with this shit.  Well any how went to enter it into the computer and it wasn\'t there so I had to make my own tag.... Rut ro :???:   And thus, the "Pimp Phone" was born.  The tag read "Pimp Phone $39.99" and had the features listed as "Screw on batery cover so when your passed out your sleazy homies don\'t steal your battery".  So yeah, we all found it funny as shit, and I actually put it up, but what do ya know, it got slammin again and I quickly forgot about it.\r\n\r\nFast forward this morning me commin into work.  My manager says "I need to talk to you" no biggie I think, 1st of the month we have a review to set goals for the month.   Then the tag comes out... Ah shiat.  Lol well he found it and reported it to the GM, Bada bing I got my walking papers.  \r\n\r\nNow a Pimp is a pimp cuz he doesn\'t lay down, that\'s what the bitches are for, so I go to the GM.  I tell him this is a bit exreme considering my track record and sales record and he is all like, "It had reacist remarks on it"  And I ask what???  He says the word "Homies" is racist!  And I respond, "And so what then is "URBAN Accents"??"  He then said that I should go home for the day and he will call me back later today and see what can be done.  \r\n\r\nBonus, day off.... course I got kids and a wife to provide for, but I\'m not worried.  Fast forward 3 hours ago.  Ring a ling dinga, it\'s the GM, saying he is happpy to tell me that I will be transfering to another store (a higher Volume store closer to my house may I add) as long as I assure him no more Pimp Phones will pop up.  Well Sure no prob... \r\n\r\nThe lesson, Pimpin aint easy, but it nessesary, and hell I basically got my ass a raise (well as far as commision sales go, I did) :cool:  :cool:  :cool:  :cool:  :cool:');
