INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46014, '9bb916f4c4', '', 'I had to move this and unlock it for this beauty.\r\nthe setup:\r\nI sign on, boom - PMs waiting - I check, I see this:\r\n[quote:9bb916f4c4="stampede_dude"]iam kind of neww to modding micros and it seems like hogjwls follows me around.i am not being sissy or anything,but i find out what i post isnt sufficient and i ask to delete it and he changes the title and message to something vulgar or rude.i might be new but he is acting like a bitch to me in everything i post and he wont get off my case.could you maybe tell him to lay off?hes making me look like a fool.please do not take this wrong,i just would like him to lay off.please disreguard this if you think it is not appropriate.\r\n                                                     Thanks,\r\n                                                        stampede_dude[/quote:9bb916f4c4]\r\nI\'m feeling nice so I reply with the typical, "look don\'t take it to heart as much as a warning" type response.\r\nat this point I still haven\'t even had a chance to look at the posts he\'s referring to, but it doesn\'t matter.\r\n\r\nI then get this PM:\r\n[quote:9bb916f4c4="stampede_dude"]thanks lots cabo-no i understand.if you dont mind me asking,could you please delete the post in the trade forum t that says i have sex violently with animals and stuff?its kinda embarrasing[/quote:9bb916f4c4]at this point I\'m ready to barf from laughing so hard.\r\nas I\'m wiping away the tears, I get another PM:\r\n[quote:9bb916f4c4="stampede_dude"]i was dumb enough not to read the b/s/t rules-sorry.i have no use for the thread i made anyways.sorry i am annoying you,if i am.[/quote:9bb916f4c4]the previous PM was the kicker, sweet jesus that was great.');
