INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46058, '077d54a28a', '', 'Thank you hog, excellent observation there bro. :-) \r\nMost people get into the sport mentality and only look at the other side as "the opposing" side. They then get blinded to facts and forget that these people are really no different than us people.\r\nHere\'s another "crasy" story.\r\nhttp://www.911uncovered.com/twintowers.html\r\nQuestion yourself this, would we be at war with iraq right now if 911 didn\'t happen? We found sadam hiding in a lil hole but we can\'t find one piece of evidence for a wmd program. Why is N.Korea getting "diplomatic" treatment with even the general public knowing that they have a nuclear weapons program?\r\nI could go on for days, but luckly for you guys my mind likes to wander. :-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46059, 'e3a488bebb', 'i was wondering...would this work?', 'i put big lego wheels on my ZZ once and it wouldnt turn.i have heard people say that is the weakness of the steering return spring.if you pop open a floppy disk,there is a return return spring on the metal piece that guards the information disk.i was wodering if the spring in the floppy   would work in a ZZ to make it turn better?i dont have the big wheels on it  anymore,so i cant test.it seems like the steering magnet is pretty strong in my cars, but could it handle the spring?');
