INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46118, 'b23fa6d8b2', '', '[quote:b23fa6d8b2="hue35"]Fuel injected 427... baddest of the bad and nothin\'s gonna change \r\nmy mind. The picture was taken in 1969 (the year I was born), and \r\nhe raced until I was about 10. Those motors were blueprinted and \r\nmachined to perfection by a local drag motor rocket scientist... \r\nmost beautiful sound I\'ve ever heard.\r\n\r\nI\'m with ya though, Payaso... that Ford GT is a beautiful car.[/quote:b23fa6d8b2]Hey looky there. That cars got the same roughed in racer look as Hue\'s bits.\r\nEven gots da 35 on the door.  :???: \r\n\r\nCoincidence? I\'m not thinkin\' so...\r\n\r\nReally though, that\'s pretty bad ass Hue. Musta have been cool to have grown up around.\r\n\r\nI was born and raised a GM man myself. My dad\'s baby was \'63 Gran Prix, but despite my leanings I have to admit I haven\'t seen anything really exciting come out of GM in a while, and that Ford GT is pretty f\'in awesome.');
