INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46181, '82c968f45f', '', 'I\'ve owned quite a few cars in my time including:\r\n\r\n- \'73 vdub super beetle (bought it when I was 15 and never go to drive it)\r\n- \'77 Pontiac Firebird -Ice blue with T-tops and white vinyl buckets\r\n- \'80 Mustang - hooked up to look like an \'82 GT\r\n- \'77 caprice classic - 305, Blue with tan vinyl top and tan vinyl interior and chrome around the wheel wells (this was the keg-haulin\' pimp mobile for sure!)\r\n- \'95 Cavalier Z24\r\n- \'83 Subaru GL Wagon\r\n- \'90 Celebrity Eurosport Wagon\r\n- \'01 Subaru Forester\r\n\r\nSeems I got less cool as I aged  :???: \r\n\r\nI have been pretty lucky with all of my cars, but I think that \'77 Caprice ruled them all. That thing was a reliable work horse and looked so pimp. It had dents in the quarter panels from the inside out from the beer kegs rollin\' around in the trunk. So, although I am not all that partial to any one car maker, more partial to individual cars, I have to go with Chevy on this one.\r\n\r\nEdit: Alright, you got me reminiscing now. Here is the \'77 pimp mobile, just picture it in medium blue:\r\n\r\n[img:82c968f45f]http://www.thevine.net/movie/equipment/caprice3.gif[/img:82c968f45f]\r\n\r\nDamn I had fun in that car.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46182, '76c3c2312a', '', 'What\'s really fucked up is that you believe that shit payaso. I highly doubt that that would happen and the spin doctors wouldn\'t unleash the media hounds on it. We would have heard it on ever news channel and read it in every paper. Why? Beucase it makes our guys look like the good guys and sways the general public from "feeling" bad about an illegal war. Think about it man, these people are fighting occupiers for what? Their homes and cars? No. They are fighting for their way of life. Use women and children as shields, only in the movies. :-)');
