INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46194, 'c5ca08b88f', '', 'ummm not everything is an x-file...\r\n\r\nI have friends in the military and I know exactly where they are and what awaits them. it\'s not illegal by any means for a soldier to reveal his orders - unless of course we\'re talking special forces (given proper orders to not divulge any info.) - which most these guys aren\'t - they\'re grunts just like the rest of us so the government doesn\'t give 2 shits what he says because they can sway the media to either back it or step away from it depending on what suits their needs. even if the media runs the opposite way - since when has that stopped our government from anything?\r\n\r\nI find it impossible to believe that the trade towers being blown up was a conspiracy, that\'s just plain stupid thinking - backed by nothing but some insane conspiracy theorists own self-deluted thoughts and ignorance (in the truest definition of the word).\r\n\r\nand to be perfectly honest, anyone shooting at me and my family (like Michael Jackson says - it don\'t matter if your black or white... or whatever). I\'ll fuckin peel your cap back and not loose a wink of sleep.\r\nwhy? because you forced me to. you forced me to defend myself, what other options do I have? to keep letting you try to kill me and my family?\r\nand if you\'re willing to die, then I have to respect and accept your willingness and do whatever I can to make that will of yours either crumble or dis-appear.\r\nsuch is war. its perpetuated and there\'s no stopping it. why? because everyone has their own opinions and everyone thinks their opinion is the one that should matter and fuck everyone elses. not to mention that barely anything is actually "run by or for the people", it\'s all about making the fat cats fatter - the rest get the shaft.\r\n\r\nfunny how the "US are the bad guys" but all across this world, most of the population is trying to get in to the US or mimicing their social structures off of the US\'s example. I don\'t really see a huge rush of the worlds population ever trying to get in to another country to try and take advantage of the "golden road to promise". lol\r\n\r\nwelcome to crazy town (fuckin dumb commercials)\r\n\r\nat any rate, I try to stay out of these convo\'s (god, abortion, war, computers) because of the Riki Lake effect (accomplish nothing but whine from all sides and stir the pot).\r\nso don\'t take my post as claiming anything to be right or wrong - take it as it is written, my own personal feelings on all this stupid "conspiracy" talk. you can agree or dis-agree - that\'s the point.\r\nI won\'t tell you to pull your head out of your ass and change your entire views on life just because our opinions may vary, thankfully - that\'s why we live in this country - so you can say shit like that.\r\n\r\n\r\nwhere\'s chuck norris when ya need him, he\'d have all this wrapped up in 90 minutes of film. lol\r\n\r\n\r\nby the way, I\'m an American born citizen with German in my blood, my wife is a Canadian born citizen with Lebonesse in her blood. I think the only other major race I\'m missing is Asian and I sure do like the Happy Hunan Buffet :lol: \r\nso there - does that make me the official voice on foreign politics?\r\nof course not, but that is exacly how I feel some people are coming off when I read their posts.\r\n\r\nhence my comment "reading this thread is like watching an episode of Riki Lake"');
