INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46205, '38ae1b66c1', '', 'and that almost sort of justifies us invading afghanistan. we knew that al queda was based trhere and allowed to run free. we warned the taliban and then did what we said. so yes the retaliation mentality for that conflict i cannot say was totally wrong.\r\n\r\niraq on the other hand, didnt send people here to blow anything up(that we have a shred of proof on at least). iraq was not a threat to us. we had them pinned between two no fly zones and you can bet we were watchin all their communications. \r\n\r\nyou know who has the most wmd in the world?\r\n\r\nthats right, the country that invades other countries for havin wmd. \r\n\r\nNow yes saddam was an asshole. but pretty much any leader of any country is an asshole.  nobody wants all that power without any seedy personal motive.\r\n\r\nlook at it this way. we have a president who was NOT elected by majority. he has officially invaded two countries in less than 3 years and has funded at least one coup. fucker has isolated us from most of our business/military allies. has fucked our economy in the ass  and then injected with paintthinner. all this while eroding most of the bill of rights. dude did a hell of a lot in one term. im sorry id rather live with money and freedom (with the fear of a terrorist lighting a bomb off every few years in the back of my mind). than live like walt disney\'s children with lots of security barriers.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46209, 'dc152bc123', '', 'i use superglue as my putty of choice. if you prep it the same as the plastic (sand all over, wash thoroughly) you should be fine. the paint stays on fine until i grind it off on the road. i\'d avoid epoxy, whenever i\'ve used it it tends to set a little too soft for sanding. could be the brand i\'ve used, but super glue sets nice and hard.');
