INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46281, 'ba944f68bc', 'win some lose some', 'ok went to burlington today. got a clone.\r\n\r\n[img:ba944f68bc]http://mywebpages.comcast.net/myaaiko/1a.jpg[/img:ba944f68bc]\r\n\r\nfor the price these things kick ass.\r\n\r\n[img:ba944f68bc]http://mywebpages.comcast.net/myaaiko/1b.jpg[/img:ba944f68bc]\r\n\r\nhow can you go wrong with such finely detailed designs and decals saying \r\n"farfamed" "nicety" "apparition" and the best and most controversial "white unique power" as well as "top flight super"\r\n\r\n[img:ba944f68bc]http://mywebpages.comcast.net/myaaiko/1c.jpg[/img:ba944f68bc]\r\n\r\nas you can see we have your standard clone in a dome here. now with these thunderfighters(my 2nd) you have a shitty ass body and a really good chassis/electronics/motor. \r\n\r\n[img:ba944f68bc]http://mywebpages.comcast.net/myaaiko/1d.jpg[/img:ba944f68bc]\r\n\r\n49mhz\r\n\r\n[img:ba944f68bc]http://mywebpages.comcast.net/myaaiko/1e.jpg[/img:ba944f68bc]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nput her together charge her up and nothin. battery charges, but nothing on or off the controller. D.O.A. beyatch. im sure it can be fixed(pcb swap) but since ill be a block away waitning for a bus i may as well go get another they have a ton.\r\n\r\nsooooooo lesson learned today: clones are like russion roulette');
