INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46410, '07f22cfe7d', '', '[quote:07f22cfe7d="chrome"]Hey pimps.  Any way we can see these cars before the auction starts?  I\'ve gotta leave for a 10 day trip on the 11th and will be away from a comp.  I\'d really love to have a piece of your guys work though.\r\n\r\nEspecially if DarkTari auctions his Beetle.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...[/quote:07f22cfe7d]\r\n\r\n1st off, No I won\'t be auctioning off anything from Da DarkTari Collection.\r\nEverything on Da Auction Block will be NEW!  Nothing you\'ve seen posted before and will not see until it hits Da Block  8) \r\n2nd, I don\'t know where your trip will take you, or what you\'ll be doin but I\'m sure you can cruise thru Da Hood at some time!  We will be auctioning off at the very least 8 cars, 1 car per week, we may extend it another couple weeks if we get the turn out we expect.  Time will tell  :cool:');
