INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46424, 'a1cc44ff20', '', 'New playlist is up: :cool: \r\n[list:a1cc44ff20]\r\n[*:a1cc44ff20][b:a1cc44ff20]Beat Nuts[/b:a1cc44ff20] - Hardcore\r\n[*:a1cc44ff20][b:a1cc44ff20]Digable Planets[/b:a1cc44ff20] - The May 4th Movement\r\n[*:a1cc44ff20][b:a1cc44ff20]Faith No More[/b:a1cc44ff20] - Midlife Crisis\r\n[*:a1cc44ff20][b:a1cc44ff20]Gorillaz[/b:a1cc44ff20] - Latin Simone\r\n[*:a1cc44ff20][b:a1cc44ff20]Colonel Les Claypool\'s Fearless Flying Frog Brigade[/b:a1cc44ff20] - Sheep\r\n[/list:u:a1cc44ff20]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46425, 'a74baadf47', '', 'http://www.crazybydesign.net/bitpimps/tunes/CLCFFFBLiveFrogsSet2.zip (38.7 MB)\r\n\r\nColonel Les Claypool\'s Fearless Flying Frog Brigade - Live Frogs Set 2\r\n1. Dogs [2]\r\n2. Pigs (Three Different Ones) [1]\r\n3. Pigs On The Wing Part 1 [3]\r\n4. Pigs On The Wing Part 2 [5]\r\n5. Sheep [4]\r\n\r\n\r\nIn case you haven\'t recognized, these are all Pink Floyd covers from the album Animals.\r\nIn case you\'re wondering, the brackets with a # inside (e.g. [1]) represent the order in which the original tracks were placed on the original album. (Pink Floyd - Animals)\r\n\r\nWhat impresses me so much about this particular album is the guts the Les had to take an eclectic mix of no-names (not for lack of talent) and cover a band that has had the least covers ever been done. They\'re almost impossible to cover - and I think the Frog Brigade pulled it off - it\'s amazing.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46426, '0f427fe547', '', '[quote:0f427fe547="hogjowlz"]i can imagine over on trc or mrcc right now\r\n\r\n"dude its so much like fast and furious. i put the stickers on and i can drift better now!!! and the underlighting would make me jizz my pants if i was old enough to produce sperm"[/quote:0f427fe547]Yeah, you know when I saw these, my first thought was, "Hey how come I didn\'t know about these?" Then shortly after I got home with them, it occurred to me, "Oh yeah, they\'d probably get into these more at TRC than bitPimps."\r\n\r\nOh well, I\'m a sucka for stickers.  :-D \r\n[img:0f427fe547]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/acurabs6.jpg[/img:0f427fe547]\r\n[img:0f427fe547]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/acurabs7.jpg[/img:0f427fe547]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAlright, here\'s the deal Radio Shack, the stickers they were entertaining for a moment there, but no where near the value of a fast motor and gears. So I propose you don\'t do this again, and return we\'ll save our money for the good stuff, but would it really kill you to include one little sticker sheet with every Zip Zap, and body set?');
