INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46480, '8f918197b6', '', 'Bah my Shacks up here are hella slow.   Don\'t have those bodies yet.  But you know me, I love my Jap cap Rice and I am a sucker for Hondas.  Now Don\'t be Hatin 8-)   But the stickers instead of motors is very very lame.  I\'ll smack up some Shack bitches for all yall.  Won\'t get me anywhere but should be entertaining. :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46481, 'a93fd0784b', '', 'Yeah I did and thanks Bird. :-)   The tires just come off if you shave the back, but they are crap.  Zip tires do the trick better.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46482, 'b1dc19dce7', '', 'ill be the first to admit that japan has fine engineers. but fast and the furious corrupted america in a very disgusting way. fucking neons with big spoilers going past my house makes me want to poop.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46483, '40fecfc605', '', '[quote:40fecfc605="hogjowlz"]how do they sit on a regular zz?[/quote:40fecfc605]Maybe slughtly better, but about the same really.\r\n\r\nAt the risk of sounding cheesy, the underglow works pretty good, and I like it.  :-D \r\nSo I guess I\'ll save these bodies for night racing, but I\'m already figuring how I could hook up the SE lights to function with a bit PCB, so maybe I can get it lowered on a standard Zip Zap chassis, and still keep the lights. \r\n\r\nA couple more notes; these bodies are extra wide, the fatty Zip Zap wheels in the back almost look right, certainly better than the stock wheels. And also the larger more scale looks has the drawback that a little Integra dwarfs a \'69 Camaro sitting next to it. That just aint right.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46484, 'ac0b908bb7', '', 'What a tight boat SG.  You have to have some park in your hood with a pond that you could let that mamma jamma rip in.  When you go tho get a captains hat some laofers and a fatty Ciggar and take some vids.   :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46485, '45648c89db', '', 'Like this guy with a stogie or the Captain from Gilligans Island.\r\n\r\n[img:45648c89db]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/contest%20land%20and%20sea/captain.jpg[/img:45648c89db]\r\n\r\nor\r\n\r\n[img:45648c89db]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/RC%20Pimp%20Stuff/contest%20land%20and%20sea/gilligan.jpg[/img:45648c89db]\r\n\r\nI like the laid back Capt. better. :cool:');
