INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46541, '7f11d12ec2', 'yea yea yea, tanks fo replyin\'-glizzad to bizze at BitPimps!', '\'Sup to all the G\'s, moneyz, hustlaz, playaz, haytaz, n\' regulataz.  REGULATE!  Coz I be rollin up in dis bitch.  Skeet skeet skeet like a mudafucka.  What?  What?  What?  Okay!  Yeyah!\r\n\r\nHail to the king, baby...\r\n\r\nHad to get that off my chest.  Not too often I can use my dirty mouth.  Ya know, I wonder if that direct terminal wiring might work.  I can time it for say, 45 seconds and see what happens, but I wanna make a 3.0v battery adaptor by making a shape of 2 AA batteries and lead two metal points on the shape to a DC adaptor and see what happens, maybe give a full clean charge to a 200mAh battery without premature drain from shitty batteries.  If that works, kickass.  I once had an old Frogger mini arcade machine running on 6 C batteries adapted for DC, and it was rokken like Dokken.  Wait, they suck ass.  Eagles of Death Metal.  Now that is rockin\'.  Anyway, yeah.  I\'ll try that on 45sec. when I get a soldering pencil from Radioshack.  I\'ve got to anyway \'cause my 49MHz charger/controller for another car had two wires that need resoldered.  That\'s small fries compared to this shit job.  \r\nI also wonder about that whole PCB thing, because it seems to work fine charging on all my other shit, so I figure it\'s fine.  \r\n\r\nKeep up da replies.  They help alot.\r\nP.S.- Y\'all bitches betta recognize :cool: \r\njaane ^_^');
