INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46594, '2812b6152b', 'FAQ: Why is hogjowlz such an asshole?', '[b:2812b6152b]this is for the little bitches who get served and go and whine to cabowabo. guess what guys, im in constant communication with him and he made me a moderator for a reason so your pms get right back to me and it just makes you look like a moron. so best advice here is if you get served: shut the fuck up and sit back cuz butting heads just gets the pack of wolves unleashed on your punkass.[/b:2812b6152b]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n1: this is a private site and nobody begged you to come here\r\n\r\n2: you dont know how to listen\r\n\r\n3: you are not contributing to the board in a good manner\r\n\r\n4: you were warned or did something so fucked up that you didnt even deserve a warning\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nthis is not a democratic site guys. it has an owner who lays the law down and its my job to enforce that shit.  we have crafted a pretty damn special niche in the bit world and the web and it didnt happen by accident. this is because we have assembled a large amount of (semi)like minded bit freaks who are sick of the pc disney crap out there.  we believe that if you are comfortable and can be yourself your work will be better and more original and well our galleries speak for themselves.  \r\n\r\ngenerally the more good work you show us the more lenient we are on you. not that we dont allow new modders to post here. that is fine but dont come rollin up like your shit dont stink if you cant back it up cuz you will get a virtual brick in your face. \r\n\r\nthis will probably get edited a buncha times til i think my point got across pretty good so fuck your mother and enjoy the bits douchebag.');
