INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46654, '2e785c0e33', '', 'it\'s all good! check dis!\r\n\r\n[img:2e785c0e33]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10012/Happy%20snaps%2821%29.jpg[/img:2e785c0e33]\r\n\r\nthey work so well, only coming unseated during rollovers. as can be expected torque is reduced and top speed is better, but i\'m currently runnig a 9t pinion so dropping down to a 6t will make it spit dirt! the tyres themselves are great, plenty grippy on concrete and a little bouncy. i can go across the grass too, thanks to the larger diameter. it gets stuck sometimes in a tall part BUT. lego comes to the rescue again! :eek: \r\n\r\nthis car has the same rims as the other, so i can only assume that these tyres will fit just as well.\r\n[img:2e785c0e33]http://cache.lego.com/images/shop/Products/TYPE07/LEGO-US-2057/Alt384x288us008383.jpg[/img:2e785c0e33]\r\n\r\nhow good is that!!!!! :eek: \r\n\r\nand the first person that says "why don\'t you just buy an overland" is gonna cop a punch in tha neck! :blazin:');
