INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46669, 'dec4e01205', '', 'I used to use the Testors Clear Coat, that shit gives one hella shine but it takes almost 4 days before it cures completely.  Then if you handle it a lot it\'ll start to get tacky.  I bought some Rustolium Satin Laquer to do my Interior &amp; Controller.  THis stuff dries COMPLETELY in 5 minutes!  Also picked up Rustolium Gloss Lacquer for the body.  This dries COMPLETELY in 5 minutes also (1 coat). I\'ve done 3-4 coats and it dried COMPLETELY in a few hours and gives a shine very comparable, if not better than the Testors  :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46670, 'e025c9abb5', '', 'Do you pimps realize that iraq\'s are paying 5 cents a gallon for gas while we pay over a $2.00 a gallon for it?I am not one to blame my problems on the U.S. political climate  , but now I am wondering if I was wrong. Before 9/11 I was making 50k year  , house payment , credit cards , nice rides , tons of toys{ 2 different scale train layouts , a collection of every model car made from 1965-1985 , over 500 Ho , 1/32 , 1/24 slotcars, plus my 1:1 car collection} .I had a life of luxury all the toys I could want , happy family , working 12 hours a day and makin lots of loot.Then 3 months after 9/11 I was fired from my job and it all went to hell , by the following july everything was gone and my house was in foreclosure.All we had left was a rust bucket ford pickup truck and a 1978 chevy wagon .Now we have put that all behind us got a little house that is paid for , the family is happy again , but our financial situation still is fucked.I see these soldiers come back from iraq and buy high end cars and live large.My buddy didn\'t pull down large loot when he went to desert storm , something is very wrong here .Clinton may have lived on secretary blowjobs but Bush2 has really fucked everything up.....bad.');
