INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46720, 'feb7162c81', '', '[quote:feb7162c81="hue35"] this place is a lot like a neighborhood bar. There\'s a reason why kids ain\'t welcome in bars. There are plenty of other sites that are kid friendlier, so sometimes I wish we could card at the door and keep the little fucks away... yeah, I\'m a crusty old bastard before my time... what of it?[/quote:feb7162c81]\r\n\r\ngreat minds think alike. i was just thinking that this place aint really an rc forum, it\'s a digital hood. and hoods can smell their own. if they wondered down to "crip" territory (they still going?) they\'d have their asses gokued lickety split! and hoods have initiations of sorts. thankfully it don\'t involve a physical beating here as i and i\'m sure most of us are weeds. but we\'d still go down with a chunka flesh between our teeth!! like an angry ferret!!:x');
