INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46762, 'e01db85244', '', '2 more days... cant wait.    \r\n\r\n one BIG request...  you reckon one basic detail, i.e the model of each car could be released in a list in the next couple o days?\r\n\r\n   i dont want a release shedule or nothin, just a rough idea of what pimped out rides are going to be released over the 8+ weeks.    \r\n\r\n  the reason, i\'ll probably only get a chance at getting one of the nicest examples of american artistry if i\'m lucky... and all i want is a chevy...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n   looks like i\'m going to have to bid my ass off for it.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46763, '00886c7a4d', '', '[quote:00886c7a4d="Finks"][quote:00886c7a4d="z-beam"]i got given my first car three weeks ago, its a 89 bmw 318i   cherry red. my lil\' sisters getting married, and for some strange reason i get a car...\r\n    pity i aint got my licence yet...[/quote:00886c7a4d]\r\n\r\nWhat?  Z how old are you?  You carry yourself as if you are older than this post makes you sound.  Wait lil Sister... nm I am just flaking I guess. :-?[/quote:00886c7a4d]\r\n\r\n\r\n i\'m 22. but dont let that fool ya, i live like i\'m 40... even tho i have never had a liscence doesn\'t mean i haven\'t driven.  \r\n my womans 32, and i wouldn\'t keep her if i couldnt........\r\n\r\n\r\nand hog, in my opinion my sister is the fugliest bitch in australia.  she is pure evil and we gave each other shit for years.  all my mates wouldn\'t touch her with a bargepole. and as she got older she was beaten even more by gods uglystick.  for one whole year i called her pigdog. i never fucked that up once! from one birthday to the next...');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46764, 'e05827f4f5', '', 'Ok, now I\'m frustrated. I go back to Reranch, and they got new message board software since I\'ve been there. The great post with all the technical info can\'t be found, but then while I\'m doing me seach I see several people refer to Acrylics and Enamels in the same sentence.\r\n\r\nSo apparently even the guitar refinishing forums have started just using Acrylic as a generic term, and I know they\'re not talking abou the water based stuff in the hobby store. So apparently I\'m the only one that has a problem with that.\r\n\r\nSo I guess I am sorry that I\'m so sensitive, and Supefly, sorry man you\'re that last one I wanted to make an example of, it\'s just that if I\'d like to be the same page with someone, then you\'d be one of them.\r\n\r\n\r\nBUT, am I really wrong. If everyone uses acrylic as a generic term, doesn\'t it get confusing? I think it does, and I will stand behind that.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46765, '03341c15ef', '', '[quote:03341c15ef="Finks"][quote:03341c15ef]I\'m afraid to go there and get yelled at.  [/quote:03341c15ef]\r\n\r\nmuhahaha fear us!  Well you gotta respect him tho, he knows he will ask dumb ass questions, and he knows how we will respond, unlike some fuck wits we have here.[/quote:03341c15ef]You know though, I\'m kinda confused about that one.\r\n\r\nI don\'t really want people to fear us, and avoid us. I\'d like for everyone hang out in the hood, just not act stupid.\r\n\r\nI feel bad sometimes, cause I think I\'m being misunderstood most the time. I\'m just trying to be helpful. I don\'t mean to be an asshole, but I guess I just can\'t help it sometimes. \r\n\r\nI piss people off wherever I go. \r\n\r\n\r\nAlso, just one other vaguely related little thing that frustrates me. I hate when someone asks a question that\'s been asked before, but hasn\'t been addressed in a while, and they get the usual "do a search" response.\r\n\r\nI believe readdressing an issue with new blood around can bring some new points to the surface, and help advance the hobby. \r\n\r\nI especially hated that "do a search" thing at TRC, because you\'d read through 10 pages of an old thread, just to find out they never really had the answer.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I\'m apparently ranting again, so I\'ll stop.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHi my name\'s Dave, and I\'m a asshole.  :-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46766, '74df2322b3', '', 'haha i still call my siter "gomer" i dont really know why i call her gomer but its still halarious.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46767, '2bfe80af5a', '', '[quote:2bfe80af5a="z-beam"]one BIG request...  you reckon one basic detail, i.e the model of each car could be released in a list in the next couple o days?[/quote:2bfe80af5a]Ummm, nope. I\'m still deciding how I\'m gonna modify my cars, but I will say this. I think maybe, that I might, more than likely, but still not sure, be doing something with the \'71 Mustang Zip Zap body.\r\n\r\nBUT I\'ll make no promises, cause if I do that I\'ll jinx myself, and break that body in half. Sooooo...expect nothing, and just be surprised by what you see!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46768, '3f3d2da7ce', '', 'I don\'t think you\'re wrong, Dave, and I don\'t really know the true answer. I was using the term like saying kleenex instead of facial tissue. I\'ll do a little digging and see if I can find any information on what\'s what.\r\n\r\nBelieve me, I completely understand where you\'re coming from. I too hate when people use the wrong word to describe something, even when both of us know what they really mean.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46769, '64afaec880', '', '[img:64afaec880]http://www.libertymeadows.com/images/ComicFightClubs.jpg[/img:64afaec880]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46770, '8280b48c27', '', '[quote:8280b48c27="crazydave"]I don\'t really want people to fear us, and avoid us......\r\n\r\nAlso, just one other vaguely related little thing that frustrates me. I hate when someone asks a question that\'s been asked before, but hasn\'t been addressed in a while, and they get the usual "do a search" response.\r\n\r\nI believe readdressing an issue with new blood around can bring some new points to the surface, and help advance the hobby. \r\n\r\nI especially hated that "do a search" thing at TRC, because you\'d read through 10 pages of an old thread, just to find out they never really had the answer.[/quote:8280b48c27]\r\n\r\nI can agree on Dave on this point, to a certain degree.  Sometimes bringing a topic back to life can be good, but that do a search thing doesn\'t always give you the right material you\'re looking for, Like reading 10 pages of "Wow, how\'d you get that to do that on your Skyline.?" or "What a cool sticker!!"\r\n\r\nI know its a little easier to get what your looking for here, because our mods do a great job on keeping things in line and where the posts belong, but there are some theads that are full of smiley exchanges... :grin: \r\n\r\nI agree that people shouldn\'t be scared, but definately imtimidated a little.  Just enough to realize they can\'t get away with posting, "How do you change the tires on a ZipZap?" and "If I put a sticker on my skyline wing, will it be slower because of the air flow?" \r\n\r\nThose questions deserve a good kick in the balls! :cool: \r\n\r\nBye... :-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46771, 'fd2234f679', '', '[quote:fd2234f679="crazydave"]\r\nI don\'t really want people to fear us, and avoid us. I\'d like for everyone hang out in the hood, just not act stupid.\r\n[/quote:fd2234f679]\r\n\r\nPoint taken.  Course if you can\'t box don\'t get in the ring.  It says it right in the name "Pimps" arn\'t known for being the model of good behavior and if I am not wrong this site was founded on bringing like minded bit modders together.  Bottom line, I personally will cut more slack but there is a line and when it\'s crossed I enjoy going off. :grin: \r\n\r\nI know there will be different feelings here, for me I just want what is best for the site that I have grown to love.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46772, '03d9abda1b', '', 'well i see this site as kind of "second level". bitPimps forsure isnt the first board you should goto if you are into this hobby.  you can always tell the people who read up a lot before ever posting here. and you can tell the morons who got kicked off trc and mrcc before thinking they can get away with the same shit here.  somehow charlie has stuck around and hes almost getting it now? \r\n\r\n\r\nanyhow i may be a little more on edge lately but school is out now and last summer we had a major influx of little twerps with nothin better to do so i guess im just flexin my muscles a little harder.');
