INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46835, '17f4951645', '', '[quote:17f4951645="Son_Gokou"]#1: The reason that I can\'t test it out for myself is that I don\'t have the tools or money to do it. So this is why I take info and use it. I don\'t get $300 a month to spend on these things, so I can\'t buy the tools immediatley. [/quote:17f4951645]Oh BS, you\'re making excuses. \r\n\r\nOk so I\'m an adult and I have a job, you think that means I got money to blow left and right? I\'ve got to pay rent, bills, keep food in our mouths, and buy toys for my kid. I\'m lucky if I have $15-$20 month to spend on my cars, but I do have almost 30 working cars. Why? For one [i:17f4951645]I don\'t break \'em.[/i:17f4951645]. (Well not all of them)\r\n\r\nTools, you wanna talk tools? I\'ve got a 5 dolla soldering iron from Radio Shack, a 8 dollar generic knife set, and a $15 multi meter. Now with all the cars you\'ve broke, don\'t tell me you can\'t afford that. Or should I say your parents can\'t afford that.\r\n\r\nI do body work with a 50 cent tube of super glue, some plastic that would have gone in the trash, and 50 cent emery boards. So just don\'t give me that crap, cause I don\'t wanna hear it. Period.\r\n\r\n[quote:17f4951645]There\'s something called "learning". I don\'t know how to record a video on the current camera my parents let me use, but I\'ll get a better camera one day and I\'ll LEARN. [/quote:17f4951645]Yes there is something called learning, what the hell does camera have to do with that. See you\'re not trying to learn what we\'re doing. You trying to be a bad ass and invent some new mod, when you don\'t even understand what you\'re talking about. That is not learning. \r\n\r\n[quote:17f4951645]#2: Can you find any examples of these "pontifications" that aren\'t a month old? [/quote:17f4951645]Ummm yeah, this freakin\' thread right here. Why the hell do you think ph2t said that. Jeez get a clue.\r\n\r\n[quote:17f4951645]I\'m LEARNING ph2t, I know what my past mistakes were and I\'m currently trying to correct them. As hogjowlz said, I\'m TRYING HARD to fit in. And the FETs I ordered from digikey haven\'t even come in yet, and my dad ordered them for me 2 Sundays ago! I promise you as soon as they come in, and when I have time, I WILL MOD THE FUCKING CAR and post up pics...and videos, when I get a better camera.[/quote:17f4951645]That\'s just exactly it. You\'re trying so damn hard. Stop it, and knock it off with the camera excuse, when you start to get it, we will be able to tell, but some vid would definately help your case.\r\n\r\nAt any rate your whole last post was just a big excuse. A lie so to speak. Either you\'re lying to us, or yourself. If you really believe half that BS you spouted, then you\'re lying to yourself, and need to take a step back and really re-evaluate where you\'re going wrong.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46836, '18c842b769', '', 'when i was laying down an epoxy sealant on some tables once . the directiond stated that it was likely that bubbles would be included in the mix. it stated that the best way to remove these was by blowing carbon dioxide across the surface. the simplest source of carbon dioxide is you! try blowing across the surface with a straw, it worked like magic with the epoxy. dunno if it\'s the same deal with acrylics but can\'t hurt to try.');
