INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46846, '8b31822c9b', '', 'i don\'t mind hearing about sg busting cars cos at least he\'s trying. there will come a day when he attempts to repair something and it actually gets fixed. took me a while but you get there.\r\n\r\nand as for money, fergit it! i\'m on tha welfare. the reason alot of us come up with brilliant mods is because we can\'t afford to buy tricked out shit all the time, so we try to make it. or it hasn\'t been made and we want it so we try to make it. i probably would never have done a full suspension bit if they were available for sale.\r\n\r\nand tools? i\'m the same as cd, i use hacksawblades with no handle, concrete for sanding and a cordless drill that smokes when used etc etc.\r\n\r\nand camera? for all those "amazingly perfessional" shots i take i\'m using an old 1.2mpx tank of a camera that uses 1.4mb floppy discs for storage.\r\n\r\nso the moral of the story is make the most of what you\'ve got.\r\n\r\none of my greatest heroes leonardo da vinci invented shit like gliders and cars before there was technology to do so. medical science is now poring over his work and discovering that he made observations about the human body that no one has. he didn\'t have lots of cash, a fancy digi cam or even a forum to discuss ideas. in fact he was hated by alot of religious and science types claiming his ideas were stupid or anti god.');
