INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46857, 'e599fce3ab', '', 'Well, I guess I should give a lil background. :???: \r\nI was born and raised right here, in Albany NY. I\'ve lived most my life here and from being the punk/hoodlum that I was I got pretty good personal experiences with atleast the local authorities. I then take those experiences and apply them to the "greater" picture and I begin to see parrallels. For example, when smoking pot with white kids in a suburban setting all that would happen when caught is the pot being taken away or at worst a "scare" tactic (like taking us to the precint and calling our parents). Now the same situation with the brothers or some poor ass mother fuckers with a misdemenar or two. You get shackled together and read the miranda and get to spend a night or two in the lockup till the judge sees ya. Believe that. What did I learn from this? Not that racists run things, that shit aint true. It\'s money. Money fuckin rules all. The kids in the burbs got mommy and daddy\'s bank roll for back, and the cops know this.\r\nThat is all there is to it. The fuckin basics for everything. We don\'t give two shits about anyone else (in the governments eyes) if they don\'t have something of worth. Am I wrong? We as the only "super power" left on the planet don\'t need any "premptive" strikes to defend ourselves. We have agency upon agency that should be doing there jobs. If they fuck up then it\'s the management that needs to be looked at/blamed. Consider this shit part one. I\'ll countinue if yall want some other time.');
