INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46885, '62a02066d1', '', 'to: betty.k\r\nfrom: viperdud\r\n\r\nWhat\'s with you man? I pmed hog and asked why he was acting like an ass towards me. It isn\'t like I insulted him, or did I. I pmed him to find out. I don\'t understand why he\'s so pissed. I post up one thing about getting li-ons cheaper and couldn\'t decide to put it in breaking news or in xmods, so I put in both. I want to save people some money. Is that what this is about? I don\'t even know why you are getting involved. I obviously stepped on his toes somehow and don\'t know where. Have I ever insulted you?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nto: viperdud\r\nfrom: betty.k\r\n\r\nno, not one insult outta you fer me. this is my problem. do i have to come to your house and hump yer poodle in front of your granny before you get cranky with me?? have all my insults fallen on deaf ears??\r\n\r\ntwat');
