INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46893, 'd55e083647', '', 'Greets all, looks like I joined the game a little late. Here\'s a few thoughts, hopefully they\'ll help...\r\n\r\n1. Auctions is a GREAT idea, here\'s why and what more to do...\r\na. Since it\'s pure bitPimps Custom shit, other sites that sell shit won\'t have a problem with the Pimps advertising because it doesn\'t conflict with their interests...This is key.\r\nb. Test drive eBay, there\'s just no reason not to. Yeah, they\'ll skim their share, but with a good campaign of advertising (DT is the king for that!) that should drive some traffic to the eBay Auction and just the \'normal\' eBay traffic (some of which probably hasn\'t even heard of bitPimps, which means advertising) will jump in on it too and drive bids up.\r\n\r\n2. bitPimps merchandise! Decals is a great idea, now add some bitPimps branded hats, T-shirts, feminine napkins, whatever...If you gotta go to an Arts-n-Crafts store and buy $5 shirts and handpaint \'bitPimps\' on it, so be it...Sell em for $15 and make that money!\r\n\r\n3. Along the same lines...How\'s about \'bitPimps\' branded cases for putting cars in?\r\n\r\n4. Here\'s a wacky one...bitPimps DVDs! Make a compilation of all the vids and pics and shit for all things bitPimps and burn that shit onto DVD and sell it...I offer my help on this one, I\'ve got DVD cases, Blank inkjet printable DVDs and a CD/DVD printer. I would just ask for the cost for the items and the rest goes towards keeping the pimps afloat.\r\n\r\n5. I can\'t offer much in the way of body customizations, you maniacs have me beat hands down...But I\'ve got MAD photo gear and I offer my help in anyway with that. If you want some slick ass pics of your shit, the gear I\'ve got can make a turd look like gold.\r\n\r\n6. "The bitPimps Guide to Body Customizations" book/pamphlet! I\'m sure all you freaks have some little tidbit of knowledge the average stooge doesn\'t know about...Put that shit all together in a single compilation and sell it! Where I work I have access to laser printers and to an extent color laser and it don\'t cost me shit to print as much as I want (though the color laser I have to be a little more careful about too much printing). So a black-n-white copy could cost so much and a color version would be more.\r\n\r\nThat\'s what\'s running through my head right now, when I think of more shit I\'ll post it.');
