INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (46901, 'eeb0d231ce', '', 'Hey Namuna, cool seeing you here. :-) \r\n\r\nI agree with you about ebay. There\'s no reason we can\'t put at least one car up, just to see what happens.\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ve got experience with the t-shirt and decal business. I used to hang with alot of bands, and you know those guys are always having T-shirts and decals made.\r\n\r\nI\'ve tried the do it yourself technique. I got book on silkscreening, got all the stuff I need, and tried it out. It\'s not too easy, and not very cost effective silk screening at home. It seems to best way to go about is to go to some place like Kinko\'s. If I remeber right it cost them about $8 a shirt, bit they were getting like 10-20 at a time.\r\n\r\n\r\nSelling a DVD might be a great idea. There\'s probably a bunch of people on dial up that haven\'t had the patience to watch all the videos.\r\n\r\nI just wish my vids were higher quality for that.  :-( \r\n\r\n\r\nAt any rate I gotta get off my ass, I got a pile of cars to work on this weekend.');
