INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47053, 'ef097fc87c', '', 'Got my first car ready for that ol\' block there. :-D \r\n\r\nIt came out nicer than I hoped. It\'s gonna be harder to give up than I thought. So I gotta give you guys a sneek peak.\r\n\r\n[img:ef097fc87c]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/newbus1.jpg[/img:ef097fc87c]\r\n[img:ef097fc87c]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/newbus2.jpg[/img:ef097fc87c]\r\n\r\nThis Precious chassis was exceptionally fast, and handled good to begin with. Some FETs, and Tomy teal gears got it going super fast, and smooth.  I filled in the hole for the cop light, side mirrors, and bumpers. Then I rolled the bottom edges under. I blacked out the V-dub logo, and put full size Tomy wheels for that 8-spoke Empi look. I was planning to use this bus body that had the copper light on it, but when I put it on this kick ass chassis, man it\'s too cool to sell now.\r\n\r\nBut don\'t worry, this one will go on the block. 8-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47561, 'bbe2ae4486', '', 'ahh hey thanks dude I\'ve been afraid to touch the windsheild just because of that... oh and the wheels were ripped off a Dub City car... I have no remorse the car was an s2000 ricer so they were gladly removed hehe... I\'m also suprised that my car still turns with them... on all my other bodies the wheels would get stuck on the wells :P');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47055, '21869cbd90', '', 'ATM I have 2 super bits and another one is coming my way. I guess they all stutter due to the lack of range. Have you ever noticed how they seem to repeat the last action they did after loosing range? They\'re fast and very sharp turning, but I only use them to race around my feet  :grin: j/k about the lambo and ferrari sets I don\'t know, but they should carry the same problems as the regular sets bits.  :-)');
