INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47151, 'cf1729de2d', 'Motorworks Tanks and The Beastie Boys', 'Yo everyone!! I recently purchased a motorworks tank, and I\'m very pleased... I did so digging and was happy to see a 160 mAH nimh batt and two hardwired motors... The only thing I didnt like was the fact that there was even one more gear than the bits have. It\'s like they did that so that it would drive exactly like a tank... but w/e... The only prollem so far is that the treads dont seem small enough... they slip off when i try and turn... i dunno what the prollem is. I juss need to know if there\'s any way of fixing this.... all help is appreciated.. thanks pimps!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47152, '97e567259c', '', 'Yes there is.\r\n\r\nGet a small pot of H2O boiling and drop your treads in for a minute or so.  Not too long or they will shrink too much and twist.  Bird tried this technique when he got one and it was just enough to do the trick.\r\n\r\nThe only other thing to do would be to splice the tread and reglue it.\r\n\r\nI bought a couple of those tanks awhile back on clearance for $4.88 each!!  There fun to climb over and around stuff on the table or to have two people go at it and try to flip each other.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47153, 'b10accbf2e', '', 'But at least we got to play with it first. :-D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47154, 'a6b78aa719', '', 'Don\'t even go that long... just drop \'em in the boiling water for a few seconds, and it should shrink them up enough to keep them from coming off.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47155, 'cdc9bee8ed', '', '[quote:cdc9bee8ed="JDM-R34"]OK here is my I think 3rd Contest entry, and this is my ZZ Honda S2000, it\'s got a flat black paint job with yellow on the side\'s of the spoiler and for the interior there is yellow with gloss black. The Honda has dual exuast and Chrome rims, with the Green ZZ gear set and a KIT Racer motor. :cool: \r\n[/quote:cdc9bee8ed]\r\n\r\nHoly  hell JDM.  Remeind me to reffer to this car whenever you post dumb shit, cuz this whip is mad nice.  Many props bro.');
