INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47215, 'adfcb35196', '', '[quote:adfcb35196="sessiz"]Well, I guess I should give a lil background. :???: \r\nI was born and raised right here, in Albany NY. I\'ve lived most my life here and from being the punk/hoodlum that I was I got pretty good personal experiences with atleast the local authorities. I then take those experiences and apply them to the "greater" picture and I begin to see parrallels. For example, when smoking pot with white kids in a suburban setting all that would happen when caught is the pot being taken away or at worst a "scare" tactic (like taking us to the precint and calling our parents). Now the same situation with the brothers or some poor ass mother fuckers with a misdemenar or two. You get shackled together and read the miranda and get to spend a night or two in the lockup till the judge sees ya. Believe that. What did I learn from this? Not that racists run things, that shit aint true. It\'s money. Money fuckin rules all. The kids in the burbs got mommy and daddy\'s bank roll for back, and the cops know this.\r\nThat is all there is to it. The fuckin basics for everything. We don\'t give two shits about anyone else (in the governments eyes) if they don\'t have something of worth. Am I wrong? We as the only "super power" left on the planet don\'t need any "premptive" strikes to defend ourselves. We have agency upon agency that should be doing there jobs. If they fuck up then it\'s the management that needs to be looked at/blamed. Consider this shit part one. I\'ll countinue if yall want some other time.[/quote:adfcb35196]\r\n\r\nI guess I should talk about some of my past...\r\n\r\nMy parents were immigrants, so they weren\'t too familiar with American lingo and talk and principles/terms....they didn\'t know how to label "gay" or "fag" or "pimp" stuff. They just taught me to be a nice kid, to focus on my schoolwork and all that stuff. I lived in Long Island for a while, and all I got was the "You are a dork" or "You\'re weird" or "You have no friends" bullshit. Today, I view that as a friendship compared to the fucks in school and fucks online (not you guys, but in chat and on other sites) that I have to tolerate. Before, I was just called a dork, weirdo, loser, whatever. When I moved to Westchester, I didn\'t know "mainstream" common sense...I would repeat some shitty dialogues from the TVs, and got laughed at a lot...I was the "gay retard". I got punched in the face, kicked around, and manipulated. When I tried to fight back....I got smacked down again. \r\n\r\nWhen I look back on it....there are some people who learn, and some don\'t. I\'m trying to move on and forget about those bastards who were dropped on their heads at birth, but I\'m still annoyed with them today. My neighbors who constantly trespass on the steep driveway for their fuckin bike/sled stunts probably won\'t grow up for a long time. \r\n\r\nHow does any of this have anything to do with this thread? Simple. There are just some nasty people out there....in any country. Those countries may hate us westerners because of those reasons sessiz listed....But we also hate those other countries. Sometimes people of different ethnic backgrounds do a lot of shit that ticks us off, and we may stereotype them as part of an ignorant race or shit like that. It\'s just that there are pros and cons to every civilization, person, or situation. My ethnicity may do weird stuff like stupid dances or bad hygiene, but they\'ve contributed a lot of stuff in the areas of computers, technology, medical science, blah blah whatever. \r\n\r\nIt\'s like they told us when we were little..."look on the bright side". \r\n\r\nSessiz: lol, yeah it\'s amazing what people do for money these days: Get personal info on celebs lives and try to ruin them in those bullshit magazines, sleep with people they think are hideous, etc etc. Money can get you a lot of things....Of course, at my age and reputation, the amount of money that\'s desired and the amount that\'s gotten is different.....heck, as betty.k said once, some of us don\'t have money, that\'s why you guys try to be creative, brilliant, and make your own resources. betty made a skid plate for his BCG out of a floppy disk, for example. Some people focus so much on the bling bling, they forget what they can do with their own two hands....which is what I need to think about myself.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47216, '3a15ca20b8', 'Some stuff for sale.', 'For sale is \r\n\r\n1 red Skyline mini-z body from i-waver would make a GREAT beater or with touch ups a great show car, been ran twice, includes tab - 15$\r\n\r\n1 Zip Zap SE choose a body from below, works fine, newer version with steering fix, ran a few times - 20$ Sale pending.\r\nvarious zip zap bodies...\r\nCuda\', Older mustang, chevelle (SOLD), red rx-7 (fast and furious), green eclipse (fast and furious), old and new fire bird bodies, all 4$ except eclipse(sold) and rx-7 are 5$\r\n\r\nMy custom project Blue thunder wrx shen qi wei, 35 mgz, rally rims and tires, runs great- 17$\r\n\r\nMy custom Project "riceout" rx-7, shen qi wei, 57 mgz, runs great, - 15$\r\n\r\nshipping not included. \r\n\r\nthanks for looking!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47217, 'd4f36bf948', 'Got LED?', 'This is a work in progress for my summer comp entry.  I know I haven\'t done much 1/64 modding lately so I thought I\'d pull somthing outta my arse to show that I (think) still got it..??....\r\n\r\nI got some clear plastic rod and glued a small SMD blue LED on one side.   What you see is about 1.5cm long.  \r\n\r\n[img:d4f36bf948]http://users.tpg.com.au/ph2t/bit_g/bit_neon1.JPG[/img:d4f36bf948]\r\n\r\nWith 3V going though it:\r\n\r\n[img:d4f36bf948]http://users.tpg.com.au/ph2t/bit_g/bit_neon2.JPG[/img:d4f36bf948]\r\n\r\nAnd some more work in progress shots.....\r\n\r\n[img:d4f36bf948]http://users.tpg.com.au/ph2t/bit_g/bit_neon3.JPG[/img:d4f36bf948]\r\n[img:d4f36bf948]http://users.tpg.com.au/ph2t/bit_g/bit_neon4.JPG[/img:d4f36bf948]\r\n\r\n :smile: \r\n\r\n[img:d4f36bf948]http://users.tpg.com.au/ph2t/bit_g/bit_neon5.JPG[/img:d4f36bf948]\r\n\r\ncool......\r\n\r\nph2t.');
