INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47220, '5affd44ba1', '', '[quote:5affd44ba1="ph2t"][quote:5affd44ba1="hogjowlz"]hell ya that 3 way action was sweet last week. .................[/quote:5affd44ba1]\r\n\r\ndamn man!  I didn\'t even need to edit this one! lol..............\r\n\r\nbloody fag!\r\n\r\n :D \r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:5affd44ba1]\r\n\r\nI was very careful with my choice of words in my first post in this thread for just that reason, br2ce, and leave it to hog to say it like that!\r\n\r\nAnd dammit it\'s just my luck to go for 4 months without breaking anything, and less than a week after giving hog my extra set of knuckles.... I broke a damn knuckle tonight!!! Dammit! Serves me right for wanting to go and floss my freshly painted gunmetal rims down the end of the block...\r\n\r\nEDIT... Scratch that whiny dammit shit! I just got done remaking the lower part of the knuckle my damn self! Used a pen and some crazyglue. It works just like it did before it broke, but probly isn\'t as strong... That\'s aaaight too, though, now I have an excuse to make the knuckle guards I\'ve been thinking about.... Back to the lab!\r\n\r\nEDIT AGAIN!... Hue... it\'s the truth, I probably wouldn\'t be as deep into this if it weren\'t for 219 coming over and getting himself hooked... And I feel really lucky that we have someone like hog so close too... That fact alone is pushing me to do better shit...');
