INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47300, '1243c2a497', '', 'If I have the #\'s right.  I have 20GB of traffic and 2500mb a month in storage.  I think thats right.  I\'d have to go read my info again.  But all I\'m really concerned with is a place to host my videos and share some info and other stuff that I feel is cool to share with other people.  \r\n\r\nI\'m using [url]http://www.ixwebhosting.com[/url] and got the plan thats $65 every 3 months.\r\n\r\nIf anyone decides to use this hosting, please use me as a reference if you don\'t mind.  I get some kind of credit to my account, of my choice or something.  Like more space, bandwhith, or cash, or something.\r\n\r\nEdited ........  6-17-04');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47301, '710413da27', '', 'Thanks man,  it\'s all done in Photoshop. Here\'s the pics I started with...\r\n\r\n[img:710413da27]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/pimpscenePart1.jpg[/img:710413da27] [img:710413da27]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/pimpscenePart2.jpg[/img:710413da27] [img:710413da27]http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/pimpscenePart3.jpg[/img:710413da27]\r\n\r\nFirst, I needed a pic of a street that had the right angle to match my Bit Pic, \r\nthen I searched for city skyline pics, and the St Louis pic was the first one that \r\nhad the angle I was looking for. The main thing is starting with pics that have \r\nthe right angles and lighting. Then, adjust the colors of each pic so they feel \r\nlike they\'re all part of the same scene. I also shortened the depth of field so \r\nthe focus is on the car.');
