INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47339, '6e0b3ad959', '', 'Yeah we finally got these in today and after the initial ooooh coooool rice baby I was quickly disapointed, well for th average consumer I was that is. :grin:   \r\n\r\nThese things sit like total shit on the bodies, and the seperate front ends have a disgustingly huge gap on em.  Also like CD said, these are so big they are closer to Superslick size.  Now the plus side for us pimps, these BEG to be thrown on Bit chassis w/ the apropriate mods.  Add a little putty and a gnarly wheel conversion and these American jap crap wannabes will look so damn hot!  \r\n\r\nOh also, as far as the stickers are concerned, I thought up an idea.  Stickers blow but think about it, what you do have is pre masked off stenciles.  Granted I don\'t even own these yet to give it a try, but it has the possiblity.  What do you think Dave, would it work?');
