INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47348, 'e203d34f58', '', '[quote:e203d34f58="ph2t"]Charlie, when ordering parts from digikey, always check that the parts are in stock.  At times this info isn\'t the clearest.\r\n\r\nCharlie, in a recent PM to me you asked about the hookup for nelly on to a z/xmod/iwaver PCB.  Did the link I send you make sense?  I guess it did \'cause you stopped asking questions.\r\n\r\nWhat you gotta learn Charlie is that when people try to help you, you need to read their info first and makes sense of it before asking the next question.   In the "Upgraded Fet" thread at tinyrc Jshwaa was trying to help you and you kept asking the same question after question.   This gets frustrating from the helpers point of view because you\'re not taking the time to comprehend what is being said and just firing off another useless question.   Jshwaa took the time to help you, you should take the time to listen.   When he got frustrated you threw it back in his face.   Now that\'s the act of a LSOAK!\r\n\r\nLSOAK = Little Shit Of A Kid......\r\n\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:e203d34f58]\r\n\r\nOk, ph2t... What I realized here is that, sometimes I\'m too lazy to make use of my own mind, and I force other people to bust their minds trying to help. I almost gave up on your diagram because it was hard to understand, but the truth is I\'m not TRYING to understand. That\'s where I was wrong.\r\n\r\nFine, I\'m at a loss for words. I was wrong in the first place, with Jshwaa too....it\'s just that I heard something different from my normal concept, and that\'s why I asked to get a better understanding....I didn\'t TRY to understand, but I made him bust his back trying to help me...Fine. I guess that was just stupid little shit Charlie acting up. My bad.\r\n\r\nAs for the diagram, I\'m gonna have a good look at it and analyze it better.');
