INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47386, 'a07c7b4da1', '', 'well since i replaced my motorworks body with a vdub i had this old school hod rod with some potenital laying arond . it wouldnt fit a bit wilout some hacking so hack it i did , then slot lowerd the front to the ground , reshaped the front wheel whells a bit , added a cowl induction scoop . to the chassis i added motor works drag tiers ( had to hack stuff to make them fit ...) and dual exaust tips from a charger modle car . and i actualy dealled this car , wholy crap  :eek:  ...\r\n\r\n[img:a07c7b4da1]http://img78.photobucket.com/albums/v296/matthew_e/old_school_hod_rod.jpg[/img:a07c7b4da1]\r\n\r\n[img:a07c7b4da1]http://img78.photobucket.com/albums/v296/matthew_e/my_drager.jpg[/img:a07c7b4da1]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47387, 'fe272b5a42', 'Holy fuckin shit, I got busted!', 'Yesterday apartment maintenence entered our apartment for a routine AC inspection. This morning, I found an eviction notice on my door, for the possesion of illegal substances.\r\n\r\nWhat did they find? A freakin Sucrets box, I use for a tray, that had residuals.\r\n\r\nNow I have 10 days to find a place to live.\r\n\r\nWTF, do they even have the right to go through my stuff, i don\'t believe they do. I think they didn\'t like me for one reason or another, as I\'ve had problems with the managment in the past, and they\'re also having us evicted because they\'re saying our apartment is a health hazard, which is bullshit. To prove this point they took pictures of the cat\'s littler box, which had been changed the night before, and the cat pooped in it once, and kicked litter all over the place, which had happened after I left for work, at any rate we pay a pet deposit, and pet rent, so what if we have a litter box with one poop in it. They also took pictures of our laundry, There\'s only about 3 loads there. I didn\'t know you had to keep your laundry perfectly caught up to live here.\r\n\r\n\r\nAt any rate we have 5 days to rectify the situation. We can clean the place spotless, but they want me to produce a prescription for the marijuana. I could argue that they had no right to get into my personal possessions, but what\'s the sense, I don\'t want to live some place where I constantly have watch my back.\r\n\r\nIt\'s really upsetting having to move on such short notice, but what\'s really bothering me is the feeling of being violated, and also I just feel like everyone hates me, and I\'m just wondering WTH I did to them to derserve this.\r\nI feel sick. :-(');
