INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47390, '3f2db3f598', '', 'Dude, that\'s seriously fucked up... they clearly had it in for you. The laundry and cat box shit is totally screwed, but the sucrets box is just plain fucked. I think you\'re right, they can\'t snoop through your shit and you could probably sue their asses. It\'s probably best to just get the fuck out, but yeah... 10 days to find a place and move? Fuckers.\r\n\r\nYou have every reason to feel violated dude, \'cause you were. As far as the hatred you\'re feeling from those bastards.. fuck \'em. They don\'t even deserve 2 seconds of thought on the matter. Fuck \'em. \r\n\r\nSorry to hear the news, Dave.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47391, '9cc32d9a5b', '', 'Yeah, and they are fuckin\' bastards. We\'re the ones that were complaining about the roach problem, and that the exterminaters have done nothing, and they\'re sayng we never contacted them about it when we not did, but we yelled at them about it. Half the time when we call the office, they\'re all sorry no habla engles. Fuck \'em\r\n\r\nOh yeah we\'re getting fined $200 bucks for causing a roach problem.\r\n\r\nGot lucky, the place where we used to live, that we wish we never moved out of, has a $99 - free months rent move in, and has an apartment available.\r\n\r\nSo i got a home again, but moving in 10 days :shock: \r\nFuck that. And my wife is in Disneyland with the kid for the next 4 days, so I\'ve got alot to do on my own.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAll this stress, I need to get baked, but I feel guilty about it now.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47392, '2dc7d678cb', '', 'Dude, that totally sucks! If it\'s any consolation, the law favors renters in most situations.\r\n\r\nI know what you mean though about the final outcome. You can fight it and probably win, but if the management has a hard-on to kick you out, you\'ll just be hassled from now on. Not to mention living in paranoia that they\'ll be going through your shit when you\'re not home.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nP.S. I don\'t hate you');
