INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47396, 'b760995847', '', 'they\'re straight fucking you in the ass.\r\nthat sucks dude.\r\nbut like you said, why bother to fight it? you don\'t wanna live there if that\'s how they do shit.\r\n\r\nI can\'t believe payaso hasn\'t gotten nailed, I know maintenance has gone in there with piles of weed on the table, etc., etc. and nothing but a new hook-up came from it.\r\n\r\nThey straight rifled through your shit like they\'re the FBI, and you know why - because that\'s the only plus about their job - that\'s why they took the job. the job pays shit, but the perk is if you\'re a nosey motherfucker, you get to root through peoples shit.\r\nI\'m sure with assmunchers like that there, you\'re not the only one who\'s gotten violated. I bet they steal from their tenants.\r\n\r\nat any rate, I\'m really sorry to hear that dude.\r\nthat\'s such shit.\r\nbut again, you\'ll be happier the sooner you\'re out of that place.\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'d also take pictures or get copies of the same pictures they have (I think by law they have to provide them to you - it is pictures of your property, on their property)\r\nI might even talk with a lawyer, a lot of em are willing to talk a bit before any billing occurs, tell them the situation and if you have the pictures and info, that\'d help.\r\nif a lawyer saw even the slightest discrimination there, they\'d go for it - most of those suits win a pretty nice chunk of change.\r\n\r\ngood luck bro.');
