INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47404, 'fde9fc6904', 'Sooo Many Pimps, So little Time', 'OK so cuz SG keeps hinting, got me thinking.  Would people be interested in possibly extending the Competition?  (Pending the mods OK)  Now I mean don\'t vote yes if it will just allow you to be lazy and take some time on finishing her up.  What I mean is, if more time was allowed would you not only be able to enter one of your rides you are almost done w/ or have completed, but yet another totally kick ass whip?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47405, 'fb7aea65d8', '', '@ Finks...Thanks for noticing. :-) \r\n\r\nThe only reason I would like to see it extended is to take it right up to the end of the month.  Sorta like rounding the time up and the amount of time is just one more week.  Plus, the MOD\'s got a shitload more time. I think any longer the contest would lose its steam and fizzle out.\r\n\r\nPlus, I\'ll be honest, I do have two more rides in the works, and I only see one of them, maybe, making the current deadline.  But if they don\'t make it, hey, thats the way the cookie crumbles.  I already have 2 rides and a boat, so it really doesn\'t matter.\r\n\r\nThere seems to be a great turn-out so far, so because of such a great turn-out, I can only see more rides [color=green:fb7aea65d8]gettin\' perfected, not built[/color:fb7aea65d8] in that week.\r\n\r\nJust suggesting....hint, hint. :-)');
