INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48867, '48999b40d0', '', 'here we go..... \r\n\r\n\r\nI must have posted that incorrectly cuz it ain\'t like that. I fuckin love bitpimps, I\'ve been here for for-fuckin ever, you guys are like my family. The whole reason for me posting at bit-racer.de is because the german pimps don\'t give a flying FUCK about what i think. They dont give a damn about me, they\'ll say, that fuckin shit sucks right to your face. I mean look at this thread: [url]http://549.rapidforum.com/topic=100181108386[/url] . DarkTari, the fuckin master of every bit mod you\'ll ever see. All of us people here look up to the man because his mods kickass... The Germans? Yeah, they tell it like it is. That paint is fuckin amazing, in my eyes (i can\'t come close to that detail), yet that guy says that its badly painted? Lets put it this way, the advice you guys give kicks ass, but it seems like i have to ask for it in order to get it. Yes, I kno, at bitracer.de I did ask for advice, but I really dont think that I even needed to ask. It seemed to me that whatever I posted here at bitpimps was just for a confidence boost. It seems like I get two pages of great job midget man, but nothing more than that.\r\n\r\nI\'ve loved bitpimps ever since I found it almost a year and a half ago. The bottom line is that, when I posted that, the intention wasn\'t to knock bitpimps at all. I fuckin love this site!!! I look up to DT and Cabo, and when i read their posts at bitracer.de, I felt terrible. It was like a kid who wants to be JUST LIKE michael jordan getting told to fuck off... That was how I felt.\r\n\r\nBasically, now i get to sit, hope, wait, and pray that your guys wont see it like you\'re seeing it now. if you want me to leave because you think I\'m not in love with this site, then so be it. I can take it like a man, but I want you to know, I dont wanna leave, and I certainly dont want to be fuckin hated.\r\n\r\nThanks for your time, gents.');
