INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49834, '18460a76f6', '', 'Galleries have been updated.\r\n\r\nhere\'s my picks for 1st, 2nd, 3rd, 4th, and 5th places:\r\n\r\n1st: sg\'s boat\r\n[img:18460a76f6]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/contests/swing_bling/thumb_08_sg219_01.jpg[/img:18460a76f6]\r\nbecause he stuck with the theme for sure, made a car that pulled it, and the boat itself is pretty killer with the flip lid and wood old school style.\r\n\r\n2nd: ripper\'s bb\r\n[img:18460a76f6]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/contests/swing_bling/thumb_20_ripper7777777_02.jpg[/img:18460a76f6]\r\nbecause the paint scheme is pretty original as far as the two-tone goes, it stuck with the the theme, and the cooler on the luggage rack set it off.\r\n\r\n3rd: biohazard\'s flames\r\n[img:18460a76f6]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/contests/swing_bling/thumb_16_biohazard_01.jpg[/img:18460a76f6]\r\nI really dig the color transitions on this car, especially in the flames.\r\ncrazydave is known as the flame king and it\'s nice to see someone else that does a slightly different flame job.\r\n\r\n[b:18460a76f6]edit:[/b:18460a76f6] whoops, forgot about 4th and 5th, but that\'s easy.\r\n\r\n4th: hue\'s flames\r\n[img:18460a76f6]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/contests/swing_bling/thumb_13_hue35_01.jpg[/img:18460a76f6]\r\nI like the colors, the flame job and convertible sticks more with the theme.\r\n\r\n5th: jmay\'s whatever (I forget for now, but it\'s a real car - dorky but real)\r\n[img:18460a76f6]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/contests/swing_bling/thumb_28_jmays_01.jpg[/img:18460a76f6]\r\nbasically just because he modded the body more, he\'s got some different and pretty nice flames on it, and it\'s somewhat more than the other sticking with the theme with surf boards and such.');
