INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47480, '531f369dfa', '', '[quote:531f369dfa="sessiz"]As long as there is some room for the icon\'s where they can be displayed clearly without too much background clutter, the functionality of the wallpaper is good.[/quote:531f369dfa]\r\nThat\'s what I was getting at... I didn\'t know if that needed to be in a specific part of the screen... you know, to accomodate all the limitations y\'all have to deal with. I don\'t know shit about PCs\r\n\r\n[quote:531f369dfa="CaboWabo"]1280 x 1024 seems to have been missed.[/quote:531f369dfa]\r\nThat\'s where I run my monitor.\r\n\r\nIt\'s funny how these Mac/PC wars always flare up so quickly... we\'re all workin\' with what we got, and it seems everyone\'s gettin\' by. I just happen to enjoy using a system that my chimp has no problems figuring out. I was mainly askin\' the questions because I\'ve never really used a PC... I figured all you PC dudes were using monitors with about the same resolution as a Light Brite.  8-)');
