INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47519, '29b3eb5c61', '', 'man, this whole war shit is an issue that is genuinely upsetting me. i just caught micheal moore\'s appearance on letterman and he took the words right outta my mouth. i\'m not fucking happy that good honest people join the army to protect freedom for us all with their lives, only to be sent off for a bullshit war and lied to. how the fuck are soldiers supposed to believe in what they do when w feeds them so much obvious bushit(sic). he\'s fucked the whole world up for the worst in my opinion. \r\nnow the american citizens, after just recovering from the "highly succesful" war on drugs, have to endure another fucking excuse for another attack from the government that\'s supposed to make you feel safe. this is shit. \r\nall you gotta do now to be under suspicion of fuck knows what is i don\'t even fucking know anymore.\r\ndon\'t get me wrong, those wacky arab loonies comitting atrocities are a whole other kind of psychos, but the handling of this whole thing by the government and the media is both unforgetable and unforgiveable.\r\n\r\ni dunno why this fucking shit gets me so worked up. i mean i\'m a clinically depressed lonely guy (and i\'m betting i\'m not the only one around here), so i\'m a bit unstable at times. but this shit hurts me in a completely different way to all the regular crap that happens in my life.\r\n\r\n\r\n :shock: \r\n\r\nsorry \'bout that. you\'ll believe me when i say i\'m twisting one up and the kettle\'s on! thank gawd this place is here fulla likeminded people, y\'know that 1% of people that are just crapped out with the made for masses, homogenous garbage that floods our lives. i wish i was ignorant. :???:');
