INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47619, '5d26a486db', '', 'Well you know, the camera I got to replace it is basically a direct replacement, but it is slightly better, and I scored it for a $100. So that\'s kinda working out. \r\n\r\nWe went down and got our credit approval at the new place today, so we\'re in. It feels 100% better knowing that you have a home next week, and it\'s right down the road. The school\'s right behind it, and our kid is getting in the headstart program this year. We used to live in this place for 4 years. The only reason we moved is because it was cheaper to move than tranfer into a 2 bedroom, but after stopping by there today, me and my wife both felt, we belong here, we\'re home. So I guess that\'s working out for the better.\r\n\r\n\r\nReally I\'ve been feeling sick, depressed, and we\'ve been having bad luck for since the year began, but now I\'m starting to see this as a turning point.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe got our tax check yesterday too. 8-) \r\nToo bad we were gonna have to use the federal to pay off the state, but we can pay that later, right now, this is getting us out of a tight spot.');
