INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48563, 'f4afa9737a', '', '[quote:f4afa9737a="betty.k"]y\'know what? i don\'t believe you.[/quote:f4afa9737a]\r\n\r\nLMAO!\r\n\r\nI got free tickets to see VH about 6 years ago and went for the hell of it. It was the tour with the 3rd singer... don\'t remember that dipshit\'s name. Anyway, it turned out to be a funny fuckin\' evening. First off, they sucked... the great thing was all the drunk fuckin\' hesher, burned-out 40-somethins..."WHOOOOOOO! WHOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!.... YEEEEEEAAH!"... these fuckers were seein\' the best show they could remember. Then, there was the younger crowd... "man, I can\'t believe we\'re at a VAN HALEN concert!!!... SWEET!.. this is AWESOME!!"\r\n\r\nSo, about halfway through the show, the 19yo girl right in front of me gets up and goes off somewhere. Meanwhile, her 19yo boyfriend is sitting there all by himself and is feeling the need to make up for her half of the rocking, so he busts out his lighter (I remember my first time). So he\'s makin\' up the difference and showin\' his love for the rocking with a big \'ol flame shootin out of his lighte,r when he realizes he better save a little juice soze he can impress the girl when she gets back... OOOPS, the lighter is stuck on and in a panic he starts waving it around to put it out. The flame only gets bigger and the violent thrashing makes the thing leak, so now there\'s fire balls shooting out of it... this kid is freakin\' out! I felt like I was watching an anti lighter-at-concert propganda film from the 70s. So he throws the lighter down and it blows up with a fairly mild yet exciting POOF! Just as the fire is out, the girlfriend comes back and sees that he\'s kinda freaked... far as I could tell, he just blew it off like it never happened. Funny as shit.\r\n\r\nThen, about fifteen minutes later, I feel this drop of liquid hit me quickly followed by a decent-sized splash. I turn around to se these two 40yo gutter whores going off on each other. The whore directly behind me (whore 1) has the other whore (whore 2) by the front of her trick-magnet dress, screaming at her in a drunken rage "YOU FUCKEN BETCH!!! I\'M GONNA KILL YOU, YOU FUCKEN BETCH!!!!", all the while balancing a mostly-full beer right above my head. Whore 2 throws her beer on whore 1... whore 1 quickly retaliates. Whore 2\'s \'ol man steps in to break it up... he holds his gutter snipe back and tells whore 1 to calm down. Whore 1 belches out, "YOU JUST TELL THAT CUNT TO KEEP HER FUCKEN MOUTH SHUT!!!"... and that was pretty much that.\r\n\r\nAs for the show, it sucked... of course it sucked, I knew this going in. I\'m glad I went though, that was a hell of a funny evening, for free.');
