INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48977, '8b6410d73b', '', 'as far as your gallery, what finks says - make sure you optimize as much as possible. and delete shots as he said.\r\nI\'d also cut down on the amount of shots of the same subject.\r\nfor instance in this thread:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?p=48950#48950\r\nyou have 9 shots when you probably could have done the same in 5 shots.\r\njust your one post alone has almost a half of a MB of imagery, not including your signature. (455.970 kilobytes)\r\n\r\nI just bumped everyones space limit up a tad, so enjoy - but remember to use wisely.\r\n\r\n\r\nnow for the shots.\r\nI find it hard to focus on both the car and background myself. so I just resort to focusing on the car. the background is still legible, just not crisp and clear - but the main subject (the car) hopefully is.');
