INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47725, 'c42ed7413e', 'Comin\' out  Swingin\'(and Blingin\') contest car preview', 'Well, since today was the original deadline, I guess I\'ll throw this up for some input from you guys... \r\n\r\nI have seat backs ready to paint and install, and a few other details to work out, but I\'m pretty happy with it. the shell was a Mitsubishi EVO that I threw up in progress pics of a few months back... [url=http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3536]here[/url]... I used Nkok boat wings to get the rolled look on the front and rear ground effects, made my own hidden antenna, and decided to use the controller as my contest tag... I\'m already set on redoing that, similar, but better... oh, and the bird came down off of his can to cap the controller antenna... I feel lucky that I have more time to do some more work to get it right, but just wanted to show you what I have so far... and I plan on taking my contest pics in real sunlight lol...\r\n\r\n[img:c42ed7413e]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/almostdone5.jpg[/img:c42ed7413e]\r\n[img:c42ed7413e]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/almostdone4.jpg[/img:c42ed7413e]\r\n[img:c42ed7413e]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/almostdone3.jpg[/img:c42ed7413e]\r\n[img:c42ed7413e]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/almostdone2.jpg[/img:c42ed7413e]\r\n\r\nI also appreciate the extra time so I can maybe finish another ride and maybe my boat, too.');
