INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47799, '8e63b2cd9f', 'VW Cabriolet', 'All right, here is what I have been spinning in the work shop for a while.  Started off with one of those cheapo Thundercharger bodies from Big Lots.  Over all a general looking body and said "hey, that could be a cool Jetta"  So work started.\r\n[img:8e63b2cd9f]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10009/JettaSanded.jpg[/img:8e63b2cd9f]\r\n\r\nBut then what do ya know, it\'s contest time and the theme?  Summer Swing Bling Baby!  So that means this bitch needs to take a different rout.  So after a little look over, she weemed to scream "Make me a beach bunny VW Cabriolet!" So the choppin started.  It\'s interesting to note, the Thundercharger bodies cut like butter.  I just used an exacto knife.\r\n[img:8e63b2cd9f]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10009/Cabriolet-003.jpg[/img:8e63b2cd9f]\r\n\r\nBut the problem was the front end.  What to do to get that classic 4 light shiners that they have.  Found a Di cast Muscle Machines BWM and the problem was solved.\r\n[img:8e63b2cd9f]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10009/Cabriolet-001.jpg[/img:8e63b2cd9f]\r\n\r\nOk to make this short Made the rag top detailed the inside and Badaboom.  Here she is.\r\n\r\n[img:8e63b2cd9f]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10009/VWCabriolet.jpg[/img:8e63b2cd9f]\r\n[img:8e63b2cd9f]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10009/VWCabriolet2.jpg[/img:8e63b2cd9f]\r\n[img:8e63b2cd9f]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10009/VWCabriolet3.jpg[/img:8e63b2cd9f]\r\n[img:8e63b2cd9f]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10009/VWCabriolet4.jpg[/img:8e63b2cd9f]\r\n\r\nNeedless to say, I am proud of this whip.');
