INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47920, '6f6a8b598a', 'Steering Gear Box', 'I take pride in the fact that essentially any problem a kid has with an X-mod I can fix for them here at the Shack in a timly manner.  All but one problem that seems to be rearing it\'s evil head more and more.  Basically the steering box locks up and stutters (like a ZZ SE) and will only steer one way or not at all.  I have tried to take the box apart and analyze the problem but nothing is poping out at me.  In the last month I have seen 3 X-mods come back because of this and it\'s pissin me off.  Anybody have some input?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48969, '7b950711d1', '', 'I agree with Gokuo.  I had my 6 cell on my Xmod plastic speed ties on, and the ties draged and caught shit as I was drivin\'.  The gumbands might be better, but there has to be a better way.  Maybe try glueing it on while cutting out the holes for the screws? :???:');
