INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (47922, '0f1650da05', 'Re: Steering Gear Box', '[quote:0f1650da05="Finks"]I take pride in the fact that essentially any problem a kid has with an X-mod I can fix for them here at the Shack in a timly manner.  All but one problem that seems to be rearing it\'s evil head more and more.  Basically the steering box locks up and stutters (like a ZZ SE) and will only steer one way or not at all.  I have tried to take the box apart and analyze the problem but nothing is poping out at me.  In the last month I have seen 3 X-mods come back because of this and it\'s pissin me off.  Anybody have some input?[/quote:0f1650da05]\r\n\r\nIt is not the servo it is either the pot (can on the back) or the main board.  Mine does it when I am running my hottest motor like the servo can\'t get enough prower.  I\'m still researching a full board replacement.  Just takes time to reverse engineer!');
