INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48929, 'e6b4efe03a', '', '[quote:e6b4efe03a="midget_man1387"]lol fuck you! I was so scared... Oh wait, don\'t hate me for saying fuck you :lol:  lol j/k :-) ....Yes, please do give me constructive criticism. Damn I love you guys  :sad: \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOk fuck the teary eyed shit, let\'s blaze :cool: \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\no wait, I still would like to hear some comments lol....[/quote:e6b4efe03a]\r\n\r\nMidge, I think we all need some constructive critiscism at one time or another. I guess you wanted constructive critiscism, but you weren\'t getting it here cuz peepz were afraid they might upset you, so they held it back...but that actually worsened the situation. I was afraid to give you C.C. cuz that would be a case of the blind leading the blind...I haven\'t contributed too many pimped rides myself, so I felt I had no right to talk. I guess from now on, it\'s ok to tell you how you can improve....\r\n\r\nOne time, in chat, me and Namuna were yappin about how it\'s ok to get critiscism, fuck it\'s pointing out how something in ya can be fixed!! But when you critiscize the forums, that\'s when ya cross the line....Oh well. I guess we can\'t blame you if you wanted something we decided not to give you (perverts! I\'m not talking about THAT!!  :x )\r\n\r\nMothafuckas, now I\'m getting into the teary-eyed shit :sad:\r\n\r\nWelcome back midget!\r\n\r\n*steps off the soapbox* ok, now who\'s got ma cigs?');
