INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48591, 'afbe4a587c', '', '[quote:afbe4a587c="CaboWabo"]doh, trucks always win against cars.\r\nsorry to hear it bro - but coulda been worse.\r\n\r\nsome kiddie with dads mustang 5.slow ran in to the back of my folks denali.\r\nhis car was totaled, battery acid flew on the side and back of my folks\' denali - fucked up the paint job, and barely pushed in the rear bumper.\r\n\r\nI love big heavy vehicles that can drive through day cares.[/quote:afbe4a587c]\r\n\r\nNot all the time......... my neighbor was speeding thru an intersection in his  crew cab dually 1 ton chevy diesel truck  and I t -boned him { slid on ice doing 20 mph}with a 1982 corolla 4 door ... I drove my car away with very minor damage ....... his truck was near totalled  , bent cab  , door , bent frame... it would n\'t even move   ... funniest shit I have ever seen , even the sheriff thought it was a joke ... he kept asking where is the car that hit this truck ? really where is it?');
