INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48680, 'a770bbc7da', '', 'Oh yeah, my guitar pics, I gotta put those back up someday, I\'ll probably have to take new ones, may have lost them when I reformated.\r\n\r\nThere\'s actually quite a few musical types hanging around these boards.\r\n\r\nHere\'s something I was building last year, and never quite finished.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3569\r\n\r\nI also got a strat style kit that\'s finished. Lake Placid Blue with matching headstock. 8-) \r\n\r\nMy Ibanez Blazer is my #1 guitar. I\'ve rewired the electrics so it\'s hotter, and I got abunch of coil tapping and out of phase stuff going on for different sounds. I have a Squier Jagmaster in Silver sparkle, that guitar just looks cool, but someday I was to put some Seymour Duncan Jazzmaster Hots pickups in it.\r\n\r\nI also like to build and modify effects. I got a couple fuzzboxes I built. I ripped off Roger Keeley\'s "Seeing Eye" mod for the Boss DS-1 distortion. Now it has a flickering blue LED sticking out the top, and has a fatter, smoother distortion sound, similar to a Big Muff. \r\n\r\n\r\nAnyways, don\'t me started, I could ramble about guitars all night. :lol:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48681, 'aa3c7e0c38', '', 'Hot Damn, It\'s Summer Time Baby!  We got a Biddin War in here!\r\n\r\nI got [b:aa3c7e0c38]21 Ducketts [/b:aa3c7e0c38]on [b:aa3c7e0c38]Da Block [/b:aa3c7e0c38]from da Pimp that wants this baby!\r\n\r\nIt is a Very Hot Piece! I\'ve seen this one in person and it\'s [b:aa3c7e0c38]All That ![/b:aa3c7e0c38]\r\n\r\n[b:aa3c7e0c38]Do I here $24.00 ? [/b:aa3c7e0c38] \r\n 8-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48682, '6b979db829', '', 'Here\'s a vaguely related story, with little point.\r\n\r\nI had done a bunch of those cars Photochopped to look like bits. I was excited to see if anyone noticed, and here\'s midget man a minute later asking for the originator of the thread, who hadn\'t been around in 6 months, to do his mom\'s Gran Am, and for none of us other people to do it, because we were copy cats. So he offended me, and to be a smart ass, I did the Grand Am, even though, he said for me not to. He whined that I shrunk his mom in the background, so I fixed it so she was extra fat, and he got pissy with me. I think he hit the \'report this post to a mod\' button, because TinyRC showed up out of no where, and he said I did excellent work. 8-) \r\n\r\nAnyways, my point being, he\'s a pud. He never gave me any respect until I became a mod here, and still hasn\'t kissed my ass the way does the rest you guys. I get so sick of seeing his ass kissing, he just says whatever he thinks people want to hear.\r\n\r\nEnd of midget man rant.');
