INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48696, 'd8c59c03dd', '', '[quote:d8c59c03dd="Finks"]:edit: wow looked back and literally a month almost to the day.  What was the dealio with the comp that knocked you out of the web for such a streatch?[/quote:d8c59c03dd]\r\n\r\n\r\nI was cleaning some shit out of the old machine when I accidentally deleted the program that updates my IP.   I was stuck on the same IP, and didn\'t have the $$$ to pay RR to come out, and fix it.  It sucked big time.\r\n\r\nI did alot of hanging out at sessiz house to pass the time, but I think they\'re starting to get upset with me for peeing the bed.  Sorry about that one sessiz, but you can\'t tickle me that hard cause I have a weak bladder....hehe\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D');
