INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48721, '3c38bed673', '', 'I guess that people often judge others for their background and not their character. I guess "ignorance" has been demonstrated in the 1800\'s when slavery existed, and it still exists today when the leaders of other countires and fuckheads like Osama judge our whole country by the fuckheads like George Bush who run it. \r\n\r\nI\'m also learning to try to avoid ignorance...in my global class we learned about how the leaders of muslims tried to invade other countries back in history, and when people didn\'t agree they attacked...should I judge the people of Islam as bossy morons? NO. (besides that was way back then, this is now) \r\n\r\nSo I guess the moral here is judge people by themselves and not idiots from their background. I mean, there\'s idiots in every background, but if we judge the whole nation by a few fuckheads, that\'s when you cross the line over to ignorance.');
