INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48762, '83c3d89b0f', '', 'Ok I pulled this dual cell mod off, it was successful! It won\'t pop wheelie\'s  I guess because it doesn\'t have the normal ruber tires on it (i\'m running on hotwheels rims the hard plastic ones) so it slides all around the place, and it has a slight speed increase, but not that much.  This cars going into the swing and bling contest, I got a few more details to finish up before I post up the entry. :cool:  Thanks for Ya\'ll\'s Help');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48763, '2c14c571ac', '', 'lol Z, it looks like we\'re all magnets for dickheads these days.\r\n\r\nCrazy, you picked up on a good point man.  Charlie does latch onto you and then doesn\'t leave you alone.  I think the lil fucker is stalking me.  Ever since the tinyrc days where I ripped into him for being a pontificating (for sg :)) dickhead.  he\'s always PM\'ing we questions like this:\r\n\r\n[quote:2c14c571ac]You said that you did some searching for the FETs used in your Woah Nelly turbo. \r\n\r\nHow exactly did you go about searching....did you use a specific part finder, did you enter a description and find the mosfet to match them...? \r\n\r\nOh, and what does "Q.E.D." mean?\r\n[/quote:2c14c571ac]\r\n\r\nI mean, how can you explain to someone "how to learn"  I mean shit, it\'s like me asking Cabo or DT, "What process is in your noggin\' that makes you select the paint colour on your rides....".......   He just doesn\'t get it.   This sorta shit sin\'t dependant on having an EE degree, it\'s just about how you pick things up.\r\n\r\nAs bruce.k once said:\r\n\r\n[quote:2c14c571ac]It ain\'t important on what you know.  It\'s how you learn this knowledge that\'s the key.  You can teach someone something, but you can\'t teach them HOW[/quote:2c14c571ac]\r\n\r\nSo I then get this from gokfuck.\r\n\r\n[quote:2c14c571ac]\r\nDo you have a tutorial showing where to connect all the pins and wires for the FETs on Woah nelly...like, where to connect them, and what FETs to use....thanks!\r\n[/quote:2c14c571ac]\r\n\r\nHe know\'s about the link at brucemicro showing the schematic of nelly, yet he asked this question.   I just ignore him now.\r\n\r\nJust to top it off he then makes this diagram for me, stating that it\'s "easier" to read.\r\n\r\n[img:2c14c571ac]http://img19.photobucket.com/albums/v57/amitojbatra/woahnellydiagram.jpg[/img:2c14c571ac]\r\n\r\nApart from being wrong, it looks like an explosion in a spaghetti factory....\r\n\r\n