INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48815, '9af7724715', '', 'lol pimps, I feel honoured that ya\'ll talking about me.....\r\n\r\nand hue, would you believe that sometimes, just sometimes I feel sorry for the poor little nugget, but then he goes and put\'s his proverbial in it again and my attitude goes to shit........ :x \r\n\r\nthe dickhead gene definately trancends any link to that of age or level of maturity, but hey, some fellas start early.....\r\n\r\ntime to crash, 2:35am here on a school night....... :-( \r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48816, '853170ee48', '', 'welp, I\'m pretty sure everyone knows my stance.\r\nI have yet to even buy an xmod or mini-z.\r\n\r\nI was very skeptical of the zips, then se\'s came out, kinda cool, but still liked my bits better.\r\nafter driving a fet\'ed se (payaso\'s), I dug them more.\r\nnow they share garage space with my bits.\r\n\r\nI\'ve got many of my own reasons why I stick with what I do, but overall it comes down to; them being fun for me and the stuff I do with them.\r\n\r\nI\'d personally love to see a tutorial.\r\ngranted I might not try it for awhile, but it\'s there if want to, and I know it would spark some interests in others as well.\r\n\r\ngood call crazydave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48817, '80aca53360', 'Do yourself a favor and go see Spiderman 2 !!!', 'No shit here folks, Spiderman 2 was absolutely awesome. And I\'m not talking from a Blockbuster action flick kind of way...I\'m talking about in a great goddamned story that also happens to have some kick ass action.\r\n\r\nExcept for a few very minor flaws (like am i really supposed to believe that a super hero who can save a whole city, and who\'s got a genius level intelligence, can\'t get a better job than pizza delivery...Even if he\'s so busy as Spiderman?) the story was/is top notch.\r\n\r\nSee it, you\'ll love.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48818, 'ae11daff95', '', 'I am kinda new to this scene but i was always into RC stuff since my first AeroHopper.  I love new techonology and modding.  Thats what lead me here.  You guys were always coming up with new shit for the bits and pimp ass body mods and paint jobs.  Never knew what a FET was till I came here (Mech-E here).  You peepz never cease to amaze me  :eek: \r\n\r\nI for one would definately pay you CD for one, or even chip in a few bucks (or donor cars) to help support the cause.  \r\n\r\nAs Rev Jesse Jackson one Said,  "Keep THE Pimphand Strong" or was it keep hope alive...  ah well');
