INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (48996, 'cd4cb3f994', '', 'Ok, this is another entry from me, It\'s the pimping-est chrome Hummer in the bit world, It\'s a hotwheels hummer body that has been chopped into a truck version of the hummer, the hummer body is jacked up on Xmod suspesion, on a bit chassis, the chassis is dual celled and has a stock motor. The chassis is rull\'n on a set of dubs/ chrome rims, The body has a spoiler, a spare tire/rim on the back, and a chrome bumber, dual exuast, and a skid plate thingy on the front of the chassis. The following pics are of the  Hummer rolling on it\'s dubs, and then some more pics of it rolling on it\'s lego tires, sorry for the long description.\r\nHere\'s the pics:\r\nRollin on dubs:[img:cd4cb3f994]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0QQCz*wgTs23O*jGD9Te2vOEhbmcToPpgLayfaAuSN62iDapNc!ZklwrMoaLzzv6ZVieoqdnW*DI65hvTD7mX4xxx4tPWeAGzncGUMh7eFFw/untitled.JPG?dc=4675479775100710960[/img:cd4cb3f994]\r\n[img:cd4cb3f994]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0RgCz*5MSCGtq9cpmlvXLROra6SK3eVgLDiCC74sCJn2RtpiWIhLQAa5ckOf7!FXw1xuSBZ2TMCQmyZ8HnQdOU9wyk029xK2XIfk9Zt0qm8g/MVC-002F0.JPG?dc=4675479757931043119[/img:cd4cb3f994]\r\n[img:cd4cb3f994]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0QwCz*!4RFTBq9cpmlvXLRIP8eW1LdN1E!Ef7XxLdWCvcTIAnfpr0Ou34ltF80QJoWRon1E7k!LTz!bfWU5fUtSnjI63b5oJ1IGjgbnLjNFM/MVC-004F20.JPG?dc=4675479774946760244[/img:cd4cb3f994]\r\n[img:cd4cb3f994]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0QQAAAIkR5hRq9cpmlvXLRGsu1IS4kvIwdoKH6L1VoivMM1WCCRg5ZROqbOsIIf4a!Geyb!80ZoyPPVU0*UfQZZy33c*B5x!NNyd69NyEjD8/MVC-001F.JPG?dc=4675479758117785116[/img:cd4cb3f994]\r\nRolling on Lego tires, and chrome painted lego rims:\r\n[img:cd4cb3f994]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0QgAlA7sRRCJq9cpmlvXLRBUboy952M*VI!qyb6Xn8AMUYYYKtcr8rVX1vPvhOaOiIriQT*Frg69M6RFB5XCVgSjhwu3dnIBEcsIJ4I36PQ4/MVC-001F2.JPG?dc=4675479758862118855[/img:cd4cb3f994]\r\n[img:cd4cb3f994]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0QgA5A7sRSCJq9cpmlvXLRLCPersk3smvIKBSq1YK9embP748FMe5DY4WClXNdw7zWMWdqQZTUwEXAXcRlWjqq00CLKblMcef8Q4EIFi9vlk/MVC-003F0.JPG?dc=4675479758936558592[/img:cd4cb3f994]\r\nSorry for taking up so much space just for one post, but I think I got the Bling part down of the Swing and Bling Contest, tell me what Ya\'ll think. Thanks\r\n  :cool:\r\nEDIT: I shrunk the pics some but there is still a big white box around some pics. Sorry for taking up the screen. :cool:');
