INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49047, 'b066002ead', '', '[b:b066002ead]Are you a new registrant? Did you just register and want to introduce yourself?[/b:b066002ead]\r\nDo it here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=1840\r\n\r\n\r\n[b:b066002ead]I just registered in the forums, since I registered, does that register me for the "Galleries" too?[/b:b066002ead]\r\nNo. It does not.\r\nYou need to register in the "Forums" and "Galleries" seperate.\r\nPlease use the same username you have for the "Galleries" as you do the "Forums". this makes it easier to decipher who gets/needs the "special priviliages".\r\n\r\n[b:b066002ead]I\'ve got more questions![/b:b066002ead]\r\nView the contents of the FAQs &amp; FGAs / Rules forum here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewforum.php?f=28');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49048, '5c5d99abe1', '', '[quote:5c5d99abe1="CaboWabo"]that arizona sun looks hot as hell on the car.\r\nI love it.[/quote:5c5d99abe1]And that\'s the indirect sunlight coming in through my bedroom. You should see it outside. :shock: \r\n\r\nIt\'s freakin\' melt your skin hot outside today. :-( \r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:5c5d99abe1="Superfly"]I\'m sitting here digging on your pictures, and it dawns on me, YOU GOT A NEW CAMERA!!! [/quote:5c5d99abe1]I was hoping someone would notice. Isn\'t it great!!! :-D \r\n\r\nIt\'s basically a direct replacement. Later model #, identical features, more compact size, but the pictures look so much better. I\'m not even doing anything special, just pointing and shooting.\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:5c5d99abe1]btw, on the second pic, the camber looks a little off...[/quote:5c5d99abe1]Yeah, it probably is. I use an exacto knife to carve my holes, so they\'re slightly coned shaped. I do that because I\'ve found it the best way to keep my holes centered, and I\'d rather have a little play in the front end than have it bouncing around. \r\n\r\nIn this case I just need to push that pin in a little more, but I used the pic anyways, \'cause I think negative camber looks badass. 8-) \r\n\r\nI\'m convinced now my old camera was jacked. One of these days, I\'m gonna reshoot all my cars.');
