INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49051, '95c443a65f', '', 'So much better dude.  Sorry that my temper was getting short, and glad to see you listend.  If I remember correctly it was Hugh that said he takes something like 20-50 pics of his cars then only uses 3 of them.  That\'s IMO why his rides always look flat out amazing, not to knock his modding skillz cuz fuck they are crazy, but it shows how meticulse (sp&gt;me) his photography techniques are.\r\n\r\nAs a closing thought, it\'s cool to want to archive all you pics Midge just do it on your hard drive or better yet www.Photobucket.com   Bottom line, that final pic is great, live and learn ya know?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49052, 'f94d74744c', '', '[quote:f94d74744c="hue35"]That\'s really nice lookin\', dave... really nice. And what a treat to see the new camera in action, I think it\'s a huge improvement... how about a coupoe of new pics of The Rat and the others?  :eek:[/quote:f94d74744c]Oh yeah, you bet, that should been the first thing I took pictures of. It was killing me with all those decals showing off how fuzzy everything is cause you can\'t read one of them. :roll:\r\n\r\n[quote:f94d74744c="Finks"]BTW what brand/Model Camera is that?[/quote:f94d74744c]It\'s an Olympus D-390. They run about $150, but do a search, plenty of places have refurbs w/ a factory warranty for around a $100, that\'s what I scored.\r\n\r\nI just went with an Olympus again, because I couldn\'t find anything else in that price range that took video clips, and I\'ve become kinda attached to that feature.');
