INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49075, '0ccb1aa081', '', 'ohh blah blah blah\r\n\r\nits like a car wreck, nobody likes to be a part of one, but almost everyone gawks at them at least once.\r\nI watched a few, but it quickly grew tiresome.\r\nthere\'s no benefit to surrounding yourself by hate.\r\nI\'m already a volitile person, pump that shit in to my brain all day and I\'ll start lopping off heads. (hey look, a cycle)\r\n\r\nI\'ve said it before and I\'ll say it again, you can get numbers / statistics to say almost whatever you want. I get more pissed at these stupid statistics than I do a beheading. They cause just as much harm if not more because its basically a farce on a much larger scale and a few people read it as gospel.\r\n2,200 adult Americans isn\'t a good judge of 293,695,619 Americans.\r\nand then they throw out statements like "24 percent...., or 30 million...."\r\nthat\'s such bullshit.\r\nIf I was the only person to vote on this poll that was just created, and then locked it and published the results, by their "sub-standards", I could then say "100% of bitPimps users (640) agree".\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m not "offended" per say by them (beheadings), I just think the people that do that shit are completely ignorant and I can only hope they meet the same horrible ending as they\'ve dispensed on others.\r\n\r\n\r\nand I really didn\'t get the message of americans want to go to iraq and kill but don\'t want anyone to see it lol\r\nmore so, I got the message that people are rubber neckers, but we already knew that - and people are morons that like to toss numbers around that mean absolutely nothing and fool the rest of the ignorant readers in to believing their, uh..... story.\r\n\r\n\r\nbut anyways, like I said, blah blah blah. lol');
