INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49195, '5a1ec6ecf1', '', '[quote:5a1ec6ecf1="Son_Gokou"]\r\nWhere\'s all the source/drain labelings? It\'s kinda hard for me to understand....And "even the dumbest people of ausmicro can understand this"? Sorry if ausmicro is a place just for people who\'ve had 10 years of getting an electrical engineering degree.  :???: [/quote:5a1ec6ecf1]\r\n\r\nhey dickhead.  the mosfets on the schematic are the standard electrical representation for them.  Look at all the data sheets you have and check out the symbol for the mosfet on the first page.  That\'s the same symbol that\'s in the schematic.   The datasheet will have what pin is what.  Symbols are standard for a reason.  Take the time to learn them and you will know from just looking at them what pin is what......\r\n\r\nAnd that 2nd photo your posted, that ain\'t even a schematic, just a diagram.......\r\n\r\ndickhead...');
