INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49248, '5b62f5a0a6', '', '[quote:5b62f5a0a6="sg219"]Check out this jerk off over on Ebay!!  He\'s sellin\' micros for crazy prices!!  The S&amp;H is just plain insane, which is where he gets you in the wallet!!! I wish I could kick this dude in the nuts!!!  I hope noone is dumb enough to buy from him!!! Especially gullable parents and their kids....\r\n\r\n\r\n[url]http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;category=44025&amp;item=3187187473&amp;rd=1[/url]\r\n\r\n[url]http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;category=44025&amp;item=3186756484[/url]\r\n\r\nThrow this idiot under the train, then scrape him up and then throw him under the bus while lighting his remains on fire!!\r\n\r\nThis kind of S&amp;H and price gougeing (&lt;&lt;spelling??) makes me sick!!  Make your money on the item, not the S&amp;H!! If you can\'t afford to sell it and chance it @ auction, then don\'t put it up on Ebay!!\r\n\r\n\r\nRant over.......Thanks and have a good night.....[/quote:5b62f5a0a6]\r\n\r\nDo you know that Ebay takes no money out of the shipping and handling?\r\nThats why many people use that strategy, to get a lot of money and screw Ebay (or paypal, cant remember) out of there 10 cents. I never use this tactic and never will, its a waste of time and sheesh, you gotta thank Ebay (or paypal, shit why cant i remember?!) for all that they have done for you by giving them a resonable amount of your $$$ that you make by using their services.');
