INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49344, 'ad0f1947d7', '', '[quote:ad0f1947d7="sg219"]I guess Cabo also started charging for the use of the SEARCH button/feature!! [/quote:ad0f1947d7]hi - I don\'t charge shit for anything. I don\'t even put up banners or click here to donate bullshit. I give you a chance to help by gaining something in return, that\'s as far as I go.\r\n\r\nif you\'re referring to the auction, that wasn\'t even my idea, though I like it and support it like I do our contests.\r\nand even if it was my idea, I\'d defend it with "the pimps who can help are only trying to do so, nobody sends you a fucking bill to be here - so you can still be the freeloading assmuncher you are if that\'s how it is. ever heard of supporting your own cause / entertainment / whatever?".\r\n\r\nI take the "cabo / charge" shit seriously because now you\'re debating one of the main reasons this site started. and I\'ll defend it till it\'s death - and that ain\'t gonna happen by 1 misled hombre, we\'ve had many - as is plainly seen all over this site, pimps set eachother straight quite often.\r\n\r\nnow if you didn\'t mean that, sorry and don\'t take it personally, but as I said - bitPimps in general "gives" and doesn\'t "take", we might "accept" from time to time, but we never "force" anyone to choose an "option" (e.g. pay or leave).\r\nmatter of fact we do quite the opposite.\r\nIf we tallied up the $ bitPimps has thrown to the users versus the $ that has come in - we\'d all have a great fucking laugh and my pocket book would cry - not to mention all the other freebies the other "bitPimps" have given out.\r\n\r\nbefore I go on and on, peace - I\'m out lol');
