INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49350, '86df8e1775', '', 'okay, I go all over the place when it comes to music.\r\nI like a variety, even between songs.\r\n\r\nbut I can tell what I\'ve been on to lately when catching a buzz.\r\n\r\npink floyd (obscure, non-typical stuff).\r\nI know it probably seems I listen to pink a lot, but I don\'t. I\'ve just recently re-discovered pink, and I\'ve got such a large collection that I can span 30 years so I gets a lot of choice there.\r\n\r\nslayer (kinda obscure, but most have been heard before any metal concert)\r\nI\'ve had a lot of aggression lately and I\'ve always loved slayer. they play slayer before just about any "metal" concert to get you hyped, that\'s for a reason - because slayer can get you hyped.\r\nlately, the riffs and lyrics in "bloodline" have been catching my ear.\r\n\r\nbeyond that, all day long I listen to a variety of tunes from alice in chains and temple of the dog to genesis and jethro tull to master p and the beasties to the crystal method and fugazi.\r\nbasically I span the gamut minus opera and country.\r\n\r\nlet ya know my next "it" thing when I\'m high.');
