INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49397, '2a52e011ca', '', 'Everyone in the hood I grew up in was fanatical about Slayer. That gives you a clue of what a fucked up bunch we were, but whether they were punks or stoners, that was one band we all agreed on. \r\n\r\nOut here on the west end, we have no clubs, west side bands are virtually unknown, but once a month we\'d have a kegger in the Estrella Mountain Park, my buddies band LSD would headline over 3 or 4 bands, and about half their set was Slayer covers, and the other half was even faster and more aggressive. We used to have massive, insane, crazy mosh pits.\r\n\r\n\r\nEveryone gets pissed, I think we need music like Slayer to blow off our aggressions.\r\n\r\nTo me music is a drug, it can influence your mood. I listen to music to help take me to another place. If I want to blow off agression, I might be listening to Slayer or Slipknot, if I want to wind down, I could be listening to anything from Andre Segovia playing Bach\'s Chacone, to the Beatles.\r\n\r\n\r\nSpeaking of the Beatles, I was just listening to the White Album, and was just marveling at how such \'heady\' music could become a staple of our society.\r\n\r\n"Happiness is warm gun, bang bang shoot shoot"');
