INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49428, '4d18205db6', 'My Track', 'okay im showing off my track!  :-)  Some might know me from Ausmicro forums others well i never posted before cause i had nothing really to say  :-( \r\n\r\nbut the thing is it took so bloody long to finish the fucker i want to show everyone!\r\n\r\n[img:4d18205db6]http://members.ausmicro.com/galleries/5255/4886F3C54886F3C6.JPG[/img:4d18205db6]\r\n[img:4d18205db6]http://members.ausmicro.com/galleries/5255/4887797F4886F3C7.JPG[/img:4d18205db6]\r\n[img:4d18205db6]http://members.ausmicro.com/galleries/5255/4889B5274886F3C9.JPG[/img:4d18205db6]\r\nthe best part of the track is the bridge which is a 45 dgree incline the a banking turn to a steep downhill to gain some speed!\r\n[img:4d18205db6]http://members.ausmicro.com/galleries/5255/488A47D24886F3CA.JPG[/img:4d18205db6]\r\n[img:4d18205db6]http://members.ausmicro.com/galleries/5255/488B4E074886F3CB.JPG[/img:4d18205db6]\r\n[img:4d18205db6]http://members.ausmicro.com/galleries/5255/488C035D4886F3CC.JPG[/img:4d18205db6]\r\n[img:4d18205db6]http://members.ausmicro.com/galleries/5255/488CB7D84886F3CD.JPG[/img:4d18205db6]\r\n[img:4d18205db6]http://members.ausmicro.com/galleries/5255/48907BA64886F3CF.JPG[/img:4d18205db6]\r\n[img:4d18205db6]http://members.ausmicro.com/galleries/5255/489BCC224886F3D4.JPG[/img:4d18205db6]\r\ni wanted it to look like i was racing through a forrest hence all the trees!\r\n\r\nim proud of this track as it took me over a year to finish you see i started stopped, started stopped raced sttopped.\r\n\r\nonly until a few weeks ago when i was avoiding doing some study for exams that i finished it off.\r\n\r\ntell us what you all think of it and maybe ways to improve the thing   :grin: [/img]');
