INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49591, 'f684dcfa13', '', 'I don\'t care what any of the Ass Pirates do.  As long as my health insurance don\'t go up any more because I have to help pay for their kids.  Which is the ONLY thing I don\'t like about gay men marrying.  The kids?  How does a gay man teach his boy manly type subjects, when he is as girly as Cinderella at the Queen\'s Ball.  There is this dude at work who is gay, very open about it also, but him and his boyfriend adopted 2 kids, one boy, and one girl.  Both are about the same age, 4 or 5, and very cute.  I can\'t tell which parent is gayer!!  How do you teach a boy how to be a man or at least similar to one. \r\n\r\nI don\'t think its wrong for a gay man to have an adopted child, but when its a boy, it makes me really uncomfortable thinking about where we will be years down the road? A bunch of gay 3rd graders?  A gay little league baseball team?  A gay midget football team?  The locker rooms of these teams?  Also, think if 2 women are married?  Who is the father figure to teach the boy how to stick up for himself?  To talk trash on whores?  To teach the Birds and Bees?  The right way first!!  Not gay from the start and then turn straight.\r\n\r\nAnyway I have health insurance from work, now if they get married, they will both be covered and so will the kids.  Right?  Well, as long as I don\'t pay more, or if it makes it cheaper, because of no hospitalzation for giving birth.  Which ever helps me, because after all thats all you got to worry about, is YOURSELF!! \r\n\r\nAs far a chics getting hitched...well.....as long as I can see some video proof that they love each other, its OK with me!!!!\r\n\r\nJust some food for thought!!  To some it all up, I just don\'t care unless it HURTS me.  Anything else would be uncivilized!!');
