INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49641, '90eadea102', '', 'Ok gonna type some shit here.  Mind you this is all my personal opinion that I don\'t put on anyone but hell since this is the hot topic here ya go.  \r\n\r\nMy basic feeling is fuck it, allow gay marriage.  If not for the core reason of equal rights.  BUT, I am a christian, and personally dislike gay marriages noticed by the church.  I know there is little to nothing that can be done about that so oh well.  The way I feel is that shit (no offence Sezzis) but american government recognizes Muzlim, Jewish, agnostic and all other styles of marriage (and if my memory serves me right we didn\'t always) Homosexual marriage is just another form of personal belifes.  Throughout my life I have known and been close friends with many "non-secular couples" and even though I\'m not gonna shit my pants when they tie the knot from a religouse point of view, on a personal level I wouldn\'t be against celebrating thier unity.\r\n\r\nBottom line tho, the mean spirited comments in this thread are kinda weak.  But then again the way J posted the thread wasn\'t the best either.  Like I said, Ahh well fuck it.');
