INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49644, '1b97c6f7de', 'pleasant surprise', 'I don\'t know about you guys, but whenever I get a sizeable amount of stash, I fill a few small containers and hide them around so when I run out, I can go looking for them. You know, places like inside my ski boots, a film can full of weed in my camera bag, maybe in the pocket of a coat I don\'t wear very often, etc. \r\n\r\nI thought I was almost out. Like when you take the amount you would normally pack into a bowl for one giant rip, take a second look, and then split it in half so you can have some more later and last the rest of the week.\r\n\r\nAnyway, I was looking around in my basement last night for some airbrush parts I had in a box, and I stumbled across this container that\'s one of those watertight plastic cylinders with a cord that hangs around your neck. I thought, "what the hell is this doing in with the airbrush parts? What is it?" I opened it up, and inside was a bud that had to be crammed in there, so it was about 6" long and 1 1/2" wide. Big ol\' skunky crystally kola. I started laughing out loud, so much that my wife sticks her head in the door to the basement and asks if I\'m ok. I have no idea when I put that there, sometime in the last 2 years, but I don\'t know. I\'m gonna go home and break off a big chunk and go see "Farenheight 911" tonight.  :cool:');
