INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49690, '2c6969c738', 'DelSol (Clothes that change color in the sun) FREE Tote Bag', 'Figured I\'d share this here...\r\n\r\nDelSol sells some cool ass shit...Clothes that are \'plain\' black &amp; white in the shade, then when the Sun (or any ultraviolet light) hits it? It fills with color!\r\n\r\nI found out about this when the Wife and I were in Kaua\'i, they had a store there and we bought a couple of shirts. And just recently I bought a tote bag and some nail polish for the Wife for her Birthday (they have an online store too).\r\n\r\nAnyway, they don\'t have many storefront locations, but if you can get to one it\'s worth the trip...Especially with this FREE tote bag (worth $18 ) with ANY purchase coupon.\r\n\r\nI took the email I got and hosted it here:\r\n[url]http://www.geocities.com/lmennuti38/DelSol.htm[/url]\r\n\r\nEnjoy bitches!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49691, 'c1504807b0', 'Where\'s my birthday bud?!!!', 'Ok, this the routine every year. \r\n\r\nRound about June it start to get scraggly. More stems, lots of seeds, but still decent smoke, you just go through a lot of it cleaning out the BS.\r\n\r\nThen by July even the scraggly shit gets scarce. Then right in the middle of July, just before my birthday, out of no where, I always get a bag of some piney ass popcorn buds. \r\n\r\nBeen like that the last 10 years, so I\'ve come to expect it, and I always refer to that as my birthday sack.\r\n\r\nWell this year, it didn\'t dry up, the buds got scraggly, but not too bad. I thought, this is cool, but it\'s not right, and I wondered if I\'d get a birthday sack this year.\r\n\r\nWell I didn\'t, I got some grassy smelling crap. :( \r\n\r\nIt\'ll do ya, you just gotta smoke twice as much, but then if you come back for a round 2 it\'ll give you headache.\r\n\r\nSo far, today is gonna be a lame birthday. :lol:');
