INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49798, 'f1697ded57', 'Re: Storms are spooky.', '[quote:f1697ded57="hogjowlz"]we dont really get good storms here. just lots of them right about rush hour.[/quote:f1697ded57]\r\n\r\nOh, we get storms, just not hurricanes.  This way May of 2002.  A person got killed at Kennywood.  My neighborhood lost quite a few houses.   A couple of close friends lost theirs.  It was a "so-called Macro-burst"!!  Bullshit, it was a tornado!!!  The only reason they didn\'t classify it as a tornado, was if they did, they would have to give government aid.  \r\n\r\n[url]http://www.wpxi.com/news/2240589/detail.html[/url]\r\n\r\nThe pic next to the cake is a few hundred yards away, it was an auto body place.\r\n\r\nThen a few years before that, Mt. Washington (I think Hog took some pics from up there.)got smacked with a couple of tornados.  That time they classified them as tornados, because thats where alot of rich or well off people live!!  Government ASSHOLES!!!\r\n\r\nThen there was the year it snowed.\r\n\r\n[url]http://www.wpxi.com/weather/2015701/detail.html[/url]');
