INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49868, '8f59378277', '', 'My apologies, Cabo...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nwhat I was getting at anyway(and this goes for all you impatient ones who say "The contest is over!!! Who won?? Huh? Huh??"):\r\n\r\nYes, the contest ended yesterday. But that doesn\'t mean that the Mods know who won today. Every contest, there\'s always someone who\'s like "WHO WON!!?? I GOTTA KNOW!!" after the first day.... Well, here\'s a thought: why don\'t you give the mods sometime to decide?? Hey now that sounds like a novel idea!! The winners should be up around Monday (right Cabo?? At least thats usually when they are, after it ends on Friday), so don\'t ask who won... The Mods will tell us as soon as they complete their decision!!\r\n\r\nThanks for hearing my rant!');
