INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49954, 'a1a8ac7cbe', '', 'awright, i gots some aussie fillums you pissants should hunt down! :-) \r\n\r\ni\'d be remiss in my ways if i didn\'t mention mad max 1. that scene where max is introduced to the interceptor gives me shivers, i get hard at the sound of a pumpin aussie v8. if you\'ve never seen this movie you are a loser. and avoid the "dubbed merikan" version if you can.\r\n\r\nghosts of the civil dead. the most farken full on prison movie ever. cast includes nick cave as a fricken looney nutbag (played brilliantly), lot\'s of melbourne music celeb\'s and lots of real mc coy double hard bastards.\r\n\r\ndogs in space. real slice o\' life flick revolving around a share house in inner melbourne during the late 70\'s. pissfunny and sad bunch of drug lovin\' kiddies havin\' it large. one of the best soundtracks ever, cast includes everyone who was anyone in the melbourne rock scene at the time including micheal hutchence.\r\n\r\nthe castle. disturbingly loveable family of halfwits fight to save their house from the local airport\'s "compulsory aquisition". hilarious film, they\'re absolute idiots!\r\n\r\nromper stomper. very true to life film about the nazi skins in oz. makes american history x tame (except for that scene, you know the one! :shock: ) genuine performances by all except that cockhead russell crowe.\r\n\r\nwelcome to whoop whoop. this is just plain weird but pissfunny. about a merikan that finds himself in the weirdest outback town in australia. stars rod taylor of all people (the time machine).\r\n\r\ni\'m sure i\'ll think up some more');
