INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49965, 'bc7cc4b017', '', 'There\'s a distinction between \'disturbing\' and \'offensive\'.\r\n\r\nAnd I think the best way to seperate the 2 is intent.\r\n\r\nThe demonic freaks that crispied the cat intended PURE MALICE for pleasure (we know this because they were laughing). This we can categorize as \'offensive\' (to the extreme).\r\n\r\nThat wacky shit with eating fetus\'s I\'d wager a big amount is intended as an aphrodisiac or some kind of medicinal agent, no malicious intent here. This, I believe, can be put in the \'disturbing\' category.\r\n\r\nSpeaking of the crispy kitty vid, why\'d you take it down? Sure, it was offensive as all fuck (certainly pissed me off), but it\'s pretty clear that C-Dub runs a pretty open-minded, free speech Forum here. If you\'re going to take it down, do it because YOU think it\'s the right thing to do...Not because you\'re worried about what others think or feel.');
