INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49969, 'e8ec6fc2bd', '', '[quote:e8ec6fc2bd="payaso"]Are they any peppier, or are they still in need of having the internals massaged?\r\n[/quote:e8ec6fc2bd]They are slightly peppier, but still benefit greatly from a FET mod.\r\n\r\nThe Chevelle, and Starsky &amp; Hutch cars are fixed also, but apparently there\'s still an occasional slighty twitchy one.\r\n\r\n\r\n...and I agree they get what they deserve for releasing a buggy product onto the market. Besides making use waste our hard earned money to do their R&amp;D, they put a hurt on the hobby by coinciding the crappy SE release with the XMod release... coincidence? I wonder. :???:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49970, '4072dc2c23', '', 'The Jota is a hopped-up Miura (if ya\'ll didn\'t know)... I\'m guessing it\'ll be exactly the same as a Jota without the rivets, the air dam up front and the wing. If they\'ve done it right, they\'ve reworked the rear fenders and eliminated the bulk... I\'m hopin\', I like me a straight-up Miura more than the Jota.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49971, '40d82900f2', '', 'obviously I haven\'t seen the pics\r\nbut sounds like the Jota I made (minus rivets)\r\n[img:40d82900f2]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10008/jota_darkblue_04.jpg[/img:40d82900f2]\r\n\r\nif so, that make\'s #3 of vehicles I\'ve modded that have turned into production bodies.\r\n- My Trucks\r\n[img:40d82900f2]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10008/truck_bitpimps_03.jpg[/img:40d82900f2][img:40d82900f2]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10008/truck_flames_01.jpg[/img:40d82900f2]\r\n\r\n- My V-Dub Truck\r\n[img:40d82900f2]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10008/beetle_blue_truck_02.jpg[/img:40d82900f2]\r\n(note my \'bed\' area creases are much more smoother than the piece of shit posted from Germany, look in my gallery if you need more proof)\r\n\r\n- And now the Jota Jamboree\r\n[img:40d82900f2]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10008/jota_darkblue_04.jpg[/img:40d82900f2]\r\n\r\n\r\nbut no, they don\'t lurk our site or copy any of us (referring back to the "jukebox" and \'zz sponsored contest thread\'.)\r\n\r\nfags...');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49972, '5a06d6d271', '', 'the parts in question look like "home remedy" to me, minus the heat sink - but there\'s only 1 pic to decipher from so it\'s hard to tell.\r\n\r\nthe dual cell part is for sure a home-made job, only modded chassis get the tape across the pcb.\r\n\r\nthe dual motors is questionable, small wire from one to other and the heat sink in the pic we see seem to say it\'s not a home-made job, but since nobody else but Sinned seems to have any information on them, I\'m marking it up as a "home-made" job, at least until 1 other person in the entire micro world can verify (which usually isn\'t even a question)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49973, 'c776081047', '', 'Namuna hit the nail on the head for me too.\r\nI don\'t give a fuck - I\'ve seen dorks eating embrios - I don\'t care. baby was dead already.\r\nthe cat wasn\'t.\r\nif the cat were, different story all together.\r\n\r\nI only said those kinds of people were pussies for exhibiting so much cruelty to things so easily controlled and in their power to control so easily (not they had to use a cage because the cat would have scratched their little mushroom cap dicks off). \r\nthat is no kind of feat (us, minus the "a").\r\nthat\'s just inbred, moronic shit and I\'d kick their asses through several states until I reached my home where I\'d put them in a cage, piss on them, dump gasoline on them, and set them a-blaze.\r\n\r\neye for an eye biatch and I\'m the sherrif around here. lol');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49974, '52410185e4', '', 'the all mighty dollar rules all.\r\nif they can get a few hundred thousand out of it, they\'ll release it.\r\n\r\nit\'s like software.\r\nI\'ve actually seen Microsofts schedule on releasing software versus the amounts of bugs, versus the amounts of features...\r\nThis pertains to almost every software development company - 99.9% of them.\r\n\r\neverything is lines and graphs and cash.\r\nif they can release it and even a slight majority will accept it, they then release it, knowingly full of bugs - they don\'t give a shit - that\'s cash, more cash than what they put in to the software.\r\nthey will release "updates and fixes" and everyone will use them and they\'ll still continue to make cash.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (49975, '104ace23c5', '', 'I just got my ZZ Jeep and F150 from Ebay today. I have to agree with hog that these spring suspension chasis are nice. There is a noticeable difference running these things over my hardwood floor. The grooves in between the boards tend to make the chasis with the pivot point suspension bounce around a bit. The spring suspension chasis doesn\'t seem to bounce as much and holds a pretty straight course.\r\n\r\nSome closeups:\r\n\r\n[img:104ace23c5]http://img67.photobucket.com/albums/v205/sdog70/DSC00654.jpg[/img:104ace23c5]\r\n\r\nNote the lack of the pivot point suspension bar in the spring chasis, but the space for the bar is still there:\r\n[img:104ace23c5]http://img67.photobucket.com/albums/v205/sdog70/DSC00655.jpg[/img:104ace23c5]\r\n\r\nI really like these, but I\'m still liking the newer ZZ SE chasis best (Chevelle, Torino, GTO). The only down side to the newer SE chasis is its tuff to lower a body shell on them because the elctronics make for a tall chasis.\r\n\r\nPersonally I\'d like to find out more about these Panther chasis that Dennis/Sinned has been tossing around in some forums. Why? Because I\'d like to be able to make my ZZ\'s look like this on a proportional chasis:\r\n\r\n[img:104ace23c5]http://img67.photobucket.com/albums/v205/sdog70/Acura.jpg[/img:104ace23c5]\r\n\r\nNumerous people have asked Sinned for the lowdown on these Panther chasis and he doesn\'t seem to want to put up the info. Honestly, that shit pisses me off. So...if you are reading this Sinned...I\'m calling you out. Stop being such a selfish dick and give up some info.');
