INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50081, 'd8336cb142', '', 'Ok here\'smy votes. I went by intial visual impact. Then quality and difficulty of mods, then sticking to the theme, then there\'s just the pimposity, or cool factor of the person and the car.\r\n\r\n#1  Hue\'s Camaro \r\n[img:d8336cb142]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/contests/swing_bling/thumb_13_hue35_01.jpg[/img:d8336cb142] \r\nBecause it\'s just perfect, amazingly beautiful, and Hue\'s just one our best modders who post here regularly, and derserves the #1 distinction.\r\n\r\n#2  Ripper7\'s bB\r\n[img:d8336cb142]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/contests/swing_bling/thumb_20_ripper7777777_01.jpg[/img:d8336cb142]\r\nExcellent details, great job sticking to the theme. Not much else to say, just clean original work.\r\n\r\n#3 For the combined work of both his cars, but particularly for this.\r\n[img:d8336cb142]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/contests/swing_bling/thumb_22_finks_01.jpg[/img:d8336cb142]\r\nLike Super Sugar Smacks, I dig \'em.\r\n\r\n#4 Jmays\r\n[img:d8336cb142]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/contests/swing_bling/thumb_28_jmays_01.jpg[/img:d8336cb142]\r\nWell he did put a lot of work into it, it does fit the theme, and I am partial to flames, so I guess I\'ll give him 4th. :lol: \r\n\r\n#5 Biohazard\r\n[img:d8336cb142]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/contests/swing_bling/thumb_16_biohazard_01.jpg[/img:d8336cb142]\r\n\r\nHad a 4 way tie, but Biohazard just barely nudged out Superfly, because I am partial to flames\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThere, that\'s my opnion, and I\'m sticking to it. :lol: \r\n\r\nNow let\'s go knock in some knee caps for making that so hard on us. That sucked. :sad:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50082, '0b0dfa251f', '', 'Yeah....a lot of the bodies do sit high. But, the muscle car bodies and the Torino sit a lot better than the others, which gives me hope that RS is getting the idea. Then again, the new Acura tuner set they just came out with for the SE sits worse than just about anything so far....UGH!\r\n\r\nThey need to find a way to make the SE chasis lower profile to get the bodies down (or so they can be modded to get the bodies lower).\r\n\r\nBTW....the black paint flakes off of those SE chasis real easy. A lot of them come looking like that out of the box.\r\n\r\nI think Cdub has it right when he says RS and others are watching this site and copying it. Maybe if we keep threads like this going they will get the idea.');
