INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50190, '548ae6e5c8', 'pulled sugar', 'hi everyone \r\n\r\nhere is a lighter thread than my last mistake,\r\nbelow is a picture of a rose that i did at work, its out of sugar.\r\ni needed 12 of them for a wedding this past weekend.\r\ni really liked the way the roses came out!\r\n\r\npeice out\r\njmays\r\n[img:548ae6e5c8]http://img27.photobucket.com/albums/v82/superpieboy/sugar_rose.jpg[/img:548ae6e5c8]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50191, '13910285d3', 'Dump\'d Truck', 'Dump\'d as in slammed, get it? :lol: \r\n\r\nAnyways, I copy catted Ahh5hit. My first instinct would have been to go off road with the F-150, but when I saw his slammed, I had to do it.\r\n\r\nI also got the Dub City wheels on the Zip Zap wheel backs, and a nice subtle wing from a RSX.\r\n\r\n[img:13910285d3]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10007/f1501.jpg[/img:13910285d3]\r\n\r\n\r\nOh but I\'m not even done copy cattin\'. I\'m gonna rip off the paint scheme from the Dub City die-cast that I ripped the wheels from. It\'s almost exactly what I was picturing anyways, so I was like, "Ok I\'ll do that."\r\n[img:13910285d3]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10007/f1502.jpg[/img:13910285d3]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50192, '427fa5fffd', 'slammed', 'that is so sweet, nice job on adapting those dub wheels to the zz hubs.\r\ncant wait to see the paint fx.\r\n\r\njmays');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50193, '84f8477f0e', '', 'That looks great, dude... that F150 is just OK off the RS shelf, but you\'ve brought it into the \'badass\' category. Dude, I\'m so happy with your new camera... you know, in case you were wonderin\' how I felt about it.  8-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50194, '2813136ffc', '', 'I agree with bird.  Even though people move on to bigger scale they are still interested in Bits.  Its like your legos or 8-bit nintendo you always enjoy playing with them even though you have PS2 and X-BOX.\r\n\r\nFor Instance I finally tried to fet mod and LXX and it WORKED..I know I am years behind you Peepz but I am getting the hang of things here.  I have a bad headache from squinting to trying to hold those little fuckers but It paid off.  \r\n\r\nLong Live BiTPiMPS!\r\n\r\n!!!BiTZ R DA SHiTZ!!!!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50195, '4dfbebf877', '', 'Whatever you do, don\'t let those crazy Bruce\'s drive it!!!!\r\n\r\n[img:4dfbebf877]http://img28.photobucket.com/albums/v85/sg219/Comebacks/wreckedtruck.jpg[/img:4dfbebf877]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50196, '704146553a', '', 'Dude, old-school Broncos are the fuckin\' shit... perfect paint scheme on that thing, I couldn\'t dig it more. I can\'t wait to see that mutha tearin\' shit up.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50197, '6c32e0a277', '', 'just got some stuff from rs.. i got the SE muscle package , LEDs, and a speed and lap counter. :-D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50198, 'f1186a1538', '', '[quote:f1186a1538="crazydave"]Well yeah the bodies sit too high, but gotta have something left to modify ourselves, don\'t we?[/quote:f1186a1538]\r\n\r\nI agree that we need something left to modify....but do you think the current configuration of the SE chasis even allows for it? I haven\'t tried it yet because it looks to me like there just isn\'t much room for lowering. The GTO doesn\'t need much lowering, but you have seen how bad the new Acura tuner set sits and I\'m wondering if there is any room under the body to lower it. I haven\'t seen any lowered SE\'s. I suppose part of the problem may be their higher cost ($25 vs. a $6 bit clone) and noone wants to mess with them.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50199, '03f577c232', '', 'There is a lot of detail in that Impala....this should be interesting to watch. Looking forward to see how this one turns out.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50200, '9444925039', '', 'Yeah....that looks great just the way it is. I\'m sure the paint will look great too. I just picked up one of those F150\'s up from an ebay auction. the lowering and wheel mods makes it look so much nicer.\r\n\r\nDitto on the new cam...');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50201, 'd5b908291c', '', 'Great work, very impresive.  I can\'t do that shit!! :shock: \r\n\r\nI worked with some pulled suger a couple of times and it SUCKED!!!!  I can do some OK things with pastilalage and baked merange.  (&lt;&lt;questionable spellings)   :???: \r\n\r\nOh, ya, I love working with those sheets that you have the roses on, they\'re great to make dusts, powders, and crusts with.  Basically puree something and put it on one of those and bake till hard and dry, then crumble or put in blender to make a great dust.  I just don\'t bake, way too much of a sceince for me!!  I like to throw stuff together, cook it and serve it to unsuspecting customers!!!    :hungry:  :innocent: \r\n\r\nAllthough, for the last 2 1/2 years I haven\'t done much cooking(only when the line goes into self-destruct mode, my cooks really suck at times), I\'ve been butchering seafood in a nice cold room!! :cool:');
