INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50296, '83c14dc451', '', 'Stampede Dude i must commend you. You searched that link down and splashed it all over MRRC and here. Your a credit........\r\n\r\n\r\nTo tha muthafuckin Haters Club of the Century ya Bitch!\r\n\r\nThat auction is MINE and i just received a shipment of the hard to find product THIS morning via Fed EX. What fuccin kills me is that as long as ive been here and on the Mini RC forums (well over a year casting bodies and selling shit on Tiny/MRRC/WGU and a few others) only one other bastard was as dedicated a dick wad as you.\r\n\r\nYou want better pics - ASK for them. I got crap loads with garbage cans and squirrels in the back ground ya hoe. \r\n SYNJ what the fuck are you talking about? Get ya hand off ya dick and stop whiffing root smoke homie. That PANTHER CHARIOT (not just Panther like the previous clones) car that Dennis is using is the one and the same PANTHER CHARIOT shipment i received. How do i know? Cause i did the research over a 5 day span and got in contact with the company in China DIRECTLY (spent much time on the phone with them). Sinned\'s Panther car (specifically the body) is on the left side panel of the open front box. How do i know...CAUSE I GOT A SHIPMENT BITCH. I dont wait for muthafuckers to make shit happen...I MAKE IT HAPPEN. \r\n\r\n\r\nYou wanna rag on 88.9% positive feedback? Whats next...99%? 6 out of 7 people had excellent transactions and this one kid (out of 2 ZZSE\'s that were sold mind you) gets pissed because he didnt know the Chevelle would be opened and test run once in order to ensure he didnt claim it didnt work adn ask for a refund AND IM THE BAD GUY? Not to mention the lil bitch received an extra body for free IN THE PACKAGE as a thank you for the purchase. POST THAT ya one eyed K0ck sucker!  Peep MY feedback - NOBODY else had issues. The day a man is convicted cuz one out of 7 people yell "guilty" is the day we all need kick rocks cuz the game is over.\r\n\r\nSG219 - You came correct. I answered your question. Feel free to post . No beef with you.\r\nCabo - I appreciate that you let playas tell it like it is on your forum without massive edits. Again no beef with you despite how you may view the pics.\r\n\r\nLike Snoop Dog said " I lay it out for yall to play it out."');
