INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50567, '26214c177f', 'Decales', 'Was thinking today, would any of you pimps (Cd,Hugh and Superfly come quickly to mind) make a couple of 1/64 scale decale sheets to sell?  Just an idea, but you could sell em for $10 shipped and I know I would pay it.  My printer is just not cut out for that kind of action.  To throw in some ideas, other than the obvious stuff I know I would love to see 1/64 car logos and just some toally random bad ass Bit Pimp shit.  Any how, just an idea.\r\n\r\n:edit: LOL screw you Bird fixed it');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50568, '2e90971f68', 'Re: Decales', '[quote:2e90971f68="Finks"]Supperfly[/quote:2e90971f68]\r\n\r\nTotally off subject... but I saw Supperfly and had a vision of like the 40 year bitPimps re-reunion party, and Fly had let himself go a bit in his old age, and everyone was breakin\' his balls, callin\' him "Supperfly"...\r\n\r\nHe was pissed, and brawlin\' quickly ensued... \r\n\r\n\r\nI second that decal thought... That would be the shit.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50569, 'fb7371d92f', 'What an exciting week', 'Looking back on this week, WOW!  I mean we finally find out where to get Panthers.  The alloy hop ups for X-mods are announced.  New Zip Zaps AND new X-mods are discovered.  Not to forget the interesting hop up kits.  And personally I feel, one of the coolest custom jobs since Miva\'s Testarossa gets started by Jmays.  This site is hoppin.  Just what we needed after that whole site wars BS a couple of weeks ago.  Oh and on a personal note... unless one of you bitches out bid me, I will be the extreamly proud owner of a Subie done up by CD &amp; DT. :eek:');
