INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50603, '951c9ea680', '', 'Holy shit! It\'s 3:20am and I just got home from a great night out... I figured I\'d dial up (ouch) and see what happened in the \'hood tonight... god damn, talk about icing on the cake! Thanks a ton (cabo &amp; crew) for puttin\' these badass contests together and taking crazydave to the other side.  8-)  I have to say, it feels damn good to be amongst the top 5 in this contest... that fuckin\' Cabrio (my personal favorite of the contest... I hate to play favorites, but it\'s just the truth), the rack on that bb is sick, the woody gave me one and the beautiful ground-up custom single cab... all y\'all is badasses... today was a great fuckin\' day.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50604, 'c8adf7767a', 'summer', '[quote:c8adf7767a="hue35"]that fuckin\' Cabrio (my personal favorite of the contest... .[/quote:c8adf7767a]\r\n\r\nDitto on the cabrio, its one nice ride. thanks for the contest, everyone put out some real nice custom bits. congratulations on hue with his sweet ride.\r\n the rack on the Bb is bad ass and the cooler to top it off. and the woody, its sure a fine water craft! thank you cabo and crew for the contest! with hues paint jobs i have something to strive for!\r\n\r\njmays');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50605, 'e256f46028', '', 'Congtratulations to all the entrants.  :-)  \r\nYou Pimps put out some serious rides which always makes it difficult to decide on da winners.  You\'re all winners in my book of Bits but unfortunately we could only pick 5.\r\n\r\nAs C-Dub mentioned earlier, will Da Winners PM me with Yo Addresses... :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50606, '9ea76dd077', '', '[quote:9ea76dd077="CaboWabo"]welp.\r\nhopefully there\'s a few more "exciting" things to come in the very near future :wink:[/quote:9ea76dd077]\r\n\r\nI detect a hint in there...you got something up your sleeve Cdub?  :???:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50607, '74c3cdb491', '', 'Congrates pimps! Those are all some sick ass rides.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50608, '1cb2068003', '', '[quote:1cb2068003="crazydave"]\r\nSince all these newer ones have the same pcb, I have to say the problem is in the set up. I\'ve noticed that if the steering is trying to center between steps, it jitters worse. It\'s like it can\'t decide which step to fall on.\r\n\r\nTry this. Take the front end apart. With the gear removed, center the steering on the controller, and on the chassis. Replace gear, and reassemble. You\'ll have to make slight adjustments to the chassis center adjustment.\r\n\r\nThat would drastically reduce jitter on the first generation SEs, so maybe it will help on the newer ones that still jitter.[/quote:1cb2068003]\r\n\r\nCD: When you say "With the Gear Removed" which gear are you referring to?\r\n\r\n[img:1cb2068003]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10045/ZZSE%20Front%20End.jpg[/img:1cb2068003]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50609, '2f48451f6c', '', 'Don\'t forget the Cars (modified Aspens) from Fantasy Island.\r\nThe Monkees Car\r\nThe truck from the Beverly Hillbillies.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50610, 'ca73a275f6', '', '!!!!!!! :D \r\n\r\nWell thanks guys, this is killer.  Hugh and J, IMO you two are some of the best modders out there, I take your compliments very seriously.  As for SG, man I love Da boat, grats on being the first pimp boat modder and taking home some "phat lewts" for your innovation.  And of course thanks to the Mods, a) for not being able to compete b) for making these competitions so much fun and the prizes so Dope.  I have up untill this point just used exacto blade end (no handle) for all my chops.  This kit will be a welcomed addition.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50611, 'c374afe40f', '', '[quote:c374afe40f="BilboBaggins"]\r\nThe Monkees Car\r\n[/quote:c374afe40f]Hell yeah. I love that car.\r\n\r\nFunny thing is, last time I saw it, it was in a Sisters of Mercy video, for the song "Black Planet", and in that context that car looked flat out evil.\r\n\r\nThe Monkees did not deserve such a cool car.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50612, '1f63ee25c1', '', 'I took off the flat gear, but I would imagine that if you could get the pinion off, you\'d be able to get the flat gear out easier. :???:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50613, '12811268a3', '', 'It\'s no longer up since I\'ve used some parts of it.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50614, 'def24ef7a6', '', 'Holy Fark...\r\n\r\nThe more I take this thng apart the more appreciation I have for how much stuff RS crammed in to these little things...\r\n\r\nGetting it back together should be fun.\r\n\r\n[img:def24ef7a6]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10045/ZZSE%20Front%20End%202.jpg[/img:def24ef7a6]\r\n\r\n\r\nEdit: Well, I gave it a try and the damn thing still chatters like a little monkey with a stick up its ass. It still turns way too sharp to the right too (This bugs me more than the chattering because it makes it harder to control). Well at least I have a better idea of what makes these things tick.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50615, '1f79e4dcbe', '', '[quote:1f79e4dcbe="crazydave"]The Monkees did not deserve such a cool car.[/quote:1f79e4dcbe]\r\n\r\nAin\'t it the truth...\r\n\r\n\r\nOh, and I\'d like to add the Wagon Master Family Truckster (National Lampoons Vacation) to this list...');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50616, '552938ea88', '', 'and we have a winner!!!!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50617, 'a5327d2dec', '', 'compare this http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=654 to this http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3937\r\n\r\ni think the bar has been raised substantially over the past year or so.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50618, '67f3dc9391', '', 'Wow... This came out pretty much EXACTLY like I predicted... Congratulations, fellas, those rides are kick-ass...\r\n\r\nI had my money on hues from the start lol... that ride is just flawless, and Finks... someone(hue?) said "you got a style all your own"... That\'s the truth, right there... keep doin \'em with that Finks flavor, you can\'t go wrong... Ripper, what can I say.. when I saw that the first thing that came to mind was "sick... this dude just did to a bit what arch2b does to OLs..." nicely done.  jmays... I don\'t even need to tell you that you are on your own level in this game... the stuff you are doing is mind blowing and inspiring, and surely killer. sg219 brought that woody to my crib a few days before he finished it and I have been speechless since... I still have a hard time describing how sweet that boat is.\r\n\r\nI want to thank you guys, and all of the other entries, for pushing me to make a ride that I am proud of... and when hog decides to get off his butt and finish the gallery, I\'ll be honored to have it sitting among ALL of yours...');
