INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50641, '3eb24c0151', 'Server outage?', 'Hey, what up here. I was unable to get on bPs until 9:00 friday night, and yesterday I kept trying and trying and never got on. \r\n\r\nSince my internet is working otherwise fine I assumed it was a server outage, but now I get back on, and there\'s all these post from yesterday.\r\n\r\nSo am I the only one that couldn\'t see bPs? If so, what would cause that? That\'s odd.\r\n\r\nI\'m mad because I had some better updated pictures of the auction car that I never got a chance to upload, and also I can\'t help but to wonder if any potential bidders had the same problem I had. :mad:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50642, '822fa49017', '', 'I\'m a bit ho. I love \'em, and leave \'em.\r\n\r\nHey guys, I\'m wondering if it\'s not time to discuss taking these to ebay. I personally feel we\'re putting too much time and work into these cars for them to go for under $30, and with what I got planned for a couple projects, I\'d be really pissed if they went for less than $30. Hog has already established that he aint settling for less than $30. Sooo, what you guys think about all of it?\r\n\r\nBTW, I should mention that one of my cars sold for $60 on ebay.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_posts_text VALUES (50643, 'e74191eed2', '', '[quote:e74191eed2="hue35"]Thanks a ton (cabo &amp; crew) for puttin\' these badass contests together and taking crazydave to the other side.  8-)  [/quote:e74191eed2]Shit dude, I can\'t compete with perfection.  :lol: \r\n\r\nHog\'s last post makes a great point. The bar has been raised in the last year. As glad as I am I didn\'t have to compete amongst them, it was really difficult judging. Lots of really incredible work this time around. \r\n\r\nGreat job guys, thanks for making the bitPimps contest the happening place to be. :-)');
